# game/script.rpy:1866
translate Chinese chapter1_86267af8:

  # "This maybe happened, or maybe did not."
  "也许确有其事，也许从未有过。"

# game/script.rpy:1867
translate Chinese chapter1_24b7f072:

  # "The time is long past, and much is forgot."
  "难敌年深日久，往事早已遗落。"

# game/script.rpy:1868
translate Chinese chapter1_65071726:

  # "Back in the old days, when wishing worked, your mother lived in a vast forest teeming with strange figures."
  "很久以前，在许愿尚能成真的年代，你的母亲栖居在一片广袤的森林里，林中到处是奇异的身影。"

# game/script.rpy:1870
translate Chinese chapter1_388ccc4c:

  # "Yet she had little time to spend wondering about these odd folks, for she had twelve children and had to work night and day just to feed them."
  "但她无暇好奇这些怪客。她有十二个孩子，必须没日没夜地劳作才能勉强糊口。"

# game/script.rpy:1871
translate Chinese chapter1_16ca61e5:

  # "When you were born as the thirteenth, she had no idea what to do. She took you up in her arms and ran into the darkness of the forest, promising that she would ask the first man she met to be your Godfather."
  "你排行十三，降生之时，她已一筹莫展。她把你抱在怀里，跑进幽暗的森林，发誓要请她遇见的第一个男人做你的教父。"

# game/script.rpy:1873
translate Chinese chapter1_970a3da6:

  # "Neither here nor there, but long ago..."
  "不在此地，不在彼方，而是在很久以前……"

# game/script.rpy:1874
translate Chinese chapter1_641b60c1:

  # "Back in the old days, when the gods were real, your mother lived in a vast and mysterious rainforest full of strange figures."
  "很久以前，在众神依然存在的年代，你的母亲栖居在一片广袤神秘的雨林里，林中遍布奇异的身影。"

# game/script.rpy:1876
translate Chinese chapter1_87ae7791:

  # "Yet she had little time to spend wondering about these odd folks, for she had ten children and had to work night and day just to feed them."
  "但她无暇好奇这些怪客。她有十个孩子，必须没日没夜地劳作才能勉强糊口。"

# game/script.rpy:1877
translate Chinese chapter1_49ba8f0c:

  # "When you were born as the eleventh, she had no idea what to do. She took you up in her arms and ran into the darkness of the forest, promising that she would ask the first man she met to be your Godfather."
  "你排行十一，降生之时，她已一筹莫展。她把你抱在怀里，跑进幽暗的森林，发誓要请她遇见的第一个男人做你的教父。"

# game/script.rpy:1879
translate Chinese chapter1_546ca8a4:

  # "Once there was, and once there wasn't."
  "曾有这么一回事，又似乎并无此事。"

# game/script.rpy:1880
translate Chinese chapter1_5d48c9d3:

  # "In the long-distant days of yore, when haystacks winnowed sieves, when genies played jereed in the old bathhouse, fleas were barbers, camels were town criers, I softly rocked my baby grandmother to sleep in her creaking cradle, in an exotic land, far, far away, there was a woman who lived in a vast rainforest full of strange, empty spaces."
  "遥远的昔日，干草堆簸起筛子，精灵在旧浴场里骑马掷标枪，跳蚤当理发师，骆驼做打更人，我在吱呀作响的摇篮旁，轻摇着尚在襁褓中的祖母哄她入睡。在一个遥远又遥远的异国他乡，有个女人住在一片广袤的雨林里，林中到处是诡异的空旷荒地。"

# game/script.rpy:1882
translate Chinese chapter1_568cb28a:

  # "Yet she had little time to think about these things, for she had four children and had to work day and night just to feed them."
  "但她无暇多想。她有四个孩子，必须没日没夜地劳作才能勉强糊口。"

# game/script.rpy:1883
translate Chinese chapter1_4b7aa14c:

  # "When you were born to her as the fifth, she had no idea what to do. She took you up in her arms and ran into the darkness of the forest, promising that she would ask the first man she met to be your Godfather."
  "你排行第五，降生之时，她已一筹莫展。她把你抱在怀里，跑进幽暗的森林，发誓要请她遇见的第一个男人做你的教父。"

# game/script.rpy:1886
translate Chinese chapter1_b3459461:

  # "Listen closely."
  "听好了。"

# game/script.rpy:1887
translate Chinese chapter1_4588e156:

  # "I won't repeat myself again."
  "我不会再说第二遍。"

# game/script.rpy:1888
translate Chinese chapter1_68fbbfc2:

  # "Back in the old days, when there was still a chance, your mother lived in a vast, empty forest."
  "很久以前，在一切尚存转机的年代，你的母亲栖居在一片广袤空旷的森林里。"

# game/script.rpy:1890
translate Chinese chapter1_34777223:

  # "One day, your mother gave birth to you as her first and only child."
  "有一天，你母亲生下了你，你是她第一个也是唯一的孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:1892
translate Chinese chapter1_8fcb249a:

  # "She had no idea what to do. She took you up in her arms and ran into the darkness of the forest, promising that she would ask the first man she met to be your Godfather."
  "她一筹莫展，把你抱在怀里，跑进幽暗的森林，发誓要请她遇见的第一个男人做你的教父。"

# game/script.rpy:1949
translate Chinese chapter1_167ac34b:

  # "In the darkness of the forest, she may or may not have met a man in white."
  "在森林的幽暗中，她也许遇见了一个白衣客，也许未曾遇见。"

# game/script.rpy:1950
translate Chinese chapter1_45c50df6:

  # "(Is anything certain these days?)"
  "（这年头，还有什么事是确定的呢？）"

# game/script.rpy:1951
translate Chinese chapter1_1feb23ba:

  # "His right hand held a dove. His other hand held a gun. His other hand held a crisp dollar bill. His other hand held a pillar of fire."
  "他的右手托着白鸽，另一只手握着枪，另一只手捏着崭新的钞票，另一只手擎着一柱烈火。"

# game/script.rpy:1952
translate Chinese chapter1_22374aaa:

  # "His suit was perfect. His face was too bright to look upon. He already knew what was on her mind."
  "他的西装完美无瑕。面容光辉夺目，令人不敢直视。他早已看透了她的心思。"

# game/script.rpy:1955
translate Chinese chapter1_7eb2f7e4:

  # miw "Poor woman. Let me be the Godfather."
  miw "可怜的女人。让我来做这孩子的教父吧。"

# game/script.rpy:1956
translate Chinese chapter1_a2752b81:

  # miw "I shall hold this child, and make sure [hes] happy on this Earth for the rest of [his] days."
  miw "我将在洗礼上托举这个孩子，保[his]此生在世上幸福喜乐。"

# game/script.rpy:1964
translate Chinese characterIntros_e2406251:

  # "To the north lived a cunning thief."
  "在北方，住着一个狡诈的神偷。"

# game/script.rpy:1975
translate Chinese characterIntros_7189d0ed:

  # "To the north, there was nothing and no-one."
  "在北方，空无一物，空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:1987
translate Chinese characterIntros_ac8ef21c:

  # "To the west, a cackling witch."
  "在西方，住着一个咯咯怪笑的女巫。"

# game/script.rpy:1997
translate Chinese characterIntros_e8954f26:

  # "To the west, there was nothing and no-one."
  "在西方，空无一物，空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:2010
translate Chinese characterIntros_aa5a585f:

  # "To the east, a haughty toad."
  "在东方，住着一只高傲的蟾蜍。"

# game/script.rpy:2020
translate Chinese characterIntros_ab0d41a8:

  # "To the east, there was nothing and no-one."
  "在东方，空无一物，空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:2033
translate Chinese characterIntros_37cd2d5d:

  # "To the south, a wise mushroom."
  "在南方，住着一株睿智的蘑菇。"

# game/script.rpy:2044
translate Chinese characterIntros_57906e1f:

  # "To the south, there was nothing and no-one."
  "在南方，空无一物，空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:2061
translate Chinese firstMan_7384aeb5:

  # miw "I will ask only one thing: [He] must work hard, and earn every dollar, and obey me above all else." nointeract
  miw "我只有一个要求：这孩子必须辛勤劳作，赚取每一分钱，并且要将服从我置于一切之上。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:2066
translate Chinese godYes_48d5fef0:

  # miw "As I have foreseen."
  miw "一如我所预见。"

# game/script.rpy:2067
translate Chinese godYes_626c47fc:

  # "He bowed down and placed His great hand upon you, leaving His mark on your right hand."
  "他俯下身，巨手覆上你的身躯，在你右手烙下了印记。"

# game/script.rpy:2068
translate Chinese godYes_22adc8da:

  # miw "You will name [him] [povname]."
  miw "你要给[him]起名叫[povname]。"

# game/script.rpy:2070
translate Chinese godYes_15e8b1b1:

  # miw "I will come for the child the moment [he] turn eighteen. Keep [him] safe for me until then."
  miw "待[he]满十八岁那刻，我便会来接这孩子。在此之前，替我保[him]平安。"

# game/script.rpy:2072
translate Chinese godYes_2144befa:

  # miw "I will come for the child the moment [he] turns eighteen. Keep [him] safe for me until then."
  miw "待[he]满十八岁那刻，我便会来接这孩子。在此之前，替我保[him]平安。"

# game/script.rpy:2081
translate Chinese godYes_d59ce897:

  # "But He was talking to Himself."
  "但他只是在自言自语。"

# game/script.rpy:2082
translate Chinese godYes_9c80220d:

  # "He looked around, holding the child."
  "他抱着孩子，环顾四周。"

# game/script.rpy:2083
translate Chinese godYes_eb4df7fc:

  # "There was no-one there."
  "那里空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:2087
translate Chinese godYes_b45eef13:

  # "There never was.{vspace=200}{i}In your notes, write down that {b}You are the Godchild of the King of Kings.{/b}{/i}"
  "从来都只有他。{vspace=200}{i}在你的笔记中写下，{b}你是万王之王的教子。{/b}{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:2091
translate Chinese godYes_0ec3798f:

  # mum "Just make sure you're there for the christening."
  mum "只要确保洗礼时你在场就好。"

# game/script.rpy:2095
translate Chinese godYes_3162b7ae:

  # "But He was already gone.{vspace=200}{i}In your notes, write down that {b}You are the Godchild of the King of Kings.{/b}{/i}"
  "但他已经不见了。{vspace=200}{i}在你的笔记中写下，{b}你是万王之王的教子。{/b}{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:2099
translate Chinese godYes_ef733c9e:

  # mum "Then I don't want you as the Godfather. You give to the rich, and take from the poor. You are no Lord of mine."
  mum "那么我不要你做教父。你劫贫济富，算不得我的主。"

# game/script.rpy:2100
translate Chinese godYes_54ec4d3b:

  # "(She said this foolish thing, with no understanding of how wisely the Lord distributes wealth and poverty.)"
  "（她说了这番蠢话，全然不懂主在分配富贵与贫穷时的无上睿智。）"

# game/script.rpy:2101
translate Chinese godYes_d9184f7f:

  # "Then she turned away from Him and ran into the forest."
  "随后她转过身，跑进了森林。"

# game/script.rpy:2104
translate Chinese godYes_a969500b:

  # miw "I am your dear Lord."
  miw "我是你亲爱的主。"

# game/script.rpy:2109
translate Chinese secondMan1_49cdd6d7:

  # "In the deeper darkness of the forest, she may or may not have met a man all in red."
  "在森林更深处的幽暗中，她也许遇见了一个红衣客，也许未曾遇见。"

# game/script.rpy:2110
translate Chinese secondMan1_775bd3cf:

  # "(How can we be sure of anything but the greatness of G-d?)"
  "（除了主的伟大，我们还能对什么确信无疑呢？）"

# game/script.rpy:2111
translate Chinese secondMan1_941bd86c:

  # "All the jewels of the earth fell from His right hand, and all the pleasures of the world fell from His left, and His other hand held all the wonders of the universe, and His other hand held a fat cigar, and His other hand held a long knife black as coal dust, and His other hand held the most intoxicating spices, such that the King of Kings would cry to taste them, and His other hand held a single dead rose, and His other hand was in his pocket and out of view."
  "世间的所有珠宝从他右手滑落，世间的一切欢愉从他左手流泻；他的另一只手托着宇宙万象的奇观，另一只手夹着粗大的雪茄，另一只手握着漆黑如煤灰的长刀，另一只手捧着最醉人的香料，连万王之王尝了都会落泪；他的另一只手捏着枯萎的玫瑰，而他的另一只手插在口袋里，藏在暗处。"

# game/script.rpy:2112
translate Chinese secondMan1_f38751b9:

  # mir "Poor woman. Let me be the Godfather."
  mir "可怜的女人。让我来做这孩子的教父吧。"

# game/script.rpy:2113
translate Chinese secondMan1_895cb9b6:

  # mir "I'll make sure the child needs nothing, and wants everything. [He] shall live in wealth and comfort for all of [his] days, and devour only the richest meats for every meal."
  mir "我会确保这孩子所需皆有，却又欲壑难填。这孩子此生都将在荣华富贵中度过，顿顿只享用最肥美的肉。"

# game/script.rpy:2119
translate Chinese secondMan2_2507629f:

  # mir "I only have one condition: [He] must promise to obey no master, and scorn the rule of law, and do as [he] wilt every day of [his] life." nointeract
  mir "我唯有一个条件：[He]必须立誓不奉任何人为王，蔑视一切法则，此生此世行[he]欲行之事，为[he]欲行之为。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:2121
translate Chinese secondMan2_5aebfe7f:

  # mum "Very well. Beggars can't be choosers, I suppose."
  mum "好吧。我想，叫花子没资格挑肥拣瘦。"

# game/script.rpy:2122
translate Chinese secondMan2_fc87549f:

  # mir "Excellent!"
  mir "极好！"

