  "那里空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:2198
translate Chinese deathYes_00936b23:

  # "There never was.{vspace=200}{i}In your notes, write down that {b}You are Death's Godchild.{/b}{/i}"
  "从来都只有他。{vspace=200}{i}在你的笔记中写下，{b}你是死神的教子。{/b}{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:2202
translate Chinese deathYes_1a953895:

  # mum "Just make sure you're there for the christening on Sunday."
  mum "只要确保周日的洗礼你在场就好。"

# game/script.rpy:2206
translate Chinese deathYes_21b890d4:

  # "But She was already leaving. She crawled into the earth with Her long, broken legs trailing behind her, until she was swallowed up whole.{vspace=160}{i}In your notes, write down that {b}You are Death's Godchild.{/b}{/i}"
  "但她已然离开。她向泥土中爬去，修长残破的双腿拖在身后，直到被大地完全吞没。{vspace=160}{i}在你的笔记中写下，{b}你是死神的教子。{/b}{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:2210
translate Chinese deathYes_18f1893d:

  # mum "I don't want you as the Godmother. You take men before it is their time."
  mum "我不要你做教母。你总在人们命数未尽时就将他们夺走。"

# game/script.rpy:2211
translate Chinese deathYes_b806ecbe:

  # wib "There is no-one else left to take [him]."
  wib "已经没有其他人能收下这孩子了。"

# game/script.rpy:2212
translate Chinese deathYes_da16cdc7:

  # wib "You must make your choice."
  wib "你必须做出选择。"

# game/script.rpy:2219
translate Chinese deathYes_bf0470a0:

  # "In desperation, she renounced her foolish pride and sought the protection of the Most High Himself."
  "绝望之中，她抛弃了愚蠢的骄傲，去寻求至高者的亲自庇护。"

# game/script.rpy:2222
translate Chinese deathYes_2b04424f:

  # "In desperation, she turned back and sought the protection of the deceiver Himself."
  "绝望之中，她只能回头，去寻求欺诈者的亲自庇护。"

# game/script.rpy:2225
translate Chinese deathYes_5ad076f1:

  # mum "I'm sorry for my foolish words. Please, protect my child."
  mum "请原谅我的口不择言。求求您，保护我的孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:2245
translate Chinese deathYes_14578651:

  # mum "I don't know you."
  mum "我不认识你。"

# game/script.rpy:2246
translate Chinese deathYes_e14819bb:

  # wib "Everyone knows me."
  wib "每个人都认识我。"

# game/script.rpy:2247
translate Chinese deathYes_c2da8e22:

  # "She tilted her head so that the moonlight fell upon it, and your mother saw that it was true. The woman was Lady Death Herself."
  "她微微仰起头，任由月光倾泻在自己脸上。你母亲看出她所言非虚。这女人正是死神女士本尊。"

# game/script.rpy:2258
translate Chinese chapter2_6044d994:

  # "And so you grew up alone in an old cottage on stilts in the forest."
  "于是，你在森林里的一座破旧的高脚木屋中独自长大了。"

# game/script.rpy:2260
translate Chinese chapter2_b045f94d:

  # "There were many miraculous things in the house. The table was set. The larder was fully stocked. You had plenty of food to survive on."
  "屋内充满了不可思议的事物。餐桌上总是备好饭菜，储藏室总是满满当当。你永远不愁温饱。"

# game/script.rpy:2261
translate Chinese chapter2_e56ce8ae:

  # "Where did it come from? You couldn't recall."
  "这些东西从何而来？你记不清了。"

# game/script.rpy:2262
translate Chinese chapter2_b98e5bb0:

  # "The closets were filled with clothes of all sizes. In the bedroom was a hand-sewn patchwork quilt that fit just right."
  "壁橱里塞满了各种尺寸的衣服。卧室里有一床手工缝制的百衲被，大小正合适。"

# game/script.rpy:2263
translate Chinese chapter2_e9c8165c:

  # "How did these things come to pass? You didn't trouble yourself with such thoughts. Whenever you encountered these miracles, you simply said:"
  "这一切是怎么回事？你从不拿这些问题自寻烦恼。每当遇到这些奇迹，你只会说一句："

# game/script.rpy:2264
translate Chinese chapter2_97b69347:

  # pov "The House provides."
  pov "屋宅自有赐予。"

# game/script.rpy:2271
translate Chinese chapter2_3dffd2f9:

  # "And so you grew up as a kind and well-mannered child, and you made your mother proud."
  "于是，你长成了一个善良懂事的孩子，成了你母亲的骄傲。"

# game/script.rpy:2272
translate Chinese chapter2_2f687f84:

  # "You went to church every Sunday and worked hard every day of your life, and never did you succumb to the beast within. All the neighbours smiled and said \"That one has the mark of G-d upon [him].\""
  "你每个周日都去教堂，每一天都辛勤劳作，从未屈从于心中的猛兽。所有的邻居都微笑着说：“那孩子身上有主的印记。”"

# game/script.rpy:2273
translate Chinese chapter2_1cc42f8f:

  # "Your Godfather was as good as His word. He appeared at church for the christening, and blessed you."
  "你的教父信守诺言。他在教堂的洗礼上现身，为你赐福。"

# game/script.rpy:2274
translate Chinese chapter2_92f79715:

  # "You soon found that luck was always in your favour, and everyone took to calling you \"Fortune's Favourite\"."
  "你很快发现自己总是鸿运当头，大家都开始叫你“命运宠儿”。"

# game/script.rpy:2276
translate Chinese chapter2_5baad0da:

  # "And so you grew up as a wild and wilful child, and your drove your mother to distraction with your wickedness."
  "于是，你长成了一个狂野任性的孩子，你的顽劣让你母亲伤透了神。"

# game/script.rpy:2277
translate Chinese chapter2_37fd813c:

  # "You obeyed no laws and no masters, and you roamed heedlessly across the hills and dales, cackling wildly and throwing mud in your wake, and all the neighbours said \"That one has the Devil's mark upon [him],\" and shut their doors."
  "你不守法纪，不服管教，在漫山遍野间肆意游荡。你一路尖声狂笑，所过之处泥巴乱飞。所有的邻居都说：“那孩子身上有魔鬼的印记”，然后紧闭家门。"

# game/script.rpy:2279
translate Chinese chapter2_6e654b5d:

  # "This so grieved your mother that she fell down dead."
  "这让你母亲悲痛欲绝，最终倒地而亡。"

# game/script.rpy:2281
translate Chinese chapter2_01ceb1bc:

  # "In spite of this, you still did not mend your wicked ways. Your ill deeds were rewarded, for you soon found that you could scarcely trip over a stone without unearthing precious diamonds and gems, and you became rich beyond the dreams of avarice."
  "尽管如此，你依然死性不改。你的恶行得到了回报，因为你很快发现，随便被哪块石头绊一跤，都能挖出璀璨的钻石珠玉。你聚敛的财富，令世间最贪婪的狂想都相形见绌。"

# game/script.rpy:2283
translate Chinese chapter2_4c2ac8a5:

  # "And so you grew up as a solemn and quiet child, and you made your mother sick with worry with your gloomy ways."
  "于是，你长成了一个严肃安静的孩子，你那阴郁的性子让你母亲忧心成疾。"

# game/script.rpy:2284
translate Chinese chapter2_a72ded99:

  # "You ate very little and said even less, and every night you would stalk quietly through the forest shadows or sit for long hours watching insects crawl in stagnant ponds, and all the neighbours said \"That one has the mark of Death upon [him],\" and shut their doors."
  "你吃得很少，话更少。每天夜里，你要么在森林的阴影中无声游荡，要么在死水塘边一坐就是好几个小时，盯着虫子爬行。所有的邻居都说：“那孩子身上有死神的印记”，然后紧闭家门。"

# game/script.rpy:2287
translate Chinese chapter2_aa63c244:

  # "You lived with your twelve siblings in a house on stilts on the banks of a muddy river in a vast rainforest."
  "你和十二个兄弟姐妹住在广袤雨林中一条浑浊河畔的高脚屋里。"

# game/script.rpy:2289
translate Chinese chapter2_118fa042:

  # "You lived with your ten siblings in a house on stilts on the banks of a muddy river in a vast rainforest."
  "你和十个兄弟姐妹住在广袤雨林中一条浑浊河畔的高脚屋里。"

# game/script.rpy:2291
translate Chinese chapter2_708424a6:

  # "You lived with your four siblings in a house on stilts on the banks of a muddy river in a vast rainforest."
  "你和四个兄弟姐妹住在广袤雨林中一条浑浊河畔的高脚屋里。"

# game/script.rpy:2295
translate Chinese chapter2_1ef7e51d:

  # "Your mother loved you very much, and you lived with her and your twelve siblings in a house on stilts on the banks of a muddy river in a vast rainforest. Each night you would fall fast asleep under the patchwork quilt she knitted for you."
  "你的母亲非常爱你。你和她，以及你的十二个兄弟姐妹，住在广袤雨林中一条浑浊河畔的高脚屋里。每天夜里，你都会在她为你缝制的百衲被下酣然入睡。"

# game/script.rpy:2297
translate Chinese chapter2_886aa581:

  # "Your mother loved you very much, and you lived with her and your ten siblings in a house on stilts on the banks of a muddy river in a vast rainforest. Each night you would fall fast asleep under the patchwork quilt she knitted for you."
  "你的母亲非常爱你。你和她，以及你的十个兄弟姐妹，住在广袤雨林中一条浑浊河畔的高脚屋里。每天夜里，你都会在她为你缝制的百衲被下酣然入睡。"

# game/script.rpy:2299
translate Chinese chapter2_ad3787e6:

  # "Your mother loved you very much, and you lived with her and your four siblings in a house on stilts on the banks of a muddy river in a vast rainforest. Each night you would fall fast asleep under the patchwork quilt she knitted for you."
  "你的母亲非常爱你。你和她，以及你的四个兄弟姐妹，住在广袤雨林中一条浑浊河畔的高脚屋里。每天夜里，你都会在她为你缝制的百衲被下酣然入睡。"

# game/script.rpy:2331
translate Chinese mapOpens_8ffab238:

  # "The lands around your house were strange."
  "你家周围的土地十分奇异。"

# game/script.rpy:2366
translate Chinese neighbours_7189d0ed:

  # "To the north, there was nothing and no-one."
  "在北方，空无一物，空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:2372
translate Chinese neighbours_26f3d796:

  # "Do not ask lightly of the northern forest, my child."
  "孩子，切莫轻易打探北方的森林。"

# game/script.rpy:2373
translate Chinese neighbours_43364b91:

  # "That was a cursed place where wicked sprites and gleeful ghosts held sway. All who lived there slept uneasily in their beds as they heard the Goblin Train rattle past their windows each night."
  "那是个受诅咒的地方，由邪恶的妖精和欢闹作祟的幽灵所统治。住在那里的人每晚都会听到哥布林列车呼啸着从窗外驶过，夜不能寐。"

# game/script.rpy:2375
translate Chinese neighbours_9388ac02:

  # "The worst of them all was the Master Thief, a dextrous and sinister figure who was said to have all manner of powers."
  "他们中最难缠的莫过于神偷。据说那是个身手敏捷、阴险狡诈的人物，拥有各种各样的能力。"

# game/script.rpy:2376
translate Chinese neighbours_b41e88d8:

  # "It was said on moonless nights their long, long arms would stretch through your window and up your stairs and into your bedroom and steal your dreams right out from under your pillow. In a single motion their long, long legs would carry them away to a secret hideout where they would place your forgotten thoughts in a sack of mysterious things, never to be seen again."
  "传说在无月的黑夜，那极长极长的双臂会从窗户探入，沿着楼梯蜿蜒而上，一路探进你的卧室，直接从你的枕头底下偷走你的梦。紧接着，那奇长的双腿只需大步一跨，便能把他带回秘密的巢穴。在那里，神偷会把你遗忘的思绪塞进一个装着神秘物件的麻袋，从此再无踪迹。"

# game/script.rpy:2377
translate Chinese neighbours_cdac6370:

  # "No jail could hold them and no lock could bar them entry."
  "没有哪座监狱能关住其身，也没有哪把锁能挡住其步。"

# game/script.rpy:2378
translate Chinese neighbours_26777d35:

  # "Or so it was said."
  "至少传说是这样的。"

# game/script.rpy:2390
translate Chinese neighbours_ab0d41a8:

  # "To the east, there was nothing and no-one."
  "在东方，空无一物，空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:2396
translate Chinese neighbours_4873ce8c:

  # "To the east, the river flowed down to the coast. The mangrove trees swayed in the summer heat, and the air thrummed with chanting in honour of the insect god, Karnopticon."
  "在东方，河流一路奔向海岸。红树林在夏日的酷暑中摇曳，空气中震荡着敬奉虫神卡诺普提孔的颂歌，嗡嗡作响。"

# game/script.rpy:2398
translate Chinese neighbours_5970f551:

  # "On the edge of the swamp was a grand manor, owned by a noble frog lord."
  "沼泽边缘有一座宏伟的庄园，主人是一位高贵的青蛙领主。"

# game/script.rpy:2399
translate Chinese neighbours_7604fdd8:

  # "He was rarely seen, but people whispered that he was wiser than Solomon and richer than Midas. Kings and prophets would come from across the land to seek his counsel and gaze with envy upon the glittering spires of his house. To buy even a single gem from amoung the hundreds that adorned the manor would bankrupt any one of them."
  "很少有人见过他，但人们私下里议论，说他比所罗门更睿智，比迈达斯更富有。各地的国王与先知纷纷慕名而来，向其求取真知，嫉妒地凝视着他那闪耀的庄园尖塔。庄园里点缀着数百颗奇珍异宝，哪怕他们倾尽家财，也换不来其中的区区一颗。"

# game/script.rpy:2400
translate Chinese neighbours_26777d35_1:

  # "Or so it was said."
  "至少传说是这样的。"

# game/script.rpy:2413
translate Chinese neighbours_57906e1f:

  # "To the south, there was nothing and no-one."
  "在南方，空无一物，空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:2420
translate Chinese neighbours_4e97d10c:

  # "Ah! In fact, the south river and the forest around it was watched over by a wise mushroom ambassador, who had owned these lands since before anyone could remember."
  "啊！事实上，南方的河流及其周边的森林，都由一位睿智的蘑菇大使守护。远在人类有记忆的漫长岁月之前，她便已是这片土地的主人。"

# game/script.rpy:2421
translate Chinese neighbours_63aae58f:

  # "On cold clear nights, you could see her walking through the depths of the forest with her white veil and delicate waves of silver spores drifting behind her."
  "在寒冷晴朗的夜晚，你可以看到她在森林深处漫步。白色的面纱和如轻纱般荡漾的银色孢子在她身后随风飘动。"

# game/script.rpy:2422
translate Chinese neighbours_f5a121f2:

  # "She allowed your family to live on the river and use her lands, under one condition."
  "她允许你的家人住在河边、使用她的土地，但有一个条件。"

# game/script.rpy:2423
translate Chinese neighbours_3250871e:

  # m "Ask not of what concerns you not, lest you hear what pleases you not."
  m "勿问身外事，免听逆耳言。"

# game/script.rpy:2424
translate Chinese neighbours_76287e37:

  # "Your family accepted her wishes, and so you let each other be."
  "你的家人遵从了她的意愿，于是你们互不干涉，相安无事。"

# game/script.rpy:2425
translate Chinese neighbours_0fda2368:

  # "She was often away brokering trade agreements and peace treaties and delicate alliances between the many trees and plants and old warring ferns of the forest."
  "她常常出门在外，在林间繁多的草木与古老而好斗的蕨草之间穿针引线，斡旋于贸易协定与和平条约，维系着脆弱的同盟。"

# game/script.rpy:2426
translate Chinese neighbours_26777d35_2:

  # "Or so it was said."
  "至少传说是这样的。"

# game/script.rpy:2441
translate Chinese neighbours_e8954f26:

  # "To the west, there was nothing and no-one."
  "在西方，空无一物，空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:2448
translate Chinese neighbours_f28ab257:

  # "None dared venture to the western mountains, for all the lands around it were said to be home to a terrible witch."
  "无人敢踏足西方的群山，因为据说那周围的所有土地都是一个可怕女巫的领地。"

# game/script.rpy:2449
translate Chinese neighbours_4d72b4c9:

  # "Her hut lay deep under a secret lake, and she would emerge on moonless nights when the waters of that lake turned still and silver-green."
  "她的小屋深藏在一座神秘湖泊的湖底。当无月之夜，湖水平静、泛起银绿时，她便会浮出水面。"

# game/script.rpy:2450
translate Chinese neighbours_2f0a37fb:

  # "The witches held their Sabbath on the mountain to the east, and when the sky was clear you could see the peak blaze with fire, and the Destroyer himself would emerge to dance in the firelight."
  "女巫们在东边的山上举行巫魔宴。当天空晴朗时，你可以看到山峰燃起熊熊烈火，而毁灭者本尊会在火光中现身狂舞。"

# game/script.rpy:2451
translate Chinese neighbours_26777d35_3:

  # "Or so it was said."
  "至少传说是这样的。"

# game/script.rpy:2479
translate Chinese introMenu_3ac479fb:

  # "Yours was a vast and silent land."
  "你的家乡是一片广袤而寂静的土地。"

# game/script.rpy:2480
translate Chinese introMenu_6b7547c3:

  # "At times you could walk for days without seeing another soul."
  "有时你走上几天，也见不到半个人影。"

# game/script.rpy:2481
translate Chinese introMenu_b871e00c:

  # "You dared not venture out often. Whenever you did, you felt the pressure of that gigantic emptiness lurking just out of sight like a bottomless ocean, and fled quickly back to the safety of your home."
  "你不敢经常外出。每当你走出去，总会感到一种巨大而深不见底的空虚。它如汪洋般潜伏在视线边缘，压迫着你，让你赶紧逃回安全的家中。"

# game/script.rpy:2483
translate Chinese introMenu_c830f6b6:

  # "The outside world was quiet. The land lay still."
  "外界寂静无声。大地沉眠不语。"

# game/script.rpy:2484
translate Chinese introMenu_94d8e2d4:

  # "But inside your body, your bones roiled and your flesh threatened riot."
  "但在你的体内，你的骨骼在翻腾，你的血肉几欲反叛。"

# game/script.rpy:2485
translate Chinese introMenu_f700df26:

  # "At times even your own hands turned against you and scuttled out into the night to cause terrible mischief while you slept, so that you would wake to find strange signs and marks and bites upon them and jewelled rings on each crooked finger."
  "有时，就连你的双手也会背叛你。它们会在你熟睡时，悉悉索索地爬入黑夜，惹出可怕的麻烦；以至于当你醒来时，会发现手上布满奇怪的印记、划痕和咬痕，每根扭曲的手指上还戴着镶满宝石的戒指。"

# game/script.rpy:2486
translate Chinese introMenu_74d3c3a3:

  # "Your skull was haunted by restless ghosts that cradled your brain and forced terrible thoughts into your mind at all hours; the bones in your spine became infested with sprites (which made your back crack in twisted and painful ways all through your long life) the blood in your veins was, of course, only a red water nixie that pulsed throughout your body, constantly seeking escape, and even your soul itself was simply a small shard of G-d, caught inside you and vibrating wildly. Not a single scrap of your own body, mind or soul was actually your own."
  "你的颅骨里盘踞着焦躁不安的幽灵，它们捧着你的大脑，无时无刻不在将骇人的恶念强灌进你的脑海；你脊柱的骨节里滋生着妖精（这让你的后背在你漫长的一生中，总是以扭曲而痛苦的方式嘎吱作响）；你血管中的血液，理所当然，不过是只红色的水妖，随脉搏在你体内悸动不休，不断试图逃脱；甚至连你的灵魂，也不过是主的一小块碎片，困在你的躯壳里狂乱地震颤。你的肉体、心智与灵魂，没有一丝一毫是真正属于你自己的。"

# game/script.rpy:2487
translate Chinese introMenu_a6a3cacd:

  # "There was no \"You\". Just a collection of monsters, writhing in borrowed skin."
  "根本就没有“你”。有的只是一群怪物，在借来的皮囊下蠕动。"

# game/script.rpy:2489
translate Chinese introMenu_4931fe8a:

  # "Your world was overrun. It festered. It swarmed."
  "你的世界已经沦陷。它在溃烂，爬满了异类。"

# game/script.rpy:2490
translate Chinese introMenu_04ccbdb7:

  # "Every tree and lantern and street-corner was teeming with gutterlings, bat-folk, scab-eaters, rounds, lurks, sworlk, nathorn-hobs, lantern-lings, curselings, grimmel-dobbies, fold-overs, whisper kings, hook-takers, the cannibal wind howling 'cross the plains, ghost water pooling luminescent in underground caverns. Every house was haunted and every knife was drawn against the dark."
  "每一棵树、每一盏灯、每一个街角都爬满了阴沟小鬼、蝙蝠人、食痂鬼、滚球怪、潜伏者、涡兽、纳索小妖、提灯精、咒灵、格里梅尔地精、折叠怪、低语之王以及夺钩者。食人风在平原上呼啸，幽灵水在地下洞穴中泛着荧光。家家户户邪祟盘踞，刀枪剑戟向夜出鞘。"

# game/script.rpy:2491
translate Chinese introMenu_55c1420d:

  # "Yet still, there were strange hollow places where nothing lived. No sound escaped the stillness of that lacuna. If anything walked there, it walked alone."
  "然而，依然有一些奇异的空洞地带，那里寸草不生。没有任何声音能逃脱那种空缺。如果有什么在那片空缺中行走，必定是踽踽独行。"

# game/script.rpy:2493
translate Chinese introMenu_7c576d42:

  # "Yours was a many-haunted land, my child."
  "孩子，你的家乡是一片鬼魅丛生的土地。"

# game/script.rpy:2494
translate Chinese introMenu_f4f03c26:

  # "Back in those days you could barely take a step without stumbling over a ghost, gutterling, hook-taker, scab-eater, batfolk or gringe. The earth was overrun. Every house was haunted and the Devil lurked at every crossroad."
  "在那些日子里，你几乎寸步难行，随便走一步就会被幽灵、阴沟小鬼、夺钩者、食痂鬼、蝙蝠人或格灵怪绊倒。大地已经沦陷。每座房子都在闹鬼，每个十字路口都潜伏着魔鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:2495
translate Chinese introMenu_11f95f46:

  # "In fact the whole earth was overrun with trolls, hob-and-lanthorns, gringes, cutties and nisses, boguests, bonelesses, boggleboes, black-bugs and night-bats, clabbernappers, corpse lights, candles and Gabriel-hounds, mawkins, hodge-pochers, korreds, lubberkins, cluricauns, hob-thrushes, tod-lowries, Jack-in-the-Wads, men-in-the-oak, dudmen, yeth-hounds, mormos, changelings, redcaps, colt-pixies, Tom-thumbs, madcaps, scrags, spectres, scar-bugs, shag-foals, Jinny-burnt-tails, dopple-gangers, and apparitions of every shape, make, form, and fashion."
  "事实上，整个世界都挤满了巨魔、提灯游魂、格灵怪、短衣妖与尼西小神、波盖特怪、无骨软怪、波格怪、黑虫怪与夜蝙蝠、克拉伯纳伯怪、尸火、蜡烛精与加百列猎犬、毛金怪、大杂烩怪、科雷怪、懒汉精灵、酒窖小妖、霍布画眉妖、托德劳里狐妖、杰克鬼火、橡树人、稻草人怪、野猎犬、莫尔莫恶灵、调包儿、红帽子妖、小马妖、拇指汤姆、疯帽子妖、瘦骨怪、幽灵、疤痕虫怪、粗毛马驹怪、金妮烧尾鬼火、二重身，以及形形色色、千奇百怪的幻影。"

# game/script.rpy:2501
translate Chinese introMenu_0d7d6864:

  # "Well, it was a rich house, and you had everything you could ever want."
  "嗯，那是个富贵的家，你拥有你想要的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:2503
translate Chinese introMenu_48440043:

  # "Well, it was a happy house."
  "嗯，那是个快乐的家。"

# game/script.rpy:2504
translate Chinese introMenu_b2dea097:

  # "The house was always full of chatter from your ten siblings, and you were always cramped for space with all of them around."
  "房子里总是充满你那十个兄弟姐妹的叽叽喳喳声，有他们在，你总觉得空间逼仄。"

# game/script.rpy:2505
translate Chinese introMenu_be73521b:

  # "But still, sometimes you would get a hollow feeling inside you, and walk out of the house to stare into the dark woods beyond."
  "但有时候，你内心仍会涌起一种空虚感，于是你会走出屋子，凝视外面幽暗的树林。"

# game/script.rpy:2506
translate Chinese introMenu_0891572a:

  # "No matter how many people were around you, you felt like something was missing."
  "不管身边有多少人，你总觉得少了些什么。"

# game/script.rpy:2507
translate Chinese introMenu_b535dcee:

  # "Every year, on the day before your birthday, the village would throw a twilight festival for no reason anyone could name. On these nights you always felt strange."
  "每年，在你生日的前一天，村里都会举办一场说不出由来的暮光庆典。在这些夜晚，你总是感觉很奇怪。"

# game/script.rpy:2508
translate Chinese introMenu_61b53533:

  # "You would avoid the festival and stare deep into the woods all through the night."
  "你会避开庆典，整晚都凝视着森林深处。"

# game/script.rpy:2512
translate Chinese introMenu_494f26de:

  # "Well, it was a happy home. The house was always full of chatter from your four siblings, and you were always cramped for space with all of them around."
  "嗯，那是个快乐的家。房子里总是充满你那四个兄弟姐妹的叽叽喳喳声，有他们在，你总觉得空间逼仄。"

# game/script.rpy:2513
translate Chinese introMenu_eddd3111:

  # "But at night, when the others had gone to bed, you felt a latent silence lurking in the house."
  "但是到了夜里，等其他人都睡下，你会感觉到房子里潜伏着一种隐秘的死寂。"

# game/script.rpy:2514
translate Chinese introMenu_270d3ca6:

  # "Underneath the old floorboards. Inside the crooked walls."
  "在破旧的地板下。在倾斜的墙壁里。"

# game/script.rpy:2515
translate Chinese introMenu_7bfc4222:

  # "Waiting for its time to come."
  "等待着它的时刻降临。"

# game/script.rpy:2516
translate Chinese introMenu_5b7b0f8b:

  # "Not long now."
  "已经不远了。"

# game/script.rpy:2522
translate Chinese introMenu_ab03be07:

  # "You lived a contented life. No-one bothered you. The stoop was full of fresh-cut logs for the fireplace. The house had many beds, so that you never lacked for a place to sleep."
  "你过着心满意足的生活。没人打扰你。门廊上堆满了壁炉用的新砍圆木。房子里有许多床，所以你从不缺睡觉的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:2523
translate Chinese introMenu_97b69347:

  # pov "The House provides."
  pov "屋宅自有赐予。"

# game/script.rpy:2524
translate Chinese introMenu_7847b71d:

  # "You kept yourself busy and distracted as much as you could. But every day there came that terrible time when you finally had to lie down alone in bed."
  "你尽可能让自己忙个不停，不去多想。但每一天，那个可怕的时刻终会到来——你不得不独自躺在床上。"

# game/script.rpy:2525
translate Chinese introMenu_c06a4f2d:

  # "As you lay awake in bed at night, you felt the silence."
  "夜里躺在床上无法入眠时，你会感觉到那种死寂。"

# game/script.rpy:2526
translate Chinese introMenu_6192752c:

  # "It lurked behind everything. Like a shadow on the wall of something that you dared not turn around to see."
  "它潜伏在万物背后。就像墙上投下的一道阴影，而你根本不敢回头去看那个投下阴影的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:2527
translate Chinese introMenu_7850b3e8:

  # "You found yourself leaving the taps going, the fire roaring, keeping the pots and pans rattling just to shut it out. Just so you couldn't hear what lay behind the sound."
  "你不由自主地任由水龙头哗哗长流，让炉火烧得劈啪作响，把锅碗瓢盆弄得叮当作响，只求能隔绝那片死寂。只求不必去听那声音背后蛰伏着什么。"

# game/script.rpy:2536
translate Chinese introMenu_8566e63a:

  # "Soon you could stand it no longer. You knew there would be a festival in town tonight (although you could not have said how you knew this)."
  "很快，你再也受不了了。你知道镇上今晚会有庆典，尽管你也说不清自己是如何知道的。"

# game/script.rpy:2537
translate Chinese introMenu_f78b0dd8:

  # "You searched the pantry and found a package wrapped up with a coinpurse, along with some bread and meat."
  "你在储藏室里翻找，发现了一个与钱袋绑在一起的包裹，还有些面包和肉。"

# game/script.rpy:2538
translate Chinese introMenu_97b69347_1:

  # pov "The House provides."
  pov "屋宅自有赐予。"

# game/script.rpy:2546
translate Chinese introMenu_b981911d:

  # "Alas, all too soon, the eve of your eighteenth birthday arrived. You set about in wild terror, for you knew that your Godmother would own your immortal soul as soon as the clock struck midnight."
  "唉，十八岁生日的前夕转眼即至。你陷入了极度的恐慌，因为你知道，午夜钟声一响，你的教母就会收走你不朽的灵魂。"

# game/script.rpy:2547
translate Chinese introMenu_86cf8288:

  # "You had no doubt that She would soon send Her three messengers for you, and then take you down to the kingdom of ruin forever."
  "你毫不怀疑，她很快就会派来三位信使，然后永远地将你带往毁灭的国度。"

# game/script.rpy:2549
translate Chinese introMenu_b03cdc91:

  # "Alas, all too soon, the eve of your eighteenth birthday arrived. You set about in wild terror, for you knew that your Godfather would come to take you away as soon as the clock struck midnight, and you had no wish to leave just yet."
  "唉，十八岁生日的前夕转眼即至。你陷入了极度的恐慌，因为你知道，午夜钟声一响，你的教父就会来把你带走，而你现在还不想离开。"

# game/script.rpy:2551
translate Chinese introMenu_df11a4c9:

  # "The closer the hour grew, the more frantic you became. You knew you would soon pay dearly for all your years of wicked indolence."
  "那个时刻越近，你越发狂乱。你知道，自己很快就会为这么多年罪恶的怠惰付出惨痛代价。"

# game/script.rpy:2552
translate Chinese introMenu_751589e4:

  # pov "I know. I'll go to the village festival this eve. There will be travellers there from all over this haunted land. Surely one of them will know how to save me from my terrible fate."
  pov "有了！今晚我就去村里的庆典。那里会有来自这片闹鬼之地的各路旅人。肯定有人知道如何将我从这可怕的命运中拯救出来。"

# game/script.rpy:2553
translate Chinese introMenu_321576eb:

  # "You gathered up your coinpurse, along with some bread and meat for the journey, and resolved to travel until you found a way to escape the Devil."
  "你带上钱袋，拿上旅途所需的干粮和肉，下定决心要一直走下去，直到找到逃离魔鬼的方法。"

# game/script.rpy:2555
translate Chinese introMenu_d94b8514:

  # mum "You must go to the festival tonight, my child. There will be travellers there from all over this wild earth. Surely one of them will know how to save you from this terrible fate."
  mum "孩子，今晚你必须去庆典。那里会有来自这片狂野大地的各路旅人。肯定有人知道如何将你从这可怕的命运中拯救出来。"

# game/script.rpy:2556
translate Chinese introMenu_01a855b5:

  # "She gave you a thick coinpurse, and some bread and meat for the journey."
  "她给了你一个鼓鼓囊囊的钱袋，以及旅途所需的干粮和肉。"

# game/script.rpy:2557
translate Chinese introMenu_80bd3e95:

  # mum "Go! But be careful of strangers, and do not leave the path."
  mum "去吧！但要当心陌生人，绝不要偏离小路。"

# game/script.rpy:2559
translate Chinese introMenu_87ba52cf:

  # mum "A terrible wolf lurks out there, in the space between the trees."
  mum "在那林木幽隙里，潜伏着一只可怕的狼。"

# game/script.rpy:2567
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_53f99785:

  # "And so you took up your belongings and strode on down the road to the festival."
  "于是你带上行囊，沿着大路向庆典大步走去。"

# game/script.rpy:2569
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_8993a103:

  # "The twilight set in. The wet cool mist of the rainforest settled around you."
  "暮色降临。雨林里湿冷的水汽在你周围弥漫。"

# game/script.rpy:2570
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_a65f7d99:

  # "You could see no animals stirring."
  "四周不见任何动物的踪迹。"

# game/script.rpy:2571
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_a45b6992:

  # "No birdsong disturbed the peace."
  "没有任何鸟鸣打破这份宁静。"

# game/script.rpy:2573
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_83a71b8c:

  # "The twilight set in. The crickets and cicadas all around began their chattering and squabbling, and the evening birds began to laugh and trill as the wet cool mist of the rainforest settled around you."
  "暮色渐浓。四周的蟋蟀与秋蝉开始聒噪争吵，初醒的夜鸟也开始欢笑啼啭；与此同时，雨林里湿冷的水汽在你周围弥漫。"

# game/script.rpy:2574
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_44c54ac0:

  # "The crooked old water-dragons looked sideways at you and plotted their long, slow schemes."
  "佝偻的老水龙侧目打量你，盘算着它们那漫长又漫长的阴谋。"

# game/script.rpy:2575
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_83ead349:

  # "A small turtle saw you coming and fled into the water with a splash."
  "一只小乌龟看到你走近，扑通一声逃进了水里。"

# game/script.rpy:2583
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_9034bb1d:

  # "In the depths of the woods, you heard nothing."
  "在森林深处，你什么也没听见。"

# game/script.rpy:2584
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_5119f10c:

  # "You saw no-one."
  "你没看到任何人。"

# game/script.rpy:2585
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_1b6ae7d8:

  # "You were alone."
  "你独自一人。"

# game/script.rpy:2586
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_7e507a6d:

  # "You continued on down the empty road."
  "你沿着空无一人的道路继续前行。"

# game/script.rpy:2591
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_f8fe74f5:

  # "As you walked down the road, you saw the wise mushroom moving through the deep darkness of the trees, her pale spores flowing in a fog behind her."
  "沿路前行时，你看见那株睿智的蘑菇穿梭于林木深处的幽暗中，苍白的孢子如雾气般在她身后弥散。"

# game/script.rpy:2598
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_16f02ffc:

  # "You left the path and followed her from a distance."
  "你离开小路，远远地跟在她后面。"

# game/script.rpy:2601
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_9ca04211:

  # "She walked into the towering buttress roots of an ancient strangler fig and cut the vines and swamp flowers from it to reveal a small blue door, inlaid with precious moonstone and intricate engravings."
  "她步入一棵古老绞杀榕高耸的板根之间，斩断攀附其上的藤蔓与沼生野花，露出一扇蓝色的小门，门上镶嵌着珍贵的月光石，刻有繁复的花纹。"

# game/script.rpy:2606
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_0c9134fa:

  # m "Gorge, guzzle, gulp and grab; never shall this wound scab.{vspace=160}{i}In your notes, write down that you {b}know the password.{/b}{/i}"
  m "狼吞、牛饮、虎咽、鹰攫；此伤此创，永不结痂。{vspace=160}{i}在你的笔记中写下，你{b}知道了暗号。{/b}{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:2616
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_c1514f47:

  # "You quickly snuck inside before the door closed behind you."
  "趁着大门还未合拢，你迅速溜了进去。"

# game/script.rpy:2620
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_7702fa80:

  # "Inside you were shocked to find the tree completely hollow. A boundless cavern was formed inside it, cold as ice despite the heat outside."
  "进去后你震惊地发现，这棵树完全是中空的。它的内部是一个无边无际的洞穴，尽管外面酷暑难耐，里面却寒冷如冰。"

# game/script.rpy:2621
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_7cad57c0:

  # "The floor of the cavern was piled with rubies and pearls and glinting onyx and solid gold pieces, larger than your fist."
  "洞窟的地面上堆满了红宝石、珍珠、熠熠生辉的缟玛瑙和赤金块，件件都比你的拳头还要大。"

# game/script.rpy:2622
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_85d6bd17:

  # "All across the room you saw lush silks and pillars of precious metals of every type and all manner of riches that would turn the King of Kings green with envy."
  "放眼望去，华美的丝绸铺陈满地，各种珍稀金属铸就的廊柱林立，各色奇珍异宝足以令万王之王都嫉妒得眼红。"

# game/script.rpy:2623
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_cf83b469:

  # "The glimmering magenta incense smoke rolled across the room and coated it all in a dark haze, smelling of the most incredible spices and herbs and enchanting odours."
  "泛着微光的绛紫熏烟在洞窟内缭绕，将周遭的一切笼罩在晦暗的烟霾里，空气中弥漫着不可思议的香料、草药与迷人芬芳交织的奇异气息。"

# game/script.rpy:2624
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_5c8229e0:

  # "There was no sign of the mushroom anywhere."
  "蘑菇不见了踪影。"

# game/script.rpy:2625
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_df04bd84:

  # "In the stillness you heard muffled noises coming from a small black door, deep in the recesses of the cavern."
  "死寂之中，你听到洞穴深处一扇黑色小门后传来沉闷的声响。"

# game/script.rpy:2626
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_857662e0:

  # "And the distant echo of some soft sound."
  "伴着某种轻柔、遥远的回音。"

# game/script.rpy:2627
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_ce9f1473:

  # "It almost sounded like scratching. In the walls of the chamber."
  "听起来就像是抓挠声。从洞室的墙壁里传出。"

# game/script.rpy:2628
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_95c44ec9:

  # "All at once you remembered the festival, and your Godparent, and the promise you made to your mother. This was no time to be dallying about exploring caverns! You had to find a way to escape your fate before midnight."
  "你猛然想起了庆典，想起了你的教神，想起了你对母亲的承诺。现在可不是在洞穴里流连探险的时候！你必须在午夜前找到逃脱宿命的方法。"

# game/script.rpy:2629
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_e7369101:

  # "Run along now, child."
  "快走吧，孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:2632
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_1afcff0a:

  # "You left the cavern at once and continued on towards the festival."
  "你立刻离开洞穴，继续朝着庆典的方向前进。"

# game/script.rpy:2635
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_7702fa80_1:

  # "Inside you were shocked to find the tree completely hollow. A boundless cavern was formed inside it, cold as ice despite the heat outside."
  "进去后你震惊地发现，这棵树完全是中空的。它的内部是一个无边无际的洞穴，尽管外面酷暑难耐，里面却寒冷如冰。"

# game/script.rpy:2636
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_7cad57c0_1:

  # "The floor of the cavern was piled with rubies and pearls and glinting onyx and solid gold pieces, larger than your fist."
  "洞窟的地面上堆满了红宝石、珍珠、熠熠生辉的缟玛瑙和赤金块，件件都比你的拳头还要大。"

# game/script.rpy:2637
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_85d6bd17_1:

  # "All across the room you saw lush silks and pillars of precious metals of every type and all manner of riches that would turn the King of Kings green with envy."
  "放眼望去，华美的丝绸铺陈满地，各种珍稀金属铸就的廊柱林立，各色奇珍异宝足以令万王之王都嫉妒得眼红。"

# game/script.rpy:2638
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_cf83b469_1:

  # "The glimmering magenta incense smoke rolled across the room and coated it all in a dark haze, smelling of the most incredible spices and herbs and enchanting odours."
  "泛着微光的绛紫熏烟在洞窟内缭绕，将周遭的一切笼罩在晦暗的烟霾里，空气中弥漫着不可思议的香料、草药与迷人芬芳交织的奇异气息。"

# game/script.rpy:2639
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_419bb525:

  # m "Oh darling, what are you doing back again?"
  m "噢，亲爱的，你跑回来做什么？"

# game/script.rpy:2640
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_6d7616b8:

  # "The Mushroom popped up, startling you."
  "蘑菇突然钻了出来，吓了你一跳。"

# game/script.rpy:2641
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_cf9fb1aa:

  # m "I'm sure I remember telling you quite clearly never to darken my door again."
  m "我很确定，我曾清清楚楚地告诉过你，不许再踏入我家大门半步。"

# game/script.rpy:2642
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_a0f58d2c:

  # "She looked off to the side."
  "她往旁边瞥了一眼。"

# game/script.rpy:2643
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_4e468d4f:

  # m "Yes, I'm just telling them now. One moment."
  m "是的，我正跟他们说呢。稍等一下。"

# game/script.rpy:2644
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_8af21f74:

  # m "Have some common courtesy, darling, please. I don't barge into {b}your{/b} house looking wild and dishevelled and try to steal the untold riches of {b}your{/b} domain, do I?"
  m "讲点基本礼貌好吗，亲爱的。我可不会蓬头垢面地闯进{b}你{/b}家，试图偷走{b}你{/b}地盘上数不清的财富，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:2645
translate Chinese mushroomIntro_81136717:

  # m "Not without an invitation, at least."
  m "至少没有邀请我不会这么做。"

# game/script.rpy:2651
translate Chinese mushroomWater_f97915a4:

  # m "Out with it, then. What do you want?" nointeract
  m "说吧。你想要什么？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:2653
translate Chinese mushroomWater_86acea04:

  # pov "Just some water would be nice, please."
  pov "来点水就好，谢谢。"

# game/script.rpy:2654
translate Chinese mushroomWater_7067279c:

  # m "{i}Water?{/i} Really?"
  m "{i}水？{/i}当真？"

# game/script.rpy:2655
translate Chinese mushroomWater_30247836:

  # m " How... conventional."
  m "多么……老套啊。"

# game/script.rpy:2656
translate Chinese mushroomWater_e41b0490:

  # pov "What's wrong with water?"
  pov "水有什么问题吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2657
translate Chinese mushroomWater_8997755e:

  # m "Oh, nothing, nothing. It's fine. If you're into that sort of thing."
  m "哦，没问题，没问题。挺好的。如果你就好这口的话。"

# game/script.rpy:2658
translate Chinese mushroomWater_14df9559:

  # m "It's just a bit... derivative, isn't it? A bit played out."
  m "只是有点……落了俗套，不是吗？有点烂大街了。"

# game/script.rpy:2659
translate Chinese mushroomWater_48bff423:

  # m "You know, \"I'm a lumbering humanoid, I love digesting liquids in order to sustain my bodily functions, dah de dah de dah\", etc, etc. Is this really the type of harmful stereotype we want to play into?"
  m "你懂的，就是“我是个笨重的人形生物，我喜欢消化液体来维持身体机能，巴拉巴拉巴拉”诸如此类的。我们真的要坐实这种恶劣的刻板印象吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2661
translate Chinese mushroomWater_412bc256:

  # pov "Uh... I can drink something else-"
  pov "呃……我可以喝点别的——"

# game/script.rpy:2662
translate Chinese mushroomWater_bfc74972:

  # m "No no, don't push yourself, it's fine. We can't all be innovators."
  m "不不，别勉强自己，没关系。毕竟不是所有人都能成为创新者。"

# game/script.rpy:2663
translate Chinese mushroomWater_30c8197a:

  # m "I'll go get the water. Please, have a seat and relax."
  m "我去拿水。请坐，放松一下。"

# game/script.rpy:2665
translate Chinese mushroomWater_a269e671:

  # m "But do not, under any circumstances, go into the basement."
  m "但是，无论如何，都不要进地下室。"

# game/script.rpy:2666
translate Chinese mushroomWater_81efd904:

  # "She waved to a small, black door set into the bark of the tree."
  "她扬手示意了一下嵌在树皮里的一扇黑色小门。"

# game/script.rpy:2667
translate Chinese mushroomWater_0ffea2ef:

  # "An ominous glow shone through the crack beneath it. The wood was marked with strange and terrible sigils. You heard a low whispering beyond."
  "门缝底下透出一道不祥的光。木门上刻着诡异可怕的符文。你听到门后传来低声的耳语。"

# game/script.rpy:2669
translate Chinese mushroomWater_10cf689e:

  # m "Be right back."
  m "马上回来。"

# game/script.rpy:2673
translate Chinese mushroomWater_390a2527:

  # m "I'm sorry darling, it's been a long day already. I don't have time to explain your body to you. Again."
  m "抱歉亲爱的，今天已经够漫长了。我没空再向你解释一遍你的身体是怎么回事了。"

# game/script.rpy:2677
translate Chinese mushroomWater_ce46a653:

  # m "Darling, you're confused, you're babbling, you're all over the place, please, you're a mess. More so than usual, even."
  m "亲爱的，你脑子发昏，满嘴胡话，整个人魂不守舍的。拜托，你现在一团糟。甚至比平时还要糟。"

# game/script.rpy:2678
translate Chinese mushroomWater_2227cc3d:

  # m "You were here just a minute ago. The you with the mask and the long legs."
  m "你刚才明明就在这里。那个戴着面具、双腿奇长的你。"

# game/script.rpy:2679
translate Chinese mushroomWater_35a730a4:

  # m "Perhaps you should sit down and take a moment."
  m "也许你应该坐下来缓一缓。"

# game/script.rpy:2680
translate Chinese mushroomWater_ce7b6a91:

  # m "Can I get you anything? Decaying plant matter? It's all the rage back home."
  m "要我给你拿点什么吗？腐烂的植物残骸？这在我们老家可是风靡一时。"

# game/script.rpy:2685
translate Chinese mushroomWater_8959758e:

  # "She looked vaguely around the glittering splendour before you."
  "她漫不经心地环顾着眼前金碧辉煌的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:2686
translate Chinese mushroomWater_acc4423c:

  # m "Oh, this?"
  m "噢，这个？"

# game/script.rpy:2687
translate Chinese mushroomWater_a9672d2f:

  # "She dismissed the mountains of jewels with a wave of her hand."
  "她挥了挥手，对堆积如山的珠宝不屑一顾。"

# game/script.rpy:2688
translate Chinese mushroomWater_7d06819b:

  # m "I told you. All the wealth of the world falls to us in the end."
  m "我跟你说过了。世间所有的财富最终都会落入我们手中。"

# game/script.rpy:2692
translate Chinese mushroomWater_71dac625:

  # m "My dear, an apology is as good to me as a beard to a turtle-dove."
  m "亲爱的，你的道歉对我来说，就像斑鸠的胡子一样多余。"

# game/script.rpy:2693
translate Chinese mushroomWater_b5ae6c40:

  # m "But no, don't worry about it, it's fine, really, completely fine."
  m "不过算了，别放在心上，没关系的，真的，完全没关系。"

# game/script.rpy:2703
translate Chinese basement_ffc866a4:

  # "Naturally you opened the basement door."
  "不出所料，你打开了地下室的门。"

# game/script.rpy:2707
translate Chinese basement_0ae9bcd0:

  # ""
  ""

# game/script.rpy:2711
translate Chinese basement_0e1605c1:

  # "Within, you saw a most terrible sight."
  "门内，你看到了极其恐怖的一幕。"

# game/script.rpy:2712
translate Chinese basement_44516fd2:

  # "Seven mushroom corpses hung in the room, dripping black ichor, each being feasted upon by a fat blue-tongued lizard."
  "七具蘑菇尸首吊在半空中，滴着漆黑的脓液，每具尸首上都趴着一只肥胖的蓝舌蜥蜴，正大快朵颐。"

# game/script.rpy:2713
translate Chinese basement_1b752c58:

  # "Every one of them was identical to the lady Mushroom herself."
  "而每具尸首都与蘑菇女士长得一模一样。"

# game/script.rpy:2714
translate Chinese basement_e439a25d:

  # pov "W-what is this?"
  pov "这……这是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:2715
translate Chinese basement_157ce7ca:

  # m "Fool!"
  m "蠢货！"

# game/script.rpy:2717
translate Chinese basement_8815f661:

  # "The mushroom appeared from the earth before you with a terrible crash."
  "伴随着一声可怕的巨响，蘑菇从你面前的地底钻了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:2718
translate Chinese basement_02c39077:

  # m "You have asked about what concerns you not, and so you will hear what pleases you not!"
  m "你既然问了身外事，那就准备听听逆耳言吧！"

# game/script.rpy:2720
translate Chinese basement_818a3274:

  # m "I gave you fair warning, darling. Now all your milk will spoil, all your bread will burn, your socks will always be wet, and you will live in torment for the rest of your days!"
  m "我给过你警告的，亲爱的。现在，你所有的牛奶都会发酸，所有的面包都会烤焦，你的袜子永远都是湿的，你将在余生中受尽折磨！"

# game/script.rpy:2721
translate Chinese basement_74458d1e:

  # pov "Noooooooo!"
  pov "不————！"

# game/script.rpy:2722
translate Chinese basement_2257179c:

  # m "Don't say I didn't tell you so."
  m "别说我没提醒过你。"

# game/script.rpy:2723
translate Chinese basement_9789e9da:

  # "You cried out and set about wailing and tearing your clothes to pieces and beating yourself upon the ground in pitiful anguish."
  "你大叫出声，开始嚎啕大哭，把身上的衣服撕得粉碎，痛苦地在地上打滚捶胸，样子极其凄惨。"

# game/script.rpy:2724
translate Chinese basement_c5143696:

  # pov "Please, Lady Mushroom, spare me your curse. If you do, I will tell you a story, the likes of which would cause you to go white with astonishment if you were to hear it."
  pov "求求您，蘑菇女士，收回您的诅咒吧。只要您大发慈悲，我便给您讲一个故事。那故事哪怕您只听上一耳，也会惊骇得面色惨白。"

# game/script.rpy:2725
translate Chinese basement_409c98e8:

  # m "Ha! Please."
  m "哈！省省吧。"

# game/script.rpy:2726
translate Chinese basement_b786f4e9:

  # m "I've talked with the ferns, who saw the dinosaurs rise and fall."
  m "我曾与目睹恐龙兴衰的古蕨交谈。"

# game/script.rpy:2727
translate Chinese basement_16c088a0:

  # m "I am one with the mosses and lichens of the land who are even older still. I have talked to ancient trees who saw the inferno and the deluge and yet still stand."
  m "我与这片土地上更为古老的苔藓与地衣同为一体。我曾与历经业火与洪水却依然屹立的古树对话。"

# game/script.rpy:2732
translate Chinese basement_c362c855:

  # m "What could you possibly tell me that I don't already know?" nointeract
  m "你还能有什么故事是我不知道的？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:2734
translate Chinese basement_370a3c58:

  # pov "I'm on my way to the festival, and there will be people there from all over this cryptic earth. Surely one of them will have a story you haven't heard before."
  pov "我正赶去参加庆典，那里会有来自这片神秘大地的各路旅人。肯定有人能讲出一个您没听过的故事。"

# game/script.rpy:2737
translate Chinese basement_fcb480ef:

  # pov "I'm seeking a way to escape being taken by my Godfather, the old man in heaven. Surely the story of my adventure will be unique enough for you."
  pov "我正在寻找逃脱宿命的方法，以免被我的教父，被天堂里的那位老者带走。想必我的冒险故事对您来说足够独特了。"

# game/script.rpy:2739
translate Chinese basement_f29c40bc:

  # pov "I'm seeking a way to escape my Godfather, Lucifer. Surely the story of my adventure will be unique enough for you."
  pov "我正在寻找方法，以逃离我的教父路西法。想必我的冒险故事对您来说足够独特了。"

# game/script.rpy:2741
translate Chinese basement_2a858eeb:

  # pov "I'm seeking a way to escape my Godmother, Annihilation. Surely the story of my adventure will be unique enough for you."
  pov "我正在寻找方法，以逃脱我的教母湮灭。想必我的冒险故事对您来说足够独特了。"

# game/script.rpy:2742
translate Chinese basement_e09dccbc:

  # "The Mushroom grew quiet as she thought over your proposal, and you prayed to the Most High (May He watch over us always) to deliver you from this terrible situation."
  "蘑菇安静下来，思考着你的提议。而你则向至高者祈祷（愿他永远庇佑我们），求他拯救你脱离这可怕的绝境。"

# game/script.rpy:2743
translate Chinese basement_2ce3b864:

  # m "Very well, dear. I'll let you go."
  m "那好吧，亲爱的。我放你走。"

# game/script.rpy:2744
translate Chinese basement_588b3ff0:

  # m "But be warned: If you fail to return to me this very night with the story you have promised me, then your punishment will be as tenfold."
  m "但警告你：如果你今晚没带着答应我的故事回来见我，那么你受的惩罚将加重十倍。"

# game/script.rpy:2745
translate Chinese basement_40e3cc46:

  # m "You will be fated to trip over a stone and into the ocean and drown, and when you die, your ghost will come back as a wild dog, and harry your mother and father all day and night, nipping at their heels until they both fall into deep wells and turn into terrible black fish that will lie forever there at the bottom of those pits, moaning weakly and cursing the ungrateful child who brought them such devastation and woe."
  m "你注定会被石头绊倒跌入海中淹死。死后，你的鬼魂会变成野狗，日夜作祟，追咬你父母的双足，直到他们双双跌入深井，变成丑陋漆黑的怪鱼，永远卧在井底微弱呻吟，咒骂那个给他们带来如此毁灭与悲痛的逆子。"

# game/script.rpy:2747
translate Chinese basement_74458d1e_1:

  # pov "Noooooooo!"
  pov "不————！"

# game/script.rpy:2748
translate Chinese basement_6944a9b5:

  # "She struck the ground. It opened before her and she disappeared into it instantly."
  "她敲击地面。大地在她面前裂开，她瞬间消失在其中。"

# game/script.rpy:2749
translate Chinese basement_990862c2:

  # "You set about rolling around the floor in even more pitiful devastation and horror than before, tears streaming from your eyes at this terrible curse."
  "你绝望而惊恐地在地上打滚，样子比之前更可怜，这可怕的诅咒令你泪如雨下。"

# game/script.rpy:2750
translate Chinese basement_1f05ec7d:

  # "Finally you were forced to pick yourself up and carry on."
  "最后，你不得不爬起来，继续赶路。"

# game/script.rpy:2753
translate Chinese basement_5c20ec0d:

  # "Thus you went on your way to the festival, fretting and worrying all the while."
  "于是，你继续前往庆典，一路忧心忡忡。"

# game/script.rpy:2755
translate Chinese basement_4b916869:

  # "Now you had two burdens: To escape the grip of your Godmother, and to find a story that could satisfy the disdainful Mushroom."
  "现在你背上了两副重担：既要逃离教母的魔爪，又要找到一个能让那株傲慢蘑菇满意的好故事。"

# game/script.rpy:2757
translate Chinese basement_6ed50217:

  # "Now you had two burdens: To escape the grip of your Godfather, and to find a story that could satisfy the disdainful Mushroom."
  "现在你背上了两副重担：既要逃离教父的魔爪，又要找到一个能让那株傲慢蘑菇满意的好故事。"

# game/script.rpy:2758
translate Chinese basement_a207d478:

  # "\"Never again,\" you cried to yourself, \"Will I ask of what concerns me not!\""
  "“绝不再犯了，”你在心里哭诉，“我再也不去过问那些身外事了！”"

# game/script.rpy:2761
translate Chinese basement_690236e5:

  # "In an unlikely turn of events, you sat there and waited patiently, paying no mind to the mysterious door."
  "出人意料的是，你竟坐在那里耐心等待，对那扇神秘的门毫不理会。"

# game/script.rpy:2762
translate Chinese basement_d2698305:

  # "(Some protagonist you turned out to be.)"
  "（你这个主角当得可真行啊。）"

# game/script.rpy:2763
translate Chinese basement_f826fb25:

  # "Soon, the mushroom returned with a cup of water. You took a sip and then coughed violently."
  "很快，蘑菇端着一杯水回来了。你喝了一口，然后猛烈地咳嗽起来。"

# game/script.rpy:2764
translate Chinese basement_a1700cdc:

  # pov "Um, excuse me... this is full of compost."
  pov "呃，抱歉……这杯子里全是堆肥。"

# game/script.rpy:2765
translate Chinese basement_e4b3252a:

  # m "Yes of course, darling. It's the latest thing."
  m "当然了，亲爱的。这可是时下最新潮的玩意儿。"

# game/script.rpy:2766
translate Chinese basement_4c323bc0:

  # m "It's rich. It's bold. It's avant-garde. It may not be what you {i}want{/i} right now, but it is what you {i}need{/i}."
  m "口感醇厚，味道浓烈，风格前卫。它或许不是你此刻{i}想要{/i}的，但绝对是你所{i}需要{/i}的。"

# game/script.rpy:2767
translate Chinese basement_41491814:

  # m "So, what brings you back here?"
  m "那么，什么风又把你吹回来了？"

# game/script.rpy:2769
translate Chinese basement_9e883e92:

  # "You told her of the terrible dilemma with your Godfather, our Dear Lord."
  "你向她讲述了自己因教父，也就是我们亲爱的主而卷入的可怕困境。"

# game/script.rpy:2771
translate Chinese basement_6852de75:

  # "You told her of the terrible dilemma with your Godfather, Old Nick."
  "你向她讲述了自己因教父，也就是那个老魔头而卷入的可怕困境。"

# game/script.rpy:2773
translate Chinese basement_d4b95377:

  # "You told her of the terrible dilemma with your Godmother, who rides a pale horse."
  "你向她讲述了你与教母，那位骑着苍白之马的死神之间可怕的困境。"

# game/script.rpy:2774
translate Chinese basement_60c37906:

  # m "Hmm. Quite the story, darling."
  m "嗯。这故事可真不简单，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:2775
translate Chinese basement_99ad019c:

  # m "I must say, you could certainly work on the pacing. And I think the obvious analogy you've drawn for 13th century France and the fragmentation of the Carolingian Empire was a tad heavy-handed. But it's a good start."
  m "我得说，你确实得在叙事节奏上再下点功夫。而且，我觉得你用来影射十三世纪法国与加洛林帝国分裂的那个比喻未免太直白，稍微有点用力过猛了。不过，算是个不错的开头。"

# game/script.rpy:2777
translate Chinese basement_28a3b94d:

  # m "I know a bit about pale-faced Death. Her house is not far from here. Perhaps -"
  m "我对那位面色苍白的死神略知一二。她的居所离这里不远。也许——"

# game/script.rpy:2778
translate Chinese basement_c866934d:

  # "A large grandfather clock in the corner suddenly chimed, and she looked up with a start."
  "角落里的一座大型落地钟突然敲响，她一惊，猛地抬起头。"

# game/script.rpy:2779
translate Chinese basement_4eff28c6:

  # m "Oh dear. Time marches on, even for me."
  m "噢，天哪。时光不歇，对我也一样。"

# game/script.rpy:2780
translate Chinese basement_03f57286:

  # m "I'm sorry to be so rude but I'd better be off. Come back after the festival, and I may be able to help."
  m "很抱歉如此失礼，但我得走了。庆典结束后再来找我，也许我能帮上忙。"

# game/script.rpy:2781
translate Chinese basement_7deece90:

  # m "Please take care of yourself, dear. All of yourself."
  m "请保重，亲爱的。保重好你的全部。"

# game/script.rpy:2782
translate Chinese basement_2e118bf6:

  # "And before you could reply to this strange remark, she took your cup and ushered you out of the door in an instant."
  "还没等你对这句古怪的话做出回应，她便一把收走你的杯子，眨眼间就把你请出了门外。"

# game/script.rpy:2783
translate Chinese basement_86cea738:

  # "You took up your bag and set off down the road once more."
  "你拎起行囊，再次踏上了路途。"

# game/script.rpy:2786
translate Chinese basement_bba90b8f:

  # m "I'm afraid I don't know if I can help. I know a little about pale-faced Death, but I've never met your Godfather."
  m "只怕我也说不准能不能帮上你的忙。我对那位面色苍白的死神略知一二，但我从未见过你的教父。"

# game/script.rpy:2787
translate Chinese basement_c866934d_1:

  # "A large grandfather clock in the corner suddenly chimed, and she looked up with a start."
  "角落里的一座大型落地钟突然敲响，她一惊，猛地抬起头。"

# game/script.rpy:2788
translate Chinese basement_4eff28c6_1:

  # m "Oh dear. Time marches on, even for me."
  m "噢，天哪。时光不歇，对我也一样。"

# game/script.rpy:2789
translate Chinese basement_03f57286_1:

  # m "I'm sorry to be so rude but I'd better be off. Come back after the festival, and I may be able to help."
  m "很抱歉如此失礼，但我得走了。庆典结束后再来找我，也许我能帮上忙。"

# game/script.rpy:2790
translate Chinese basement_7deece90_1:

  # m "Please take care of yourself, dear. All of yourself."
  m "请保重，亲爱的。保重好你的全部。"

# game/script.rpy:2791
translate Chinese basement_2e118bf6_1:

  # "And before you could reply to this strange remark, she took your cup and ushered you out of the door in an instant."
  "还没等你对这句古怪的话做出回应，她便一把收走你的杯子，眨眼间就把你请出了门外。"

# game/script.rpy:2792
translate Chinese basement_86cea738_1:

  # "You took up your bag and set off down the road once more."
  "你拎起行囊，再次踏上了路途。"

# game/script.rpy:2795
translate Chinese basement_292e2963:

  # "You rushed back to the path, worried at any moment that you might be seen."
  "你匆忙跑回小路，提心吊胆，生怕随时会暴露行踪。"

# game/script.rpy:2796
translate Chinese basement_28389284:

  # pov "Thank goodness that I know not to ask of what concerns me not! That could have led me to some kind of dangerous and magical adventure!\""
  pov "谢天谢地，我懂得勿问身外事！否则很可能已经卷入什么危险又离奇的魔法冒险里去了！"

# game/script.rpy:2797
translate Chinese basement_d14766b6:

  # "And so you continued on down the path, giving thanks to our Lord for your natural good sense."
  "于是你顺着小路继续前行，感谢主赐予了你与生俱来的明智。"

# game/script.rpy:2803
translate Chinese basement_0624b08b:

  # "You turned and kept on walking down the path, just as your mother taught you."
  "你转过身，继续沿着小路走，正如你母亲教导的那样。"

# game/script.rpy:2807
translate Chinese basement_ca84aec7:

  # "You ignored the mushroom and walked deeper and deeper into the woods."
  "你没理会那株蘑菇，而是径直向森林深处走去。"

# game/script.rpy:2819
translate Chinese thief1_9034bb1d:

  # "In the depths of the woods, you heard nothing."
  "在森林深处，你什么也没听见。"

# game/script.rpy:2820
translate Chinese thief1_5119f10c:

  # "You saw no-one."
  "你没看到任何人。"

# game/script.rpy:2821
translate Chinese thief1_1b6ae7d8:

  # "You were alone."
  "你独自一人。"

# game/script.rpy:2822
translate Chinese thief1_7e507a6d:

  # "You continued on down the empty road."
  "你沿着空无一人的道路继续前行。"

# game/script.rpy:2829
translate Chinese thief1_f6b59914:

  # "As you were walking down the road thusly, you came upon an old beggar-woman."
  "你就这样走在路上，遇见了一个老乞婆。"

# game/script.rpy:2830
translate Chinese thief1_dde7ec84:

  # "Her eyes were blind, and her back was crooked in 5 directions at once, and her hair floated all around her head like twisting grey fog, and she hobbled about with only the aid of an old cane to help her along."
  "她双目失明，脊背向五个方向畸形地扭曲着，头发如翻涌的灰雾般缭绕在脸庞四周。她只能拄着一根旧拐杖，一瘸一拐地往前挪。"

# game/script.rpy:2832
translate Chinese thief1_47fc6deb:

  # mys "... "
  mys "……"

# game/script.rpy:2833
translate Chinese thief1_fb1319c0:

  # mys "Sorry, uh - Ho! Young Traveller!"
  mys "抱歉，呃——喂！年轻的旅人！"

# game/script.rpy:2839
translate Chinese thief1_a568147b:

  # mys "Might you lend a hand for a frail old woman? The woods are dark tonight, and I thought I heard howling from the space between the trees." nointeract
  mys "你能帮帮一个虚弱的老太婆吗？今晚林子里黑漆漆的，我好像听到林木幽隙里传来了嚎叫声。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:2845
translate Chinese thiefAccept_54ca720c:

  # "You took the old woman's arm to support her weight."
  "你搀扶住老太婆的胳膊。"

# game/script.rpy:2846
translate Chinese thiefAccept_15e8af36:

  # mys "FOOOOOL!"
  mys "蠢——货——！"

# game/script.rpy:2847
translate Chinese thiefAccept_2d215876:

  # "In a flash her clothes tore asunder, and her mask fell to the ground, and you saw it was all nothing but a disguise."
  "霎时间，她的衣服撕裂，面具掉落。你发现这一切不过是个伪装。"

# game/script.rpy:2848
translate Chinese thiefAccept_63dc0024:

  # "In her stead stood the cunning and terrible form of the Master Thief!"
  "取而代之的，是神偷狡诈而可怕的真身！"

# game/script.rpy:2850
translate Chinese thiefAccept_a71e913d:

  # "Their hands shook under their midnight cloak."
  "在那件午夜斗篷下，那双手不停颤抖着。"

# game/script.rpy:2852
translate Chinese thiefAccept_2a201133:

  # "They wore a midnight cloak across their back and a cunning look on their sly face."
  "神偷背披午夜斗篷，狡黠的脸上挂着奸猾的神情。"

# game/script.rpy:2853
translate Chinese thiefAccept_dda5ff77:

  # t "That's right, it's me! Back again to steal your heart and tear this land asunder!"
  t "没错，就是我！我又回来掏走你的心脏，把这片土地搅得天翻地覆啦！"

# game/script.rpy:2856
translate Chinese thiefAccept_4bb520e4:

  # t "They'll never catch me, no matter how they try. I have placed my head in the wolf's mouth and never felt the sting of its coiling jaws."
  t "无论他们怎么煞费苦心，都永远抓不住我。我曾把头伸进恶狼的嘴里，却丝毫未觉它双颚紧闭时的刺痛。"

# game/script.rpy:2857
translate Chinese thiefAccept_a86ce1da:

  # t "I have stolen fire and cheated death. I will live forever. There's nothing you can do to stop me now."
  t "我盗取过火种，也欺瞒过死神。我将获得永生。现在，你没有任何办法能阻止我。"

# game/script.rpy:2858
translate Chinese thiefAccept_7da90713:

  # "They laughed a high, feverish laugh and ran into the forest and out of sight."
  "神偷发出一阵高亢狂热的笑声，跑进森林，消失在视野中。"

# game/script.rpy:2860
translate Chinese thiefAccept_938ec3b6:

  # t "No law shall stand and no magistrate shall ever know peace, for as long as my legs can run!"
  t "只要我的双腿还能奔跑，世间便再无王法可言，也没有哪个法官能得安宁！"

# game/script.rpy:2861
translate Chinese thiefAccept_9a679437:

  # "And with a shout of laughter they demonstrated this, running their long legs into the forest and out of sight."
  "伴着一声大笑，神偷立刻证明了这一点——他迈开长腿跑进森林，转眼便没了踪影。"

# game/script.rpy:2862
translate Chinese thiefAccept_b88b9611:

  # "As soon as you tried to chase them you discovered that your clothes had been stolen off your back and replaced with origami paper replicas. Your belt was now a strip of seaweed, your socks were old moss, and you were wearing someone else's shoes."
  "你刚要追赶，就发现自己身上的衣服不知何时已被扒光，换成了纸折的赝品。你的腰带变成了一截海带，袜子变成了枯藓，脚上穿着的还是别人的鞋。"

# game/script.rpy:2870
translate Chinese thiefChase_fe640abd:

  # "You chased after the mocking laughter of the Master Thief, tripping over your mismatched shoes. The shadowy figure darted through the trees as they shed disguises, wigs, belts, and the old cane."
  "你穿着那双不合脚的破鞋，磕磕绊绊地循着神偷的嘲笑声追去。那个模糊的身影在树林间穿梭，一边跑一边丢下各种伪装：假发、腰带，还有那根旧拐杖。"

# game/script.rpy:2871
translate Chinese thiefChase_47d80c91:

  # "Finally, you caught up to the figure in a forest clearing, and grabbed it tight."
  "终于，你在林中空地上追上了那个身影，紧紧地抓住了它。"

# game/script.rpy:2873
translate Chinese thiefChase_356b629d:

  # pov "Now you will face your just punishment, sure as the heavens declare the glory of G-d."
  pov "现在，你将面临应得的惩罚，这就像诸天述说主的荣耀一般无可更改。"

# game/script.rpy:2875
translate Chinese thiefChase_813c68fd:

  # pov "You wretched fool. You should never have tried to out-do me in wickedness."
  pov "你这可悲的蠢货。你根本不该试图在作恶这方面超越我。"

# game/script.rpy:2877
translate Chinese thiefChase_797a2ca6:

  # pov "I have my grip on you now, sure as Death has Her hand on us all."
  pov "我现在逮住你了，就像死神之手终将攥住我们所有人一样确凿无疑。"

# game/script.rpy:2878
translate Chinese thiefChase_e7402f2b:

  # "You threw the figure to the ground, laughing in triumph."
  "你得意地大笑着将那个身影摔在地上。"

# game/script.rpy:2879
translate Chinese thiefChase_afae31cb:

  # "But as soon as you did so, you realised it was nothing but a pig, wearing a wig and the ragged cloak of the old woman."
  "但你刚把它摔在地上，就发现那不过是一头戴着假发、披着老太婆破斗篷的猪罢了。"

# game/script.rpy:2880
translate Chinese thiefChase_17edb508:

  # "The Master Thief was gone."
  "神偷不见了。"

# game/script.rpy:2888
translate Chinese thiefchase2_440c8f6d:

  # "You picked up the pig and held it under the crook of your arm."
  "你把猪抱起来，夹在臂弯里。"

# game/script.rpy:2892
translate Chinese thiefchase2_12026d86:

  # "From that day on he would always be your loyal friend and ally, and the two of you would get through more scrapes and misadventures than I have time to relate tonight.{vspace=100}{i}In your notes, write down that you {b}have a pig.{/b}{/i}"
  "从那天起，他将永远是你忠诚的朋友和盟友。你们俩将共同经历无数的麻烦与倒霉事，多到我今晚都讲不完。{vspace=100}{i}在你的笔记中写下，你{b}有一头猪。{/b}{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:2895
translate Chinese thiefchase2_c15c84f8:

  # "With sorrow, you removed the cloak and wig, and gave the pig his freedom."
  "你悲伤地脱下它的斗篷和假发，还了这头猪自由。"

# game/script.rpy:2896
translate Chinese thiefchase2_57016b86:

  # "He oinked joyfully and fled off into the night. From there, he joined with the wild bush pigs, and founded a crooked kingdom that was as a scourge upon the earth."
  "他愉快地哼唧了一声，逃进了夜色。从那时起，他与野林猪群为伍，建立了一个畸恶的国度，成为了世间的祸害。"

# game/script.rpy:2897
translate Chinese thiefchase2_566be240:

  # "Cruel indeed was the pig king, and countless innocents fell before his terrible iron hooves."
  "猪王生性暴虐无度，无数无辜者倒在他那可怕的铁蹄之下。"

# game/script.rpy:2898
translate Chinese thiefchase2_24aea19a:

  # "In the years to come, you would curse your impetuous decision to let that devil-pig free many times."
  "在未来的岁月里，你会无数次咒骂自己放走那头魔鬼猪的鲁莽决定。"

# game/script.rpy:2899
translate Chinese thiefchase2_9e3abd82:

  # "But that is a story for another day."
  "但那就是另一个故事了。"

# game/script.rpy:2901
translate Chinese thiefchase2_2d9b8a18:

  # pov "{b}{i}NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!{/b}{/i}"
  pov "{b}{i}不—————————————————————
————————————————————————
————————————————————————
—————————————————————！{/b}{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:2908
translate Chinese thiefchase2_745f1190:

  # "The birds of the forest took off in great clouds all around you at the pitiful sound."
  "听到这凄惨的声音，森林里的鸟儿大片大片地惊飞而起。"

# game/script.rpy:2912
translate Chinese thiefchase2_e83cff23:

  # pov "Noooooooooooo!"
  pov "不————！"

# game/script.rpy:2916
translate Chinese thiefchase2_72868860:

  # pov "NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!"
  pov "不————————————！"

# game/script.rpy:2920
translate Chinese thiefchase2_e8d9638d:

  # pov "NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!"
  pov "不——————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————！"

# game/script.rpy:2927
translate Chinese thiefchase2_3288aa47:

  # "Your cry echoed through the forest."
  "你的哀嚎在森林中回荡。"

# game/script.rpy:2931
translate Chinese thiefchase2_8264a17a:

  # "You walked sorrowfully back to the road, cursing Old Gooseberry for your misfortune."
  "你满心悲伤地走回大路，痛骂老魔头给你带来的厄运。"

# game/script.rpy:2935
translate Chinese thiefchase2_ff346c7e:

  # "As you trudged back to the road you discovered that all of your coins had been stolen and replaced with I.O.U.'s, the bread was now nothing but crumbs, and the meat had been turned into a live possum with a note on it saying \"Ham\". It bit you and fled into the trees.{vspace=100}{i}In your notes, write down that {b}Your things have been stolen.{/b}{/i}"
  "步履蹒跚地走回大路时，你发现你所有的金币都被偷走了，取而代之的是一堆欠条；面包变成了碎屑；肉则变成了一只活负鼠，身上还贴着张字条，写着“火腿”。它咬了你一口，逃进了树林里。{vspace=100}{i}在你的笔记中写下，{b}你的东西被偷了。{/b}{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:2937
translate Chinese thiefchase2_caea87a1:

  # "And so you set about wailing and beating the ground and tearing at your paper clothes, crying out saying \"Oh Lord, how could you treat your servant thus?\""
  "于是你开始嚎啕大哭，捶打地面，撕扯身上的纸衣服，哭喊着说：“主啊，您怎能如此对待您的仆人？”"

# game/script.rpy:2938
translate Chinese thiefchase2_4597aa16:

  # "After a long time you drew yourself up from the ground and spoke to the trees."
  "过了好久，你从地上爬起来，对着树木开口。"

# game/script.rpy:2939
translate Chinese thiefchase2_12ed16ed:

  # pov "Hear me now, Thief. With the Lord as my witness, I will not rest until you see justice."
  pov "听好，神偷。主可为我作证，若不能让你受到正义的制裁，我誓不罢休。"

# game/script.rpy:2941
translate Chinese thiefchase2_e9784ac8:

  # "And so you set about wailing and beating the ground and tearing at your paper clothes, crying out saying \"Oh my Lord and Master, the Father of Lies, how could you forsake me? I, who have outdone all others in wickedness, and served you faithfully in evil for all these long years?\""
  "于是你开始嚎啕大哭，捶打地面，撕扯身上的纸衣服，哭喊着：“我的主，我的主人，谎言之父啊，您怎能忍心抛弃我？我作恶多端无人能及，多年来一直忠心耿耿为您行恶，您怎能这样对待我？”"

# game/script.rpy:2942
translate Chinese thiefchase2_4597aa16_1:

  # "After a long time you drew yourself up from the ground and spoke to the trees."
  "过了好久，你从地上爬起来，对着树木开口。"

# game/script.rpy:2943
translate Chinese thiefchase2_81b67639:

  # pov "Hear me now, Thief. My Godfather is the Devil, and my blood runs with nothing but spite, and I will not rest until the Prince of Darkness fastens His hands around your ankles and drags you straight down to Hell where you belong."
  pov "听好，神偷。我的教父是魔鬼，我的血管里流淌着纯粹的恶意，若不能让黑暗魔君亲手攥住你的脚踝，把你径直拖下地狱老家，我誓不罢休。"

# game/script.rpy:2945
translate Chinese thiefchase2_70fd2fee:

  # "And so you set about wailing and beating the ground and tearing at your paper clothes, crying out saying \"Lady Death, take me now!\""
  "于是你开始嚎啕大哭，捶打地面，撕扯身上的纸衣服，哭喊着说：“死神女士，现在就把我带走吧！”"

# game/script.rpy:2946
translate Chinese thiefchase2_4597aa16_2:

  # "After a long time you drew yourself up from the ground and spoke to the trees."
  "过了好久，你从地上爬起来，对着树木开口。"

# game/script.rpy:2947
translate Chinese thiefchase2_2e21c979:

  # pov "Hear me now, Thief. My godmother is the end of all things, and I will not rest until you have been dragged down into Her icy waters where you belong."
  pov "听好，神偷。我的教母是万物之终结，若不能把你拖入她那冰冷的水底老家，我誓不罢休。"

# game/script.rpy:2949
translate Chinese thiefchase2_c1e6d906:

  # "But there was nothing to be done for now, and so you tightened your seaweed around your waist and set off once more for the festival. Now you had two dire tasks ahead of you: retrieve a story for the Mushroom and visit vengeance upon the Master Thief."
  "但眼下别无他法，你只能紧了紧腰间的海带，再次踏上前往庆典的路。现在你面临两项艰巨的任务：为蘑菇找个故事，以及找神偷复仇。"

# game/script.rpy:2951
translate Chinese thiefchase2_14347254:

  # "But there was nothing to be done for now, and so you tightened your seaweed around your waist and set off once more for the festival, vowing vengeance upon the Master Thief."
  "但眼下别无他法，你只能紧了紧腰间的海带，再次踏上前往庆典的路，发誓要找神偷复仇。"

# game/script.rpy:2956
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_c58b6cf1:

  # pov "I'm sorry ma'am, but I cannot help you. I've been told not to talk to strangers."
  pov "抱歉夫人，我帮不了您。长辈教导过我，不要和陌生人说话。"

# game/script.rpy:2957
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_12e51747:

  # "\"Bah!\" cried the older woman, and stomped her foot on the ground."
  "“呸！”老妇人大喊一声，重重地跺了一下脚。"

# game/script.rpy:2958
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_413fb093:

  # "In a flash her clothes tore asunder, and her grey hair fell to the ground, and you saw it was all nothing but a disguise."
  "霎时间，她的衣服撕裂，灰发掉落。你发现这一切不过是个伪装。"

# game/script.rpy:2959
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_6098bec6:

  # "In front of you stood the cunning and terrible form of the Master Thief!"
  "站在你面前的，是狡诈而可怕的神偷！"

# game/script.rpy:2960
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_b50671cf:

  # "They had long, long legs and thin dextrous fingers that twisted in arcane motions around them."
  "神偷长着奇长的双腿，灵巧纤细的手指在周围舞动出神秘的轨迹。"

# game/script.rpy:2962
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_a71e913d:

  # "Their hands shook under their midnight cloak."
  "在那件午夜斗篷下，那双手不停颤抖着。"

# game/script.rpy:2964
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_27c0803a:

  # "They wore a flowing midnight cloak across their back and a cunning look on their sly face."
  "神偷背披飘逸的午夜斗篷，狡黠的脸上挂着奸猾的神情。"

# game/script.rpy:2965
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_22822b2b:

  # t "You may have outwitted me this time, but I'll get you yet!"
  t "这次算你机灵，但我迟早会得手！"

# game/script.rpy:2968
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_4bb520e4:

  # t "They'll never catch me, no matter how they try. I have placed my head in the wolf's mouth and never felt the sting of its coiling jaws."
  t "无论他们怎么煞费苦心，都永远抓不住我。我曾把头伸进恶狼的嘴里，却丝毫未觉它双颚紧闭时的刺痛。"

# game/script.rpy:2969
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_a86ce1da:

  # t "I have stolen fire and cheated death. I will live forever. There's nothing you can do to stop me now."
  t "我盗取过火种，也欺瞒过死神。我将获得永生。现在，你没有任何办法能阻止我。"

# game/script.rpy:2970
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_7da90713:

  # "They laughed a high, feverish laugh and ran into the forest and out of sight."
  "他发出一阵高亢狂热的笑声，跑进森林，消失在视野中。"

# game/script.rpy:2972
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_db84122e:

  # t "No law shall stand, no magistrate shall know peace and no lawman shall sleep easy in his bed, for as long as my legs can run!"
  t "只要我的双腿还能奔跑，世间便再无王法可言，没有哪个法官能得安宁，更没有哪个执法者能安枕无忧！"

# game/script.rpy:2973
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_71b33430:

  # "And with a click of their heels they rushed away into the shadows of the woods."
  "伴着鞋跟的一声清脆碰撞，神偷冲进了森林的阴影中。"

# game/script.rpy:2974
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_07b4b870:

  # "\"Praise the Lord,\" you said to yourself, \"that I know not to help mysterious old women!\""
  "“赞美主，”你在心里对自己说，“幸好我知道不能去帮来历不明的老太婆！”"

# game/script.rpy:2975
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_19b3a388:

  # "(A wise habit. Once you've given someone a hand, they'll take your arm.)"
  "（真是个明智的习惯。你一旦伸出援手，他就会连你的胳膊一块拽走。）"

# game/script.rpy:2976
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_d14766b6:

  # "And so you continued on down the path, giving thanks to our Lord for your natural good sense."
  "于是你顺着小路继续前行，感谢主赐予你与生俱来的明智。"

# game/script.rpy:2982
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_a03f294c:

  # mys "Wait, please! Surely you'll help a poor old woman?"
  mys "等等，求你了！你肯定会帮帮一个可怜的老太婆吧？"

# game/script.rpy:2991
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_48039e5e:

  # mys "I don't think you want to go that way. These woods grow dark swiftly." nointeract
  mys "我劝你别往那边走。这片林子很快就会暗无天日。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:3000
translate Chinese thiefRefuse_69fac1df:

  # "Without a word, you left the old woman behind and walked deeper and deeper into the woods."
  "你一言不发，撇下老太婆，往林子深处越走越远。"

# game/script.rpy:3013
translate Chinese toadIntro_79970f8f:

  # "In the depths of the woods, with the pig trotting beside you, you heard nothing."
  "深入林中，只有小猪在身旁小跑，除此以外，你什么声音也没听见。"

# game/script.rpy:3014
translate Chinese toadIntro_5119f10c:

  # "You saw no-one."
  "你没看到任何人。"

# game/script.rpy:3015
translate Chinese toadIntro_1b6ae7d8:

  # "You were alone."
  "你独自一人。"

# game/script.rpy:3016
translate Chinese toadIntro_7e507a6d:

  # "You continued on down the empty road."
  "你沿着空无一人的道路继续前行。"

# game/script.rpy:3018
translate Chinese toadIntro_04a19fcb:

  # "In the depths of the woods, sweating in the warmth of the summer night, you heard nothing."
  "在森林深处，夏夜的闷热让你大汗淋漓，你什么也没听见。"

# game/script.rpy:3019
translate Chinese toadIntro_5119f10c_1:

  # "You saw no-one."
  "你没看到任何人。"

# game/script.rpy:3020
translate Chinese toadIntro_1b6ae7d8_1:

  # "You were alone."
  "你独自一人。"

# game/script.rpy:3021
translate Chinese toadIntro_7e507a6d_1:

  # "You continued on down the empty road."
  "你沿着空无一人的道路继续前行。"

# game/script.rpy:3029
translate Chinese toadIntro_1e1aa327:

  # "As you walked down the road with the pig trotting beside you, you heard the thunder of hooves, and turned to see four horses pulling a magnificent golden carriage."
  "你沿着大路前行，猪在身旁小跑，此时你听到了如雷的马蹄声。回头一看，只见四匹马拉着一辆华丽的金色马车。"

# game/script.rpy:3031
translate Chinese toadIntro_e0ce4024:

  # "As you walked down the road, sweating in the warmth of the summer night, you heard the thunder of hooves behind you, and turned to see four horses pulling a magnificent golden carriage."
  "走在大路上，夏夜的闷热让你大汗淋漓，你听到身后传来如雷的马蹄声。回头一看，只见四匹马拉着一辆华丽的金色马车。"

# game/script.rpy:3032
translate Chinese toadIntro_7e2d3de0:

  # "The horses were pure white, with intricate porcelain and shining bridles made of fine-spun ropes laced with gold."
  "那四匹马纯白如雪，披挂着繁复精美的瓷饰，金线交织细绳编织的辔头闪闪发光。"

# game/script.rpy:3033
translate Chinese toadIntro_6934c6ca:

  # "The carriage door was open to show a curtain of lush red silk, and behind the curtain you could see the shadow of a lean and graceful figure of noble bearing."
  "马车门敞开着，垂着一道华贵的红绸门帘。透过绸幔，你能隐约看见一个清瘦优雅、气度不凡的剪影。"

# game/script.rpy:3035
translate Chinese toadIntro_94e39276:

  # eg "Hold!"
  eg "吁！"

# game/script.rpy:3036
translate Chinese toadIntro_11262a1a:

  # "There was a long pause."
  "漫长的停顿。"

# game/script.rpy:3037
translate Chinese toadIntro_e62182c5:

  # "You stood beside the carriage in an uncertain silence."
  "你站在马车旁，一时不知所措，只有沉默。"

# game/script.rpy:3038
translate Chinese toadIntro_f24eec59:

  # eg "I..."
  eg "我……"

# game/script.rpy:3039
translate Chinese toadIntro_d0ea7d1e:

  # eg "I forget what I'm supposed to say now."
  eg "我忘了我现在该说什么。"

# game/script.rpy:3040
translate Chinese toadIntro_b3bfbc68:

  # "His words came slowly. He seemed to be having difficulty speaking."
  "他语速缓慢。似乎说话有些困难。"

# game/script.rpy:3041
translate Chinese toadIntro_14cc2cac:

  # pov "You're supposed to say, \"Where are you headed, fellow traveller?\""
  pov "你该说：“同路人，你要前往何方？”"

# game/script.rpy:3042
translate Chinese toadIntro_e67ff23c:

  # "The figure nodded gratefully."
  "那个身影感激地点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:3049
translate Chinese toadIntro_94e39276_1:

  # eg "Hold!"
  eg "吁！"

# game/script.rpy:3051
translate Chinese toadIntro_607d6bb0:

  # "A rich, low voice like dark mahogany came from behind the curtains, showing the distinctive tones of one of good breeding and character. The horses slowed to walk beside you."
  "门帘后传来一个低沉醇厚的声音，宛如深色桃花心木般富有质感，独特的腔调彰显着主人良好的教养与高贵的品格。马匹放慢脚步，与你并肩同行。"

# game/script.rpy:3052
translate Chinese toadIntro_91db5971:

  # "A slender hand grasping a long cigarette holder emerged from the curtains and beckoned to you. The shadow of the man inside swirled a glass of brandy in his other hand."
  "一只纤细的手握着细长的烟嘴，从帘内探出，向你招了招。映在帘子上的那个男人的剪影，正用另一只手摇晃着一杯白兰地。"

# game/script.rpy:3053
translate Chinese toadIntro_4a32676d:

  # "From inside the curtain you could smell rich spices, incense and thyme."
  "从门帘里飘出浓郁的香料、熏香和百里香的气味。"

# game/script.rpy:3059
translate Chinese toadIntro_1a810ef5:

  # eg "Where are you headed, fellow traveller?" nointeract
  eg "同路人，你要前往何方？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:3061
translate Chinese toadIntro_6c010a79:

  # eg "Why, that's exactly where I'm going!"
  eg "哎呀，这也正是我的目的地啊！"

# game/script.rpy:3063
translate Chinese toadIntro_4834a92c:

  # eg "Nonsense! There's no reason to be travelling that way."
  eg "胡扯！根本没有理由往那边走。"

# game/script.rpy:3064
translate Chinese toadIntro_13222d06:

  # eg "I am heading to the village festival. You should join me."
  eg "我要去村里的庆典。你该跟我一起去。"

# game/script.rpy:3066
translate Chinese toadIntro_4834a92c_1:

  # eg "Nonsense! There's no reason to be travelling that way."
  eg "胡扯！根本没有理由往那边走。"

# game/script.rpy:3067
translate Chinese toadIntro_13222d06_1:

  # eg "I am heading to the village festival. You should join me."
  eg "我要去村里的庆典。你该跟我一起去。"

# game/script.rpy:3069
translate Chinese toadIntro_4834a92c_2:

  # eg "Nonsense! There's no reason to be travelling that way."
  eg "胡扯！根本没有理由往那边走。"

# game/script.rpy:3070
translate Chinese toadIntro_13222d06_2:

  # eg "I am heading to the village festival. You should join me."
  eg "我要去村里的庆典。你该跟我一起去。"

# game/script.rpy:3072
translate Chinese toadIntro_9e03b6dc:

  # eg "Now now, no need to be shy."
  eg "好了好了，不必害羞。"

# game/script.rpy:3073
translate Chinese toadIntro_13222d06_3:

  # eg "I am heading to the village festival. You should join me."
  eg "我要去村里的庆典。你该跟我一起去。"

# game/script.rpy:3074
translate Chinese toadIntro_a3d08599:

  # eg "Come, ride along in my carriage, and we shall get there twice as fast."
  eg "来吧，坐我的马车，我们赶路的速度能快上一倍。"

# game/script.rpy:3076
translate Chinese toadIntro_7d4b36f2:

  # "Your pig sniffed at the carriage suspiciously."
  "你的猪警惕地嗅了嗅马车。"

# game/script.rpy:3083
translate Chinese toadIntro_b04f8ab9:

  # eg "This is no night to be walking out alone. Haven't you heard there's something in these woods?" nointeract
  eg "这种夜晚可不适合独自外出。难道你没听说这林子里有脏东西吗？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:3101
translate Chinese toadAccept_b74b7b8f:

  # "You reached up to take the gentleman's hand, and he whisked you and the pig into the carriage."
  "你伸手握住那位绅士的手，他一把将你和猪拉进了马车。"

# game/script.rpy:3103
translate Chinese toadAccept_61b96993:

  # "You reached up to take the gentleman's hand, and he whisked you into the carriage."
  "你伸手握住那位绅士的手，他一把将你拉进了马车。"

# game/script.rpy:3104
translate Chinese toadAccept_48d5289f:

  # "The moment you were through the curtain you realised something was wrong."
  "穿过门帘的瞬间，你发觉不对劲了。"

# game/script.rpy:3105
translate Chinese toadAccept_7399dcca:

  # "Instead of the graceful and elegant nobleman you expected, you discovered a small, ugly cane toad."
  "根本没有什么优雅高贵的贵族，出现在你面前的，是一只丑陋矮小的蔗蟾。"

# game/script.rpy:3106
translate Chinese toadAccept_39defb26:

  # "The incense you smelled was nothing but the reek of dirt and mud, the brandy was pond scum, the gleaming carriage was just a rotten old squash, and the graceful arm that beckoned you from behind the curtain was nothing but a wooden prop the toad held in his bulging hand."
  "你闻到的所谓熏香，不过是泥土和淤泥的恶臭；白兰地其实是池塘里发臭的绿藻；闪闪发光的马车只是个烂掉的旧歪瓜；而门帘后向你招手的优雅手臂，不过是蟾蜍那肿胀爪子里举着的一根木头道具。"

# game/script.rpy:3107
translate Chinese toadAccept_27fe1f81:

  # "You turned to run, but it was too late. With a clap, the toad commanded his steeds."
  "你转身想跑，但为时已晚。蟾蜍拍了拍手，命令他的坐骑："

# game/script.rpy:3108
translate Chinese toadAccept_aebcb0fa:

  # f "Prickle! Crawl! Shudder and Clink! Don't tarry or stall, get us there in a wink!"
  f "芒刺！游移！战栗！叮铃！莫迟莫疑，眨眼送行！"

# game/script.rpy:3109
translate Chinese toadAccept_a6fbc61d:

  # "The brilliant white horses tore off their clothes and revealed themselves to be a crow-shrike, a rat, a bat and an old black cockatoo."
  "那几匹耀眼的白马扯下身上的伪装，露出了真面目——一只白背钟鹊、一只老鼠、一只蝙蝠和一只衰老的黑凤头鹦鹉。"

# game/script.rpy:3110
translate Chinese toadAccept_47d07f11:

  # "They cackled and gibbered to each other as they raced off down the road with you, bumping and rolling and pulling apart pinecones and causing terrible devastation as they went."
  "它们互相怪笑、叽叽喳喳，拉着你沿着大路狂奔，一路上颠东倒西，连着扯碎沿途的松果，造成了骇人的毁灭浩劫。"

# game/script.rpy:3112
translate Chinese toadAccept_5744425b:

  # "You clutched your pig close, and you both shivered in terror at the unforeseen calamity that had befallen you."
  "你紧紧抱住你的猪，你们俩都因为这场突如其来的无妄之灾而吓得瑟瑟发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:3118
translate Chinese toadAccept_dc7b3bab:

  # f "Well, are you impressed?" nointeract
  f "怎么样，是不是被惊到了？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:3120
translate Chinese toadAccept_e357c96d:

  # f "No doubt you've heard of me."
  f "你肯定听说过我。"

# game/script.rpy:3121
translate Chinese toadAccept_f183c9ee:

  # f "I am Brildebrogue Chippingham, and I have never failed at anything in my life."
  f "我是布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉。我这辈子从没把事办砸过。"

# game/script.rpy:3123
translate Chinese toadAccept_e1dfa99d:

  # pov "Absolutely, sir. I'm stunned."
  pov "当然了，先生。我简直目瞪口呆。"

# game/script.rpy:3124
translate Chinese toadAccept_dccfdbc7:

  # f "Only natural."
  f "理所应当。"

# game/script.rpy:3125
translate Chinese toadAccept_32e4b5ed:

  # f "I find it's better to conceal my true nature from the common-folk."
  f "我发现，最好还是对平民百姓隐藏我的真实身份。"

# game/script.rpy:3126
translate Chinese toadAccept_e915967a:

  # f "Were they to see the incandescent beauty of my true visage at first sight, I dare say they would fall to their knees and wail in shock, so transfixed would they be."
  f "倘若他们亲眼目睹我这绝世容颜的耀眼光芒，我敢说他们肯定会震惊得跪倒在地、痛哭流涕，如同脚下生根般动弹不得。"

# game/script.rpy:3127
translate Chinese toadAccept_95f7fcac:

  # f "I would never be able to get anywhere without them pawing at me and offering me their baked goods and falling about in ecstasy, you know how these people are."
  f "要是我不隐藏起来，无论走到哪儿都会被他们拉拉扯扯、硬塞各种烘焙糕点，甚至看他们激动得东倒西歪——你懂的，这帮乡下人就是这副德性。"

# game/script.rpy:3128
translate Chinese toadAccept_7f9effd9:

  # f "But you, I believe, have sufficient grace to withstand the urge."
  f "但我相信，你有足够的风度，能克制住那种冲动。"

# game/script.rpy:3131
translate Chinese toadAccept_66ec01e8:

  # pov "Sir, you've made one mistake. Never tangle with the spawn of the Devil."
  pov "先生，您犯了一个错误。永远不要招惹魔鬼的子嗣。"

# game/script.rpy:3133
translate Chinese toadAccept_f76574c8:

  # "With a single motion you stole all the valuables you could grab and leapt from the moving carriage with the pig like a holy terror, tumbling onto the road below."
  "你以迅雷不及掩耳之势，将能抓到的值钱玩意儿洗劫一空，然后抱着猪，像个混世魔王般从行驶的马车上一跃而下，在路面上翻滚了一圈。"

# game/script.rpy:3135
translate Chinese toadAccept_0c9c0178:

  # "With a single motion you stole all the valuables you could grab and leapt from the moving carriage like a holy terror, tumbling onto the road below."
  "你以迅雷不及掩耳之势，将能抓到的值钱玩意儿洗劫一空，然后像个混世魔王般从行驶的马车上一跃而下，在路面上翻滚了一圈。"

# game/script.rpy:3136
translate Chinese toadAccept_fea98f54:

  # f "What the - stop! Thief!"
  f "搞什么——站住！小偷！"

# game/script.rpy:3137
translate Chinese toadAccept_58c0b7e6:

  # "But it was too late. You were already away and running into the woods, laughing with impish glee."
  "但为时已晚。你早已拔腿跑进了林子，发出顽童般得意的笑声。"

# game/script.rpy:3141
translate Chinese toadAccept_64617a31:

  # "You looked down at your haul and found that you'd managed to swipe a lovely emerald brooch in the shape of a dragonfly.{vspace=170}{i}In your notes, write down that {b}You have an Emerald Brooch.{/b}{/i}"
  "你低头清点战利品，发现自己顺走了一枚漂亮的蜻蜓造型绿宝石胸针。{vspace=170}{i}在你的笔记中写下，{b}你拥有一枚绿宝石胸针。{/b}{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3142
translate Chinese toadAccept_d2f0a20f:

  # "You hid it in your pocket and went on your way."
  "你把它藏进口袋，继续赶路。"

# game/script.rpy:3148
translate Chinese toadAccept_c23a69f3:

  # f "So, what brings you travelling this way?" nointeract
  f "那么，是什么风把你吹到这条路上来的？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:3151
translate Chinese toadAccept_347c3768:

  # pov "I'm searching for a way to escape my Godfather, the King of Kings."
  pov "我在寻找逃离我教父——万王之王——的方法。"

# game/script.rpy:3152
translate Chinese toadAccept_e844d9bb:

  # pov "He will be here to take me away at midnight, and I have no wish to leave."
  pov "午夜时分他就会来接我走，而我现在还不想离开。"

# game/script.rpy:3153
translate Chinese toadAccept_b1af968d:

  # f "A sticky situation indeed!"
  f "这确实是个棘手的麻烦！"

# game/script.rpy:3154
translate Chinese toadAccept_7187d9d6:

  # f "I have talked with the Lord many times, of course."
  f "当然了，我曾多次与上帝交谈。"

# game/script.rpy:3157
translate Chinese toadAccept_5e6e6a15:

  # f "Why, just the other day He said to me, He said Brildebrogue! How did I ever manage to make one as handsome and charming as you? Why, even a deity with my own talents (which are quite decent of course, though nothing in comparison to your own gifts) can scarcely imagine bringing such a golden figure out of the fires of creation! At this I swung back my head in a mighty guffaw, like so: HA! And my golden mane whipped about me in the wind, and all were charmed by my wit and good humour, so much so that they joined me in an uproarious shout of laughter, such that the whole world could hear it - in fact I have no doubts that you must have heard it yourself, even out here in this backwater location, so loud was the sound, although perhaps you took it for a minor earthquake."
  f "可不是嘛，就在前些日子，他亲口对我说，布里尔德布罗格啊！我怎就造出了你这般英俊迷人的尤物？为何连我这种才华横溢的神明（我的才华自然是不错的，尽管跟你的天赋相比根本不值一提），也难以想象能从创世之火中锻造出如此完美的黄金之躯！听到这话，我仰起头放声大笑，就像这样：哈！我金色的鬃毛在风中飞舞，所有人都被我的风趣和幽默迷住了。他们跟着我哄堂大笑，笑声震天动地，全世界都能听见——事实上，我毫不怀疑，即便是在这种穷乡僻壤，你也肯定听到了。那声音实在太大，虽然你可能把它当成了一场小地震。"

# game/script.rpy:3160
translate Chinese toadAccept_9e3b5ea3:

  # f "Perhaps I could put in a good word for you with Him later. Pond scum?"
  f "也许晚些时候，我可以在他面前替你美言几句。来点池塘绿藻吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3162
translate Chinese toadAccept_b557a69b:

  # pov "I'm searching for a way to escape my Godfather, Old Scratch."
  pov "我在寻找逃离我教父——老魔鬼——的方法。"

# game/script.rpy:3163
translate Chinese toadAccept_e844d9bb_1:

  # pov "He will be here to take me away at midnight, and I have no wish to leave."
  pov "午夜时分他就会来接我走，而我现在还不想离开。"

# game/script.rpy:3164
translate Chinese toadAccept_b1af968d_1:

  # f "A sticky situation indeed!"
  f "这确实是个棘手的麻烦！"

# game/script.rpy:3165
translate Chinese toadAccept_c337e9a5:

  # f "I know the Black One well myself, in fact."
  f "事实上，我与那黑魔头颇有交情。"

# game/script.rpy:3168
translate Chinese toadAccept_f136679d:

  # f "Why just the other day I said to Him, I said Devil! How dare you twist the lives of these innocent souls here, tricking them into a terrible life of debauchery and ill-humour, just to suit your own devious and ill-conceived personal goals, when you could instead behave yourself and simply put things to rights like a well-mannered member of society such as myself? At my words, He shrank back with a most timiditous cowardice, and I saw Him gulp in nervous anxiety most profound, such was His fear of my fury (which can be quite considerable when my dander is up, although of course I take care to remain in good humour for the purpose of conversing with polite gentlefolk such as yourself). In an instant, He swore never to do evil again, and scurried away over hill and dale without a backwards glance."
  f "哎呀，就在前几天，我还对他说，我说，魔鬼！你怎么敢扭曲这些无辜灵魂的命运，诱骗他们过上荒淫乖戾的悲惨生活，只为了满足你那阴险愚蠢的私欲？你明明可以安分守己，像我这般有教养的社会名流一样，把一切引入正轨嘛！听了我的话，他以一种最为怯懦的猥琐之态瑟缩而退，我亲眼看着他在最为深切的惶恐焦虑中咽下唾沫，他对我的狂怒竟是如此恐惧（我发起火来可是相当可怕的，当然，为了能与你这样彬彬有礼的人士交流，我总是尽量保持好心情）。他立马发誓再也不作恶，然后头也不回地翻山越岭，灰溜溜地逃走了。"

# game/script.rpy:3171
translate Chinese toadAccept_9e3b5ea3_1:

  # f "Perhaps I could put in a good word for you with Him later. Pond scum?"
  f "也许晚些时候，我可以在他面前替你美言几句。来点池塘绿藻吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3173
translate Chinese toadAccept_6d9609b5:

  # pov "I'm searching for a way to escape my godmother, the Reaper."
  pov "我在寻找逃离我教母——死神——的方法。"

# game/script.rpy:3174
translate Chinese toadAccept_1745e20e:

  # pov "She said she will soon send 3 messengers, and then take me away. But I have no wish to leave just yet."
  pov "她说她很快就会派出三位信使，然后带我走。但我现在还不想离开。"

# game/script.rpy:3175
translate Chinese toadAccept_b1af968d_2:

  # f "A sticky situation indeed!"
  f "这确实是个棘手的麻烦！"

# game/script.rpy:3176
translate Chinese toadAccept_83d749fe:

  # f "Why, that reminds me of the situation when my own dear old mother was about to die."
  f "哎呀，这让我想起了我亲爱的老母亲快去世时的情形。"

# game/script.rpy:3179
translate Chinese toadAccept_821421de:

  # f "I've chatted with Death many times, of course, and so on this occasion I marched right on up to Her and said \"Unhand my mother, you ruffian! I cannot allow you to continue this wave of terror you have inflicted across the forest left and right, taking away women and old maids and children at will, rich and poor alike, before their time has come to pass! Release her at once, or I'll have to get extremely unpleasant with you (And you do NOT wish to see me when I'm being unpleasant, I assure you (Such a thing has driven many hard men to tears!)) At this stern talking-to from me, She released my mother at once with a sincere apology, and I need hardly say that She has not darkened our door again."
  f "当然了，我和死神聊过很多次。所以在那一次，我大步流星地走向她，说道：“放开我母亲，你这恶徒！我决不允许你继续在林子里到处散布恐慌，在他们命数未尽之时，随意带走女人、老妇和孩童，无论是贫是富！立刻放了她，否则我就要对你不客气了（我向你保证，你绝对不想看到我不客气的样子，那能让无数硬汉落泪！）。被我这么严厉地训斥了一顿后，她立刻真诚道歉并放了我母亲。不用说你也知道，从此她再也没敢踏进我家半步。"

# game/script.rpy:3182
translate Chinese toadAccept_fab63400:

  # f "Perhaps I could put in a good word for you with Her later. Pond scum?"
  f "也许晚些时候，我可以在她面前替你美言几句。来点池塘绿藻吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3184
translate Chinese toadAccept_f9d88084:

  # pov "Just... travelling, I suppose."
  pov "只是……到处走走而已。"

# game/script.rpy:3185
translate Chinese toadAccept_40cfbde2:

  # f "Fantastic! Nothing better than a spot of travelling. I've done quite a bit in my day, let me tell you."
  f "太棒了！没有什么比来一场旅行更美妙的了。不瞒你说，我年轻时可没少游历。"

# game/script.rpy:3188
translate Chinese toadAccept_9f10bb7c:

  # f "Why just the other day I travelled to the living city of Brilochiorp, built on a turtle's back, where your dreams cast shadows and your thoughts chase after you in the mid-afternoon sun. I was there to discuss matters with the queen of the dream thieves, you see, a rascally beggar who had been running about the city filching this dream and that right out of the heads of the poor citizens, so that they dreamed nothing and had no ideas and the city's art and culture stagnated to nothing! Well, we can't have this sort of thing going on, Brilebrogue, I said to myself, and so I paid the blighter a visit and gave her a stern talking-to, and no mistake. She renounced his ways in an instant and placed all the dreams back exactly where he found them, promising to reform her ways and be a better woman. Another successful adventure, all told."
  f "哎呀，就在前几天，我还去了一趟建在龟背上的活城布里洛奇奥普。在那里，你的梦境会投下阴影，你的思绪会在午后的阳光下追着你跑。我去那儿，是为了和盗梦贼女王谈判——你看，那是个无赖乞丐，整天在城里乱窜，从可怜市民的脑子里偷走这个梦、顺走那个梦。结果就是，市民们什么梦也做不了，什么灵感也没有，整座城市的艺术和文化完全停滞！嗯，我们可不能让这种事继续发生，布里尔德布罗格，我对自己说。于是我亲自拜访了那个混蛋，狠狠地训了她一顿。毫无疑问，她立刻金盆洗手，把所有的梦原封不动地还了回去，还发誓要洗心革面，重新做人。总之，又是一次圆满的冒险。"

# game/script.rpy:3191
translate Chinese toadAccept_e1ee0dc4:

  # f "But I'm sure your little festival will be quaint, too. Pond scum?"
  f "不过我敢肯定，你要去的那个小庆典也会挺别致的。来点池塘绿藻吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3193
translate Chinese toadAccept_4c0244fe:

  # f "No bother, then, keep your secrets to yourself."
  f "那就不麻烦了，把你的秘密烂在肚子里吧。"

# game/script.rpy:3196
translate Chinese toadAccept_c96e422f:

  # f "I myself am excellent at keeping secrets. Why, just the other day the Brass Magician of the City of Pale Stones said to me, he said Brildebrogue! Can I trust you with a most powerful and deadly secret, such that it would destroy the heavens if it were to be released? Of course I gave him my assurances immediately, and thus he told me that the devil's seven daughters were locked below the city in chains, and could only be released with the most secret and magical word, \"Grolabicon\"! Of course if this were ever to be discovered and the daughters released, they would wreak such terrible havoc on the world as to bring the Firmament crashing down from Her place up above, and it would be the seventh and final apocalypse come at last, which is why I gave him my word that I would keep the secret safe as houses, and I have never told anyone of the matter to this day."
  f "我本人就极其擅长保守秘密。哎呀，就在前几天，苍白之城的黄铜魔法师还对我说，他说，布里尔德布罗格！我能把一个极其强大且致命的秘密托付给你吗？这个秘密一旦泄露，足以毁灭诸天！当然了，我立刻向他保证没问题。于是他告诉我，魔鬼的七个女儿被锁链拴在这座城市的地下，唯有念出那个最神秘、最具魔力的词“格罗拉比孔”，才能将她们释放！当然了，如果这个秘密被发现，导致七个女儿被释放，她们将会给世界带来无比可怕的浩劫，甚至会让苍穹从高处陨落。那将是第七次，也是最后一次世界末日的降临。正因如此，我向他发誓会守口如瓶，直到今天，我也没对任何人提起过半个字。"

# game/script.rpy:3199
translate Chinese toadAccept_169ce0cf:

  # f "Pond scum?"
  f "来点池塘绿藻吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3207
translate Chinese toadAccept_be114223:

  # "You knew better than to say no. After all, it's bad luck to refuse a gift from a toad."
  "你深知不能拒绝。毕竟，拒绝蟾蜍的礼物会招来厄运。"

# game/script.rpy:3208
translate Chinese toadAccept_cd66ed27:

  # "The pondwater was surprisingly delicious. It tasted of lavender honey, cold coffee, and long evenings by a shaded pool in the heat of summer."
  "池水出乎意料地美味。它尝起来像是薰衣草蜂蜜、冰咖啡，以及炎夏里，在阴凉池畔度过的那些悠长傍晚。"

# game/script.rpy:3209
translate Chinese toadAccept_9f03c73c:

  # "As you sipped it you felt a cool emerald chill pass through your whole body."
  "你抿了一口，感觉到一股如绿宝石般清凉的寒意流过全身。"

# game/script.rpy:3212
translate Chinese toadAccept_737752ff:

  # pov "No thank you."
  pov "不用了，谢谢。"

# game/script.rpy:3213
translate Chinese toadAccept_10e8532f:

  # f "More for me, then!"
  f "那就全归我啦！"

# game/script.rpy:3214
translate Chinese toadAccept_1b3e7148:

  # "And the toad greedily gulped down the pondwater, without comment on your obvious poor manners and lack of breeding."
  "蟾蜍贪婪地大口吞下池水，对你这明显粗鲁无礼、缺乏教养的行为未作任何评价。"

# game/script.rpy:3215
translate Chinese toadAccept_8154f39a:

  # "The old squash rattled about hither and thither through the forest, giving you bruises all over, but before you knew it you had arrived at the village square."
  "那只旧歪瓜在森林里东倒西歪地乱撞，把你撞得鼻青脸肿。但还没等你回过神来，你们就已经抵达了村庄广场。"

# game/script.rpy:3216
translate Chinese toadAccept_4c4da88f:

  # "The toad rose out of his seat, leapt out through the curtains, and with a flourish offered his hand to help you down the carriage steps (which were made of old shoe-leather)."
  "蟾蜍从座位上站起，跃出帘外，潇洒地伸出手，想扶你走下马车踏板（那是用旧鞋皮做的）。"

# game/script.rpy:3218
translate Chinese toadAccept_0c05a72b:

  # "The pig trotted down after you, looking disgruntled."
  "你的小猪紧跟着你小跑下来，一脸不快。"

# game/script.rpy:3219
translate Chinese toadAccept_b0956a73:

  # f "There you are!"
  f "我们到了！"

# game/script.rpy:3220
translate Chinese toadAccept_54335f34:

  # f "Thank you for the wonderful company, and I wish you the best of luck with the festival!"
  f "感谢你一路同行，祝你在庆典上好运！"

# game/script.rpy:3225
translate Chinese toadAccept_24393ce9:

  # "Your experiences with the Mushroom and Thief had instilled a wise caution within you, and you could not accept the gentleman's offer."
  "先前在蘑菇和神偷那里的遭遇，让你明智地竖起了防备之心，因此你无法接受这位绅士的邀请。"

# game/script.rpy:3228
translate Chinese toadRefused_ba23b8af:

  # pov "Begone, worm. Pester me again and I'll drive you into the grave, just as I did my own mother."
  pov "滚开，可怜虫。再来烦我，我就送你进坟墓，就像当年送走我亲娘一样。"

# game/script.rpy:3230
translate Chinese toadRefused_e38170a2:

  # pov "No thank you, Sir. My mother warned me not to talk to strangers."
  pov "不用了，谢谢您，先生。我妈妈叮嘱过我，不能和陌生人说话。"

# game/script.rpy:3231
translate Chinese toadRefused_8cabd12d:

  # eg "You would spurn me? ME?"
  eg "你竟敢拒绝我？拒绝我？！"

# game/script.rpy:3232
translate Chinese toadRefused_1e61b559:

  # eg "I'll have you know that I am {b}Bridlebrogue Chippingham{/b}, and I've never failed at anything in my life!"
  eg "且让你长长见识，我是{b}布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉{/b}，我这辈子从没把事办砸过！"

# game/script.rpy:3233
translate Chinese toadRefused_1ea0b8e7:

  # "The curtains parted and inside you saw a small, ugly cane toad, squatting in muck. The graceful arm that beckoned you from behind the curtain was nothing but a wooden prop in his webbed hand. He tossed it to the ground with disgust."
  "门帘掀开，你看到里面蹲着一只丑陋矮小的蔗蟾，正泡在烂泥里。门帘后向你招手的优雅手臂，不过是他蹼爪里抓着的一根木头道具。他满脸厌恶地将它扔在地上。"

# game/script.rpy:3237
translate Chinese toadRefused_14e0a76a:

  # f "Why, if your mother was alive I would give her a good piece of my mind about the way she raised you. If she were in her right mind she would have reminded you to mind your betters, and had you the presence of mind to mindfully bring to mind an open mind, you wouldn't dismiss my offer with such peace of mind! I tell you, when I was a tadpole we treated our elders with respect, a good deal more respect than this, and we knew a thing or two about a thing or two, let me tell you, but we never let that go to our heads and despite my vast experience and knowledge even at that young and naive age, I still knew how to give the basic respect that a toad about town deserved, let alone the respect due to a toad with such a fine and noble name as the Burpengary Chippinghams!"
  f "哎呀，要是你母亲还在世，我非得因为她对你的家教好好让她长点心！她若是心智清明，早该提醒你要留心尊长；而你若是心思活络，懂得在心里留存一份虚心，就不至于这般心安理得地回绝我的好心了！我告诉你，当我还是一只蝌蚪的时候，我们可是极其尊敬长辈的，比你现在尊敬多了；而且我们对世事也略知一二，但我告诉你，我们从不因此而自满。尽管我年纪轻轻、天真烂漫时便拥有了渊博的知识和丰富的阅历，但我依然懂得，必须给予一位见过世面的蟾蜍最基本的尊重，更别提是像我这样拥有伯彭加里·奇平汉这种高贵姓氏的蟾蜍了！"

# game/script.rpy:3239
translate Chinese toadRefused_3ff13375:

  # f "Why, I have half a mind to give your mother a good piece of my mind. If she were in her right mind she would have reminded you to mind your betters, and had you the presence of mind to mindfully bring to mind an open mind, you wouldn't dismiss my offer with such peace of mind! I tell you, when I was a tadpole we treated our elders with respect, a good deal more respect than this, and we knew a thing or two about a thing or two, let me tell you, but we never let that go to our heads and despite my vast experience and knowledge even at that young and naive age, I still knew how to give the basic respect that a toad about town deserved, let alone the respect due to a toad with such a fine and noble name as the Burpengary Chippinghams!"
  f "哎呀，我倒真想为了你的家教让你母亲好好长点心。她若是心智清明，早该提醒你要留心尊长；而你若是心思活络，懂得在心里留存一份虚心，就不至于这般心安理得地回绝我的好心了！我告诉你，当我还是一只蝌蚪的时候，我们可是极其尊敬长辈的，比你现在尊敬多了；而且我们对世事也略知一二，但我告诉你，我们从不因此而自满。尽管我年纪轻轻、天真烂漫时便拥有了渊博的知识和丰富的阅历，但我依然懂得，必须给予一位见过世面的蟾蜍最基本的尊重，更别提是像我这样拥有伯彭加里·奇平汉这种高贵姓氏的蟾蜍了！"

# game/script.rpy:3242
translate Chinese toadRefused_6a8368a0:

  # "With a furious clap of his hand, he ordered the horses to ride on. The horses shrugged off their clothes and revealed themselves to be a crow-shrike, a rat, a bat and an old black cockatoo. You realised that the brilliant carriage they pulled was nothing more than an old rotten squash."
  "他气急败坏地拍了拍手，命令马匹继续前进。马匹们抖落身上的衣服，露出了真面目——一只白背钟鹊、一只老鼠、一只蝙蝠和一只衰老的黑凤头鹦鹉。你这才意识到，它们拉着的那辆光鲜亮丽的马车，不过是个烂掉的旧歪瓜。"

# game/script.rpy:3243
translate Chinese toadRefused_9104b23a:

  # "They pulled it bouncing down the road, crashing and rolling and pulling apart pinecones and causing terrible devastation as they went, until they were down the road and out of sight."
  "它们拉着歪瓜在路上颠簸弹跳，一路横冲直撞、四处翻滚，碾碎了沿途的松果，所到之处一片狼藉，直到消失在道路尽头。"

# game/script.rpy:3244
translate Chinese toadRefused_1035f2c2:

  # pov "Well! It's a good thing I know not to accept lifts from strange gentlemen."
  pov "哎呀！幸好我知道不能随便搭陌生绅士的车。"

# game/script.rpy:3245
translate Chinese toadRefused_9f211dc9:

  # "(A wise habit. The Lord knows this world is full of cheats and liars.)"
  "（真是个明智的习惯。天晓得，这世界到处都是骗子和无赖。）"

# game/script.rpy:3251
translate Chinese toadRefused_8ebe88c3:

  # eg "W-wait! Where are you going?"
  eg "等、等等！你要去哪里？"

# game/script.rpy:3258
translate Chinese toadRefused_37fda816:

  # eg "You can't just go off alone. These woods aren't safe." nointeract
  eg "你不能就这样独自离开。这林子里不安全。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:3266
translate Chinese toadRefused_775ef8e2:

  # "Without a word, you left him behind and walked deeper and deeper into the woods."
  "你一言不发地撇下他，往林子深处越走越远。"

# game/script.rpy:3273
translate Chinese chapter6_028e752d:

  # "And so it was that you stayed on the path the whole way, ignoring your wanton nature and never once being tempted by the offers of strangers."
  "于是，你一路上都未曾偏离小路，按捺住了自己狂野的本性，也从未被陌生人的邀约所诱惑。"

# game/script.rpy:3276
translate Chinese chapter6_f7b69916:

  # "And so it was that you stayed on the path the whole way."
  "于是，你一路上都沿着小路前行。"

# game/script.rpy:3278
translate Chinese chapter6_cf930978:

  # "And so it was that you stayed on the path the whole way, following your mother's advice and never once being tempted by the offers of strangers."
  "于是，你一路上都沿着小路前行，遵从母亲的忠告，从未被陌生人的邀约所诱惑。"

# game/script.rpy:3280
translate Chinese chapter6_d2698305:

  # "(Some protagonist you turned out to be.)"
  "（你这个主角当得可真行啊。）"

# game/script.rpy:3287
translate Chinese chapter6_663bc535:

  # "And so you finally arrived at the village."
  "就这样，你终于抵达了村庄。"

# game/script.rpy:3288
translate Chinese chapter6_68ac747c:

  # "The rich dark blanket of night was softly rolling over the town, and cooking fires lit up all across the hills, one by one."
  "浓黑的夜色如毯子般轻柔地笼罩小镇，漫山遍野的炊火一簇接一簇地亮起。"

# game/script.rpy:3298
translate Chinese witch1_9f9af49a:

  # "As you walked up to the village, no-one greeted you."
  "走近村庄时，没有人出来迎接你。"

# game/script.rpy:3299
translate Chinese witch1_5fd9636c:

  # "The woods were silent."
  "树林里一片寂静。"

# game/script.rpy:3300
translate Chinese witch1_88701591:

  # "You slowly walked out of the woods and into the village streets."
  "你慢慢走出树林，走上了村庄的街道。"

# game/script.rpy:3305
translate Chinese witch1_4e4ee8c3:

  # "As you walked up to the village, you spied a hunter standing guard."
  "走近村庄时，你远远望见一名猎人正在放哨。"

# game/script.rpy:3306
translate Chinese witch1_1f05fb21:

  # h "Good evening."
  h "晚上好。"

# game/script.rpy:3311
translate Chinese witch1_50c03e9b:

  # h "Be careful tonight. They say there's witches abroad." nointeract
  h "今晚小心点。据说有女巫出没。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:3313
translate Chinese witch1_ad67b5e3:

  # pov "Witches? Nonsense! There's no such thing!"
  pov "女巫？胡扯！根本没那种东西！"

# game/script.rpy:3314
translate Chinese witch1_64f6f926:

  # "No sooner had those foolish words escaped your mouth than a witch leapt out of the bushes and onto your back. Before you could say or do anything, she dug her heels into your sides and rode you up into the sky and over the mountains."
  "这句愚蠢的话刚一出口，一个女巫就从灌木丛里跳了出来，骑到了你的背上。还没等你有所反应，她便用脚跟一夹你的肋部，把你当马骑着飞上了天空，越过了群山。"

# game/script.rpy:3316
translate Chinese witch1_c409ca36:

  # "The pig squealed in shock down below, and quickly vanished from view."
  "小猪在底下吓得嗷嗷直叫，很快便消失在视野中。"

# game/script.rpy:3320
translate Chinese witch1_e6717c15:

  # "In a wink you found yourself at Thornton Peak, exhausted from hard riding."
  "眨眼之间，你发现自己已置身于桑顿峰，被当成坐骑一路狂奔，累得筋疲力尽。"

# game/script.rpy:3323
translate Chinese witch1_0ae9bcd0:

  # ""
  ""

# game/script.rpy:3327
translate Chinese witch1_47296af8:

  # "A witches Sabbath was afoot. A spitting bonfire raged on the peak before you, and the witches danced before it."
  "一场巫魔宴正在进行。你面前的山峰上燃着熊熊的篝火，火星四溅，女巫们在火前狂舞。"

# game/script.rpy:3329
translate Chinese witch1_1a99a1ed:

  # "The old baba yagas cackled and jibbered and danced around you with glee, poking you cruelly in your sides and making cutting remarks like, \"Now who's not real, eh?\" and \"We don't believe in YOU! How do you like that?\" which wounded your feelings most grievously."
  "那些老妖婆兴高采烈地围着你又叫又跳、叽咕怪笑，残忍地戳着你的肋骨，嘴里说着尖酸刻薄的话：“现在到底是谁不存在呀，嗯？”还有“我们才不相信有‘你’存在呢！这滋味怎么样？”这番话让你的自尊心受到了极大的伤害。"

# game/script.rpy:3330
translate Chinese witch1_4eb1b8c5:

  # w "Oh gosh, oh no, are you all right?"
  w "哎呀，糟糕，你没事吧？"

# game/script.rpy:3331
translate Chinese witch1_c4ca772a:

  # "A figure pulled you away from the jeering crowd and tended to your wounds."
  "一个人影将你从嘲笑的人群中拉了出来，为你处理伤口。"

# game/script.rpy:3332
translate Chinese witch1_e72aad8b:

  # w "I'm so sorry about that. The old girls tend to get a bit carried away. They don't get out much, you know, it's a bit of a treat for them."
  w "真是太抱歉了。这些老姐妹们往往容易忘乎所以。你要知道，她们不常出门，这对她们来说算是难得的乐子。"

# game/script.rpy:3333
translate Chinese witch1_c5e44c07:

  # w "Are you feeling ok? Let me get you up. I'm so sorry about this, I know this is probably the last thing you want to be doing on a Friday night, really can't apologise enough, it's just the full moon, you know? Always gets them a bit riled up, and it does them good to get some fresh air and dance around once in a while, you know, fulfil their oath to the devil, but, no excuses for kidnapping you obviously, that kind of behaviour is really not on."
  w "你感觉还好吗？来，我扶你起来。真的非常抱歉，我知道你周五晚上最不想碰到的就是这种事，实在是不知该如何道歉才好，只是因为今晚是满月，你懂的吧？满月总会让她们有些亢奋。偶尔出来呼吸点新鲜空气、跳跳舞对她们有好处，毕竟得履行她们对魔鬼的誓言嘛。但无论如何，绑架你显然是说不过去的，这种行为实在是太不像话了。"

# game/script.rpy:3334
translate Chinese witch1_0653f626:

  # w "Here, let me give you a lift home."
  w "来，让我载你回家吧。"

# game/script.rpy:3335
translate Chinese witch1_dbf2554d:

  # "She helped you get up on her broom and spirited you away into the sky."
  "她扶你上了她的扫帚，带着你腾空而起。"

# game/script.rpy:3336
translate Chinese witch1_b2db8e73:

  # "Below you, you heard the witches you chanting praise to Belphegor, lord of Hogs."
  "在你下方，你听到女巫们正在高唱赞歌，颂扬野猪之主贝尔芬格。"

# game/script.rpy:3337
translate Chinese witch1_15f1acbc:

  # w "So."
  w "那么。"

# game/script.rpy:3338
translate Chinese witch1_7895af63:

  # w "Been out here often?"
  w "经常来这吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3340
translate Chinese witch1_40c88dfe:

  # pov "Not often, no."
  pov "不，不经常。"

# game/script.rpy:3341
translate Chinese witch1_c9493b36:

  # w "Oh, it's lovely, you should definitely try coming back when you have a chance. Beautiful views."
  w "噢，这里很迷人的，有机会你一定要再来看看。风景美极了。"

# game/script.rpy:3342
translate Chinese witch1_132dbb7a:

  # "An explosive crack split the air. You twisted around to look back. Behind you, you saw the mountain split open and ten thousand hogs burst up from beneath the earth. The witches screeched in demonic glee."
  "一声爆炸般的巨响撕裂了空气。你扭头向后看去。在你身后，你看到山体裂开，成千上万头野猪从地底喷涌而出。女巫们发出恶魔般狂喜的尖叫。"

# game/script.rpy:3343
translate Chinese witch1_00cbb3a5:

  # w "Oh dear. I'm going to miss everything."
  w "哎呀。我快错过一切了。"

# game/script.rpy:3344
translate Chinese witch1_6953a2fd:

  # w "Alright, here you are. I'd better be getting back."
  w "好了，你到了。我最好赶紧回去。"

# game/script.rpy:3345
translate Chinese witch1_b1a91e4a:

  # w "Have a good night!"
  w "祝你有个美好的夜晚！"

# game/script.rpy:3346
translate Chinese witch1_9d088cc1:

  # "She set you down at the edge of town and flew off into the sky."
  "她把你放在镇子边缘，然后飞向了天空。"

# game/script.rpy:3348
translate Chinese witch1_f3317dc1:

  # "The pig jumped up at you, and the two of you had a tearful reunion."
  "小猪朝你扑了过来，你们俩泪流满面地团聚了。"

# game/script.rpy:3352
translate Chinese witch1_113faad3:

  # "The rich dark blanket of night was softly rolling over the village, and cooking fires lit up all across the hills, one by one."
  "浓黑的夜色如毯子般轻柔地笼罩村庄，漫山遍野的炊火一簇接一簇地亮起。"

# game/script.rpy:3355
translate Chinese witch1_3fd8495c:

  # "You looked around in fright. The bushes rustled. But you saw no witches."
  "你惊恐地环顾四周。灌木丛沙沙作响。但你没看到任何女巫。"

# game/script.rpy:3356
translate Chinese witch1_e1aae792:

  # pov "Thank you for the warning, kind hunter. I'll be careful."
  pov "谢谢你的警告，好心的猎人。我会小心的。"

# game/script.rpy:3357
translate Chinese witch1_485c3244:

  # "You walked into town."
  "你走进了镇子。"

# game/script.rpy:3358
translate Chinese witch1_113faad3_1:

  # "The rich dark blanket of night was softly rolling over the village, and cooking fires lit up all across the hills, one by one."
  "浓黑的夜色如毯子般轻柔地笼罩村庄，漫山遍野的炊火一簇接一簇地亮起。"

# game/script.rpy:3364
translate Chinese witch1_60352da5:

  # h "Hold on. The festival is about to start."
  h "等等。庆典马上就要开始了。"

# game/script.rpy:3371
translate Chinese witch1_bb78f9fb:

  # h "You'd better not wander off. You'll be late." nointeract
  h "你最好别乱跑。你会迟到的。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:3373
translate Chinese witch1_6a164045:

  # pov "Thank you for the warning, kind hunter."
  pov "谢谢你的警告，好心的猎人。"

# game/script.rpy:3374
translate Chinese witch1_485c3244_1:

  # "You walked into town."
  "你走进了镇子。"

# game/script.rpy:3375
translate Chinese witch1_113faad3_2:

  # "The rich dark blanket of night was softly rolling over the village, and cooking fires lit up all across the hills, one by one."
  "浓黑的夜色如毯子般轻柔地笼罩村庄，漫山遍野的炊火一簇接一簇地亮起。"

# game/script.rpy:3380
translate Chinese witch1_cf88c148:

  # "Without a word, you left the hunter behind and walked deeper and deeper into the woods."
  "你一言不发，撇下猎人，往林子深处越走越远。"

# game/script.rpy:3388
translate Chinese villageExplore1_b403ebab:

  # "The village was empty."
  "村子里空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:3389
translate Chinese villageExplore1_82796779:

  # "The decorations were all set. The great bonfire. The chairs and stacked tables, laden with plates. Streamers lay over the road."
  "装饰早已布置妥当。有巨大的篝火。排开的桌椅上，杯盘堆积如山。街上拉满了彩带。"

# game/script.rpy:3390
translate Chinese villageExplore1_a6974270:

  # "But the chairs were all vacant. The piles of food lay undisturbed on the tables - not even flies ventured near. The sound of the crackling bonfire echoed through deserted streets."
  "但是椅子上空无一人。桌上成堆的食物原封未动——连苍蝇都不敢靠近。篝火燃烧的噼啪声在空荡荡的街道上回荡。"

# game/script.rpy:3403
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_57b49f26:

  # "Over the bonfire was a thick suckling pig on a spit, slathered in rosemary and garlic butter and herbs of all types, and stuffed with breadcrumbs and fresh figs and crisp walnuts and apples and all the fruits of the earth."
  "篝火上方的烤肉叉上穿着一头肥硕的烤乳猪，表面涂满了迷迭香、蒜香黄油和各种香草，肚子里塞满了面包屑、新鲜无花果、脆核桃、苹果以及这片土地上的各种水果。"

# game/script.rpy:3405
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_1b8d37a6:

  # "Your pig looked upon it sadly, and shook its head at the foolish greed of the human race."
  "你的小猪悲伤地看着它，对人类愚蠢的贪婪摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:3406
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_bae04436:

  # "The mangos were in season, and the trees were so weighed down with them that they would fall off and roll down the town gutters, so that the whole town was rich with the sweet scent of fruit mixed with the smell of wood smoke and spices and crackling fat from the cooking fires."
  "正值芒果当季，沉甸甸的果实压弯了枝头，熟透的芒果掉落下来，滚入镇上的排水沟。整个镇子都弥漫着浓郁的甜美果香，混合着柴烟味、香料味以及篝火上油脂烤得滋滋作响的香气。"

# game/script.rpy:3407
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_8c8a57ec:

  # "Those mangos that didn't roll away fast enough were plucked up immediately and eaten by gleeful clouds of fruit bats that chittered and cackled in whirling chaos overhead."
  "那些没来得及滚远的芒果，立刻被黑压压的果蝠群抓起吃掉。它们在头顶上空盘旋乱舞，发出兴高采烈的叽喳声和怪叫声。"

# game/script.rpy:3408
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_ce5df311:

  # "Colossal glass bowls of red sangria were placed at each table, filled with fresh oranges and giant yellow lemon slices, ground cinnamon and brandy and crisp sweet apples and ginger ale."
  "每张桌子上都摆着巨大的玻璃碗，里面盛满了红桑格利亚汽酒，浸泡着新鲜的橙子和巨大的黄柠檬片，加入了肉桂粉、白兰地、清脆甘甜的苹果和姜汁汽水。"

# game/script.rpy:3409
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_80b0404c:

  # "For dessert there were giant lemon meringue pies made from lemons as big as your fist, covered in fresh-whipped meringue from the Baker's parlour."
  "甜点是巨大的柠檬蛋白酥派，用你拳头那么大的柠檬制成，上面铺满了烘焙坊新鲜打发的蛋白霜。"

# game/script.rpy:3414
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_f9fe81e9:

  # "You took your place at the table. All the villagers were there."
  "你在桌边入座。所有的村民都在那儿。"

# game/script.rpy:3416
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_0fe08cc2:

  # "The cunning hunter."
  "那个狡猾的猎人。"

# game/script.rpy:3418
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_43afd78f:

  # "The young goose-girl with her unruly geese."
  "那个年轻的牧鹅女和她那群不守规矩的鹅。"

# game/script.rpy:3420
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_5571b701:

  # "The old gloom-monger."
  "那个年迈的老阴郁鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:3422
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_8cab800d:

  # "The town mayor."
  "镇长。"

# game/script.rpy:3424
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_fd27f4ae:

  # " Even the warty old toad you met on the road."
  "甚至连你在路上遇见的满身疙瘩的老蟾蜍也在。"

# game/script.rpy:3427
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_7eea6610:

  # "The birds and moths and the soft mist of night all came and were seated."
  "鸟儿、飞蛾以及夜空里柔和的薄雾，也都悉数到场落座。"

# game/script.rpy:3429
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_27e48762:

  # "The stars and the moon slowly arrived to take their places. The birds and moths and the Firmament and the soft mist of night all came and were seated."
  "星星和月亮缓缓降临入座。鸟儿、飞蛾、苍穹以及夜空里柔和的薄雾，也都悉数到场落座。"

# game/script.rpy:3431
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_56563cc8:

  # "But one guest was missing: No one had seen the Wild Witch of the Woods all night."
  "但有一位客人缺席了：整个晚上，都没人见到林中野女巫的身影。"

# game/script.rpy:3432
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_4d8ef475:

  # "As the festival began a terrible concern and commotion went up amongst the guests, for we all know what terrible luck it is to spurn a witch."
  "随着庆典开始，客人们中间爆发了一阵极大的担忧与骚动，因为大家都知道，怠慢女巫会招来多么可怕的厄运。"

# game/script.rpy:3434
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_de5a2ad3:

  # may "Did her invitation go missing?"
  may "她的请柬弄丢了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3436
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_a4f29568:

  # h "Impossible. I delivered it myself."
  h "不可能。我亲自送去的。"

# game/script.rpy:3438
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_d1f1291c:

  # pov "Um, excuse me."
  pov "呃，打扰一下。"

# game/script.rpy:3439
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_2aa4de92:

  # pov "I saw the witch just tonight, actually. She was at a ritual in the mountains."
  pov "其实我今晚刚见过那个女巫。她当时正在山里举行仪式。"

# game/script.rpy:3441
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_7fbc6746:

  # may "What!? Why would she spurn our invitation?"
  may "什么！？她为什么要拒绝我们的邀请？"

# game/script.rpy:3443
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_38a35c09:

  # "But still, the witch did not arrive, and soon everyone was a frenzy of worry."
  "但女巫依然没有出现，很快大家都陷入了疯狂的焦虑之中。"

# game/script.rpy:3445
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_70bc25f9:

  # gm "We've given offence to 'er somehow. She'll turn all our 'air to straw and infest all our picnics with ants. None shall escape."
  gm "咱肯定是哪儿得罪她老人家了。她会把咱的头发全变成稻草，还会让咱的野餐爬满蚂蚁。谁也跑不了。"

# game/script.rpy:3447
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_d38028c7:

  # go "All our spoons will rust, and our forks will get stuck in the drawers! I already have enough on my hands dealing with the geese!"
  go "我们所有的勺子都会生锈，叉子会卡在抽屉里拔不出来！光是应付这群鹅，我就已经焦头烂额了！"

# game/script.rpy:3449
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_b41d25f3:

  # "The panic increased when the Sparrow-Herder rushed in and waved for attention."
  "牧雀人冲进来挥手示意大家注意，让恐慌进一步加剧。"

# game/script.rpy:3451
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_8b0cb892:

  # "Cries of woe and fear rang out as the town fell into anarchy. Children were crying. The adults tore at their clothes as they rolled on the ground and begged G-d to free them from this terrible curse."
  "小镇陷入一片混乱，悲哀与恐惧的哭喊声此起彼伏。孩子们在哭泣。大人们撕扯着衣服在地上打滚，祈求主将他们从这可怕的诅咒中解救出来。"

# game/script.rpy:3454
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_d5025c7f:

  # "Everyone was in their place."
  "所有人都在各自的位置上。"

# game/script.rpy:3455
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_5e3019d3:

  # "No-one was missing."
  "没有人缺席。"

# game/script.rpy:3459
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_4c57f09c:

  # "But soon, panic broke out when the Sparrow-Herder rushed in and waved for attention."
  "但很快，牧雀人冲进来挥手示意大家注意，人群中爆发了恐慌。"

# game/script.rpy:3462
translate Chinese villageExplore1A_987b69eb:

  # "Soon, the feast began as planned."
  "很快，盛宴如期开始。"

# game/script.rpy:3466
translate Chinese villageExplore1_3611a24b:

  # sh "The Master Thief has struck again!"
  sh "神偷又下手了！"

# game/script.rpy:3467
translate Chinese villageExplore1_903d9ad5:

  # gm "Oh lord, I knew it. I swear I can 'ear the rattlin' of the Goblin Train already."
  gm "哎哟老天爷，我就知道。俺发誓，俺都已经听见哥布林列车那哐啷哐啷的动静了。"

# game/script.rpy:3468
translate Chinese villageExplore1_cd7fc99d:

  # sh "The entire suckling pig is missing. Quick - check your valuables!"
  sh "整只烤乳猪都不见了。快——检查你们的贵重物品！"

# game/script.rpy:3469
translate Chinese villageExplore1_08dbe2e8:

  # "The whole town turned out their pockets and discovered that all their spare change had been taken and replaced with live rats, which shrieked and leapt away and ran into the forest."
  "全镇的人把口袋翻了个底朝天，发现所有的零钱都不翼而飞，取而代之的是活生生的老鼠。这些老鼠吱吱乱叫着窜出衣服，纷纷逃进了森林。"

# game/script.rpy:3470
translate Chinese villageExplore1_d90de2d8:

  # town "NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!"
  town "不—————————————————————
———————————————————————
———————————————————————
———————————————————————！"

# game/script.rpy:3477
translate Chinese villageExplore1_0acc07c1:

  # gm "Told you."
  gm "早就告诉你了。"

# game/script.rpy:3508
translate Chinese village_bdcaa247:

  # "I can't stop you any longer."
  "我拦不住你了。"

# game/script.rpy:3509
translate Chinese village_7a22e6e2:

  # "Come, then. I will meet you there."
  "那就来吧。我们那里见。"

# game/script.rpy:3520
translate Chinese village_658c148f:

  # "You don't want to go that way."
  "相信我，那条路走不得。"

# game/script.rpy:3525
translate Chinese village_2792650e:

  # "I'm telling you, you don't want to go back there."
  "听我一句劝，你最好别回那地方。"

# game/script.rpy:3530
translate Chinese village_429c159e:

  # "All your friends are here. Adventure awaits! Why not stay?"
  "你的朋友们都在这儿。无尽的冒险正等着你！何不留下来呢？"

# game/script.rpy:3531
translate Chinese village_8c3f09f1:

  # "There's nothing back there you want. Trust me."
  "那里已经没有你想要的东西了。相信我。"

# game/script.rpy:3538
translate Chinese village_0373a59f:

  # h "There you are! We've been looking all over for you!"
  h "你在这儿啊！我们到处找你！"

# game/script.rpy:3539
translate Chinese village_4c04f7c5:

  # h "Come on, let's get back to the feast."
  h "走吧，我们回宴席去。"

# game/script.rpy:3541
translate Chinese village_c04b42bb:

  # h "We need your help to help track down that dastardly Master Thief!"
  h "我们要你来帮忙追捕那个可恶的神偷！"

# game/script.rpy:3542
translate Chinese village_69285f03:

  # h "Here, I'll help you find your way back."
  h "来，我带你回去。"

# game/script.rpy:3543
translate Chinese village_56ef4e6e:

  # "The hunter took hold of your arm with a surprisingly strong grip and escorted you back into the village."
  "猎人紧紧抓住你的手臂，力气大得惊人，押送你回了村子。"

# game/script.rpy:3546
translate Chinese village_5b1a54d0:

  # h "We need your help to help with this terrible curse problem we're having!"
  h "我们这儿正闹可怕的诅咒，要你来帮忙解决！"

# game/script.rpy:3547
translate Chinese village_69285f03_1:

  # h "Here, I'll help you find your way back."
  h "来，我带你回去。"

# game/script.rpy:3548
translate Chinese village_825e06fa:

  # "They took hold of your arm with a surprisingly strong grip and escorted you back into the village."
  "他紧紧抓住你的手臂，力气大得惊人，押送你回了村子。"

# game/script.rpy:3555
translate Chinese village_d5073011:

  # h "We... we need you to, uh..."
  h "我们……我们要你，呃……"

# game/script.rpy:3556
translate Chinese village_b280d552:

  # "They looked around. Their eyes were bleary."
  "他们环顾四周。眼神浑浊迷离。"

# game/script.rpy:3557
translate Chinese village_5d2a963c:

  # h "I'm sorry, I - I don't remember why I came here."
  h "对不起，我——我不记得我为什么来这儿了。"

# game/script.rpy:3558
translate Chinese village_0c73974e:

  # h "I don't think you should go down that road. There's something..."
  h "我觉得你不该走那条路。有什么东西……"

# game/script.rpy:3559
translate Chinese village_c669a39f:

  # h "Something twisting in the darkness there... like the coiling of entrails..."
  h "有什么东西在黑暗中扭动……就像盘绕的内脏……"

# game/script.rpy:3560
translate Chinese village_51ac1e8e:

  # "They looked down."
  "他们低下头。"

# game/script.rpy:3561
translate Chinese village_0d75da92:

  # h "My hands... they haven't been working properly. They don't do what I tell them to do anymore."
  h "我的双手……它们不太听使唤了。我让它们干什么，它们偏不干。"

# game/script.rpy:3562
translate Chinese village_4c3af220:

  # h "I don't know who is telling them what to do now."
  h "我不知道现在是谁在发号施令。"

# game/script.rpy:3563
translate Chinese village_beb0d6d7:

  # h "I'm sorry. I think I need to rest."
  h "抱歉。我想我需要休息。"

# game/script.rpy:3564
translate Chinese village_5e9f9fdf:

  # "Without a word, they turned and walked back to the village."
  "他们一言不发，转身走回了村庄。"

# game/script.rpy:3572
translate Chinese village_77c17197:

  # "You began to walk home, but your wiser nature prevailed."
  "你迈开脚步往家走，但最终还是理智占了上风。"

# game/script.rpy:3573
translate Chinese village_3bc946df:

  # "You turned back and strode back towards the village with your head held high."
  "你转过身，昂首阔步地朝村庄走去。"

# game/script.rpy:3574
translate Chinese village_e3521f9a:

  # "The villagers surrounded you and congratulated you on your good sense. A small party was held in your honour."
  "村民们将你团团围住，纷纷夸赞你做出了明智的选择。为了向你致意，大家甚至举办了一场小型宴会。"

# game/script.rpy:3575
translate Chinese village_fc391e7d:

  # "\"Well done,\" they all said. \"You did it.\""
  "“干得漂亮，”大家七嘴八舌地说道，“真有你的。”"

# game/script.rpy:3580
translate Chinese village_331736b3:

  # "Whatever you think you're going to find down that road, you're wrong."
  "不管你以为在那条路上能找到什么，你都错了。"

# game/script.rpy:3581
translate Chinese village_46e226a9:

  # "There's nothing for you at home anymore."
  "那个家里已经没有你可留恋的了。"

# game/script.rpy:3586
translate Chinese village_d58d4eba:

  # "This is the last time I'll tell you."
  "这是我最后一次警告你。"

# game/script.rpy:3588
translate Chinese village_327418f8:

  # "Go back to the fire. Where it's safe."
  "回火堆旁去吧。那里安全。"

# game/script.rpy:3593
translate Chinese village_4bd430f5:

  # "Fine."
  "好吧。"

# game/script.rpy:3600
translate Chinese village_bf29c358:

  # g "'Allo mate."
  g "哟，哥们儿。"

# game/script.rpy:3601
translate Chinese village_ede81146:

  # g "Here's a tip. If you talk to people multiple times, they might have more to say."
  g "给你个提示。如果你多次和别人交谈，他们可能会有更多的话要说。"

# game/script.rpy:3602
translate Chinese village_c258f1a7:

  # g "It's true! Try it on us."
  g "是真的！在我们身上试试。"

# game/script.rpy:3604
translate Chinese village_96af6c4e:

  # g "That's the spirit!"
  g "这就对了！"

# game/script.rpy:3605
translate Chinese village_f01aed0b:

  # "They gibbered and twirled in glee."
  "他们兴高采烈地胡言乱语，手舞足蹈地打着转。"

# game/script.rpy:3607
translate Chinese village_39a660ae:

  # g "Just make sure not to talk to a Gutterling six times, or it'll own your soul forever."
  g "只是千万记住，别和阴沟小鬼连说六次话，否则它会永远霸占你的灵魂。"

# game/script.rpy:3609
translate Chinese village_eb073be0:

  # g "Yep. You definitely don't want to do that."
  g "没错。你绝对不想落得那种下场。"

# game/script.rpy:3611
translate Chinese village_4b340443:

  # g "..."
  g "……"

# game/script.rpy:3613
translate Chinese village_7952c538:

  # g "Gotcha!"
  g "上当了吧！"

# game/script.rpy:3643
translate Chinese banquet_7d24dfc9:

  # "You walked down to the river. Picnic blankets lay empty before the dark waters."
  "你走到河边。幽暗的河水前铺着几张空荡荡的野餐毯。"

# game/script.rpy:3646
translate Chinese banquet_0b0ba838:

  # "The Toad stood alone, looking into the flames. For a moment you thought you saw people around him - but they were just shadows. The food lay uneaten."
  "蟾蜍独自站在那里，凝视着火焰。有那么一瞬间，你以为看到他周围有人——但那不过是阴影。食物原封未动。"

# game/script.rpy:3648
translate Chinese banquet_175bdfd0:

  # "For a moment, you thought you saw people around the fire. But they were just shadows. The food lay uneaten."
  "有那么一瞬间，你以为看到篝火旁有人。但那不过是阴影。食物原封未动。"

# game/script.rpy:3650
translate Chinese banquet_fdf52ff5:

  # "A splash broke the stillness. You looked around to see the Sparrow Herder and the Mayor on the shore, skipping rocks over the water."
  "扑通一声水响打破了宁静。你循声望去，看到牧雀人和镇长正站在岸边打水漂。"

# game/script.rpy:3652
translate Chinese banquet_85ff937f:

  # "The Mayor sat on the shore, looking out over the water."
  "镇长坐在岸边，眺望着水面。"

# game/script.rpy:3667
translate Chinese banquet_6450f7f0:

  # "You walked down to the river, where the banquet was laid out before a bonfire. Some folks were gripping each other tight and crying out at the misfortune that had befallen their town. Others simply sat in glum silence."
  "你走到河边，盛宴就摆在篝火前。有些村民紧紧相拥，为小镇遭受的厄运大声痛哭。其他人则只是满脸愁容地默默坐着。"

# game/script.rpy:3671
translate Chinese banquet_85cec0f1:

  # "No-one sat at the banquet. The food lay uneaten."
  "宴席旁空无一人。食物原封未动。"

# game/script.rpy:3673
translate Chinese banquet_f2b8330d:

  # "The cane toad from the road was gulping down every morsel of food he could find, cradling a wineglass that was almost as big as he was and darting his tongue out to snatch prawns and hot potatoes from nearby unattended plates."
  "你路上遇到的那只蔗蟾正风卷残云地扫荡着能找到的每一口食物。他抱着一个几乎和他一样大的酒杯，舌头如闪电般探出，把附近无人看管的盘子里的明虾和热土豆卷进嘴里。"

# game/script.rpy:3681
translate Chinese banquetMenu_f2ee5d9a:

  # "They paid no attention to you, but continued shaking their heads and watching the flames with wretched misery."
  "他们没有理会你，只是继续摇着头，满脸凄苦地望着炊火。"

# game/script.rpy:3689
translate Chinese banquetMenu_dc3f1084:

  # sh "G'day."
  sh "你好。"

# game/script.rpy:3690
translate Chinese banquetMenu_435c0e96:

  # sh "The ruin to the south has many poisonous beasts. Be sure to carry Antidotes if you 'ead that way."
  sh "南边的废墟里有很多毒兽。如果你往那边去，一定要带上解毒剂。"

# game/script.rpy:3693
translate Chinese banquetMenu_71c13e08:

  # sh "They say these beasts were once envious 'ogs that spoke ill of our dear Lord."
  sh "据说那些野兽曾经是些心怀嫉妒的猪，因为出言亵渎了我们敬爱的主。"

# game/script.rpy:3694
translate Chinese banquetMenu_a458fe0a:

  # sh "Thus 'e cursed 'em, and now they can speak nothing but poisonous words. As soon as you hear their evil gossip, you'll fall down dead as a doornail."
  sh "于是主诅咒了它们，如今它们口中吐出的，只有淬毒的言语。你一旦听见那些邪恶的毒言毒语，就会立刻倒地死透。"

# game/script.rpy:3695
translate Chinese banquetMenu_17fbd6bb:

  # sh "That's what I 'eard, anyway."
  sh "反正我听到的是这样。"

# game/script.rpy:3697
translate Chinese banquetMenu_b2153acb:

  # sh "The ruin? They say it's left over from the fifth age."
  sh "废墟？据说那是第五纪元遗留下来的。"

# game/script.rpy:3698
translate Chinese banquetMenu_0534e492:

  # sh "It was an age of wise beetles that loved to make puzzles and games."
  sh "那个纪元属于充满智慧的甲虫，它们酷爱制作谜题和游戏。"

# game/script.rpy:3699
translate Chinese banquetMenu_f06d2b2a:

  # sh "The finest puzzle-makers would go on to become consorts for their Queen."
  sh "最优秀的制谜者将成为它们女王的配偶。"

# game/script.rpy:3701
translate Chinese banquetMenu_a29baea1:

  # sh "Their labyrinthine stone puzzle-boxes lie across the land even now, untouched. None who live can solve 'em."
  sh "它们那迷宫般的石头机关盒至今依然散落在各地，原封未动。现存的生者无一能解开它们。"

# game/script.rpy:3702
translate Chinese banquetMenu_8a6daa8a:

  # sh "The 'ogmasters laugh at all who try, and their poison words cut them asunder."
  sh "猪怪主宰嘲笑所有试图解谜的人，用它们带毒的言语将挑战者撕碎。"

# game/script.rpy:3704
translate Chinese banquetMenu_a5fd1eac:

  # sh "How do I know all this? The sparrows told me."
  sh "我怎么知道这些的？麻雀告诉我的。"

# game/script.rpy:3707
translate Chinese banquetMenu_dc3f1084_1:

  # sh "G'day."
  sh "你好。"

# game/script.rpy:3709
translate Chinese banquetMenu_84ff3fde:

  # sh "You seen those rings of mushrooms in the woods?"
  sh "你见过林子里的那些蘑菇圈吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3710
translate Chinese banquetMenu_688064f5:

  # sh "Be wary, friend. Those are the 'ag Tracks. They show where the witches danced last night."
  sh "当心点，朋友。那是老妖婆的足迹。它们标示着女巫昨夜起舞的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:3712
translate Chinese banquetMenu_2c9ca5c0:

  # sh "As they dance, Lady Death pushes 'er fingers slowly through the grass to clutch at their ankles. If they tarry too long, they'll be grabbed by their feet and whisked away straight down to the last kingdom."
  sh "当她们起舞时，死神女士会将手指缓缓探出草丛，试图抓住她们的脚踝。如果她们逗留太久，就会被抓住双脚，直接拖下最终的国度。"

# game/script.rpy:3713
translate Chinese banquetMenu_a55f0cb0:

  # sh "Long have they danced away from death, and eagerly does she clutch for 'em. If she doesn't catch 'em, they fly away with the dawn, and the fingers are left behind."
  sh "长久以来，她们用舞蹈逃离死亡，而死神也急切地想抓住她们。如果没抓住，她们就会随着黎明飞走，只留下那些手指。"

# game/script.rpy:3715
translate Chinese banquetMenu_828960ea:

  # sh "The lady can be nice enough, sometimes. When we had the famine years ago, she pushed 'er fingers through the grass so we could eat."
  sh "死神女士有时候也挺好的。几年前我们闹饥荒的时候，她就把手指探出草丛，好让我们有东西吃。"

# game/script.rpy:3716
translate Chinese banquetMenu_d47d1870:

  # sh "But never go into the circle. She might hear your footsteps, and mistake you for a witch. In a flash, you'll feel 'er fingers wrap around yer ankles and drag you down into the earth. Once she has you, she'll never let you go."
  sh "但绝对不要走进那个圈。她可能会听到你的脚步声，把你误认成女巫。眨眼之间，你就会感觉她的手指缠住你的脚踝，把你拖进泥土深处。一旦被她抓住，她就再也不会放你走了。"

# game/script.rpy:3718
translate Chinese banquetMenu_a5fd1eac_1:

  # sh "How do I know all this? The sparrows told me."
  sh "我怎么知道这些的？麻雀告诉我的。"

# game/script.rpy:3721
translate Chinese banquetMenu_dc3f1084_2:

  # sh "G'day."
  sh "你好。"

# game/script.rpy:3722
translate Chinese banquetMenu_ced0054f:

  # sh "Be careful as you walk around town, mate. Stick to the centre of the street, and never cross the gutters without crossing your path with salt."
  sh "在镇上走动时要小心，伙计。尽量走在街道正中间。跨越排水沟前，务必先用盐在面前划道线辟辟邪。"

# game/script.rpy:3723
translate Chinese banquetMenu_daf7a73b:

  # sh "The Gutterlings hide there."
  sh "阴沟小鬼就藏在里面。"

# game/script.rpy:3725
translate Chinese banquetMenu_7097b383:

  # sh "They are thin, pale and wretched creatures."
  sh "它们骨瘦如柴、面色苍白，是些可悲的生物。"

# game/script.rpy:3726
translate Chinese banquetMenu_7a4b6fbe:

  # sh "They rise out of the earth when the gutters overflow with the summer rains."
  sh "当夏雨让排水沟泛滥时，它们就会从地下爬出来。"

# game/script.rpy:3728
translate Chinese banquetMenu_4246a8e2:

  # sh "They will follow you slowly, concealing 'emselves with leaves and pieces of trash."
  sh "它们会用树叶和垃圾碎片伪装自己，慢吞吞地跟着你。"

# game/script.rpy:3729
translate Chinese banquetMenu_fed1729a:

  # sh "When you're alone, they reach out with their long, long arms, wrap around yer, and drag yer into the storm drain."
  sh "当你落单时，它们就会伸出极长极长的双臂缠住你，把你拖进下水道。"

# game/script.rpy:3731
translate Chinese banquetMenu_e7892f81:

  # sh "What happens then? Well."
  sh "然后会发生什么？这个嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:3732
translate Chinese banquetMenu_4eba5055:

  # sh "Some say they keep you there for years, feeding yer trash and sewer water to keep yer alive."
  sh "有人说它们会把你关在里面好几年，喂你吃垃圾、喝污水来维持你的生命。"

# game/script.rpy:3733
translate Chinese banquetMenu_ae838cac:

  # sh "From your body they will harvest small pieces o' flesh. A thumb, a toe, an ear."
  sh "它们会从你身上割下小块小块的肉。一截拇指，一根脚趾，一只耳朵。"

# game/script.rpy:3734
translate Chinese banquetMenu_566a3d8f:

  # sh "From these pieces, they will grow more Gutterlings."
  sh "它们会用这些肉块培育出更多的阴沟小鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:3736
translate Chinese banquetMenu_a5fd1eac_2:

  # sh "How do I know all this? The sparrows told me."
  sh "我怎么知道这些的？麻雀告诉我的。"

# game/script.rpy:3743
translate Chinese banquetMenu_07d863fc:

  # may "If you're going out, chum, be wary! They say Moon-Head walks these roads tonight."
  may "如果你要出门，伙计，当心点！据说今晚月亮头在这些路上游荡。"

# game/script.rpy:3745
translate Chinese banquetMenu_6533974c:

  # may "If you're going out to hunt the witch, be wary! They say Moon-Head walks these roads tonight."
  may "如果你要去猎杀女巫，当心点！据说今晚月亮头在这些路上游荡。"

# game/script.rpy:3747
translate Chinese banquetMenu_d92af301:

  # may "They say his front face is a full moon, and his back face is a new moon."
  may "据说他前面的脸是满月，背后的脸是新月。"

# game/script.rpy:3749
translate Chinese banquetMenu_483acfbf:

  # may "If he looks at you with his bright face, you can tell nothing but the truth. If he looks at you with his dark face, you can tell nothing but lies."
  may "如果他用亮堂堂的那张脸看着你，你就只能说真话。如果他用黑漆漆的那张脸看着你，你就只能说谎。"

# game/script.rpy:3751
translate Chinese banquetMenu_b4d45f3e:

  # may "His robes are rich blue silk with clouds and fog rippling across them, and they flow around him in hypnotising waves as he dances. Or so they tell me, at least."
  may "他穿着华美的蓝色丝绸长袍，云雾在上面翻涌。当他起舞时，长袍如波浪般荡漾，散发着催眠般的魔力。至少，他们是这么告诉我的。"

# game/script.rpy:3753
translate Chinese banquetMenu_ca17dcc2:

  # may "He leaps through the trees calling for his disciples, the lost and insane, and they all spring together through the woods with glee, singing moon-mad songs."
  may "他在树林间跳跃，呼唤着他的信徒——那些迷失与疯狂的人。他们兴高采烈地在林间一同雀跃狂舞，高唱着痴狂的拜月之歌。"

# game/script.rpy:3756
translate Chinese essay1Showing_44cf4683:

  # may "It's quite the sight to see."
  may "场面相当壮观。"

# game/script.rpy:3759
translate Chinese essay1Showing_9c70bee1:

  # may "He winked at my mother once, and I never saw her again."
  may "他曾对我母亲眨了下眼睛，从那以后我再也没见过她。"

# game/script.rpy:3761
translate Chinese essay1Showing_338343eb:

  # may "Sometimes I still hear her laughter on moonless nights."
  may "有时在无月的夜晚，我还能听到她的笑声。"

# game/script.rpy:3791
translate Chinese essay1Showing_54514a97:

  # p2 "Oh. It's you."
  p2 "哦。是你啊。"

# game/script.rpy:3792
translate Chinese essay1Showing_94c4ecbe:

  # "Your pig turned rose up on its hind legs."
  "你的小猪转过身，用后腿直立了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:3793
translate Chinese essay1Showing_bfd19b31:

  # p1 "Montgomery."
  p1 "蒙哥马利。"

# game/script.rpy:3794
translate Chinese essay1Showing_2a56ed99:

  # p2 "Gregory."
  p2 "格雷戈里。"

# game/script.rpy:3796
translate Chinese essay1Showing_8c7510fe:

  # p2 "I'm sorry, but you'd better not stay here. I don't think it's safe for us to be so close."
  p2 "抱歉，你最好别待在这里。我觉得我们靠得太近不安全。"

# game/script.rpy:3797
translate Chinese essay1Showing_9b52baee:

  # p1 "Hm. I see you are still gripped by this insane delusion."
  p1 "哼。看来你还是深陷在这疯狂的妄想中。"

# game/script.rpy:3799
translate Chinese essay1Showing_755af769:

  # p2 "It's no delusion, brother. I know you've heard it too. No matter how you hard you try to hide it."
  p2 "这不是妄想，兄弟。我知道你也听见了，再怎么极力掩饰都没用。"

# game/script.rpy:3801
translate Chinese essay1Showing_68d02c8e:

  # p1 "Cast off this madness, Montgomery. It's all in your head."
  p1 "从这癫狂中清醒过来吧，蒙哥马利，这全是你的臆想。"

# game/script.rpy:3802
translate Chinese essay1Showing_bdbc1742:

  # p1 "Come back to us. We all miss you."
  p1 "回到我们身边吧。我们都很想你。"

# game/script.rpy:3804
translate Chinese essay1Showing_b2e7f63f:

  # p2 "Look me in the eyes and tell me you haven't heard the scrabbling in the walls."
  p2 "看着我的眼睛告诉我，你没有听到墙里的抓挠声。"

# game/script.rpy:3805
translate Chinese essay1Showing_5bac5d09:

  # p1 "Nothing but rats."
  p1 "不过是老鼠罢了。"

# game/script.rpy:3806
translate Chinese essay1Showing_e92448fd:

  # p2 "Tell me you haven't heard the howling in the pipes."
  p2 "告诉我，你没有听到管道里的哀嚎声。"

# game/script.rpy:3807
translate Chinese essay1Showing_41655b08:

  # p1 "The wind. Just the wind."
  p1 "风声。只是风声而已。"

# game/script.rpy:3808
translate Chinese essay1Showing_4c0a480e:

  # p2 "You cannot tell me you don't seen the visions. The seven terrors, which it wears like seven cloaks. Its face, a single coiling line, like tangled entrails."
  p2 "你敢说你没见过那些幻象吗？那七重恐怖，被它如七重斗篷般披戴在身。它的脸，是一条盘绕扭曲的纹路，如同搅成一团的脏器。"

# game/script.rpy:3809
translate Chinese essay1Showing_2e1d7909:

  # p2 "The house twists with it. Swollen. You can barely breathe in there for the stink of it."
  p2 "屋子随着它扭曲。肿胀。里面的恶臭熏得你几乎无法呼吸。"

# game/script.rpy:3810
translate Chinese essay1Showing_463d9f6a:

  # p1 "Only a dream."
  p1 "只是个梦。"

# game/script.rpy:3812
translate Chinese essay1Showing_dc7eda36:

  # p2 "Perhaps it is a dream."
  p2 "也许是个梦。"

# game/script.rpy:3813
translate Chinese essay1Showing_1181da49:

  # p2 "But I hear that dream coming for me. From the space between the trees."
  p2 "但我听到那个梦正冲我而来。就在那林木幽隙里。"

# game/script.rpy:3814
translate Chinese essay1Showing_1327de64:

  # p2 "It will not be long now."
  p2 "没剩多少时间了。"

# game/script.rpy:3816
translate Chinese essay1Showing_5ca14b65:

  # p1 "I will pray for you, Montgomery. But I will not follow you down the path of madness."
  p1 "我会为你祈祷的，蒙哥马利。但我不会跟着你踏上这条疯狂的不归路。"

# game/script.rpy:3817
translate Chinese essay1Showing_56ea77f6:

  # p2 "Very well, brother. Let us each have our delusions."
  p2 "很好，兄弟。那我们就各自保留自己的妄想吧。"

# game/script.rpy:3819
translate Chinese essay1Showing_9980a6f0:

  # p2 "I will always love you."
  p2 "我永远爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:3820
translate Chinese essay1Showing_d9aff939:

  # p1 "And I you, brother. And I you."
  p1 "我也是，兄弟。我也是。"

# game/script.rpy:3822
translate Chinese essay1Showing_72da0658:

  # p1 "Let us keep moving. He is lost."
  p1 "我们继续走吧。他没救了。"

# game/script.rpy:3824
translate Chinese essay1Showing_99428a2b:

  # p1 "There is nothing for us here."
  p1 "这里已经没什么值得我们留恋的了。"

# game/script.rpy:3827
translate Chinese essay1Showing_065b84f9:

  # p2 "Oh. Hello."
  p2 "哦。你好。"

# game/script.rpy:3829
translate Chinese essay1Showing_999a43d5:

  # p2 "I'm sorry, but you'd better not stay here. It's not safe around me."
  p2 "抱歉，你最好别待在这里。靠我太近不安全。"

# game/script.rpy:3832
translate Chinese essay1Showing_6d48bf5c:

  # p2 "You see, I'm expecting someone."
  p2 "因为，我在等一个人。"

# game/script.rpy:3835
translate Chinese essay1Showing_d7926efb:

  # p2 "I can hear them coming now. I can see the spiral."
  p2 "我现在能听到他们来了。我能看到那个盘绕的纹路。"

# game/script.rpy:3837
translate Chinese essay1Showing_34851e7d:

  # p2 "The others say it's all in my head. But I know better."
  p2 "其他人都说这只是我的幻觉。但我比他们清楚。"

# game/script.rpy:3840
translate Chinese essay1Showing_0ba652ba:

  # p2 "You'd better get moving. You don't want to be here when they come."
  p2 "你最好赶紧离开。你肯定不想在他们来的时候待在这里。"

# game/script.rpy:3842
translate Chinese essay1Showing_9bf5aa79:

  # p2 "Or perhaps I'm wrong."
  p2 "或许是我错了。"

# game/script.rpy:3845
translate Chinese essay1Showing_3d8b8b8e:

  # p2 "Perhaps you've already met them. You just haven't realised yet."
  p2 "或许你已经见过他们了。只是你还没有意识到。"

# game/script.rpy:3851
translate Chinese essay1Showing_28b6da59:

  # f "Well. I suppose this is it."
  f "好吧。我想就到此为止了。"

# game/script.rpy:3852
translate Chinese essay1Showing_d32520ed:

  # "The fire reflected in his eyes. They seemed glassy and vacant."
  "火光倒映在他的眼睛里。他的眼神显得空洞无神。"

# game/script.rpy:3853
translate Chinese essay1Showing_f8c0340c:

  # f "It's been so long now."
  f "已经过了这么久了。"

# game/script.rpy:3854
translate Chinese essay1Showing_fcb7b682:

  # f "But still. Not long enough."
  f "但还是不够久。"

# game/script.rpy:3855
translate Chinese essay1Showing_a0a16463:

  # "He shook his head."
  "他摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:3856
translate Chinese essay1Showing_30bbded8:

  # f "Enough of this melancholy! We should spend these last moments in my manor. It's the finest in the world."
  f "别这么伤感了！我们应该在我的庄园里度过这最后的时刻。那可是世上最棒的庄园。"

# game/script.rpy:3857
translate Chinese essay1Showing_ec6650da:

  # f "And definitely mine, my own, no doubt about that. Always has been!"
  f "而且绝对是我的，我自己的，毫无疑问。一直都是！"

# game/script.rpy:3858
translate Chinese essay1Showing_86a20d8b:

  # f "I'm planning quite the gala. You should join me."
  f "我正筹划一场盛大的晚会。你应该来参加。"

# game/script.rpy:3859
translate Chinese essay1Showing_bd2dc9e6:

  # "He hesitated."
  "他犹豫了一下。"

# game/script.rpy:3860
translate Chinese essay1Showing_bcea199e:

  # f "That is... if you've done everything you need to, you know. Said your goodbyes."
  f "前提是……如果你该办的事都办完了，你懂的。比如道个别。"

# game/script.rpy:3867
translate Chinese essay1Showing_b009b118:

  # f "Have you made your decision? There isn't much time left."
  f "你做决定了吗？时间不多了。"

# game/script.rpy:3873
translate Chinese essay1Showing_e74d0a09:

  # f "I think this may be our last party." nointeract
  f "我想这可能是我们最后一场宴席了。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:3875
translate Chinese essay1Showing_57b178cd:

  # f "Sensational! Stay close to me, and you won't have a thing to fear."
  f "太棒了！紧紧跟着我，你什么都不用怕。"

# game/script.rpy:3876
translate Chinese essay1Showing_a00a78ae:

  # f "Let us be off at once!"
  f "我们立刻出发！"

# game/script.rpy:3880
translate Chinese essay1Showing_4010e427:

  # f "You're missing out, I'm telling you!"
  f "我敢说，不来绝对是你的损失！"

# game/script.rpy:3881
translate Chinese essay1Showing_12428f7c:

  # f "You... really should come. I'd like to spend it with you."
  f "你……真的应该来。我想和你一起度过。"

# game/script.rpy:3887
translate Chinese essay1Showing_395e11e5:

  # f "There you are! Lost track of you for a moment there, ha ha."
  f "你在这儿啊！刚才一下子没找到你，哈哈。"

# game/script.rpy:3888
translate Chinese essay1Showing_af5dde90:

  # f "Now, where were we?"
  f "刚才我们说到哪儿了？"

# game/script.rpy:3890
translate Chinese essay1Showing_854d3a27:

  # f "You!"
  f "是你！"

# game/script.rpy:3891
translate Chinese essay1Showing_318dc1bd:

  # f "Hellion! Knave! You'll see justice for your crimes, or my name isn't Brildebrogue Chippingham!"
  f "刁民！恶徒！你必将为你的罪行付出代价，否则我就不叫布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉！"

# game/script.rpy:3892
translate Chinese essay1Showing_2f70f411:

  # "You quickly hid under the tablecloth until the toad became distracted by a passing prawn platter and gave you time to slip away."
  "你迅速躲进桌布底下，直到蟾蜍的注意力被一盘恰好端过的大虾引开，你才趁机溜走。"

# game/script.rpy:3893
translate Chinese essay1Showing_3762cf5f:

  # "Best avoid him for now."
  "现在最好避开他。"

# game/script.rpy:3897
translate Chinese essay1Showing_51a6b7b8:

  # f "Good evening, my light-fingered friend!"
  f "晚上好，我这位妙手空空的朋友！"

# game/script.rpy:3898
translate Chinese essay1Showing_34eaaedf:

  # "He sprayed food as he spoke. He was sitting on a tower of pillows on his chair, so he could reach the table."
  "他说话时唾沫横飞，嘴里的食物残渣四下飞溅。他在椅子上垫了一摞高高的靠枕，这才勉强够得着餐桌。"

# game/script.rpy:3899
translate Chinese essay1Showing_02506f40:

  # f "Don't worry about that little issue of the emerald brooch you made off with. I have so much money now, you see, I'll hardly miss it. Consider it a gift! A memento of our new friendship, hoho!"
  f "你顺走那枚绿宝石胸针的事儿，就别放在心上啦。你看，我现在家财万贯，压根儿不在乎那点小玩意。就当是送你的礼物了！权作我们崭新友谊的信物，嚯嚯！"

# game/script.rpy:3902
translate Chinese essay1Showing_c7795e0b:

  # f "Hello again, fellow traveller!"
  f "又见面了，同路人！"

# game/script.rpy:3903
translate Chinese essay1Showing_34eaaedf_1:

  # "He sprayed food as he spoke. He was sitting on a tower of pillows on his chair, so he could reach the table."
  "他说话时唾沫横飞，嘴里的食物残渣四下飞溅。他在椅子上垫了一摞高高的靠枕，这才勉强够得着餐桌。"

# game/script.rpy:3904
translate Chinese essay1Showing_f319b0e9:

  # f "Do not be alarmed! I have already forgiven your poor manners in refusing my generous offer on the road."
  f "别慌！我已经原谅你在路上拒绝我慷慨邀请时的粗鲁行径了。"

# game/script.rpy:3906
translate Chinese essay1Showing_5ff48ecc:

  # f "Good evening, my dear friend!"
  f "晚上好，我亲爱的朋友！"

# game/script.rpy:3907
translate Chinese essay1Showing_34eaaedf_2:

  # "He sprayed food as he spoke. He was sitting on a tower of pillows on his chair, so he could reach the table."
  "他说话时唾沫横飞，嘴里的食物残渣四下飞溅。他在椅子上垫了一摞高高的靠枕，这才勉强够得着餐桌。"

# game/script.rpy:3908
translate Chinese essay1Showing_209921fa:

  # f "It warms my heart to see you again! Although we have known each other but a little time now, I already feel the bonds of our friendship have grown strong as the thickest iron, so warmed have I been by your gregarious companionship!"
  f "再次见到你，真叫我心头一暖！虽说咱们相识不久，但我已觉得你我间友谊的纽带坚不可摧，你那热络的陪伴当真让我如沐春风！"

# game/script.rpy:3909
translate Chinese essay1Showing_896a058a:

  # f "Please, take a seat beside me! I would count myself proud to sit among such distinguished company as yours."
  f "请坐我旁边！能与你这般尊贵的同伴比肩而坐，是我的荣幸。"

# game/script.rpy:3911
translate Chinese essay1Showing_05556692:

  # f "Ah, the traveller returns!"
  f "啊，旅人回来了！"

# game/script.rpy:3912
translate Chinese essay1Showing_02c4ac6b:

  # f "You {i}must{/i} try some of these prawns, they're simply to die for. A credit to your humble village!"
  f "你{i}必须{/i}尝尝这些大虾，简直好吃到要命。这也算你们这破村子的荣光了！"

# game/script.rpy:3919
translate Chinese toadConvo2_2bd9cffb:

  # f "Try the mango, it's marvellous." nointeract
  f "尝尝芒果，味道好极了。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:3921
translate Chinese toadConvo2_1674fb3e:

  # f "Yes, it's adequate, perfectly adequate."
  f "是的，还凑合，完全凑合。"

# game/script.rpy:3922
translate Chinese toadConvo2_2772aaa6:

  # "He opened his mouth wide and took a bite out of a chunk of bread with butter slathered on it."
  "他张大嘴巴，狠狠咬了一口涂满黄油的面包块。"

# game/script.rpy:3923
translate Chinese toadConvo2_3284d657:

  # f "Nothing like the feasts back at Chippingham Manor, of course, you understand, nothing like them at all, but certainly adequate nonetheless, I have to say, if I do say so myself, needless to say, as the saying goes, to say nothing of this fine vintage!"
  f "当然了，自然比不上奇平汉庄园的宴席，你懂的，根本没法比，但无论如何也还算凑合，我不得不说，虽说由我来说，照理说本不用多说，可俗话怎么说来着，更别说这上等佳酿了！"

# game/script.rpy:3924
translate Chinese toadConvo2_13f54d33:

  # "He awkwardly tilted the wineglass towards him and drank deeply, almost falling in."
  "他笨拙地将酒杯向自己倾斜，痛饮了一大口，差点一头栽进杯子里。"

# game/script.rpy:3927
translate Chinese toadConvo2_16ecfb5d:

  # f "Why, it quite reminds me of when I was staying with the Sultana of Yolkorich, a land far to the south across the seas, completely made out of delectable food, you understand! The trees were made of liquorice sticks, all the pillars were fine musk candy, the streams ran fresh with sparkling champagne, and the citizens would drive over the rocky roads on peppermint carriages drawn by mouth-watering omelette stallions. Well, one day I woke up and tucked into a hearty breakfast of raisin toast, smoked salmon and fried eggs, only to discover I had devoured the Sultana herself, along with her entire retinue! I had to make a hasty retreat from that situation post-haste."
  f "哎呀，这让我想起了我在遥远的南方跨海之国——浓黄乡的白葡萄干女王那里做客的日子。你懂的，那个国家完全是用美味的食物建成的！树木是甘草棍，所有的柱子都是上好的麝香糖，小溪里流淌着清冽的起泡香槟，市民们驾着薄荷马车，由令人垂涎欲滴的煎蛋卷骏马拉着，在石板街巧克力路上行驶。结果有一天，我醒来后大口享用了一顿丰盛的葡萄干吐司、熏鲑鱼和煎蛋早餐，却发现我竟然把葡萄干女王本人和她的整个随从团全给吃进肚子里了！我只得脚底抹油，赶紧溜之大吉。"

# game/script.rpy:3930
translate Chinese toadConvo2_b4623681:

  # f "There was egg on my face, I can tell you!"
  f "跟你说实话吧，那次我可真是丢尽了脸蛋，毕竟当时我脸上还挂着蛋黄呢！"

# game/script.rpy:3935
translate Chinese toadConvo2_844f930e:

  # f "Aha! Allow me to elucidate."
  f "啊哈！请容我向你说明。"

# game/script.rpy:3936
translate Chinese toadConvo2_b98ff213:

  # "He slurped noisily from his wineglass until it was empty."
  "他大声吸溜着酒杯里的酒，直到杯底朝天。"

# game/script.rpy:3938
translate Chinese toadConvo2_0cf8834a:

  # f "I came to this village to..."
  f "我来这个村子是为了……"

# game/script.rpy:3940
translate Chinese toadConvo2_313093af:

  # f "To, ah..."
  f "是为了，呃……"

# game/script.rpy:3941
translate Chinese toadConvo2_dc3a99a4:

  # "He looked down at his wineglass."
  "他低头看着自己的酒杯。"

# game/script.rpy:3942
translate Chinese toadConvo2_3c91af9d:

  # "His brow wrinkled."
  "他皱起了眉头。"

# game/script.rpy:3944
translate Chinese toadConvo2_eecc044f:

  # f "...to enjoy this magnificent feast, of course!"
  f "……当然是为了享用这场丰盛的晚宴！"

# game/script.rpy:3945
translate Chinese toadConvo2_0573c8be:

  # "He brightened up and began filling his wineglass with renewed vigour."
  "他眼睛一亮，开始重新兴致勃勃地斟满酒杯。"

# game/script.rpy:3946
translate Chinese toadConvo2_332f6122:

  # f "Yes, that must have been it. Please, join me!"
  f "没错，肯定就是这样。来吧，跟我一起吃！"

# game/script.rpy:3947
translate Chinese toadConvo2_bf4b9792:

  # f "It's nothing compared to the feasts at my manor, of course."
  f "当然了，跟我们庄园的盛宴比起来，这根本算不了什么。"

# game/script.rpy:3951
translate Chinese toadConvo2_844f930e_1:

  # f "Aha! Allow me to elucidate."
  f "啊哈！请容我向你说明。"

# game/script.rpy:3952
translate Chinese toadConvo2_b98ff213_1:

  # "He slurped noisily from his wineglass until it was empty."
  "他大声吸溜着酒杯里的酒，直到杯底朝天。"

# game/script.rpy:3953
translate Chinese toadConvo2_9c0d8749:

  # f "I plan to track this witch character down tonight, before she causes any more chaos."
  f "我打算今晚就把那个什么女巫给揪出来，免得她再惹出什么乱子。"

# game/script.rpy:3954
translate Chinese toadConvo2_c5e670a2:

  # f "We must help the poor, accursed people of this village! Already they panic, terrified that she will descend upon them and turn them all into beasts!"
  f "我们必须去帮帮村里那些饱受诅咒的可怜人！他们已经惊慌失措，生怕她降临把他们全变成野兽！"

# game/script.rpy:3956
translate Chinese toadConvo2_753b065c:

  # pov "I think that may just be a misunderstanding."
  pov "我觉得那可能只是个误会。"

# game/script.rpy:3957
translate Chinese toadConvo2_ba01a312:

  # "A tray of drinks came by and the toad dragged a new full-sized wineglass into his arms, struggling with the weight."
  "一盘饮料端了过来，蟾蜍费力地把一个新的装满酒的大杯拖到怀里。"

# game/script.rpy:3958
translate Chinese toadConvo2_5efa33b5:

  # f "Maybe so, maybe so. But between you and me, I have a curse of my own I need her to lift."
  f "或许吧，或许吧。但咱们私下说，我自己也有个诅咒需要她来解除。"

# game/script.rpy:3960
translate Chinese toadConvo2_ba01a312_1:

  # "A tray of drinks came by and the toad dragged a new full-sized wineglass into his arms, struggling with the weight."
  "一盘饮料端了过来，蟾蜍费力地把一个新的装满酒的大杯拖到怀里。"

# game/script.rpy:3961
translate Chinese toadConvo2_12178336:

  # f "And between you and me, I have a curse of my own I need her to lift."
  f "咱们私下说，我自己也有个诅咒需要她来解除。"

# game/script.rpy:3962
translate Chinese toadConvo2_1b614f7f:

  # f "{i}Transformed{/i}, you know. Keep that under your hat, very hush hush, you understand."
  f "{i}变形咒{/i}，你懂的。千万保密，这可是绝密，明白吧。"

# game/script.rpy:3967
translate Chinese toadConvo2_d9b2e509:

  # f "I understand she lurks in a cottage in the darkest depths of the rainforest, where all fear to tread."
  f "据我所知，她潜伏在雨林最深处的幽暗小屋里，那是个让人望而却步的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:3968
translate Chinese toadConvo2_e82afa46:

  # f "All except for Brildebrogue Chippingham, of course!"
  f "当然了，布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉除外！"

# game/script.rpy:3969
translate Chinese toadConvo2_dbd6c422:

  # "He attempted to give you a bold wink, but accidentally winked with both eyes at once. He was slowly sliding under the table as he talked."
  "他试图对你大胆地抛个媚眼，结果却不小心两只眼睛同时眨了一下。他边说边慢慢往桌子底下溜。"

# game/script.rpy:3970
translate Chinese toadConvo2_19ef9776:

  # f "What do you say? Care to join me?"
  f "你意下如何？要不要和我一起？"

# game/script.rpy:3971
translate Chinese toadConvo2_3a857594:

  # f "I hear she knows much, and consorts with the Devil Himself!"
  f "我听说她见多识广，甚至和魔鬼本尊有来往！"

# game/script.rpy:3978
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_0565b1be:

  # f "I need to lift this curse of mine, and surely she could help you out with... I don't know, whatever problem you have." nointeract
  f "我需要解除身上的诅咒，她肯定也能帮你解决……我不知道，不管你有什么麻烦。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:3980
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_57b178cd:

  # f "Sensational! Stay close to me, and you won't have a thing to fear."
  f "太棒了！紧紧跟着我，你什么都不用怕。"

# game/script.rpy:3981
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_7d7eb1f5:

  # f "It would be the brave forest beast indeed that would dare to cross swords with THESE powerful weapons."
  f "若有哪只林中野兽胆敢与我这两件大杀器交锋，那它的胆子可真是包了天了。"

# game/script.rpy:3982
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_686e1cdc:

  # "He flexed his arms for you. A tiny bump of muscle rose up."
  "他向你绷紧双臂，只鼓起了一小块肌肉疙瘩。"

# game/script.rpy:3983
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_a00a78ae:

  # f "Let us be off at once!"
  f "我们立刻出发！"

# game/script.rpy:3987
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_2a3c997e:

  # f "I understand. The witch's fear quails even the most courageous heart."
  f "我理解。对女巫的恐惧，足以让最勇敢的心退缩。"

# game/script.rpy:3988
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_4215a4db:

  # f "Not mine, of course! If you change your mind, I'll be here."
  f "当然，我的心除外！如果你改变主意，我就在这儿。"

# game/script.rpy:3992
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_b75b353a:

  # f "Ah, have you changed your mind?"
  f "哦？你改主意了？"

# game/script.rpy:3996
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_16599b0c:

  # pov "Aren't you going to do anything about all the stolen goods?"
  pov "难道那些失窃的物品，你们就撒手不管了？"

# game/script.rpy:3997
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_767e73ed:

  # f "And risk the wrath of the Master Thief? Not on your life! I heard they eat danger, and breathe death!"
  f "冒着激怒神偷的风险？我还要命呢！我听说那人以凶险为食，以死亡为息！"

# game/script.rpy:3998
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_4bea5e86:

  # may "I heard they stole a fine racing horse right out from under its rider."
  may "我听说那人竟然在骑手眼皮子底下，把一匹上好的赛马给偷走了。"

# game/script.rpy:3999
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_48a1f2e8:

  # sh "I heard they stole the King of Spain right out from under 'is wife."
  sh "我听说那人竟然在西班牙王后的眼皮子底下，把国王老儿给偷走了。"

# game/script.rpy:4000
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_0f58d268:

  # f "Well, I have heard tell that every winter they shrink down to the size of a pin, and hide away in your house to steal all your odd socks and hairpins and loose change."
  f "哎呀，我听人说，每年冬天那人都会缩得只有大头针那么点大，藏进你家里，把你家那些落单的袜子、发夹和零钱偷个精光。"

# game/script.rpy:4001
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_aa3e4fb5:

  # f "Why do they do it? Why, to make a nest, of course. All the better to lure their suitor, THE DEVIL!"
  f "那人为什么要这么做？嗨，当然是为了筑巢啦。只有这样，才能引得神偷的姘头——魔鬼本尊上钩啊！"

# game/script.rpy:4005
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_6f8bd758:

  # f "Ah yes, Chippingham Manor! Finest in the world, I tell you."
  f "啊，对了，奇平汉庄园！我跟你说，那是世上最棒的庄园。"

# game/script.rpy:4006
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_ec6650da:

  # f "And definitely mine, my own, no doubt about that. Always has been!"
  f "而且完完全全是我的，我自己的，毫无疑问。一直都是！"

# game/script.rpy:4007
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_4c42fba0:

  # f "Why don't you come visit? In fact, we could head there tonight. I'm planning quite the gala."
  f "何不来做客呢？说真的，我们今晚就能动身。我正筹办一场盛大的晚宴呢。"

# game/script.rpy:4012
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_4dd11137:

  # f "You'll get a taste of the real high life." nointeract
  f "带你尝尝什么叫真正的上流生活。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:4014
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_57b178cd_1:

  # f "Sensational! Stay close to me, and you won't have a thing to fear."
  f "妙极了！跟紧我，包你万无一失。"

# game/script.rpy:4015
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_7d7eb1f5_1:

  # f "It would be the brave forest beast indeed that would dare to cross swords with THESE powerful weapons."
  f "若有哪只林中野兽胆敢与我这两件大杀器交锋，那它的胆子可真是包了天了。"

# game/script.rpy:4016
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_686e1cdc_1:

  # "He flexed his arms for you. A tiny bump of muscle rose up."
  "他向你绷紧双臂，只鼓起了一小块肌肉疙瘩。"

# game/script.rpy:4017
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_a00a78ae_1:

  # f "Let us be off at once!"
  f "我们立刻出发！"

# game/script.rpy:4021
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_4010e427:

  # f "You're missing out, I'm telling you!"
  f "我敢说，不来绝对是你的损失！"

# game/script.rpy:4022
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_b134ef60:

  # f "You really should come."
  f "你真的应该来。"

# game/script.rpy:4030
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_ab602d7b:

  # pov "I need a way to escape my godmother, Lady Death. Can you help me?"
  pov "我需要找到逃离我教母——死神女士——的方法。你能帮我吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4031
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_45852e77:

  # f "Possibly, possibly."
  f "或许能，或许能。"

# game/script.rpy:4035
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_4c5fae68:

  # f "I may know someone who can assist with that. Her name is..."
  f "我可能认识能帮上忙的人。她的名字是……"

# game/script.rpy:4037
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_9f0a5f58:

  # f "Her name..."
  f "她的名字……"

# game/script.rpy:4038
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_3ec57d49:

  # f "..."
  f "……"

# game/script.rpy:4040
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_2a445028:

  # f "Never mind, I must have been mistaken. More ham?"
  f "算了，我肯定是记错了。再来点火腿吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4042
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_15362349:

  # f "Perhaps the witch will know something about it. You should join me in hunting her down!"
  f "也许女巫会知道些什么。你应该和我一起去追捕她！"

# game/script.rpy:4044
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_a1b9dcc7:

  # pov "I need a way to escape my Godfather, the Lord. Can you help me?"
  pov "我需要找到逃离我教父——上帝——的方法。你能帮我吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4045
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_45852e77_1:

  # f "Possibly, possibly."
  f "或许能，或许能。"

# game/script.rpy:4048
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_4c5fae68_1:

  # f "I may know someone who can assist with that. Her name is..."
  f "我可能认识能帮上忙的人。她的名字是……"

