translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_9f0a5f58_1:

  # f "Her name..."
  f "她的名字……"

# game/script.rpy:4051
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_3ec57d49_1:

  # f "..."
  f "……"

# game/script.rpy:4053
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_2a445028_1:

  # f "Never mind, I must have been mistaken. More ham?"
  f "算了，我肯定是记错了。再来点火腿吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4055
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_15362349_1:

  # f "Perhaps the witch will know something about it. You should join me in hunting her down!"
  f "也许女巫会知道些什么。你应该和我一起去追捕她！"

# game/script.rpy:4057
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_07850475:

  # pov "I need a way to escape my Godfather, the Devil. Can you help me?"
  pov "我需要找到逃离我教父——魔鬼——的方法。你能帮我吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4060
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_4c5fae68_2:

  # f "I may know someone who can assist with that. Her name is..."
  f "我可能认识能帮上忙的人。她的名字是……"

# game/script.rpy:4062
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_9f0a5f58_2:

  # f "Her name..."
  f "她的名字……"

# game/script.rpy:4063
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_3ec57d49_2:

  # f "..."
  f "……"

# game/script.rpy:4065
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_2a445028_2:

  # f "Never mind, I must have been mistaken. More ham?"
  f "算了，我肯定是记错了。再来点火腿吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4067
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_4e83bb5e:

  # f "I'm sure the witch would know something about that. Rumour is that she dances with the Devil on cold, moonless nights! You should join me in hunting her down."
  f "我敢肯定女巫知道点内情。有传言说，在寒冷无月的夜晚，她会和魔鬼共舞！你应该和我一起去追捕她。"

# game/script.rpy:4071
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_2600851c:

  # f "Return soon! You can't possibly leave without sampling some of this fine green mango salad over here, absolutely sensational!"
  f "早点回来！你走之前绝对得尝尝这边的极品青芒果沙拉，味道简直绝了！"

# game/script.rpy:4075
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_5815467e:

  # sh "H-hold on, mate! Leaving so soon?"
  sh "等、等等，伙计！这么快就走？"

# game/script.rpy:4076
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_f9d145e8:

  # sh "We're just hatching a plan to catch that dastardly Master Thief. We could use yer help!"
  sh "我们正盘算着怎么逮住那个卑鄙的神偷呢。正需要你搭把手！"

# game/script.rpy:4077
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_839a362d:

  # sh "Come on then, let's get back to the village."
  sh "来吧，那我们回村子里去。"

# game/script.rpy:4081
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_81bebdcc:

  # "You turned and walked out into the darkness of the woods. No-one stopped you."
  "你转过身，走向幽暗的树林。没有人拦着你。"

# game/script.rpy:4085
translate Chinese toadWitchJoin_3eede05a:

  # "You turned and walked back to the centre of the village."
  "你转过身，走回了村子中心。"

# game/script.rpy:4099
translate Chinese town_f0c0ff33:

  # "You walked out to the edge of town."
  "你走到了镇子的边缘。"

# game/script.rpy:4102
translate Chinese town_39b135d3:

  # "You walked out to the edge of town. Some lone villagers still stood there, looking out into the woods."
  "你走到了镇子的边缘。几个形单影只的村民依然伫立在那儿，眺望着树林深处。"

# game/script.rpy:4103
translate Chinese town_be29ed77:

  # "There was a sound from the depths of that forest. The howling of the wind."
  "树林深处传来一阵声响。是呼啸的风声。"

# game/script.rpy:4105
translate Chinese town_067f8b75:

  # "You walked out to the edge of town, where villagers ran to and fro, searching for the Master Thief."
  "你走到了镇子的边缘，村民们在那里来回奔跑，搜寻着神偷的下落。"

# game/script.rpy:4107
translate Chinese town_cc2b9976:

  # "Some of them were strapping down a tarp."
  "有几个人正七手八脚地把一块防水布固定在地上。"

# game/script.rpy:4118
translate Chinese townExplore_5bc57ca6:

  # h "There you are! We lost track of you for a bit there."
  h "你在这儿！刚才一眨眼就没看见你人了。"

# game/script.rpy:4119
translate Chinese townExplore_71ebfd9c:

  # h "Are you going to help us with this?"
  h "你能过来搭把手吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4121
translate Chinese townExplore_7f135446:

  # pov "What is this?"
  pov "这是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:4123
translate Chinese townExplore_a37d5b78:

  # "For a moment they didn't seem to hear you. Then they turned, as if in a dream."
  "有那么一瞬间，他们似乎没听到你的话。接着，他们转过身来，神情恍惚，仿佛身在梦境中。"

# game/script.rpy:4124
translate Chinese townExplore_49a1499a:

  # h "We're going to catch the thief."
  h "我们要去抓那个小偷。"

# game/script.rpy:4125
translate Chinese townExplore_9525e32c:

  # sh "Yes. The thief."
  sh "是的。那个小偷。"

# game/script.rpy:4126
translate Chinese townExplore_1012b4f5:

  # "They were drinking wine straight from a bottle which they passed around between them."
  "他们几个人正轮流传着一个酒瓶，对瓶猛灌。"

# game/script.rpy:4129
translate Chinese townExplore_a916969f:

  # h "Shhh! Keep your voice down. This is all part of our plan to catch that dastardly Master Thief."
  h "嘘！小声点。这都是我们抓捕那个卑鄙神偷的计策。"

# game/script.rpy:4130
translate Chinese townExplore_2d5ce13c:

  # gm "We're sure to fail. This whole plan is doomed."
  gm "我们肯定会失败的。这个计划从一开始就是死路一条。"

# game/script.rpy:4134
translate Chinese townExplore_88477f12:

  # go "Greetings, friend. Be careful of the crystal caverns to the north."
  go "你好，朋友。小心北边的水晶洞穴。"

# game/script.rpy:4136
translate Chinese townExplore_7c99057c:

  # go "It is said that the first of the Goose-girls, old crooked Belziah, attempted dark experiments there."
  go "据说，第一代牧鹅女——弯腰驼背的老贝尔齐亚——曾在那儿进行过黑暗的实验。"

# game/script.rpy:4138
translate Chinese townExplore_1d5ad1ed:

  # go "She created abominable goose-faced men that even now infest the caverns, honking endlessly and plotting to turn the world to ruin."
  go "她创造了可憎的鹅脸人。直到今天，那些怪物仍然如虫害般在洞穴中泛滥成灾。它们不断发出刺耳的鹅叫，密谋着将整个世界化作废墟。"

# game/script.rpy:4140
translate Chinese townExplore_0443e236:

  # go "Sometimes, I... I must confess I dream of those caves."
  go "有时，我……我必须承认，我会梦见那些洞穴。"

# game/script.rpy:4141
translate Chinese townExplore_8966a495:

  # go "Home of the Goose-folk! I can scarcely imagine it."
  go "鹅人的家园！我简直无法想象。"

# game/script.rpy:4143
translate Chinese townExplore_24ea9114:

  # go "What would it be like to throw off my human skin and join them?"
  go "脱掉我的人皮加入它们，会是怎样一种体验？"

# game/script.rpy:4144
translate Chinese townExplore_c5e22de1:

  # go "To honk in ecstasy with my brothers?"
  go "和我的兄弟们一起在狂喜中鸣叫？"

# game/script.rpy:4145
translate Chinese townExplore_af65d25a:

  # go "To live every day with the fierce, honest joy of a goose?"
  go "像一只鹅那样，带着那种狂野、纯粹的快乐度过每一天？"

# game/script.rpy:4147
translate Chinese townExplore_39278688:

  # go "But they are just dreams. I would never have the courage."
  go "但那些只是梦。我永远都不会有那种勇气。"

# game/script.rpy:4149
translate Chinese townExplore_43c5766b:

  # go "Do not make my mistake, friend. Think not of the crystal caverns."
  go "不要重蹈我的覆辙，朋友。别去想那些水晶洞穴。"

# game/script.rpy:4150
translate Chinese townExplore_7e4143bb:

  # go "Their beauty was not made for us."
  go "那种美本就不属于我们。"

# game/script.rpy:4164
translate Chinese townExplore_0a9fc8fd:

  # h "A wolf? Don't be silly."
  h "狼？别傻了。"

# game/script.rpy:4167
translate Chinese townExplore_1fdcf047:

  # h "There are no wolves in Australia."
  h "澳大利亚没有狼。"

# game/script.rpy:4169
translate Chinese townExplore_0941f38f:

  # h "Howling? No. You must be imagining it."
  h "嚎叫？不。那一定是你的幻觉。"

# game/script.rpy:4177
translate Chinese townExplore_9e82df8b:

  # gm "Give it up now. You're already doomed."
  gm "趁早放弃吧。你早就没救了。"

# game/script.rpy:4179
translate Chinese townExplore_53580bb7:

  # gm "We have already died countless times. And we will die countless more, 'fore this business is through."
  gm "我们已经死过无数次了。在这件事结束之前，我们还要再死上无数次。"

# game/script.rpy:4181
translate Chinese townExplore_278b9413:

  # gm "Can't you hear them? The footsteps of the Ash Giants?"
  gm "难道你没听到吗？灰烬巨人的脚步声？"

# game/script.rpy:4183
translate Chinese townExplore_53f46721:

  # gm "When we lit that first fire in the dark, they started walking."
  gm "当我们在黑暗中点燃第一团火时，他们就已朝此地走来。"

# game/script.rpy:4185
translate Chinese townExplore_ec6c4b6a:

  # gm "They are almost here now."
  gm "他们快到了。"

# game/script.rpy:4187
translate Chinese townExplore_761d74fb:

  # gm "In their right hand is a terrible sound."
  gm "他们的右手中，握着一种可怕的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:4189
translate Chinese townExplore_4380066d:

  # gm "In their left hand is a terrible light."
  gm "他们的左手中，握着一道可怕的光芒。"

# game/script.rpy:4192
translate Chinese townExplore_dcde863f:

  # gm "[povname], is it? Lovely name."
  gm "[povname]，是吗？挺好听的名字。"

# game/script.rpy:4194
translate Chinese townExplore_3f0718c8:

  # gm "Did you choose it yourself?"
  gm "是你自己选的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4196
translate Chinese townExplore_c6c91e12:

  # gm "Y'know, a secret lies in that place where names are chosen."
  gm "听着，在那个决定姓名的所在，隐藏着一个秘密。"

# game/script.rpy:4198
translate Chinese townExplore_65b1136b:

  # gm "Perhaps you could go there now. And choose another name."
  gm "也许你现在就可以去那儿。再选一个名字。"

# game/script.rpy:4200
translate Chinese townExplore_db68b3b1:

  # gm "Perhaps you will find something, if you choose the right name. Perhaps the name of an ancient king. Who can say?"
  gm "也许，如果你选对了名字，就会发现些什么。也许是一位古代国王的名字。谁说得准呢？"

# game/script.rpy:4202
translate Chinese townExplore_cab939c9:

  # gm "It won't save us, of course. Nothing will."
  gm "当然，这救不了我们。什么都救不了。"

# game/script.rpy:4204
translate Chinese townExplore_42a49367:

  # gm "We are already dead."
  gm "我们已经死了。"

# game/script.rpy:4209
translate Chinese townExplore_f96a9169:

  # well "Evening."
  well "晚上好。"

# game/script.rpy:4215
translate Chinese townExplore_a84f4519:

  # well "Got any smokes?" nointeract
  well "来根烟？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:4217
translate Chinese townExplore_8725e3f9:

  # well "Cheers."
  well "谢了。"

# game/script.rpy:4219
translate Chinese townExplore_a63db0fe:

  # well "No worries."
  well "不客气。"

# game/script.rpy:4227
translate Chinese townExplore_88f03a47:

  # "You tossed the Emerald Brooch down in the well, and wished for a way out of your terrible predicament."
  "你把绿宝石胸针投进井里，祈求能有一条绝境逢生之路。"

# game/script.rpy:4228
translate Chinese townExplore_bd2d5a1e:

  # well "Thanks for the Brooch. I can't help you, though."
  well "谢谢你的胸针。不过，我帮不了你。"

# game/script.rpy:4230
translate Chinese townExplore_e5774fe7:

  # "You would have liked to make a wish. But you had no coins on you."
  "你本想许个愿。但你身上没有硬币了。"

# game/script.rpy:4233
translate Chinese townExplore_bb3b0ce1:

  # well "Thank G-d you have it. Quickly! Come in!"
  well "谢天谢地你拿到了。快！进来！"

# game/script.rpy:4236
translate Chinese townExplore_84177a0a:

  # "You scrambled down into the well towards the secret passage. The breath of King Famine was hot on your neck. Behind you, you could see His soldiers tearing apart the village, just as He swore He would when you stole the mask from Him."
  "你连滚带爬地下到井里，钻向秘密通道。饥荒之王灼热的吐息已逼近你的后颈。在你身后，你能看到他的士兵正在将村庄夷为平地，正如当初你窃取面具时，他所发下的毒誓那般。"

# game/script.rpy:4237
translate Chinese townExplore_c5ed900f:

  # sc "Go. I'll hold them off."
  sc "走吧。我来挡住他们。"

# game/script.rpy:4238
translate Chinese townExplore_f794486c:

  # "You turned to your faithful companion, tears in your eyes."
  "你眼含泪水，转向你忠诚的同伴。"

# game/script.rpy:4239
translate Chinese townExplore_76bc84bb:

  # pov "Scraggs, are you sure?"
  pov "斯克拉格斯，你当真要这么做？"

# game/script.rpy:4240
translate Chinese townExplore_c3568d5c:

  # well "After all we've been through together... we can't just abandon you!"
  well "我们一起经历了这么多……我们不能丢下你不管！"

# game/script.rpy:4241
translate Chinese townExplore_d58ee61a:

  # "He just gave you his crooked grin."
  "他只是冲你撇着嘴笑了笑。"

# game/script.rpy:4242
translate Chinese townExplore_96ae4ec6:

  # sc "Such is life."
  sc "这就是命吧。"

# game/script.rpy:4243
translate Chinese townExplore_62faa198:

  # sc "Don't worry about me. Just make sure you collect that reward money."
  sc "别管我。务必把那笔赏金拿到手。"

# game/script.rpy:4244
translate Chinese townExplore_d3863d1b:

  # "You embraced in a passionate kiss. Then Scraggs pushed you away. His Colt Navy revolvers roared out into the night as you fled deeper into the well."
  "你们深情拥吻。随后，斯克拉格斯一把将你推开。你转身向井底深处逃亡，身后，他手中那双柯尔特海军型左轮手枪在夜色中爆发出怒吼。"

# game/script.rpy:4245
translate Chinese townExplore_4cc14678:

  # sc "Come, you bastards! Come!"
  sc "来啊，你们这些杂碎！来啊！"

# game/script.rpy:4246
translate Chinese townExplore_8954a821:

  # "The secret entrance slammed shut behind you, cutting off the sounds of battle."
  "秘密入口在你身后重重关上，隔绝了战斗的声响。"

# game/script.rpy:4247
translate Chinese townExplore_a4d5b413:

  # "The Skin-Mask was burning hot in your hands, slowly twisting as it tried to squirm out of your grip. Whispers seeped into your mind."
  "人皮面具在你手中滚烫如火，它缓缓扭动，企图挣脱你的抓握。阵阵低语渗入你的脑海。"

# game/script.rpy:4248
translate Chinese townExplore_139d40f2:

  # well "Don't listen to it. You're almost there now. I'll open the way."
  well "别听它的。你马上就要到了。我来为你开路。"

# game/script.rpy:4249
translate Chinese townExplore_2a83c8c6:

  # pov "Aloysius... your brother told us about what happened. I just wanted to say-"
  pov "阿洛伊修斯……你的遭遇，你哥哥都跟我们说了。我只是想说——"

# game/script.rpy:4250
translate Chinese townExplore_e93d65ec:

  # well "Save your breath. There's nothing to be done about it now."
  well "省省力气吧。事已至此，无可挽回了。"

# game/script.rpy:4251
translate Chinese townExplore_3a3b1938:

  # well "In the years since I died in that freak chainsaw juggling accident... there's one thing I've learned."
  well "在那场抛接电锯的离奇事故中丧生后，这些年来……我明白了一件事。"

# game/script.rpy:4252
translate Chinese townExplore_009b6dd3:

  # well "You can't change the past."
  well "你无法改变过去。"

# game/script.rpy:4253
translate Chinese townExplore_0bb60ece:

  # well "All you can do is try to change the future. Once step at a time."
  well "你所能做的，就是努力改变未来。一步一个脚印。"

# game/script.rpy:4254
translate Chinese townExplore_c40e4571:

  # "A rumble shook the cave. In horror, you saw the fingers of King Famine slowly breaking in through the earth around you. In the cracks you could see his gaping maw. A terrible screaming broke out all around you."
  "伴随隆隆巨响，洞穴剧烈震颤起来。你惊恐地看着饥荒之王的手指一点点刺破身侧的泥土。透过裂缝，你能看到他的血盆大口。四周爆发出凄厉的尖叫。"

# game/script.rpy:4255
translate Chinese townExplore_53f76d2f:

  # "With a powerful crack, Aloysius stretched his ghostly form across the cave, holding it together through sheer force of will. Thick smoke billowed all around you."
  "伴随着一声巨响，阿洛伊修斯的幽灵之躯在洞穴中极力延展，全凭意志力强撑着不让洞穴坍塌。浓烟在你四周翻滚。"

# game/script.rpy:4256
translate Chinese townExplore_7ff5a63b:

  # well "Go to her."
  well "去找她。"

# game/script.rpy:4257
translate Chinese townExplore_d23c6590:

  # pov "No. I can't lose you too."
  pov "不。我不能连你也失去。"

# game/script.rpy:4258
translate Chinese townExplore_7c60b248:

  # well "Have you forgotten?"
  well "你忘了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4259
translate Chinese townExplore_01432108:

  # well "I'm already dead."
  well "我已经死了。"

# game/script.rpy:4260
translate Chinese townExplore_c40c194d:

  # "The smoke howled through the cave and pushed you deeper into the depths. You stumbled onwards, tears pouring down your face."
  "浓烟在洞穴中呼啸，把你推向更深处。你跌跌撞撞地继续前行，早已泪流满面。"

# game/script.rpy:4261
translate Chinese townExplore_cb54ad72:

  # "The wind fell silent. The cave was quiet."
  "风停了。洞穴陷入死寂。"

# game/script.rpy:4262
translate Chinese townExplore_f50146d0:

  # sm "You are alone now."
  sm "现在，只剩你孤身一人了。"

# game/script.rpy:4263
translate Chinese townExplore_bbbdd90e:

  # "You struggled through the cave, feeling the thing twisting in your hands."
  "你在洞穴中艰难跋涉，能感觉到手里那东西正扭来扭去。"

# game/script.rpy:4264
translate Chinese townExplore_8ed307af:

  # sm "Your limbs are slowing."
  sm "你的四肢变得愈发沉重。"

# game/script.rpy:4265
translate Chinese townExplore_37fdf235:

  # sm "There is no need to worry."
  sm "无需心生畏惧。"

# game/script.rpy:4266
translate Chinese townExplore_c915772d:

  # sm "Soon, this part of the cycle will be over, and you can lay down your burden."
  sm "很快，这一世的轮回就会结束，你就能卸下重担了。"

# game/script.rpy:4267
translate Chinese townExplore_183fa441:

  # "Your shoulders ached. Your hands were raw and burnt."
  "你的双肩酸痛无比。你的双手血肉模糊，满是烫伤。"

# game/script.rpy:4268
translate Chinese townExplore_43d0d552:

  # sm "Listen."
  sm "听。"

# game/script.rpy:4269
translate Chinese townExplore_ac1a1fd7:

  # sm "Do you hear that?"
  sm "你听到了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4270
translate Chinese townExplore_b6f03317:

  # sm "The footsteps of the Ash Giants."
  sm "灰烬巨人的脚步声。"

# game/script.rpy:4271
translate Chinese townExplore_ccdc2ee4:

  # sm "They will be here soon."
  sm "他们很快就会到这里。"

# game/script.rpy:4272
translate Chinese townExplore_0d651055:

  # sm "None of this matters any more."
  sm "这一切都不再重要了。"

# game/script.rpy:4273
translate Chinese townExplore_409d3513:

  # "You stumbled out into the frozen silence of the chasm. Below you, you could see the vortex of souls. In the middle of the vortex, Princess Sun lay peacefully at rest in her tomb."
  "你跌跌撞撞地踏入深渊，四周是一片冰冷的死寂。在你下方，你能看到灵魂的漩涡。在漩涡的中心，太阳公主正安详地躺在她的坟墓里。"

# game/script.rpy:4274
translate Chinese townExplore_c47a26f9:

  # "You fell to your knees. Your legs were lead."
  "你双膝跪地。你的双腿沉重如铅。"

# game/script.rpy:4275
translate Chinese townExplore_4d614843:

  # sm "Come."
  sm "来吧。"

# game/script.rpy:4276
translate Chinese townExplore_74b5ba9c:

  # sm "It is time to end this."
  sm "是时候结束这一切了。"

# game/script.rpy:4281
translate Chinese townExplore_e8295cb3:

  # sm "Put me on." nointeract
  sm "戴上我。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:4283
translate Chinese townExplore_103aae4c:

  # "You put on the mask."
  "你戴上了面具。"

# game/script.rpy:4284
translate Chinese townExplore_b65a4579:

  # "The warm heat of it slowly closed around your face."
  "那股温热感慢慢包裹住你的脸。"

# game/script.rpy:4285
translate Chinese townExplore_8ba6f70d:

  # "The skin pressed into your mouth and eyes. Its coils folded over and enveloped you."
  "人皮挤进你的嘴巴和眼睛。那一圈圈皮肉层层叠叠，将你完全吞没。"

# game/script.rpy:4286
translate Chinese townExplore_a51f901e:

  # sm "Good."
  sm "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:4288
translate Chinese townExplore_78689bfa:

  # "The howling finally stopped."
  "呼啸声终于停止了。"

# game/script.rpy:4289
translate Chinese townExplore_4e35b6d3:

  # "All was silent and still."
  "万物归于寂静。"

# game/script.rpy:4291
translate Chinese townExplore_91a476a5:

  # "And then there was rest in the land."
  "大地终于迎来了安宁。"

# game/script.rpy:4293
translate Chinese townExplore_a20cefa7:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:4294
translate Chinese townExplore_a3967e53:

  # "Well. That's enough of that."
  "好了。那段就到此为止吧。"

# game/script.rpy:4295
translate Chinese townExplore_2b493b75:

  # "Let's get back to the story."
  "让我们言归正传。"

# game/script.rpy:4299
translate Chinese townExplore_38f35098:

  # "You crawled forward, step by step."
  "你一步一步地向前爬行。"

# game/script.rpy:4300
translate Chinese townExplore_2732c668:

  # sm "Rest, child."
  sm "休息吧，孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:4301
translate Chinese townExplore_c942b04f:

  # "Your hand started to shake. To your horror, the mask slowly crawled towards your face as you lay on the ground."
  "你的手开始颤抖。你瘫倒在地，惊恐地看着那张面具正一点点朝你的脸爬过来。"

# game/script.rpy:4302
translate Chinese townExplore_efbf5ec4:

  # sm "Good. Rest."
  sm "很好。休息。"

# game/script.rpy:4303
translate Chinese townExplore_99c01b0c:

  # "The skin crept over your mouth, towards your throat."
  "那张皮爬过你的嘴巴，向你的喉咙蔓延。"

# game/script.rpy:4304
translate Chinese townExplore_95385d77:

  # "You tried to scream. Nothing came out."
  "你想尖叫，却发不出任何声音。"

# game/script.rpy:4305
translate Chinese townExplore_939aebd7:

  # "Suddenly, you felt someone grab you and pull you up."
  "突然，你感觉有人抓住了你，把你拉了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:4306
translate Chinese townExplore_7075e838:

  # "A burly figure lifted you up and carried you towards the cliff edge."
  "一个魁梧的身影将你扛起，带着你走向悬崖边缘。"

# game/script.rpy:4307
translate Chinese townExplore_80089c33:

  # "In your blurred vision, you caught sight of a banksia seed."
  "视线模糊间，你瞥见了一颗班克木的种子。"

# game/script.rpy:4308
translate Chinese townExplore_cb161ba2:

  # pov "S...scraggs?"
  pov "斯……斯克拉格斯？"

# game/script.rpy:4309
translate Chinese townExplore_64ad4df7:

  # sc "Heh. Don't think this means I like you or anything."
  sc "呵。别以为这意味着我喜欢你什么的。"

# game/script.rpy:4310
translate Chinese townExplore_ac1f6116:

  # sc "I just need my cut of the reward."
  sc "我只是要拿到我那份赏金。"

# game/script.rpy:4311
translate Chinese townExplore_a3f73242:

  # "You reached the edge of the cliff. The vortex of souls screamed out in terror."
  "你来到了悬崖边缘。灵魂的漩涡爆发出恐惧的尖叫。"

# game/script.rpy:4312
translate Chinese townExplore_7c632bb2:

  # "With the last of your strength, you hurled the mask over the edge."
  "你用尽最后的一丝力气，将面具扔下了悬崖。"

# game/script.rpy:4313
translate Chinese townExplore_e34e5f85:

  # "There was a moment of silence."
  "周遭陷入了片刻的寂静。"

# game/script.rpy:4314
translate Chinese townExplore_63f425c4:

  # "Then a gigantic explosion hurled you and Scraggs off your feet."
  "紧接着，一场巨大的爆炸将你和斯克拉格斯掀翻在地。"

# game/script.rpy:4315
translate Chinese townExplore_162e996f:

  # "Princess Sun rose before you, the Skin-Mask writhing in her hands."
  "太阳公主在你面前站立起身，人皮面具在她手中翻腾蠕动。"

# game/script.rpy:4316
translate Chinese townExplore_ae52a655:

  # "There was a blinding light, and they both disappeared."
  "伴随一道刺目的强光，他们双双消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:4317
translate Chinese townExplore_5e425d94:

  # "Silence fell on the cavern. You heard birdsong outside."
  "洞穴陷入了死寂。你听到了外面的鸟鸣声。"

# game/script.rpy:4318
translate Chinese townExplore_279d6011:

  # "Scraggs clapped a hand on your shoulder."
  "斯克拉格斯重重拍在你肩上。"

# game/script.rpy:4319
translate Chinese townExplore_e3c69c01:

  # sc "Alright. Time to head home."
  sc "好了。该回家了。"

# game/script.rpy:4320
translate Chinese townExplore_8bac67d6:

  # "You tilted your head back and laughed with relief."
  "你仰起头，如释重负地放声大笑。"

# game/script.rpy:4321
translate Chinese townExplore_d2f2c0da:

  # "Years passed, and the story of the Skin-Mask was forgotten. You and Scraggs lived happily ever after for the rest of your days."
  "岁月流逝，人皮面具的故事逐渐被遗忘。你和斯克拉格斯在余生中过上了幸福快乐的生活。"

# game/script.rpy:4323
translate Chinese townExplore_94b9410d:

  # "And if you are not dead, you are still alive."
  "如果你没有死去，想必至今还存活于世吧。"

# game/script.rpy:4324
translate Chinese townExplore_a20cefa7_1:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:4325
translate Chinese townExplore_a3967e53_1:

  # "Well. That's enough of that."
  "好了。那段就到此为止吧。"

# game/script.rpy:4326
translate Chinese townExplore_2b493b75_1:

  # "Let's get back to the story."
  "让我们言归正传。"

# game/script.rpy:4332
translate Chinese townExplore_7c15e74b:

  # "You toss a coin in the well, and wish for a way out of your terrible predicament."
  "你向井中投下一枚硬币，祈求摆脱眼前的可怕困境。"

# game/script.rpy:4337
translate Chinese townExplore_196ad6c8:

  # f "W-wait just a second there!"
  f "等、等一下！"

# game/script.rpy:4338
translate Chinese townExplore_90338e08:

  # f "This is no time to be wandering off into the woods! We have an accursed witch to bring to justice. Not to mention a fine banquet to sample."
  f "现在可不是在树林里瞎逛的时候！我们还得去把那个该死的女巫绳之以法呢。更别提还有一顿丰盛的宴席等着咱们。"

# game/script.rpy:4339
translate Chinese townExplore_8cf29161:

  # f "Come, let's get back to the village. I can tell you all about the plan."
  f "来吧，我们回村子去。我好跟你详细聊聊这个计划。"

# game/script.rpy:4343
translate Chinese townExplore_81bebdcc:

  # "You turned and walked out into the darkness of the woods. No-one stopped you."
  "你转过身，走向幽暗的树林。没有人拦着你。"

# game/script.rpy:4347
translate Chinese townExplore_42eb007a:

  # "You turned and walked back."
  "你转过身，往回走。"

# game/script.rpy:4354
translate Chinese villagersConvo_2d104460:

  # go "Care to join us?" nointeract
  go "要加入我们吗？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:4356
translate Chinese villagersConvo_9ff073a8:

  # h "This is it. The last thing left to do."
  h "就是这个了。就差这最后一件事了。"

# game/script.rpy:4357
translate Chinese villagersConvo_c01a9855:

  # sh "We had a good run."
  sh "我们这一路也算轰轰烈烈了。"

# game/script.rpy:4358
translate Chinese villagersConvo_734add44:

  # go "I just wish there was more time."
  go "我只希望能再多点时间。"

# game/script.rpy:4359
translate Chinese villagersConvo_fc0d3f4a:

  # sh "Will you come with us?"
  sh "你愿意和我们一起去吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4363
translate Chinese villagersConvo_16d48e14:

  # h "Let's do it. One last time."
  h "让我们大干一场。最后一次。"

# game/script.rpy:4364
translate Chinese villagersConvo_fa62273a:

  # "They raised the bottle in a toast."
  "他们举起酒瓶，遥遥致意。"

# game/script.rpy:4365
translate Chinese villagersConvo_d6cfd995:

  # go "May you all find the True Ending."
  go "愿你们所有人都能找到真结局。"

# game/script.rpy:4366
translate Chinese villagersConvo_20273676:

  # "Everyone took a swig."
  "每个人都灌了一大口。"

# game/script.rpy:4367
translate Chinese villagersConvo_8f42bfff:

  # sh "I-I'm glad I'll be with all of you."
  sh "我——我很高兴能和大家在一起。"

# game/script.rpy:4368
translate Chinese villagersConvo_024ee188:

  # go "Me too."
  go "我也是。"

# game/script.rpy:4369
translate Chinese villagersConvo_4ce9fd2c:

  # h "Couldn't have asked for a better hunting party!"
  h "能有你们这样的狩猎小队，真是值了！"

# game/script.rpy:4370
translate Chinese villagersConvo_88af0b72:

  # "You, the Goose-Girl, the Sparrow-Herder and the Hunter all climbed into the cart and held hands as it rattled away down the road, leaving the old Gloom-monger behind."
  "你、牧鹅女、牧雀人和猎人纷纷爬上马车。你们手挽着手，马车在路上颠簸着远去，只把老阴郁鬼远远抛在身后。"

# game/script.rpy:4372
translate Chinese villagersConvo_d661b29a:

  # gm "You're all doomed! Doooooooomed!"
  gm "你们全都没救了！没————救————啦！"

# game/script.rpy:4374
translate Chinese villagersConvo_d081345e:

  # sh "..."
  sh "……"

# game/script.rpy:4379
translate Chinese villagersConvo_d961a00e:

  # h "With this!"
  h "就用这个！"

# game/script.rpy:4380
translate Chinese villagersConvo_c88d2c5f:

  # "The Hunter flexed their muscles and pulled back the tarp to reveal an ornate chest full of lustrous pebbles and stones."
  "猎人秀了秀肌肉，扯开防水布，露出一只华丽的箱子，里面装满了闪闪发光的各色奇石。"

# game/script.rpy:4381
translate Chinese villagersConvo_59a7f5b5:

  # go "We'll take this out to my house, and nail it to the veranda. Everyone knows that the Master Thief can't resist anything that's nailed down."
  go "我们把这个运到我家去，把它钉在门廊上。大家都知道，对于钉牢的东西，神偷向来是毫无抵抗力的。"

# game/script.rpy:4382
translate Chinese villagersConvo_96ac89a0:

  # h "Exactly. And their love for shiny rocks is well-known."
  h "没错。而且神偷对闪亮石头的热爱是出了名的。"

# game/script.rpy:4383
translate Chinese villagersConvo_dea9d065:

  # echidna "A fine plan indeed, friends! There's no way this \"Master Thief\" I've heard so much about could ever detect this scheme, no matter how cunning and gorgeous they are."
  echidna "朋友们，这计划真是绝妙！不管我耳闻已久的那个“神偷”有多么狡诈、多么魅力四射，也绝不可能识破这等计谋。"

# game/script.rpy:4384
translate Chinese villagersConvo_2fddb453:

  # h "Thanks, friend. Your confidence means a lot."
  h "谢谢，朋友。有你这话我们心里就踏实多了。"

# game/script.rpy:4388
translate Chinese villagersConvo_6b2823a9:

  # h "They stole my courage!"
  h "那家伙偷走了我的勇气！"

# game/script.rpy:4389
translate Chinese villagersConvo_33654175:

  # gm "They stole my wisdom!"
  gm "那家伙偷走了我的智慧！"

# game/script.rpy:4390
translate Chinese villagersConvo_692bc7f5:

  # go "They stole my heart."
  go "那家伙偷走了我的心。"

# game/script.rpy:4392
translate Chinese villagersConvo_5e2368a8:

  # "Your pig grunted as if to say, \"They stole my dignity.\""
  "你的猪哼唧了一声，像是在说：“那家伙偷走了我的尊严。”"

# game/script.rpy:4393
translate Chinese villagersConvo_c7af30d3:

  # h "We can't let them just run around doing as they please and getting the Goose-girl all hot and bothered. What if everyone decided to do that? It'd be anarchy!"
  h "我们不能让那家伙这样到处为所欲为，把牧鹅女撩拨得春心荡漾。要是人人都这么干，岂不是要天下大乱了！"

# game/script.rpy:4394
translate Chinese villagersConvo_7ac747a2:

  # go "Hot, sweaty anarchy."
  go "大汗淋漓、彻底失控的那种大乱。"

# game/script.rpy:4399
translate Chinese villagersConvo_df1abba9:

  # pov "I need a way to escape my Godfather, the Lord. Do any of you know how I can do that?"
  pov "我需要找到逃离我教父——上帝——的方法。你们有谁知道我该怎么做吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4400
translate Chinese villagersConvo_cc8bc8a1:

  # gm "Hmph. I advise you to give up immediately."
  gm "哼。我劝你趁早放弃。"

# game/script.rpy:4402
translate Chinese villagersConvo_a56e4561:

  # go "I'm sorry. I know of no-one who can help you with that plight."
  go "抱歉。我不知道有谁能帮你摆脱那个困境。"

# game/script.rpy:4403
translate Chinese villagersConvo_cd68d071:

  # sh "Wasn't there..."
  sh "不是有那个……"

# game/script.rpy:4404
translate Chinese villagersConvo_41cda512:

  # sh "No, never mind. You're right. There is no-one."
  sh "不，算了。你是对的。没有那种人。"

# game/script.rpy:4406
translate Chinese villagersConvo_9bab4f21:

  # go "Well, it is said that the Master Thief has hidden from the Lord all their life. If anyone would know, they would."
  go "嗯，据说神偷终其一生都在躲避主的目光。如果有人知道该怎么逃，那必定是那家伙。"

# game/script.rpy:4407
translate Chinese villagersConvo_3ef89d87:

  # h "Once we track the thief down, you could question them!"
  h "一旦我们追踪到神偷，你就可以问个究竟！"

# game/script.rpy:4409
translate Chinese villagersConvo_1faf85bb:

  # pov "I need a way to escape my Godfather, the Devil. Do any of you know how I can do that?"
  pov "我需要找到逃离我教父——魔鬼——的方法。你们有谁知道我该怎么做吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4410
translate Chinese villagersConvo_cc8bc8a1_1:

  # gm "Hmph. I advise you to give up immediately."
  gm "哼。我劝你趁早放弃。"

# game/script.rpy:4412
translate Chinese villagersConvo_a56e4561_1:

  # go "I'm sorry. I know of no-one who can help you with that plight."
  go "抱歉。我不知道有谁能帮你摆脱那个困境。"

# game/script.rpy:4413
translate Chinese villagersConvo_cd68d071_1:

  # sh "Wasn't there..."
  sh "不是有那个……"

# game/script.rpy:4414
translate Chinese villagersConvo_41cda512_1:

  # sh "No, never mind. You're right. There is no-one."
  sh "不，算了。你是对的。没有那种人。"

# game/script.rpy:4416
translate Chinese villagersConvo_46e3dff2:

  # go "Well, I have heard that the witch has sworn her soul to the devil. She would know how to help you, if anyone would."
  go "嗯，我听说那个女巫已经把灵魂卖给了魔鬼。如果有人能帮你，那肯定非她莫属。"

# game/script.rpy:4417
translate Chinese villagersConvo_31ece4bf:

  # sh "If only she was here tonight! Oh, I can already feel her curse upon me."
  sh "要是她今晚在这里就好了！噢，我已经感觉到她在我身上下的咒开始发作了。"

# game/script.rpy:4419
translate Chinese villagersConvo_e281649c:

  # pov "I need a way to escape my godmother, Lady Death. Do any of you know how I can do that?"
  pov "我需要找到逃离我教母——死神女士——的方法。你们有谁知道我该怎么做吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4420
translate Chinese villagersConvo_cc8bc8a1_2:

  # gm "Hmph. I advise you to give up immediately."
  gm "哼。我劝你趁早放弃。"

# game/script.rpy:4422
translate Chinese villagersConvo_a56e4561_2:

  # go "I'm sorry. I know of no-one who can help you with that plight."
  go "抱歉。我不知道有谁能帮你摆脱那个困境。"

# game/script.rpy:4423
translate Chinese villagersConvo_cd68d071_2:

  # sh "Wasn't there..."
  sh "不是有那个……"

# game/script.rpy:4424
translate Chinese villagersConvo_41cda512_2:

  # sh "No, never mind. You're right. There is no-one."
  sh "不，算了。你是对的。没有那种人。"

# game/script.rpy:4426
translate Chinese villagersConvo_e4b1494a:

  # go "Well, as we all know, mushrooms are the fingers of death. That wise mushroom in the deep forest would know how to help you, if anyone would."
  go "嗯，众所周知，蘑菇是死神的手指。如果说有谁能帮你，那必定是深林里那株睿智的蘑菇。"

# game/script.rpy:4427
translate Chinese villagersConvo_92c0fc3a:

  # sh "I heard that dastardly Master Thief was planning to steal from 'er this very night! We'd better get the trap laid before they 'ave a chance."
  sh "我听说那个卑劣的神偷今晚就要对她下手！趁那家伙还没得手，咱们最好赶紧把陷阱布好。"

# game/script.rpy:4431
translate Chinese villagersConvo_a88bc5f9:

  # pov "Are you going to do anything about the witch's curse?"
  pov "你们对女巫的诅咒就打算袖手旁观吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4432
translate Chinese villagersConvo_2a03a34b:

  # go "And risk the wrath of the witch? Not on your life."
  go "冒着激怒女巫的风险？我还要命呢！"

# game/script.rpy:4433
translate Chinese villagersConvo_8800dcc7:

  # gm "I heard that she has fingers as long and fat as carpet snakes, and once you fall into her clutches, you'll never see daylight again."
  gm "我听说她的手指像地毯蟒一样又粗又长，一旦你落入她的魔爪，就永远别想再见天日了。"

# game/script.rpy:4434
translate Chinese villagersConvo_06e44fa8:

  # go "I heard she has many children with the Devil, who are all evil."
  go "我听说她和魔鬼生了许多孩子，个个邪恶无比。"

# game/script.rpy:4435
translate Chinese villagersConvo_c77ad4ea:

  # h "Well, I heard that all the trees of the woods are her children, but she regards them with vicious envy, and if any of them displease her by becoming too beautiful, she strikes them down!"
  h "哎呀，我听说林子里所有的树都是她的孩子，但她却对它们怀着恶毒的嫉妒心。要是哪棵树长得太美惹她不高兴了，她就会降下天罚把它击碎！"

# game/script.rpy:4436
translate Chinese villagersConvo_9e319710:

  # h "This is why the most beautiful trees are always thunderstruck."
  h "这就是为什么最美的树总是会被雷劈。"

# game/script.rpy:4441
translate Chinese villagersConvo_58fcbd5f:

  # h "Excellent! Let's be off at once."
  h "太棒了！我们立刻出发。"

# game/script.rpy:4442
translate Chinese villagersConvo_de14d045:

  # "And so you, the Goose-Girl, the Sparrow-Herder and the Hunter all leapt on the cart and rattled away down the road, leaving the old Gloom-monger behind."
  "于是，你、牧鹅女、牧雀人和猎人都跳上了马车。马车在路上颠簸着远去，只把老阴郁鬼留在了身后。"

# game/script.rpy:4443
translate Chinese villagersConvo_d661b29a_1:

  # gm "You're all doomed! Doooooooomed!"
  gm "你们全都没救了！没————救————啦！"

# game/script.rpy:4446
translate Chinese gilPathShowingThief_a29819e7:

  # h "Don't worry. He says that every time we go anywhere."
  h "别担心。每次我们出门他都这么说。"

# game/script.rpy:4451
translate Chinese gilPathShowingThief_b2af5366:

  # sh "Yes. Say your goodbyes."
  sh "是的。道别吧。"

# game/script.rpy:4453
translate Chinese gilPathShowingThief_9b5ecb82:

  # sh "No worries. Have a good one!"
  sh "别放在心上。祝你们好运！"

# game/script.rpy:4463
translate Chinese thief2_ffc38e37:

  # "Soon, you arrived at the young goose-girls house, which was overrun by honking devils who tore at the furniture and ransacked the pantry and snapped at everyone until she was at her wit's end."
  "很快，你们抵达了年轻牧鹅女的家。那里已经被一群宛如恶魔般嘎嘎乱叫的呆鹅给霸占了，它们破坏家具、洗劫储藏室，还见人就咬，把她折腾得焦头烂额。"

# game/script.rpy:4469
translate Chinese thief2_8d316d9b:

  # "The pig quailed from the goose's wrath behind you."
  "小猪缩在你身后瑟瑟发抖，不敢直面那群大鹅的怒火。"

# game/script.rpy:4476
translate Chinese thief2_97192bd9:

  # "You got some bear traps from the Hunter's cart and placed them all around the chest, disguising them with leaves."
  "你从猎人的马车上拿了一些捕熊夹，把它们安置在箱子四周，用树叶伪装起来。"

# game/script.rpy:4479
translate Chinese thief2_0f562d24:

  # "You pulled thin tripwires all around the chest, tied to old tin cans. As soon as anyone approached it the tin cans would rattle like crazy, alerting the waiting geese."
  "你在箱子周围布下细细的绊线，上面拴着旧锡罐。只要有人靠近，锡罐就会疯狂作响，惊动在一旁等待的鹅群。"

# game/script.rpy:4482
translate Chinese thief2_020c4f6a:

  # "You picked up the most disagreeable goose from the pack and carefully placed it inside the chest, shielding your eyes as it pecked at you in rage."
  "你从鹅群中挑出一只最暴躁的鹅，小心翼翼地把它放进箱子里，同时护住眼睛，免得被它狂怒的啄咬伤到。"

# game/script.rpy:4483
translate Chinese thief2_84f56765:

  # "As soon as it was inside the chest, you slammed it shut."
  "它刚一进箱子，你就砰的一声把盖子关上了。"

# game/script.rpy:4485
translate Chinese thief2_0911d8b0:

  # "Then the four of you ducked behind a bush to watch the chest."
  "然后，你们四个人躲在灌木丛后，盯着那个箱子。"

# game/script.rpy:4486
translate Chinese thief2_6299e6cf:

  # "The geese wandered around the house, honking softly."
  "鹅群在房子周围游荡，发出轻柔的嘎嘎声。"

# game/script.rpy:4487
translate Chinese thief2_336d1557:

  # sh "Now we wait."
  sh "接下来就等着吧。"

# game/script.rpy:4488
translate Chinese thief2_b662dd40:

  # go "The thief will never get past us now."
  go "现在小偷绝对过不了我们这一关。"

# game/script.rpy:4490
translate Chinese thief2_c8a1b8a7:

  # echidna "I couldn't agree more, friends. This cunning and charismatic \"Master Thief\" character stands no chance against us."
  echidna "朋友们，我完全同意。这个狡猾又迷人的所谓“神偷”，在我们面前根本毫无胜算。"

# game/script.rpy:4491
translate Chinese thief2_50559a79:

  # h "Don't get cocky."
  h "别得意忘形。"

# game/script.rpy:4500
translate Chinese thief2_2fc48d1f:

  # "The night was dark and quiet. You thought you heard something rustling in the bushes, outside your line of sight. A sound, like something moving through the forest."
  "夜色深沉，万籁俱寂。你似乎听到视线之外的灌木丛中传来沙沙声。那声音，就像有什么东西正在穿过森林。"

# game/script.rpy:4501
translate Chinese thief2_68cceacb:

  # "But it must have been the wind."
  "但这一定是风声。"

# game/script.rpy:4505
translate Chinese thief2_c4c4a7d5:

  # "The three of you lay there for a long time, watching the chest."
  "你们三个趴在那里，盯着箱子看了很久。"

# game/script.rpy:4507
translate Chinese thief2_dacd38bf:

  # go "Wait just one moment."
  go "等一下。"

# game/script.rpy:4508
translate Chinese thief2_7a7664a6:

  # go "Was there... someone else here?"
  go "刚才……这里还有别人吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4509
translate Chinese thief2_0a6b7748:

  # pov "I don't think so."
  pov "我觉得没有。"

# game/script.rpy:4511
translate Chinese thief2_70cd8fae:

  # sh "Just us three. You, me and [povname]."
  sh "就我们三个。你、我和[povname]。"

# game/script.rpy:4512
translate Chinese thief2_2da0aa11:

  # go "For some reason I thought..."
  go "不知为什么，我总觉得……"

# game/script.rpy:4513
translate Chinese thief2_dc842cb6:

  # "The goose-girl looked around."
  "牧鹅女环顾四周。"

# game/script.rpy:4514
translate Chinese thief2_941ad0bc:

  # "After some searching she found a hunter's rifle, lying unused under the bush."
  "经过一番搜寻，她在灌木丛下发现了一把猎枪，孤零零地躺在地上。"

# game/script.rpy:4515
translate Chinese thief2_759ca411:

  # sh "How odd."
  sh "真奇怪。"

# game/script.rpy:4516
translate Chinese thief2_3d33bed9:

  # go "Does this rifle look... familiar to you?"
  go "这把猎枪……你看着眼熟吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4517
translate Chinese thief2_37a4650f:

  # sh "No. No, I don't think so."
  sh "不。不，我没见过。"

# game/script.rpy:4518
translate Chinese thief2_af537d01:

  # "The goose-girl rubbed her head."
  "牧鹅女揉了揉脑袋。"

# game/script.rpy:4519
translate Chinese thief2_961fb211:

  # go "No, you're right. I don't know what I was thinking. I've never seen it before."
  go "不，你是对的。我都不知道自己刚才在胡思乱想些什么。我以前从没见过它。"

# game/script.rpy:4520
translate Chinese thief2_181732a6:

  # "None of you had ever seen it before."
  "你们谁也没见过它。"

# game/script.rpy:4521
translate Chinese thief2_a4e12de4:

  # "There were footprints on the ground leading to it. But no-one stood there except the three of you."
  "地上的脚印一直延伸到那里。但除了你们三个，并没有人站在那里。"

# game/script.rpy:4522
translate Chinese thief2_5dc2ef43:

  # "It was always just the three of you."
  "一直都只有你们三个。"

# game/script.rpy:4528
translate Chinese thief2_9e639149:

  # "You lapsed into an uneasy silence as you went back to watching the chest."
  "你们陷入了不安的沉默中，重新把目光投向箱子。"

# game/script.rpy:4529
translate Chinese thief2_8d4432eb:

  # "The silence stretched on for a long moment."
  "沉默持续了良久。"

# game/script.rpy:4530
translate Chinese thief2_d00d8ec7:

  # "The area around the house was still, and empty."
  "房子周围一片死寂，空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:4531
translate Chinese thief2_fcd0a8e6:

  # "The clouds slowly covered moved over the moon. Their shape was ragged and spiralling, like twisting entrails."
  "云层缓缓移动，遮住了月亮。它们的形状参差缠绕，像盘绕的内脏。"

# game/script.rpy:4532
translate Chinese thief2_eef7ef5d:

  # sh "I think we'd better check the traps. Make sure they're working."
  sh "我觉得我们最好检查一下陷阱。确保它们还能正常运作。"

# game/script.rpy:4538
translate Chinese thief2_3c57c042:

  # "The two of you slowly crawled up to the chest."
  "你们两个慢慢地爬向箱子。"

# game/script.rpy:4539
translate Chinese thief2_a2156b05:

  # sh "Maybe we should have brought more people along. It's a little spooky with just the two of us."
  sh "也许我们该多带点人来的。就我们俩，感觉有点阴森。"

# game/script.rpy:4540
translate Chinese thief2_358d2492:

  # pov "You're right. We should have thought of that."
  pov "你说得对。我们早该想到的。"

# game/script.rpy:4541
translate Chinese thief2_5f014789:

  # "You looked around, but no-one was there except the two of you."
  "你环顾四周，但除了你们两个，再没有别人。"

# game/script.rpy:4542
translate Chinese thief2_dce72663:

  # "It was always just the two of you."
  "一直都只有你们两个。"

# game/script.rpy:4544
translate Chinese thief2_2690fc2f:

  # "The Sparrow Herder looked over the traps."
  "牧雀人检查了一下陷阱。"

# game/script.rpy:4545
translate Chinese thief2_e3e97e8d:

  # sh "Yep, they're all still there."
  sh "嗯，它们都在。"

# game/script.rpy:4547
translate Chinese thief2_70dc0fb5:

  # pov "How long has this old house stood here?"
  pov "这座老房子在这里多久了？"

# game/script.rpy:4548
translate Chinese thief2_b9d389da:

  # "The abandoned cottage loomed over you."
  "那座废弃的小屋在你们面前阴森地耸立着。"

# game/script.rpy:4549
translate Chinese thief2_134c8bb3:

  # "The lights were on, but it was silent and empty."
  "灯是亮着的，但里面死寂而空旷。"

# game/script.rpy:4550
translate Chinese thief2_71b5c65a:

  # sh "No idea."
  sh "不知道。"

# game/script.rpy:4551
translate Chinese thief2_4b9240c7:

  # sh "Not sure who owns it. Must have been before my time."
  sh "不确定是谁的。肯定在我出生前就有了。"

# game/script.rpy:4552
translate Chinese thief2_f29828c2:

  # "Who could say how long it had lain deserted?"
  "谁说得准它荒废多久了？"

# game/script.rpy:4553
translate Chinese thief2_9a46459a:

  # "You saw some stray goosefeathers lying in the dirt. Nothing beside remained."
  "你看到泥土里散落着一些零星的鹅毛。此外空无一物。"

# game/script.rpy:4554
translate Chinese thief2_4c878ed7:

  # sh "I-I think this might have been a mistake."
  sh "我——我觉得我们不该来的。"

# game/script.rpy:4555
translate Chinese thief2_bfd999c3:

  # sh "Let's head back to the village. Come on."
  sh "我们回村子去吧。走吧。"

# game/script.rpy:4560
translate Chinese thief2_4721173a:

  # "The trees shivered in the wind. In the distance, you heard a noise."
  "树木在风中战栗。在远处，你听到了一阵声响。"

# game/script.rpy:4561
translate Chinese thief2_626020ff:

  # "Almost like howling."
  "听起来像是在嚎叫。"

# game/script.rpy:4565
translate Chinese thief2_9b6f85ef:

  # "You and your pig stood alone in the empty clearing."
  "你和你的小猪孤零零地站在寂寥的林中空地上。"

# game/script.rpy:4567
translate Chinese thief2_df41aef7:

  # "You stood alone in the empty clearing."
  "你独自站在寂寥的林中空地上。"

# game/script.rpy:4568
translate Chinese thief2_bbae34d5:

  # "It had always been just you."
  "一直都只有你。"

# game/script.rpy:4569
translate Chinese thief2_4e086cab:

  # "No-one stood beside you. The clouds were over the moon. The wind bit into you with cold certainty."
  "身旁空无一人。乌云蔽月。寒风刺骨，让你心中涌起一阵冰冷而不容置疑的绝望。"

# game/script.rpy:4570
translate Chinese thief2_bfe19417:

  # "You felt something grab your hand."
  "你感觉有什么抓住了你的手。"

# game/script.rpy:4571
translate Chinese thief2_6ac9a701:

  # t "Run."
  t "快跑。"

# game/script.rpy:4575
translate Chinese thief2_bb65a194:

  # "The thief wrenched your arm and ran with you, away from the abandoned cottage and into the forest."
  "小偷猛拉你的手臂，拉着你夺路而逃，离开了那座废弃的小屋，跑进了森林。"

# game/script.rpy:4577
translate Chinese thief2_99ec806d:

  # "Your pig ran after you but was soon lost to sight in the darkness."
  "你的小猪在后面追赶，但很快就消失在幽暗中。"

# game/script.rpy:4578
translate Chinese thief2_43d8b018:

  # "You ran over hill and dale, through the shrubs and thorns and tangled thickets, twisting this way and that."
  "你们翻山越岭，穿梭于矮树丛、荆棘与错综的藤蔓间，一路左冲右突。"

# game/script.rpy:4579
translate Chinese thief2_e3127740:

  # "The thief ran like a wild thing, like they were being pursued. They held tight to your hand the whole way, and you heard their mad laughter in the darkness as the trees writhed around you like tormented spirits."
  "小偷跑得像头野兽，仿佛身后有追兵一般，那只手一路上紧紧抓着你的手，在黑暗中你能听到小偷那疯狂的笑声，树木如备受折磨的幽灵，在你四周痛苦地扭动。"

# game/script.rpy:4580
translate Chinese thief2_04bf6c52:

  # "They took a whistle from their pocket and blew on it, making a harsh, shrill whine echo through the forest."
  "小偷从口袋里掏出一个哨子吹响，一阵刺耳尖锐的哨声在森林中回荡。"

# game/script.rpy:4581
translate Chinese thief2_47fb86d4:

  # "At first there was silence."
  "起初是一片死寂。"

# game/script.rpy:4582
translate Chinese thief2_9f2db760:

  # "Then, you heard an answering whistle, deep and loud enough to deafen you."
  "紧接着，你听到了一声回应的哨音，低沉浑厚，震耳欲聋。"

# game/script.rpy:4583
translate Chinese thief2_8b2a9e32:

  # "A brilliant light shone through the space between the trees. There was the sound of thundering wheels."
  "一道刺目的强光穿透林木幽隙。一阵如雷鸣般的车轮声滚滚而来。"

# game/script.rpy:4587
translate Chinese thief2_0ae9bcd0:

  # ""
  ""

# game/script.rpy:4591
translate Chinese thief2_53e95615:

  # "A train crashed through the bush, twisting and bending in impossible ways to fit between the trees."
  "一列火车冲破灌木丛，车身以不可思议的姿态扭曲弯折，硬生生从树木间挤了过来。"

# game/script.rpy:4592
translate Chinese thief2_c1927455:

  # "It was swarming with wild and chaotic shapes of all manner of monsters, and you could see a team of things holding onto the front and laying tracks in front of the train as fast as they could as it swerved through the forest."
  "火车上挤满了形形色色的怪物，狂乱混沌。你能看到一群东西攀在车头，趁着火车穿梭于森林之间，以极快的速度在车前铺设铁轨。"

# game/script.rpy:4593
translate Chinese thief2_7a60b370:

  # t "Grab on!"
  t "抓紧！"

# game/script.rpy:4596
translate Chinese thief2_83e06a24:

  # "The thief pushed you up to grab onto the side of the carriage, then you reached down and pulled them up beside you."
  "小偷把你推上去，让你扒住车厢外侧，随后你探下身，把小偷拉到你身旁。"

# game/script.rpy:4597
translate Chinese thief2_89dfa693:

  # "The train whistled with full force, gathering speed until it burst out of the trees and into a wide open field."
  "火车汽笛长鸣，不断加速，直到冲出树林，驶入一片开阔的原野。"

# game/script.rpy:4601
translate Chinese thief2_daa06a22:

  # "You lay there in silence, watching the chest."
  "你静静地趴在那里，注视着那个箱子。"

# game/script.rpy:4602
translate Chinese thief2_318c7f99:

  # "A fly landed on it."
  "一只苍蝇落在了上面。"

# game/script.rpy:4603
translate Chinese thief2_8d61438d:

  # "One of the geese waddled up and began to lick it."
  "其中一只鹅摇摇晃晃地走上前，开始舔那个箱子。"

# game/script.rpy:4604
translate Chinese thief2_00e879a8:

  # go "Wait just one moment..."
  go "等一下……"

# game/script.rpy:4605
translate Chinese thief2_07fe002d:

  # "The goose-girl crawled out and cautiously dragged a finger over the chest, then stuck it in her mouth."
  "牧鹅女爬了出去，小心翼翼地用手指在箱子上刮了一下，然后把手指含进嘴里。"

# game/script.rpy:4606
translate Chinese thief2_72f90653:

  # go "It's... icing!"
  go "这是……糖霜！"

# game/script.rpy:4607
translate Chinese thief2_bbcebfce:

  # "The entire chest had been replaced with a massive cake, baked to look exactly like the chest in every detail."
  "整个箱子都被调包成了一个巨大的蛋糕，烤得和箱子一模一样，每个细节都极其逼真。"

# game/script.rpy:4609
translate Chinese thief2_b48baa89:

  # "You tested the traps to find that they were now all made out of carefully crafted fondant."
  "你检查了陷阱，发现它们现在全变成了精心制作的翻糖。"

# game/script.rpy:4611
translate Chinese thief2_47dd1289:

  # "You pulled at the tripwires to discover that every can was now a perfect cake replica of a tin can made from sponge and fondant."
  "你拉动绊线，发现每个锡罐现在都变成了由海绵蛋糕和翻糖完美复刻的锡罐蛋糕。"

# game/script.rpy:4613
translate Chinese thief2_f9eb6a8a:

  # "You cut open the cake to find a fine meringue goose inside."
  "你切开蛋糕，发现里面是一只精致的蛋白酥做的鹅。"

# game/script.rpy:4614
translate Chinese thief2_95855076:

  # "The smell of chocolate wafted from behind you. You turned in slow horror, realisation already dawning."
  "一股巧克力的香味从你身后飘来。你惊恐地缓缓回头，心中恍然大悟，惊出一身冷汗。"

# game/script.rpy:4622
translate Chinese thiefCake_5880d1fa:

  # go "{i}NoOOoOOOOOOOOOOoooOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOoOOOOOOOOOoOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOoOOOOoOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOooOOOOOOOOOoooOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOoooOOOOOOOoooOOOOOO OOOOoOOOooOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!{/i}"
  go "{i}不——————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————！{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:4629
translate Chinese thiefCake_3d02b155:

  # sh "{i}NOOOooooOOOOoOOOOOOOOOOoOOOOO OOOOOOoOOOOOOOOOOOooOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOooOOOOOOOoOOOOOOooOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOoOOOoOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOoOOOOOoOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOoOOoOOOOOOOooOOO OOoOOOOOOOOOOOOOOoOOOOoOOOOOO!{/i}"
  sh "{i}不——————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————！{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:4636
translate Chinese thiefCake_58951182:

  # h "{i}NooOOOOOOOOOOOOoOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOoooOOOoOOOOOOOOO OOOOoOOOOoOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOoOOOOOOOooOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOoOOOOOOOOOoOOOOOOOO OOoooOOOOOoOOOOOOOOOOOOoOOOOO OOOOOOOoOOOOOoOoOOOOOOOOoOOOO!{/i}"
  h "{i}不—————————————————————— ———————————————————————— ———————————————————————— ————————————————————！{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:4643
translate Chinese thiefCake_cf13883a:

  # pov "{i}NOooOOOOoOOoOOOOOOOoOOOOOOOOOO OOOooOOOOooOOOOOOOOoOOOOOOOOO OOOOOoOOOOooOOOOOOooOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOoOOOO OOOOOOOOOOooOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOoOOOOOOoOOOOOOOooOOO OOOOOOOoOOOOOOOoOOOOOOOOOOOOO!{/i}"
  pov "{i}不——————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————！{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:4650
translate Chinese thiefCake_9e943dd4:

  # "The geese honked with glee and began devouring the gingerbread cottage."
  "鹅群兴奋地嘎嘎叫着，开始吞食那座姜饼做成的小屋。"

# game/script.rpy:4656
translate Chinese thiefCake_39ab5e1f:

  # "The pig leapt from your hands and began snuffling around in the grass. It soon began sniffing at the Echidna, grunting with suspicion."
  "小猪从你手中跳下，开始在草地里乱嗅。很快，它开始围着那只针鼹嗅来嗅去，狐疑地直哼哼。"

# game/script.rpy:4657
translate Chinese thiefCake_f41f1995:

  # echidna2 "Looks like the jig is up!"
  echidna2 "看来露馅了！"

# game/script.rpy:4658
translate Chinese thiefCake_35bb3a46:

  # "You leapt for the Echidna, but it backflipped away just in time."
  "你朝针鼹扑去，但它一个后空翻刚好躲开。"

# game/script.rpy:4659
translate Chinese thiefCake_7acf6976:

  # "Laughing maniacally, it ripped off its mask to reveal none other than the Master Thief."
  "它发出癫狂的笑声，扯下面具，露出的真面目不是别人，正是神偷。"

# game/script.rpy:4660
translate Chinese thiefCake_b6f52605:

  # t "That's right, it was I all along! I have stolen the eyes of Heaven and the hands of G-d, and now I use those eyes and hands to wreak mischief upon this cursed earth!"
  t "没错，一直都是我！我偷走了天堂之眼和上帝之手，现在我要用这眼和手，在这片受诅咒的大地上肆意作恶！"

# game/script.rpy:4661
translate Chinese thiefCake_48499982:

  # h "Stop them!"
  h "抓住小偷！"

# game/script.rpy:4662
translate Chinese thiefCake_014c0169:

  # "The thief fled into the forest, with you and the loyal pig sprinting after."
  "小偷逃进了森林，你和忠诚的小猪在后面紧追不舍。"

# game/script.rpy:4665
translate Chinese thiefCake_e19455f5:

  # "You grabbed a slice of the chest cake to present to the local magistrate."
  "你抓起一块箱子蛋糕，准备拿去呈给当地的地方法官。"

# game/script.rpy:4666
translate Chinese thiefCake_4e7d5803:

  # "The goose hissed at your foolishness, then continued devouring the chest."
  "那只鹅对你这副蠢样发出轻蔑的嘶嘶声，随后继续大口吞食箱子。"

# game/script.rpy:4670
translate Chinese thiefCake_66acd049:

  # "You looked around wildly."
  "你惊慌失措地环顾四周。"

# game/script.rpy:4671
translate Chinese thiefCake_10a2892c:

  # echidna2 "What a shame. Oh well! I'd best be off."
  echidna2 "真可惜。罢了！我最好还是开溜吧。"

# game/script.rpy:4672
translate Chinese thiefCake_a235377a:

  # pov "Wait just a second!"
  pov "等一下！"

# game/script.rpy:4673
translate Chinese thiefCake_35bb3a46_1:

  # "You leapt for the Echidna, but it backflipped away just in time."
  "你朝针鼹扑去，但它一个后空翻刚好躲开。"

# game/script.rpy:4674
translate Chinese thiefCake_7acf6976_1:

  # "Laughing maniacally, it ripped off its mask to reveal none other than the Master Thief."
  "它发出癫狂的笑声，扯下面具，露出的真面目不是别人，正是神偷。"

# game/script.rpy:4675
translate Chinese thiefCake_a909764d:

  # t "That's right, it was I all along! I have stolen the eyes of Heaven and the hands of G-d, and now I use those eyes and these hands to wreak mischief and misery upon this cursed earth!"
  t "没错，一直都是我！我偷走了天堂之眼和上帝之手，现在我要用这眼和手，在这个受诅咒的世界上制造祸患和苦难！"

# game/script.rpy:4676
translate Chinese thiefCake_48499982_1:

  # h "Stop them!"
  h "抓住小偷！"

# game/script.rpy:4677
translate Chinese thiefCake_bd362d8e:

  # "The thief fled into the forest."
  "小偷逃进了森林。"

# game/script.rpy:4688
translate Chinese thiefChase2_3ab599a0:

  # "The thief led you on a merry chase, until you were deep into the forest with all the others behind you."
  "小偷带着你一通好追，直到你深入森林，把其他人远远甩在身后。"

# game/script.rpy:4689
translate Chinese thiefChase2_0826f66c:

  # "You slowly closed the distance, until you finally leapt forward and grabbed their cloak."
  "你慢慢拉近距离，直到最后纵身一跃，抓住了小偷的斗篷。"

# game/script.rpy:4693
translate Chinese thiefChase2_db11b73b:

  # "You ran deep into the forest, planning to lay an ambush for the thief. Soon, you left the others far behind."
  "你跑进森林深处，打算给小偷设个埋伏。很快，你就把其他人远远甩在了身后。"

# game/script.rpy:4694
translate Chinese thiefChase2_dd7dd318:

  # "You lay in wait behind a bush until you heard their running footsteps. Then you leapt out and grabbed them."
  "你埋伏在灌木丛后，直到听见小偷奔跑的脚步声。然后你跳出来，一把抓住了小偷。"

# game/script.rpy:4696
translate Chinese thiefChase2_e762de05:

  # "The pig chased after them furiously, grunting pig curses at the fleeing figure."
  "小猪在其身后发疯似地追赶，对着那个逃跑的身影哼哼唧唧，用猪言猪语破口大骂。"

# game/script.rpy:4699
translate Chinese thiefChase2_7d133778:

  # "You hid behind the bushes and lay in wait until you heard the thief's footsteps. Then you leapt out and grabbed them as your pig squealed in triumph."
  "你躲在灌木丛后埋伏，直到听见小偷的脚步声。就在你一跃而出、将其擒住的瞬间，你的小猪也发出了胜利的尖叫。"

# game/script.rpy:4701
translate Chinese thiefChase2_f5d3e6dd:

  # "Their cloak came away with a tearing sound, and the figure before you fell apart into dust."
  "伴随着一声撕裂的声响，斗篷被扯了下来，面前的身影顿时散架，化作枯叶与尘土。"

# game/script.rpy:4702
translate Chinese thiefChase2_631693ea:

  # "It was nothing more than a pile of dead leaves and mud, carefully posed to look like the Master Thief using a cunning series of pulleys and wires."
  "那不过是一堆枯叶和泥巴，借助一系列精巧的滑轮与暗线，被精心摆弄成神偷的模样。"

# game/script.rpy:4703
translate Chinese thiefChase2_8ce812b1:

  # "A slow clap echoed behind you."
  "你身后传来一阵迟缓的掌声。"

# game/script.rpy:4704
translate Chinese thiefChase2_3b7eb834:

  # t "Well done, friend."
  t "干得好，朋友。"

# game/script.rpy:4706
translate Chinese thiefChase2_14ef7584:

  # "The ornery goose you hid in the chest was now perched on their right shoulder, wearing a thief's mask and honking smugly."
  "你藏在箱子里的那只暴躁的鹅，现在立于其右肩上，戴着小偷的面具，得意洋洋地嘎嘎叫着。"

# game/script.rpy:4708
translate Chinese thiefChase2_59919e08:

  # "They casually munched on a frosted bear trap."
  "小偷正漫不经心地嚼着一个挂着糖霜的捕熊夹。"

# game/script.rpy:4710
translate Chinese thiefChase2_3b47ec29:

  # "They tossed you a small cake in the shape of a tin can."
  "小偷向你抛来一个小小的锡罐形状的蛋糕。"

# game/script.rpy:4711
translate Chinese thiefChase2_d81a4b21:

  # "The thief's long, thin fingers toyed with some of the shiny rocks from the chest."
  "小偷细长的手指正把玩着箱子里的一些闪亮石块。"

# game/script.rpy:4713
translate Chinese thiefChase2_8ef6c996:

  # "Your pig oinked at them, moving to protect you."
  "你的小猪对着小偷哼哼，凑过来保护你。"

# game/script.rpy:4715
translate Chinese thiefChase2_51ff9ab5:

  # pov "You! Give me back my stuff!"
  pov "你！把我的东西还给我！"

# game/script.rpy:4716
translate Chinese thiefChase2_dff2b508:

  # "They laughed. As if from nowhere, your loaf of bread appeared in their hands. They tossed it up in the air, and before you could blink it had disappeared again."
  "小偷笑了。就好像凭空出现一般，你的那条面包出现在小偷的手中。小偷把面包抛向空中，还没等你眨眼，面包又消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:4717
translate Chinese thiefChase2_c2e3f675:

  # t "I'll give it all back in time, don't worry. But first, I have an offer for you."
  t "别担心，到时候我会全都还给你的。但首先，我有个提议。"

# game/script.rpy:4719
translate Chinese thiefChase2_0a3d73d8:

  # t "You gave me quite the chase. I have an offer you may be interested in."
  t "你可真能追啊。我有个提议，你也许会感兴趣。"

# game/script.rpy:4721
translate Chinese thiefChase2_65575a59:

  # t "You see, I've heard of you. They say you run wild over the hills, doing as you please and living in contempt of the law."
  t "你看，我听说过你。大家都说你在山野间狂奔，为所欲为，蔑视法纪。"

# game/script.rpy:4723
translate Chinese thiefChase2_5b1a19c0:

  # t "You see, I've heard of you. They say you're a good little Christian, and you always do as you're told."
  t "你看，我听说过你。大家都说你是个乖巧的小基督徒，总是言听计从。"

# game/script.rpy:4724
translate Chinese thiefChase2_45e02a38:

  # t "Why not change that?"
  t "为什么不改变一下呢？"

# game/script.rpy:4726
translate Chinese thiefChase2_f3b0bb7f:

  # t "You see, I've heard of you. They say you're a strange one. You lurk out late at night and scare people."
  t "说起来，我听说过你。大家都说你是个怪胎，总在深夜跑出来游荡吓人。"

# game/script.rpy:4727
translate Chinese thiefChase2_ea3d1225:

  # t "I know you live near the Mushroom, who has riches nearing those of the King of Kings."
  t "我知道你住在那个蘑菇附近，她的财富简直比得上万王之王。"

# game/script.rpy:4728
translate Chinese thiefChase2_32f07605:

  # t "I plan to go there tonight and take her for all she's worth. Want to join? We could split the profits in a fair share."
  t "我打算今晚去那里，把她洗劫一空。想入伙吗？我们可以平分收益。"

# game/script.rpy:4730
translate Chinese thiefChase2_1095a48c:

  # t "I'll give you back everything I stole into the bargain. Promise."
  t "作为添头，我会把我偷你的所有东西都还给你。我保证。"

# game/script.rpy:4738
translate Chinese thiefConvo_0ba00012:

  # pov "But isn't that wrong and evil?"
  pov "但这难道不是又错又邪恶吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4739
translate Chinese thiefConvo_c7ba7692:

  # t "Of course!"
  t "当然！"

# game/script.rpy:4740
translate Chinese thiefConvo_f500332c:

  # t "I was born evil, and I've only gotten more evil every day I'm alive."
  t "我生来邪恶，而且只要我活着一天，我就会变得更加邪恶。"

# game/script.rpy:4741
translate Chinese thiefConvo_19b77d74:

  # t "But don't worry, the Mushroom cares nothing for money. It'll get much better use in our pockets."
  t "不过别担心，蘑菇根本不在乎钱。钱进了我们的口袋，才能发挥出更大的作用。"

# game/script.rpy:4745
translate Chinese thiefConvo_583c021b:

  # t "Wonderful! This will be a caper for the books."
  t "太棒了！这绝对会是一场足以载入史册的盗窃。"

# game/script.rpy:4746
translate Chinese thiefConvo_76eba48f:

  # t "You'd best be careful, though. I'm rotten to the core, and I'm sure to betray you sooner or later."
  t "不过你最好小心点。我已经烂到了骨子里，早晚肯定会背叛你的。"

# game/script.rpy:4749
translate Chinese thiefConvo_583c021b_1:

  # t "Wonderful! This will be a caper for the books."
  t "太棒了！这绝对会是一场足以载入史册的盗窃。"

# game/script.rpy:4750
translate Chinese thiefConvo_76eba48f_1:

  # t "You'd best be careful, though. I'm rotten to the core, and I'm sure to betray you sooner or later."
  t "不过你最好小心点。我已经烂到了骨子里，早晚肯定会背叛你的。"

# game/script.rpy:4753
translate Chinese thiefConvo_a4e14029:

  # t "Aha, I knew you'd see things my - wait, what did you say?"
  t "啊哈，我就知道你会同意我的——等等，你说什么？"

# game/script.rpy:4756
translate Chinese thiefConvo_ef053b50:

  # "Before they could react, you slipped away from them and ran away into the woods, heading for the Mushroom's house."
  "还没等他反应过来，你就从他身边溜走，跑进了树林，直奔蘑菇的房子。"

# game/script.rpy:4759
translate Chinese thiefConvo_65319140:

  # "Soon you stood knocking at the Mushroom's door, panting for breath and covered in scrapes from the journey."
  "很快，你就敲响了蘑菇的大门。你气喘吁吁，浑身上下都是路上弄出来的擦伤。"

# game/script.rpy:4765
translate Chinese thief3_f990fe5f:

  # "The thief strode ahead on their long, long legs, and you had to run to keep up. Their nimble fingers were constantly moving, grabbing leaves off the trees or small rocks from the ground to fiddle with, and they couldn't seem to keep a single part of their body still for even a second."
  "小偷迈着奇长的双腿大步走在前面，你不得不小跑着才能跟上。那灵活的手指一刻不停地动着，要么从树上摘叶子，要么从地上捡小石子把玩，全身上下似乎连一秒钟都静不下来。"

# game/script.rpy:4767
translate Chinese thief3_75ae810c:

  # "Your pig trotted along beside you."
  "你的小猪跟在你身边小跑着。"

# game/script.rpy:4770
translate Chinese thief3_76078d80:

  # "The night grew dark."
  "夜色渐深。"

# game/script.rpy:4773
translate Chinese thief3_e0d0948d:

  # "You passed a river."
  "你们渡过了一条河。"

# game/script.rpy:4776
translate Chinese thief3_f5b58f86:

  # "You passed a rocky coast."
  "你们经过了一片多岩石的海岸。"

# game/script.rpy:4779
translate Chinese thief3_13793d98:

  # "You passed the ruins of the sixth age, a grim reminder of the inevitable destruction fast approaching your world."
  "你们经过了第六纪元的废墟，这阴森冷酷的遗迹昭示着，不可避免的毁灭正迅速逼近你们的世界。"

# game/script.rpy:4782
translate Chinese thief3_572da223:

  # "You passed a tree."
  "你们经过了一棵树。"

# game/script.rpy:4783
translate Chinese thief3_02217a1f:

  # t "So, tell me about yourself. Got a family? A pet? Likes, dislikes, hobbies, dreams, nightmares? If you were stranded on a desert island, which limb would you gnaw off first?"
  t "那么，跟我说说你自己吧。家人？宠物？喜好？厌恶？兴趣？梦想？还是……梦魇？如果你被困在荒岛上，你会先啃断自己哪条肢体？"

# game/script.rpy:4792
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_ce0066d1:

  # t " " nointeract
  t " " nointeract

# game/script.rpy:4797
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_5cf110f5:

  # pov "I have a family. Twelve brothers and sisters. No mother anymore, though. She was driven into the grave by my wicked ways."
  pov "我有家人。十二个兄弟姐妹。不过母亲已经不在了。她是被我的邪恶行径气死的。"

# game/script.rpy:4799
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_e5f129e2:

  # pov "I have a family. Ten brothers and sisters. No mother anymore, though. She was driven into the grave by my wicked ways."
  pov "我有家人。十个兄弟姐妹。不过母亲已经不在了。她是被我的邪恶行径气死的。"

# game/script.rpy:4801
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_1dca2947:

  # pov "I have a family. Four brothers and sisters. No mother anymore, though. She was driven into the grave by my wicked ways."
  pov "我有家人。四个兄弟姐妹。不过母亲已经不在了。她是被我的邪恶行径气死的。"

# game/script.rpy:4802
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_6ba16039:

  # t "My condolences and/or congratulations!"
  t "不知该说是节哀顺变，还是可喜可贺！"

# game/script.rpy:4805
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_7a658778:

  # pov "I have a family. Twelve brothers and sisters."
  pov "我有家人。十二个兄弟姐妹。"

# game/script.rpy:4807
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_c94cc5a9:

  # pov "I have a family. Ten brothers and sisters."
  pov "我有家人。十个兄弟姐妹。"

# game/script.rpy:4809
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_d34aba63:

  # pov "I have a family. Four brothers and sisters."
  pov "我有家人。四个兄弟姐妹。"

# game/script.rpy:4810
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_16227ff6:

  # t "How prolific your mother is! It must be hard to get a word in edgewise."
  t "你母亲可真能生啊！家里那么多张嘴，想插句话恐怕都不容易。"

# game/script.rpy:4811
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_4ea8744e:

  # t "I have no family, of course. One day a horned toad sat on a magpie egg and I popped out fully formed."
  t "我自然是没有家人的。某天，一只角蟾卧在一枚喜鹊蛋上，我就这么蹦了出来，落地便已长成。"

# game/script.rpy:4812
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_ae9218af:

  # t "I stole my first breath of air, then I stole these hands and these legs and this body of mine, and I've been stealing ever since."
  t "我偷来了第一口呼吸，接着又偷了这双手、这双腿，还有这副躯壳。自那以后，我便一直在偷。"

# game/script.rpy:4818
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_da1ccc18:

  # pov "Well, because of you I have this pet pig now."
  pov "这下倒好，拜你所赐，我现在多了这么头宠物猪。"

# game/script.rpy:4819
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_24ac0121:

  # "The pig leapt into your arms and oinked at the thief with righteous malice."
  "小猪蹿进你的怀里，冲着小偷直哼哼，满怀理直气壮的敌意。"

# game/script.rpy:4820
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_7afb643f:

  # t "Gregory! You would abandon me, after all the schemes we've pulled together?"
  t "格雷戈里！我们一起干了那么多票，你竟然忍心就这么抛下我？"

# game/script.rpy:4821
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_ace214b0:

  # p1 "Oink."
  p1 "哼。"

# game/script.rpy:4822
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_071b79d8:

  # t "Oh, I can't stay mad at you, you silver-tongued devil. Come here."
  t "唉，我真是生不了你的气，你这花言巧语的小魔星。过来吧。"

# game/script.rpy:4823
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_b5edef6d:

  # "The thief patted the pig's head while it grunted cheerfully."
  "小偷拍了拍猪脑袋，小猪高兴地哼唧起来。"

# game/script.rpy:4828
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_bcbea57d:

  # pov "No pets. I'd love to have one someday, though."
  pov "没有宠物。不过我希望有一天能养一只。"

# game/script.rpy:4829
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_fd83389d:

  # t "Do what I do. Talk with the magpies, and the rats, and the possums on the roof. You'll never be lonely again."
  t "学学我吧。去和喜鹊说话，和老鼠说话，和屋顶上的负鼠说话，你就再也不会觉得孤单了。"

# game/script.rpy:4830
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_bf24011d:

  # "They tossed up a hunk of bread, and a kookaburra swooped down and grabbed it out of the air."
  "小偷抛起一大块面包，一只笑翠鸟俯冲下来，在半空中把它叼走了。"

# game/script.rpy:4835
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_7d8786a0:

  # pov "Well, I like reading."
  pov "嗯，我挺喜欢看书的。"

# game/script.rpy:4836
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_f006d48a:

  # t "Interesting. I never learned."
  t "有意思。我没学过认字。"

# game/script.rpy:4837
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_47015250:

  # t "Too busy, you know. Schemes and such."
  t "太忙了，你懂的。搞搞阴谋诡计什么的。"

# game/script.rpy:4838
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_7b2df0b9:

  # pov "Well, I can recommend it."
  pov "嗯，我挺推荐你试试的。"

# game/script.rpy:4839
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_8d8dc989:

  # t "Perhaps I'll try it, if I can find the time."
  t "如果能抽出时间，也许我会试试。"

# game/script.rpy:4843
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_cead46b7:

  # pov "I dreamt I had a dad, once. That was nice."
  pov "我曾经梦见自己有个爸爸。感觉还挺好的。"

# game/script.rpy:4844
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_614ce95d:

  # t "Interesting. I dreamt the same thing."
  t "有意思。我做过同样的梦。"

# game/script.rpy:4845
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_d27c9710:

  # t "More of a nightmare, really."
  t "其实更像是一场噩梦。"

# game/script.rpy:4850
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_fe528501:

  # pov "I've had this dream many times. I find myself in the middle of the forest. There is a crowd around me, but I know someone is missing."
  pov "我做过好多次这个梦。我发现自己站在森林中央。周围全是人，但我知道，缺了某个人。"

# game/script.rpy:4851
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_1b409eae:

  # pov "I look down, and I realise I have no hands. Then I look down, and realise I have no feet."
  pov "我低头一看，发现自己没有手。视线再往下移，发现自己没有脚。"

# game/script.rpy:4852
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_0d68516c:

  # pov "I always know what will happen next. I will look up, into the space between the trees. Into the spiral. I am terrified, but I can't stop myself from doing it."
  pov "我总是知道接下来会发生什么。我会抬起头，望向林木幽隙。望向那个螺旋。我恐惧万分，却又控制不住自己去看。"

# game/script.rpy:4854
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_89a27129:

  # pov "I know I will see something there. Waiting for me. In the dream, I know what it is. I know what will happen when I see it."
  pov "我知道我会在那里看到什么。有个东西在等我。在梦里，我知道那是什么，更知道看到它之后会发生什么。"

# game/script.rpy:4855
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_558c674a:

  # pov "I look up."
  pov "我抬起头。"

# game/script.rpy:4856
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_ea372f89:

  # pov "I wake up screaming. I never remember what I saw there. Until I have the dream again."
  pov "我总在尖叫中惊醒，永远记不起自己在那里究竟看到了什么——直到这个梦境再次降临。"

# game/script.rpy:4857
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_11262a1a:

  # "There was a long pause."
  "漫长的沉默。"

# game/script.rpy:4858
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_ee41ca95:

  # t "Well!"
  t "好啦！"

# game/script.rpy:4859
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_a6ce3a56:

  # t "Once I had a nightmare I was chased by clowns."
  t "我曾经做过一个被小丑追杀的噩梦。"

# game/script.rpy:4865
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_36d8684b:

  # pov "I think I would gnaw off an arm first."
  pov "我觉得我会先啃掉一条胳膊。"

# game/script.rpy:4866
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_11320949:

  # t "What? No, I could never. You need that arm for survival!"
  t "什么？不，我绝对下不去口。你得靠那条胳膊活命啊！"

# game/script.rpy:4867
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_e73cd59e:

  # "They flexed their long, slender fingers."
  "小偷活动了一下修长纤细的手指。"

# game/script.rpy:4868
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_050e26d0:

  # t "This is my money-maker. If I lose it, I'm finished."
  t "这可是我吃饭的家伙。要是没手了，我就完蛋了。"

# game/script.rpy:4872
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_21796c93:

  # t "Wait - where are you going?"
  t "等等——你去哪儿？"

# game/script.rpy:4873
translate Chinese thiefConvo3_03a8da9c:

  # "Their voice faded behind you as you walked away into the darkness."
  "你步入黑暗，小偷的声音在身后渐渐远去。"

# game/script.rpy:4881
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_5e4feaad:

  # t "Watch this!"
  t "看好了！"

# game/script.rpy:4882
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_791a5137:

  # "They caught hold of a tree bough and spun around on it, then leapt off and landed on one foot on a nearby branch, balancing precariously."
  "小偷抓住一根枝干转了一圈，顺势跃出，单脚落在附近的一根树枝上，摇摇晃晃地保持着平衡。"

# game/script.rpy:4887
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_75f0dd3f:

  # t "Eh? Eh?" nointeract
  t "怎么样？厉害吧？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:4889
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_bc1329df:

  # t "Thank you, thank you!"
  t "谢谢，谢谢大家！"

# game/script.rpy:4890
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_b5f1225a:

  # "They bowed, blew you a kiss, then drew roses out of the cuffs of their coat and tossed them out to an imaginary audience. Then they leapt down."
  "小偷鞠了一躬，朝你抛了个飞吻，然后从外套袖口里抽出几朵玫瑰，抛给想象中的观众。接着跳了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:4891
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_20323ed0:

  # t "Anyway, enough of my talents for now. We're here!"
  t "好了，身手就先卖弄到这儿。我们到了！"

# game/script.rpy:4893
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_e7906db8:

  # t "The goblins taught me."
  t "哥布林教我的。"

# game/script.rpy:4894
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_978ec80a:

  # "They leapt off the branch and landed with perfect poise, posing dramatically."
  "小偷从树枝上跃下，稳稳落地，摆出了一个极其浮夸的姿势。"

# game/script.rpy:4895
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_20323ed0_1:

  # t "Anyway, enough of my talents for now. We're here!"
  t "好了，身手就先卖弄到这儿。我们到了！"

# game/script.rpy:4897
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_bae7293a:

  # t "What? Come on, that was great!"
  t "什么嘛？拜托，刚才那下明明很精彩！"

# game/script.rpy:4898
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_069e9715:

  # "The thief sprang from the branch, performed a triple backflip and then landed on their hands. They looked at you expectantly, panting."
  "小偷从树枝上纵身跃起，在空中连续做了三个后空翻，随后双手着地倒立稳住，气喘吁吁，满脸期待地看着你。"

# game/script.rpy:4903
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_4c77d693:

  # t "How about that!" nointeract
  t "这招怎么样！" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:4906
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_7303f100:

  # t "What the - you're crazy. Come on, you must be out of your mind, that was amazing. You just don't know talent when you see it."
  t "搞什么——你疯了吧。拜托，你肯定脑子进水了，刚才那招简直绝了。你就是有眼不识泰山。"

# game/script.rpy:4907
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_a0395a18:

  # "They got back to their feet and sulked for the rest of the journey."
  "小偷翻身落地，在剩下的路程里一直在生闷气。"

# game/script.rpy:4908
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_7f766016:

  # "Eventually, they brightened up as you approached your goal."
  "直到快接近目的地时，小偷的心情才终于好了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:4909
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_43f37e69:

  # t "Alright. Never mind all that, then. We're here!"
  t "好吧。那都不重要了。我们到了！"

# game/script.rpy:4911
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_0a242a58:

  # t "Hmph. Acceptable. Thank you."
  t "哼。勉勉强强吧。谢了。"

# game/script.rpy:4912
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_29419f15:

  # "They twisted over onto their feet."
  "小偷腰身一拧，双脚落地。"

# game/script.rpy:4913
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_20323ed0_2:

  # t "Anyway, enough of my talents for now. We're here!"
  t "好了，身手就先卖弄到这儿。我们到了！"

# game/script.rpy:4915
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_9011c378:

  # t "Thank you! Thank you!"
  t "谢谢！谢谢大家！"

# game/script.rpy:4916
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_99ef07fb:

  # t "Now this is the praise I deserve."
  t "这才是配得上我的赞美。"

# game/script.rpy:4917
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_29419f15_1:

  # "They twisted over onto their feet."
  "小偷腰身一拧，双脚落地。腰身一拧，双脚落地。"

# game/script.rpy:4918
translate Chinese thiefWatchThis_20323ed0_3:

  # t "Anyway, enough of my talents for now. We're here!"
  t "好了，身手就先卖弄到这儿。我们到了！"

# game/script.rpy:4923
translate Chinese thiefFig_4c0b22f6:

  # "The colossal roots of the Mushroom's strangler fig rose above you. The pig sniffed at them suspiciously."
  "蘑菇那棵绞杀榕的巨大板根在你们上方高高耸立。小猪狐疑地凑上去嗅了嗅。"

# game/script.rpy:4925
translate Chinese thiefFig_9791e92d:

  # "The colossal roots of the Mushroom's strangler fig rose above you."
  "蘑菇那棵绞杀榕的巨大板根在你们上方高高耸立。"

# game/script.rpy:4926
translate Chinese thiefFig_30708839:

  # t "Alright. Here's the job."
  t "听好了，这次的活是这样的。"

# game/script.rpy:4927
translate Chinese thiefFig_2486221c:

  # "They drew a floor plan in the dirt."
  "小偷在地上画了张平面图。"

# game/script.rpy:4928
translate Chinese thiefFig_12f6c988:

  # t "The treasure is in the central chamber, here. The front door can only be opened with a password."
  t "宝藏在中央洞室，就在这儿。正门要暗号才能打开。"

# game/script.rpy:4929
translate Chinese thiefFig_7edd04fa:

  # t "There's another entrance up through the canopy, guarded by banksia boys."
  t "往上穿过树冠还有另一个入口，由班克木帮的小喽啰们守着。"

# game/script.rpy:4930
translate Chinese thiefFig_16a1fab9:

  # t "Or we could try to get in here, through an underground river patrolled by an old crocodile."
  t "或者我们可以试着从这里进，穿过地下河，不过那里有一条老鳄鱼在巡逻。"

# game/script.rpy:4932
translate Chinese thiefFig_90be0d1c:

  # "They kept looking over your shoulder into the darkness beyond. You noticed bags under their eyes."
  "小偷的目光不时越过你的肩头，望向你身后的黑暗。你注意到小偷眼袋沉重，满脸疲态。"

# game/script.rpy:4937
translate Chinese thiefFig_2fec0988:

  # t "So what's the plan, chief?" nointeract
  t "那怎么安排，老大？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:4940
translate Chinese thiefFig_8dea54e8:

  # pov "I know the password. We can walk straight in the front door."
  pov "我知道暗号。我们直接从正门走进去就行。"

# game/script.rpy:4942
translate Chinese thiefFig_444a76b5:

  # pov "I saw the mushroom put in the password. We can walk straight in the front door."
  pov "我看到蘑菇输入过暗号。我们可以大摇大摆地从正门进去。"

# game/script.rpy:4943
translate Chinese thiefFig_8a31e83f:

  # t "You devil, you. Lead the way!"
  t "真有你的。带路吧！"

# game/script.rpy:4944
translate Chinese thiefFig_31d62045:

  # "You walked up to the fig and cut the vines and swamp flowers away to reveal the small blue door, inlaid with precious moonstone and intricate engravings."
  "你走到绞杀榕前，劈开藤蔓，扫除沼泽花朵，露出了一扇蓝色的小门，门上不仅镶嵌着珍贵的月光石，还刻有繁复的雕花。"

# game/script.rpy:4945
translate Chinese thiefFig_9c3cc80d:

  # pov "Gorge, guzzle, gulp and grab; never shall this wound scab."
  pov "狼吞、牛饮、虎咽、鹰攫；此伤此创，永不结痂。"

# game/script.rpy:4948
translate Chinese thiefFig_b3ddaea4:

  # t "Great idea. We'll draw you into a life of crime yet."
  t "好主意。我们迟早能把你彻底拉上贼船。"

# game/script.rpy:4952
translate Chinese thiefFig_7bb3486b:

  # "You climbed up through the canopy, holding your pig tight in your arms. Before you knew it, a gaggle of Banksia seeds dropped down all around you. Their many mouths gabbled at you in a crazed frenzy."
  "你抱着小猪，爬上树冠。还没等你回过神来，一群班克木种子就从天而降，把你团团围住。它们身上长满了嘴，发了疯似的冲你叽叽喳喳个不停。"

# game/script.rpy:4954
translate Chinese thiefFig_9164b8f4:

  # "You climbed up through the canopy. Before you knew it, a gaggle of Banksia seeds dropped down all around you. Their many mouths gabbled at you with wild abandon."
  "你爬上树冠。还没等你回过神来，一群班克木种子就从天而降，把你团团围住。它们身上长满了嘴，肆无忌惮地冲你叽叽喳喳个不停。"

# game/script.rpy:4955
translate Chinese thiefFig_d7e2fd75:

  # sc "That's right, it's me!"
  sc "没错，就是我！"

# game/script.rpy:4956
translate Chinese thiefFig_fe8b3bf7:

  # sc "Scraggs McKenzie, the baddest banksia in the bush."
  sc "斯克拉格斯·麦肯齐，这片灌木丛里最狠的班克木。"

# game/script.rpy:4957
translate Chinese thiefFig_f9c1a16f:

  # boys "You tell 'em, Scraggs! {vspace=30} {w=0.4} Yeah! {vspace=30} {w=0.8}You're the best, Scraggs!"
  boys "让他们长长见识，斯克拉格斯！{vspace=30}{w=0.4}没错！{vspace=30}{w=0.8}你是最棒的，斯克拉格斯！"

# game/script.rpy:4963
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_f164a725:

  # sc "I bet you weren't expecting to run into me and my boys." nointeract
  sc "我打赌你肯定没料到会撞见我和我的兄弟们。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:4965
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_432f7376:

  # t "Never heard of him."
  t "没听说过这号人物。"

# game/script.rpy:4966
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_a8523750:

  # sc "What! Everyone's heard of Scraggs McKenzie and the boys."
  sc "什么！所有人都听过斯克拉格斯·麦肯齐和他的兄弟们的名号。"

# game/script.rpy:4967
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_377ce9b9:

  # boys "You know it, Scraggs! {vspace=30} {w=0.4} Yeah! {vspace=30} {w=0.8}No-one messes with us!"
  boys "就是这么回事，斯克拉格斯！{vspace=30}{w=0.4}没错！{vspace=30}{w=0.8}没人敢惹我们！"

# game/script.rpy:4972
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_fdc74218:

  # sc "Why, they call us..."
  sc "听好了，他们都管咱们叫……"

# game/script.rpy:4973
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_0fb0f95f:

  # "Scraggs and company launched into a long, flashy musical number explaining their backstory, the details of which I won't bore you with here."
  "斯克拉格斯和他的小弟们开始了一段冗长又浮夸的歌舞表演，来讲述他们的背景故事，其中的细节我就不在这里烦你了。"

# game/script.rpy:4974
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_8e178f83:

  # boys "...we're just tryna survive, in a world of baa-aad seeeeeeeds!"
  boys "……我们只是为了在这个全是超~级~坏~种~的世界里，努力求生罢了！"

# game/script.rpy:4975
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_1f41d999:

  # sc "That's right!"
  sc "没错！"

# game/script.rpy:4976
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_4cee7c91:

  # "You and the thief clapped politely."
  "你和小偷礼貌地鼓了鼓掌。"

# game/script.rpy:4979
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_f85128ba:

  # sc "NO-ONE gets past Scraggs McKenzie."
  sc "没人能闯过斯克拉格斯·麦肯齐这关。"

# game/script.rpy:4980
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_3da9ca08:

  # sc "Not without answering one of my riddles first."
  sc "除非你先解开我的谜语。"

# game/script.rpy:4985
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_cdad1ffa:

  # sc "What walks on 4 legs in the morning, 2 legs at noon, and 3 legs in the evening?" nointeract
  sc "什么东西早晨用四条腿走路，中午用两条腿走路，晚上用三条腿走路？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:4987
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_bc189829:

  # sc "Ha Ha Ha! Wrong!"
  sc "哈哈哈！错！"

# game/script.rpy:4990
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_bc189829_1:

  # sc "Ha Ha Ha! Wrong!"
  sc "哈哈哈！错！"

# game/script.rpy:4993
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_bc189829_2:

  # sc "Ha Ha Ha! Wrong!"
  sc "哈哈哈！错！"

# game/script.rpy:4996
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_093ee08f:

  # sc "That's... that's correct. You may pass."
  sc "没错……没错。你可以过去了。"

# game/script.rpy:4997
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_2f031385:

  # boys "You'll get 'em next time, Scraggs. {vspace=30} {w=0.4} Don't worry about it. {vspace=30} {w=0.8} We still love you, Scraggs!"
  boys "下次你会难住他们的，斯克拉格斯。{vspace=30}{w=0.4}别放在心上。{vspace=30}{w=0.8}我们依然爱你，斯克拉格斯！"

# game/script.rpy:4998
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_a0449159:

  # sc "I know, boys. I know."
  sc "我知道，兄弟们。我知道。"

# game/script.rpy:4999
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_ba84646b:

  # sc "Alright, go on through. But if me or my boys see you around here again, you'll be in serious trouble."
  sc "好吧，过去吧。但如果我和我的兄弟们再在这附近看见你，你可就有大麻烦了。"

# game/script.rpy:5000
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_9766a1c6:

  # "You walked down past the banksias, and found a little yellow door in the tree."
  "你越过那些班克木，在树干上找到了一扇黄色的小门。"

# game/script.rpy:5001
translate Chinese scraggsConvo_ed0ff2aa:

  # "You pulled it open and peered down inside."
  "你拉开它，探头朝下方望去。"

# game/script.rpy:5004
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_bac78671:

  # sc "You're in serious trouble now. Me and my boys are going to make you think twice before you step in this neck of the woods again."
  sc "你现在有大麻烦了。我和我的兄弟们会让你在下次踏进咱们这片林子前，好好掂量掂量。"

# game/script.rpy:5005
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_819a1561:

  # boys "That's right, Scraggs. {vspace=30} {w=0.4} You've got it handled! {vspace=30} {w=0.8} No-one does it like you, Scraggs."
  boys "说得对，斯克拉格斯。{vspace=30}{w=0.4}一切尽在你的掌握！{vspace=30}{w=0.8}没人能比得上你，斯克拉格斯。"

# game/script.rpy:5006
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_7c324d30:

  # sc "Alright boys, that's enough. Now listen here-"
  sc "好了兄弟们，够了。那边的，给我听好——"

# game/script.rpy:5007
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_5bffaf08:

  # boys "You tell 'em, Scraggs. {vspace=30} {w=0.4} They're nothing. {vspace=30} {w=0.4} These jokers have nothing on you. {vspace=30}{w=0.4}This is in the bag, Scraggs. {vspace=30} {w=0.8} You got this -"
  boys "让他们长长见识，斯克拉格斯。{vspace=30}{w=0.4}他们根本不算什么。{vspace=30}{w=0.4}这些跳梁小丑根本没法跟你比。{vspace=30}{w=0.4}简直十拿九稳，斯克拉格斯。{vspace=30}{w=0.8}你绝对没问题——"

# game/script.rpy:5008
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_8810d810:

  # sc "Boys! Please! Just give me a second."
  sc "兄弟们！拜托！先让我说一句。"

# game/script.rpy:5009
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_e7a8f1ce:

  # sc "Aw geeze, now look what you've done. Y-you made me lose it with the boys."
  sc "哎哟，现在看看你干的好事。你、你害得我对兄弟们发火了。"

# game/script.rpy:5010
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_23fe5bb3:

  # sc "I'm sorry boys, I never shoulda spoken to you in that way. You don't deserve that kind of treatment."
  sc "对不起，兄弟们，我绝不该用那种口气跟你们说话。你们不该受这委屈。"

# game/script.rpy:5011
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_96a4b584:

  # boys "It's ok Scraggs! {vspace=30} {w=0.4} We forgive you Scraggs. {vspace=30} {w=0.8} Forget about it."
  boys "没关系的，斯克拉格斯！{vspace=30}{w=0.4}我们原谅你，斯克拉格斯。{vspace=30}{w=0.8}别放在心上。"

# game/script.rpy:5012
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_c3fa44f7:

  # sc "Now it's personal. No-one disrespects my boys like that."
  sc "这下可是私人恩怨了。没人能这么不把我的兄弟们当回事。"

# game/script.rpy:5013
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_c92f8624:

  # t "Watch out!"
  t "小心！"

# game/script.rpy:5014
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_43791fbf:

  # "The thief dived into you and pulled you to the floor just as a razor-sharp banksia leaf slashed above you."
  "小偷猛冲过来把你一把扑倒在地，几乎同时，一片剃刀般锋利的班克木树叶贴着你头顶削过。"

# game/script.rpy:5016
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_d28f5cf4:

  # "The pig tackled Scraggs McKenzie and he fell from the branch, screaming vengeance."
  "小猪一个飞扑撞翻了斯克拉格斯·麦肯齐，他从树枝上摔了下去，一路狂吼着发誓要报仇。"

# game/script.rpy:5017
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_c9ecd079:

  # "The banksia boys swung their leaves around them like sawblades, and their dozens of eyes opened and closed in fury."
  "班克木帮的小喽啰们把树叶挥舞得宛如飞转的锯片，身上数十只眼睛愤怒地开合着。"

# game/script.rpy:5019
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_1a080627:

  # "The thief dragged you up and grabbed the pig. You all darted and dived through the melee until you dove through a door in the tree trunk and slammed it behind you."
  "小偷一把将你拽起，同时抓起小猪。你们在乱战中左冲右突、连滚带爬，直到钻进树干上的一扇门，在身后反手把门关上。"

# game/script.rpy:5021
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_36d66aaa:

  # "The thief dragged you up and you both darted and dived through the melee until you dove through a door in the tree trunk and slammed it behind you."
  "小偷一把将你拽起，你们俩在乱战中左冲右突、连滚带爬，直到钻进树干上的一扇门，然后猛地把它关上。"

# game/script.rpy:5022
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_8847b040:

  # "You fell to the floor, gasping. You had some bruises, and you saw that the Master Thief had suffered a slash across their arm."
  "你瘫倒在地，大口喘气。你身上有些淤青，还看到神偷的手臂上被划了一道长长的口子。"

# game/script.rpy:5023
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_99f13a17:

  # t "N-nothing to worry about."
  t "没、没什么好担心的。"

# game/script.rpy:5025
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_07cb393e:

  # "The pig nuzzled them with a concerned oink."
  "小猪蹭了蹭小偷，关切地哼哼了一声。"

# game/script.rpy:5032
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_1c53e5e9:

  # "You tore off one of your sleeves and bound it around the thief's arm as a bandage. They grumbled about it, but accepted your help."
  "你撕下自己的一截袖子当绷带，替小偷包扎了手臂。那张嘴虽然嘟嘟囔囔抱怨了几句，但还是接受了你的帮助。"

# game/script.rpy:5033
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_3664acb3:

  # t "You're wasting your time, I'm telling you."
  t "我告诉你，你这是在白费力气。"

# game/script.rpy:5034
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_8af1d2a1:

  # t "One day soon I will make love to the ropemaker's daughter, and the croaking of ravens will be our music for the occasion, and the world will be a better place for it."
  t "不久之后的某天，我会与制绳匠的女儿共赴巫山，让群鸦的嘶鸣为我们的寻欢作伴奏，而这个世界将因此变得更加美好。"

# game/script.rpy:5039
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_d3bf2724:

  # t "And then all your work will be for naught." nointeract
  t "到那时，你所有的努力都会化为泡影。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:5041
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_b2cf0058:

  # pov "Well, you'd better hold on a while longer. I plan to betray you and grab all the treasure for my own, and I can't do that if you're dead."
  pov "不过，你最好还是再多撑一会儿。我还盘算着背叛你，把财宝全据为己有呢，你要是死了我就没法这么干了。"

# game/script.rpy:5042
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_6f4883c9:

  # t "Fantastic!"
  t "太棒了！"

# game/script.rpy:5043
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_895b945f:

  # t "Then let the best betrayer win."
  t "那就看咱们俩谁才是更高明的叛徒了。"

# game/script.rpy:5044
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_31753861:

  # "They grabbed your hand and shook it."
  "小偷抓住你的手，握了握。"

# game/script.rpy:5046
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_e1c8d990:

  # "You pulled them up, and you all crept through the tree until you found a rotted red door."
  "你把小偷拉起来，你们顺着树干内部蹑手蹑脚地前行，直到发现了一扇腐朽的红门。"

# game/script.rpy:5048
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_5ec1b43e:

  # "You pulled them up, and you both crept through the tree until you found a rotted red door."
  "你把小偷拉起来，你们俩顺着树干内部蹑手蹑脚地前行，直到发现了一扇腐朽的红门。"

# game/script.rpy:5051
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_9e88ace4:

  # pov "Come on. Don't talk like that."
  pov "拜托，别说这种无情的话。"

# game/script.rpy:5052
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_5fc50482:

  # "The thief shrugged."
  "小偷耸了耸肩。"

# game/script.rpy:5053
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_cb304b25:

  # t "I never learned any other way to talk."
  t "我天生就只会这么讲话。"

# game/script.rpy:5054
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_da0450c0:

  # "They struggled to their feet, and you both crept through the tree until you found a rotted red door."
  "小偷挣扎着站起身，你们俩顺着树干内部蹑手蹑脚地前行，直到发现了一扇腐朽的红门。"

# game/script.rpy:5057
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_b3ddaea4:

  # t "Great idea. We'll draw you into a life of crime yet."
  t "好主意。我们迟早能把你拉上贼船。"

# game/script.rpy:5061
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_62862ed9:

  # "You leapt down a well with the pig in your arms, and crept up the underground river until you came across an ancient, leviathan saltwater crocodile."
  "你抱着小猪跳下一口井，沿着地下河潜行，直到遭遇了一条巨兽般的远古咸水鳄。"

# game/script.rpy:5063
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_0db6b7b7:

  # "You leapt down a well and crept up the underground river until you came across an ancient, leviathan saltwater crocodile."
  "你跳下一口井，沿着地下河潜行，直到遭遇了一条巨兽般的远古咸水鳄。"

# game/script.rpy:5064
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_0b7a63ac:

  # t "Watch this."
  t "看好了。"

# game/script.rpy:5065
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_1af1e653:

  # "Before you could say anything, they stole right up to the old master. With a flick of their wrist they stole his claws, and with a twist of their fingers stole his brightest emerald scales."
  "还没等你开口，小偷就已经摸到了那位老霸主跟前。手腕一抖，偷走了它的利爪；手指一捻，又顺走了它最耀眼的翠绿鳞片。"

# game/script.rpy:5066
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_358c1ebc:

  # t "Not impressed yet? How about this?"
  t "还没被惊艳到吗？那这招如何？"

# game/script.rpy:5067
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_c5e3dddf:

  # "They began reaching down into his gullet to steal the stones from his belly. You saw the crocodile's jaws about to clamp shut, and you grabbed their midnight cloak and pulled them away just in time."
  "小偷开始把手探进鳄鱼的喉管，想要偷取它腹中的石头。你眼看鳄鱼的血盆大口就要咬合，于是一把抓住小偷的午夜斗篷，把他扯了回来。"

# game/script.rpy:5068
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_9ef56a60:

  # "The old lord snapped about in a fury and turned on you."
  "这位老霸主在狂怒中张口乱咬，张着血盆大口朝你们扑来。"

# game/script.rpy:5069
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_c92f8624_1:

  # t "Watch out!"
  t "小心！"

# game/script.rpy:5070
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_7f412335:

  # "The thief dived and pulled you to the floor just as its powerful jaws closed above your head."
  "小偷一个飞扑把你拉倒在地，它那惊人的巨颚就在你头顶上空咔嚓一声合上了。"

# game/script.rpy:5071
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_9d4c4564:

  # "The thief dragged you up and you both darted and dived through the melee until you dove through a door and slammed it behind you."
  "小偷一把将你拽起，你们俩在乱战中左冲右突、连滚带爬，直到钻进一扇门内，然后猛地把它关上。"

# game/script.rpy:5072
translate Chinese scraggsWrong_8847b040_1:

  # "You fell to the floor, gasping. You had some bruises, and you saw that the Master Thief had suffered a slash across their arm."
  "你瘫倒在地，大口喘气。你身上有些淤青，还看到神偷的手臂上被划了一道长长的口子。"

# game/script.rpy:5078
translate Chinese thiefHeal_83ed0743:

  # t "N-nothing to worry about." nointeract
  t "没、没什么好担心的。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:5082
translate Chinese thiefHeal_9e0aa9fa:

  # pov "Are you crazy? That crocodile could have swallowed you whole!"
  pov "你疯了吗？那只鳄鱼差点把你整个吞了！"

# game/script.rpy:5083
translate Chinese thiefHeal_21d161dc:

  # t "So much the better. A crocodile's belly is no less than I deserve."
  t "那倒更好。葬身鳄腹也是我罪有应得。"

# game/script.rpy:5084
translate Chinese thiefHeal_9d295d6d:

  # t "And you'd be better off not saving me next time, for I plan to soon betray you."
  t "下次你最好别救我了，因为我正计划着很快就背叛你。"

# game/script.rpy:5088
translate Chinese thiefHeal_1c53e5e9:

  # "You tore off one of your sleeves and bound it around the thief's arm as a bandage. They grumbled about it, but accepted your help."
  "你撕下自己的一截袖子当绷带，替小偷包扎了手臂。那张嘴虽然嘟嘟囔囔抱怨了几句，但还是接受了你的帮助。"

# game/script.rpy:5089
translate Chinese thiefHeal_3664acb3:

  # t "You're wasting your time, I'm telling you."
  t "我告诉你，你这是在白费力气。"

# game/script.rpy:5090
translate Chinese thiefHeal_8af1d2a1:

  # t "One day soon I will make love to the ropemaker's daughter, and the croaking of ravens will be our music for the occasion, and the world will be a better place for it."
  t "不久之后的某天，我会与制绳匠的女儿共赴巫山，让群鸦的嘶鸣为我们的寻欢作伴奏，而这个世界将因此变得更加美好。"

# game/script.rpy:5096
translate Chinese thiefHeal_370d13d3:

  # t "And then all your work will be for naught!" nointeract
  t "到那时，你所有的努力都会化为泡影！" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:5098
translate Chinese thiefHeal_1e4652a7:

  # pov "Well, you'd better hold on a while longer. I plan to soon betray you and grab all the treasure for my own, and I can't do that if you're dead."
  pov "不过，你最好还是再多撑一会儿。我还打算过阵子背叛你，把财宝全据为己有呢，你要是死了我就没法这么干了。"

# game/script.rpy:5099
translate Chinese thiefHeal_6f4883c9:

  # t "Fantastic!"
  t "太棒了！"

# game/script.rpy:5100
translate Chinese thiefHeal_895b945f:

  # t "Then let the best betrayer win."
  t "那就看咱们俩谁才是更高明的叛徒了。"

# game/script.rpy:5101
translate Chinese thiefHeal_31753861:

  # "They grabbed your hand and shook it."
  "小偷抓住你的手，握了握。"

# game/script.rpy:5102
translate Chinese thiefHeal_bb9457c4:

  # "You pulled them up, and you both ventured further into the tunnel. Eventually you found a little silver door in the rock."
  "你把小偷拉起来，你们俩继续向隧道深处进发。最终，你们在岩壁上发现了一扇银色的小门。"

# game/script.rpy:5105
translate Chinese thiefHeal_9e88ace4:

  # pov "Come on. Don't talk like that."
  pov "拜托，别说这种无情的话。"

# game/script.rpy:5106
translate Chinese thiefHeal_5fc50482:

  # "The thief shrugged."
  "小偷耸了耸肩。"

# game/script.rpy:5107
translate Chinese thiefHeal_cb304b25:

  # t "I never learned any other way to talk."
  t "我天生就只会这么讲话。"

# game/script.rpy:5108
translate Chinese thiefHeal_c97033eb:

  # "They struggled to their feet, and you both ventured further into the tunnel. Eventually you found a little silver door in the rock."
  "小偷挣扎着站起身，你们俩继续向隧道深处进发。最终，你们在岩壁上发现了一扇银色的小门。"

# game/script.rpy:5114
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_ff93b99b:

  # "The door opened to reveal the vast cavern of glittering treasure far below. You saw the gold and gems and red mist of incense, just as it was earlier in the night."
  "门开了，展露出下方堆满闪耀财宝的巨大洞窟。你看到了黄金、宝石，还有红色的熏香薄雾，一切都与今晚早些时候看到的一模一样。"

# game/script.rpy:5116
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_b92eee9d:

  # "The door opened to reveal a vast cavern of glittering treasure far below."
  "门开了，展露出下方堆满闪耀财宝的巨大洞窟。"

# game/script.rpy:5117
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_34717a98:

  # "It was the hollow interior of an ancient strangler fig. The deep cavern reached down into the earth, cold as ice despite the heat outside."
  "那是古老绞杀榕的内部空洞。深邃的洞穴一路向下延伸进地底，尽管外界酷热难耐，这里却寒气刺骨。"

# game/script.rpy:5118
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_7cad57c0:

  # "The floor of the cavern was piled with rubies and pearls and glinting onyx and solid gold pieces, larger than your fist."
  "洞窟的地面上堆满了红宝石、珍珠、闪烁的缟玛瑙和赤金块，件件都比你的拳头还要大。"

# game/script.rpy:5119
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_6e5be29f:

  # "All across the room were lush silks and pillars of precious metals of every type and all manner of riches that would turn the King of Kings green with envy."
  "放眼望去，整个空间到处是华美的丝绸、各种贵金属铸成的柱子，以及足以让万王之王嫉妒得眼红的各种奇珍异宝。"

# game/script.rpy:5120
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_ce6a2138:

  # "You inhaled the rich dark scent of incense, and saw glimmering magenta smoke roll across the room and coat it all in a dark haze, smelling of the most incredible spices and herbs and enchanting odours."
  "你深吸了一口浓郁的熏香，微闪的紫红烟雾在洞穴内翻腾，给周围的一切蒙上了一层暗沉的薄纱，空气中弥漫着不可思议的香料与草药混合的迷人芬芳。"

# game/script.rpy:5121
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_3ed3807f:

  # t "Jackpot."
  t "发财了。"

# game/script.rpy:5122
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_47dbc630:

  # "The thief tied a rope around their waist, tied the other end to the doorknob, and began to lower themselves down to the treasure below."
  "小偷在腰间系了根绳子，另一头绑在门把手上，顺着绳子降到下方的宝藏堆里。"

# game/script.rpy:5123
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_f15cf35c:

  # t "Come on!"
  t "快来！"

# game/script.rpy:5131
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_8063a600:

  # "You tied a rope around you and the pig and lowered yourself down to help the thief."
  "你用绳子把你和小猪系在一起，顺着绳子降下去帮小偷。"

# game/script.rpy:5133
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_72ad74fa:

  # "You tied a rope around your waist and lowered yourself down to help the thief."
  "你把绳子系在腰上，顺着绳子降下去帮小偷。"

# game/script.rpy:5134
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_52ff043c:

  # "They grabbed up a shining goblet, encrusted with rubies and amethysts and chunks of moonstone carved in the shape of wild flowers."
  "小偷抓起一个闪闪发光的高脚杯，上面镶嵌着红宝石、紫水晶，还有雕刻成野花形状的大块月光石。"

# game/script.rpy:5135
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_b4720fd0:

  # "As soon as they did, you heard a terrible rumbling and groaning all around you, and the walls shook. The Mushroom emerged from a trapdoor in the floor and looked around wildly."
  "小偷刚一拿起杯子，四周就响起了可怕的轰鸣与沉闷的悲鸣，连墙壁都在震颤。蘑菇从地板的活板门里钻了出来，发狂般地环顾四周。"

# game/script.rpy:5136
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_711ba31a:

  # t "Whoops. Looks like we'd better work fast!"
  t "哎呀。看来我们得抓紧时间了！"

# game/script.rpy:5139
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_1494e39a:

  # "You grabbed the scimitar and slashed through the rope in a single motion."
  "你抓起弯刀，一刀就斩断了绳子。"

# game/script.rpy:5140
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_bf5f3bf0:

  # "The form of the thief fell down below. As it fell away, you saw it was nothing but a raggedy old cloak stuffed with straw. You felt a sharp point at your back."
  "小偷的身影跌落下去。但在掉落下去的那一刻，你发现那不过是一件塞满稻草的破烂旧斗篷。有个尖锐的东西抵在了你的背上。"

# game/script.rpy:5141
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_11b4e00f:

  # t "You're learning, my friend. But not quite quick enough. En Garde!"
  t "你在进步，我的朋友。但还是不够快。看剑！"

# game/script.rpy:5142
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_28eb0412:

  # "You whirled around and barely parried a slash from the thief, but the force of the blow sent you tumbling down and onto a pile of diamonds."
  "你猛地转过身，勉强招架住了小偷的一记劈砍，但这股力道把你震得向下跌落，滚到了一堆钻石上。"

# game/script.rpy:5143
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_e08adfb3:

  # "You pulled yourself up and fought fiercely across the glittering hills of treasure, gold pieces sliding away with every step."
  "你爬起来，在闪闪发光的财宝山上与小偷激烈搏斗，每走一步都有金币向下滑落。"

# game/script.rpy:5145
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_90987862:

  # "The pig left bravely at the Master Thief, but they effortlessly dodged and it went rolling down the hill, squealing wildly."
  "小猪勇敢地扑向神偷，但那身影毫不费力地闪开了，小猪一路尖叫着滚下了财宝山。"

# game/script.rpy:5146
translate Chinese thiefMushroomCavern_a454b8e3:

  # "The Master Thief effortlessly riposted your blows with one hand, while the other hand darted around grabbing nearby gems and stuffing them into their cloak."
  "神偷只用一只手便轻松对你格挡还击，另一只手则像闪电般在周围抓取宝石，塞进斗篷里。"

# game/script.rpy:5151
translate Chinese thiefFinale_c2c70ada:

  # pov "Run!"
  pov "快跑！"

# game/script.rpy:5152
translate Chinese thiefFinale_045f25d3:

  # "You grabbed the thief's hand and tried to pull them away as they stuffed gems and jewels into their pockets."
  "你一把抓住小偷的手，试图把他拉走，而他还在不停地把各种宝石往口袋里塞。"

# game/script.rpy:5153
translate Chinese thiefFinale_c12e0b0a:

  # m "So you've decided to steal from our Lady after all?"
  m "所以你最终还是决定偷我们女士的东西了？"

# game/script.rpy:5155
translate Chinese thiefFinale_be52e3d4:

  # m "I knew should never have given you a second chance. Curse first, ask questions later, darling, that's what I've always said."
  m "我就知道根本不该给你第二次机会。先下咒，后盘问，亲爱的，我向来都是这么说的。"

# game/script.rpy:5157
translate Chinese thiefFinale_e359ef54:

  # m "How trite. I hoped you had the originality to avoid rehashing such dull tropes, darling."
  m "真是老掉牙了。我本指望你能有点创意，别总炒这种无聊的冷饭呢，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:5160
translate Chinese thiefFinale_1c4a764c:

  # "The floor began to fall away before you, and all the golden treasure sprouted and turned into jellyspots and rust fungus and dog lichen and yellow staghorn and blue mould which bloomed in all directions."
  "你面前的地板开始坍塌，所有金色财宝的表面开始萌发，变成了星孢寄生菌、锈菌、狗地衣、黄鹿角菌和蓝霉菌，向四周蔓延。"

# game/script.rpy:5162
translate Chinese thiefFinale_3777d64f:

  # "The pig leapt into your arms, grunting in fear."
  "小猪跳进你的怀里，惊恐地直哼哼。"

# game/script.rpy:5163
translate Chinese thiefFinale_5e354c86:

  # "The black tongues of the earth wriggled out of the treasure horde and lashed around you, and out from the soil emerged ten dozen mushrooms, all identical to the one in front of you. For weapons they held puffballs and shield fungi and spindle toughshanks, and they walked towards you with slow but terrible confidence."
  "大地黑色的长舌从宝藏堆中蠕动而出，在你周围肆虐抽打。一百多只蘑菇从泥土中钻出，长得都和你面前的这只一模一样。它们以马勃菌、盾状真菌和纺锤形韧柄菌为武器，迈着缓慢却令人毛骨悚然的笃定步伐向你逼近。"

# game/script.rpy:5165
translate Chinese thiefFinale_76f5b016:

  # m3 "Drop the treasure. {vspace=30} {w=0.4} Drop the treasure. {vspace=30} {w=0.8}Drop the treasure. "
  m3 "放下宝藏。{vspace=30}{w=0.4}放下宝藏。{vspace=30}{w=0.8}放下宝藏。"

# game/script.rpy:5175
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_63488526:

  # "You grabbed a nearby candlesnuff fungus and parried a thrust from the closest mushroom."
  "你抓起旁边的一根烛煤菌，格挡开了最近那只蘑菇的突刺。"

# game/script.rpy:5176
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_fcfdd73f:

  # m "Hmm. I think I can see glimpses of what you were going for, darling, but ultimately the performance feels superficial and dated."
  m "嗯。我想我大概能看出你想表达什么了，亲爱的，但终究还是觉得这场表演既肤浅又过时。"

# game/script.rpy:5177
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_da8c8aed:

  # "The mushroom effortlessly disarmed you with a sweep of her toughshank."
  "蘑菇只用她的韧柄菌扫了一下，便毫不费力地打飞了你的武器。"

# game/script.rpy:5178
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_1c22ad44:

  # m2 "Disappointing."
  m2 "真让人失望。"

# game/script.rpy:5179
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_f40e1f50:

  # m4 "Agreed. A lackluster piece. One suspects the artist's best days are behind [him]."
  m4 "同意。极其平庸的作品。让人不禁怀疑这位艺术家的巅峰期早已离[him]而去。"

# game/script.rpy:5180
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_b40cf7a5:

  # "Their attacks began to push you and the thief towards the edge of the ragged hole in the floor."
  "它们的攻击把你和小偷逼向地板上那个破洞的边缘。"

# game/script.rpy:5184
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_9ef0413b:

  # "You ducked back and crammed some tumbling gems into your pockets with your spare hand."
  "你往后一缩，用腾出的那只手将一些滚落的宝石塞进口袋。"

# game/script.rpy:5185
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_509bd182:

  # "As you did, they burst apart into puffballs which sent a waft of spores out of your pockets. The room began to spin around you."
  "刚一塞进去，它们就突然炸裂成马勃菌，一股孢子粉从你的口袋里腾升而起。你眼前的房间开始天旋地转。"

# game/script.rpy:5186
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_7ae38853:

  # "You slipped on a scarlet elf cap and began to fall into the pit. Below you, you could hear the slow beating of an ominous heart, and you looked down and saw pale flesh twisting languidly in the darkness of the earth."
  "你一脚踩在猩红精灵杯上滑倒，径直坠入深坑。在下方，你能听到一颗不祥的心脏正缓慢跳动；低头望去，只见地下深处的黑暗中，苍白的血肉正在迟缓地蠕动。"

# game/script.rpy:5187
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_bdd306f6:

  # "The Master Thief threw up a grappling hook and grabbed hold of your waist. The hook caught, and the two of you swung across the cavern to solid ground."
  "神偷抛出一个抓钩，揽住了你的腰。抓钩勾住了固定点，你们俩在半空中荡过洞穴，落在了坚实的地面上。"

# game/script.rpy:5188
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_0e590b2d:

  # "Still, you couldn't escape the swarms of fungi."
  "尽管如此，你们依然无法逃脱成群的真菌包围。"

# game/script.rpy:5192
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_92257c80:

  # "You tried to run. But you were completely surrounded."
  "你想跑。但你已经被彻底包围了。"

# game/script.rpy:5193
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_c927ab26:

  # m3 "No-one escapes the Lady's embrace. {vspace=30} {w=0.4} Lady's embrace. {vspace=30} {w=0.8}No-one. "
  m3 "没有人能逃离女士的怀抱。{vspace=30}{w=0.4}女士的怀抱。{vspace=30}{w=0.8}没有人。"

# game/script.rpy:5196
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_601ad48b:

  # pov "There's too many of them!"
  pov "数量太多了！"

# game/script.rpy:5197
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_8a5537a2:

  # t "Not so fast."
  t "慢着。"

# game/script.rpy:5198
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_44561bff:

  # "They took a whistle from their pocket and blew on it, making a harsh, shrill whine echo through the cavern."
  "小偷从口袋里掏出一枚哨子吹响，刺耳尖锐的哨音在洞穴中回荡。"

# game/script.rpy:5199
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_75d1f82b:

  # "At first there was silence. The mushrooms paused."
  "起初一片寂静。那些蘑菇停了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:5200
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_9f2db760:

  # "Then, you heard an answering whistle, deep and loud enough to deafen you."
  "紧接着，你听到了一声回应的哨音，低沉浑厚，震耳欲聋。"

# game/script.rpy:5201
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_cb614279:

  # "A brilliant light shone through the windows of the cavern. There was the sound of thundering wheels."
  "一道刺目的强光穿透了洞穴的孔隙。一阵如雷鸣般的车轮声滚滚而来。"

# game/script.rpy:5205
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_0ae9bcd0:

  # ""
  ""

# game/script.rpy:5210
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_9f9aafa4:

  # "A train crashed through the walls of the cavern."
  "一列火车撞碎洞壁冲了进来。"

# game/script.rpy:5212
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_8c66431f:

  # "It was swarming with wild and chaotic shapes of all manner of monsters, and you could see a team of things holding onto the front and laying tracks in front of the train as fast as they could as it swerved through the cavern, fungi leaping aside before it."
  "火车上挤满了形形色色的怪物，狂乱混沌。你能看到一群东西攀在车头，趁着火车呼啸着穿梭于洞穴，以极快的速度在车前铺设铁轨，那些真菌纷纷闪避不迭。"

# game/script.rpy:5214
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_7a60b370:

  # t "Grab on!"
  t "抓紧！"

# game/script.rpy:5215
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_6b2dddb9:

  # "Behind you the mushrooms closed in, throwing puffballs that exploded in clouds of spores around you. You ran up to the side of the train as it clattered along."
  "身后的蘑菇们逼近了，掷出的马勃菌在你们周围炸成一团团孢子云。你冲向那列正哐当驶过的火车侧面。"

# game/script.rpy:5216
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_83e06a24:

  # "The thief pushed you up to grab onto the side of the carriage, then you reached down and pulled them up beside you."
  "小偷把你推上去，让你扒住车厢外侧，随后你探下身，把小偷拉到你身旁。"

# game/script.rpy:5217
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_9c399f5a:

  # "The train whistled with full force, gathering speed until it smashed through the other wall of the cavern and shot through the trees of the forest, leaving the mushrooms behind."
  "火车拉响汽笛，不断加速，直到撞碎洞穴另一侧的岩壁，如离弦之箭般穿梭在森林间，把那些蘑菇远远甩在身后。"

# game/script.rpy:5218
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_dfca1cfc:

  # t "Well! Did you ever doubt me?"
  t "怎么样！你刚才该不会怀疑我吧？"

# game/script.rpy:5221
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_8e71b353:

  # "A thousand goblin shapes writhed up out of the train to hold up the thief in celebration, and you heard a cheer rise up from a thousand goblin throats."
  "上千个哥布林从火车里涌出，把小偷高高举起以示庆祝，你听到欢呼声从数千个哥布林的喉咙里爆发出来。"

# game/script.rpy:5222
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_0a465d83:

  # "Some had the heads of bats, some had the paws of cats, six heads, three heads, five arms, ten tails, and they bristled with tails and wings and fur and scales."
  "有些长着蝙蝠脑袋，有些长着猫爪，有的六个头，有的三个头，还有的长着五条胳膊、十条尾巴，它们浑身竖立着尾巴、翅膀，覆满了皮毛与鳞片。"

# game/script.rpy:5223
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_5def37d6:

  # "One crawled like a snail, one prowled like a wombat, one looked like seven doves tied together with string. All of them had a chaos of forms the likes of which you had never seen."
  "一只像蜗牛般蠕动，一只像袋熊般游荡，还有一只看起来像是被绳子拴在一起的七只鸽子。它们形态千奇百怪，都是你生平从未见过的。"

# game/script.rpy:5224
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_9e56f357:

  # "A dozen hands clapped you on the back and drew you into the train carriage."
  "十几只手拍打着你的后背，把你拉进了火车车厢。"

# game/script.rpy:5225
translate Chinese thiefMushroomBattle_042ffcf2:

  # goblin1 "Have a drink with us! Any friend of the thief's is a friend of ours."
  goblin1 "和我们喝一杯吧！小偷的朋友就是我们的朋友。"

# game/script.rpy:5233
translate Chinese goblinTrain_332c8036:

  # "You fell into a chair and looked around."
  "你瘫坐在椅子里，环顾四周。"

# game/script.rpy:5236
translate Chinese goblinTrain_6c685cc3:

  # "This part of the train was some kind of bar or gambling hall. Looking up through a maze of trapdoors in the roof, you could see there were many floors stacked above this one. Bathhouses, gardens, workshops and observatories."
  "火车的这一部分似乎是个酒吧或者赌场。透过车顶如迷宫般交错的活板门向上看去，你能发现上面还叠着好几层。有澡堂、花园、作坊和天文台。"

# game/script.rpy:5238
translate Chinese goblinTrain_cdf8b1e9:

  # "Your pig nestled into the chair beside you and began to chat to the nearby goblins in the language of mud."
  "你的小猪舒服地窝在旁边的椅子里，开始用泥巴的语言和附近的哥布林聊起天来。"

# game/script.rpy:5244
translate Chinese goblinTrain_d745715f:

  # "A team of goblins hung off the back of the train and picked up the tracks behind it, then climbed around to hand the tracks to the goblins at the front, who laid them in front of the train as it squeezed through the trees of the forest."
  "一队哥布林挂在火车尾部，收起刚驶过的铁轨，然后顺着车身爬到车头递过去；车头的哥布林则赶在火车挤过林木之前，飞快地把它们铺在车前。"

# game/script.rpy:5250
translate Chinese goblinTrain_d4e11551:

  # "The goblins poured you dozens of goblin brews, bubbling ales and steaming warm ciders, goblin wines that oozed with red fog and goblin brandies that froze and melted and froze again as you drank them."
  "哥布林们给你倒了几十杯哥布林特酿。有冒着气泡的麦芽酒、蒸腾着热气的温苹果酒、氤氲着红雾的哥布林葡萄酒，还有一种哥布林白兰地，在你饮用时，酒液会不断结冰、融化、再结冰。"

# game/script.rpy:5251
translate Chinese goblinTrain_634dc700:

  # "Foolishly, you drank deeply of the brews. You guzzled them down until you could drink no more, until your vision was a haze and the brew ran down your mouth and drenched your clothes, and still you thirsted for them."
  "你鬼迷心窍地大口痛饮起这些佳酿。你贪婪地把它们灌下肚，直到再也喝不下一滴，直到视线模糊，酒水顺着嘴角流下浸透了衣服，你却依然对它们充满渴望。"

# game/script.rpy:5252
translate Chinese goblinTrain_05c96d8c:

  # "From that day on, no other drink would ever be able to quench your thirst, and you would always shiver and feel cold without the wild drunken feeling of warmth the goblin drinks gave you."
  "从那天起，世间再也没有任何饮料能解你的渴，如果尝不到哥布林酒液带来的那种狂野醉人的温暖，你就会永远在战栗与寒冷中度过。"

# game/script.rpy:5253
translate Chinese goblinTrain_8bb3d117:

  # goblin2 "On the house! Just for tonight."
  goblin2 "免费畅饮！仅限今晚。"

# game/script.rpy:5259
translate Chinese goblinTrain_e9f6df52:

  # "You walked through the cramped corridors of the train and found yourself in a giant feast hall where they were celebrating the Master Thief at the head of the table."
  "你穿过火车逼仄的走廊，步入一个巨大的宴会厅，哥布林们正在大摆筵席，为坐在长桌主位的神偷庆祝。"

# game/script.rpy:5260
translate Chinese goblinTrain_de7e6061:

  # goblin3 "Show us the loot!"
  goblin3 "让我们看看战利品！"

# game/script.rpy:5261
translate Chinese goblinTrain_f1985217:

  # goblin1 "Yeah, what'd you get?"
  goblin1 "是啊，你搞到什么了？"

# game/script.rpy:5262
translate Chinese goblinTrain_8ebd2f5b:

  # "The thief nervously reached into their pockets and turned them out."
  "小偷紧张地把口袋翻了个底朝天。"

# game/script.rpy:5263
translate Chinese goblinTrain_9d2650fa:

  # "All the precious gold and gemstones had turned into nothing but mud, sticks, rocks and lichen."
  "所有珍贵的黄金和宝石都已经变成了烂泥、树枝、石头和地衣。"

# game/script.rpy:5264
translate Chinese goblinTrain_8e450b97:

  # "A tumble of mould and webcaps and orange peel fungus dropped onto the table."
  "一堆霉菌、丝膜菌和橙皮菌散落在桌子上。"

# game/script.rpy:5265
translate Chinese goblinTrain_5b7135a8:

  # "The goblins stared in silence."
  "哥布林们直勾勾地盯着，沉默不语。"

# game/script.rpy:5266
translate Chinese goblinTrain_30dceb9a:

  # "Then erupted into wild cheers."
  "然后爆发出狂热的欢呼声。"

# game/script.rpy:5267
translate Chinese goblinTrain_8abea754:

  # goblin1 "These are some of the shiniest rocks I ever saw!"
  goblin1 "这些是我见过最闪亮的石头了！"

# game/script.rpy:5268
translate Chinese goblinTrain_aaa38afc:

  # goblin2 "Now, look at that. That right there is a nice stick if ever I seen one, and I seen quite some sticks in my time. That one is goin' in the nest for sure."
  goblin2 "哟，快瞧瞧那个。我这辈子也算阅枝无数了，这根绝对是极品。这根肯定得拿回窝里去。"

# game/script.rpy:5269
translate Chinese goblinTrain_a9f60d3c:

  # goblin3 "'Ow'd you get such good mould? This is the best mould haul I've seen since the great fungus caper of '48!"
  goblin3 "你咋搞到这么好的霉菌的？这是自48年那场真菌大劫案以来，我见过最好的一批货了！"

# game/script.rpy:5270
translate Chinese goblinTrain_58a466e0:

  # "The crowd quieted down as a grizzled old goblin called for a toast."
  "随着一只苍老斑白的哥布林提议祝酒，人群安静了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:5271
translate Chinese goblinTrain_acb91e05:

  # goblin4 "Ahem! Hem Hem Hem!"
  goblin4 "咳咳！咳咳咳！"

# game/script.rpy:5272
translate Chinese goblinTrain_6db55b9b:

  # goblin4 "I declare your apprenticeship complete!"
  goblin4 "我宣布，你的学徒期正式结束！"

# game/script.rpy:5273
translate Chinese goblinTrain_aae71e14:

  # goblin4 "And so, with all the power invested in me, I hereby dub thee..."
  goblin4 "因此，凭借赋予我的权力，我在此册封你为……"

# game/script.rpy:5274
translate Chinese goblinTrain_d57a43dc:

  # goblin4 "{b}The Junior Thief!{/b}"
  goblin4 "{b}初级小偷！{/b}"

# game/script.rpy:5275
translate Chinese goblinTrain_d4b16bef:

  # "She held up the thief's hand and all the goblins roared and danced and sang and rolled around in celebration."
  "她高高举起小偷的手，所有的哥布林顿时欢呼咆哮，又唱又跳，满地打滚以示庆祝。"

# game/script.rpy:5276
translate Chinese goblinTrain_75fb7cf2:

  # "The thief smiled awkwardly. But for some reason, they didn't seem to share in the good mood. The smile quickly slid off their face, and they made an excuse to leave the party."
  "小偷尴尬地笑了笑，但不知为何似乎并没有被这欢乐的气氛感染。笑容很快从那张脸上隐去，小偷找了个借口，离开了派对。"

# game/script.rpy:5286
translate Chinese goblinTrain2_1c16af2f:

  # "The goblins laughed and cheered and served goblin fruits and carved goblin hams made of rich mould and mud and played goblin games all across the table."
  "哥布林们欢笑、欢呼，端上哥布林的果实，切开用肥厚的霉菌和泥巴做成的哥布林火腿，还在桌子上玩起了各种哥布林游戏。"

# game/script.rpy:5288
translate Chinese goblinTrain2_8bc07250:

  # "Your pig was quickly drawn into a wager, with it's greatest hopes and dreams as the stakes. Fortunately it won, and was granted a small kingdom in the mountains as it's prize. It would go on to raise a mighty pig empire there, and rule over it for the rest of its days."
  "你的小猪很快被拉入了一场赌局，以它最大的希望和梦想作为赌注。幸运的是，它赢了，并获封了一座山间小王国作为战利品。它将在那里建立一个庞大的小猪帝国，并终其一生统治那片领土。"

# game/script.rpy:5290
translate Chinese goblinTrain2_14d42ea0:

  # "You could see goblins betting on the games with their hopes, dreams and fears as the stakes."
  "你能看到哥布林们以他们的希望、梦想和恐惧作为赌注来进行游戏。"

# game/script.rpy:5294
translate Chinese goblinTrain2_79e66d33:

  # "Foolishly, you tasted the goblin fruits."
  "你鬼迷心窍地品尝了哥布林的果实。"

# game/script.rpy:5295
translate Chinese goblinTrain2_980733b3:

  # "They were sweeter than honey, stronger than wine, clearer than water and darker than tar."
  "它们比蜂蜜更甜，比醇酒更烈，比清水更清澈，比焦油更暗黑。"

# game/script.rpy:5296
translate Chinese goblinTrain2_eb0eb581:

  # "You gorged yourself until you could eat no more, until you knew not whether it was night or day, and still your mouth watered for them."
  "你狼吞虎咽地吃着，直到再也塞不下一口，直到不辨昼夜，可你却依然对它们垂涎欲滴。"

# game/script.rpy:5297
translate Chinese goblinTrain2_16722772:

  # "From that day forward all other foods would be ash in your mouth, and you would wither and go grey with the need of them."
  "从那天起，世间一切其他的食物在你嘴里都将味同嚼蜡，而你会因为对它们的无尽渴求而日渐枯槁、面如死灰。"

# game/script.rpy:5302
translate Chinese goblinTrain2_02256a12:

  # "You found them sitting on the rear balcony with their legs over the edge, watching the trees and hills roll by in the smoky night."
  "你发现小偷正坐在车尾的露台上，双腿悬在外面，望着树木与山丘在烟雾缭绕的夜色中向后掠过。"

# game/script.rpy:5303
translate Chinese goblinTrain2_38b78ab9:

  # t "Hi."
  t "嗨。"

# game/script.rpy:5304
translate Chinese goblinTrain2_4b7fe600:

  # "You sat there with them in silence for a while, looking out."
  "你和小偷静静地坐了一会儿，向外眺望。"

# game/script.rpy:5305
translate Chinese goblinTrain2_1e029028:

  # t "Oh, before I forget."
  t "哦，趁我还没忘。"

# game/script.rpy:5307
translate Chinese goblinTrain2_1cc3a70f:

  # "They handed back the suckling pig and all of the loose change stolen from the village, along with your stolen possessions and some extra money for payment."
  "小偷把那头小乳猪和从村里偷来的零钱全还给了你，连同你被偷的私人物品，还多给了些钱作为报酬。"

# game/script.rpy:5309
translate Chinese goblinTrain2_8e1416e4:

  # "They handed back the suckling pig and all of the loose change stolen from the village, along with some extra money for payment."
  "小偷把那头小乳猪和从村里偷来的零钱全还给了你，还多给了些钱作为报酬。"

# game/script.rpy:5315
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_3460276a:

  # t "Sorry about that." nointeract
  t "对不起了。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:5318
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_40906c0a:

  # pov "What is this place?"
  pov "这是什么地方？"

# game/script.rpy:5319
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_8ad9f112:

  # t "The goblin train."
  t "哥布林列车。"

# game/script.rpy:5320
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_0ddca4bd:

  # t "It travels wherever there are thoughts and dreams for the goblins to steal. Provides safe passage to desperate souls. Serves the will of the goblin queens. That kind of thing."
  t "哪里有梦和思想可偷，它就开去哪里。为绝望的灵魂提供安全的通道。效命于哥布林女王。诸如此类吧。"

# game/script.rpy:5324
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_e4d3d0c4:

  # pov "So... Junior Thief? I thought you were the Master Thief."
  pov "所以……初级小偷？我还以为你是神偷呢。"

# game/script.rpy:5325
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_21762e72:

  # goblin1 "{i}Master{/i}? Oh Lord, that's a good one! Our young thief's been telling you some real porkies if you've picked that up!"
  goblin1 "{i}神偷{/i}？噢老天，这可真够好笑的！你要是从那家伙嘴里听来这词，那咱们这位年轻小偷可给你编了不少瞎话！"

# game/script.rpy:5326
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_bc81df9a:

  # goblin1 "They need to complete the seven year advanced traineeship to even become a Journeyman Thief. Then they MIGHT be able to apply for their masters, IF the queen thinks they're good enough!"
  goblin1 "得先完成七年的高级学徒期，才够格成为出师小偷。然后才“也许”有资格去考取神偷资格，那还得看女王觉不觉得他们够格才行！"

# game/script.rpy:5327
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_c648a0fc:

  # "The goblin wiped tears of laughter from their eyes and headed back into the train, pulling a sack of coal behind them."
  "那只哥布林擦了擦笑出来的眼泪，拖着一袋煤炭转身回了车厢。"

# game/script.rpy:5328
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_d272b117:

  # t "Um. Sorry about the deception."
  t "呃。骗了你很抱歉。"

# game/script.rpy:5329
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_5487ce7b:

  # t "My skill is nothing compared to the goblins. They can steal the thoughts from your head, quick as a wink."
  t "我的本事跟哥布林比起来根本算不了什么。眨眼间的功夫，他们就能把你脑袋里的想法偷走。"

# game/script.rpy:5330
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_8bb2d7ae:

  # t "Just thought it sounded more impressive than Apprentice Thief."
  t "只是觉得这称号听起来比“学徒小偷”要拉风得多。"

# game/script.rpy:5334
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_7413e413:

  # t "Yep. I've proved myself now."
  t "是的。现在我已经证明自己了。"

# game/script.rpy:5335
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_832ade06:

  # t "I've been training here for a full year. This was my final test."
  t "我在这儿训练整整一年了。这是我的终极考验。"

# game/script.rpy:5336
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_866b02d5:

  # t "I have to thank you. I couldn't have done it without you."
  t "我得谢谢你。没有你我根本办不到。"

# game/script.rpy:5343
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_59eb110f:

  # t "It's a long story." nointeract
  t "说来话长。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:5345
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_1cb239e3:

  # pov "I don't have anywhere to be."
  pov "我没什么非去不可的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:5346
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_cd6db0b6:

  # t "Oh, well. No harm in telling you, I suppose."
  t "噢，好吧。我想告诉你也无妨。"

# game/script.rpy:5349
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_66c24afd:

  # pov "Well, you'd better make it quick."
  pov "好吧，你最好长话短说。"

# game/script.rpy:5352
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_34c49fe4:

  # pov "Time is moving on, and I need to find a way to escape my Godfather before midnight."
  pov "时间紧迫，我得在午夜前找到逃离我教父的方法。"

# game/script.rpy:5354
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_4924819a:

  # pov "Time is moving on, and I need to find a way to escape my Godmother before midnight."
  pov "时间紧迫，我得在午夜前找到逃离我教母的方法。"

# game/script.rpy:5357
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_ccf99d5b:

  # pov "Well, I don't have a lot of time..."
  pov "嗯，我的时间也不多了……"

# game/script.rpy:5358
translate Chinese thiefConvo2_ce5e37c0:

  # t "My parents are terrible. They sent me to the goblins to train as a thief. Now they're coming back to take me away."
  t "我父母很糟糕。他们把我送到哥布林这里接受小偷训练。现在他们又要回来把我带走。"

# game/script.rpy:5366
translate Chinese thiefStory_f8c2e708:

  # t "Right. Long ago, the Lord came to visit my parents. I heard my mother gesture to me, and talk to the Lord of me thus:"
  t "是这样。很久以前，主曾造访我的父母。我听到母亲冲我比划着，如此向主诉说我的情形："

# game/script.rpy:5367
translate Chinese thiefStory_a53bf06d:

  # thiefmum "Inside all good people there dwells a golden soul, given by you, oh Lord. But as soon as you look, anyone can see this one has nothing but a hollow nest of spiders and rats inside. What trade can I teach such a one as this?"
  thiefmum "所有好人的体内，都驻留着一个金子般的灵魂，那是您所赐予的，主啊。但只要您一看便知，这孩子体内不过是个空洞的蛛巢鼠穴罢了。像这样的人，我能教点什么手艺好呢？"

# game/script.rpy:5369
translate Chinese thiefStory_c1b493eb:

  # t "The Lord thought on this, and said to me thus:"
  t "上帝略作沉思，便对我这般说道："

# game/script.rpy:5370
translate Chinese thiefStory_c88f902a:

  # miw "You shall be a Thief. It is the work your wicked hands are made for."
  miw "你将成为一名小偷。你那双罪恶的手就是为此而生的。"

# game/script.rpy:5371
translate Chinese thiefStory_2da3935b:

  # t "My parents took me to the goblins to learn the art of Thievery as the Lord instructed."
  t "于是，我父母按照上帝的旨意，把我送去哥布林那里学习偷窃之术。"

# game/script.rpy:5372
translate Chinese thiefStory_0cdba0be:

  # t "One of the Goblin Queens sat and talked with me for a long time. Then they went to my parents and said:"
  t "其中一位哥布林女王坐下来跟我聊了很久。然后她走到我父母面前说："

# game/script.rpy:5373
translate Chinese thiefStory_c6005951:

  # goblinQueen "Your child will be taught well. We will keep them as an apprentice for one year."
  goblinQueen "我们会好好教你的孩子。这孩子要在我们这里当一年学徒。"

# game/script.rpy:5374
translate Chinese thiefStory_1ef34292:

  # goblinQueen "Come back then, and if you can still recognize them, I won't take any money for my services and you can take them away."
  goblinQueen "一年后再回来，如果你还能认出这孩子，我的教导就不收分文，你可以把人带走。"

# game/script.rpy:5375
translate Chinese thiefStory_0ce93db7:

  # goblinQueen "But if you cannot recognise them, you must give me three hundred talers, and they must be allowed to go free and do as they will."
  goblinQueen "但如果你认不出来了，就必须付我三百塔勒，并且必须还这孩子自由，任其去留自便。"

# game/script.rpy:5376
translate Chinese thiefStory_49e418e1:

  # t "My parents agreed, and went home. And now, that year has passed."
  t "我父母同意了，然后回了家。而现在，一年之期已满。"

# game/script.rpy:5377
translate Chinese thiefStory_5fc72027:

  # t "Tonight, my parents will be here soon to take me away, and they always carry the Lord in their hearts."
  t "今晚，我父母很快就会来接我走，而他们的心中常存主恩。"

# game/script.rpy:5378
translate Chinese thiefStory_18a20df6:

  # t "As soon as they arrive, He will instantly see me for the wretch I am. Then I will be whisked away from here again."
  t "他们一到，上帝立刻就会看清我这个卑劣之徒的真面目。到那时，我又会被强行带走了。"

# game/script.rpy:5381
translate Chinese thiefStory_ee4133e5:

  # t "My mother gave birth to 8 children - some beautiful, and some ugly."
  t "我母亲生了八个孩子——有长得漂亮的，也有长得丑的。"

# game/script.rpy:5382
translate Chinese thiefStory_a3796d40:

  # t "After much time passed, the Lord came by to visit. My parents were delighted, and they gathered the children around them."
  t "过了很久，上帝顺道来拜访。我父母欣喜若狂，把孩子们都召集在身边。"

# game/script.rpy:5383
translate Chinese thiefStory_f638e0fc:

  # t "The beautiful children were washed and bathed, and placed in newly washed shirts. However, the ugly children were placed out of sight."
  t "漂亮的孩子们沐浴更衣，换上了刚洗好的衬衫。然而，丑陋的孩子们却被藏到了看不见的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:5384
translate Chinese thiefStory_a2697d9e:

  # t "One was hidden under the straw, one under a wine barrel, one under the leather we used to cut our shoes, one under the cloth from which she made our clothes. And finally, I was placed in the coal chute."
  t "一个藏在稻草下，一个藏在酒桶下，一个藏在我们裁皮做鞋的皮革下，一个藏在她缝衣服用的布料下。最后，我被塞进了煤槽里。"

# game/script.rpy:5385
translate Chinese thiefStory_c882a073:

  # t "And so the Lord visited the house, and ended up staying there for many years."
  t "就这样，上帝拜访了这所房子，并且一住就是好多年。"

# game/script.rpy:5386
translate Chinese thiefStory_2604c380:

  # t "I saw Him often from the crack in the door to the coal chute. I cried to see His glory, and my tears carved trails of pale gold down my cheeks."
  t "我经常从煤槽门的缝隙里偷偷看他。看到他的荣光，我忍不住哭泣，泪水在我的脸颊上蚀刻出一道道淡金色的泪痕。"

# game/script.rpy:5387
translate Chinese thiefStory_df30bcee:

  # t "One day I heard my mother talk of me to the Lord, saying \"What are we to do with this one?\""
  t "有一天，我听到母亲对上帝谈论起我，她说：“这孩子我们该怎么处置呢？”"

# game/script.rpy:5388
translate Chinese thiefStory_a53bf06d_1:

  # thiefmum "Inside all good people there dwells a golden soul, given by you, oh Lord. But as soon as you look, anyone can see this one has nothing but a hollow nest of spiders and rats inside. What trade can I teach such a one as this?"
  thiefmum "所有好人的体内，都驻留着一个金子般的灵魂，那是您所赐予的，主啊。但只要您一看便知，这孩子体内不过是个空洞的蛛巢鼠穴罢了。像这样的人，我能教点什么手艺好呢？"

# game/script.rpy:5389
translate Chinese thiefStory_32448f2c:

  # t "The Lord thought on this, and said \"Bring all your children before me.\" To the first child He said:"
  t "上帝略作沉思，便说：“把你所有的孩子都带到我面前来。”他对第一个孩子说："

# game/script.rpy:5390
translate Chinese thiefStory_d4f3a11e:

  # miw "You shall become a powerful King."
  miw "你将成为权势滔天的国王。"

# game/script.rpy:5391
translate Chinese thiefStory_76d35233:

  # t "Then to the second, and third, and so on down the line:"
  t "接着是第二个、第三个，依次往下："

# game/script.rpy:5392
translate Chinese thiefStory_5f21a15e:

  # miw "You shall become a Duke."
  miw "你将成为一名公爵。"

# game/script.rpy:5393
translate Chinese thiefStory_fc983b87:

  # miw "You, a rich Merchant."
  miw "你，一名富有的商人。"

# game/script.rpy:5394
translate Chinese thiefStory_54cfe8bf:

  # miw "You, a Tanner. You, a Shoemaker. You, a Butcher. You, a Beggar."
  miw "你，去做皮匠；你，去当鞋匠；你，做屠夫；你，当乞丐。"

# game/script.rpy:5395
translate Chinese thiefStory_3bcb40db:

  # t "Then He finally reached me at the end of the line."
  t "最后，他终于走到了队伍末尾，来到了我的面前。"

# game/script.rpy:5396
translate Chinese thiefStory_bde3681e:

  # miw "And you shall be a Thief."
  miw "而你，注定要成为一名小偷。"

# game/script.rpy:5397
translate Chinese thiefStory_2da3935b_1:

  # t "My parents took me to the goblins to learn the art of Thievery as the Lord instructed."
  t "于是，我父母按照上帝的旨意，把我送去哥布林那里学习偷窃之术。"

# game/script.rpy:5398
translate Chinese thiefStory_0cdba0be_1:

  # t "One of the Goblin Queens sat and talked with me for a long time. Then they went to my parents and said:"
  t "其中一位哥布林女王坐下来跟我聊了很久。然后她走到我父母面前说："

# game/script.rpy:5399
translate Chinese thiefStory_c6005951_1:

  # goblinQueen "Your child will be taught well. We will keep them as an apprentice for one year."
  goblinQueen "我们会好好教你的孩子。这孩子要在我们这里当一年学徒。"

# game/script.rpy:5400
translate Chinese thiefStory_1ef34292_1:

  # goblinQueen "Come back then, and if you can still recognize them, I won't take any money for my services and you can take them away."
  goblinQueen "一年后再回来，如果你还能认出这孩子，我的教导就不收分文，你可以把人带走。"

# game/script.rpy:5401
translate Chinese thiefStory_0ce93db7_1:

  # goblinQueen "But if you cannot recognise them, you must give me three hundred talers, and they must be allowed to go free and do as they will."
  goblinQueen "但如果你认不出来了，就必须付我三百塔勒，并且必须还这孩子自由，任其去留自便。"

# game/script.rpy:5402
translate Chinese thiefStory_49e418e1_1:

  # t "My parents agreed, and went home. And now, that year has passed."
  t "我父母同意了，然后回了家。而现在，一年之期已满。"

# game/script.rpy:5403
translate Chinese thiefStory_5fc72027_1:

  # t "Tonight, my parents will be here soon to take me away, and they always carry the Lord in their hearts."
  t "今晚，我父母很快就会来接我走，而他们的心中常存主恩。"

# game/script.rpy:5404
translate Chinese thiefStory_eeae77ca:

  # t "As soon as they arrive, He will instantly see me for the wretch I am. Then I will be whisked away from here again, and live in the coal chute forever after."
  t "他们一到，上帝立刻就会看清我这个卑劣之徒的真面目。到那时，我又会被强行带走，永生永世与煤槽为伴。"

# game/script.rpy:5409
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_b4c06b97:

  # "They sighed."
  "小偷叹了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:5414
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_69388290:

  # t "There's still time. I can sneak away, and get myself arrested. Then I'll be safe in a jail cell for a bit." nointeract
  t "还有时间。我可以偷偷溜走，去惹点事让自己被抓起来。这样我就能在牢房里躲上一阵子，避避风头。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:5416
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_e578503d:

  # "You took their hand and squeezed it."
  "你紧紧攥住了小偷的手。"

# game/script.rpy:5417
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_a43ee74b:

  # pov "Come on. Haven't you escaped the wrath of the Lord and the Law all your life? Haven't you stolen fire and cheated death and escaped the hangman's noose at every turn?"
  pov "得了吧。你这辈子难道不是一直在躲避上帝的震怒与世俗的王法吗？你不是盗取过火种，欺骗过死神，一次次从刽子手的绞索下死里逃生吗？"

# game/script.rpy:5418
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_a4896bff:

  # pov "You've got this. No-one is better at hiding from G-d than you."
  pov "这难不倒你。没人比你更擅长瞒避天听了。"

# game/script.rpy:5419
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_3e7ea4d6:

  # "The thief held your hand tight."
  "小偷紧紧握住你的手。"

# game/script.rpy:5420
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_6c6cafac:

  # t "Thank you."
  t "谢谢你。"

# game/script.rpy:5422
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_e578503d_1:

  # "You took their hand and squeezed it."
  "你紧紧攥住了小偷的手。"

# game/script.rpy:5423
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_5276c5b5:

  # pov "Don't do that. I'll stay with you."
  pov "别干傻事。我会留下来陪你。"

# game/script.rpy:5424
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_defa155c:

  # pov "If your parents want to take you, they'll have to take both of us."
  pov "如果你父母想带走你，他们就得把我们俩一起带走。"

# game/script.rpy:5425
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_3e7ea4d6_1:

  # "The thief held your hand tight."
  "小偷紧紧握住你的手。"

# game/script.rpy:5426
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_6c6cafac_1:

  # t "Thank you."
  t "谢谢你。"

# game/script.rpy:5429
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_9fb6e95a:

  # "In a few short hours, the train stopped on a rocky stretch of coast, and the thief's mother and father came to meet it."
  "短短几个小时后，火车停在了一段岩石嶙峋的海岸上，小偷的父母走上前来迎接。"

# game/script.rpy:5431
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_e9e67b82:

  # "Midnight was approaching fast. You felt a cold chill come over you. Soon, your Godfather would come and take you away."
  "午夜将至。你感到一阵刺骨的寒意袭来。很快，你的教父就会来把你带走。"

# game/script.rpy:5432
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_d26b7f6d:

  # "The goblins lined up you and the thief with twelve goblins on a tree branch, all of you transformed to become king parrots and sparrows and magpies and birds of every type."
  "哥布林们让你和小偷连同十二个哥布林在树枝上排成一排，你们统统变成了国王鹦鹉、麻雀、喜鹊以及各种各样的鸟儿。"

# game/script.rpy:5434
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_6956d34b:

  # "Just at that moment, the clock struck midnight."
  "就在那一刻，午夜的钟声敲响了。"

# game/script.rpy:5437
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_5bfeb2de:

  # "The clouds parted and an unnatural sun shone through them, bright as a searchlight in the dark of night."
  "云层散开，一轮诡异的太阳从云缝间射出光芒，在黑夜中亮如探照灯。"

# game/script.rpy:5438
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_91b97c23:

  # "You felt the hot rays of the Lord's gaze upon you, sweeping the line of birds. Your skin blistered with sunburn as it struck you."
  "你感觉到上帝灼热的目光压了下来，一路扫过那排鸟儿。目光击中你的瞬间，你的皮肤被灼出了水泡。"

# game/script.rpy:5439
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_f178aa3a:

  # miw "Where is my godchild?"
  miw "我的教子在哪里？"

# game/script.rpy:5440
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_552f4037:

  # thiefmum "Yes. And where is my child?"
  thiefmum "是的。我的孩子在哪里？"

# game/script.rpy:5441
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_51a18364:

  # "You felt the thief shake beside you."
  "你感觉到身边的小偷在发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:5442
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_3792c104:

  # goblin4 "If you want 'em, you'll have to pick them out of the line!"
  goblin4 "想要人的话，就自己从这排鸟里把那家伙挑出来！"

# game/script.rpy:5443
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_8379d990:

  # "The Lord's gaze moved down the branch, hovering over the thief in their form as a blackbird."
  "上帝的目光顺着树枝移动，在化身黑鸟的小偷身上徘徊。"

# game/script.rpy:5444
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_0f24edf1:

  # "Their breath grew short, and they looked straight ahead, trying not to seem as though anything was wrong."
  "小偷呼吸急促，目不斜视，极力装出若无其事的样子。"

# game/script.rpy:5446
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_b43624f4:

  # "The pig looked up from the ground with anticipation and fear."
  "小猪在地上抬起头，期盼又惶恐地看着。"

# game/script.rpy:5447
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_033ebb60:

  # "After a long time, His gaze moved on down the line, hovering over each in turn. Finally, He spoke."
  "过了很久，他的目光继续在队伍中移动，依次在每只鸟儿上方游移。最终，他开口了。"

# game/script.rpy:5448
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_93551ec3:

  # miw "These are the ones we seek."
  miw "这两只就是我们要找的。"

# game/script.rpy:5449
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_aacc4656:

  # "Rays of light beamed down on two cinnamon cockatiels at the very end of the line."
  "几道光芒投射在队伍最末端的两只肉桂色玄凤鹦鹉身上。"

# game/script.rpy:5450
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_774d0b0d:

  # "With a shout they burst into smoke, and revealed themselves to be goblins."
  "随着一声大喊，它们化作一团烟雾，露出了哥布林的真面目。"

# game/script.rpy:5451
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_bb28323b:

  # "The whole line erupted into goblin smoke, and the two of you were revealed. In a flash, the goblins turned both the parents into hideous grubs which squirmed away and were buried in the dirt. The Lord cursed in disgust and vanished back behind the clouds, and the whole train leapt up in celebration."
  "整排鸟儿纷纷化作哥布林的烟雾爆开，你们俩也显出了原形。眨眼间，哥布林们就把那对父母变成了丑陋的蛆虫，它们扭动着爬走，钻进了泥土里。上帝厌恶地咒骂了一声，退回云层后消失不见了。整列火车顿时欢腾起来。"

# game/script.rpy:5454
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_76326433:

  # "The thief stared about in amazement."
  "小偷目瞪口呆地环顾四周。"

# game/script.rpy:5455
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_b189364e:

  # t "But... "
  t "可是……"

# game/script.rpy:5456
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_08a5385e:

  # t "I felt the eyes of G-d upon me. How could He not see all the rot inside me?"
  t "我感受到了主的目光落在我身上。他怎么会看不透我满心的腐朽与污秽呢？"

# game/script.rpy:5457
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_259b324a:

  # pov "There is none. There never was."
  pov "根本就没有。从来都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:5459
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_8f8f84cd:

  # goblinQueen "Choose your child out of the line, and their life will be yours once more. But fail, and you must leave them with us."
  goblinQueen "从队伍里认出你的孩子，那孩子的命就再次交由你发落。但要是认错了，你就必须把那孩子留给我们。"

# game/script.rpy:5460
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_c5fb87ba:

  # "The thief's mother stood and stared for a long time, moving down the line slowly."
  "小偷的母亲站在那里盯了很久，沿着队伍缓缓走动审视。"

# game/script.rpy:5463
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_bec81d00:

  # "As she looked over you, the clouds parted and you felt the hot, bright rays of the Lord's gaze pierce through you, lighting up every scrap of darkness and guilt in your soul. The thief shook beside you."
  "当她的目光扫过你时，云层散开，你感觉到上帝灼热、明亮的目光刺穿了你，照亮了你灵魂中每一丝黑暗与罪恶。小偷在你身边发着抖。"

# game/script.rpy:5464
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_0f24edf1_1:

  # "Their breath grew short, and they looked straight ahead, trying not to seem as though anything was wrong."
  "小偷呼吸急促，目不斜视，极力装出若无其事的样子。"

# game/script.rpy:5466
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_b43624f4_1:

  # "The pig looked up from the ground with anticipation and fear."
  "小猪在地上抬起头，期盼又惶恐地看着。"

# game/script.rpy:5467
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_3eaa8577:

  # "After a long time, she moved on down the line. She stepped away and conferred with her husband. Finally, she spoke."
  "过了很久，她继续沿着队伍往前走。她走到一旁，和丈夫商量了一下。最终，她开口了。"

# game/script.rpy:5470
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_fa316282:

  # thiefmum "This one is our child."
  thiefmum "这个是我们的孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:5471
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_177ba9a4:

  # "She pointed to a cinnamon cockatiel on the very left of the line."
  "她指着队伍最左边的一只肉桂色玄凤鹦鹉。"

# game/script.rpy:5472
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_a01ef6d3:

  # "With a shout, it burst into smoke, and revealed itself to be a goblin."
  "随着一声大喊，它化作一团烟雾，露出了哥布林的真面目。"

# game/script.rpy:5473
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_5432ded5:

  # "The whole line erupted into goblin smoke, and the two of you were revealed. In a flash, the goblins turned both the parents into hideous grubs which squirmed away and were buried in the dirt. The blazing light vanished back behind the clouds, and the whole train leapt up in celebration."
  "整排鸟儿纷纷化作哥布林的烟雾爆开，你们俩也显出了原形。眨眼间，哥布林们就把那对父母变成了丑陋的蛆虫，它们扭动着爬走，钻进了泥土里。耀眼的光芒退回云层后消失不见了。整列火车顿时欢腾起来。"

# game/script.rpy:5474
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_76326433_1:

  # "The thief stared about in amazement."
  "小偷目瞪口呆地环顾四周。"

# game/script.rpy:5475
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_b189364e_1:

  # t "But... "
  t "可是……"

# game/script.rpy:5476
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_324a1bcf:

  # t "I felt the eyes of G-d upon me. How could He not see the rot inside me?"
  t "我感受到了主的目光落在我身上。他怎么会看不透我的腐朽与污秽呢？"

# game/script.rpy:5477
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_f8487fb3:

  # pov "There's none there. There never was."
  pov "根本就没有。从来都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:5479
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_00b01b68:

  # "Just then in a puff of smoke, the Devil appeared! Your Godfather had come for you at last."
  "就在这时，伴随着一团烟雾，魔鬼出现了！你的教父终于来接你了。"

# game/script.rpy:5480
translate Chinese thiefStoryEnd_8d4e65ab:

  # mir "Well done, my crooked little friends! Always good to see The Man Upstairs outsmarted yet again."
  mir "干得漂亮，我奸诈的小朋友们！看到“老天爷”再次被戏弄，总是一件乐事。"

# game/script.rpy:5486
translate Chinese devilNever_4035c42c:

  # mir "Come along now. The Hour of Ghosts is almost up, and I need you to clean out all the boilers of hell!" nointeract
  mir "跟我走吧。群鬼游荡的时辰快结束了，我还等着你去把地狱的锅炉统统刷干净呢！" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:5488
translate Chinese devilNever_d4b2f765:

  # pov "Never!"
  pov "休想！"

# game/script.rpy:5489
translate Chinese devilNever_bf06733e:

  # t "Psst. I think I know a way out of this. Let's go with Him."
  t "嘘。我想我知道怎么脱身了。我们跟他走。"

# game/script.rpy:5493
translate Chinese devilNever_7badc3f3:

  # t "Follow my lead."
  t "听我的。"

# game/script.rpy:5494
translate Chinese devilNever_a29b374d:

  # t "May I come along too, oh Devil? Long have I wished to see the fires of Hell."
  t "我也能一起去吗，噢，魔鬼大人？我一直渴望见识一下地狱的烈焰。"

# game/script.rpy:5495
translate Chinese devilNever_7bbba368:

  # mir "Bah! We have so many thieves already. Why would I need another?"
  mir "呸！我们那儿的小偷已经够多了。我要再来一个干什么？"

# game/script.rpy:5496
translate Chinese devilNever_9941677b:

  # t "But I am the sovereign of thieves, and all crooks owe me allegiance."
  t "可我是小偷之王，所有恶棍都得向我效忠。"

# game/script.rpy:5497
translate Chinese devilNever_573fcf06:

  # "And they proved it by stealing the Devil's golden tooth right out of his mouth. The Devil snatched it back with a snarl."
  "为了证明这一点，小偷竟然从魔鬼嘴里把金牙给偷了出来。魔鬼咆哮着把金牙一把夺了回去。"

# game/script.rpy:5498
translate Chinese devilNever_54b93db8:

  # mir "Very well! A fine prize you shall make for my servants."
  mir "很好！你正好能给我那些手下当件绝妙的玩物。"

# game/script.rpy:5499
translate Chinese devilNever_51d872d2:

  # "And the three of you set along the path to hell, with the Devil rubbing His hands gleefully. As you walked, you passed a cherry tree full of red fruits."
  "于是，你们三个踏上了去往地狱的路，魔鬼在一旁得意地搓着手。走着走着，你们经过了一棵结满红果实的樱桃树。"

# game/script.rpy:5500
translate Chinese devilNever_f41d8e66:

  # t "Devil, please, if I may make one last request... may you please climb up that tree and hand us some cherries?"
  t "魔鬼大人，拜托了，容我再提最后一个请求吧……您能爬上那棵树，给我们摘些樱桃吗？"

# game/script.rpy:5501
translate Chinese devilNever_37d5c976:

  # "Believing the two of you to be broken, the Devil agreed. But as soon as he was on the tree, the thief whipped out a vial of salt. In a wink they drew a circle around the tree in chalk, and the old serpent was stuck to a branch as if He was glued to it."
  "魔鬼以为你们俩的意志已经崩溃，便答应了。但他刚一上树，小偷就猛地掏出一小瓶盐。眨眼之间，小偷用粉笔在树周围画了一个圈，这古蛇顿时被牢牢粘在树枝上，动弹不得。"

# game/script.rpy:5502
translate Chinese devilNever_9519dde4:

  # mir "NOOOOOOOOOOOO!"
  mir "不————————！"

# game/script.rpy:5503
translate Chinese devilNever_b3e825be:

  # mir "Foolish mortal - you will pay dearly for this!"
  mir "愚蠢的凡人——你们会为此付出惨痛的代价！"

# game/script.rpy:5504
translate Chinese devilNever_8c0fd7b9:

  # t "Throw down my friend's contract, and I'll release you!"
  t "把我朋友的契约扔下来，我就放了你！"

# game/script.rpy:5505
translate Chinese devilNever_09067600:

  # "The Evil One refused for a long time, baring his teeth, wailing, and spreading an indescribable stench."
  "这恶者死活不肯答应，他龇牙咧嘴，凄厉哀嚎，还散发出一股难以名状的恶臭。"

# game/script.rpy:5506
translate Chinese devilNever_9eba17dd:

  # "But soon, the Hour of Ghosts was about to end, and the Goatfoot risked losing his reign forever, which wore Him down (As you can imagine)."
  "但很快，群鬼游荡的时辰就要结束了。如果赶不回去，羊蹄魔王就面临着永远丧失王权的危机，这让他终于泄了气（你也想象得到）。"

# game/script.rpy:5507
translate Chinese devilNever_3ac848a0:

  # mir "Fine. Take it, then."
  mir "好吧。那就拿去吧。"

# game/script.rpy:5508
translate Chinese devilNever_55d63bd3:

  # "He unscrewed his left horn, took out a yellowed parchment and threw it down. You recognised it as your Mother's handwriting, and in an instant you tore it into a thousand pieces. You felt a great weight lift from you."
  "他拧下左角的角尖，掏出一张发黄的羊皮纸扔了下来。你认出那是母亲的笔迹，并立刻将它撕得粉碎。你感觉到身上的一副千斤重担卸了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:5513
translate Chinese devilNever_9c494272:

  # mir "Now let me go!" nointeract
  mir "现在放我走！" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:5515
translate Chinese devilNever_3cca8ae7:

  # "You nodded to the thief, and they use a pouch of mysterious coal dust to draw a circle around the tree."
  "你向小偷点了点头，那家伙掏出一袋神秘的煤灰，在树周围画了个圈。"

# game/script.rpy:5516
translate Chinese devilNever_c08127ac:

  # "The Devil was gone like the wind in an instant, cackling and spreading a terrible stench and causing misery and woe behind him. And He plagues the earth still."
  "魔鬼在一阵狂笑与令人作呕的恶臭中瞬间如风般遁逃，所过之处留下一片苦难与哀号。直到今天，他依然在世间作祟。"

# game/script.rpy:5517
translate Chinese devilNever_d3b23759:

  # t "You're free now."
  t "你现在自由了。"

# game/script.rpy:5519
translate Chinese devilNever_191e3f4e:

  # "But you left Lucifer standing on that cherry-tree, stomping His feet and pulling out His hair and turning the air black with curses. And He stays there to this day."
  "但你们把路西法留在了那棵樱桃树上。他气得直跺脚，拼命扯着自己的头发，骂出的脏话把空气都染黑了。而且，他至今还待在那儿呢。"

# game/script.rpy:5520
translate Chinese devilNever_d3b23759_1:

  # t "You're free now."
  t "你现在自由了。"

# game/script.rpy:5521
translate Chinese devilNever_0513f561:

  # "The sounds of goblin celebration erupted all around you."
  "哥布林们庆祝的欢呼声在你周围爆发。"

# game/script.rpy:5522
translate Chinese devilNever_1d93e118:

  # "You wrapped the Master Thief in a crushing bear hug, and lifted them up on your shoulders."
  "你给了神偷一个几乎让人窒息的熊抱，然后把小偷扛在了肩膀上。"

# game/script.rpy:5524
translate Chinese devilNever_de5a1c90:

  # "You were both free at last."
  "你们俩终于都自由了。"

# game/script.rpy:5526
translate Chinese devilNever_6d6e2410:

  # "The pig leapt up joyfully into your arms, and you passed it up to the thief to lift aloft in triumph."
  "小猪欢快地跃入你的怀中，你把它递给小偷，让其高高举起以示胜利。"

# game/script.rpy:5529
translate Chinese devilNever_fe4e49ae:

  # "You leapt on the goblin train, and the thief and the goblins danced and celebrated all through the night."
  "你们跳上哥布林列车，小偷和哥布林们整夜都在跳舞庆祝。"

# game/script.rpy:5540
translate Chinese thiefEnd_80693906:

  # "After many adventures, the Goblin Queen married you on the train. There was a joyous goblin riot for forty days and forty nights."
  "经历了诸多冒险之后，哥布林女王在火车上为你主持了婚礼。随之而来的哥布林狂欢持续了四十天四十夜。"

# game/script.rpy:5542
translate Chinese thiefEnd_d98e73ba:

  # "Your pig watched over the wedding ceremony with tears in his eyes, and stayed with you as your constant companion and friend."
  "你的小猪热泪盈眶地注视着婚礼仪式，作为你忠实的伙伴和朋友一直陪伴着你。"

# game/script.rpy:5543
translate Chinese thiefEnd_1e3fe138:

  # "You lived there in happiness for all of your days, venturing from place to place with wild abandon."
  "你在那里度过了幸福的余生，纵情恣意地四处游历冒险。"

# game/script.rpy:5548
translate Chinese thiefEnd_f51cc105:

  # "You live there still, rattling across the whole world on the Goblin Train, and you will have no rest until the Day of Judgement."
  "你至今仍生活在那里，乘坐哥布林列车轰隆隆地穿梭于整个世界，直到审判日降临也不曾停歇。"

# game/script.rpy:5549
translate Chinese thiefEnd_a20cefa7:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:5550
translate Chinese thiefEnd_00620a41:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:5551
translate Chinese thiefEnd_60dd08ff:

  # "And what happened to the mushroom, you ask?"
  "你问那个蘑菇后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:5555
translate Chinese thiefEnd_8751f68b:

  # "You lived on the train in happiness with your friend the thief for all of your days, venturing from place to place with wild abandon."
  "你和你的小偷朋友在列车上幸福地度过了余生，无拘无束地四处游历冒险。"

# game/script.rpy:5557
translate Chinese thiefEnd_f2baf8d2:

  # "Your pig wished you a fond farewell, and went to live in his kingdom in the mountains."
  "你的小猪向你依依惜别，前往他群山之中的王国生活。"

# game/script.rpy:5559
translate Chinese thiefEnd_cc375450:

  # "Your pig stayed with you as your constant companion and friend."
  "你的小猪留了下来，成了你形影不离的朋友与伙伴。"

# game/script.rpy:5564
translate Chinese thiefEnd_f51cc105_1:

  # "You live there still, rattling across the whole world on the Goblin Train, and you will have no rest until the Day of Judgement."
  "你至今仍生活在那里，乘坐哥布林列车轰隆隆地穿梭于整个世界，直到审判日降临也不曾停歇。"

# game/script.rpy:5565
translate Chinese thiefEnd_a20cefa7_1:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:5566
translate Chinese thiefEnd_00620a41_1:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:5567
translate Chinese thiefEnd_60dd08ff_1:

  # "And what happened to the mushroom, you ask?"
  "你问那个蘑菇后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:5570
translate Chinese thiefEnd_1b54ed88:

  # "In the morning, you were faced with a choice. "
  "清晨到来时，你面临着一个抉择。"

# game/script.rpy:5571
translate Chinese thiefEnd_0c32ee5e:

  # "Because you had not yet tasted the goblin fruits, you could still return to your family and the world of humans."
  "因为还未品尝过哥布林的果实，你依然可以重返人类世界，回到家人身边。"

# game/script.rpy:5578
translate Chinese thiefEnd_20500802:

  # "You bade a tearful farewell to the thief, and returned back to your world among the humans, where you lived for many years in joyous happiness."
  "你含泪向小偷告别，回到了人类世界，在那里度过了许多年幸福快乐的时光。"

# game/script.rpy:5582
translate Chinese thiefEnd_403fa557:

  # "There you stayed for the rest of your days, growing slowly older. On cold nights, you swear you could still hear the whistle of the Goblin Train, and the laughter of the thief in the wind."
  "你在那里度过了余生，慢慢老去。在寒冷的夜晚，你恍惚间依然能听见风中传来哥布林列车的汽笛，以及那小偷的笑声。"

# game/script.rpy:5584
translate Chinese thiefEnd_3ef8bdc9:

  # "And then came an elephant with a very long snout, and it blew the story out."
  "大象长长鼻子一卷，故事就此随风不见。"

# game/script.rpy:5586
translate Chinese thiefEnd_a20cefa7_2:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:5587
translate Chinese thiefEnd_00620a41_2:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:5588
translate Chinese thiefEnd_ad6a9690:

  # "What happened to the mushroom, you ask?"
  "你问那个蘑菇后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:5592
translate Chinese thiefEnd_8751f68b_1:

  # "You lived on the train in happiness with your friend the thief for all of your days, venturing from place to place with wild abandon."
  "你和你的小偷朋友在列车上幸福地度过了余生，无拘无束地四处游历冒险。"

# game/script.rpy:5594
translate Chinese thiefEnd_f2baf8d2_1:

  # "Your pig wished you a fond farewell, and went to live in his kingdom in the mountains."
  "你的小猪向你依依惜别，前往他群山之中的王国生活。"

# game/script.rpy:5596
translate Chinese thiefEnd_4bb3e860:

  # "Your pig stayed there as your constant companion and friend."
  "你的小猪留在了那里，成了你形影不离的朋友与伙伴。"

# game/script.rpy:5601
translate Chinese thiefEnd_f51cc105_2:

  # "You live there still, rattling across the whole world on the Goblin Train, and you will have no rest until the Day of Judgement."
  "你至今仍生活在那里，乘坐哥布林列车轰隆隆地穿梭于整个世界，直到审判日降临也不曾停歇。"

# game/script.rpy:5602
translate Chinese thiefEnd_a20cefa7_3:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:5603
translate Chinese thiefEnd_00620a41_3:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:5604
translate Chinese thiefEnd_60dd08ff_2:

  # "And what happened to the mushroom, you ask?"
  "你问那个蘑菇后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:5608
translate Chinese thiefEnd_80693906_1:

  # "After many adventures, the Goblin Queen married you on the train. There was a joyous goblin riot for forty days and forty nights."
  "经历了诸多冒险之后，哥布林女王在火车上为你主持了婚礼。随之而来的哥布林狂欢持续了四十天四十夜。"

# game/script.rpy:5610
translate Chinese thiefEnd_a5a4149a:

  # "Your pig watched over the wedding ceremony with tears in his eyes."
  "你的小猪热泪盈眶地在一旁守望着你们的婚礼。"

# game/script.rpy:5612
translate Chinese thiefEnd_13575066:

  # "After the wedding he wished you a fond farewell, and went to live in his kingdom in the mountains."
  "婚礼结束后，他向你依依惜别，回到了他群山之中的王国生活。"

# game/script.rpy:5614
translate Chinese thiefEnd_11593093:

  # "After the wedding, he stayed with you there as your constant companion and friend."
  "婚礼结束后，他留在那里，作为你忠实的伙伴和朋友一直陪伴着你。"

# game/script.rpy:5619
translate Chinese thiefEnd_5849e2f8:

  # "And if you have not died, you live there still. On windless nights, your siblings whisper that they can hear your laughter, and the rattling wheels of the goblin train."
  "若是尚未离世，想必你至今仍生活在那里。在无风的夜晚，你的兄弟姐妹们会窃窃私语，说他们能听见你的笑声，还有哥布林列车隆隆的车轮声。"

# game/script.rpy:5621
translate Chinese thiefEnd_a20cefa7_4:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:5622
translate Chinese thiefEnd_00620a41_4:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:5623
translate Chinese thiefEnd_ad6a9690_1:

  # "What happened to the mushroom, you ask?"
  "你问那个蘑菇后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:5628
translate Chinese thiefDeath_b4d71b52:

  # "But youth does not last forever."
  "但青春无法永驻。"

# game/script.rpy:5629
translate Chinese thiefDeath_ff76ab68:

  # "One day, you felt yourself wracked with a terrible fever."
  "有一天，你发了一场可怕的高烧，备受折磨。"

# game/script.rpy:5630
translate Chinese thiefDeath_1b6cb54d:

  # "Then, you felt gout take hold of you and make all your limbs twitch, and you were bedeviled with one illness after another, and you fell into deep sleep for long days."
  "接着，痛风找上了你，引得四肢不停抽搐；接二连三的病痛折磨着你，让你陷入了漫长的昏睡。"

# game/script.rpy:5632
translate Chinese thiefDeath_6247ec6e:

  # "Neither the goblins nor the thief nor your loyal pig could help you, though they travelled through the land stealing the most priceless medicines and remedies for you."
  "无论是哥布林、小偷还是你忠诚的小猪，都对你的病情束手无策，尽管他们跑遍了整片大陆，为你偷来了最名贵的药材与偏方。"

# game/script.rpy:5634
translate Chinese thiefDeath_dab0dc87:

  # "Neither the goblins nor the thief could help you, though they travelled through the land stealing the most priceless medicines and remedies for you."
  "无论是哥布林还是小偷，都对你的病情无能为力，尽管他们跑遍了整片大陆，为你偷来了最名贵的药材与偏方。"

# game/script.rpy:5635
translate Chinese thiefDeath_ca33c070:

  # t "We still have places left to try. Next we'll raid the treasure-palace of the lord of the plague doctors -"
  t "我们还有没试过的地方。接下来我们就去洗劫瘟医领主的藏宝宫殿——"

# game/script.rpy:5636
translate Chinese thiefDeath_ec1df498:

  # pov "Don't worry. I won't die until Death sends Her messengers."
  pov "别担心。死神降下她的信使之前，我是不会死的。"

# game/script.rpy:5637
translate Chinese thiefDeath_ebd3db2d:

  # "But as you spoke, there was a knock on the door, and the goblins opened it to reveal the wise mushroom from the forest."
  "但话音未落，敲门声响了。哥布林们打开门，门外站着的正是森林里那株睿智的蘑菇。"

# game/script.rpy:5639
translate Chinese thiefDeath_fe45266e:

  # m "I suppose my curse won't be needed after all."
  m "看来我的诅咒终究是用不上了。"

# game/script.rpy:5640
translate Chinese thiefDeath_77865824:

  # m "It is time. Come with me."
  m "时候到了。跟我走吧。"

# game/script.rpy:5647
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_71b3ca75:

  # m "The mother of mushrooms is waiting for you." nointeract
  m "蘑菇之母在等你。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:5649
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_a8ebb631:

  # pov "But - is She going to break her promise? She said She'd send three messengers."
  pov "可是——难道她要食言吗？她说过会派三位信使来的。"

# game/script.rpy:5650
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_ae936415:

  # m "Didn't the fever rage at you? Didn't the Gout take hold of you and shake you to pieces?"
  m "难道高烧不曾折磨过你吗？难道痛风不曾纠缠过你，把你的身体扯得支离破碎吗？"

# game/script.rpy:5651
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_fcacbdb8:

  # m "She even sent her sister, Sleep, to remind you of Her."
  m "她甚至派出了她的妹妹——沉睡，来提醒你她的存在。"

# game/script.rpy:5652
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_9991443a:

  # m "She has sent all her messengers. Now you must come down to Her kingdom."
  m "她已经派出了所有的信使。现在，你必须随我下到她的国度了。"

# game/script.rpy:5657
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_74a10a00:

  # pov "Can I say goodbye first?"
  pov "我能先道个别吗？"

# game/script.rpy:5658
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_29362efd:

  # m "Of course."
  m "当然可以。"

# game/script.rpy:5660
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_c650d488:

  # "You turned to the goblins, the thief, and the pig."
  "你转过头，看向哥布林们、小偷和小猪。"

# game/script.rpy:5662
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_eab40698:

  # "You turned to the goblins and the thief."
  "你转过头，看向哥布林们和小偷。"

# game/script.rpy:5669
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_48057142:

  # pov "Goodbye, my dear. I love you, so much."
  pov "再见，亲爱的。我爱你，非常爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:5670
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_74488757:

  # t "I love you too."
  t "我也爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:5672
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_75aa0994:

  # "The thief, the pig and all the goblins embraced you in a warm, furry hug, and their tears fell upon you."
  "小偷、小猪和所有的哥布林给了你一个温暖又毛茸茸的拥抱，泪水纷纷滴落在你身上。"

# game/script.rpy:5674
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_fc5ced5f:

  # "The thief and all the goblins embraced you in a warm, furry hug, and their tears fell upon you."
  "小偷和所有的哥布林给了你一个温暖又毛茸茸的拥抱，泪水纷纷滴落在你身上。"

# game/script.rpy:5675
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_fb87ec17:

  # t "I'm sorry I couldn't do more. You should have chosen someone else. Maybe if you'd-"
  t "对不起，我能为你做的太少了。你本该选择别人的。要是当初你——"

# game/script.rpy:5676
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_5337c22f:

  # pov "Shh. I chose you. You have nothing to be sorry about."
  pov "嘘。我选择了你。你不欠我什么。"

# game/script.rpy:5677
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_ad8dc856:

  # "And you gripped them tight."
  "你紧紧回抱住他们。"

# game/script.rpy:5680
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_347bbd31:

  # pov "Goodbye, all of you. I will remember you always."
  pov "再见，各位。我会永远记住你们的。"

# game/script.rpy:5681
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_42bef879:

  # t "Goodbye."
  t "再见。"

# game/script.rpy:5683
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_75aa0994_1:

  # "The thief, the pig and all the goblins embraced you in a warm, furry hug, and their tears fell upon you."
  "小偷、小猪和所有的哥布林给了你一个温暖又毛茸茸的拥抱，泪水纷纷滴落在你身上。"

# game/script.rpy:5685
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_fc5ced5f_1:

  # "The thief and all the goblins embraced you in a warm, furry hug, and their tears fell upon you."
  "小偷和所有的哥布林给了你一个温暖又毛茸茸的拥抱，泪水纷纷滴落在你身上。"

# game/script.rpy:5686
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_f5850665:

  # t "I'm sorry I couldn't do more for you. You should have chosen someone else. Maybe if you'd-"
  t "对不起，我能为你做的太少了。你本该选择别人的。要是当初你——"

# game/script.rpy:5687
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_5337c22f_1:

  # pov "Shh. I chose you. You have nothing to be sorry about."
  pov "嘘。我选择了你。你不欠我什么。"

# game/script.rpy:5688
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_ad8dc856_1:

  # "And you gripped them tight."
  "你紧紧回抱住他们。"

# game/script.rpy:5691
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_31f4e52f:

  # pov "Alright. I'm ready."
  pov "好了。我准备好了。"

# game/script.rpy:5692
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_cb738ab6:

  # m "No-one's ever ready. But there's no time left."
  m "从来就没人能真正准备好。但已经没时间了。"

# game/script.rpy:5693
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_5cfba400:

  # "She gently took you down to the kingdom of Death."
  "她轻柔地带着你，向死神的国度沉去。"

# game/script.rpy:5695
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_d148c16f:

  # "And what you did after that, none who live can say."
  "至于那之后你经历了什么，生者无人知晓。"

# game/script.rpy:5697
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_a20cefa7:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:5698
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_00620a41:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:5699
translate Chinese deathThiefQuestions_ad6a9690:

  # "What happened to the mushroom, you ask?"
  "你问那个蘑菇后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:5811
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_9f109c84:

  # "After you fled, the mushroom was left standing outside her tree. She looked out at the vanishing smoke of the goblin train in the distance and sighed."
  "你们逃走后，蘑菇独自站在她的巨树边。她望着远方哥布林列车渐渐消散的烟雾，叹了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:5814
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_0713799d:

  # "A giant hole had been torn in the strangler fig, and the untold riches of her domain were leaking out all over the place."
  "绞杀榕被撞出了一个大洞，她领地里数不尽的财宝正从里面四处洒落。"

# game/script.rpy:5820
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_e9816027:

  # m "Oh well."
  m "唉，罢了。"

# game/script.rpy:5823
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_9ba1eed9:

  # m2 "Nothing to do about it now."
  m2 "现在也无能为力了。"

# game/script.rpy:5826
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_b4df1798:

  # m3 "Perhaps a drink?"
  m3 "不如喝一杯？"

# game/script.rpy:5829
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_5d99a6cf:

  # "She pulled a bottle of wine from one of the scattered treasure-piles that had fallen out in the commotion, and popped the cork."
  "财宝在骚乱中洒落一地，她从散乱的宝物堆里抽出一瓶酒，拔掉了软木塞。"

# game/script.rpy:5832
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_f611c3f6:

  # m2 "Wonderful idea, darling."
  m2 "好主意，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:5835
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_14f793a1:

  # m2 "We can always start the cleanup tomorrow."
  m2 "反正明天再收拾也不迟。"

# game/script.rpy:5839
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_d227d624:

  # m "Sisters... does the sky seem darker than normal to you?"
  m "姐妹们……你们觉不觉得这天看起来比平时还要黑？"

# game/script.rpy:5842
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_8eef503b:

  # m3 "Hmmm?"
  m3 "嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:5845
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_cd0c98a7:

  # "They looked out into the night."
  "她们望向夜空。"

# game/script.rpy:5848
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_f6ec22e3:

  # "There was a sound from the trees. Like the howling of the wind."
  "树林间传来一阵声响，听上去像是风的嚎叫。"

# game/script.rpy:5851
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_3251b85f:

  # m3 "Oh no. No."
  m3 "噢，不。不。"

# game/script.rpy:5856
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_1e87e202:

  # "She rushed back inside and slammed the door behind her."
  "她冲回屋内，重重地关上了门。"

# game/script.rpy:5857
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_903bdbc9:

  # m2 "Courage. We knew this day would come."
  m2 "勇敢点。我们早知道会有这一天。"

# game/script.rpy:5858
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_abf2583c:

  # m3 "I just didn't realise it would be so soon!"
  m3 "我只是没想到这一天会来得这么快！"

# game/script.rpy:5859
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_b73d8ad2:

  # m "We'll have to run. Come on-"
  m "我们得赶紧跑。快来——"

# game/script.rpy:5862
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_51728611:

  # "But as she looked around for her sisters, she realised she was alone."
  "但当她环顾四周寻找姐妹时，才意识到这里只有她自己。"

# game/script.rpy:5863
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_79c61455:

  # "There was only one mushroom there. Standing alone, in the centre of an empty room."
  "这里只有一株蘑菇，孤零零地站在空荡荡的房间中央。"

# game/script.rpy:5864
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_67ac72e8:

  # "There had never been anything more."
  "从来就没有什么别的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:5865
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_64fa0d26:

  # "The treasure was gone. The floorboards were bare."
  "财宝不见了。地板光秃秃的。"

# game/script.rpy:5866
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_937af0f9:

  # "Through the hole in the tree, she could see the night sky. There were no stars."
  "透过树洞，她看到了夜空。那里没有星星。"

# game/script.rpy:5873
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_eddf763d:

  # "She grabbed the bottle of wine, ran to her hidden chamber and locked the door tight."
  "她抓起酒瓶，逃进密室，把门紧紧锁住。"

# game/script.rpy:5874
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_51a69870:

  # "It was too late, of course."
  "当然，太迟了。"

# game/script.rpy:5877
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_1eb86ccf:

  # "The wolf was already inside."
  "狼已经在里面了。"

# game/script.rpy:5879
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_0ce433a8:

  # "She turned to grab the door and escape."
  "她转过身去抓门把手，想要逃离。"

# game/script.rpy:5880
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_590f207d:

  # "But there was no door. There never was. Nothing but smooth, featureless wall."
  "但是那里没有门。从来就没有。除了光秃平滑的墙壁，什么都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:5881
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_6a7ce233:

  # "She turned, and held the bottle up like a club."
  "她转过身，把酒瓶像棍棒一样举了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:5882
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_5948c0d8:

  # m "Get out, beast. It's not time yet. Get out."
  m "滚出去，畜生。时候未到。滚出去。"

# game/script.rpy:5886
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_10b13570:

  # "Get out, Mushroom?"
  "滚出去，小蘑菇？"

# game/script.rpy:5887
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_bb0aee91:

  # "But how?"
  "可是怎么出去呢？"

# game/script.rpy:5888
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_a7320309:

  # "This room is the only thing that exists. There is nothing outside. There is nowhere but here."
  "这间屋子是唯一存在的空间。外面什么都没有。除了这里，无处可去。"

# game/script.rpy:5889
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_a30759af:

  # "That's the way it's always been."
  "一直都是如此。"

# game/script.rpy:5890
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_078b2c09:

  # "She screamed and clawed at the walls."
  "她尖叫着，抓挠着墙壁。"

# game/script.rpy:5891
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_ca866848:

  # "But there were no walls."
  "但那里并没有墙壁。"

# game/script.rpy:5892
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_812181f8:

  # "There were no doors. There were no windows. There was no floor."
  "没有门。没有窗户。没有地板。"

# game/script.rpy:5893
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_1afe8e46:

  # "There was no air. There was no light. There was no space."
  "没有空气。没有光线。没有空间。"

# game/script.rpy:5902
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_d8d1464d:

  # "And then there was nothing at all."
  "然后，就什么都没有了。"

# game/script.rpy:5903
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_84b5a8f0:

  # "Nothing but a bottle of wine, that fell through the emptiness and smashed into pieces."
  "只剩下一瓶酒，跌落虚空，摔得粉碎。"

# game/script.rpy:5905
translate Chinese mushroomDisappears_b65b5631:

  # "It was never seen or heard from again."
  "从此，它便彻底销声匿迹。"

# game/script.rpy:5914
translate Chinese thiefSolo_8e71b353:

  # "A thousand goblin shapes writhed up out of the train to hold up the thief in celebration, and you heard a cheer rise up from a thousand goblin throats."
  "成千上万的哥布林从火车里涌出，把小偷高高举起以示庆祝，你听到欢呼声从数千个哥布林的喉咙里爆发出来。"

# game/script.rpy:5915
translate Chinese thiefSolo_0a465d83:

  # "Some had the heads of bats, some had the paws of cats, six heads, three heads, five arms, ten tails, and they bristled with tails and wings and fur and scales."
  "有些长着蝙蝠脑袋，有些长着猫爪，有的六个头，有的三个头，还有的长着五条胳膊、十条尾巴，它们浑身竖立着尾巴、翅膀，覆满了皮毛与鳞片。"

# game/script.rpy:5916
translate Chinese thiefSolo_5def37d6:

  # "One crawled like a snail, one prowled like a wombat, one looked like seven doves tied together with string. All of them had a chaos of forms the likes of which you had never seen."
  "一只像蜗牛般蠕动，一只像袋熊般游荡，还有一只看起来像是被绳子拴在一起的七只鸽子。它们形态千奇百怪，都是你生平从未见过的。"

# game/script.rpy:5917
translate Chinese thiefSolo_9e56f357:

  # "A dozen hands clapped you on the back and drew you into the train carriage."
  "十几只手拍打着你的后背，把你拉进了火车车厢。"

# game/script.rpy:5918
translate Chinese thiefSolo_042ffcf2:

  # goblin1 "Have a drink with us! Any friend of the thief's is a friend of ours."
  goblin1 "和我们喝一杯吧！小偷的朋友就是我们的朋友。"

# game/script.rpy:5919
translate Chinese thiefSolo_c35a6069:

  # goblin2 "Aye, it's good to see them come back in one piece."
  goblin2 "是啊，真高兴看到那家伙完好无损地回来了。"

# game/script.rpy:5920
translate Chinese thiefSolo_495f97fa:

  # goblin3 "We sent them out on a training mission, you see. To steal from..."
  goblin3 "瞧，我们派那家伙去执行训练任务了。去偷……"

# game/script.rpy:5921
translate Chinese thiefSolo_c05cf63b:

  # goblin2 "To steal... from..."
  goblin2 "去偷……"

# game/script.rpy:5922
translate Chinese thiefSolo_e722eebd:

  # "A vague and desperate confusion settled on their faces."
  "他们的脸上浮现出一种茫然无措而又绝望的困惑。"

# game/script.rpy:5923
translate Chinese thiefSolo_dd7f73c2:

  # t "Barkeep! Drinks for everyone, on me!"
  t "酒保！大家随便喝，算我账上！"

# game/script.rpy:5924
translate Chinese thiefSolo_2c4a5f0f:

  # "The confusion cleared as the goblins all joined together in a roar of approval."
  "随着哥布林们齐声爆发出赞许的欢呼，那份困惑顿时一扫而空。"

# game/script.rpy:5936
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_332c8036:

  # "You fell into a chair and looked around."
  "你瘫坐在一把椅子上，环顾四周。"

# game/script.rpy:5939
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_6c685cc3:

  # "This part of the train was some kind of bar or gambling hall. Looking up through a maze of trapdoors in the roof, you could see there were many floors stacked above this one. Bathhouses, gardens, workshops and observatories."
  "火车的这一部分似乎是个酒吧或者赌场。透过车顶如迷宫般交错的活板门向上看去，你能发现上面还叠着好几层。有澡堂、花园、作坊和天文台。"

# game/script.rpy:5941
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_cdf8b1e9:

  # "Your pig nestled into the chair beside you and began to chat to the nearby goblins in the language of mud."
  "你的小猪舒服地窝在旁边的椅子里，开始用泥巴的语言和附近的哥布林聊起天来。"

# game/script.rpy:5942
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_9cd18470:

  # "The thief whirled through the room - juggling, twisting, dancing, the life of the party."
  "小偷在房间里飞舞旋转——抛接杂耍、扭动身姿、翩翩起舞，简直是派对的灵魂人物。"

# game/script.rpy:5943
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_0002190c:

  # "Something was wrong with the inside of the carriage. You couldn't put your finger on it."
  "车厢里有些不对劲。但你也说不上来具体是哪里不对。"

# game/script.rpy:5944
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_7b3fcc27:

  # "Something you couldn't see. In your blind spot."
  "是一些你看不见的东西。潜藏在你的盲区里。"

# game/script.rpy:5950
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_d745715f:

  # "A team of goblins hung off the back of the train and picked up the tracks behind it, then climbed around to hand the tracks to the goblins at the front, who laid them in front of the train as it squeezed through the trees of the forest."
  "一队哥布林挂在火车尾部，收起刚驶过的铁轨，然后顺着车身爬到车头递过去；车头的哥布林则赶在火车挤过林木之前，飞快地把它们铺在车前。"

# game/script.rpy:5951
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_7da01306:

  # "The wind howled like a wild beast."
  "狂风如野兽般嚎叫着。"

# game/script.rpy:5952
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_46d55367:

  # t "Let's get some music going!"
  t "奏乐！"

# game/script.rpy:5955
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_19e0f22d:

  # "The goblin band struck up a wild tune. The thief gestured to push them to play louder and louder until you couldn't even hear the wind outside."
  "哥布林乐队奏起了一支狂野的曲子。小偷挥着手示意他们奏得再响些、再响些，直到你根本听不见外面的风声。"

# game/script.rpy:5956
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_93bd1081:

  # "You felt your vision warping, for some reason you couldn't define. Like staring into a magic eye puzzle."
  "你的视线开始莫名扭曲，原因难以名状。就像是盯着一张三维错觉图。"

# game/script.rpy:5962
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_d4e11551:

  # "The goblins poured you dozens of goblin brews, bubbling ales and steaming warm ciders, goblin wines that oozed with red fog and goblin brandies that froze and melted and froze again as you drank them."
  "哥布林们给你倒了几十杯哥布林特酿。有冒着气泡的麦芽酒、蒸腾着热气的温苹果酒、氤氲着红雾的哥布林葡萄酒，还有一种哥布林白兰地，在你饮用时，酒液会不断结冰、融化、再结冰。"

# game/script.rpy:5963
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_53e314f0:

  # "The thief challenged the largest goblin to a drinking competition and drank them under the table."
  "小偷向体型最大的那只哥布林发起了拼酒挑战，把对方喝趴在了桌底。"

# game/script.rpy:5964
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_634dc700:

  # "Foolishly, you drank deeply of the brews. You guzzled them down until you could drink no more, until your vision was a haze and the brew ran down your mouth and drenched your clothes, and still you thirsted for them."
  "你鬼迷心窍地大口痛饮起这些佳酿。你贪婪地把它们灌下肚，直到再也喝不下一滴，直到视线模糊，酒水顺着嘴角流下浸透了衣服，你却依然对它们充满渴望。"

# game/script.rpy:5965
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_05c96d8c:

  # "From that day on, no other drink would ever be able to quench your thirst, and you would always shiver and feel cold without the wild drunken feeling of warmth the goblin drinks gave you."
  "从那天起，世间再也没有任何饮料能解你的渴，如果尝不到哥布林酒液带来的那种狂野醉人的温暖，你就会永远在战栗与寒冷中度过。"

# game/script.rpy:5970
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_8b0a6fbf:

  # "You managed to corner the thief as they laughed in a group of goblins."
  "小偷正和一群哥布林有说有笑，你好不容易才把那家伙堵住。"

# game/script.rpy:5971
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_01d81847:

  # pov "Why did you grab me and take me here?"
  pov "你为什么要抓住我，把我带到这里？"

# game/script.rpy:5972
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_7405edb5:

  # t "It is my nature! Nothing more."
  t "这就是我的本性！仅此而已。"

# game/script.rpy:5973
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_6c702751:

  # t "I am the greatest thief of my generation. I was raised by these goblins to steal the moon and sun and stars, and now I have stolen you away."
  t "我是我这代人中最伟大的小偷。我是被这些哥布林养大的，为了偷走日月星辰，而现在，我偷走了你。"

# game/script.rpy:5974
translate Chinese thiefSoloMenu_f579cd87:

  # "They laughed wildly. Their face was slick with sweat."
  "小偷狂笑着，脸上布满了汗水。"

# game/script.rpy:5992
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_95593600:

  # t "Nothing at all!"
  t "一点事都没有！"

# game/script.rpy:5993
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_d940ed94:

  # "They wiped the sweat from their forehead and gave you a charming smile. Their fingers were twisting and twitching rapidly, like they couldn't keep still."
  "小偷擦去额角的汗水，冲你展露迷人的微笑。但手指却在快速扭转抽搐着，仿佛一刻也停不下来。"

# game/script.rpy:5994
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_296e70fe:

  # t "Everything is as it should be. In fact, this is the best it's ever been. Come, let us dance!"
  t "一切都本该如此。事实上，现在的感觉前所未有地好。来吧，让我们共舞！"

# game/script.rpy:5995
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_48f4ee12:

  # "They took your hand in a dance that spiralled out of control. The music was deafening. The goblin faces whirled around you until you were breathless."
  "小偷拉着你的手跳起舞来，舞步渐渐失控。音乐震耳欲聋。哥布林们的脸在你周围旋转，让你喘不过气来。"

# game/script.rpy:6003
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_f392e4d5:

  # t "Nonsense! There's so much joy to be had here. Stay, and celebrate with us."
  t "胡说！这里有数不尽的乐趣。留下来，和我们一起庆祝。"

# game/script.rpy:6004
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_3cda9500:

  # "Their smile slipped for an instant."
  "小偷的笑容僵滞了一瞬。"

# game/script.rpy:6005
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_05c8eabf:

  # t "Please stay."
  t "请留下来吧。"

# game/script.rpy:6006
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_ac39a7d0:

  # t " I don't want to be alone when it comes."
  t "当它来临时，我不想孤身一人。"

# game/script.rpy:6007
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_af237791:

  # "Then it reappeared like nothing had happened. They drank deeply of their goblin wine and gestured for you to do the same."
  "紧接着笑容又重新浮现，就像什么都没发生过。小偷大口灌下哥布林葡萄酒，并示意你也照做。"

# game/script.rpy:6008
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_7ff669f0:

  # t "Bedlam! I think a celebration like this calls for some smoke."
  t "躁起来吧！我觉得这样的庆典还得来点烟雾助兴。"

# game/script.rpy:6009
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_bd072e07:

  # "A goblin creature shaped like a sack full of rats nodded, and started throwing herbs into the fire."
  "一个形状犹如装满老鼠的麻袋般的哥布林生物点了点头，开始往火里扔草药。"

# game/script.rpy:6010
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_b2ae0f06:

  # "Purple, twinkling smoke began to ooze out of it. As you breathed it in, your vision twisted and your limbs began to feel far away."
  "闪烁的紫色烟雾开始弥漫。你吸入这股烟雾，感觉视线渐渐扭曲，四肢也仿佛不再属于自己。"

# game/script.rpy:6019
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_7344494d:

  # "The thief twisted away from you, but you managed to track them down at the dice tables. The mass of goblins seethed around you."
  "小偷扭身从你身边溜走，但你最终还是在骰子桌旁逮到了那家伙。大群的哥布林在你们周围喧闹涌动。"

# game/script.rpy:6020
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_79b4ab87:

  # pov "I need you to tell me what's going on."
  pov "告诉我到底怎么回事。"

# game/script.rpy:6021
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_61dd1907:

  # pov "I feel it. Something is missing."
  pov "我能感觉到。缺了点什么。"

# game/script.rpy:6022
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_a4fb507e:

  # pov "I don't know how to explain it, but I feel... more alone. More than I've ever been before."
  pov "我不知道该怎么解释，但我感觉……更加孤独了。前所未有的孤独。"

# game/script.rpy:6023
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_ae403ca4:

  # t "Don't worry about them, my friend. They made their choice. We all did!"
  t "别管他们了，我的朋友。那是他们自己的选择。我们也一样！"

# game/script.rpy:6024
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo_63711814:

  # "They rolled the dice and raised their hands in triumph. The goblins around the table groaned and pushed a stack of rocks over to them."
  "小偷掷出骰子，高举双手欢呼胜利。桌边的哥布林们抱怨连连，把一堆石头推了过去。"

# game/script.rpy:6037
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_ab89a165:

  # "The music stopped. You looked around to see that the carriage was empty around you."
  "音乐停止了。你环顾四周，发现身边的车厢空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:6038
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_fe9369ec:

  # "It had always been empty."
  "这里一直都是空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:6039
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_f97cff5d:

  # t "I don't think this train is going fast enough, haha!"
  t "我觉得这列车开得还不够快，哈哈！"

# game/script.rpy:6040
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_e1da650b:

  # "Juggling spoons with their right hand, they grabbed you and pulled you through the empty carriage towards the engine room."
  "小偷右手抛耍着勺子，一把抓住你，拉着你穿过空荡荡的车厢，直奔引擎室而去。"

# game/script.rpy:6043
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_2ad1e5ef:

  # "You burst out of the carriage door and into the cool night air. Without the sound of the music, you could hear the wind howling like a banshee."
  "你冲出车厢门，一头扎进微凉的夜色里。没有了音乐的掩护，你能听见风如报丧女妖般凄厉地嚎叫。"

# game/script.rpy:6049
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_9f2d06af:

  # "The thief pulled you through and into the engine room, where four sooty goblins were lounging."
  "小偷拉着你穿过通道，进入了引擎室，那里有四个浑身是煤灰的哥布林懒洋洋地瘫坐着。"

# game/script.rpy:6050
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_534064ec:

  # t "Stoke the engine, will you? Let's see how fast this thing can move!"
  t "给引擎添点煤！让我们看看这玩意儿到底能跑多快！"

# game/script.rpy:6051
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_bc689e0a:

  # goblin4 "Aye, boss!"
  goblin4 "遵命，老大！"

# game/script.rpy:6052
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_67e50aa7:

  # "The three goblins grabbed their shovels and set to work piling coal into the engine. The heat was intense."
  "那三个哥布林抓起铲子，开始拼命往引擎里添煤。热气逼人。"

# game/script.rpy:6055
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_3ca1c0ea:

  # "You looked out the window. It was pitch black outside."
  "你往窗外看去。外面漆黑一片。"

# game/script.rpy:6062
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_031d5b44:

  # "The train moved faster and faster, and you could hear sparks coming off the wheels."
  "列车越开越快，你能听见车轮摩擦迸射火花的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:6063
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_6c5bb805:

  # "Your thoughts were jumbled and fractured."
  "你的思绪混乱而支离破碎。"

# game/script.rpy:6072
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_c9d12d6f:

  # "You heard something. Like claws, scrabbling in the mechanism underneath the carriage."
  "你听见了一阵异响。就像是利爪在车厢底部的机械结构里胡乱抓挠。"

# game/script.rpy:6075
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_2ee4dccf:

  # pov "Do you hear-"
  pov "你听见——"

# game/script.rpy:6076
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_51602938:

  # t "Nothing to worry about! Just the wind!"
  t "没什么好担心的！只是风声！"

# game/script.rpy:6077
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_2742d0c9:

  # t "Help me shovel this coal, will you?"
  t "帮我铲煤，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6078
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_49b213d7:

  # "You looked around. The engine room was empty, except for you and the thief."
  "你环顾四周。引擎室里空空荡荡，除了你和小偷什么都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:6079
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_388681bf:

  # "You picked up a shovel and held it."
  "你捡起一把铲子，握在手里。"

# game/script.rpy:6081
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_bc57beec:

  # pov "Listen. I'll help you shovel if you tell me what's happening here."
  pov "听着。如果你告诉我这里到底怎么了，我就帮你铲。"

# game/script.rpy:6082
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_75b23826:

  # "You could feel the confusion blooming in your brain. Expanding blank spaces like tumours."
  "你能感觉到困惑在脑海中滋生。大片大片的空白如同肿瘤般不断扩张。"

# game/script.rpy:6083
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_dcb64f28:

  # pov "What's happening to me? To us? What... is this?"
  pov "我怎么了？我们怎么了？这……这到底是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:6084
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_53764426:

  # "The thief sighed."
  "小偷叹了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:6085
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_6715f7e8:

  # t "Alright. Just, please - help me shovel."
  t "好吧。只是，算我求你——帮我铲煤。"

# game/script.rpy:6086
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_1e08f047:

  # "You both began to shove coal into the furnace. The fire flared and the room grew hotter and hotter as the train sped up."
  "你们俩开始往炉膛里铲煤。火苗越窜越高，随着列车加速，房间里也变得越来越烫。"

# game/script.rpy:6087
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_233e8287:

  # "The thief looked into the flames."
  "小偷盯着炉火。"

# game/script.rpy:6088
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_d23813a0:

  # t "I made a deal. A long time ago."
  t "我做了一笔交易。很久以前了。"

# game/script.rpy:6089
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_c6c7bdbf:

  # t "We all took it. You will, too, in the end."
  t "我们都接受了这笔交易。你最终也会的。"

# game/script.rpy:6090
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_96f600f5:

  # t "Today, my debt is due. It's the end of the line."
  t "今天，是我还债的日子。这就是终点了。"

# game/script.rpy:6091
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_9846193f:

  # "The flames reflected in their dark eyes."
  "火光倒映在小偷黑色的眼眸中。"

# game/script.rpy:6092
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_b2d694ea:

  # t "Ah, well."
  t "唉，罢了。"

# game/script.rpy:6093
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_4acd6619:

  # t "Everyone gets eaten by something. Might as well be this."
  t "每个人迟早都要被什么东西吞噬。不如就是它吧。"

# game/script.rpy:6094
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_25652915:

  # "The train screeched as it rounded a tight bend, sending you both stumbling."
  "列车驶过一个急弯时发出刺耳的尖啸，把你们俩都晃了个踉跄。"

# game/script.rpy:6095
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_e607e68d:

  # t "I think that's as fast as it'll go."
  t "我想这就是它的极限了。"

# game/script.rpy:6096
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_d62fbf88:

  # t "Come on. Let's spend the last moment in the moonlight."
  t "来吧。去月光下度过这最后的时刻。"

# game/script.rpy:6100
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_9388a762:

  # "They took your hand, and in a single twist of their long, long arms they pulled you both out of the engine and up onto the roof of the train."
  "小偷拉着你的手，奇长的手臂轻轻一挥，便把你们俩拉出了引擎室，拽到了火车车顶。"

# game/script.rpy:6103
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_e0135749:

  # "You looked out across the night landscape. This haunted land stretched out before you, beautiful and terrible. The smoke stung your eyes."
  "你向外眺望夜景。这片鬼魅丛生的土地在你面前铺展，美丽而又可怕。烟雾刺痛了你的眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:6104
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_675ac6c0:

  # t "Here. I still have this."
  t "拿着。我还有这个。"

# game/script.rpy:6105
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_0ba2692b:

  # "They waved an ornate bottle of champagne at you."
  "小偷冲你挥了挥一瓶华丽的香槟。"

# game/script.rpy:6106
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_1de2cfc3:

  # t "From my father's cellar. One of the first things I ever stole. I was saving it for a special occasion."
  t "从我父亲地窖里拿的。算是我最早偷的东西之一。我本来想留到什么大日子再开。"

# game/script.rpy:6107
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_51fe7993:

  # "They popped the cork."
  "小偷拔掉了软木塞。"

# game/script.rpy:6108
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_033cb47c:

  # t "Don't worry. It's not goblin drink."
  t "别担心。这不是哥布林的酒。"

# game/script.rpy:6109
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_3d16de59:

  # "They offered you a swig from the bottle as the train hurtled forward, teetering off the rails."
  "就在列车向前狂飙、险些脱轨之际，小偷把酒瓶递了过来，示意你灌上一口。"

# game/script.rpy:6111
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_2c4c1e82:

  # "You could hear something in the darkness behind you. Like the thudding of great paws."
  "你能听见身后黑暗中传来的动静。像是巨大的爪子踩踏出的声响。"

# game/script.rpy:6113
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_d54f7ee9:

  # t "I had to do it."
  t "我必须这么做。"

# game/script.rpy:6114
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_a4a48af3:

  # t "Imagine a culture built around a black hole."
  t "想象一个围绕着黑洞建立的文明。"

# game/script.rpy:6115
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_0600b2a6:

  # t "A tree with nothing at the root."
  t "一棵根部空空的树。"

# game/script.rpy:6117
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_66454648:

  # t "The real world holds nothing for us. All we can do is extract as much joy as we can from each single day."
  t "现实世界对我们空无一物。我们所能做的，就是从每一天里榨取出尽可能多的欢乐。"

# game/script.rpy:6118
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_451943e6:

  # t "Until we finally take the westward line."
  t "直到我们最终踏上西去的列车。"

# game/script.rpy:6119
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_e77aeba7:

  # "They took a swig from the champagne bottle."
  "小偷对着香槟瓶灌了一口。"

# game/script.rpy:6123
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_3b5d9fad:

  # "The howling wind abated for a single moment. The air was clear. The moon emerged from the clouds."
  "呼啸的狂风停歇了片刻。空气一片澄澈。月亮从云层中探出了头。"

# game/script.rpy:6124
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_649d12d9:

  # "The thief leaned off the train, holding onto the smoke stack with one hand and the champagne bottle with the other."
  "小偷探出车外，一手抓着烟囱，一手握着香槟。"

# game/script.rpy:6125
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_0aade1ed:

  # t "Well. This is it."
  t "好了。到此为止了。"

# game/script.rpy:6126
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_c27940e5:

  # "You looked at their face. It was fierce with exaltation. A ferocious laugh split their mouth."
  "你看着小偷的脸。那表情因狂喜而显得有些狰狞。一阵狂笑撕裂了小偷的嘴角。"

# game/script.rpy:6127
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_76a25d97:

  # t "I did it."
  t "我做到了。"

# game/script.rpy:6128
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_7ca277b8:

  # t "I'm not sorry, you hear me?"
  t "我不后悔，你听见了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6129
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_c775d6c3:

  # t "I struck out from the cruelty and bleakness and grey endless grinding of that machine, and I lived every day I was alive."
  t "我挣脱了那台冷酷、死寂、无休无止碾磨着的灰色机器；在我活着的每一天，我都真真正正地活过。"

# game/script.rpy:6130
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_8d28b4e5:

  # "Their laughter faded and they looked out at the moon with relief. They handed you the champagne."
  "小偷的笑声渐渐平息，带着如释重负的神情凝望着月亮，把香槟递给了你。"

# game/script.rpy:6131
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_77d48502:

  # t "I won."
  t "我赢了。"

# game/script.rpy:6134
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_ab383527:

  # "The wind returned, howling like a monstrous beast."
  "风又回来了，像一头巨大的野兽般嚎叫。"

# game/script.rpy:6136
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_8ecee916:

  # "They looked at you with piercing clarity. You saw the moon reflected in their dark eyes."
  "小偷目光锐利，无比清明。你看到月亮倒映在小偷黑色的眼眸中。"

# game/script.rpy:6137
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_b7886ca2:

  # t "Thank you, [povname]. For everything."
  t "谢谢你，[povname]。谢谢你所做的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:6138
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_0790c63f:

  # t "I'm sorry we didn't get more time together."
  t "很抱歉，我们没能有更多时间相处。"

# game/script.rpy:6139
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_a5c3f30d:

  # t "If you get out, tell them..."
  t "如果你能逃脱，告诉他们……"

# game/script.rpy:6140
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_5e6d7ef2:

  # t "Tell those bastards I hated them all."
  t "告诉那些混蛋，我恨他们所有人。"

# game/script.rpy:6152
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_54a212f4:

  # "They gave you a sudden shove in the centre of your chest. You fell sprawling from the roof and slammed into the dirt, tumbling down the side of the hill and away from the train."
  "小偷突然在你的胸口猛推了一把。你跌跌撞撞地摔下车顶，重重砸进泥土里，顺着山坡往下滚，远离了那列火车。"

# game/script.rpy:6153
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_50e1de58:

  # "The train hurtled past you in a blaze of smoke and fire, and then was gone."
  "列车裹挟着火光与浓烟从你身边呼啸而过，然后便消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:6157
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_3cb34276:

  # "You lay in the underbrush, catching your breath, before staggering up."
  "你躺在灌木丛中，喘了口气，然后踉跄地爬了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:6158
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_bb71f662:

  # "There was no train. There were no train tracks."
  "没有火车。也没有铁轨。"

# game/script.rpy:6159
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_c534d61e:

  # "How did you get here? Who were you looking for?"
  "你是怎么到这儿来的？你原本在找谁？"

# game/script.rpy:6160
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_128a1f66:

  # "You shook your head at your foolishness. There's no-one out here."
  "你摇了摇头，暗笑自己的愚蠢。这荒郊野外根本就没有人。"

# game/script.rpy:6161
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_9bdc963c:

  # "There never was."
  "从来就没有。"

# game/script.rpy:6162
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_9db94e17:

  # "For some reason, you were holding an empty champagne bottle. You couldn't think why."
  "不知什么原因，你手里拿着一个空香槟瓶。你想不出为什么。"

# game/script.rpy:6164
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_84fe170d:

  # "You heard a soft grunting coming from the bush."
  "你听到灌木丛里传来一阵轻柔的哼唧声。"

# game/script.rpy:6165
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_381ba792:

  # "The bushes rustled, and then your pig leapt out and into your arms, oinking joyfully. You cradled it softly."
  "灌木丛沙沙作响，接着你的小猪跳了出来，跃入你的怀抱，欢快地叫着。你温柔地把它抱在怀里。"

# game/script.rpy:6166
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_cde4c791:

  # "You picked yourself up and begin the long walk back home with the pig."
  "你站起身，和小猪一起踏上了漫长的回家之路。"

# game/script.rpy:6168
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_c84327ba:

  # "You picked yourself up and begin the long walk back home."
  "你站起身，踏上了漫长的回家之路。"

# game/script.rpy:6169
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_5fa51f99:

  # "The wind whistled in the trees."
  "风在树林中呼啸。"

# game/script.rpy:6170
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_61c8e2f5:

  # "It was just the wind."
  "只是风声而已。"

# game/script.rpy:6171
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_956c1e90:

  # "There is nothing else to tell."
  "没有什么别的可说的了。"

# game/script.rpy:6172
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_664c1c4e:

  # "My tale is done."
  "我的故事讲完了。"

# game/script.rpy:6173
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_261e3cdf:

  # "See the mouse run."
  "小老鼠，在奔逃。"

# game/script.rpy:6175
translate Chinese thiefSoloConvo2_64c0cb6a:

  # "Catch it, whoever can, and then you can make a great big cap out of its fur."
  "谁有本事捉住它，取它皮毛做大帽。"

# game/script.rpy:6188
translate Chinese mushroom1_71b11ae1:

  # m "You again? Have you returned with a tale for me?" nointeract
  m "又是你？你带着故事回来见我了吗？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:6198
translate Chinese mushroom1_2f540422:

  # "The mushroom ushered you and your pig inside, and you both took a seat in the plush red armchairs. Your pig snuffled around, searching for truffles. You pretended to sip a cup of decaying leaf matter as you told your tale."
  "蘑菇将你和你的小猪迎进屋里，你们在红色的长毛绒扶手椅上坐下。你的小猪四处乱嗅，寻找着松露。而你则在讲述故事时，假装抿着一杯腐叶茶。"

# game/script.rpy:6200
translate Chinese mushroom1_5fdfc9ea:

  # "The mushroom ushered you inside, and you both took a seat in the plush red armchairs. You pretended to sip a cup of decaying leaf matter as you told your tale."
  "蘑菇将你迎进屋里，你们在红色的长毛绒扶手椅上坐下。你在讲述故事时，假装抿着一杯腐叶茶。"

# game/script.rpy:6201
translate Chinese mushroom1_fcabddfc:

  # m "Well! Never in all the years I've known you have you ever told me a tale such as this!"
  m "哎呀！认识你这么多年了，你还是头一次给我讲这样的故事！"

# game/script.rpy:6202
translate Chinese mushroom1_0f1646b8:

  # pov "Um... we only just met tonight."
  pov "呃……我们今晚才刚认识。"

# game/script.rpy:6203
translate Chinese mushroom1_7e478744:

  # m "You know what I mean. The other you's."
  m "你知道我指的是什么。其他的“你”。"

# game/script.rpy:6210
translate Chinese mushroomTales_365c61a5:

  # m "I have to say, darling, your stories are improving. Still a bit flabby in the second act, but I was most intrigued by your subtle commentary on the innate oneness of being." nointeract
  m "我得说，亲爱的，你的故事有进步。第二幕还是有点拖沓，但你对生命内在合一的微妙见解让我很感兴趣。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:6212
translate Chinese mushroomTales_9e71025b:

  # m "Well, your tale still could have done with some improvement."
  m "嗯，你的故事还是有待改进的。"

# game/script.rpy:6213
translate Chinese mushroomTales_eaf8502b:

  # m "The plot was rambling, and the characterisation was flimsy at best."
  m "情节松散拖沓，人物塑造充其量只能算单薄。"

# game/script.rpy:6214
translate Chinese mushroomTales_fdcd2844:

  # m "But I suppose a deal's a deal. I swear I will not curse you with a mushroom's curse."
  m "但我想交易就是交易。我发誓我不会用蘑菇的诅咒来诅咒你。"

# game/script.rpy:6215
translate Chinese mushroomTales_a9106423:

  # m "This time."
  m "至少这次不会。"

# game/script.rpy:6219
translate Chinese mushroomTales_4bd0a45a:

  # m "No need to worry about it, darling. I'm just glad you decided to come clean about your plan to steal our treasure."
  m "别放在心上，亲爱的。我很高兴你决定坦白你偷我们财宝的计划。"

# game/script.rpy:6220
translate Chinese mushroomTales_733cbce4:

  # pov "No no... it's the Master Thief who's planning to steal the treasure."
  pov "不不……是神偷打算偷财宝。"

# game/script.rpy:6221
translate Chinese mushroomTales_7ac182c0:

  # m "Right, the \"Master Thief\" you. But of course you can just stop yourself from doing it, right?"
  m "没错，就是那个神偷你。不过你当然可以克制自己不这么做，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:6222
translate Chinese mushroomTales_b3180f96:

  # pov "Uh - I - That's not..."
  pov "呃——我——那不是……"

# game/script.rpy:6225
translate Chinese mushroomThiefBattle_d26f90c9:

  # "At just that moment, you noticed your cup had disappeared from your hand and been replaced with an old gumboot full of pond scum."
  "就在那一刻，你注意到你手里的杯子不见了，取而代之的是一只装满池塘绿藻的旧橡胶靴。"

# game/script.rpy:6227
translate Chinese mushroomThiefBattle_b69669f4:

  # "Your pig squealed a warning."
  "你的小猪尖叫了一声示警。"

# game/script.rpy:6229
translate Chinese mushroomThiefBattle_487b2cc7:

  # "You looked around and saw a shadow flit across the wall."
  "你环顾四周，看到一个影子在墙上掠过。"

# game/script.rpy:6230
translate Chinese mushroomThiefBattle_4ecce603:

  # "Grabbing a nearby jewelled scimitar, you leapt up from your seat and swung around to clash swords with the Master Thief!"
  "你一把抓起手边镶满宝石的弯刀，从座位上跃起，转身与神偷兵刃相接！"

# game/script.rpy:6231
translate Chinese mushroomThiefBattle_61d488a0:

  # t "Haha! You're learning."
  t "哈哈！你在进步嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:6232
translate Chinese mushroomThiefBattle_6ad908dc:

  # t "There's still time, you know. Join me."
  t "还有时间，你知道的。加入我吧。"

# game/script.rpy:6237
translate Chinese mushroomThiefBattle_3087acec:

  # t "Together we'll spit in the face of the law and destroy the concept of private ownership once and for all." nointeract
  t "我们会携手唾弃世间的法则，一劳永逸地摧毁私有制的概念。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:6239
translate Chinese mushroomThiefBattle_5a4e463d:

  # "You hesitated... and then you dropped your sword."
  "你犹豫了……然后你放下了剑。"

# game/script.rpy:6240
translate Chinese mushroomThiefBattle_4194f500:

  # t "Excellent. Now..."
  t "极好。现在……"

# game/script.rpy:6243
translate Chinese mushroomThiefBattle_d4b2f765:

  # pov "Never!"
  pov "休想！"

# game/script.rpy:6244
translate Chinese mushroomThiefBattle_e08adfb3:

  # "You pulled yourself up and fought fiercely across the glittering hills of treasure, gold pieces sliding away with every step."
  "你挣扎起身，在闪闪发光的财宝山上边退边战，激烈搏斗，每走一步都有金币向下滑落。"

# game/script.rpy:6246
translate Chinese mushroomThiefBattle_90987862:

  # "The pig left bravely at the Master Thief, but they effortlessly dodged and it went rolling down the hill, squealing wildly."
  "小猪勇敢地扑向神偷，却被对方毫不费力地闪开，一路尖叫着滚下了财宝山。"

# game/script.rpy:6247
translate Chinese mushroomThiefBattle_a454b8e3:

  # "The Master Thief effortlessly riposted your blows with one hand, while the other hand darted around grabbing nearby gems and stuffing them into their cloak."
  "神偷只用一只手便轻松对你格挡还击，另一只手则像闪电般在周围抓取宝石，塞进斗篷里。"

# game/script.rpy:6252
translate Chinese mushroomSolo_644c2433:

  # "You walked through the woods."
  "你穿过树林。"

# game/script.rpy:6257
translate Chinese mushroomSolo_2c771d95:

  # "Soon you came upon an ancient strangler fig. You cut the vines and swamp flowers from it to reveal a small blue door, inlaid with precious moonstone and intricate engravings."
  "很快，你遇到了一棵古老的绞杀榕。你砍断藤蔓和沼泽花朵，露出一扇小巧的蓝门，门上镶嵌着珍贵的月光石和繁复的雕花。"

# game/script.rpy:6260
translate Chinese mushroomSolo_2c771d95_1:

  # "Soon you came upon an ancient strangler fig. You cut the vines and swamp flowers from it to reveal a small blue door, inlaid with precious moonstone and intricate engravings."
  "很快，你遇到了一棵古老的绞杀榕。你砍断藤蔓和沼泽花朵，露出一扇小巧的蓝门，门上镶嵌着珍贵的月光石和繁复的雕花。"

# game/script.rpy:6262
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_9806f9db:

  # "The words already lurked in your mind."
  "那些暗号已经潜伏在你的脑海里。"

# game/script.rpy:6263
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_9c3cc80d:

  # pov "Gorge, guzzle, gulp and grab; never shall this wound scab."
  pov "狼吞、牛饮、虎咽、鹰攫；此伤此创，永不结痂。"

# game/script.rpy:6264
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_f5785ab5:

  # "With this, the door opened before you, and you vanished inside immediately."
  "话音刚落，门在你面前打开，你立刻闪身进去了。"

# game/script.rpy:6267
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_b93f8c8d:

  # "Inside was a boundless cavern, cold as ice despite the heat outside."
  "里面是一个无边无际的洞穴，尽管外面酷暑难耐，里头却寒冷如冰。"

# game/script.rpy:6268
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_7cad57c0:

  # "The floor of the cavern was piled with rubies and pearls and glinting onyx and solid gold pieces, larger than your fist."
  "洞窟的地面上堆满了红宝石、珍珠、闪烁的缟玛瑙和赤金块，件件都比你的拳头还要大。"

# game/script.rpy:6269
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_85d6bd17:

  # "All across the room you saw lush silks and pillars of precious metals of every type and all manner of riches that would turn the King of Kings green with envy."
  "放眼望去，到处是华美的丝绸、各种贵金属柱子，以及足以让万王之王嫉妒得眼红的各色奇珍异宝。"

# game/script.rpy:6270
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_cf83b469:

  # "The glimmering magenta incense smoke rolled across the room and coated it all in a dark haze, smelling of the most incredible spices and herbs and enchanting odours."
  "泛着微光的洋红色熏烟在洞窟内翻滚，将万物笼罩在一层晦暗的阴霾之下，交织着奇诡的香料、草药与迷人的芬芳。"

# game/script.rpy:6271
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_67b7b86e:

  # m "Come. It's time."
  m "来吧。时间到了。"

# game/script.rpy:6272
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_61268892:

  # "The mushroom startled you. She was holding a picnic basket. Her eyes were red."
  "蘑菇吓了你一跳。她提着一个野餐篮，眼圈红红的。"

# game/script.rpy:6273
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_ad32521b:

  # pov "Time for what?"
  pov "什么时间到了？"

# game/script.rpy:6274
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_7f6a6732:

  # m "I think you know, darling. I think you can see where this is going by now."
  m "我想你知道的，亲爱的。事到如今，你应该能看出这事会怎么收场了。"

# game/script.rpy:6275
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_a490aca6:

  # m "Carry those things for me please, will you?"
  m "麻烦你帮我提一下这些东西，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6276
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_67fb587f:

  # "You looked down and say bottles of red wine placed by the door. Two wineglasses were next to them. A small, neat pile of napkins."
  "你低下头，看到了放在门边的红酒瓶。旁边放着两只高脚杯。还有一小叠叠得整整齐齐的餐巾纸。"

# game/script.rpy:6277
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_25daf377:

  # "Everything had been prepared long ago."
  "一切早就准备就绪了。"

# game/script.rpy:6278
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_766c9ac9:

  # "You picked up the supplies. The mushroom linked her arm with yours, and in a blink you were travelling down. Down through the rocks and the pillars of the earth. Down into the last kingdom."
  "你拿起这些东西。蘑菇挽住你的手臂，眨眼之间，你们就开始往下坠。穿过岩石，穿过大地的支柱，一直坠入那最后的国度。"

# game/script.rpy:6282
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_158b3fcb:

  # "Flickering silver light lit up the scene. All around you pressed a blooming mass of webcaps, milkcaps, scarlet elf caps, poisonpies, decievers, pinkgills, brittlegills, veiled ladies, lawyer's wigs, stinkhorns, earthstars, beefsteaks, chicken of the woods, earthballs, sculpted puffballs, yellowfoots, lungworts, brown-eyed wolves, golden-eyed umbrellas, Satan's boletes, false chanterelles, death caps and destroying angels, and all members of the mysterious Dark Taxa, the dark matter fungi that lie unknown to mankind."
  "闪烁的银光照亮了眼前的景象。你周围挤满了一大片盛开的丝膜菌、乳菇、猩红精灵杯、毒粉褶菌、欺诈菌、粉褶菌、红菇、长裙竹荪、毛头鬼伞、鬼笔、地星、牛排菌、硫色绚孔菌、硬皮马勃、雕纹马勃、黄柄菇、肺衣、褐眼狼菌、金眼伞菌、撒旦牛肝菌、假鸡油菌、死帽蕈和毁灭天使菌，以及所有属于神秘“暗类群”的成员——那些不为人类所知的暗物质真菌。"

# game/script.rpy:6283
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_e7bbdda7:

  # "They all swept to and fro through a twisted city of endless tunnels. The shape of a giant, pale and broken mountain loomed over the city, barely visible through the thick fog of spores."
  "它们在由无尽隧道组成的扭曲城市中穿梭来去。一座巨大、苍白而残破的山峰在城市上空若隐若现，透过浓厚的孢子雾只能隐约看到它的轮廓。"

# game/script.rpy:6284
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_ec7eee55:

  # m "Don't worry dear, I've picked out a spot. I've had it picked out for a long time."
  m "别担心，亲爱的，我已经选好地方了。我很久以前就选好了。"

# game/script.rpy:6287
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_c56efae3:

  # "She took you through the throng of mushrooms and out onto a lonely hilltop overlooking the kingdom. A picnic rug was already laid on the moss. You could see the plants of the underworld rustling darkly in thick woods at the bottom of the hill, leading to the pale mountain beyond."
  "她带你穿过蘑菇群，来到一座可以俯瞰整个国度的孤山上。苔藓上已经铺好了一块野餐垫。你能看到山脚下茂密的树林中，冥界植物在黑暗中沙沙作响，一路延伸向远处那座苍白的山峰。"

# game/script.rpy:6289
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_fc1eaa63:

  # m "Here we are."
  m "我们到了。"

# game/script.rpy:6290
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_fdae852d:

  # "She set tea-candles sparkling at each corner of the rug, and laid out a rich feast before you."
  "她在毯子的四角布下茶蜡，点点烛光摇曳，在你面前摆开了一顿丰盛的大餐。"

# game/script.rpy:6291
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_7b56d60d:

  # "You took out the wineglasses, and she uncorked the wine and poured a toast."
  "你拿出酒杯，她拔去软木塞，斟满酒杯，举杯祝酒。"

# game/script.rpy:6292
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_3ea8341e:

  # m "To us."
  m "敬我们。"

# game/script.rpy:6293
translate Chinese gilPathShowingMushroom_9161085a:

  # "She looked away and discretely wiped her eyes."
  "她移开视线，悄悄地擦了擦眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:6298
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_e529a808:

  # "The great pale mountain in the distance shifted in uneasy slumber."
  "远处那座苍白的巨山在不安的沉睡中挪动了一下。"

# game/script.rpy:6302
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_23bb6ac2:

  # "There was a distant sound from the darkness of the kingdom. Almost like howling."
  "从国度的黑暗中传来一阵遥远的声音。听起来像是在嚎叫。"

# game/script.rpy:6306
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_adbf0d4e:

  # "The plants down at the bottom of the hill shook, as if disturbed by the passage of a colossal beast."
  "山脚下的植物摇晃着，仿佛被一只路过的庞然大物所惊扰。"

# game/script.rpy:6310
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_2a144bd9:

  # "Were there always this many stars in the sky? You found you couldn't recall."
  "天上一直都有这么多星星吗？你发现自己记不清了。"

# game/script.rpy:6322
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_92707f21:

  # m "I know you must be terribly worried. I'm sorry, dear."
  m "我知道你一定非常担心。对不起，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:6323
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_dfd398ce:

  # m "I just wanted to sit, look out at the stars, and enjoy some nice wine and company."
  m "我只是想坐下来，看看星星，享受一下好酒和陪伴。"

# game/script.rpy:6324
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_32e75684:

  # m "I've thought about this moment so many times. This is how I wanted it to be at the end."
  m "我曾无数次设想过这一刻。这就是我所希望的最后结局。"

# game/script.rpy:6325
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_332b5627:

  # "She cut off a small sliver of aged truffle cheese and spread it on a water cracker, then looked at it doubtfully."
  "她切下一小片陈年松露奶酪，涂在薄脆饼干上，然后有些迟疑地端详着它。"

# game/script.rpy:6326
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_63d71012:

  # m "Oh, to hell with it. No harm in it now."
  m "噢，管他呢。现在吃也没什么坏处了。"

# game/script.rpy:6327
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_d47d6c10:

  # "She added an extra slice of cheese, a chilli and garlic olive, a piece of salami and a chunk of marinated artichoke heart onto the cracker, then gently eased the whole concoction into her mouth."
  "她在饼干上又加了一片奶酪、一颗辣椒蒜香橄榄、一片萨拉米香肠和一块腌制洋蓟心，然后将这整个大杂烩轻轻送入口中。"

# game/script.rpy:6332
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_ae77a96b:

  # m "Do you think I did the right thing?"
  m "你觉得我做对了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6333
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_761d1544:

  # pov "Uh - "
  pov "呃——"

# game/script.rpy:6334
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_3dcd0f88:

  # m "You don't know what I'm talking about. I'm sorry, I'm being quite self-indulgent, aren't I?"
  m "你不知道我在说什么。抱歉，我是不是太任性了？"

# game/script.rpy:6335
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_4abdcc18:

  # m "Well, you'll have to deal with it. This is my time and I'm going to be as self-indulgent as I damn well please."
  m "罢了，受不了你也得给我受着。这是属于我的时间，我今天乐意怎么任性，就要怎么任性。"

# game/script.rpy:6336
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_d4d964c4:

  # "She lathered some cream on a fresh-baked scone and took a delicate bite."
  "她在一个新鲜出炉的司康饼上抹了厚厚一层奶油，优雅地咬了一口。"

# game/script.rpy:6337
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_c97c556e:

  # m "It all seemed like the right choice at the time. But now it just feels like cowardice."
  m "当时看，这一切似乎都是正确的选择。但现在，它让人觉得只是懦弱罢了。"

# game/script.rpy:6338
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_320fe3f6:

  # m "All those years I've spent in here. So many things I could have done in those years."
  m "我在这里度过的这么多年。那些年里，我有太多本可以做的事情。"

# game/script.rpy:6339
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_24f40ddb:

  # m "No use worrying about it now, of course. No point."
  m "当然，现在再纠结这些已经没用了。毫无意义。"

# game/script.rpy:6344
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_9286cdf1:

  # pov "Let's get out of here. We need to find somewhere safe."
  pov "我们离开这里吧。我们得找个安全的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:6345
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_d9045485:

  # m "No, no, no. Darling, I appreciate your enthusiasm, but there's no point."
  m "不，不，不。亲爱的，我很感激你的热心，但那没用的。"

# game/script.rpy:6346
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_37ea91fa:

  # "She held the scones towards you with a stern glance until you took one."
  "她把司康饼递向你，眼神严厉地盯着你，非要你拿上一个不可。"

# game/script.rpy:6347
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_ba9c2c92:

  # m "There never was an ending other than this. There never was a time other than this. No other place but this one."
  m "从来没有其他结局。从来没有其他时间。除了这里，没有别处。"

# game/script.rpy:6349
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_43a18cec:

  # m "This is the True Ending. At least for me."
  m "这就是真实的结局。至少对我来说是如此。"

# game/script.rpy:6350
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_9859d3a7:

  # m "I made my decision a long time ago. And soon, I'm sure, you'll need to make yours."
  m "我很久以前就做出了决定。而且我敢肯定，你很快也得做出你的决定了。"

# game/script.rpy:6355
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_23e072c7:

  # m "Do? Well, the next thing to do is the move on to this lovely lemon delicious I've packed us. And pour me another glass, please."
  m "做什么？嗯，接下来要做的就是品尝我给我们带的这道美味柠檬布丁。再给我倒一杯，谢谢。"

# game/script.rpy:6356
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_6a186385:

  # pov "I know something's wrong here, but I don't -"
  pov "我知道这里有些不对劲，但我不知道——"

# game/script.rpy:6357
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_b9bed351:

  # m "Shh. Shh, dear."
  m "嘘。嘘，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:6358
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_f67a8244:

  # m "All we can do now is sit back and finish off the rest of this food. That's it."
  m "我们现在能做的，就是坐在这里，把剩下的食物吃完。仅此而已。"

# game/script.rpy:6359
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_18887d99:

  # m "What happens after that, you'll have to figure out for yourself. Just as we did."
  m "之后会发生什么，你得自己去弄明白了。就像我们以前那样。"

# game/script.rpy:6364
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_15b51930:

  # "The misty night air settled around the blanket. Flickering fireflies were visible in the distance. A haze of chirping from underground crickets washed over the scene."
  "雾蒙蒙的夜气在毯子周围弥漫。远处能看见闪烁的萤火虫。地底蟋蟀朦胧的鸣叫声如水般漫过四周。"

# game/script.rpy:6365
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_7d7b7bc5:

  # "A deep breath slowly came out of you. You let the weight in your shoulders slip away, piece by piece."
  "你长长地舒了一口气，让双肩上的重担一点一点地卸下。"

# game/script.rpy:6366
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_b7486ea3:

  # "The mushroom's pale spores began to lift out of her cap and away down the hill in the breeze."
  "蘑菇苍白的孢子开始从她的菌盖上飘起，随风向山下飘去。"

# game/script.rpy:6367
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_28a214fa:

  # m "Thank you for spending this time with me, darling."
  m "谢谢你陪我度过这段时光，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:6368
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_5d5098cb:

  # m "You could have gone anywhere, couldn't you? Stayed with anyone."
  m "你本可以去任何地方，不是吗？本可以和任何人为伴。"

# game/script.rpy:6369
translate Chinese mushroomSoloConvo_ccd772b4:

  # m "I would ask you not to forget me. But I know that won't be possible. "
  m "我本想请你不要忘记我。但我知道那是不可能的。"

# game/script.rpy:6375
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_89f9a846:

  # "The mushroom fell back onto the picnic rug and spread out her arms."
  "蘑菇仰面倒在野餐垫上，摊开双臂。"

# game/script.rpy:6379
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_a6477309:

  # "You lay down to join her and looked up at the sky above. A great, long sigh slowly eased out of her."
  "你也躺下来陪她，仰望上方的天空。她松弛下来，呼出一声长长的叹息。"

# game/script.rpy:6380
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_ddb2e5d3:

  # m "Have you ever looked back at your life and tried... tried to calculate the sheer volume of it that you've wasted? The just ungodly amount of time that you've let slip away?"
  m "你有没有回首过自己的人生，试图……试图算一算自己究竟挥霍了多少时间？那庞大到令人绝望、被你眼睁睁看着溜走的时间？"

# game/script.rpy:6383
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_67d3f9f4:

  # m "Of course I don't mean the time spent having picnics or afternoon naps, or watching the sky. That time isn't wasted."
  m "当然，我指的不是去野餐、睡午觉或看天空的时间。那些时间并没有被浪费。"

# game/script.rpy:6384
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_ac484070:

  # m "I mean the time spent doing things you don't want to do, for people you don't care about."
  m "我指的是用来做你不想做的事，为那些你不在乎的人付出的时间。"

# game/script.rpy:6387
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_af3e4721:

  # m "Those long decades spent paying rent, attending meetings, hunched over desks, travelling to work and back, doing all those petty grinding little tasks every day..."
  m "那些漫长的几十年，用来付房租、开会、伏案趴在办公桌前、通勤上下班，每天重复着那些琐碎磨人的小任务……"

# game/script.rpy:6390
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_0358d82d:

  # m "It's horrifying. How incalculable a waste."
  m "太可怕了。多么难以估量的浪费。"

# game/script.rpy:6391
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_9283d080:

  # "There was the sound of scratching. It seemed to come from somewhere inside you."
  "传来一阵抓挠声。似乎是从你体内的某个地方传出来的。"

# game/script.rpy:6394
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_e623580c:

  # m "How many minutes and hours and days and years have vanished into that black yawning pit. It's impossible to even fit the number into my mind. It's nightmarish. The stars in the sky. The grains of sand on the beach... I can't even begin to take it in."
  m "多少分分秒秒、多少日日夜夜，就这么消失在那个黑漆漆的无底洞里。那个数字庞大到我的脑子都装不下。简直像噩梦一样。就像天上的星星。海滩上的沙粒……我根本无法理解。"

# game/script.rpy:6397
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_4d8958bc:

  # m "But every time you think about it, every time that number starts to creep into your mind, you think \"There's still time,\" don't you?"
  m "但每次你想起这件事，每次那个数字开始爬进你的脑海时，你都会想，“还有时间呢”，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:6398
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_2e4babcb:

  # "The wine in your glasses rippled into complicated, twisting patterns. Like the entrails of beasts, from which omens might be read."
  "你们酒杯里的酒液荡开复杂、扭曲的涟漪。宛如用以观象卜凶的野兽脏腑。"

# game/script.rpy:6401
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_4bd4047b:

  # m "There's still time to chase that dream, there are still years left to me, I'll make it someday, I can turn this around, it'll all work out in the end! I'll start tomorrow."
  m "还有时间去追逐梦想，我还有大把的岁月，总有一天我会成功的，我能扭转乾坤，最后一切都会迎刃而解！我明天就开始。"

# game/script.rpy:6404
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_2dad1985:

  # m "But there are no tomorrows left."
  m "但是已经没有明天了。"

# game/script.rpy:6407
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_eb720100:

  # "The earth shook beneath you. You almost thought you heard the impact of great footfalls. Almost upon you now."
  "你脚下的大地在震动。你甚至觉得听到了巨大脚步声的撞击。它们几乎已经逼近到你面前了。"

# game/script.rpy:6408
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_cde4d293:

  # m "I can't say that anymore. It's done. The hours I spent are all the hours I'll ever have."
  m "我不能再这么说了。结束了。我花掉的时间，就是我曾拥有的所有时间。"

# game/script.rpy:6412
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_0a4efd83:

  # m "And... all throughout my life, the moments where I did something I really enjoyed were like small gasps of air between years of drowning."
  m "而在……那些真正让我感到享受的零星时刻，就像在长年累月的溺水里，勉强挣扎出水面吸取的一小口残氧。"

# game/script.rpy:6413
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_bb90b6fd:

  # "The night was getting darker and darker."
  "夜色越来越浓，越来越暗。"

# game/script.rpy:6416
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_66b6d466:

  # m "I had to plan them and save up for them and spend every day just trying to hold out for the next one. Those tiny, tiny moments where I got to be alive."
  m "我必须为它们做计划，为它们攒钱，并且每天都在努力苦撑，只为了等到下一次深呼吸。那些微不足道的、让我感觉自己真实活着的一瞬。"

# game/script.rpy:6419
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_ceeeff89:

  # "Something was very close to you now. You didn't dare look. There was a smell like something rotting. A sound like something coiling in the grass."
  "某个东西已经离你非常近了。你不敢看。空气中有一股腐烂的气味。还有一阵仿佛什么东西在草丛中蠕动盘绕的声响。"

# game/script.rpy:6420
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_e7a1296b:

  # m "All I have left now is that number. That percentage of waste."
  m "我现在剩下的，就只有那个数字了。那个代表浪费的百分比。"

# game/script.rpy:6428
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_4d511081:

  # m "It'll never get any smaller. It's done. It's all done."
  m "这个比例永远都不会再降下来了。结束了。一切都结束了。"

# game/script.rpy:6429
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_55a88b9d:

  # "Tears ran down her cheeks. She made no effort to hide them anymore. "
  "泪水顺着她的脸颊滑落。她再也不打算掩饰了。"

# game/script.rpy:6432
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_c54d062e:

  # m "Hold me, please."
  m "抱紧我，求你了。"

# game/script.rpy:6433
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_3f2f5267:

  # "You tentatively put your arm around her, and she nestled into your shoulder and wept."
  "你试探着用手臂揽住她，她依偎在你的肩膀上哭泣。"

# game/script.rpy:6434
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_956f51bf:

  # "You held her tight as you stared out into the night sky."
  "你紧紧地抱着她，凝视着夜空。"

# game/script.rpy:6444
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_5ef5253d:

  # "It was pitch black. No stars or moon brightened that abyss."
  "漆黑一片。没有任何星光或月光能照亮那片深渊。"

# game/script.rpy:6445
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_a32a1cb0:

  # "You reached for the wine bottle, and realised there was none."
  "你伸手去拿酒瓶，却发现什么都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:6446
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_1ee46c02:

  # "There were no wineglasses. There was no food."
  "没有酒杯。也没有食物。"

# game/script.rpy:6447
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_7fd6d38c:

  # "You felt the touch of moss underneath you. There was no blanket."
  "你触碰到了身下的苔藓。那里没有毯子。"

# game/script.rpy:6448
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_bbbfd3cc:

  # "You looked down."
  "你低下头。"

# game/script.rpy:6449
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_929c0a1e:

  # "You were holding nothing at all. Your arms were embracing thin air."
  "你什么也没抱到。你的双臂环抱着一团虚无。"

# game/script.rpy:6450
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_3797dba5:

  # "Why were you here?"
  "你为什么会在这里？"

# game/script.rpy:6451
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_9d0ca283:

  # "You must have needed a rest. A night outdoors. "
  "你肯定是太需要休息了。于是在户外露宿了一宿。"

# game/script.rpy:6452
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_485e9302:

  # "All of us need some time to ourselves every now and then, don't we?"
  "我们所有人都时不时需要一点独处的时间，不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6453
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_4a4fd086:

  # "No harm in that."
  "这没什么坏处。"

# game/script.rpy:6454
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_2f810dd3:

  # "You stood up. Brushed away the moss. Breathed in the cool night air."
  "你站了起来。拍掉身上的苔藓。呼吸着清凉的夜风。"

# game/script.rpy:6455
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_d10fbeb6:

  # "You felt warm, full, and sad, for no reason you could name."
  "你感到温暖、充实，又有些说不出是什么原因的悲伤。"

# game/script.rpy:6456
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_463c28e9:

  # "Finally you began the long walk home in silence, with the dark night sky looming above you."
  "最终，你在沉默中踏上了漫漫归途，漆黑的夜空沉沉地笼罩着你。"

# game/script.rpy:6457
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_cd5d5a8a:

  # "There's nothing else left to tell."
  "没有别的可以说了。"

# game/script.rpy:6458
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_bd257120:

  # "That's the end."
  "故事到此结束。"

# game/script.rpy:6460
translate Chinese mushroomSoloFinale_9256611c:

  # "Run away with it now, as fast as you can."
  "现在，带着它跑吧，越快越好。"

# game/script.rpy:6491
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_d1dcc18f:

  # m "Oh dear."
  m "噢，天哪。"

# game/script.rpy:6492
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_d841f04a:

  # "Another mushroom, identical to the lady, emerged from a side door."
  "另一个和夫人长得一模一样的蘑菇从侧门冒了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:6493
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_a9f99b92:

  # m2 "I know, it's awful."
  m2 "我知道，太糟糕了。"

# game/script.rpy:6495
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_8ea28495:

  # m2 "I mean, what are [he] trying to say, here? I think we can find a vague stab towards meaning in this performance, but who's the audience?"
  m2 "我的意思是，[he]这是想表达什么？我觉得能从这场表演里隐约看出点追求深意的意思，但观众是谁呢？"

# game/script.rpy:6497
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_b2a79bb7:

  # m2 "I mean, what is [he] trying to say, here? I think we can find a vague stab towards meaning in this performance, but who's the audience?"
  m2 "我的意思是，[he]这是想表达什么？我觉得能从这场表演里隐约看出点追求深意的意思，但观众是谁呢？"

# game/script.rpy:6498
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_cf29e45a:

  # "You stumbled and teetered at the edge of a cliff as the thief's stabs pushed you backwards. Another identical mushroom popped up."
  "面对小偷步步紧逼的凌厉剑锋，你步步后退，在悬崖边缘踉跄摇晃。又一个一模一样的蘑菇钻了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:6499
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_5ece31e9:

  # m4 "Perhaps it's meant to be ironic."
  m4 "也许这本意是讽刺的。"

# game/script.rpy:6500
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_3f211b44:

  # m2 "Perhaps it's satirical."
  m2 "也许是用来影射的。"

# game/script.rpy:6501
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_302b9ed0:

  # m3 "Yes, but what is it satirising?"
  m3 "没错，但它影射了什么？"

# game/script.rpy:6502
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_5816ce92:

  # "You regained your footing and slashed the thief's sword out of their hands. Just as you were on the brink of victory, mushrooms swarmed up and surrounded you."
  "你稳住阵脚，一剑挑飞了小偷手里的剑。正当胜利在望之际，成群的蘑菇涌上来包围了你。"

# game/script.rpy:6504
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_f4a597d4:

  # "Your pig leapt into your arms in fear."
  "你的小猪吓得跳进了你的怀里。"

# game/script.rpy:6505
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_6058f994:

  # m "I think we've seen enough. It's time to get off the stage."
  m "我想我们看够了。是时候下台了。"

# game/script.rpy:6506
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_581867d3:

  # "Before you could blink, they took hold of your ankles and dragged you down into the earth."
  "猝不及防，它们抓住了你的脚踝，把你拖进了泥土深处。"

# game/script.rpy:6507
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_b02f1ffb:

  # m3 "Shh. Shhh."
  m3 "嘘。嘘。"

# game/script.rpy:6508
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_38c947e5:

  # "The Master Thief managed to wriggle out of their grasp."
  "神偷设法从它们的束缚中挣脱了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:6509
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_b3c20662:

  # t "Au revoir, my friend!"
  t "再见了，我的朋友！"

# game/script.rpy:6510
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_61ff9c22:

  # "You heard the thunder of a rattling train carriage outside. In a smooth motion, they leapt out of the window, onto the train and out of sight."
  "你听见外面传来列车车厢隆隆驶过的轰鸣声。小偷动作流畅地翻出窗外，跃上列车，消失了踪影。"

# game/script.rpy:6513
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_bade8a30:

  # "That was the last thing you saw before you were dragged underneath the earth."
  "这是你被拖入地下前看到的最后一幕。"

# game/script.rpy:6515
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_63b6439a:

  # "You and the pig were pulled down through untold layers of dirt by your ankles. You heard the mushrooms whisper around you."
  "你和小猪被抓住脚踝，拉扯着穿过不知多少层泥土。你听到周围蘑菇的窃窃私语。"

# game/script.rpy:6517
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_70e19487:

  # "You were pulled down through untold layers of dirt by your ankles. You heard the mushrooms whisper around you."
  "你被抓住脚踝，拉扯着穿过不知多少层泥土。你听到周围蘑菇的窃窃私语。"

# game/script.rpy:6518
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_eff21193:

  # m3 "Everything's going to be ok.{vspace=30} {w=0.4}You're safe here.{vspace=30} {w=0.8}Shhhh."
  m3 "一切都会好起来的。{vspace=30}{w=0.4}在这里没人能伤害你……{vspace=30}{w=0.8}嘘。"

# game/script.rpy:6521
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_793ec059:

  # "Soon, you emerged into a colossal underground kingdom lit with flickering silver light."
  "很快，你来到了一座由闪烁银光照亮的巨大地下王国。"

# game/script.rpy:6523
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_6dfa11a5:

  # "All around you pressed a blooming mass of webcaps, milkcaps, scarlet elf caps, poisonpies, decievers, pinkgills, brittlegills, veiled ladies, lawyer's wigs, stinkhorns, earthstars, beefsteaks, chicken of the woods, earthballs, sculpted puffballs, yellowfoots, lungworts, brown-eyed wolves, golden-eyed umbrellas, Satan's boletes, false chanterelles, death caps and destroying angels, and all members of the mysterious Dark Taxa, the dark matter fungi that lie unknown to mankind."
  "你周围挤满了一大片盛开的丝膜菌、乳菇、猩红精灵杯、毒粉褶菌、欺诈菌、粉褶菌、红菇、长裙竹荪、毛头鬼伞、鬼笔、地星、牛排菌、硫色绚孔菌、硬皮马勃、雕纹马勃、黄柄菇、肺衣、褐眼狼菌、金眼伞菌、撒旦牛肝菌、假鸡油菌、死帽蕈和毁灭天使菌，以及所有属于神秘“暗类群”的成员——那些不为人类所知的暗物质真菌。"

# game/script.rpy:6525
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_e7bbdda7:

  # "They all swept to and fro through a twisted city of endless tunnels. The shape of a giant, pale and broken mountain loomed over the city, barely visible through the thick fog of spores."
  "它们在由无尽隧道组成的扭曲城市中穿梭来去。一座巨大、苍白而残破的山峰在城市上空若隐若现，透过浓厚的孢子雾只能隐约看到它的轮廓。"

# game/script.rpy:6526
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_f48039eb:

  # pov "I was about to win! Why have you kidnapped me?"
  pov "我马上就要赢了！你们为什么要绑架我？"

# game/script.rpy:6527
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_d17af1f9:

  # m "Darling, trust us, that sad production wasn't going to win anything. You were hurting yourself."
  m "亲爱的，相信我们，那场可悲的戏码赢不了任何东西。你那是在伤害自己。"

# game/script.rpy:6528
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_4114e8e9:

  # m2 "Hurting yourself."
  m2 "伤害你自己。"

# game/script.rpy:6529
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_8d0c34da:

  # m "Please don't take the criticism too personally. It was an intriguing bit of invisible theatre. We do respect the way you put everything into the role."
  m "请别对这些批评太介怀。那确实是一段引人入胜的隐形剧场表演。我们也的确敬佩你对角色毫无保留的投入。"

# game/script.rpy:6530
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_326f13e8:

  # "Dozens of identical mushrooms pressed around you, speaking in soft, overlapping voices."
  "几十个一模一样的蘑菇簇拥在你周围，用轻柔而此起彼伏的声音说着话。"

# game/script.rpy:6531
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_6c9ee871:

  # m3 "I think it might be best if you stay here until I know that you're safe.{vspace=30} {w=0.4}Until I know you're safe.{vspace=30} {w=0.8}It's for the best, if you stay here."
  m3 "我觉得你最好还是留在这里，直到我确信你安全无虞。{vspace=30}{w=0.4}直到我确信你安全无虞。{vspace=30}{w=0.8}留在这里，才是最好的安排。"

# game/script.rpy:6532
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_087062c6:

  # m4 "I'll watch over you.{vspace=30} {w=0.4}Over you.{vspace=30} {w=0.8}Watch over."
  m4 "我会守着你的。{vspace=30}{w=0.4}守着你。{vspace=30}{w=0.8}好好守着。"

# game/script.rpy:6536
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_f718c8f1:

  # "You were taken through a decadant palace of yellow chanterelles and given robes of fine moss. Your room was lushly furnished with soft covers woven from black mushroom silk. Your pig had his own quarters and a bevy of servants to attend to his every whim. All the gems and gold and treasures of the earth were available to you both."
  "你被领着穿过一座由黄鸡油菌筑成的奢靡宫殿，被赐予了一袭精美的苔藓长袍。你的房间陈设丰饶，铺着黑蕈丝织就的柔软被褥。你的小猪也有了专属住处，还有成群的仆人伺候着它的每一个念头。这世间所有的宝石、黄金与财宝，你们皆可尽情享用。"

# game/script.rpy:6538
translate Chinese mushroomFinale_31da6452:

  # "You were taken through a decadant palace of yellow chanterelles and given robes of fine moss. Your room was lushly furnished with soft covers woven from black mushroom silk, and all the gems and gold and treasures of the earth were available to you."
  "你被领着穿过一座由黄鸡油菌筑成的奢靡宫殿，换上了一件精美的苔藓长袍。你的房间陈设丰饶，铺着黑蕈丝织就的柔软被褥。这世间所有的宝石、黄金与财宝，你皆可尽情享用。"

# game/script.rpy:6544
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_40656ef2:

  # m "You will be safe here." nointeract
  m "你在这里会很安全的。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:6546
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_d57bd04d:

  # "The mushroom looked at you sadly."
  "蘑菇悲伤地看着你。"

# game/script.rpy:6547
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_ccabf415:

  # m2 "We've talked about this many times, darling. Don't you remember?"
  m2 "我们已经说过很多次了，亲爱的。你不记得了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6548
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_9f78a448:

  # m3 "This is the kingdom of Lady Death. Mother of Mushrooms. I am her fingers, and we take all things on earth to her."
  m3 "这里是死神女士的国度。她是蘑菇之母。我是她的手指，我们将地上万物接引至她座前。"

# game/script.rpy:6549
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_820245f8:

  # m "Would you like me to tell you the story again?"
  m "你想让我再给你讲一遍那个故事吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6554
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_02ef99c8:

  # "She sat down and began to tell you her tale."
  "她坐下来，开始向你讲述她的故事。"

# game/script.rpy:6555
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_c75f8e61:

  # m "Once upon a time, Death came for Our Dear Lord, as it was His appointed time."
  m "很久以前，死神来找我们亲爱的主，因为他的大限已至。"

# game/script.rpy:6556
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_f1a65bbe:

  # m2 "He did not wish to go, and so they battled across the limitless sea of the world. They fought for forty days and forty nights, but eventually the Heavenly Father got the upper hand."
  m2 "他不愿离去，于是他们在世间无垠的汪洋上展开了激战。他们打了四十天四十夜，但天父最终占得了胜机。"

# game/script.rpy:6557
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_60b15c82:

  # m3 "He broke Our Lady across the sky, and cut off Her hands, and threw Her down into the deepest pit underground. She was so weak that She could not pull Herself up."
  m3 "他将我们圣母的身躯掷向苍穹，砍下她的双手，将她掷入地底最深处的渊蔽。她太虚弱了，根本无法自行起身。"

# game/script.rpy:6558
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_90b0e0dc:

  # m "\"What will become of the world,\" She asked Herself, \"If I just lie here?\""
  m "“如果我就这么躺在这里，”她问自己，“世界会变成什么样？”"

# game/script.rpy:6559
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_6fcd275c:

  # m4 "\"There will be no more deaths, and soon there'll be so many people in the world that they won't have the room to stand next to each other.\""
  m4 "“世上将不再有死亡。很快，世上的人就会多得连并肩站立的空地都没有了。”"

# game/script.rpy:6560
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_4e66b7de:

  # m3 "And so She extended Her long, broken arms, so that Her fingers poked out of the soil."
  m3 "于是，她伸出那折断的修长双臂，让自己的手指探出泥土。"

# game/script.rpy:6561
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_7aa1ca47:

  # m2 "Those fingers are the Mushrooms."
  m2 "那些手指，就是蘑菇。"

# game/script.rpy:6562
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_1b37db2c:

  # m "We provide food for the poor and the animals of the forest, and support the plants and connect them together."
  m "我们为穷人和林间野兽提供食粮，维系植物，把它们连结为一。"

# game/script.rpy:6563
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_6b1248ab:

  # m4 "But most importantly, we do The Work."
  m4 "但最重要的是，我们在推进那项“大业”。"

# game/script.rpy:6564
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_ecd9c105:

  # m2 "We take hold of the dead and the dying, and the old wood and old bones, and carry it all down to Her kingdom, far underground."
  m2 "我们收拢亡者与将死之躯，拥抱朽木与枯骨，将这一切拖入她深藏地底的国度。"

# game/script.rpy:6565
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_c92782eb:

  # m3 "We work slowly."
  m3 "我们的工作很慢。"

# game/script.rpy:6566
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_e40101f5:

  # m2 "We are patient."
  m2 "我们很有耐心。"

# game/script.rpy:6567
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_1fde1d04:

  # m3 "Soon, the work will be complete, and everything will rest here inside Her kingdom, as was intended when the world began."
  m3 "很快，这大业就将完成，万物都将安息在她的国度里，一如创世之初的注定。"

# game/script.rpy:6568
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_1d60c7d3:

  # "The mushroom gestured to the pale mountain, looming over the city through the fog of spores."
  "蘑菇指了指那座苍白的山峰，它在孢子浓雾中若隐若现，巍然笼罩着这座城市。"

# game/script.rpy:6569
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_13a5e5f6:

  # m4 "Her body still lies there, broken. It is what the hills and forests and continents are built on. It is but rarely that She can walk among men as She once did."
  m4 "她的身躯依然躺在那里，支离破碎。群山、森林与大陆在她的身上拔地而起。她极少能像以前那样在人类中行走。"

# game/script.rpy:6571
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_e78085f4:

  # m "It was a strange occasion indeed on which She walked the earth to become your godmother. I hope it was worth it."
  m "她那次在世间行走并成为你的教母，确实是一次非同寻常的机缘。我希望这一切都是值得的。"

# game/script.rpy:6574
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_3cbcec2f:

  # m "I'm sorry, darling, it's simply impossible."
  m "对不起，亲爱的，这根本不可能。"

# game/script.rpy:6575
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_335fa5cd:

  # m "You're a danger to yourself. All of yourself."
  m "你会伤害自己的。伤害你所有的自我。"

# game/script.rpy:6576
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_cba96578:

  # m "I only wish I could keep all of you in here, until you're well again."
  m "我只希望能把所有的你都留在这里，直到你康复。"

# game/script.rpy:6580
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_59bf4497:

  # m "We've talked about this so many times, darling. And you have forgotten so much."
  m "我们已经说过这么多次了，亲爱的。可你却忘得一干二净。"

# game/script.rpy:6581
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_fd9d21e4:

  # m2 "You're not well."
  m2 "你病了。"

# game/script.rpy:6582
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_c8a0fa31:

  # m3 "You argue with yourself. Even kill yourself. All the time."
  m3 "你和自己争吵。甚至戕害自身。一直如此。"

# game/script.rpy:6583
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_82e06ac9:

  # m4 "You make food and then give it to us to rot, while you lie starving."
  m4 "你做好了食物交给我们腐烂，自己却倒在一旁挨饿。"

# game/script.rpy:6584
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_0a2bfd5f:

  # m2 "You build houses and then leave them empty, while you die of cold on the streets."
  m2 "你建起了房屋任其空置，自己却在街头冻死。"

# game/script.rpy:6585
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_7a28d557:

  # m "We respect your dedication to your art. It is a beautiful performance."
  m "我们敬佩你对艺术的献身精神。那是一场美丽的表演。"

# game/script.rpy:6586
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_01a4b7cf:

  # m2 "But is it worth the cost?"
  m2 "但这么做值得吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6590
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_28f70d14:

  # pov "I think you're confused. Me and the thief and all those other people... they're separate. We aren't the same person."
  pov "我觉得你搞混了。我、小偷还有其他那些人……他们都是独立的。我们不是同一个人。"

# game/script.rpy:6591
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_f21cb6f5:

  # m "Darling, I think you're the one who's confused. You've been taken in by the surface elements of the piece without considering the greater picture."
  m "亲爱的，我觉得搞混的人是你。你被这件作品的表象迷惑了，却没有领会它宏大的全貌。"

# game/script.rpy:6592
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_95162426:

  # m2 "When you look at mushrooms on the surface, it may look like each one is a separate being."
  m2 "当你观察地表的蘑菇时，每一朵似乎都是独立的个体。"

# game/script.rpy:6593
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_5a71f188:

  # m3 "But when you look underneath, you can see it. It's all one beast. Impossibly large. Under the earth."
  m3 "但当你往地下看时，你就能明白。它们其实同属一头巨兽。庞大得超乎想象。深潜于大地之下。"

# game/script.rpy:6594
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_15ace3b3:

  # m "You're the same. You've just forgotten."
  m "你们也是一样。只是你忘记了。"

# game/script.rpy:6595
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_96f1bff0:

  # m4 "You can't see the shape of the great Human Being under the dirt."
  m4 "你看不见泥土下那个庞大的人类本体的轮廓。"

# game/script.rpy:6599
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_fcc16d31:

  # m3 "Of course. One moment."
  m3 "当然可以。稍等。"

# game/script.rpy:6600
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_0092511b:

  # "The mushrooms took one of their number out of the room. There was a chopping sound from outside. In moments, they returned with a rich mushroom stew."
  "蘑菇们把一名同伴带出了房间。外面传来一阵刀剁声。不一会儿，它便端着一碗浓郁的蘑菇炖汤回来了。"

# game/script.rpy:6602
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_74d4ab21:

  # m2 "Here."
  m2 "给你。"

# game/script.rpy:6606
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_595d4c51:

  # m3 "Do you promise not to hurt any of your selves?"
  m3 "你保证不会伤害任何一个“你”吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6607
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_268b2b31:

  # pov "Um... yes, I do."
  pov "呃……是的，我保证。"

# game/script.rpy:6608
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_a64fa71b:

  # m2 "Very well. I will come with you."
  m2 "很好。我和你一起去。"

# game/script.rpy:6609
translate Chinese mushroomPrison_7ba0d832:

  # m "You can go anywhere in the kingdom. But if I ever feel that you're a danger to yourself, we'll have to take you back here."
  m "你可以去王国里的任何地方。但只要我觉得你又有伤害自己的倾向，我们就得把你带回这里。"

# game/script.rpy:6615
translate Chinese mushroomKingdom_b8848990:

  # "You walked out into the lush expanse of the underground kingdom. Rich moss and lichens flowered from every surface. "
  "你步入地下王国那片葱郁的广袤疆域。目之所及处处绽放着繁茂的苔藓和地衣。"

# game/script.rpy:6617
translate Chinese mushroomKingdom_bd92dccb:

  # m "Don't worry. I know about your Godfather. He cannot reach us here."
  m "别担心。我知道你教父的事。他在这里找不到我们。"

# game/script.rpy:6628
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_b19530e1:

  # "The mushroom showed you all the wonders of that undiscovered land, where life and death go hand in hand."
  "蘑菇向你展示了这片未被发现的土地上所有的奇观，在这里，生与死携手并存。"

# game/script.rpy:6630
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_c6ec2534:

  # "Your pig frolicked through the gardens beside you."
  "你的小猪在你身旁的庭院里嬉戏。"

# game/script.rpy:6631
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_fa5066e1:

  # "You saw the four seasons all flowering at once. To the north, the cicadas and crickets chirped loudly in a summer haze. To the south, the ground was silver white with snow. To the west, the autumn rains fell, and to the east was the full glory of spring."
  "你看到四季在这里同时绽放。在北方，夏蝉和蟋蟀在夏日的薄雾中纵声长鸣。在南方，大地被白雪覆盖，一片银白。在西方，秋雨绵绵。而在东方，则是春意盎然的盛景。"

# game/script.rpy:6632
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_966b63c3:

  # "Out in the distance, you noticed a picnic rug lying on the moss of a lonely hillside."
  "极目远眺，你注意到一张野餐垫铺在一座孤山的苔藓上。"

# game/script.rpy:6633
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_0934736a:

  # "The wonders of those gardens were so stunning that the tongue fails to describe them, and you walked and watched for days, until your eyes were so full that they couldn't stand to see another scrap of beauty."
  "那些庭院的奇景美得动人心魄，言语根本无法形容。你日复一日地游荡观赏，直到双眼餍足，再也无法承载一丁点额外的美景。"

# game/script.rpy:6634
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_780269e4:

  # m "A tad garish, isn't it?"
  m "有点太花哨了，不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6640
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_009e027f:

  # "As soon as you entered the palace a train of toadstools appeared, all in ceremonial garb. With silent steps, they surrounded you, bearing delicacies of mushroom risotto and crisp goose roasted in truffle butter and dark red wine and platters of mushroom bourguignon with roast potatoes, and set this wondrous feast before you. "
  "你一走进宫殿，一列身披仪式盛装的毒伞菌便列队出现。它们迈着无声的步伐将你簇拥，端上了蘑菇烩饭、松露黄油烤脆皮鹅、深红色的葡萄酒，以及一大盘勃艮第红酒炖蘑菇配烤土豆，将这顿奇妙的盛宴摆在你面前。"

# game/script.rpy:6642
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_9a26f283:

  # "Your pig feasted with wild abandon."
  "你的小猪忘乎所以地狂啃海塞。"

# game/script.rpy:6643
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_cce8b60e:

  # m "You HAVE to try the truffle aioli, darling, that's my absolute favourite."
  m "你一定得尝尝这松露蒜香蛋黄酱，亲爱的，那绝对是我的最爱。"

# game/script.rpy:6644
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_2f0c23cb:

  # pov "You... eat mushrooms?"
  pov "你……吃蘑菇？"

# game/script.rpy:6645
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_f8185779:

  # m2 "Of course. And one day they will eat me."
  m2 "当然。而且总有一天它们也会吃掉我。"

# game/script.rpy:6646
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_6b8fba94:

  # "Never in your whole life had you sat down to such a marvellous feast, and you gorged yourself for days on end until they had to roll you out of the palace."
  "你这辈子都没吃过这么丰盛的宴席。你一连几天胡吃海塞，吃到最后，它们不得不把你滚出宫殿。"

# game/script.rpy:6650
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_511933da:

  # "The mushroom took you down to show you the deep, ancient roots of the whole forest above you. Delicate fungal networks wove through every root, carrying vital letters and trade agreements and treaties to every plant in the woods."
  "蘑菇带你深入地下，向你展示头顶整片森林深邃而古老的根系。纤细的真菌网络交织在所有树根之中，将至关重要的信件、贸易协定与条约传递给林中的每一株植物。"

# game/script.rpy:6651
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_0e55e7fd:

  # "You spent days among them, learning their intricate customs. You realised that the forest you knew was an intricate web of delicate alliances between opposing factions that hated each other with bitter envy."
  "你和它们共处了几天，学习它们繁复的习俗。你意识到，你所熟知的森林其实是一张复杂的网络，是由彼此嫉恨的对立派系结成的微妙联盟。"

# game/script.rpy:6652
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_f6a66f77:

  # m3 "Exhausting, isn't it? But it must be done."
  m3 "挺累人的，不是吗？但这事必须得做。"

# game/script.rpy:6653
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_28c3ed94:

  # m2 "If we didn't do this, the whole forest would probably fall into all-out war. And then we'd never get The Work done."
  m2 "如果我们不这么做，整片森林很可能会陷入全面战争。那样我们就永远无法完成“大业”了。"

# game/script.rpy:6659
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_ae055f04:

  # "The mushroom took you closer to the shape you saw from the palace. It loomed over you, larger than life. With a start, you saw that it was breathing."
  "蘑菇带你走近你在宫殿里看到的那个轮廓。它赫然耸立在你上方，神祇般巍峨庞大。你心里一惊，它在呼吸。"

# game/script.rpy:6660
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_8b0d2def:

  # m2 "This is the Lady. She waits here, while we do The Work."
  m2 "这就是女士。她在这里等待，而我们负责完成“大业”。"

# game/script.rpy:6661
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_462208bb:

  # pov "The Work?"
  pov "大业？"

# game/script.rpy:6663
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_943ebe8d:

  # m4 "We take all things down here, one by one. It's slow work. But already, those down here outnumber the ones above. We are more than halfway done."
  m4 "我们把万物逐一接引至此。这是一项缓慢的工程。但如今，地底的众生早已多过地表的生灵。我们完成一大半了。"

# game/script.rpy:6664
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_3ef8db66:

  # m3 "Someday, everyone and everything will be down here."
  m3 "总有一天，万事万物都会来到这下面。"

# game/script.rpy:6665
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_bc570a4c:

  # m "On that day, the Lady will draw her fingers down through the soil and back to her."
  m "到那一天，夫人就会让她的手指穿过泥土，将一切都收拢到她身边。"

# game/script.rpy:6666
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_71801281:

  # m3 "We will finally have completed the piece. Our Magnum Opus. It will be spectacular, I assure you, darling."
  m3 "我们终于能完成这件作品了。我们的无上杰作。我向你保证，亲爱的，那场面绝对无比壮观。"

# game/script.rpy:6667
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_23acb816:

  # m "Don't look yet, it's not finished. Barely a first draft, really, I'd be so embarrassed if you saw it in its current state."
  m "先别看，还没完成呢。说真的，这勉强只算个雏形，要是你现在就看，我会很不好意思的。"

# game/script.rpy:6668
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_e97b2aed:

  # m2 "So much left to do."
  m2 "还有好多事没做完呢。"

# game/script.rpy:6669
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_72bfd20a:

  # m3 "No need to worry. We have all the time in the world."
  m3 "不用担心。我们有的是时间。"

# game/script.rpy:6670
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_4921dae8:

  # "You felt a strange peace in the shadow of the pale lady, and you stayed there with the mushroom for many days, looking out at the splendour of the world."
  "在苍白夫人的庞大阴影中，你感到一种奇妙的宁静。你和蘑菇在那里待了许多天，眺望着世间的壮丽光景。"

# game/script.rpy:6676
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_f4088472:

  # "Such were the wonders of that kingdom that you almost forgot everything, even the riches you left behind and your twelve siblings and your own country."
  "那个国度充满奇观，让你几乎忘却了一切，甚至忘了你留下的财富、你的十二个兄弟姐妹，以及你的故国。"

# game/script.rpy:6678
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_d33f8fbb:

  # "Such were the wonders of that kingdom that you almost forgot everything, even the home you left behind and your mother and your twelve siblings and your own country."
  "那个国度充满奇观，让你几乎忘却了一切，甚至忘记了你留下的家、你的母亲、你的十二个兄弟姐妹，以及你的故国。"

# game/script.rpy:6681
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_489fea44:

  # "Such were the wonders of that kingdom that you almost forgot everything, even the riches you left behind and your ten siblings and your own country."
  "那个国度充满奇观，让你几乎忘却了一切，甚至忘了你留下的财富、你的十个兄弟姐妹，以及你的故国。"

# game/script.rpy:6683
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_4fc4c4bb:

  # "Such were the wonders of that kingdom that you almost forgot everything, even the home you left behind and your mother and your ten siblings and your own country."
  "那个国度充满奇观，让你几乎忘却了一切，甚至忘记了你留下的家、你的母亲、你的十个兄弟姐妹，以及你的故国。"

# game/script.rpy:6686
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_5eb46796:

  # "Such were the wonders of that kingdom that you almost forgot everything, even the riches you left behind and your four siblings and your own country."
  "那个国度充满奇观，让你几乎忘却了一切，甚至忘了你留下的财富，你的四个兄弟姐妹，以及你的故国。"

# game/script.rpy:6688
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_a84f7adf:

  # "Such were the wonders of that kingdom that you almost forgot everything, even the home you left behind and your mother and your four siblings and your own country."
  "那个国度充满奇观，让你几乎忘却了一切，甚至忘记了你留下的家、你的母亲、你的四个兄弟姐妹，以及你的故国。"

# game/script.rpy:6691
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_e946adec:

  # "Such were the wonders of that kingdom that you almost forgot everything, even the riches you left behind and your own country."
  "那个国度充满奇观，让你几乎忘却了一切，甚至忘记了你留下的财富，以及你的故国。"

# game/script.rpy:6693
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_0196888d:

  # "Such were the wonders of that kingdom that you almost forgot everything, even the home you left behind and your mother and your own country."
  "那个国度充满奇观，让你几乎忘却了一切，甚至忘记了你留下的家、你的母亲，以及你的故国。"

# game/script.rpy:6694
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_14cbbb9a:

  # "But soon, your mind came back to you, and you realised that you did not belong to this wonderful land. And so you said to the mushroom:"
  "但很快，你回过神来，意识到自己并不属于这片奇妙的土地。于是你对蘑菇说："

# game/script.rpy:6695
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_e4f5709c:

  # pov "I've been very happy with you, and you've been kinder to me than words can tell. But I must go back."
  pov "和你们在一起的时光我很开心，你对我更是好得难以言表。但我必须得回去了。"

# game/script.rpy:6700
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_117eb978:

  # m "Oh darling, no! Do you have to go? Why not stay here with me?" nointeract
  m "噢，亲爱的，别啊！你非走不可吗？为什么不留下来陪我呢？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:6702
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_d78f9838:

  # "For a long time, you thought over the Mushroom's proposal. Finally, you agreed."
  "对蘑菇的提议，你考虑了很久。最终，你答应了。"

# game/script.rpy:6710
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_82400884:

  # "You and the mushrooms built a close together friendship over many years, laying each moment shared together like the bricks of a house. You came to know their deep fears and most secret shames."
  "多年来，你和蘑菇们建立起了亲密无间的友谊，将共同度过的每个瞬间砌砖建屋般累积。你知晓了它们内心深处的恐惧，以及隐秘的耻辱。"

# game/script.rpy:6712
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_85702a75:

  # "Your pig settled down to a contented life among the truffles."
  "你的小猪在松露中安顿下来，过上了心满意足的生活。"

# game/script.rpy:6713
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_d434d304:

  # "You set up a quaint home in that strange country, and soon you were even able to find your poor mother and make amends for your wicked behaviour."
  "你在那个陌生的国度安了个别致的家。不久之后，你甚至找到了你可怜的母亲，并弥补了你过去的恶行。"

# game/script.rpy:6714
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_6d527df0:

  # "After a long time, your siblings came down to join you there, one by one."
  "过了很久，你的兄弟姐妹们也一个接一个地来到地下，与你团聚。"

# game/script.rpy:6715
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_17381254:

  # "Even I was there, though you did not see me."
  "甚至连我也在那里，虽然你并没有看见我。"

# game/script.rpy:6717
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_82400884_1:

  # "You and the mushrooms built a close together friendship over many years, laying each moment shared together like the bricks of a house. You came to know their deep fears and most secret shames."
  "多年来，你和蘑菇们建立起了亲密无间的友谊，将共同度过的每个瞬间砌砖建屋般累积。你知晓了它们内心深处的恐惧，以及隐秘的耻辱。"

# game/script.rpy:6719
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_85702a75_1:

  # "Your pig settled down to a contented life among the truffles."
  "你的小猪在松露中安顿下来，过上了心满意足的生活。"

# game/script.rpy:6720
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_3da163e6:

  # "You set up a quaint home in that dark kingdom."
  "你在那个黑暗的国度安了个别致的家。"

# game/script.rpy:6721
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_08f85327:

  # "After a long time, your mother and siblings came down to join you there, one by one."
  "过了很久，你的母亲和兄弟姐妹们也一个接一个地来到地下，与你团聚。"

# game/script.rpy:6722
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_17381254_1:

  # "Even I was there, though you did not see me."
  "甚至连我也在那里，虽然你并没有看见我。"

# game/script.rpy:6724
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_ae490022:

  # "After slowly growing close over many years, you and the mushrooms all became married together in a beautiful ceremony."
  "经过多年的慢慢亲近，你和蘑菇们在一场美丽的仪式上结为连理。"

# game/script.rpy:6725
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_029c1f23:

  # "Your mother came down to the kingdom of death for the occasion, and all the plants and lichens and moss and toadstools of the forest were in attendance."
  "你的母亲特意来到死亡的国度参加这场婚礼，森林里所有的植物、地衣、苔藓和毒伞菌也都出席了。"

# game/script.rpy:6726
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_a94a38b3:

  # "The occasion was full of joy. I laughed as I raised a toast, and the beer ran down my chin but did not go into my mouth."
  "婚礼上欢声笑语。我笑着举杯祝酒，麦酒顺着下巴流走，半滴也没沾湿我的口。"

# game/script.rpy:6728
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_6f7bbb53:

  # "Long did your Godfather the Almighty search for you, but never could he find you, hidden as you were in that undiscovered country."
  "你的教父，全能的主，曾寻觅你良久，却终是一无所获，因为你藏身在那片无人知晓的国度里。"

# game/script.rpy:6730
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_f9f56ff1:

  # "Long did your Godfather the Devil search for you, but never could he find you, hidden as you were in that undiscovered country."
  "你的教父，魔鬼，曾寻觅你良久，却终是一无所获，因为你藏身在那片无人知晓的国度里。"

# game/script.rpy:6732
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_ba2421c7:

  # "And so the promise came to pass, and you took your place with the woman clad all in black, just as she promised your mother all those years ago."
  "就这样，承诺应验了。你留在了那位一身黑衣的女人身边，正如她多年前向你母亲承诺的那样。"

# game/script.rpy:6734
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_fddb9963:

  # "You stayed there at the side of the Pale Lady, forever and ever, until the final horn and the coming of the end of days."
  "你留在那里，永远陪伴在苍白夫人的身旁，直到末日的最后一声号角吹响。"

# game/script.rpy:6736
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_a20cefa7:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:6737
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_00620a41:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:6739
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_1d169db6:

  # "And what happened to the thief, you ask?"
  "你问那个小偷后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:6744
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_769b7c9a:

  # pov "Don't think that I want to leave you. It's just that I must see my old country again."
  pov "别以为我是想抛下你。只是我必须再回去看看我的故国。"

# game/script.rpy:6746
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_314917a9:

  # pov "Don't think that I want to leave you. It's just that I must see my old mother and my old country."
  pov "别以为我是想抛下你。只是我必须再回去看看我年迈的母亲和我的故国。"

# game/script.rpy:6747
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_7a1e28f8:

  # m3 "I see. Well, then I'm sure we can't stand in your way. Take this to remember us by, please."
  m3 "我明白了。好吧，那我们肯定不能拦着你。请收下这个，留个纪念吧。"

# game/script.rpy:6748
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_2307533b:

  # "She handed you a black box tied with a tassel of red silk."
  "她递给你一只用红丝流苏系着的黑盒子。"

# game/script.rpy:6749
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_2846b16c:

  # m4 "This is the box of the jewelled hand, and it holds something very precious. Do not open it, no matter what happens."
  m4 "这是装有珠宝之手的盒子，里面装着非常珍贵的东西。无论发生什么，都绝不能打开它。"

# game/script.rpy:6751
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_28bb1bca:

  # "You bid her a tearful farewell. Then, you turned to your pig."
  "你含泪向她告别。然后，你转向了你的小猪。"

# game/script.rpy:6752
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_0ead89a4:

  # p1 "I am sorry, my erstwhile companion. After all our adventures together, I have come to see you as a dear friend - even as family."
  p1 "对不起了，我昔日的伙伴。在一起经历了这么多冒险之后，我早已将你视为挚友——甚至是家人。"

# game/script.rpy:6753
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_e5dd58b0:

  # p1 "But where you go now, I cannot follow. My place is here, with the truffles. I hope you can understand."
  p1 "但你现在要去的地方，我无法追随。我的归宿在这里，和松露在一起。希望你能理解。"

# game/script.rpy:6754
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_46666e90:

  # "It hurt you dearly to part ways, but you understood. You and the pig embraced warmly."
  "离别让你痛苦万分，但你心里明白。你和小猪深情相拥。"

# game/script.rpy:6755
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_bca1e713:

  # p1 "I will always remember you, [povname]."
  p1 "我会永远记住你的，[povname]。"

# game/script.rpy:6756
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_056ec0a6:

  # "And so you promised that you would never open the box, and the mushrooms took hold of you and bore you back up to the surface."
  "于是你发誓绝不打开那个盒子。蘑菇们将你托起，把你送回了地面。"

# game/script.rpy:6759
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_62752ac8:

  # "You blinked in the harsh light of the sun above, and found that your eyes had become almost blind in the darkness below. Your skin was pale and shrunken."
  "你在头顶刺眼的阳光中眨了眨眼，发现因为地底的黑暗，你的双眼几近失明。你的皮肤也变得苍白干瘪。"

# game/script.rpy:6760
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_bdf2bd92:

  # "As you looked around, a strange anxiety gripped you. The ancient old strangler fig you remembered was gone. You couldn't see the blue door to the mushroom's domain."
  "当你环顾四周时，一种莫名的焦虑涌上心头。记忆中那棵古老的绞杀榕不见了踪影。你也找不到那扇通往蘑菇领地的蓝色小门了。"

# game/script.rpy:6763
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_aa2ac43e:

  # "As you walked down the road to your house, something seemed wrong. The people you saw walking past had different faces to the people you knew so well before. Even your old house was a different shape."
  "当你走在回家的路上时，一切都透着不对劲。路边匆匆走过的都是生面孔，没有昔日熟识的旧人。甚至连你的老房子也变了模样。"

# game/script.rpy:6764
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_d98e12ea:

  # "You walked up to your old home and called out:"
  "你走到老屋门前，大声呼唤："

# game/script.rpy:6765
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_6321d7e9:

  # pov "Mum! I'm back!"
  pov "妈妈！我回来了！"

# game/script.rpy:6766
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_82cdaefd:

  # "But just as you were about to enter, a strange man came out."
  "可正当你要进门时，一个陌生的男人走了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:6767
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_b2064b63:

  # som "Who are you?"
  som "你是谁？"

# game/script.rpy:6768
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_35d425bd:

  # pov "What? Who are you? And why do you twist in that crooked way?"
  pov "什么？你又是谁？你身子干嘛扭曲得这么怪？"

# game/script.rpy:6769
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_d02068d8:

  # som "We're all crooked now, child. It's the law. But answer my question!"
  som "我们现在全都得这样扭曲，孩子。这是律法规定的。快回答我的问题！"

# game/script.rpy:6771
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_eeb2dedc:

  # pov "My name is [povname]."
  pov "我叫[povname]。"

# game/script.rpy:6772
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_6bc8be5b:

  # som "Don't joke around like that."
  som "别开这种玩笑了。"

# game/script.rpy:6774
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_84c4a182:

  # som "It's true that someone by the name of [povname] once lived here, but that is a tale three hundred years old! [He] couldn't possibly be alive now."
  som "以前确实有个叫[povname]的人住在这里，但那都是三百年前的传说了！[He]怎么可能还活到现在。"

# game/script.rpy:6775
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_31d11569:

  # "When you heard those odd words, a terrible fear gripped you, and you ran out onto the street and through the twisting alleyways. The forest you knew was gone. A grey rain of ash fell ceaselessly across the land from the grey clouds above down onto the bent and crooked grey people of the realm, who huddled in grim shelters underneath places that hideously resembled the hills and lakes and villages you once knew."
  "听到这些古怪的话，极度的恐惧攥紧了你的心脏。你冲到街上，穿过蜿蜒的窄巷。你熟知的森林荡然无存。灰烬如雨，从灰暗的云层中向大地无休止地倾泻，洒在满国弯腰驼背的灰色民众身上。他们蜷缩在阴暗的棚户下，而周围那些扭曲畸形的破败景象，竟丑陋地模仿着你曾熟知的群山、湖泊与村庄。"

# game/script.rpy:6776
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_38828dd7:

  # "Over and over, you heard them mutter of the Ash Giants, and you heard terrible footfalls shake the earth from some distant place, growing closer every moment."
  "你一遍遍听到他们念叨着“灰烬巨人”，也听到远方传来撼动大地的骇人脚步声，无时无刻不在向你逼近。"

# game/script.rpy:6777
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_20652048:

  # "The awful feeling came over you that what the old man said was true. Each day you spent in the underground kingdom was as a hundred years on earth."
  "一种可怕的预感涌上心头：那个老人说的全是真的。你在地下王国度过的每一天，就等同于人间的上百年。"

# game/script.rpy:6780
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_692eeac0:

  # "You ran through the grey streets and parking lots and abandoned shopping centres and the vast, decayed, echoing airports and twisting subterranean toll roads and subway tunnels, last remnants of a loose and raving hunger that had scooped out the whole of this hollow earth and left it its wake only the slow landfill rivers that boiled around you with the serpentine motion of the secluded trash queens as you stumbled through them into the suffocating silence of cracked bitumen roads and empty apartment complexes (packed with flickering TV screens of silent static that never ceased) under the grim endless maze of freeways that blotted out the grey sky above."
  "你狂奔过灰暗的街道、停车场与废弃的购物中心，穿过庞大、衰败、回声阵阵的机场，跑进蜿蜒的地下收费站和地铁隧道。这都是一场失控狂乱的饥饿浩劫掏空整个地球后留下的最后残骸，只在身后留下了缓慢蠕动的垃圾填埋河。河流在你周围沸腾，像蛰伏的垃圾女王如蛇般翻滚。你跌跌撞撞地穿过它们，扎进开裂沥青路与空荡公寓群令人窒息的死寂中（公寓里密密麻麻全是永不停歇地闪烁着无声雪花点的电视屏幕），而在你头顶上方，是无尽阴森的立交桥迷宫，遮蔽了灰色的天空。"

# game/script.rpy:6783
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_7df9eb68:

  # "But try as you might you couldn't find the way back to the kingdom you left."
  "但任凭你如何拼命，也找不到那条回到地下王国的路了。"

# game/script.rpy:6785
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_afe30546:

  # miw "Finally."
  miw "终于。"

# game/script.rpy:6786
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_c9fc6a00:

  # "You felt a heavy hand fall on your shoulder. A burning light seared behind you, too bright for you to turn and face it."
  "你感觉到一只沉重的手落在了你的肩膀上。一道灼目的光芒在你背后炙烤，刺眼得让你无法转身直视。"

# game/script.rpy:6787
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_cbb1e7f3:

  # miw "Long have I waited. Now, you will come with me."
  miw "我等得太久了。现在，跟我走吧。"

# game/script.rpy:6790
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_a6885655:

  # mir "Finally."
  mir "终于。"

# game/script.rpy:6791
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_2d6bded3:

  # "A crooked red hand fell on your shoulder, and you turned to see the cackling face of the old serpent himself."
  "一只扭曲的红色手掌落在了你的肩膀上，你转过身，看到了那古蛇本尊正在怪笑的脸。"

# game/script.rpy:6792
translate Chinese mushroomExplore_eaa11591:

  # mir "Now you see that no matter how long you hide, none can escape the devil's clutches! Come with me, and we will dance together in Hell forever."
  mir "现在你该明白了吧，无论躲避多久，都没人能逃出魔鬼的掌心！跟我走吧，我们将永远在地狱中共舞。"

# game/script.rpy:6802
translate Chinese mushroomBox_c6dcbd09:

  # "Having lost everything dear to you, you realised that there was no reason not to open it."
  "失去了所有珍视之物后，你意识到自己再也没有理由不去打开它了。"

# game/script.rpy:6803
translate Chinese mushroomBox_f066017e:

  # pov "At such a time, surely I will find something inside this box to save me and lead me back to the Mushroom."
  pov "到了这种时候，这盒子里肯定装着能拯救我、指引我回到蘑菇身边的奇迹。"

# game/script.rpy:6805
translate Chinese mushroomBox_66951da8:

  # miw "No."
  miw "不。"

# game/script.rpy:6807
translate Chinese mushroomBox_41600035:

  # mir "What are you doing? No!"
  mir "你在干什么？住手！"

# game/script.rpy:6808
translate Chinese mushroomBox_4d1fdaba:

  # "You untied the red silk and lifted the lid of the precious box."
  "你解开红丝绸，掀开了这只珍贵宝盒的盖子。"

# game/script.rpy:6809
translate Chinese mushroomBox_44b9e94a:

  # "As soon as you did, all of your years rushed out of the box, and they came upon you at once. Your hair grew and turned white, your back twisted into a knot with age, your face wrinkled up and you fell down dead in an instant."
  "宝盒开启的瞬间，你错失的所有岁月从中喷涌而出，瞬间倾注在你身上。你的头发变长变白，你的后背因苍老而佝偻成一团，你的脸上布满皱纹，眨眼间你便倒地而亡。"

# game/script.rpy:6812
translate Chinese mushroomBox_f40a3fba:

  # "Poor thing! I wept to see your woeful fate. Because of your disobedience, never would you live to see your loved ones again."
  "可怜的家伙！目睹你这悲惨的命运，我不禁落泪。只因你违背了告诫，你再也无法活着见到挚爱之人了。"

# game/script.rpy:6814
translate Chinese mushroomBox_8ed30a81:

  # "Little children, never be disobedient to those who are wiser than you, for disobedience is the mother of all misery and father of all woe."
  "孩子们，永远不要违背那些比你更睿智之人的教诲，因为叛逆是万般苦楚之母，也是一切悲哀之父。"

# game/script.rpy:6816
translate Chinese mushroomBox_a20cefa7:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:6817
translate Chinese mushroomBox_00620a41:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:6819
translate Chinese mushroomBox_1d169db6:

  # "And what happened to the thief, you ask?"
  "你问那个小偷后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:6824
translate Chinese mushroomBox_fb9a55f6:

  # "You hesitated - but in the end you couldn't bring yourself to break your promise to the mushroom."
  "你犹豫了——但最终你还是不忍心违背对蘑菇的承诺。"

# game/script.rpy:6826
translate Chinese mushroomBox_8bc33d92:

  # "And so the Lord took you, and you rested in the basement of His White House forever and ever, until the final horn and the coming of the end of days."
  "于是主带走了你，让你永远安息在祂那纯白宅邸的地下室里，直到末日的最后一声号角吹响。"

# game/script.rpy:6828
translate Chinese mushroomBox_a20cefa7_1:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:6829
translate Chinese mushroomBox_00620a41_1:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:6831
translate Chinese mushroomBox_1d169db6_1:

  # "And what happened to the thief, you ask?"
  "你问那个小偷后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:6834
translate Chinese mushroomBox_fb9a55f6_1:

  # "You hesitated - but in the end you couldn't bring yourself to break your promise to the mushroom."
  "你犹豫了——但最终你还是不忍心违背对蘑菇的承诺。"

# game/script.rpy:6836
translate Chinese mushroomBox_04f4aa64:

  # "And so the Devil took you, and you were trapped as his servant in Hell forever and ever, until the final horn and the coming of the end of days."
  "于是魔鬼带走了你，你沦为他的奴仆，被永远囚禁于地狱中，直到末日的最后一声号角吹响。"

# game/script.rpy:6838
translate Chinese mushroomBox_a20cefa7_2:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:6839
translate Chinese mushroomBox_00620a41_2:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:6841
translate Chinese mushroomBox_1d169db6_2:

  # "And what happened to the thief, you ask?"
  "你问那个小偷后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:6844
translate Chinese mushroomBox_0d5f3033:

  # "And so you stayed there, forever searching for an entrance back to that kingdom you missed so much."
  "于是你留在了那里，永远徒劳地寻找着入口，渴盼回到你无比思念的那个王国。"

# game/script.rpy:6845
translate Chinese mushroomBox_b3385fc1:

  # "For years you searched, with no success. Soon, the Ash Giants came upon the world, and you felt their searing light upon your skin."
  "你找了许多年，一无所获。很快，灰烬巨人降临于世，你感到他们灼目的光芒在炙烤你的肌肤。"

# game/script.rpy:6846
translate Chinese mushroomBox_0f3cd88f:

  # "As the light burnt you away, you felt something take hold of you and draw you into the earth."
  "当那光芒将你寸寸焚毁之际，你感觉到有什么东西抓住了你，把你拉入地下。"

# game/script.rpy:6847
translate Chinese mushroomBox_f73a4514:

  # m "It's ok."
  m "没事的。"

# game/script.rpy:6848
translate Chinese mushroomBox_6d4e752c:

  # m2 "It's just me."
  m2 "是我。"

# game/script.rpy:6849
translate Chinese mushroomBox_ae0aea7c:

  # m3 "Just us."
  m3 "是我们。"

# game/script.rpy:6850
translate Chinese mushroomBox_cb292801:

  # m3 "You've returned."
  m3 "你回来了。"

# game/script.rpy:6852
translate Chinese mushroomBox_b7c02d24:

  # "Your pig jumped out from the arms of the mushroom and danced around you in glee."
  "你的小猪从蘑菇的怀里跳了出来，高兴地围着你又蹦又跳。"

# game/script.rpy:6857
translate Chinese mushroomBox_0ad8852e:

  # "And so your godmother finally came for you, as promised. The mushrooms took you down into the earth. There you stayed at the side of Lady Death, forever and ever, until the work was complete, and the glory of it shone out forevermore."
  "就这样，你的教母最终如约来接你了。蘑菇们将你带入地底。你留在了那里，永远相伴于死神夫人身侧，直到大业终成，无上荣光将长明不灭。"

# game/script.rpy:6859
translate Chinese mushroomBox_ced1d098:

  # "The mushrooms took you down into the earth. There you stayed at the side of Lady Death, forever and ever, until the work was complete, and the glory of it shone out forevermore."
  "蘑菇们将你带入地底。你留在了那里，永远相伴于死神夫人身侧，直到大业终成，无上荣光将长明不灭。"

# game/script.rpy:6861
translate Chinese mushroomBox_a20cefa7_3:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:6862
translate Chinese mushroomBox_00620a41_3:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:6863
translate Chinese mushroomBox_1d169db6_3:

  # "And what happened to the thief, you ask?"
  "你问那个小偷后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:6888
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_259460d3:

  # "After you were taken they strolled away from the tree, laughing and clutching their ill-gotten gains. "
  "你被带走后，小偷从树旁慢悠悠地离开，一边大笑一边紧紧捂着得来的不义之财。"

# game/script.rpy:6889
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_c5317d16:

  # t "Another successful heist."
  t "又是一票完美的打劫。"

# game/script.rpy:6890
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_e6d1edd3:

  # h "Hold it right there!"
  h "站住别动！"

# game/script.rpy:6891
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_79e85fae:

  # "The hunter, the sparrow-herder and the goose-girl leapt from the bushes and surrounded the thief, holding pitchforks and rakes and an old shovel."
  "猎人、牧雀人和牧鹅女从灌木丛里跳了出来，拿着干草叉、耙子和一把破铁锹，把小偷团团围住。"

# game/script.rpy:6892
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_60c658d9:

  # go "Looks like your day is done, scoundrel!"
  go "看来你的好日子到头了，恶棍！"

# game/script.rpy:6893
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_7ce5906d:

  # sh "Yeah! We got you bang to rights, we have."
  sh "没错！这下可是把你抓了个现行。"

# game/script.rpy:6894
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_12b65bb0:

  # "The three of them jeered and prodded the thief with glee."
  "这三人嬉皮笑脸地起哄着，拿手里的家伙去戳那小偷。"

# game/script.rpy:6895
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_d9d45be8:

  # t "Ha ha ha! Well, if you think you're going to take me to jail, I'm afraid..."
  t "哈哈哈！好吧，如果你们以为能把我送进监狱，那我只能说……"

# game/script.rpy:6897
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_f04fad0b:

  # "The thief trailed off."
  "小偷的声音渐渐弱了下去。"

# game/script.rpy:6898
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_c460b3f8:

  # "There was a sound in the woods."
  "林子里传来一阵声响。"

# game/script.rpy:6900
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_bdcc604c:

  # "A low, hushed and ragged sound, like a howl in the wind."
  "那声音低沉、喑哑而破碎，就像风中的嚎叫。"

# game/script.rpy:6901
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_72f78750:

  # t "Did you hear that?"
  t "你们听到了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6902
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_0461c535:

  # t "Was that... the wolf?"
  t "那是……狼吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6903
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_43641069:

  # h "Don't try to distract us, you wretched cur. There are no wolves in Australia."
  h "少来分散我们的注意力，你这可恶的杂种。澳大利亚根本没有狼。"

# game/script.rpy:6904
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_7623c0c0:

  # sh "Yeah! We won't be turned away that easily!"
  sh "就是！我们可没那么容易被吓退！"

# game/script.rpy:6907
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_51defe2d:

  # "The two of them jabbed at the thief."
  "他们两个又狠狠戳了小偷一下。"

# game/script.rpy:6909
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_0349ef2e:

  # "It was always just the two of them. The Hunter and the Sparrow-herder, cornering the thief."
  "一直以来都只有他们两个。猎人和牧雀人，再无旁人。"

# game/script.rpy:6910
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_80503cfd:

  # "No-one else was there."
  "再无旁人。"

# game/script.rpy:6911
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_f6747ba7:

  # h "Come on, let's grab them."
  h "来吧，抓住这贼。"

# game/script.rpy:6912
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_45993ae6:

  # "The thief looked down."
  "小偷往下看去。"

# game/script.rpy:6913
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_adf9d328:

  # "There was a dark red stain on the ground. In the dirt where a third person would have stood."
  "地上有一滩暗红色的污迹，渗在那块本该站着第三个人的泥土中。"

# game/script.rpy:6914
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_d2401107:

  # "But of course, no such person had ever been there."
  "当然了，根本不曾有这样一个人存在过。"

# game/script.rpy:6915
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_1fe9353a:

  # t "Something's wrong. I think we need to run."
  t "不对劲。我觉得我们得跑了。"

# game/script.rpy:6919
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_7fa48e70:

  # "The trees rustled, as if with the movement of something colossal."
  "树木沙沙作响，仿佛有什么庞然大物正从中穿行。"

# game/script.rpy:6920
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_01391250:

  # sh "Ha! You'd like that, wouldn't you? Just when I've got you cornered."
  sh "哈！你想得美，对吧？我好不容易才把你逼到绝境。"

# game/script.rpy:6921
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_0f36c321:

  # sh "No, you're coming with me, chum."
  sh "不，你得跟我走，小子。"

# game/script.rpy:6922
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_087bcd93:

  # "The sparrow-herder grabbed the thief."
  "牧雀人一把抓住了小偷。"

# game/script.rpy:6923
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_13a5cbc2:

  # "The two of them were alone in the clearing."
  "林间空地上，只剩下他们两人。"

# game/script.rpy:6924
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_0d57b135:

  # "There was no-one else."
  "没有别人。"

# game/script.rpy:6926
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_f15cf35c:

  # t "Come on!"
  t "快跑！"

# game/script.rpy:6927
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_74f48ccc:

  # sh "Hold on, I -"
  sh "等等，我——"

# game/script.rpy:6930
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_0e9e05f0:

  # "The thief dragged the sparrow-herder through the woods and burst out of the woods to a field with a small cottage, surrounded by geese."
  "小偷拉着牧雀人穿过树林，扎进一片田野，那里有一座被鹅群包围的小屋。"

# game/script.rpy:6931
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_b404e916:

  # sh "What are you doing?"
  sh "你干什么？"

# game/script.rpy:6932
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_88539779:

  # "It was echoing and empty."
  "屋里空荡荡的，只有回声作响。"

# game/script.rpy:6933
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_b79c9329:

  # "No-one lived there but geese. No-one ever had."
  "那里除了鹅，空无一人。从来都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:6934
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_755ab976:

  # t "Help! Someone help us!"
  t "救命！谁来救救我们！"

# game/script.rpy:6938
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_f143ecc0:

  # "Who are you calling out to, Thief?"
  "你在跟谁求救呢，小偷？"

# game/script.rpy:6939
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_c79ceb0c:

  # "You're alone. You always have been."
  "你只有一个人。一直以来，都只有你一个人。"

# game/script.rpy:6941
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_03ce5d2c:

  # t "No, they're right here, they -"
  t "不，他们就在这儿，他们——"

# game/script.rpy:6945
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_a905474e:

  # "They looked around. There was no-one there."
  "小偷环顾四周。那里空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:6946
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_6f4d7a8b:

  # "The trees were silent."
  "树木寂静无声。"

# game/script.rpy:6947
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_7ea78c28:

  # "No animals lived in this part of the woods. No bird calls troubled its vast, silent depths. The woods were dead."
  "这片树林里没有任何活物。也没有一声鸟啼惊扰深邃广袤的死寂。这片树林早已死去。"

# game/script.rpy:6948
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_ab2d73c7:

  # "The thief ran through the forest, ragged and alone."
  "小偷衣衫褴褛，独自在森林里奔跑。"

# game/script.rpy:6949
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_4b82a107:

  # "They searched their memories. Had there ever been a time before this one? Another place?"
  "小偷搜寻着自己的记忆。真的存在过比这更早的时光吗？存在过别的地方吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6950
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_9457eac6:

  # "Had there ever been anyone else in the world but them?"
  "这个世界上除了自己，真的还存在过其他人吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6951
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_9ab83624:

  # "They could remember nothing except this. A single frozen moment of running through the woods in fear, alone."
  "除了这个，什么也记不起来。只剩下一个凝固的瞬间：孤身一人，在恐惧中穿行于树林狂奔。"

# game/script.rpy:6952
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_23c105a5:

  # "There was nothing else."
  "再没有别的了。"

# game/script.rpy:6953
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_8f67b3ef:

  # "There had never been anything else."
  "从来就没有别的。"

# game/script.rpy:6954
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_14f55cec:

  # "Hot breath warmed the back of their neck."
  "一股滚烫的吐息喷洒在后颈上。"

# game/script.rpy:6955
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_9fed0bad:

  # "They ran as fast as they could. But it was no use, of course. There was no-where to run to."
  "小偷拼命地跑。但这当然无济于事。根本无处可逃。"

# game/script.rpy:6956
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_9ac4415d:

  # t "Please... I-"
  t "求求你……我——"

# game/script.rpy:6966
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_40443c6a:

  # "And then there was nothing."
  "然后，就什么都没有了。"

# game/script.rpy:6967
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_5f226d05:

  # "The woods were empty."
  "树林里空荡荡的。"

# game/script.rpy:6968
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_218688d2:

  # "There was never anything there at all."
  "那里从来就没有任何东西。"

# game/script.rpy:6969
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_85637270:

  # "Just a ragged midnight cloak, stained red, that floated away in the breeze and was gone forever."
  "只剩下一件破烂的午夜斗篷，沾染着红色，随风飘走，永远地消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:6971
translate Chinese thiefDisappears_472d5772:

  # "It was never seen again."
  "再也没有人见过它。"

# game/script.rpy:6978
translate Chinese toad1_7d198a09:

  # "He gulped down the rest of his plate and stumbled unsteadily away from the table."
  "他把盘子里剩下的食物囫囵吞下，摇摇晃晃地离开了桌子。"

# game/script.rpy:6980
translate Chinese toad1_5f48f7c8:

  # "You, the toad and the pig stepped into the squash carriage, and it went rattling away down the path into the rainforest."
  "你、蟾蜍和小猪踏进了歪瓜马车，马车沿着小径颠簸着驶入了雨林。"

# game/script.rpy:6982
translate Chinese toad1_988773b2:

  # "You both stepped into the squash carriage, and it went rattling away down the path into the rainforest."
  "你们俩踏进了歪瓜马车，马车沿着小径颠簸着驶入了雨林。"

# game/script.rpy:6985
translate Chinese toad1_f58fdaeb:

  # "As you went down the road, the forest began to get darker and darker."
  "随着你们沿路前行，森林变得越来越黑。"

# game/script.rpy:6987
translate Chinese toad1_e8d7e0fa:

  # "The trees closed in like a wall around you. The night sky was black, and shed no light."
  "树木像一堵墙一样将你们围住。夜空漆黑一片，透不出一丝光亮。"

# game/script.rpy:6989
translate Chinese toad1_39203e4e:

  # "The trees closed in like a wall around you, and the moon and stars fled in fear."
  "树木像一堵墙一样将你们围住，连月亮和星星都吓得躲了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:6990
translate Chinese toad1_890adacb:

  # f "Nothing to fear, my friend! My boys will get us through this dark road, quick smart!"
  f "没什么好怕的，我的朋友！我的小伙子们很快就能带我们穿过这条漆黑的路！"

# game/script.rpy:6991
translate Chinese toad1_4cd6097b:

  # "He waved the crow-shrike, the rat, the bat and the old black cockatoo onwards. But instead of going faster, they slowed down and came to a stop."
  "他挥手示意白背钟鹊、老鼠、蝙蝠和那只衰老的黑凤头鹦鹉继续赶路。但它们非但没有加速，反而慢了下来，最后停住了。"

# game/script.rpy:6992
translate Chinese toad1_b606f4c2:

  # f "What? Why are you stopping?"
  f "怎么回事？你们怎么停下了？"

# game/script.rpy:6993
translate Chinese toad1_dffc5902:

  # crowshrike "Well... now seems as good a time as any."
  crowshrike "嗯……我看现在这节骨眼就挺合适。"

# game/script.rpy:6994
translate Chinese toad1_4dc34cab:

  # rat "We've been meaning to have a bit of a chat with you, mate."
  rat "我们一直想找你聊聊，伙计。"

# game/script.rpy:6995
translate Chinese toad1_d7fa0eca:

  # bat "About the payment situation."
  bat "关于报酬的问题。"

# game/script.rpy:6997
translate Chinese toad1_66594f08:

  # "The toad coughed nervously."
  "蟾蜍紧张地咳了一声。"

# game/script.rpy:6998
translate Chinese toad1_8854ed73:

  # f "I-I assure you fellows, the check is in the mail..."
  f "我——我向各位保证，支票已经在邮寄的路上了……"

# game/script.rpy:6999
translate Chinese toad1_1e4ec77d:

  # cockatoo "Not good enough. Get him, boys!"
  cockatoo "这可不行。上，兄弟们！"

# game/script.rpy:7000
translate Chinese toad1_4ed18ba3:

  # "And with that they fell on the toad and took him for all he was worth and dumped him on the side of the road."
  "说着，它们扑向蟾蜍，把他身上值钱的东西扒了个精光，然后把他丢在了路边。"

# game/script.rpy:7001
translate Chinese toad1_2b015e8a:

  # "Then they turned to you and respectfully escorted you from the carriage."
  "接着它们转向你，恭恭敬敬地把你请下了马车。"

# game/script.rpy:7006
translate Chinese toad1_fdceaf7e:

  # crowshrike "Sorry about all that. You seem nice enough. Good luck with it." nointeract
  crowshrike "刚才让你受惊了。你看着是个好人。祝你好运。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:7008
translate Chinese toad1_683fc9ba:

  # rat "Yeah, nah."
  rat "算了吧，免谈。"

# game/script.rpy:7009
translate Chinese toad1_2e7db720:

  # cockatoo "I can't let the boys risk their necks with the Wild Witch of the Woods."
  cockatoo "我可不能让弟兄们冒着掉脑袋的风险，去招惹那林中野女巫。"

# game/script.rpy:7010
translate Chinese toad1_82dc6bb8:

  # "They all shivered."
  "它们全都打了个寒战。"

# game/script.rpy:7011
translate Chinese toad1_f1258eae:

  # crowshrike "If you live through it, come get a drink with us sometime."
  crowshrike "要是你能活着出来，改天找我们喝一杯。"

# game/script.rpy:7013
translate Chinese toad1_d0a96da9:

  # bat "Back to the feast, I reckon."
  bat "我觉得我们该回宴会去了。"

# game/script.rpy:7014
translate Chinese toad1_f99e90e3:

  # bat "There's some mangos in the gutter with my name on them."
  bat "排水沟里还有几个专门留给我的芒果呢。"

# game/script.rpy:7016
translate Chinese toad1_abfd388e:

  # "They jumped in the old rotten squash and rode it away back to the village, leaving you, the toad and the pig on the side of the road."
  "它们跳进那个旧歪瓜里，驾车扬长而去，一路回了村子，把你、蟾蜍和小猪留在了路边。"

# game/script.rpy:7018
translate Chinese toad1_7ecf522d:

  # "They jumped in the old rotten squash and rode it away back to the village, leaving you both on the side of the road."
  "它们跳进那个旧歪瓜里，驾车扬长而去，一路回了村子，只留下你们俩被扔在路边。"

# game/script.rpy:7019
translate Chinese toad1_16d222d1:

  # f "...Uh..."
  f "……呃……"

# game/script.rpy:7020
translate Chinese toad1_8b8afecd:

  # f "A-another successful adventure! Good thing I was able to fight off those ruffians!"
  f "又——又是一次成功的冒险！幸亏我身手了得，击退了那些流氓！"

# game/script.rpy:7021
translate Chinese toad1_072c6977:

  # "He coughed up some mud from the ditch, shuddering weakly."
  "他虚弱地颤抖着，咳出几口沟里的烂泥。"

# game/script.rpy:7022
translate Chinese toad1_65dd26db:

  # "Then he stood up and said to himself sternly:"
  "然后他站起身，严厉地对自己说："

# game/script.rpy:7023
translate Chinese toad1_47a5c784:

  # f "I am Bridlebrogue Chippingham, and I've never failed at anything in my life."
  f "我是布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉，我这辈子从没把事办砸过。"

# game/script.rpy:7024
translate Chinese toad1_01cb5bff:

  # "With this, he regained his former swagger and strode forward."
  "说完，他恢复了之前大摇大摆的神态，大步向前走去。"

# game/script.rpy:7025
translate Chinese toad1_76078d80:

  # "The night grew dark."
  "夜色渐深。"

# game/script.rpy:7026
translate Chinese toad1_20a97d78:

  # "You walked through the trees together."
  "你们一同穿行在树林中。"

# game/script.rpy:7029
translate Chinese toad1_3573de1c:

  # "The Firmament looked down at you from Her place up above."
  "苍穹高高在上地俯视着你。"

# game/script.rpy:7038
translate Chinese toad1_8c4e262a:

  # pov "How do you know where the witch's cottage is?"
  pov "你怎么知道女巫的小屋在哪儿？"

# game/script.rpy:7039
translate Chinese toad1_f21180ae:

  # f "Oh... just my natural good sense of direction, I suppose! Ha ha!"
  f "哦……大概是因为我天生方向感好吧！哈哈！"

# game/script.rpy:7040
translate Chinese toad1_7a829e33:

  # f "When you become an adventurer like me, you just know these things."
  f "等你成为像我这样的冒险家，你自然就会知道了。"

# game/script.rpy:7042
translate Chinese toad1_5313148f:

  # pov "Have you been through this part of the forest before?"
  pov "你以前穿过森林的这一带吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7043
translate Chinese toad1_dacfc0e3:

  # f "Oh... no, of course not. No, I'm far too busy being off at more important places, with more important people. All across the world. Barely have a moment to myself, you know."
  f "哦……没，当然没有。不，我忙得很，得去更重要的地方，见更重要的人物。满世界飞。你懂的，连一点喘息的私人时间都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:7044
translate Chinese toad1_2fefba53:

  # f "I wouldn't have the slightest idea what it's like to live in a swamp like this. Ha. Ha."
  f "我根本不知道住在这破沼泽里是什么感觉。哈。哈。"

# game/script.rpy:7045
translate Chinese toad1_724422ec:

  # f "Come on, we can't let ourselves be cowed by a little darkness! Why, I remember when I was journeying through the pits of Arborkios, where darkness is forged on a black anvil of star-stuff, and the blackest night shelters for rest each night after being torn apart by the light of day each morning! Well, I marched right on through that black pit, and I said -"
  f "来吧，我们可不能被这点黑暗吓倒！哎呀，我记得当我穿越阿波基奥斯的深坑时，那里的黑暗是在星尘铸就的黑铁砧上锻造而出的，即便是至暗的夜，在每天清晨被天光撕裂后，也得在入夜时逃往那里寻求庇护！嗯，我就那样直接穿过了那个黑色深坑，我说——"

# game/script.rpy:7046
translate Chinese toad1_fbf3e6bc:

  # f "Ack!"
  f "啊！"

# game/script.rpy:7047
translate Chinese toad1_6a39c858:

  # "You heard him trip over in front of you and go tumbling down and down through the muck of the rainforest until he fell into a deep pit and landed at the bottom with a crash."
  "你听到他在你前面绊倒了，顺着雨林的淤泥不断往下翻滚、跌落，直到掉进一个深坑，砰地一声砸在坑底。"

# game/script.rpy:7048
translate Chinese toad1_0f1f9765:

  # "You picked your way carefully down to him."
  "你小心翼翼地摸索到他身边。"

# game/script.rpy:7049
translate Chinese toad1_01df78fb:

  # f "Never fear! I have found... a shortcut!"
  f "别怕！我找到了一条……捷径！"

# game/script.rpy:7051
translate Chinese toad1_86f1e3dd:

  # "The pig pushed the toad with its snout."
  "小猪用鼻子拱了拱蟾蜍。"

# game/script.rpy:7052
translate Chinese toad1_dcddb205:

  # f "I just... need a moment. M-might have... sprained my ankle there, I think. And maybe my arm."
  f "我只是……需要缓一下。我想我可能……把脚踝扭了。也许胳膊也扭到了。"

# game/script.rpy:7053
translate Chinese toad1_9d860f48:

  # "He wheezed and lay there in the mud for a long time, breathing heavily and trying not to cry."
  "他在泥里躺了很久，喘着粗气，极力忍着不哭出声来。"

# game/script.rpy:7054
translate Chinese toad1_70d36b2f:

  # "You heard him whisper to himself weakly."
  "你听到他虚弱地喃喃自语。"

# game/script.rpy:7055
translate Chinese toad1_9bdd426e:

  # f "I am B-brildebrogue Chippingham. And I..."
  f "我是布——布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉。而我……"

# game/script.rpy:7063
translate Chinese toad1_dfecfe3d:

  # "You reached down and found the toad's hand."
  "你探下身子，握住了蟾蜍的手。"

# game/script.rpy:7064
translate Chinese toad1_7b4b773a:

  # "Even in the darkness, you saw him blush bright red."
  "即使在黑暗中，你也能看到他脸红到了脖子根。"

# game/script.rpy:7065
translate Chinese toad1_3c00f237:

  # f "Well I - t-this is all most..."
  f "这个我——这、这实在太……"

# game/script.rpy:7066
translate Chinese toad1_0d20b017:

  # f "Hand-holding, before marriage? What will people say?"
  f "婚前就牵手？这传出去像什么话？"

# game/script.rpy:7067
translate Chinese toad1_418ee78d:

  # "You picked him up out of the muck and put him on your shoulder."
  "你把他从烂泥里捞了起来，放在你的肩膀上。"

# game/script.rpy:7068
translate Chinese toad1_79a2cd79:

  # f "Good, good. I-I'll lead you onward."
  f "很好，很好。我——我来带路。"

# game/script.rpy:7070
translate Chinese toad1_d9f31646:

  # f "W-what are you doing? Wait!"
  f "你、你在干什么？等等！"

# game/script.rpy:7071
translate Chinese toad1_f033040b:

  # "His voice faded behind you as you walked away into the darkness."
  "随着你径直步入黑暗，他的声音在你身后渐渐远去。"

# game/script.rpy:7075
translate Chinese toad1_faef132d:

  # "You walked on. Soon, you began to see a glimmer of silver light in the darkness."
  "你继续走着。很快，你在黑暗中看到了一线闪烁的银光。"

# game/script.rpy:7078
translate Chinese toad1_0780a027:

  # "The forest was covered in puddles of water from the rains. Each one shone with light."
  "森林里到处都是雨后积起的水洼。每一个都泛着微光。"

# game/script.rpy:7079
translate Chinese toad1_0a2eced7:

  # "All around you, the woods were dark and empty. But when you looked into the water, you saw the reflection of a shining cottage below."
  "你周围的树林黑暗而空旷。但当你向水里看去时，却看到下方倒映着一座闪闪发光的小屋。"

# game/script.rpy:7083
translate Chinese toad1_0ae9bcd0:

  # ""
  ""

# game/script.rpy:7088
translate Chinese toad1_1668d521:

  # "For a brief moment, you thought you saw a figure reflected in the water. But as soon as you blinked, it was gone."
  "有那么短短的一瞬，你以为看到水里倒映着一个人影。但你一眨眼，它就不见了。"

# game/script.rpy:7100
translate Chinese puddle_e7f50077:

  # "You crawled to the edge and looked down into the puddle."
  "你爬到边缘，低头看向水洼。"

# game/script.rpy:7101
translate Chinese puddle_7cd147f0:

  # "The surface of the water was flat and still."
  "水面平静如镜。"

# game/script.rpy:7104
translate Chinese puddle_307d5c87:

  # "The cottage in the reflection shone with bright light, as if the setting sun was behind it."
  "倒影中的小屋闪耀着明亮的光芒，仿佛夕阳正从它背后照来。"

# game/script.rpy:7107
translate Chinese puddle_61023088:

  # "There was no trace of a cottage in the world above the water."
  "在水面上的世界里，根本找不到任何小屋的踪迹。"

# game/script.rpy:7111
translate Chinese puddle_26014a45:

  # "You picked up a stick from the ground, and tossed it into the puddle."
  "你从地上捡起一根树枝，扔进水洼里。"

# game/script.rpy:7112
translate Chinese puddle_ff499cad:

  # "It fell in without a single ripple in the water."
  "树枝落入水中，水面却未泛起一丝涟漪。"

# game/script.rpy:7113
translate Chinese puddle_ac59d260:

  # "You saw it drop through into the reflection, and land close to the cottage."
  "你看到它落入倒影里，落在小屋附近。"

# game/script.rpy:7114
translate Chinese puddle_37e73c24:

  # "You looked up. There was no trace of it in the world outside the reflection."
  "你抬起头。在倒影外的世界里，根本找不到那根树枝的踪迹。"

# game/script.rpy:7119
translate Chinese puddle_7be3ad39:

  # "You grabbed the pig and the toad to you, then leapt into the puddle."
  "你一把抓过小猪和蟾蜍，然后跳进了水洼。"

# game/script.rpy:7121
translate Chinese puddle_7b024584:

  # "You held the toad tight, then leapt into the puddle."
  "你紧紧抱住蟾蜍，然后跳进了水洼。"

# game/script.rpy:7124
translate Chinese puddle_34bd7779:

  # "The world flipped over."
  "世界翻转了。"

# game/script.rpy:7125
translate Chinese puddle_17e60d48:

  # "You felt the water pass over you, and a cool chill tingled all through your body."
  "你感觉到水流漫过你，一股清凉的寒意传遍全身。"

# game/script.rpy:7128
translate Chinese puddle_f108985a:

  # "When you opened your eyes, you were standing right way up again."
  "当你睁开双眼时，发现自己又重新正立了过来。"

# game/script.rpy:7129
translate Chinese puddle_0fec5802:

  # "The puddle you had jumped into was now a floor, like a silver mirror."
  "刚刚跳入的那个水洼，此刻变成了银镜般的地板。"

# game/script.rpy:7130
translate Chinese puddle_f590bf40:

  # "The world all around you shone white."
  "周围的世界闪耀着白光。"

# game/script.rpy:7131
translate Chinese puddle_fb1d5a14:

  # "At the centre of the puddle was the cottage, shining with light."
  "水洼的中心就是那座小屋，闪耀着光芒。"

# game/script.rpy:7132
translate Chinese puddle_d9f83a34:

  # "The toad was very quiet now. His fine suit was ruined with mud. He jumped out of your hand and sat down."
  "蟾蜍现在非常安静。他那套考究的西装已经糊满了污泥。他从你手中跳下，瘫坐在一旁。"

# game/script.rpy:7134
translate Chinese puddle_43df4ffe:

  # f "You'd... better go on. I'd just slow you down."
  f "你……最好还是自己走吧。我只会拖累你。"

# game/script.rpy:7141
translate Chinese puddle_952da51c:

  # pov "Thanks for pretending to fall down back there."
  pov "谢谢你刚才假装摔倒。"

# game/script.rpy:7142
translate Chinese puddle_e956e03d:

  # f "What?"
  f "什么？"

# game/script.rpy:7143
translate Chinese puddle_71665a20:

  # pov "Well, I know you must have done it deliberately. Just so I would have something to do."
  pov "嗯，我知道你肯定是故意的。只是为了让我也能派上点用场。"

# game/script.rpy:7144
translate Chinese puddle_35a3c170:

  # pov "After all, you were leading us here so easily!"
  pov "毕竟，你带我们来这儿简直是轻而易举！"

# game/script.rpy:7145
translate Chinese puddle_73d48273:

  # pov "Thanks for making me feel included."
  pov "谢谢你让我觉得我也出了一份力。"

# game/script.rpy:7146
translate Chinese puddle_8edfe287:

  # f "Oh. I..."
  f "哦。我……"

# game/script.rpy:7147
translate Chinese puddle_cc1ced25:

  # "He brightened up."
  "他两眼放光。"

# game/script.rpy:7148
translate Chinese puddle_e0d9490e:

  # f "Yes, I had to make sure you were included! We're both on this adventure together, after all. We're a team."
  f "没错，我得确保让你也有参与感！毕竟这场冒险是我们俩一起的。我们是一个团队嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:7149
translate Chinese puddle_08eefaa0:

  # "You saw him start to smile shakily."
  "你看到他开始勉强挤出一丝微笑。"

# game/script.rpy:7150
translate Chinese puddle_5cfcca6d:

  # f "I did do a decent job getting us here, didn't I?"
  f "我这一路领航领得还算漂亮，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:7151
translate Chinese puddle_92095506:

  # pov "Of course!"
  pov "当然了！"

# game/script.rpy:7152
translate Chinese puddle_313de22f:

  # "You gently slapped him across the back."
  "你轻轻拍了拍他的背。"

# game/script.rpy:7153
translate Chinese puddle_c4b62cf1:

  # pov "You're Brildebrogue Chippingham, and you've never failed at anything in your life."
  pov "你是布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉，你这辈子从没把事办砸过。"

# game/script.rpy:7154
translate Chinese puddle_125bfe54:

  # "With this, the toad wiped the tears from his eyes, and beamed."
  "听了这话，蟾蜍抹去眼角的泪水，眉开眼笑。"

# game/script.rpy:7157
translate Chinese puddle_10365580:

  # pov "You have. It would be better if you'd never come."
  pov "你确实是。要是你当初根本没跟来就好了。"

# game/script.rpy:7158
translate Chinese puddle_263bf7dd:

  # "The toad winced and looked away, trying not to cry."
  "蟾蜍瑟缩了一下，移开视线，极力忍住不哭。"

# game/script.rpy:7159
translate Chinese puddle_fed4aafa:

  # f "You're right. I'm sorry."
  f "你说得对。对不起。"

# game/script.rpy:7160
translate Chinese puddle_247394c8:

  # f "I just..."
  f "我只是……"

# game/script.rpy:7161
translate Chinese puddle_f9a6c8b6:

  # f "I wanted to go on an adventure."
  f "我想经历一场冒险。"

# game/script.rpy:7162
translate Chinese puddle_b40988bc:

  # f "I'll stay here, then. Don't want to get in your way."
  f "那我就留在这里吧。不想再碍你的眼了。"

# game/script.rpy:7163
translate Chinese puddle_beb349a3:

  # f "But if you aren't out in ten minutes, I... I'll come in to rescue you. Alright?"
  f "但如果你十分钟内还没出来，我……我就进去救你。好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7164
translate Chinese puddle_b40cd7cf:

  # "You agreed."
  "你同意了。"

# game/script.rpy:7168
translate Chinese puddle_c7505df1:

  # "You crossed the river paths to the cottage in the centre."
  "你穿过河间小路，走向中心的小屋。"

# game/script.rpy:7169
translate Chinese puddle_45b702f7:

  # "Up over the walls grew a riot of herbs and flowers of every type, rambling over everything and growing in a lush green-grass garden on the roof. "
  "墙上长满了各种各样的草药和花朵，藤蔓肆意缠绕着一切，甚至在屋顶上长成了一片郁郁葱葱的青草花园。"

# game/script.rpy:7171
translate Chinese puddle_694585b8:

  # "The pig munched on some violets blooming from the windowsill."
  "小猪嚼起了在窗台上绽放的几朵紫罗兰。"

# game/script.rpy:7172
translate Chinese puddle_6be40cbb:

  # "You saw the glimmer of two red eyes watching you from a small crook in the roof. Then there was a gasp from inside, and they disappeared."
  "你看到两只闪烁的红眼睛从屋顶的一个小缝隙里盯着你。接着里面传来一声倒吸凉气的声音，红眼睛消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:7174
translate Chinese puddle_a6b81705:

  # "The closer you got to the cottage, the more the toad shook with terror."
  "你们越靠近小屋，蟾蜍抖得越厉害。"

# game/script.rpy:7175
translate Chinese puddle_65f650db:

  # pov "You'd better stay behind. Guard the rear."
  pov "你最好留在这里。帮我殿后。"

# game/script.rpy:7176
translate Chinese puddle_4bd0df12:

  # f "G-good idea."
  f "好、好主意。"

# game/script.rpy:7177
translate Chinese puddle_9c226226:

  # f "But be wary, my friend. Few have ever left that cottage alive."
  f "但要当心，我的朋友。很少有人能活着离开那座小屋。"

# game/script.rpy:7178
translate Chinese puddle_287ce3b2:

  # f "Witches have red eyes. They see very far, but they have a keen sense of smell, like animals, and can sense when humans are near them."
  f "女巫长着红眼睛。她们不但看得很远，而且嗅觉像野兽一样敏锐，大老远就能闻出人类靠近的活人气。"

# game/script.rpy:7179
translate Chinese puddle_0f0e93d0:

  # f "If you aren't out in ten minutes, I'll come in there to rescue you."
  f "如果你十分钟内还没出来，我就进去救你。"

# game/script.rpy:7184
translate Chinese toadFinale_40b33880:

  # "You leapt to defend the toad, diving and pushing him away from the slashes of the crooked dagger."
  "你扑过去保护蟾蜍，一把将他撞开，躲过了那把弯曲匕首的乱劈。"

# game/script.rpy:7186
translate Chinese toadFinale_b1334e31:

  # "The pig joined the melee and tried to defend you. As it did, a black vial of liquid smashed over the three of you and you were all instantly turned into witchetty grubs."
  "小猪加入了混战，试图保护你。就在这时，一个盛着液体的黑色药瓶在你们三个身上砸碎，你们瞬间全都被变成了木蠹蛾幼虫。"

# game/script.rpy:7188
translate Chinese toadFinale_1e3f8a63:

  # "As you pulled him away, a black vial of liquid smashed over the two of you and you were both instantly turned into witchetty grubs."
  "就在你一把将他拉开时，一瓶黑色的液体在你们俩身上砸碎，你们瞬间全都被变成了木蠹蛾幼虫。"

# game/script.rpy:7190
translate Chinese toadFinale_88b145f8:

  # "The cottage wall gave way and you were washed out of the house in a multicoloured wave of potions."
  "小屋的墙壁塌了，你们被五彩斑斓的魔药洪流冲出了屋子。"

# game/script.rpy:7192
translate Chinese toadFinale_ff0585a0:

  # "The cottage wall gave way and you were both washed out of the house in a multicoloured wave of potions."
  "小屋的墙壁塌了，你们俩被五彩斑斓的魔药洪流冲出了屋子。"

# game/script.rpy:7195
translate Chinese toadFinale_8d86280c:

  # "The world flipped upside down as you fell through the silver puddle outside, and you found yourself caught up in a torrent of writhing fish and magpies and bats and crocodiles being washed down the rainforest river, all transforming into new animals every second."
  "当你从外面的银色水洼跌落时，世界天翻地覆。你发现自己被卷入了一股狂暴的洪流，顺着雨林的河道冲刷而下，身边全是疯狂扭动的鱼群、喜鹊、蝙蝠和鳄鱼，每一秒都在变幻成全新的动物。"

# game/script.rpy:7197
translate Chinese toadFinale_eb870944:

  # "You popped into a cat, then a fish, then back into a witchetty grub again. The toad turned into a water-rat and whirled around. The pig turned into a platypus and strained against the current to reach you."
  "你变成了一只猫，接着变成鱼，然后又变回了木蠹蛾幼虫。蟾蜍变成了一只水鼠，在水里晕头转向地打着转。小猪则变成了一只鸭嘴兽，拼命逆着水流朝你扑腾过来。"

# game/script.rpy:7199
translate Chinese toadFinale_447f76d1:

  # "You popped into a cat, then a fish, then back into a witchetty grub again. The toad turned into a water-rat and whirled around."
  "你变成了一只猫，接着变成鱼，然后又变回了木蠹蛾幼虫。蟾蜍变成了一只水鼠，在水里晕头转向地打着转。"

# game/script.rpy:7200
translate Chinese toadFinale_9528efa2:

  # fr "Watch out!"
  fr "小心！"

# game/script.rpy:7201
translate Chinese toadFinale_ee9f1846:

  # "A greedy magpie dove for you as you squirmed helplessly."
  "正当你无助地扭动时，一只贪婪的喜鹊朝你俯冲下来。"

# game/script.rpy:7202
translate Chinese toadFinale_705db284:

  # "The toad transformed into a gecko and grabbed you, dropping his tail."
  "蟾蜍变成了一只壁虎，一把抓住你，断掉了自己的尾巴。"

# game/script.rpy:7204
translate Chinese toadFinale_bc94c89a:

  # "The magpie grabbed the tail and flew off, before turning into a wallaby and falling back in the river."
  "喜鹊抓起尾巴飞走了，随后它变成了一只沙袋鼠，又掉回了河里。"

# game/script.rpy:7205
translate Chinese toadFinale_597fff71:

  # fg "Hold on! I know where to go!"
  fg "抓紧！我知道该去哪儿！"

# game/script.rpy:7206
translate Chinese toadFinale_116f85e8:

  # "You felt yourself transform into a squirming tadpole. The toad changed into a sea bass and held you in his mouth, swimming for a point on the shore."
  "你感觉自己变成了一只扭动的蝌蚪。蟾蜍变成了一条海鲈鱼，把你衔在嘴里，奋力朝岸边的某处游去。"

# game/script.rpy:7208
translate Chinese toadFinale_87b15d9c:

  # "Just as his fins began to give out, the pig turned into a cat and grabbed the two of you, pulling you both up out of the water."
  "就在他的鱼鳍快要力竭时，小猪变成了一只猫，抓住你们俩，把你们一起拖出了水面。"

# game/script.rpy:7210
translate Chinese toadFinale_f31f6ce8:

  # "Just as his fins began to give out, you turned into a cat and grabbed him and pulled you both up out of the water."
  "就在他的鱼鳍快要力竭时，你变成了一只猫，抓住他，把你们俩一起拖出了水面。"

# game/script.rpy:7213
translate Chinese toadFinale_5434c10d:

  # "The toad directed you to a small, muddy hole on the river bank. As soon as you entered, the mud fell down behind you and blocked your exit."
  "蟾蜍引着你们来到河岸边一个泥泞的土洞前。你们刚一进去，身后的泥巴就塌了下来，封死了出口。"

# game/script.rpy:7214
translate Chinese toadFinale_e2994666:

  # "The hole was wet, and cramped, and crawling with small worms and roaches, but it was safe."
  "洞里又湿又挤，四处还爬满了小虫和蟑螂，但这里很安全。"

# game/script.rpy:7216
translate Chinese toadFinale_bd9a97cb:

  # "You shivered in the cold. The toad flopped down beside you, becoming a wet quoll. The pig grunted sadly in the form of a fruit bat."
  "你冻得瑟瑟发抖。蟾蜍瘫软在你身旁，变成了一只湿漉漉的袋鼬。小猪化作果蝠的模样，悲伤地哼唧着。"

# game/script.rpy:7218
translate Chinese toadFinale_95d7c6a3:

  # "You shivered in the cold. The toad flopped down beside you, becoming a wet quoll."
  "你冻得瑟瑟发抖。蟾蜍瘫软在你身旁，变成了一只湿漉漉的袋鼬。"

# game/script.rpy:7225
translate Chinese toadExplore1_b41847a0:

  # fq "Well. This is another fine mess I've made." nointeract
  fq "好吧。我又捅娄子了。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:7228
translate Chinese toadExplore1_72ae018b:

  # "You uncovered a rug and a fireplace in the muck, and lit the fire."
  "你在淤泥中扒出了一块地毯和一个壁炉，生起了火。"

# game/script.rpy:7230
translate Chinese toadExplore1_1b1b2bd2:

  # "The toad uncovered a pantry with a single, mouldy piece of bread and toasted it over the fire for the three of you."
  "蟾蜍刨出了一个储藏室，里面只有一块发霉的面包。他在火上烤了烤，分给你们三个。"

# game/script.rpy:7232
translate Chinese toadExplore1_6c969902:

  # "The toad uncovered a pantry with a single, mouldy piece of bread and toasted it over the fire for the both of you."
  "蟾蜍刨出了一个储藏室，里面只有一块发霉的面包。他在火上烤了烤，分给你们两个。"

# game/script.rpy:7233
translate Chinese toadExplore1_334fdd44:

  # fq "This all the food I have, sorry."
  fq "我就只剩这点吃的了，抱歉。"

# game/script.rpy:7237
translate Chinese toadExplore1_66ad7496:

  # "You travelled down a hole in the back of the cave which lead down into the mud."
  "你们顺着洞穴后部的一个地洞往下走，钻进了泥土深处。"

# game/script.rpy:7238
translate Chinese toadExplore1_f0f29c11:

  # "Down the hole was a small room with a bed and a cupboard."
  "洞底是一个小房间，有一张床和一个柜子。"

# game/script.rpy:7239
translate Chinese toadExplore1_22d35b6a:

  # "The toad opened the cupboard and took out two threadbare costumes: a witch and a unicorn. You pulled them around you for warmth."
  "蟾蜍打开柜子，拿出了两套破旧的演出服：一套女巫服，一套独角兽服。你们把衣服裹在身上取暖。"

# game/script.rpy:7241
translate Chinese toadExplore1_3aae56b7:

  # "The pig grunted in appreciation."
  "小猪感激地哼了一声。"

# game/script.rpy:7242
translate Chinese toadExplore1_5274f7cb:

  # fq "I... used to like to dress up in this stuff. I'd put on little plays and things for myself."
  fq "我……以前喜欢打扮成这样。我会给自己演些小短剧之类的。"

# game/script.rpy:7243
translate Chinese toadExplore1_48b4f958:

  # fq "Pretty dumb, I know. Kid's stuff. Haven't done it in years."
  fq "挺蠢的，我知道。小孩子的把戏。我已经好些年没玩过了。"

# game/script.rpy:7244
translate Chinese toadExplore1_3b531aa4:

  # "But the costumes seemed well cared for."
  "但这几件戏服分明被他珍藏得很好。"

# game/script.rpy:7248
translate Chinese toadExplore1_1d05ae48:

  # pov "Where are we?"
  pov "我们在哪儿？"

# game/script.rpy:7249
translate Chinese toadExplore1_93429d29:

  # fq "This is my home. My real home."
  fq "这是我的家。我真正的家。"

# game/script.rpy:7250
translate Chinese toadExplore1_d33dece5:

  # fq "That's right. The grand fortune? The prestigious inheritance? The manor on the hill? All lies."
  fq "没错。巨额财富？显赫的遗产？山上的庄园？全是我瞎编的。"

# game/script.rpy:7251
translate Chinese toadExplore1_8ce783e8:

  # fq "I've lived in this hole near the witch's cottage since I was a tadpole."
  fq "打从我还是只蝌蚪的时候起，我就住在这个靠近女巫小屋的洞里。"

# game/script.rpy:7252
translate Chinese toadExplore1_7c81c1fd:

  # fq "Yes, I know it might be hard to believe with my noble bearing. But it's all true."
  fq "是的，我知道以我这般尊贵的做派，说出来很难让人相信。但这全是真的。"

# game/script.rpy:7256
translate Chinese toadExplore1_9828067a:

  # pov "I'm sorry. Now we'll never be able to cure your curse."
  pov "很抱歉。这下我们永远也别想解开你的诅咒了。"

# game/script.rpy:7257
translate Chinese toadExplore1_12fca583:

  # fq "Oh... don't worry about that."
  fq "哦……那个不用担心。"

# game/script.rpy:7258
translate Chinese toadExplore1_70517742:

  # fq "There was never a curse."
  fq "从来就没有什么诅咒。"

# game/script.rpy:7259
translate Chinese toadExplore1_1cf9d257:

  # fq "I just didn't want to be me anymore."
  fq "我只是不想再做我自己了。"

# game/script.rpy:7263
translate Chinese toadExplore1_72b71602:

  # pov "How are we going to get out of here?"
  pov "我们要怎么从这里出去？"

# game/script.rpy:7264
translate Chinese toadExplore1_f8991a8e:

  # fq "Don't worry. I'm sure {b}{i}he{/i}{/b} will rescue us soon."
  fq "别担心。我确定{b}{i}他{/i}{/b}很快就会来救我们的。"

# game/script.rpy:7265
translate Chinese toadExplore1_5454a5cb:

  # pov "{i}He?{/i}"
  pov "{i}他？{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:7266
translate Chinese toadExplore1_77db9da7:

  # "Suddenly the ceiling burst open and a shining light came upon you, blinding in its glory."
  "突然，天花板破裂，光芒倾泻在你们身上，荣耀的光辉刺得人睁不开眼。"

# game/script.rpy:7267
translate Chinese toadExplore1_ad718c74:

  # "Out from the light strode the most beautiful frog you'd ever seen."
  "从光芒中大步走出一只你见过的最英俊的青蛙。"

# game/script.rpy:7269
translate Chinese toadExplore1_ad015723:

  # "The pig rolled over in shock and transformed into a turtle."
  "小猪吓得滚了一圈，变成了一只缩头乌龟。"

# game/script.rpy:7270
translate Chinese toadExplore1_8929abd5:

  # "His skin was glimmering green like the wings of summer beetles, his muscles rippled with strength, his eyes threw out glances of fire, and he was dressed in a gorgeous midnight-blue suit."
  "他的皮肤闪烁着夏日甲虫翅膀般的熠熠绿光，肌肉线条中涌动着力量，眼神如火，身上穿着一套华丽的午夜蓝西装。"

# game/script.rpy:7271
translate Chinese toadExplore1_27e0d7a5:

  # "On each finger gleamed a golden ring inlaid with precious jadestone and chrysoprase and emeralds, and his finely-coiffed hair waved in the breeze with such beauty that none had ever seen the like, not even in a dream."
  "他的每根手指上都戴着镶嵌珍贵玉石、绿玉髓和祖母绿的金戒指，闪烁着熠熠光芒。他那精心打理的发丝在微风中飘逸，美得令人窒息，哪怕在梦里也未曾见过。"

# game/script.rpy:7272
translate Chinese toadExplore1_506e934d:

  # mysFrog "Are you quite alright?"
  mysFrog "各位都没事吧？"

# game/script.rpy:7273
translate Chinese toadExplore1_d766efe4:

  # pov "Who are you?"
  pov "你是谁？"

# game/script.rpy:7274
translate Chinese toadExplore1_ade25f4d:

  # "The toad sighed."
  "蟾蜍叹了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:7275
translate Chinese toadExplore1_d83b108a:

  # fq "This..."
  fq "这位……"

# game/script.rpy:7276
translate Chinese toadExplore1_1e4394fa:

  # fq "...is Brildebrogue Chippingham."
  fq "……就是布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉。"

# game/script.rpy:7277
translate Chinese toadExplore1_4e3638ea:

  # bc "The very same!"
  bc "如假包换！"

# game/script.rpy:7279
translate Chinese toadExplore1_73b48b13:

  # "The frog beamed and helped you to your feet as you transformed into a garden rake."
  "青蛙满面春风地扶你站了起来，就在这时，你变成了一把园艺耙子。"

# game/script.rpy:7280
translate Chinese toadExplore1_50254bff:

  # bc "Say, that voice is awfully familiar..."
  bc "我说，这个声音听起来好耳熟……"

# game/script.rpy:7281
translate Chinese toadExplore1_27b2c96a:

  # bc "Is that you, Blort?"
  bc "是你吗，布洛特？"

# game/script.rpy:7282
translate Chinese toadExplore1_d6d2ba4c:

  # fq "Yes. Yes, that's my real name."
  fq "是的。是的，那是我的真名。"

# game/script.rpy:7283
translate Chinese toadExplore1_20094865:

  # fq "I am Blort Bronkum, and I have never succeeded at anything in my life."
  fq "我是布洛特·布朗库姆，我这辈子从没把事办成过。"

# game/script.rpy:7286
translate Chinese toadExplore1_c3e87819:

  # "The real Brildebrogue Chippingham pulled you out of the hole and into a golden carriage waiting nearby, which whisked you away to a stately riverside manor."
  "真正的布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉将你们一把拉出泥洞，请进了一辆恭候在一旁的金色马车。马车疾驰而去，将你们带到了一座宏伟的河畔庄园。"

# game/script.rpy:7287
translate Chinese toadExplore1_406f44d0:

  # "With a click of his fingers, Brildebrogue summoned a cavalcade of richly dressed frog manservants, who offered you all the finest delicacies from across the world, such that the King of Kings would cry to taste them."
  "布里尔德布罗格打了个响指，召来一队衣着华贵的青蛙男仆，他们奉上了来自世界各地的顶级美味，连万王之王尝了都会落泪。"

# game/script.rpy:7288
translate Chinese toadExplore1_a64ed519:

  # "With another click, a dozen beautiful frog maids escorted you to golden baths where all the muck and grime was washed away, and you were restored to your true forms as the finest frog soprano choir in all the land serenaded you."
  "他又打了个响指，十几位美丽的青蛙女仆将你们引至金色的浴池。洗尽污泥与尘垢后，你们恢复了原本的形态，全境最顶级的青蛙女高音合唱团在一旁为你们唱起婉转的小夜曲。"

# game/script.rpy:7289
translate Chinese toadExplore1_32796103:

  # "Brildebrogue himself regaled you with witty anecdotes of his thrilling adventures, which had everyone rolling around on the floor laughing, except for the toad, who sat in the corner and scowled."
  "布里尔德布罗格亲自用风趣幽默的言辞，绘声绘色地讲述起他那些惊心动魄的冒险轶事，逗得大伙在地上笑得直打滚，唯独蟾蜍独自坐在角落里阴沉着脸。"

# game/script.rpy:7290
translate Chinese toadExplore1_69e2ff3f:

  # bc "Please make yourselves at home, my friends!"
  bc "朋友们，请把这儿当自己家！"

# game/script.rpy:7291
translate Chinese toadExplore1_70e4d0f1:

  # bc "I'm afraid I must leave immediately. Business with the jewelled serpent-kings of the City of Brass, you understand."
  bc "恐怕我得立刻动身了。要去和黄铜之城的珠宝蛇王们谈点生意，你们懂的。"

# game/script.rpy:7292
translate Chinese toadExplore1_f7d71689:

  # f "Of course. Actually, I recall I was chatting with the jewelled serpent-kings myself just the other day, and -{w=1.0}{nw}"
  f "当然。说起来，我记得前几天我本人才刚跟那群珠宝蛇王聊过，而且——{w=1.0}{nw}"

# game/script.rpy:7293
translate Chinese toadExplore1_5ef2b962:

  # bc "Help yourselves to all the delights of Chippingham Manor! Here are the keys to the whole place. You may go wherever you wish, and open every door!"
  bc "尽情享受奇平汉庄园的一切乐趣吧！这是整座庄园的钥匙。你们想去哪儿就去哪儿，随便开哪扇门都行！"

# game/script.rpy:7295
translate Chinese toadExplore1_28b319de:

  # bc "...except one."
  bc "……除了一扇。"

# game/script.rpy:7296
translate Chinese toadExplore1_f83ca67c:

  # bc "This little golden key will unlock the smallest closet in the tallest tower. Do not open that closet."
  bc "这把金色的小钥匙能打开最高塔楼里最小的那个壁橱。绝对不要打开那个壁橱。"

# game/script.rpy:7297
translate Chinese toadExplore1_804ec220:

  # bc "But I'm sure that won't be a problem! I know I can trust you, my dear friends. I'll see you on my return!"
  bc "但我相信这对各位来说肯定不难！我知道我能信任你们，亲爱的朋友们。我们回头见！"

# game/script.rpy:7298
translate Chinese toadExplore1_ec3a62cc:

  # "And with a wave of his hand, he leapt into a gleaming gold carriage and sped away across the horizon in an instant."
  "他挥了挥手，跳进一辆闪闪发光的金色马车，转瞬便消失在地平线上。"

# game/script.rpy:7299
translate Chinese toadExplore1_fd5d4fed:

  # f "Hmph. Show-off."
  f "哼。爱出风头的家伙。"

# game/script.rpy:7301
translate Chinese toadExplore1_0acd9183:

  # "The pig relaxed into his bath and grunted with contentment."
  "小猪舒服地沉入浴池里，心满意足地哼哼着。"

# game/script.rpy:7307
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_d8ebeb78:

  # blank "" nointeract
  blank "" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:7310
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_e9afeac9:

  # "Inside the first tower, the three of you discovered a trio of stately frog wizards, who flushed the last remains of the potions from your systems and restored you to good health."
  "在第一座塔楼里，你们三个发现了三位威严的青蛙巫师。他们帮你们清除了体内残留的魔药，让你们恢复了健康。"

# game/script.rpy:7312
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_64ec1473:

  # "Inside the first tower, the two of you discovered a trio of stately frog wizards, who flushed the last remains of the potions from your systems and restored you to good health."
  "在第一座塔楼里，你们两个发现了三位威严的青蛙巫师。他们帮你们清除了体内残留的魔药，让你们恢复了健康。"

# game/script.rpy:7317
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_589ff435:

  # "Inside the second tower, you discovered the finest frog chefs of all the land, who quickly sliced off their own legs and served them to you as the most delicious dish the three of you had ever tasted."
  "在第二座塔楼里，你们发现了全境最顶级的青蛙主厨。他们手脚麻利地切下自己的大腿端上桌，那是你们三个吃过的最美味的一道菜。"

# game/script.rpy:7319
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_fef7aa0d:

  # "Inside the second tower, you discovered the finest frog chefs of all the land, who quickly sliced off their own legs and served them to you as the most delicious dish either of you had ever tasted."
  "在第二座塔楼里，你们发现了全境最顶级的青蛙主厨。他们手脚麻利地切下自己的大腿端上桌，那是你们两个吃过的最美味的一道菜。"

# game/script.rpy:7324
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_63f09bba:

  # "Inside the third tower, you discovered a stately harem of frog courtesans, who poured rich wines and made witty conversation with you until you were all completely sloshed and dizzy from the refined repartee."
  "在第三座塔楼里，你们发现了一群气派的青蛙名妓。她们为你们斟满醇酒，妙语连珠，直到你们全都在高雅的谈笑中喝得烂醉如泥、头晕目眩。"

# game/script.rpy:7326
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_b2c4bf60:

  # "Inside the third tower, you discovered a stately harem of frog courtesans, who poured rich wines and made witty conversation with you until you were both completely sloshed and dizzy from the refined repartee."
  "在第三座塔楼里，你们发现了一群气派的青蛙名妓。她们为你们斟满醇酒，妙语连珠，直到你们两个都在高雅的谈笑中喝得烂醉如泥、头晕目眩。"

# game/script.rpy:7331
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_a16cf280:

  # "Inside the fourth tower was a sparkling fountain of emeralds and sapphires and precious gems, which splashed out over a scale model replica of the forest. You could see immediately that a single gemstone from this fountain was so valuable that it would bankrupt the richest sultan."
  "第四座塔楼里有一座闪烁的喷泉，喷涌出的全是祖母绿、蓝宝石和各种珍贵宝石。它们如瀑布般洒落在一座森林的微缩模型上。你一眼就能看出，这喷泉里随便挑出一颗宝石，都足以掏空最富有苏丹的国库。"

# game/script.rpy:7332
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_091f6957:

  # f "I spent my whole life looking up at this place. Hard to believe we're actually here."
  f "我一辈子都在仰望这个地方。真不敢相信我们现在竟然真的在这儿。"

# game/script.rpy:7336
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_e1bb9324:

  # "Inside the fifth tower you found a gigantic closet of the finest clothes, rich silks and suits and uniforms of office, all extremely masculine in cut and befitting of a king."
  "在第五座塔楼里，你们发现了一个巨大的衣橱，里面装满了最顶级的衣服、华美的丝绸、西装和制服，剪裁硬挺，彰显男子气概，与国王的身份极其相称。"

# game/script.rpy:7340
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_e97b2d24:

  # "Inside the sixth tower you found the Library of Alexandria. A small plaque explained that Brildebrogue had miraculously saved the books from the fires, and they'd been stored here safely for all this time."
  "在第六座塔楼里，你们发现了亚历山大图书馆。一块小牌匾上写着，是布里尔德布罗格奇迹般地从那场大火中抢救出了这些书，它们一直安全地存放在这里。"

# game/script.rpy:7343
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_29315f0d:

  # "Inside the seventh and tallest tower you found only a tiny wooden closet."
  "在最高的那座第七塔楼里，你只发现了一个小小的木制壁橱。"

# game/script.rpy:7350
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_eda4e6f0:

  # "You inserted the key, and slowly opened the door with a long creak."
  "你插进钥匙，伴着长长的一声嘎吱缓缓打开了门。"

# game/script.rpy:7353
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_ec308319:

  # "As soon as the door opened, a stream of blood flowed over you, and you saw seven dead frog brides hanging all along the walls, some only skeletons."
  "门一打开，一股鲜血便浇在你身上。你看到墙上挂着七具青蛙新娘的尸体，有些已经化为了白骨。"

# game/script.rpy:7355
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_7ba64a1d:

  # "The pig squealed in terrible fear."
  "小猪吓得发出了凄厉的尖叫。"

# game/script.rpy:7360
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_39e7e935:

  # f "Well, if you're not going to open this damn closet, I am."
  f "好吧，要是你不打算打开这个该死的壁橱，那让我来。"

# game/script.rpy:7361
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_32797dc9:

  # "He rushed to the seventh and tallest tower, and unlocked the closet with the golden key."
  "他冲进第七座也是最高的那座塔楼，用金钥匙打开了壁橱。"

# game/script.rpy:7362
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_2197d276:

  # "He slowly turned the key, and opened the closet door with a long creak."
  "他缓缓转动钥匙，伴着一声长长的嘎吱作响，缓缓打开了门。"

# game/script.rpy:7365
translate Chinese chippinghamManor_b93131a6:

  # "As soon as the door opened, a stream of blood flowed over the two of you, and you saw seven dead frog brides hanging all along the closet walls, some only skeletons."
  "门一打开，一股鲜血便浇在你们两人身上。你看到沿着壁橱墙壁悬挂着七具青蛙新娘的死尸，有些已经化为了白骨。"

# game/script.rpy:7370
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_6e53fa71:

  # f "Oh my G-"
  f "哦，我的天——"

# game/script.rpy:7374
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_656148d9:

  # "You slipped in the blood and felt it on your hair and tasted it in your mouth. The blood washed over your face and you felt the blood on your hands and the blood underneath your feet and the blood on the walls and the blood in your fingernails. The toad quickly slammed the door, but the key popped out and into the blood.{vspace=80}{i}In your notes, write down that you {b}have blood on your hands.{/b}{/i}"
  "你在血泊中滑倒，发丝间是血，嘴里尝到了血。鲜血漫过你的脸，你感觉手上是血，脚底是血，墙上是血，指甲缝里也是血。蟾蜍猛地关上门，但钥匙弹了出来，掉进血泊里。{vspace=80}{i}在你的笔记中写下，你{b}手上沾满了鲜血。{/b}{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:7375
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_a8df6e8f:

  # f "No no no no no. Oh god."
  f "不不不不不。哦，天哪。"

# game/script.rpy:7376
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_8eb7404a:

  # "The clock chimed a quarter to twelve."
  "时钟敲响，差一刻十二点。"

# game/script.rpy:7377
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_b31e0a09:

  # "You tried to wipe the blood off the key, but it wouldn't come off."
  "你试图擦掉钥匙上的血，但怎么也擦不掉。"

# game/script.rpy:7378
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_506509b1:

  # f "Quickly! We have to wash this off."
  f "快点！我们得把它洗掉。"

# game/script.rpy:7382
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_d9181c14:

  # "You both rushed downstairs and tore off your clothes and burned them and put on new, spotless clothes without a hint of blood. You scrubbed the pig clean so that there was no sign that anything was amiss. But no matter how long you scrubbed at the key, you couldn't get it off. When you rubbed the blood off one side, it appeared on the other."
  "你们俩冲下楼，扯下身上的衣服烧毁，换上没有一丝血迹、一尘不染的新衣。你们把小猪洗得干干净净，没留下任何破绽。但无论在钥匙上擦洗多久，血迹就是洗不掉。刚擦净这一面的血，它又会在另一面渗出来。"

# game/script.rpy:7384
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_da2799fc:

  # "You both rushed downstairs and tore off your clothes and burned them and put on new, spotless clothes without a hint of blood. But no matter how long you scrubbed at the key, you couldn't get it off. When you rubbed the blood off one side, it appeared on the other."
  "你们俩冲下楼，扯下身上的衣服烧毁，换上没有一丝血迹、一尘不染的新衣。但无论在钥匙上擦洗多久，血迹就是洗不掉。刚擦净这一面的血，它又会在另一面渗出来。"

# game/script.rpy:7385
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_af3e21a9:

  # bc "Good evening!"
  bc "晚上好！"

# game/script.rpy:7386
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_fbf3e6bc:

  # f "Ack!"
  f "啊！"

# game/script.rpy:7387
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_7acfc327:

  # f "I-I mean hello! Brildebrogue! Back so soon?"
  f "我——我是说你好！布里尔德布罗格！这么快就回来了？"

# game/script.rpy:7388
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_5b7626dc:

  # bc "Yes, the business was wrapped up fairly swiftly after I recovered the megastone from the lost glacier city of Url'Iarch."
  bc "是的，从失落冰川之城乌尔·伊亚奇找回巨石之后，生意很快就谈妥了。"

# game/script.rpy:7389
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_07becce9:

  # f "Aha, o-of course, yes. Why, that reminds me of the time when I recovered the lost demondecahedron from the -"
  f "啊哈，当——当然，是的。哎呀，这让我想起了我从——找回失落的恶魔十二面体的那次——"

# game/script.rpy:7394
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_3233e310:

  # bc "Would you be so kind to hand me back my keys, old sport? I have much business to attend to." nointeract
  bc "劳驾把我的钥匙还给我好吗，老兄？我还有很多事情要处理。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:7396
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_cbfa7023:

  # f "H-here you go... o-old sport..."
  f "给——给你……老——老兄……"

# game/script.rpy:7397
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_d39159b7:

  # bc "..."
  bc "……"

# game/script.rpy:7398
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_ae20132b:

  # bc "Interesting."
  bc "有意思。"

# game/script.rpy:7399
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_cc0032ae:

  # bc "How came this blood upon this key?"
  bc "这钥匙上哪儿来的血？"

# game/script.rpy:7400
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_270e8ea9:

  # f "I-I am sure I do not know."
  f "我——我真的不知道。"

# game/script.rpy:7401
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_4309661c:

  # bc "You do not know?"
  bc "你不知道？"

# game/script.rpy:7402
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_a56f383a:

  # bc "But I know well enough."
  bc "但我清楚得很。"

# game/script.rpy:7403
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_98d4274f:

  # bc "If you have such an interest in my closet, you can take your place among the ladies there."
  bc "既然你对我的壁橱这么感兴趣，你大可去和里面的女士们作伴。"

# game/script.rpy:7404
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_ab4ff7d4:

  # "He took out his scimitar and locked the door to his manor behind him."
  "他拔出弯刀，反锁了庄园的大门。"

# game/script.rpy:7405
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_d863c63d:

  # f "RUN!"
  f "快跑！"

# game/script.rpy:7408
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_ee0377aa:

  # f "L-looks like we must have misplaced it, sorry... o-old sport..."
  f "看——看来我们肯定是把它放错地方了，抱歉……老——老兄……"

# game/script.rpy:7409
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_d39159b7_1:

  # bc "..."
  bc "……"

# game/script.rpy:7410
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_ae20132b_1:

  # bc "Interesting."
  bc "有意思。"

# game/script.rpy:7411
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_66ffc6f4:

  # bc "Where is it?"
  bc "它在哪儿？"

# game/script.rpy:7412
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_270e8ea9_1:

  # f "I-I am sure I do not know."
  f "我——我真的不知道。"

# game/script.rpy:7413
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_4309661c_1:

  # bc "You do not know?"
  bc "你不知道？"

# game/script.rpy:7414
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_a56f383a_1:

  # bc "But I know well enough."
  bc "但我清楚得很。"

# game/script.rpy:7415
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_0d9b69eb:

  # "In one motion he twisted the toad's arm behind his back. The toad gasped and dropped the bloody key on the floor."
  "他一把将蟾蜍的手臂扭到背后。蟾蜍痛呼一声，那把带血的钥匙掉在了地上。"

# game/script.rpy:7416
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_98d4274f_1:

  # bc "If you have such an interest in my closet, you can take your place among the ladies there."
  bc "既然你对我的壁橱这么感兴趣，你大可去和里面的女士们作伴。"

# game/script.rpy:7417
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_ab4ff7d4_1:

  # "He took out his scimitar and locked the door to his manor behind him."
  "他拔出弯刀，反锁了庄园的大门。"

# game/script.rpy:7418
translate Chinese brildebrogueCloset_d863c63d_1:

  # f "RUN!"
  f "快跑！"

# game/script.rpy:7424
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_070f7edd:

  # "You ran into the twisting castle corridors together, but Brildebrogue Chippingham was fast behind you, smiling a charming smile."
  "你们一起跑进错综复杂的城堡走廊，但布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉紧随其后，脸上挂着迷人的微笑。"

# game/script.rpy:7427
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_94288142:

  # "You raced up and down endless staircases with the pig leading the way, hearing Brildebrogue's pleasant, resonant voice behind you."
  "在小猪的带领下，你们在无尽的楼梯上爬上爬下，身后传来布里尔德布罗格愉快而洪亮的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:7429
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_d54fd4b1:

  # "You both raced up and down endless staircases, hearing Brildebrogue's pleasant, resonant voice behind you."
  "你们俩在无尽的楼梯上狂奔，身后传来布里尔德布罗格愉快而洪亮的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:7430
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_e094da22:

  # bc "Just stand aside, Blort. I've no interest in you."
  bc "闪到一边去，布洛特。我对你没兴趣。"

# game/script.rpy:7431
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_08e94b33:

  # bc "Honour among toads, and all that."
  bc "什么蟾亦有禅，诸如此类的。"

# game/script.rpy:7433
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_0ea2a3ea:

  # "Warm, resonant laughter echoed behind you as you stumbled across the manor's battlements."
  "当你们跌跌撞撞地跑过庄园的城墙时，身后回荡着他温暖洪亮的笑声。"

# game/script.rpy:7436
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_6a6d4e44:

  # "You and the pig pulled the exhausted toad up ladders and down wells. Brildebrogue wasn't even tired. He strolled after you at a leisurely pace."
  "你和小猪拉着筋疲力尽的蟾蜍爬上梯子，钻下水井。布里尔德布罗格却连大气都没喘一口。他不紧不慢地跟在你们身后溜达。"

# game/script.rpy:7438
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_48b3abee:

  # "You pulled the exhausted toad up ladders and down wells. Brildebrogue wasn't even tired. He strolled after you at a leisurely pace."
  "你拉着筋疲力尽的蟾蜍爬上梯子，钻下水井。布里尔德布罗格却连大气都没喘一口。他不紧不慢地跟在你们身后溜达。"

# game/script.rpy:7440
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_697871b4:

  # "As you ran up the manor staircases, you saw an old clock on the wall. It was almost midnight. The moon loomed large above you."
  "你们顺着庄园的楼梯狂奔而上，看到了墙上的一座旧时钟。午夜将至。一轮硕大的月亮在你们头顶高悬。"

# game/script.rpy:7443
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_cdbec345:

  # "The pig panted in exhaustion. You smelt Brildebrogue's intoxicating cologne all around you as you dragged the toad over the crooked manor roof. His sweet breath was hot on your neck."
  "小猪累得直喘粗气。当你拖着蟾蜍翻过歪斜的庄园屋顶时，你闻到周围弥漫着布里尔德布罗格那令人陶醉的古龙水味。他甜腻的吐息带着热气，喷在你的脖颈上。"

# game/script.rpy:7445
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_9c70c55d:

  # "You smelt Brildebrogue's intoxicating cologne all around you as you dragged the toad over the crooked manor roof. His sweet breath was hot on your neck."
  "当你拖着蟾蜍翻过歪斜的庄园屋顶时，你闻到周围弥漫着布里尔德布罗格那令人陶醉的古龙水味。他甜腻的吐息带着热气，喷在你的脖颈上。"

# game/script.rpy:7447
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_097e1236:

  # "You were at your limit. You struggled on, putting one stumbling foot after another. You felt Brildebrogue's elegant, manicured hand reaching over your shoulder."
  "你已经到了极限。你挣扎着，跌跌撞撞地往前挪。你感觉到布里尔德布罗格那只优雅、保养得宜的手越过肩膀，向你伸来。"

# game/script.rpy:7452
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_d8ebeb78:

  # blank "" nointeract
  blank "" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:7457
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_c4abb8a9:

  # "You begged for help from the stately trio of frog wizards inside the first tower, but with one look at Brildebrogue, they quickly turned themselves into newts and slithered away into dark holes in the rock, as fast as they could go."
  "你向第一座塔楼里三位威严的青蛙巫师求救，但他们只看了布里尔德布罗格一眼，就立刻化作蝾螈，以最快的速度溜进了漆黑的岩洞里。"

# game/script.rpy:7458
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_20ea7e8c:

  # bc "Are you happy to have regained your true form, Blort? Happy to look into the mirror every morning and see that wretched face?"
  bc "恢复原形就这么让你得意吗，布洛特？每天早上照镜子看到那张可悲的脸，你很开心吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7460
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_e0fa9943:

  # "The toad looked around at the mirrors all around him, and tears came to his eyes."
  "蟾蜍环顾四周的镜子，泪水涌上了眼眶。"

# game/script.rpy:7461
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_b4eee731:

  # "In a single motion, Brildebrogue swept the toad back and sliced the tower in two. You dragged the toad up and fled as it crumbled around you."
  "布里尔德布罗格随手把蟾蜍击飞，一刀便把塔楼劈成两半。塔楼在四周倒塌，你把蟾蜍拽起，夺路而逃。"

# game/script.rpy:7467
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_a432bd8f:

  # "You raced to the cavalcade of fine frog chefs inside the second tower. With a click of his fingers, Brildebebrogue commanded them, and they slid out of the room and began preparing the pots and pans and knives to make a delicious meal from your carcasses when the fighting was done."
  "你们冲向第二座塔楼里那群顶级的青蛙主厨。布里尔德布罗格打了个响指命令他们，他们便立刻滑出房间，开始准备锅碗瓢盆和刀具，就等着战斗结束后用你们的尸块做一顿美餐。"

# game/script.rpy:7468
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_9f06f21c:

  # bc "Still hungry? Maybe you should lay off for a while. Go for a jog."
  bc "还饿吗？也许你该稍微节制一下了。去跑个步吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7469
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_e5bcb50d:

  # "He thrust an elbow into the toad's paunch, winding him. Then with his other hand he tore down the tower. You fled as it crumbled around you."
  "他一肘捣在蟾蜍的大肚子上，打得他喘不过气来。接着他用另一只手生生拆毁了塔楼。当塔楼在你们周围坍塌时，你们夺路而逃。"

# game/script.rpy:7475
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_e50f9922:

  # "You pushed your way through the pack of finely-dressed courtesans inside the third tower. Brildebrogue walked calmly after you as they stroked his thick arms and complimented his physique."
  "你们推挤着穿过第三座塔楼里那群衣着华丽的名妓。布里尔德布罗格从容不迫地跟在身后，任由她们抚摸他粗壮的手臂，称赞他的体格。"

# game/script.rpy:7477
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_1b0e8909:

  # bc "I know about the long nights you've spent alone, Blort."
  bc "我知道你独自度过的那些漫漫长夜，布洛特。"

# game/script.rpy:7479
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_2e2e3b7f:

  # bc "I know about the long nights you've spent alone."
  bc "我知道你独自度过的那些漫漫长夜。"

# game/script.rpy:7480
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_01642b2d:

  # bc "Just hand [him] over, and I can buy you all the friends you want."
  bc "只要把[him]交出来，你要多少朋友我都能给你买来。"

# game/script.rpy:7481
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_21d2be24:

  # "With a flick of his wrist, Bildebrogue turned the courtesans into a pack of wild squawking galahs which tore down the tower like an oversized pinecone. You fled as it crumbled around you."
  "布里尔德布罗格手腕一抖，把那些交际花变成了一群叽叽喳喳的粉红凤头鹦鹉，它们像扯碎一个大松果一样把塔楼撕成了碎片。当塔楼在你们周围坍塌时，你们夺路而逃。"

# game/script.rpy:7487
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_c087b8e8:

  # "You ran through the glimmering fountain of emeralds and sapphires and precious gemstones in the fourth tower. The toad and Brildebrogue battled back and forth behind you."
  "你们跑过第四座塔楼里那座由祖母绿、蓝宝石和各种珍贵宝石砌成的闪亮喷泉。蟾蜍和布里尔德布罗格在你身后激烈交锋。"

# game/script.rpy:7488
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_6d8a7d4a:

  # bc "I'm sure I can give you a few of these as a small loan."
  bc "我当然可以借几颗这玩意给你当小额贷款。"

# game/script.rpy:7489
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_81539e9d:

  # bc "Maybe you can finally make something of yourself."
  bc "也许你终于能混出点名堂来了。"

# game/script.rpy:7490
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_2b905f01:

  # "The toad gritted his teeth as glittering gems fell all around him, and he parried Brildebrogue's thrust with an unsteady hand."
  "闪耀的宝石在周围纷纷落下，蟾蜍咬紧牙关，用颤抖的手招架住了布里尔德布罗格的突刺。"

# game/script.rpy:7491
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_701730d1:

  # "Brildebrogue shrugged, puffed up his cheeks, and blew down the tower in a single breath. You fled as it crumbled around you."
  "布里尔德布罗格耸了耸肩，鼓起腮帮子，一口气便吹倒了塔楼。当塔楼在你们周围坍塌时，你们夺路而逃。"

# game/script.rpy:7498
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_73866946:

  # "The pig stood behind you and tried to fend Brildebrogue off, but with a single sweep, he cut off its right hoof and sent it tumbling away."
  "小猪站在你身后，试图挡住布里尔德布罗格，但他随手一挥，便砍断了它的右蹄，将它打飞了出去。"

# game/script.rpy:7499
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_9c39c006:

  # "You pulled the injured pig into your arms and fled through the racks of fine clothes in the fifth tower as Brildebrogue sliced them apart behind you."
  "你把受伤的小猪抱进怀里，穿过第五座塔楼里一排排的华服夺路而逃，布里尔德布罗格在你们身后将衣服砍成碎片。"

# game/script.rpy:7501
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_6d1e4761:

  # "You fled through the racks of fine clothes in the fifth tower as Brildebrogue sliced them apart behind you."
  "你穿过第五座塔楼里一排排的华服夺路而逃，布里尔德布罗格在你们身后将衣服砍成碎片。"

# game/script.rpy:7502
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_11490589:

  # bc "Trying to steal from my wardrobe?"
  bc "想从我衣柜里偷东西？"

# game/script.rpy:7503
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_52838581:

  # bc "I heard the servants laughing about your little dress-up obsession, Blort. I just never realised it went this far!"
  bc "我听仆人们取笑过你那点换装小癖好，布洛特。我只是没想到你会痴迷到这种地步！"

# game/script.rpy:7504
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_e84f3703:

  # "With one clap of his hands he brought down water rushing in from the seas. You fled through the waves as they brought the tower down around you."
  "他拍了下手，便从大海引来汹涌的水流。塔楼在巨浪的冲击下于你们四周轰然倒塌，你则在浪涛中夺路而逃。"

# game/script.rpy:7511
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_3d2b2228:

  # "The three of you scrabbled through the aisles of books in the sixth tower - but as you turned a corner, Brildebrogue was in front of you, carelessly thumbing through a thick volume."
  "你们三个在第六座塔楼的书架过道间连滚带爬地逃命——但刚转过一个拐角，布里尔德布罗格就已经站在你们面前，漫不经心地翻阅着一本厚厚的书。"

# game/script.rpy:7513
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_ed6af0ff:

  # "You and the toad scrabbled through the aisles of books in the sixth tower - but as you turned a corner, Brildebrogue was in front of you, carelessly thumbing through a thick volume."
  "你和蟾蜍在第六座塔楼的书架过道间连滚带爬地逃命——但刚转过一个拐角，布里尔德布罗格就已经站在你们面前，漫不经心地翻阅着一本厚厚的书。"

# game/script.rpy:7514
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_857251b1:

  # bc "\"On Rays of Light.\" Democritus. One of my favourites."
  bc "《论光线》。德谟克利特的作品。我的最爱之一。"

# game/script.rpy:7515
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_9558b317:

  # bc "But then, you never learned to read or write, did you? All those sad little stories you tell, and you never learned."
  bc "不过话又说回来，你压根没学过读书写字，对吧？你讲了那么多可悲的小故事，却大字都不识一个。"

# game/script.rpy:7516
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_89c30987:

  # f "I..."
  f "我……"

# game/script.rpy:7517
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_8ad5ae2f:

  # f "I mean, of course I can..."
  f "我是说，我当然会……"

# game/script.rpy:7518
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_8233e9bc:

  # bc "Give [him] over, and I'll teach you."
  bc "把[him]交出来，我就教你。"

# game/script.rpy:7519
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_1b2bb780:

  # bc "Don't worry, it's easy. Even a child could do it."
  bc "别担心，这很简单。连小孩子都能学会。"

# game/script.rpy:7520
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_fe95614d:

  # "The toad said nothing."
  "蟾蜍一言不发。"

# game/script.rpy:7521
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_444eb3ec:

  # "Brildebrogue tossed the book down. With a click of his fingers he brought down lightning from the skies, and the whole tower went up in flames. You both fled through the fire as it burned around you."
  "布里尔德布罗格把书扔下。他打了个响指，从天空引下闪电，整座塔楼瞬间燃起熊熊大火。烈焰在四周肆虐，你们两人在火海中夺路而逃。"

# game/script.rpy:7524
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_0eb35433:

  # "You burst through the door to the tallest tower. In front of you was the small room with the bloody closet, now yawning open wide."
  "你们冲破最高塔楼的门。在你们面前，那个藏着血腥壁橱的小房间，此刻正大门洞开。"

# game/script.rpy:7525
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_f5ac21d3:

  # "There was nowhere left to run. You heard slow footsteps behind you."
  "已经无路可退了。你听到身后传来缓慢的脚步声。"

# game/script.rpy:7526
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_c63fc02d:

  # bc "You've heard all my offers, Blort. You know I could give you the life you always wanted."
  bc "你已经听过我开出的所有条件了，布洛特。你知道我能给你一直梦寐以求的生活。"

# game/script.rpy:7528
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_f28ced76:

  # "The pig panted weakly, bleeding from its severed leg. The toad stood between the two of you and Brildebrogue with sword cane drawn, hands shaking."
  "小猪虚弱地喘息着，断腿处还在流血。蟾蜍站在你们俩和布里尔德布罗格之间，拔出杖剑，双手颤抖着。"

# game/script.rpy:7530
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_754219e0:

  # "The toad stood between you and Brildebrogue with sword cane drawn, hands shaking."
  "蟾蜍站在你和布里尔德布罗格之间，拔出杖剑，双手颤抖着。"

# game/script.rpy:7531
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_5f919d1a:

  # bc "You've seen what I've built. I built it with these two hands."
  bc "你已经看到我所创造的一切。全是我用这双手打拼出来的。"

# game/script.rpy:7532
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_862f95bb:

  # bc "You have a choice. You can hand [him] over, and become a great man."
  bc "你还有得选。你可以把[him]交出来，然后成为一个大人物。"

# game/script.rpy:7533
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_292a9d15:

  # bc "Or you can stay a wretch and die, and leave nothing but a stain in the gutter that will be washed away with the morning rain."
  bc "或者你可以继续当个可悲的爬虫，死在这里，最终只会在臭水沟里留下一滩污迹，被明晨的雨水冲刷得一干二净。"

# game/script.rpy:7534
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_3ec57d49:

  # f "..."
  f "……"

# game/script.rpy:7535
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_ce0cacb6:

  # f "Then I will die a wretch."
  f "那我就当个可悲的爬虫死去吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7536
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_0a69c0f0:

  # f "But I will die with my friend beside me."
  f "但我死的时候，身边有我的朋友。"

# game/script.rpy:7538
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_53cf9698:

  # "The toad brought up his sword cane to clash with the scimitar. And at just that moment, you heard the clock strike twelve."
  "蟾蜍举起杖剑，迎击弯刀。就在那一刻，你听到时钟敲响了十二点。"

# game/script.rpy:7540
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_8a241b6a:

  # pov "Godfather! Help me!"
  pov "教父！救救我！"

# game/script.rpy:7543
translate Chinese brildebrogueFinale_f63aeb85:

  # pov "Godmother! Help me!"
  pov "教母！救救我！"

# game/script.rpy:7549
translate Chinese frogEnding_f310c323:

  # miw "Be not afraid."
  miw "毋须恐惧。"

# game/script.rpy:7550
translate Chinese frogEnding_e76e95c4:

  # "A harsh light fell upon the room, and you looked up to see a whirl of wings and feathers and eyes and fire standing before you."
  "一道刺目的强光照进房间，你抬起头，看到一团交织着翅膀、羽毛、眼睛与火焰的旋涡矗立在你面前。"

# game/script.rpy:7551
translate Chinese frogEnding_3a886ad1:

  # "Brildebrogue dropped to his knees."
  "布里尔德布罗格扑通一声跪了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:7552
translate Chinese frogEnding_aa64a7fa:

  # bc "Lord, please...I have always been your faithful disciple."
  bc "主啊，求您……我一直都是您最忠诚的信徒。"

# game/script.rpy:7553
translate Chinese frogEnding_33bada16:

  # miw "That may be so."
  miw "也许是这样。"

# game/script.rpy:7554
translate Chinese frogEnding_ca987a59:

  # miw "But none may touch my grandchild and live."
  miw "但谁敢碰我的教孙，谁就得死。"

# game/script.rpy:7555
translate Chinese frogEnding_0cd85143:

  # bc "N-now see here. I am Brildebrogue Chippingham, and I have never failed at anything in my-"
  bc "听——听我说。我是布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉，我这辈子从没把事办砸——"

# game/script.rpy:7556
translate Chinese frogEnding_1ecf8580:

  # "But the light fell upon him, and without even a scream, he was burnt up in an instant and gone forever."
  "但光芒落在他身上，他甚至连一声惨叫都没来得及发出，瞬间就被烧成了灰烬，永远消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:7557
translate Chinese frogEnding_4f21250e:

  # miw "Come with me now, my grandchild. It is time for you to take your rightful place in heaven."
  miw "现在跟我走吧，我的教孙。你该在天堂归位，占据你应有的位置了。"

# game/script.rpy:7558
translate Chinese frogEnding_aabf9768:

  # f "Hold on just a second. How do we know you're really the Lord?"
  f "等一下。我们怎么知道你真的是上帝？"

# game/script.rpy:7559
translate Chinese frogEnding_f28cf923:

  # miw "Do not doubt my power. I am the wind in the sky and the old stones in the earth."
  miw "不要怀疑我的力量。我是天空中的风，是大地里古老的石头。"

# game/script.rpy:7560
translate Chinese frogEnding_af1104b0:

  # f "Show us. Seeing is believing."
  f "展示给我们看。眼见为实。"

# game/script.rpy:7561
translate Chinese frogEnding_67e1b1e9:

  # "The Lord performed this feat and turned into a mighty wind. But just as He did so, the toad opened the window, and the Lord blew right out of the tower and across the sea. With this, the toad slammed the window shut."
  "上帝施展神迹，变成了一阵狂风。但他刚一变，蟾蜍就打开了窗户，上帝顺着窗户刮出了塔楼，一路卷过了大海。紧接着，蟾蜍砰地一声关上了窗户。"

# game/script.rpy:7562
translate Chinese frogEnding_2f7a1bcc:

  # f "Well. That takes care of that."
  f "好吧。这下问题解决了。"

# game/script.rpy:7566
translate Chinese frogEnding_270f075e:

  # mir "Your time is up!"
  mir "你的时间到了！"

# game/script.rpy:7567
translate Chinese frogEnding_2a3b5516:

  # "The Devil Himself exploded out of the floor in a flash of brimstone and soot."
  "在一阵夹杂着硫磺与黑灰的闪光中，魔鬼本尊从地板下炸了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:7569
translate Chinese frogEnding_c3aa7ca2:

  # "The pig hid behind you, shivering."
  "小猪躲在你身后，瑟瑟发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:7570
translate Chinese frogEnding_f1f9562d:

  # "As soon as he saw your Godfather, Brildebrogue went white as ash."
  "一看到你的教父，布里尔德布罗格顿时面如死灰。"

# game/script.rpy:7571
translate Chinese frogEnding_18f7c56b:

  # bc "Lucifer. My contract isn't up yet. You told me I still had six years!"
  bc "路西法。我的契约还没到期。你告诉过我，我还有六年的时间！"

# game/script.rpy:7572
translate Chinese frogEnding_845ca63f:

  # mir "That may be so."
  mir "也许是这样。"

# game/script.rpy:7573
translate Chinese frogEnding_45745cc3:

  # mir "But I never keep a bargain, and no-one messes with my grandchild and lives!"
  mir "但我从不信守交易，而且谁敢惹我的教孙，谁就得死！"

# game/script.rpy:7574
translate Chinese frogEnding_0cd85143_1:

  # bc "N-now see here. I am Brildebrogue Chippingham, and I have never failed at anything in my-"
  bc "听——听我说。我是布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉，我这辈子从没把事办砸——"

# game/script.rpy:7575
translate Chinese frogEnding_1c1f2885:

  # "But with one cloven hoof the devil kicked him straight out the window, whereupon he fell screaming down the tower and into his grave and straight to Hell."
  "但魔鬼用他那裂蹄一脚把他踢出了窗外，他尖叫着跌下塔楼，坠入坟墓，直下地狱。"

# game/script.rpy:7576
translate Chinese frogEnding_1311d518:

  # mir "That takes care of that. Now come with me, my grandchild. All the wonders of Hell await!"
  mir "这下问题解决了。现在跟我走吧，我的教孙。地狱里有数不尽的奇观等着你呢！"

# game/script.rpy:7577
translate Chinese frogEnding_b18fb140:

  # f "Hold on just a second. How do we know you're really the Devil?"
  f "等一下。我们怎么知道你真的是魔鬼？"

# game/script.rpy:7578
translate Chinese frogEnding_98dcf54c:

  # mir "Ha! You dare doubt my power? I can grow tall as a fir tree and small as a mouse."
  mir "哈！你敢怀疑我的力量？我能长得像冷杉树一样高，也能变得像老鼠一样小。"

# game/script.rpy:7579
translate Chinese frogEnding_d3dc4738:

  # f "Prove it."
  f "证明给我们看。"

# game/script.rpy:7580
translate Chinese frogEnding_ecf71257:

  # "The Devil performed His feat, but just as He turned into a mouse, the toad grabbed Him and stuffed Him in a sack and threw Him out the window, whereupon He fell screaming down the tower and into His grave and straight to Hell."
  "魔鬼施展了他的绝技，但他刚变成老鼠，蟾蜍就一把抓住他，把他塞进麻袋里扔出了窗外，他尖叫着跌下塔楼，坠入坟墓，直下地狱。"

# game/script.rpy:7581
translate Chinese frogEnding_2f7a1bcc_1:

  # f "Well. That takes care of that."
  f "好吧。这下问题解决了。"

# game/script.rpy:7584
translate Chinese frogEnding_c9b99a70:

  # "As the clock struck midnight, the ground around Brildebrogue Chippingham began to sprout with pale mushrooms (the fingers of Lady Death)."
  "午夜钟声敲响时，布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉周围的地面开始长出苍白的蘑菇（死神女士的手指）。"

# game/script.rpy:7585
translate Chinese frogEnding_e917817f:

  # bc "No... please! It's not yet my time!"
  bc "不……求求你！还没到我的大限！"

# game/script.rpy:7586
translate Chinese frogEnding_0cd85143_2:

  # bc "N-now see here. I am Brildebrogue Chippingham, and I have never failed at anything in my-"
  bc "听——听我说。我是布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉，我这辈子从没把事办砸——"

# game/script.rpy:7587
translate Chinese frogEnding_561cc536:

  # "But in an instant the mushrooms grew all around and through him, and he fell to the floor."
  "但眨眼间，蘑菇就在他周围疯长，刺穿了他的身体，他倒在了地板上。"

# game/script.rpy:7588
translate Chinese frogEnding_79dfa92e:

  # "And so he died, and he has remained dead up to this very day."
  "就这样，他死了，并且一直死到了今天。"

# game/script.rpy:7589
translate Chinese frogEnding_2f7a1bcc_2:

  # f "Well. That takes care of that."
  f "好吧。这下问题解决了。"

# game/script.rpy:7593
translate Chinese frogEnding_e39fdcdf:

  # "You and the toad bandaged up the pig's injured leg. Then you all left the ruins of Chippingham manor behind to rot."
  "你和蟾蜍包扎好小猪受伤的腿。然后你们把奇平汉庄园的废墟抛在脑后，任其腐朽。"

# game/script.rpy:7595
translate Chinese frogEnding_0c5ed5db:

  # "You and the toad left the ruins of Chippingham manor behind to rot."
  "你和蟾蜍把奇平汉庄园的废墟抛在脑后，任其腐朽。"

# game/script.rpy:7597
translate Chinese frogEnding_07b4aaa8:

  # "You took the gems from the wreckage and renovated the toad's old mud-hole, turning it into a warm, comfy little cottage with a crackling fire and enough food for a lifetime, along with a large closet of fine clothes."
  "你们从废墟中带走宝石，翻修了蟾蜍以前那个泥洞，把它变成了一座温暖舒适的小屋。里面有劈啪作响的炉火，有一辈子吃不完的食物，还有一个装满华服的大衣柜。"

# game/script.rpy:7599
translate Chinese frogEnding_62ccf78b:

  # "Eventually the pig recovered from his injuries and bid you a tearful farewell. With his share of the treasure, he bought a prosthetic hoof made of iron and started a gambling-house in the village. You all visited from time to time to enjoy a game of chance with him."
  "最终，小猪养好了伤，含泪向你们告别。他用分到的财宝买了一只铁铸的假蹄，在村里开了一家赌场。你们时常去拜访他，陪他玩上两把。"

# game/script.rpy:7600
translate Chinese frogEnding_5f8b4aa5:

  # "Thus, the legend of Iron Hoof was born."
  "于是，铁蹄的传说就此诞生。"

# game/script.rpy:7608
translate Chinese frogEnding_31336933:

  # "But you found you didn't want to leave. You stayed together in your cosy home in the swamp. The toad worked long hours sewing many fine costumes, and the two of you put on plays together which delighted the people of the village."
  "但你发现自己不想离开了。你们一起留在了沼泽里那个舒适的家中。蟾蜍花很长时间缝制了许多精美的戏服，你们俩一起排演戏剧，给村里的人们带来了无数欢乐。"

# game/script.rpy:7609
translate Chinese frogEnding_230b3f24:

  # "After many years of companionship, you finally got married and lived happily together."
  "在相伴多年后，你们最终结为连理，过上了幸福的生活。"

# game/script.rpy:7610
translate Chinese frogEnding_1da06983:

  # "I should know - I was at your wedding!"
  "我当然知道——我参加了你们的婚礼！"

# game/script.rpy:7612
translate Chinese frogEnding_63eba1f7:

  # "I gorged myself on the fresh meat and raised my glass for the toast, and the beer ran down my chin but did not go into my mouth."
  "我大口咀嚼着新鲜的肉，举杯祝酒，啤酒顺着我的下巴流下，却没有流进我嘴里。"

# game/script.rpy:7618
translate Chinese frogEnding_a20cefa7:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:7619
translate Chinese frogEnding_00620a41:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:7620
translate Chinese frogEnding_d84052b1:

  # "And what happened to the witch, you ask?"
  "你问那个女巫后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:7625
translate Chinese frogEnding_400d447a:

  # "But you found you didn't want to leave. You stayed together in your cosy home in the swamp."
  "但你发现自己不想离开了。你们一起留在了沼泽里那个舒适的家中。"

# game/script.rpy:7626
translate Chinese frogEnding_f9fb10ee:

  # "The two of you settled down to a happy life together. The toad found work sewing fine costumes for the people of the village, and soon enough you founded a theatre with the savings."
  "你们俩安顿下来，过上了幸福的生活。蟾蜍找到了为村民缝制精美戏服的工作，很快，你们就用攒下的钱建立了一家剧院。"

# game/script.rpy:7627
translate Chinese frogEnding_3a2b7688:

  # "I saw the two of you put on many fine plays through the years! Together you had the whole village in stitches. I laughed and laughed and laughed, though none could hear me."
  "这些年来，我看了你们俩排演的许多精彩戏剧！你们一起让整个村子的人笑得前仰后合。我笑啊笑啊笑啊，尽管没人听得见我。"

# game/script.rpy:7632
translate Chinese frogEnding_00683f9d:

  # "You were happy there for the rest of your days, and you still would live if you had not died."
  "你们在那儿幸福地度过了余生，如果你们没死，现在还会好好活着。"

# game/script.rpy:7634
translate Chinese frogEnding_a20cefa7_1:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:7635
translate Chinese frogEnding_00620a41_1:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:7636
translate Chinese frogEnding_d84052b1_1:

  # "And what happened to the witch, you ask?"
  "你问那个女巫后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:7643
translate Chinese frogEnding_df71ef32:

  # "When it was time to leave, you wished the toad a tearful farewell, and returned to your cottage with your family."
  "到了该离开的时候，你含泪向蟾蜍告别，回到了与家人同住的小屋。"

# game/script.rpy:7644
translate Chinese frogEnding_d29a94bb:

  # "You lived there for many long, happy years, visiting the toad often as a good friend."
  "你在那里度过了许多漫长而幸福的岁月，作为好朋友，你经常去拜访蟾蜍。"

# game/script.rpy:7645
translate Chinese frogEnding_6f384b38:

  # "The toad found work sewing fine costumes for the people of the village, and soon enough you founded a theatre with the savings."
  "蟾蜍找到了为村民缝制精美戏服的工作，很快，你们就用攒下的钱建立了一家剧院。"

# game/script.rpy:7646
translate Chinese frogEnding_3a2b7688_1:

  # "I saw the two of you put on many fine plays through the years! Together you had the whole village in stitches. I laughed and laughed and laughed, though none could hear me."
  "这些年来，我看了你们俩排演的许多精彩戏剧！你们一起让整个村子的人笑得前仰后合。我笑啊笑啊笑啊，尽管没人听得见我。"

# game/script.rpy:7651
translate Chinese frogEnding_9cfffca5:

  # "You were very happy there for the rest of your days, and you still would live if you had not died."
  "你们在那儿非常幸福地度过了余生，如果你们没死，现在还会好好活着。"

# game/script.rpy:7653
translate Chinese frogEnding_a20cefa7_2:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:7654
translate Chinese frogEnding_00620a41_2:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:7655
translate Chinese frogEnding_d84052b1_2:

  # "And what happened to the witch, you ask?"
  "你问那个女巫后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:7660
translate Chinese toadDeath_b4d71b52:

  # "But youth does not last forever."
  "但青春无法永驻。"

# game/script.rpy:7661
translate Chinese toadDeath_ff76ab68:

  # "One day, you felt yourself wracked with a terrible fever."
  "有一天，你发了一场可怕的高烧，备受折磨。"

# game/script.rpy:7662
translate Chinese toadDeath_6702f09a:

  # "Then, you felt gout take hold of you and make all your limbs twitch, and you were wracked with one illness after another, and you fell into deep sleep for long days."
  "接着，痛风找上了你，引得四肢不停抽搐；接二连三的病痛折磨着你，让你陷入了漫长的昏睡。"

# game/script.rpy:7663
translate Chinese toadDeath_0d27e95c:

  # "Not even the toad could help you, though he toiled at your bedside for many long hours."
  "尽管蟾蜍在你的病榻前不辞辛劳地日夜守候，却也对你束手无策。"

# game/script.rpy:7664
translate Chinese toadDeath_b7cd26f5:

  # f "I-I'm so sorry, my old friend... I wish I knew more about this kind of thing."
  f "我——我真的很抱歉，老朋友……真希望我对治病这种事能多懂一点。"

# game/script.rpy:7665
translate Chinese toadDeath_ec1df498:

  # pov "Don't worry. I won't die until Death sends Her messengers."
  pov "别担心。死神派信使来之前，我是不会死的。"

# game/script.rpy:7666
translate Chinese toadDeath_c0256e3b:

  # "But as you spoke, there was a knock on the door, and the toad opened it to reveal the wise mushroom from the forest."
  "但话音未落，敲门声响了。蟾蜍打开门，门外站着的正是森林里那株睿智的蘑菇。"

# game/script.rpy:7668
translate Chinese toadDeath_fe45266e:

  # m "I suppose my curse won't be needed after all."
  m "看来我的诅咒终究是用不上了。"

# game/script.rpy:7669
translate Chinese toadDeath_77865824:

  # m "It is time. Come with me."
  m "时候到了。跟我走吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7670
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_ddd08a3a:

  # m "Death is waiting for you."
  m "死神在等你。"

# game/script.rpy:7677
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_a8ebb631:

  # pov "But - is She going to break her promise? She said She'd send three messengers."
  pov "可是——难道她要食言吗？她说过会派三位信使来的。"

# game/script.rpy:7678
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_89f9adce:

  # m "She has sent all her messengers. "
  m "她已经派出了所有的信使。"

# game/script.rpy:7679
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_416d8e0b:

  # m "Didn't the fever rage at you? Didn't the gout take hold of you and shake you to pieces?"
  m "难道高烧不曾折磨过你吗？难道痛风不曾纠缠过你，把你的身体扯得支离破碎吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7680
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_fcacbdb8:

  # m "She even sent her sister, Sleep, to remind you of Her."
  m "她甚至派出了她的妹妹——沉睡，来提醒你她的存在。"

# game/script.rpy:7681
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_369972a0:

  # m "Now you must come down to Her kingdom."
  m "现在，你必须跟我去她的国度了。"

# game/script.rpy:7686
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_74a10a00:

  # pov "Can I say goodbye first?"
  pov "我能先道个别吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7687
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_29362efd:

  # m "Of course."
  m "当然可以。"

# game/script.rpy:7689
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_2c152c83:

  # "You turned to the toad. He was crying, and where his tears fell they turned into gleaming black geckos that skittered away into the corners of the room."
  "你转向蟾蜍。他在哭泣，滴落的眼泪化作闪闪发光的黑色壁虎，窸窸窣窣地窜进房间的角落。"

# game/script.rpy:7695
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_48057142:

  # pov "Goodbye, my dear. I love you, so much."
  pov "再见，亲爱的。我爱你，非常爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:7696
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_2bb8e30e:

  # f "I love you too."
  f "我也爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:7697
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_086646c3:

  # "You embraced, and his tears fell upon you, and you felt the cool gecko's feet across your cheeks."
  "你们紧紧相拥，他的眼泪滴落在你身上，你感觉到壁虎冰凉的脚爪爬过你的脸颊。"

# game/script.rpy:7698
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_f3379bbf:

  # "I wept in the shadows."
  "我在阴影中落泪。"

# game/script.rpy:7699
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_a0b09b32:

  # f "I'm sorry I couldn't be more. You should have chosen someone else. Maybe if you'd-"
  f "对不起，我能为你做的太少了。你本该选择别人的。要是当初你——"

# game/script.rpy:7700
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_5337c22f:

  # pov "Shh. I chose you. You have nothing to be sorry about."
  pov "嘘。我选择了你。你不欠我什么。"

# game/script.rpy:7701
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_61c1899b:

  # "And you gripped him tight."
  "你紧紧地抱住了他。"

# game/script.rpy:7704
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_f494bf5e:

  # pov "Goodbye, my dear friend. I love you, so much."
  pov "再见，我亲爱的朋友。我爱你，非常爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:7705
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_e674c761:

  # f "Goodbye."
  f "再见。"

# game/script.rpy:7706
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_086646c3_1:

  # "You embraced, and his tears fell upon you, and you felt the cool gecko's feet across your cheeks."
  "你们紧紧相拥，他的眼泪滴落在你身上，你感觉到壁虎冰凉的脚爪爬过你的脸颊。"

# game/script.rpy:7707
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_b8a36135:

  # "I wept to see such a tragic moment."
  "看到这悲情的一幕，我不禁落泪。"

# game/script.rpy:7708
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_873d5a8c:

  # f "I'm sorry I couldn't be more for you. You should have chosen someone else. Maybe if you'd-"
  f "对不起，我能为你做的太少了。你本该选择别人的。要是当初你——"

# game/script.rpy:7709
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_5337c22f_1:

  # pov "Shh. I chose you. You have nothing to be sorry about."
  pov "嘘。我选择了你。你不欠我什么。"

# game/script.rpy:7710
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_61c1899b_1:

  # "And you gripped him tight."
  "你紧紧地抱住了他。"

# game/script.rpy:7713
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_31f4e52f:

  # pov "Alright. I'm ready."
  pov "好了。我准备好了。"

# game/script.rpy:7714
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_cb738ab6:

  # m "No-one's ever ready. But there's no time left."
  m "从来就没人能真正准备好。但已经没时间了。"

# game/script.rpy:7717
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_5cfba400:

  # "She gently took you down to the kingdom of Death."
  "她轻柔地带着你，向死神的国度沉去。"

# game/script.rpy:7719
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_6ae14d2e:

  # "And you lie there still."
  "而你至今仍长眠在那里。"

# game/script.rpy:7721
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_a20cefa7:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:7722
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_00620a41:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:7723
translate Chinese deathToadQuestions_d84052b1:

  # "And what happened to the witch, you ask?"
  "你问那个女巫后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:7733
translate Chinese witchDisappears_719dca94:

  # "The witch was left alone in her cottage. The wet, swollen greenery pressed in around her, twisting in spirals like the organs of some giant beast."
  "女巫独自留在小屋里。潮湿肿胀的绿色植物向她步步紧逼，像巨兽的脏腑般盘旋扭曲。"

# game/script.rpy:7734
translate Chinese witchDisappears_6433f030:

  # w "Well. I guess I'd better clean up this mess."
  w "好吧。我想我最好清理一下这个烂摊子。"

# game/script.rpy:7736
translate Chinese witchDisappears_08b00899:

  # "There was a sound outside."
  "外面传来了一阵声响。"

# game/script.rpy:7737
translate Chinese witchDisappears_2b32d51e:

  # "From the space between the trees."
  "从林木幽隙中传来。"

# game/script.rpy:7738
translate Chinese witchDisappears_3cc6bb74:

  # "Perhaps it was just the howling of the wind, and nothing more."
  "也许那只是风的嚎叫，仅此而已。"

# game/script.rpy:7739
translate Chinese witchDisappears_68d0d7b6:

  # w "I'll make some tea. That always calms me down."
  w "我要去泡点茶。那总能让我平静下来。"

# game/script.rpy:7743
translate Chinese witchDisappears_bd8833de:

  # "But when she went to her tea cabinet, she found she'd forgotten how."
  "但当她走到茶柜前时，她发现自己忘了该怎么泡茶。"

# game/script.rpy:7745
translate Chinese witchDisappears_e1cef408:

  # w "What? I'm sure I.."
  w "什么？我敢肯定我……"

# game/script.rpy:7746
translate Chinese witchDisappears_fc237a2c:

  # "She thought, and thought, but no knowledge of how to brew tea was left in her mind. There was nothing but a hole where the information had been. Like a great, red bite taken out of her brain."
  "她想了又想，但脑海中再也找不到任何泡茶的记忆了。原本储存这些信息的地方，现在只剩下一个大洞。就像是她的大脑被活生生咬掉了一大块血肉。"

# game/script.rpy:7747
translate Chinese witchDisappears_6e3fecdd:

  # w "Oh no. No, no, no."
  w "哦，不。不，不，不。"

# game/script.rpy:7748
translate Chinese witchDisappears_43542375:

  # "Something was outside."
  "有东西在外面。"

# game/script.rpy:7751
translate Chinese witchDisappears_39bbbc13:

  # "She ran to lock the door. But she didn't know how anymore."
  "她跑去锁门。但她已经不知道该怎么锁了。"

# game/script.rpy:7752
translate Chinese witchDisappears_3c76304b:

  # "How did locks work? How did one interact with a door? The latch, the key, the handle - what were these things, and how did they fit together?"
  "锁有什么用？门该怎么开？门闩、钥匙、把手——这些到底是什么，它们彼此间又有什么关系？"

# game/script.rpy:7753
translate Chinese witchDisappears_32e8487c:

  # "The knowledge was gone."
  "这些认知都消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:7754
translate Chinese witchDisappears_740fab77:

  # "She clawed at it, but it was just a wooden rectangle now, an abstract shape with no meaning. Another gaping wound in her mind, still fresh and dripping."
  "她双手抓挠着门，但现在那不过是个木制的长方形，一个毫无意义的抽象形状。她脑海中又多了一道裂开的伤口，依旧鲜红，依旧淌血。"

# game/script.rpy:7755
translate Chinese witchDisappears_6a5ede0f:

  # w "I - No."
  w "我——不。"

# game/script.rpy:7756
translate Chinese witchDisappears_a2c9c96a:

  # w "I see the cabinet. I smell the tea. I hear the rustle of the leaves. I taste - I taste -"
  w "我看到了柜子。我闻到了茶香。我听到了茶叶的沙沙声。我尝到了——我尝到了——"

# game/script.rpy:7757
translate Chinese witchDisappears_da30c6f1:

  # "She tried to recite one thing she could see. One thing she could smell. One thing she could hear."
  "她试图念出一样能看到的东西。一样能闻到的东西。一样能听到的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:7758
translate Chinese witchDisappears_69a05f56:

  # "But it was too late."
  "但太迟了。"

# game/script.rpy:7762
translate Chinese witchDisappears_24c12abe:

  # "The wolf was already inside the house."
  "狼已经在房子里了。"

# game/script.rpy:7763
translate Chinese witchDisappears_b73313db:

  # "She fell to the floor. She had forgotten how to walk. Perhaps she never knew."
  "她跌倒在地。她忘了该怎么走路。也许她从来就不知道。"

# game/script.rpy:7764
translate Chinese witchDisappears_0293e273:

  # "What were these things, at the end of her legs? What strange process animated these lumps of unknown flesh?"
  "长在双腿末端的，是什么东西？是什么诡异的法则在驱动这些不知名的肉块？"

# game/script.rpy:7765
translate Chinese witchDisappears_01063e19:

  # w "I see the window. I can feel the floor. I can hear... I hear..."
  w "我看到了窗户。我能感觉到地板。我能听到……我听到……"

# game/script.rpy:7769
translate Chinese witchDisappears_932d92a0:

  # "She heard nothing."
  "她什么也没听到。"

# game/script.rpy:7771
translate Chinese witchDisappears_b4cf7fde:

  # "Her ears did not hear. Her eyes did not see. Her fingers no longer felt the wood under her nails."
  "她的耳朵听不见。她的眼睛看不见。她的手指再也感觉不到指甲下的木头。"

# game/script.rpy:7772
translate Chinese witchDisappears_b7468056:

  # "The information from her senses meant nothing at all to her anymore. She could no longer tell whether she was hot or cold, wet or dry, whether the thing underneath her hands was wood, or flesh, or even just air - the knowledge of what these things felt like had been taken - but then maybe she was suspended in nothingness after all, maybe there was nothing here but the empty abyss of endless nothing-space in every single direction, maybe she heard nothing because there was nothing in the entire world except for herself."
  "感官所接收到的一切信息再也无法被她理解。她再也分不清是冷是热，是湿是干，分不清手底下的东西是木头、是肉体、还是仅仅只有空气，关于这些触感的记忆全被夺走了。不过，或许她终究只是悬浮在虚无之中，或许除了四面八方无尽的虚无深渊外，这里什么都没有，或许她什么也听不见，是因为整个世界除了她自己，本来就一无所有。"

# game/script.rpy:7773
translate Chinese witchDisappears_941113a9:

  # w "You can't do this. I am myself."
  w "你不能这么做。我是我自己。"

# game/script.rpy:7774
translate Chinese witchDisappears_10d2c032:

  # w "I name you, and bind you, beast. By your True Name, I cast you out."
  w "野兽，我呼唤汝名，将你束缚。以你的真名，我将你驱逐！"

# game/script.rpy:7775
translate Chinese witchDisappears_e77140b5:

  # "But how can you do that, witch?"
  "但你怎么可能做到呢，女巫？"

# game/script.rpy:7776
translate Chinese witchDisappears_85aa3b8d:

  # "You don't even remember your own name."
  "你连自己的名字都记不得了。"

# game/script.rpy:7777
translate Chinese witchDisappears_8291a0cc:

  # w "No! My name is... my name is..."
  w "不！我的名字是……我的名字是……"

# game/script.rpy:7778
translate Chinese witchDisappears_cf4b5025:

  # "It was gone. Eaten up whole."
  "它消失了。被整个吞噬了。"

# game/script.rpy:7779
translate Chinese witchDisappears_58579802:

  # "The thing that had no name lay there on the floor, senseless."
  "那个没有名字的东西躺在地板上，失去了感官。"

# game/script.rpy:7780
translate Chinese witchDisappears_c06599b6:

  # "It saw nothing."
  "它什么也看不见。"

# game/script.rpy:7781
translate Chinese witchDisappears_6fb61e19:

  # "It smelled nothing."
  "它什么也闻不到。"

# game/script.rpy:7782
translate Chinese witchDisappears_b8802b10:

  # "It felt nothing."
  "它什么也感觉不到。"

# game/script.rpy:7783
translate Chinese witchDisappears_3b248e0e:

  # "It tasted nothing."
  "它什么也尝不出。"

# game/script.rpy:7784
translate Chinese witchDisappears_6b330413:

  # "It heard nothing."
  "它什么也听不见。"

# game/script.rpy:7792
translate Chinese witchDisappears_b96f7117:

  # "And then it was gone."
  "然后，它就不见了。"

# game/script.rpy:7794
translate Chinese witchDisappears_b65b5631:

  # "It was never seen or heard from again."
  "再也没有人见过它，也没有人听到过它的消息。"

# game/script.rpy:7803
translate Chinese toadSolo_02b867db:

  # "The toad leapt up from the table and clicked his fingers."
  "蟾蜍从桌边跳起，打了个响指。"

# game/script.rpy:7806
translate Chinese toadSolo_aebcb0fa:

  # f "Prickle! Crawl! Shudder and Clink! Don't tarry or stall, get us there in a wink!"
  f "芒刺！游移！战栗！叮铃！莫迟莫疑，眨眼送行！"

# game/script.rpy:7809
translate Chinese toadSolo_aebcb0fa_1:

  # f "Prickle! Crawl! Shudder and Clink! Don't tarry or stall, get us there in a wink!"
  f "芒刺！游移！战栗！叮铃！莫迟莫疑，眨眼送行！"

# game/script.rpy:7811
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_a7a3651d:

  # "His great squash carriage rattled out of the bushes and pulled up right next to the banquet table."
  "他巨大的歪瓜马车从灌木丛里嘎哒嘎哒地驶出，停在了宴会桌旁。"

# game/script.rpy:7812
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_c4fa4bbc:

  # f "If you get us there before sundown, there's a tenner in it for you!"
  f "如果你们能在日落前把我们送到，我赏你们十块钱！"

# game/script.rpy:7813
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_44696844:

  # "He tossed a bag of shiny coins to the crow-shrike, the rat, the bat and the old black cockatoo."
  "他把一袋闪闪发光的硬币扔给白背钟鹊、老鼠、蝙蝠和那只衰老的黑凤头鹦鹉。"

# game/script.rpy:7814
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_b9c65842:

  # bat "Cheers, boss."
  bat "谢了，老板。"

# game/script.rpy:7815
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_b675295d:

  # "The cockatoo bit into one of the coins."
  "凤头鹦鹉拿起其中一枚硬币咬了一口。"

# game/script.rpy:7816
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_143e8906:

  # cockatoo "Yep, it's good money. Let's do it, boys."
  cockatoo "没错，是真钱。伙计们，干活吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7817
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_a4e1b98e:

  # rat "We'll get you there in a jiffy, mate."
  rat "我们分分钟把你们送到，伙计。"

# game/script.rpy:7818
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_98184c80:

  # crowshrike "Caw!"
  crowshrike "嘎！"

# game/script.rpy:7819
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_7981517c:

  # "The squash rattled and bumped down the road with haste. The toad attempted some witty anecdotes while you pretended to listen."
  "歪瓜马车在路上颠簸疾驰。蟾蜍试着讲些风趣的奇闻轶事，而你则假装在听。"

# game/script.rpy:7822
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_d5139881:

  # "Finally you arrived at a stately riverside manor."
  "最后，你们来到了一座宏伟的河畔庄园。"

# game/script.rpy:7823
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_c18786cb:

  # "With a clap of his hands, the toad summoned a cavalcade of richly dressed frog manservants, who poured flutes of champagne while offering spontaneous and completely unplanned anecdotes about the incredible things Brildebrogue Chippingham had said or done lately."
  "蟾蜍拍了拍手，召来一队衣着华贵的青蛙男仆，他们一边斟满一杯杯香槟，一边故作不经意地大谈特谈布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉最近的种种惊人壮举。"

# game/script.rpy:7824
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_c78d97b4:

  # "With another click, a dozen beautiful frog maids escorted you to golden baths where all the dirt of the journey was washed away. The finest frog soprano choir in all the land serenaded you with tales of Brildebrogue Chippingham's latest exploits."
  "他又打了个响指，十几位美丽的青蛙女仆护送你们去到金色的浴池，洗去了旅途的尘埃。全境最顶级的青蛙女高音合唱团为你献唱小夜曲，歌颂着布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉的最新功绩。"

# game/script.rpy:7825
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_6c20166b:

  # "All the while, the toad's servants pretended to laugh at his jokes as he tipped them generously."
  "在此期间，每当蟾蜍慷慨地掷下赏钱，仆人们便假意被他的笑话逗乐。"

# game/script.rpy:7826
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_2f39eeaa:

  # f "Yes, please make yourself at home, my dear friend! We are friends now, right?"
  f "没错，请把这儿当自己家，我亲爱的朋友！我们现在是朋友了，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:7827
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_c6bb71fb:

  # f "That is to say, of course we are! I have so many friends these days, you know. In fact I may be completely tied up with them and all the time we spend together constantly, doing all the things friends do, you know, but never fear, I won't forget the little people such as yourself, my dear friend, we shall certainly have some time to spend together."
  f "也就是说，我们当然是朋友！要知道，这些天我交了好多朋友。老实说，我完全被他们缠得脱不开身，忙得简直分身乏术，净干些朋友之间干的事，你懂的。不过别害怕，我绝不会忘了你这种无足轻重的平头百姓的，我亲爱的朋友，我们肯定会有时间相处的。"

# game/script.rpy:7828
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_0fd11825:

  # pov "Have you... always owned this manor?"
  pov "这座庄园……一直都是你的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7830
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_aa14438d:

  # f "Of course! The manor is owned by me, Brildebrogue Chippingham! That's my name! Why would you think otherwise?"
  f "当然了！这座庄园的主人就是我，布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉！这就是我的名字！你干嘛问这种话？"

# game/script.rpy:7831
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_70222283:

  # f "Anyway, no time to talk about trivialities such as property ownership, I have a party to plan! It will begin soon, you'd better make ready!"
  f "总之，没时间谈论财产所有权这种琐事了，我还要筹划一场派对！马上就要开始了，你最好准备一下！"

# game/script.rpy:7832
translate Chinese gilPathShowingToad_67940fb0:

  # "And with that the toad flitted out of the room and left you alone to explore the manor."
  "说完，蟾蜍飞快地溜出了房间，留下你独自探索庄园。"

# game/script.rpy:7851
translate Chinese chippinghamManorSolo_c3daddf6:

  # "Deep underneath the first tower was a bottomless vault full of riches."
  "在第一座塔楼的地底深处，是一个装满财富的无底金库。"

# game/script.rpy:7852
translate Chinese chippinghamManorSolo_4246cd98:

  # "Inside the vault was a cornucopia of luscious fruit, fat flies, even gardens and lakes that produced enough food to last for years - perhaps centuries."
  "金库内是一派丰饶景象，装满了甜美的果实、肥硕的苍蝇，甚至还有花园和湖泊，能产出足够吃上几年——乃至几个世纪的食物。"

# game/script.rpy:7853
translate Chinese chippinghamManorSolo_9968a23c:

  # "A team of frog engineers were reinforcing the walls to make them totally impenetrable."
  "一队青蛙工程师正在加固墙壁，让它们变得坚不可摧。"

# game/script.rpy:7858
translate Chinese chippinghamManorSolo_1b6c66ec:

  # "Inside the second tower was a trio of stately frog wizards, hard at work placing sigils and wards and runes all across the manor to guard against every possible evil."
  "第二座塔楼里有三位威严的青蛙巫师，他们正埋头在庄园各处布下印记、结界和符文，以防备所有可能的邪恶。"

# game/script.rpy:7863
translate Chinese chippinghamManorSolo_f10177ca:

  # "Inside the third tower, you discovered a collection of fine frog bards, composing poems and arias in Brildebrogue's name that moved you to tears just to hear them."
  "在第三座塔楼里，你发现了一群优秀的青蛙吟游诗人，他们创作着冠以布里尔德布罗格之名的诗歌与咏叹调，光是听一听就让你感动落泪。"

# game/script.rpy:7869
translate Chinese chippinghamManorSolo_b8329627:

  # "The whole fourth tower was taken up by a looming pyramid. Atop it stood a gigantic sculpture of Brildebrogue, vomiting forth emeralds and sapphires and precious gems."
  "整座第四塔楼被一座巍峨耸立的金字塔占据。塔顶矗立着一座巨大的布里尔德布罗格雕像，嘴里正不断呕出祖母绿、蓝宝石和各种珍贵的宝石。"

# game/script.rpy:7874
translate Chinese chippinghamManorSolo_f92503a8:

  # "Inside the fifth tower were the greatest frog artists of their age, furiously painting a series of refined portraits of Brildebrogue at rest."
  "第五座塔楼里聚集着那个时代最伟大的青蛙艺术家，他们正狂热地绘制着一系列描绘布里尔德布罗格闲适姿态的精美肖像。"

# game/script.rpy:7879
translate Chinese chippinghamManorSolo_36268e1c:

  # "Inside the sixth tower you found the Library of Alexandria. You opened a random volume to discover that it was a biography of Brildebrogue's life (part 6 of 2,987)."
  "在第六座塔楼里，你发现了亚历山大图书馆。你随便翻开一卷，发现那是布里尔德布罗格的生平传记（全2987卷的第6卷）。"

# game/script.rpy:7883
translate Chinese chippinghamManorSolo_29315f0d:

  # "Inside the seventh and tallest tower you found only a tiny wooden closet."
  "在最高的那座第七塔楼里，你只发现了一个小小的木制壁橱。"

# game/script.rpy:7891
translate Chinese chippinghamManorSolo_eda4e6f0:

  # "You inserted the key, and slowly opened the door with a long creak."
  "你插进钥匙，伴着长长的一声嘎吱缓缓打开了门。"

# game/script.rpy:7894
translate Chinese chippinghamManorSolo_24322ad0:

  # "As soon as the door opened, a stream of blood flowed over you."
  "门一打开，一股鲜血便浇在你身上。"

# game/script.rpy:7896
translate Chinese chippinghamManorSolo_7ba64a1d:

  # "The pig squealed in terrible fear."
  "小猪吓得发出了凄厉的尖叫。"

# game/script.rpy:7897
translate Chinese chippinghamManorSolo_9b6a68c2:

  # "In the depths of the darkness, you saw a hollow face."
  "在黑暗的深处，你看到了一张空洞的脸。"

# game/script.rpy:7905
translate Chinese chippinghamManorSolo_046eae35:

  # "The eyes were gone. The mouth had rotted away. It was all that remained of Brildebrogue Chippingham."
  "眼睛不见了。嘴巴腐烂了。那是布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉剩下的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:7917
translate Chinese toadConstruct_45d75de8:

  # "The toad was busy reinforcing the manor's defences."
  "蟾蜍正忙着加固庄园的防御。"

# game/script.rpy:7918
translate Chinese toadConstruct_414bdd6d:

  # "Golden locks were placed on every door, and silver bars at every window."
  "每扇门上都装了金锁，每扇窗户上都安了银栅栏。"

# game/script.rpy:7921
translate Chinese toadConstruct_aeae3667:

  # "Hordes of guests began arriving for the gala. Notable political figures, great artists or famed adventurers from the swamplands."
  "成群结队的宾客陆续抵达这场盛会。有知名的政治人物、伟大的艺术家，还有沼泽地里著名的冒险家。"

# game/script.rpy:7922
translate Chinese toadConstruct_f5afc4aa:

  # "The toad greeted them hastily before leading a team of master masons through the house, heading for the basement."
  "蟾蜍匆匆迎接了他们，然后带领一队石匠大师穿过房子，直奔地下室。"

# game/script.rpy:7923
translate Chinese toadConstruct_40b31b11:

  # "The masons carried lumbering wagons of copper and iron."
  "石匠们推着装满铜和铁的笨重推车。"

# game/script.rpy:7929
translate Chinese toadConstruct_ee999096:

  # f "Did you hear that?"
  f "你听到了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7930
translate Chinese toadConstruct_96948dfd:

  # "Sweat streamed down the toad's face."
  "汗水顺着蟾蜍的脸颊流下。"

# game/script.rpy:7931
translate Chinese toadConstruct_89708449:

  # pov "Hear what?"
  pov "听到什么？"

# game/script.rpy:7933
translate Chinese toadConstruct_32a941ac:

  # f "It sounded like howling."
  f "听起来像是在嚎叫。"

# game/script.rpy:7934
translate Chinese toadConstruct_6969853d:

  # f "Build faster."
  f "建快点。"

# game/script.rpy:7935
translate Chinese toadConstruct_14d83559:

  # "The labourers increased their speed. A layer of mercury was bound into the walls of the manor."
  "工人们加快了速度。一层水银被浇筑进了庄园的墙壁里。"

# game/script.rpy:7936
translate Chinese toadConstruct_ad89a823:

  # "The party intensified. Scenes of froggish debauchery played out all around you."
  "派对愈演愈烈。周围尽是群蛙荒淫无度的狂欢场面。"

# game/script.rpy:7941
translate Chinese toadConstruct_08e5fb7b:

  # "Layers of ash and salt were drawn around the mansion."
  "庄园周围撒上了一层层的灰烬和盐。"

# game/script.rpy:7942
translate Chinese toadConstruct_65de4e76:

  # "The doors were barred. Guests weren't allowed to enter or leave."
  "大门被封死了。宾客们不准进出。"

# game/script.rpy:7943
translate Chinese toadConstruct_74ec3432:

  # "They didn't seem to care. Fine swamp cocktails were handed out and a big band played on into the night."
  "他们似乎并不在乎。精美的沼泽鸡尾酒流水般奉上，一支大乐队一直持续演奏，彻夜不息。"

# game/script.rpy:7945
translate Chinese toadConstruct_a43ca2a4:

  # "Underneath the music, you almost thought you could hear something moving underneath the floorboards."
  "在音乐的掩盖下，你几乎觉得能听到地板下面有什么东西在移动。"

# game/script.rpy:7951
translate Chinese toadConstruct_6c93c9aa:

  # "The final layer of protection was delivered. The layer of Bone."
  "最后一层防护被运了进来。骸骨层。"

# game/script.rpy:7952
translate Chinese toadConstruct_ba4e0146:

  # "You saw it drawn into the castle under cover of night."
  "你看到它在夜色的掩护下被拉进城堡。"

# game/script.rpy:7953
translate Chinese toadConstruct_76c82c23:

  # "The band leader leapt into a triumphant saxophone solo."
  "乐队指挥激情澎湃地奏响了一段高亢的萨克斯独奏。"

# game/script.rpy:7960
translate Chinese toadConstruct_31c7ce90:

  # "The vault was complete."
  "金库建成了。"

# game/script.rpy:7961
translate Chinese toadConstruct_e2eae5c7:

  # "It yawned underneath the manor like an open mouth."
  "它像一张张开的大嘴，在庄园下方深不见底。"

# game/script.rpy:7962
translate Chinese toadConstruct_7e4b2b61:

  # "The walls were thick. Impenetrable in every way. Every possible ward had been laid upon them."
  "墙壁很厚。坚不可摧。所有能用的结界都布在了上面。"

# game/script.rpy:7963
translate Chinese toadConstruct_87a62ac4:

  # "They formed a twisting spiral, like a knot of entrails from which omens could be read."
  "它们形成了一个扭曲的螺旋，宛如一团纠缠的脏腑，能够从中观象卜凶。"

# game/script.rpy:7982
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_34156d80:

  # f "I see you've found it."
  f "看来你找到它了。"

# game/script.rpy:7983
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_6076e36e:

  # "You jumped in shock. The toad was right behind you."
  "你吓了一跳。蟾蜍就在你身后。"

# game/script.rpy:7984
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_a000bf09:

  # f "Very well. You deserve to know what happened."
  f "很好。你有权知道发生了什么。"

# game/script.rpy:7985
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_ad7a75e7:

  # f "In a time already long past, I came to this mansion as a lowly servant. My name in those days was Blort."
  f "在很久很久以前，我来到了这座宅邸，做过低贱的下人。那时我的名字叫布洛特。"

# game/script.rpy:7986
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_47f91eb7:

  # f "The manor was owned by a frog named Brildebrogue Chippingham, who was so handsome that light shone from his face as if from the sun. The wind whistled for him, and the cobblestones sighed in joy to receive his feet upon them. Everyone in the land adored him."
  f "庄园的主人是一只名叫布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉的青蛙，他生得极为俊美，面容熠熠生辉，宛如骄阳。风为他轻吟，鹅卵石因为能承载他的脚步而发出喜悦的叹息。全境的人都崇拜他。"

# game/script.rpy:7987
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_9e909742:

  # f "Sweeping his floors, and dusting his closets, I searched through the manor each night."
  f "我每晚一边扫地、给壁橱掸灰，一边在庄园里搜寻。"

# game/script.rpy:7989
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_132e0393:

  # f "Finally, I found his secret."
  f "终于，我发现了他的秘密。"

# game/script.rpy:7990
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_b0a8bc47:

  # f "I stole his key, and left it in the hall, so that he would find it and think something was wrong."
  f "我偷了他的钥匙，把它留在走廊里，这样他就会发现，觉得有些不对劲了。"

# game/script.rpy:7991
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_290bb336:

  # f "He came across it late at night."
  f "他深夜偶然看到了它。"

# game/script.rpy:7992
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_6a56c209:

  # bc "What's this?"
  bc "这是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:7993
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_f12238dd:

  # f "In a panic, he ran to the cupboard on the seventh floor of the seventh tower."
  f "他惊慌失措地跑到第七座塔楼第七层的那个壁橱。"

# game/script.rpy:7994
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_3674a98d:

  # f "He wrested open the door in a feverish state."
  f "他狂乱地拉开了门。"

# game/script.rpy:7995
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_82915713:

  # bc "My darlings. My darlings. Are you still in here?"
  bc "我的心肝们。我的心肝们。你们还在里面吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7996
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_0c78c5ca:

  # wives "Come closer."
  wives "靠近点。"

# game/script.rpy:7997
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_d32cd930:

  # wives "Come closer, our love. We can barely see your face."
  wives "靠近点，我的亲爱的。我们快看不清你的脸了。"

# game/script.rpy:7998
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_070be266:

  # f "Brildebrogue took one step inside. That's when I drew my dagger and ran him through."
  f "布里尔德布罗格向里迈了一步。就在那时，我拔出匕首刺穿了他。"

# game/script.rpy:7999
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_265fd329:

  # bc "The devil - Blort? You bastard -"
  bc "见鬼——布洛特？你这混蛋——"

# game/script.rpy:8000
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_ef548876:

  # f "With my last strength I pushed him into the closet."
  f "我用尽最后的力气把他推进了壁橱。"

# game/script.rpy:8001
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_e0bafa45:

  # f "His seven wives were waiting."
  f "他的七个妻子正等着他。"

# game/script.rpy:8002
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_895620c2:

  # wives "Come to us."
  wives "到我们这儿来。"

# game/script.rpy:8003
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_afcd3128:

  # bc "No, no-"
  bc "不，不——"

# game/script.rpy:8004
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_83e66802:

  # wives "Stay. Stay."
  wives "留下来。留下来。"

# game/script.rpy:8006
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_8db3b403:

  # f "Their skeletal arms closed around him and dragged him into the blood-soaked blackness."
  f "她们白骨森森的手臂箍住了他，把他拖入血淋淋的黑暗深处。"

# game/script.rpy:8007
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_feb1ebc2:

  # f "I slammed the door. I took up his clothes and his mantle."
  f "我重重地关上门。我换上了他的衣服，接过了他的头衔。"

# game/script.rpy:8008
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_6fd9dd8e:

  # f "None can tell the difference. Or perhaps they don't care to, as long as I keep the money flowing."
  f "没人能看出区别。又或者，只要我能继续挥金如土，他们根本懒得去分辨。"

# game/script.rpy:8009
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_67f2ef85:

  # "The sounds of laughter and music echoed from behind the door."
  "欢笑声和音乐声在门后回荡。"

# game/script.rpy:8010
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_ea2d2274:

  # pov "You're living a lie."
  pov "你一直活在谎言里。"

# game/script.rpy:8011
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_dabf44c8:

  # f "No."
  f "不。"

# game/script.rpy:8012
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_2f29271d:

  # f "He was the imposter. History will remember me as the real thing."
  f "他才是那个冒牌货。历史会记住，我才是正牌货。"

# game/script.rpy:8013
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_5858372c:

  # "The toad walked over and swung the closet door shut."
  "蟾蜍走过去，一把带上了壁橱的门。"

# game/script.rpy:8014
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_e510ec64:

  # "A frog sage appeared to inform you both that the vault was ready."
  "一位青蛙贤者出现，通知你们两人金库已经准备就绪。"

# game/script.rpy:8015
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_dccde09a:

  # f "Good. Come with me."
  f "很好。跟我来。"

# game/script.rpy:8018
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_4e42958b:

  # "You both walked down through the manor, past the riotous party, down to the vault in the basement."
  "你们俩穿过庄园，走过喧闹的派对，一路往下，来到地下室的金库。"

# game/script.rpy:8020
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_8999b090:

  # pov "Is this really what you want?"
  pov "这真的是你想要的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8021
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_6d443ff9:

  # f "Of course. This is the life I always desired. This is why I took the deal, all those years ago."
  f "当然。这就是我一直渴望的生活。这也是我多年前接受那笔交易的原因。"

# game/script.rpy:8022
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_c04da5ca:

  # "The toad walked into the cyclopean, hungry mouth of the vault."
  "蟾蜍走进了金库那如独眼巨兽般大张着的饥渴巨口中。"

# game/script.rpy:8025
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_536a1815:

  # f "I'll certainly miss you, my friend, Don't get me wrong. But I'm sure you can understand my decision. Deep within this vault, you see, I will be safe and secure to live out the rest of my days in luxury. These seven impenetrable layers will hold off all harm. Got the idea from a book, y'know, read it somewhere - I have so much time for reading, now, you see, educating myself on the finer things in life, why, if I could only tell you of the tomes I've read now! I believe even the wizened scholars of Algrembria would fall to their knees, seeing themselves as mere infants, babes, ignoramuses in the light of my enlightened wisdom! Such is the nature of the knowledge I now possess."
  f "别误会，我的朋友，我肯定会想念你的。但我相信你能理解我的决定。你看，在这个金库的最深处，我将安全无虞、奢华地度过余生。这七道坚不可摧的防线会挡住一切伤害。从书里学来的主意，你知道的，不知在哪儿读到过——你看，我现在有大把时间读书，陶冶高雅的情操。哎呀，真想向你好好讲讲我现在读过的那些大部头！我相信，即便是阿尔格伦布里亚那些干瘪枯槁的学者，在我这无上智慧的光芒面前，也会羞愧地跪倒在地，发觉自己简直就是些牙牙学语的婴儿、无知的稚童和不学无术之辈！这就是我现在所拥有的知识的本质。"

# game/script.rpy:8028
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_c8cd2935:

  # pov "Why don't you give up the charade? Come with me. You can live in the village. As your true self."
  pov "你为什么不能别再演戏了呢？跟我走。你可以住在村子里。做真实的自己。"

# game/script.rpy:8029
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_1482811d:

  # f "No. I've come too far now."
  f "不。我已经无法回头了。"

# game/script.rpy:8030
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_0f6a5fc2:

  # f "I am Brildebrogue Chippingham, and I will never die."
  f "我是布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉，我永远不会死。"

# game/script.rpy:8031
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_70a4354c:

  # f "The sages will speak of me. The bards will sing poems."
  f "贤者会谈论我。吟游诗人会传唱我。"

# game/script.rpy:8032
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_a8bc62a6:

  # f "The statues outside will stand forever. Historians will speak of me a thousand years hence."
  f "外面的雕像将永远矗立。历史学家在一千年后仍会谈论我。"

# game/script.rpy:8033
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_2eebaba5:

  # f "There will not be a soul on this earth who does not know my name."
  f "这世上不会有任何人不知道我的名字。"

# game/script.rpy:8034
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_93397a63:

  # f "There is nothing to fear. I am already immortal."
  f "没什么好怕的。我已经不朽了。"

# game/script.rpy:8038
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_43fbb874:

  # "You embraced. The cavernous emptiness of his vault loomed before him."
  "你们相拥告别。深穴般空旷的金库在他面前赫然显现。"

# game/script.rpy:8039
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_7e1eb1b3:

  # "He gave you a final wave. Then, he was swallowed up into the darkness."
  "他向你挥了最后一次手。然后，他被黑暗吞噬了。"

# game/script.rpy:8040
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_d53371bd:

  # "The lock sealed. The magic shook the earth, and a golden sigil appeared upon it."
  "锁封死了。魔法让大地为之震动，一个金色的印记出现在锁上。"

# game/script.rpy:8041
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_cb4d82c5:

  # "The barriers were set. The guards of silver, gold, lead, rowan, ash, oak, and the final layer of bone. Seven auras, which lay upon the manor like seven cloaks."
  "屏障设置完毕。银、金、铅、花楸木、白蜡木、橡木构成的防护，以及最后一层骸骨。七重光环，如七件披风般笼罩着庄园。"

# game/script.rpy:8054
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_48c9bdff:

  # "A slow silence seeped up into the house."
  "迟缓的寂静渗入了这栋房子。"

# game/script.rpy:8055
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_6807b8a4:

  # "As you wiped the tears away, you wondered what you were crying about."
  "当你擦去眼泪时，你纳闷自己为什么要哭。"

# game/script.rpy:8056
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_4b8b9f3c:

  # "Where did these tears come from? You strained your memory, but you could not recall."
  "这些眼泪是从哪儿来的？你绞尽脑汁地回忆，却怎么也想不起来。"

# game/script.rpy:8057
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_6a3a0630:

  # "You found yourself in a large, empty manor, for no reason you could remember."
  "你发现自己身处一座空旷的大庄园里，却想不起自己为什么会在这儿。"

# game/script.rpy:8058
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_2b166410:

  # "There was no-one around. There never had been."
  "周围空无一人。从来就没有任何人。"

# game/script.rpy:8059
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_06ad904b:

  # "Ah, well. No need to worry."
  "唉，算了。没什么好担心的。"

# game/script.rpy:8060
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_ca82d50b:

  # "You dried your eyes, and began the walk back to the village."
  "你擦干眼泪，迈步走回村子。"

# game/script.rpy:8061
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_956c1e90:

  # "There is nothing else to tell."
  "没有什么别的可说的了。"

# game/script.rpy:8062
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_4fb1b273:

  # "Have you tired of this story yet?"
  "你听厌这个故事了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8063
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_6b3fef84:

  # "No?"
  "没有？"

# game/script.rpy:8064
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_ef04fd78:

  # "Well, I’ve had enough for this round. If you want any more you can make it up yourself."
  "好吧，这一轮我算是讲够了。如果你还想听，可以自己编一个。"

# game/script.rpy:8066
translate Chinese toadSoloFinale_f911c8f8:

  # "The rat’s tail is off. That’s the end."
  "鼠尾已折断。故事到此完。"

# game/script.rpy:8077
translate Chinese witch2_291b83d9:

  # "You walked up the front steps, and put your hand on the doorknob."
  "你走上门前的台阶，握住门把手。"

# game/script.rpy:8078
translate Chinese witch2_2023ba25:

  # "The door opened up with a shuddering creak."
  "门在一阵震颤的嘎吱声中打开了。"

# game/script.rpy:8080
translate Chinese witch2_bbf6278c:

  # "You and the pig slowly crept forward."
  "你和小猪蹑手蹑脚地往里走。"

# game/script.rpy:8083
translate Chinese witch2_e88f7e75:

  # "Inside the cottage was a wild clutter of books and herbs and plants of all description, growing up the walls and roof."
  "小屋里杂乱无章地堆满了书，各种各样的草药和植物顺着墙壁和屋顶疯长。"

# game/script.rpy:8084
translate Chinese witch2_d4f41332:

  # "The cottage was tiny, but the walls were covered with bookshelves stuffed with old manuscripts and notebooks and thick textbooks on all kinds of plants and animals."
  "小屋很小，但墙边摆满了书架，上面塞满了旧手稿、笔记本，以及各种关于动植物的厚重教科书。"

# game/script.rpy:8086
translate Chinese witch2_b8ea80a2:

  # "The wooden bookshelves were sprouting with herbs and plants of every type."
  "木制书架上长出了各色草药与植物的嫩芽。"

# game/script.rpy:8087
translate Chinese witch2_7244cb3c:

  # "In the corner was a small kitchen with a cauldron, and up above was a small attic crawl-space."
  "角落里是摆着一口大坩埚的小厨房，上方是一个只能爬行进出的低矮小阁楼。"

# game/script.rpy:8088
translate Chinese witch2_5d203b06:

  # "Out of the attic poked a small head with a giant black hat. It looked at you with shock."
  "阁楼里探出个小脑袋，头上顶着顶硕大的黑帽子。她震惊地看着你。"

# game/script.rpy:8089
translate Chinese witch2_5b299973:

  # w "Oh!"
  w "哦！"

# game/script.rpy:8090
translate Chinese witch2_16573296:

  # "It quickly withdrew into the rafters and you heard a crash."
  "她迅速缩回了房梁间，接着你听到了一声撞击。"

# game/script.rpy:8091
translate Chinese witch2_ba70565b:

  # "After a moment, out popped the witch, carrying a thick binder of notes and the remains of a broken pot plant."
  "过了一会儿，女巫钻了出来，手里捧着一本厚厚的活页笔记本和一盆摔碎的盆栽。"

# game/script.rpy:8092
translate Chinese witch2_42946bbc:

  # w "Um... hello!"
  w "呃……你好！"

# game/script.rpy:8093
translate Chinese witch2_e0488cab:

  # "She set about trying to fix the pot plant back together with tape from her belt."
  "她从腰间扯下胶带，试着把盆栽拼凑回去。"

# game/script.rpy:8094
translate Chinese witch2_ef257fbe:

  # "Coiling, midnight blue smoke slowly rose out from under her hat, fogging up the whole upper half of the cottage."
  "午夜蓝的烟雾从她帽沿下缓缓升腾，让小屋的上半部分一片雾气缭绕。"

# game/script.rpy:8095
translate Chinese witch2_6f3ee277:

  # w "I'm sorry, you startled me!"
  w "抱歉，你吓到我了！"

# game/script.rpy:8096
translate Chinese witch2_2424d923:

  # w "I don't get much visitors here."
  w "我这儿平时没什么访客。"

# game/script.rpy:8097
translate Chinese witch2_f85128cd:

  # w "Or... any visitors, I guess."
  w "或者说……没有任何访客吧。"

# game/script.rpy:8098
translate Chinese witch2_f1b60df0:

  # w "Please, h-have a seat! Can I get you some tea?"
  w "请，请——请坐！需要我给你泡点茶吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8099
translate Chinese witch2_3b0b3dfa:

  # w "I have so much tea and I never get a chance to drink most of it because..."
  w "我有很多茶，大部分我都没机会喝，因为……"

# game/script.rpy:8100
translate Chinese witch2_36b3c726:

  # "Her expression became vague and confused."
  "她的表情变得有些茫然和困惑。"

# game/script.rpy:8102
translate Chinese witch2_2877d726:

  # w "Because, uh... why do I..."
  w "因为，呃……为什么我……"

# game/script.rpy:8103
translate Chinese witch2_d0143bf0:

  # w "Oh, the caffeine, that's right. The caffeine makes me too wired and I can't get to sleep at night, so I have to stick to all the herbal stuff."
  w "哦，咖啡因，没错。咖啡因会让我太兴奋，晚上睡不着，所以我只能喝点花草茶。"

# game/script.rpy:8104
translate Chinese witch2_a0741568:

  # w "But you don't have to take the black tea if you don't want to, I have all kinds, it's fine. Or you don't have to have any kind of tea at all, that's totally fine too, I don't want to be out here stuffing tea down your mouth."
  w "但如果你不想喝红茶也不勉强，我什么茶都有，没关系的。或者你什么茶都不喝也行，绝对没问题，我可不想在这里硬灌你喝。"

# game/script.rpy:8105
translate Chinese witch2_cc0ee7ab:

  # w "I-It's just been so long since I had company for tea, so I haven't had a chance to get it out."
  w "只——只是我好久没碰到能一起喝茶的了，所以一直没机会拿出来。"

# game/script.rpy:8106
translate Chinese witch2_f7e7e8b0:

  # w "Not that I like company at all, obviously."
  w "当然，这可不是说我喜欢有人陪。"

# game/script.rpy:8107
translate Chinese witch2_bc4577ee:

  # w "I spurn it!"
  w "我鄙视陪伴！"

# game/script.rpy:8108
translate Chinese witch2_e92c143f:

  # w "I need no-one, and I want no-one."
  w "我不需要任何人，我也不想要任何人。"

# game/script.rpy:8110
translate Chinese witch2_6621615a:

  # "She patted the pig absently. It accepted the gesture with dignity."
  "她心不在焉地拍了拍小猪。小猪端着架子，坦然接受了。"

# game/script.rpy:8112
translate Chinese witch2_f365f2dd:

  # w "We haven't met before, have we?"
  w "我们以前没见过面吧？"

# game/script.rpy:8114
translate Chinese witch2_49062ec6:

  # w "Hold on... we've met before, haven't we?"
  w "等等……我们以前见过，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:8115
translate Chinese witch2_c8deb22b:

  # "She took out her binder of notes and began to leaf through it."
  "她拿出笔记活页夹，开始翻阅。"

# game/script.rpy:8121
translate Chinese witchConvo1_2b04cc09:

  # w "I-I don't think I have any notes on you?" nointeract
  w "我、我的笔记里好像没写你的事？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:8123
translate Chinese witchConvo1_c32c4440:

  # w "Great!"
  w "太棒了！"

# game/script.rpy:8124
translate Chinese witchConvo1_f5522006:

  # "The witch leapt up and started rifling through a towering triangular cupboard with dozens of tiny compartments hanging open."
  "女巫跳了起来，在一个高耸的三角形柜子里一通翻找，柜子上几十个小隔间的门都耷拉敞开着。"

# game/script.rpy:8125
translate Chinese witchConvo1_e7bf9daa:

  # w "Ok, um..."
  w "好了，呃……"

# game/script.rpy:8127
translate Chinese witchConvo1_41243d43:

  # "She slowed down and looked into one of the drawers blankly."
  "她慢了下来，茫然地看着其中一个抽屉。"

# game/script.rpy:8128
translate Chinese witchConvo1_99657ed6:

  # w "What was I..."
  w "我刚才要干什么来着……"

# game/script.rpy:8129
translate Chinese witchConvo1_6fcd37ab:

  # pov "The tea?"
  pov "茶？"

# game/script.rpy:8130
translate Chinese witchConvo1_afb0289d:

  # w "Oh! Of course!"
  w "哦！对！"

# game/script.rpy:8131
translate Chinese witchConvo1_95ee3f27:

  # w "Ok, so I have some fancy sour cherry tea, English breakfast, Australian breakfast if you're feeling patriotic, green tea, lemon and ginger, and a pack of this stuff which, I don't know what it is to be honest, it's all in Japanese and I haven't tried it yet."
  w "好了，我这有点高档的酸樱桃茶、英式早餐茶，如果你比较爱国的话还有澳式早餐茶，有绿茶、柠檬生姜茶，还有一包这玩意儿——老实说我也不知道是什么，上面全是日文，我还没试过呢。"

# game/script.rpy:8137
translate Chinese witchConvo1_894a6c25:

  # w "What do you think?" nointeract
  w "你想喝哪个？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:8139
translate Chinese witchConvo1_6ce35f03:

  # w "Nice! Coming right up."
  w "好嘞！马上就来。"

# game/script.rpy:8143
translate Chinese witchConvo1_6ce35f03_1:

  # w "Nice! Coming right up."
  w "好嘞！马上就来。"

# game/script.rpy:8145
translate Chinese witchConvo1_6ce35f03_2:

  # w "Nice! Coming right up."
  w "好嘞！马上就来。"

# game/script.rpy:8153
translate Chinese witchConvo1_6ce35f03_3:

  # w "Nice! Coming right up."
  w "好嘞！马上就来。"

# game/script.rpy:8157
translate Chinese witchConvo1_6ce35f03_4:

  # w "Nice! Coming right up."
  w "好嘞！马上就来。"

# game/script.rpy:8159
translate Chinese witchConvo1_6ce35f03_5:

  # w "Nice! Coming right up."
  w "好嘞！马上就来。"

# game/script.rpy:8160
translate Chinese witchConvo1_08b24140:

  # "She turned on the stove and set a tiny kettle down on it. Then she looked around the clutter until she found two mugs tipped over on the floor, cleaned them out in the sink, and put the tea-bags in them."
  "她打开炉子，放上一个小水壶。然后在杂物堆里找了找，直到在地板上发现了两个倒扣着的杯子。她在水槽里涮了涮，把茶包扔了进去。"

# game/script.rpy:8161
translate Chinese witchConvo1_227f07e4:

  # w "Ready to go, just need the water to boil."
  w "准备就绪，只等水烧开。"

# game/script.rpy:8162
translate Chinese witchConvo1_fab6d7f7:

  # w "Sit, sit!"
  w "坐，坐！"

# game/script.rpy:8163
translate Chinese witchConvo1_6341be25:

  # "You nestled down into one of the comfy old chairs by the stove, and she took the other."
  "你窝进炉边一把舒适的旧椅子里，她坐了另一把。"

# game/script.rpy:8167
translate Chinese witchConvo1_13e97e60:

  # w "Oh, good."
  w "哦，太好了。"

# game/script.rpy:8168
translate Chinese witchConvo1_79b2d3b1:

  # w "It gets so awkward when someone just comes up and starts talking to me out of the blue, and I'm just like \"Mmhmm, yep,\" just nodding and trying to read through my notes when they aren't looking to see who they are, and they always think it's so rude but I'm like, hey, who just walked up and started talking to me without giving me time to read my notes first? THAT's what's really rude here."
  w "每次有人突然蹦出来跟我搭话我都尴尬得要死，我就只能“嗯嗯对”地一边点头一边趁他们不注意拼命翻笔记想搞清楚他们是谁。他们总觉得我这样很没礼貌，可我心里想的是，喂，是谁不给我看笔记的时间就跑来跟我搭话的？这才是真正的没礼貌好吗。"

# game/script.rpy:8172
translate Chinese witchConvo1_0f4aefb7:

  # w "Oh... tonight?"
  w "哦……今晚？"

# game/script.rpy:8173
translate Chinese witchConvo1_26648941:

  # "An expression of panic came over her face. She leafed back and forth through her notes."
  "她脸上闪过一丝恐慌。她来回翻阅着笔记。"

# game/script.rpy:8174
translate Chinese witchConvo1_89f74de8:

  # w "I'm so sorry, this is so embarrassing, I'm... I'm afraid I don't quite remember."
  w "真的很抱歉，太尴尬了，我……我恐怕不太记得了。"

# game/script.rpy:8175
translate Chinese witchConvo1_7dcba6c6:

  # w "I mustn't have written it down. It's nothing to do with you, I'm just... if I don't write it down it goes straight out of my head. I'm sorry."
  w "我肯定忘了记下来。不是你的问题，我只是……如果我不写下来，它就会从我脑子里溜走。对不起。"

# game/script.rpy:8181
translate Chinese witchConvo1_054b0034:

  # pov "I'm hoping you can help me with a problem. My Godfather is the Lord, and He has sworn to take me away at midnight tonight."
  pov "我希望你能帮我解决一个问题。我的教父是上帝，他发誓今晚午夜要带我走。"

# game/script.rpy:8182
translate Chinese witchConvo1_bb3fcd99:

  # w "That's wild."
  w "真离谱。"

# game/script.rpy:8183
translate Chinese witchConvo1_430c30f7:

  # w "I mean, I'm a witch, yeah, but I'm not exactly all powerful over here, I'm not sure what you want me to do about that?"
  w "我的意思是，对，我是个女巫，但我也不是无所不能的啊，我不太清楚你希望我能对这件事做点什么？"

# game/script.rpy:8184
translate Chinese witchConvo1_b7057d74:

  # w "But yeah nah, maybe I could help you out. Let me take a look through my books, I'll see what I can come up with."
  w "不过嘛……说不定我真能帮上忙。让我翻翻书，看看能想出什么好办法。"

# game/script.rpy:8185
translate Chinese witchConvo1_cb63215d:

  # "And she began rifling through the stack of books lying randomly around the floor."
  "说着，她开始在散落一地的书堆里翻找起来。"

# game/script.rpy:8187
translate Chinese witchConvo1_6d6d2916:

  # pov "I'm hoping you can help me with a problem. My Godfather is the Devil, and He has sworn to take me away at midnight tonight."
  pov "我希望你能帮我解决一个问题。我的教父是魔鬼，他发誓今晚午夜要带我走。"

# game/script.rpy:8188
translate Chinese witchConvo1_92d228b7:

  # w "Oh no!"
  w "哦，天哪！"

# game/script.rpy:8189
translate Chinese witchConvo1_49d40e5e:

  # w "Well, I..."
  w "好吧，我……"

# game/script.rpy:8190
translate Chinese witchConvo1_3df363bc:

  # w "To be honest I do know a bit about your red friend, I have had some uh, {i}dealings{/i} with Him, I guess you could say. It wasn't my choice though, I don't want you to think I'm one of those wild women of the woods who dance around naked and worship the Devil and all that kind of thing, know what I mean? I admire them but I tried it once or twice and it gets really chilly, not recommended."
  w "老实说，我确实对你那位红通通的朋友有一点了解。怎么说，我和他也算是有过一些，呃，{i}交集{/i} 吧。不过那不是我自愿的，我可不想让你觉得我是森林里那种裸体跳舞、崇拜魔鬼之类的野女巫，你懂我意思吧？我倒是挺佩服她们的，但我试过一两次，真的太冷了，不推荐。"

# game/script.rpy:8191
translate Chinese witchConvo1_87936e9a:

  # w "But yeah, nah, maybe I could help you out. Let me take a look through my books, I'll see what I can come up with."
  w "不过嘛……说不定我真能帮上忙。让我翻翻书，看看能想出什么好办法。"

# game/script.rpy:8192
translate Chinese witchConvo1_cb63215d_1:

  # "And she began rifling through the stack of books lying randomly around the floor."
  "说着，她开始在散落一地的书堆里翻找起来。"

# game/script.rpy:8194
translate Chinese witchConvo1_4bc22d46:

  # pov "I'm hoping you can help me with a problem. My godmother is Death, and She has sworn to take me away."
  pov "我希望你能帮我解决一个问题。我的教母是死神，她发誓要带我走。"

# game/script.rpy:8195
translate Chinese witchConvo1_bb3fcd99_1:

  # w "That's wild."
  w "真离谱。"

# game/script.rpy:8196
translate Chinese witchConvo1_430c30f7_1:

  # w "I mean, I'm a witch, yeah, but I'm not exactly all powerful over here, I'm not sure what you want me to do about that?"
  w "我的意思是，对，我是个女巫，但我也不是无所不能的啊，我不太清楚你希望我能对这件事做点什么？"

# game/script.rpy:8197
translate Chinese witchConvo1_43769695:

  # w "But yeah nah, maybe I could help you out with that problem. Let me take a look through my books, I'll see what I can come up with."
  w "不过话虽如此，也许我能帮你解决这个问题。让我翻翻我的书，看看能想出什么好办法。"

# game/script.rpy:8198
translate Chinese witchConvo1_cb63215d_2:

  # "And she began rifling through the stack of books lying randomly around the floor."
  "说着，她开始在散落一地的书堆里翻找起来。"

# game/script.rpy:8203
translate Chinese witchConvo1_723de72c:

  # pov "I came to ask why you didn't come to the festival tonight. Everyone's a bit worried."
  pov "我来是想问问你今晚为什么没去参加祭典。大家都有点担心。"

# game/script.rpy:8204
translate Chinese witchConvo1_49ab3d9e:

  # w "The what?"
  w "什么？"

# game/script.rpy:8206
translate Chinese witchConvo1_2f2500f5:

  # "She looked at you with unfocused eyes, then sat bolt upright in her chair."
  "她双眼涣散地望着你，然后猛地在椅子上坐直了身子。"

# game/script.rpy:8208
translate Chinese witchConvo1_414cf3a3:

  # "She looked at you with unfocused eyes, then jerked bolt upright."
  "她双眼涣散地望着你，然后猛地挺直了身板。"

# game/script.rpy:8209
translate Chinese witchConvo1_9b8e11de:

  # w "That was TONIGHT?"
  w "那是今晚？"

# game/script.rpy:8211
translate Chinese witchConvo1_038ba9de:

  # "She collapsed in the chair in despair, and you saw tears of frustration in her eyes."
  "她绝望地瘫倒在椅子上，你看到她眼里闪烁着沮丧的泪水。"

# game/script.rpy:8213
translate Chinese witchConvo1_3662d3f0:

  # "She fell back in despair, and you saw tears of frustration in her eyes."
  "她绝望地向后倒去，你看到她眼里闪烁着沮丧的泪水。"

# game/script.rpy:8214
translate Chinese witchConvo1_b2499f80:

  # w "Not again. I really wanted to go this year. I don't know what happened, I swear I..."
  w "又来。我今年真的很想去的。我不知道发生了什么，我发誓我……"

# game/script.rpy:8215
translate Chinese witchConvo1_e74d5da8:

  # "She rustled through her notes."
  "她哗啦啦地翻着笔记。"

# game/script.rpy:8216
translate Chinese witchConvo1_9f76da52:

  # w "Where is it... Where is it..."
  w "在哪儿呢……在哪儿呢……"

# game/script.rpy:8217
translate Chinese witchConvo1_38d5ca54:

  # w "Aha!"
  w "啊哈！"

# game/script.rpy:8218
translate Chinese witchConvo1_761dff40:

  # "She darted under the table and came out with a sticky note saying {b}{i}\"FESTIVAL!!!!!!\"{/i}{/b} underlined three times."
  "她钻到桌子底下，出来时手里攥着一张便利贴，上面写着{b}{i}“祭典！！！！！”{/i}{/b}，下面还画了三道下划线。"

# game/script.rpy:8219
translate Chinese witchConvo1_27d65815:

  # w "It must have fallen out. Oh my God, I'm so sorry. It's just-"
  w "肯定是掉出来了。哦我的天哪，真的很抱歉。只是——"

# game/script.rpy:8220
translate Chinese witchConvo1_da67fe78:

  # "She waved helplessly at the blue smoke leaking out of her hat and pooling under the cottage roof."
  "她无奈地挥手驱赶着那些蓝烟，烟雾从她帽子里漏出，盘旋淤积在小屋的屋顶下。"

# game/script.rpy:8221
translate Chinese witchConvo1_3af44485:

  # w "It all leaks out. I can't keep it in."
  w "全漏光了。我存不住。"

# game/script.rpy:8227
translate Chinese witchConvo1_130b30a7:

  # pov "The place is really lovely."
  pov "这地方真的很可爱。"

# game/script.rpy:8228
translate Chinese witchConvo1_40a95be6:

  # w "What place?"
  w "什么地方？"

# game/script.rpy:8229
translate Chinese witchConvo1_6a79f5a4:

  # "She looked around blearily."
  "她眼神迷离地环顾四周。"

# game/script.rpy:8230
translate Chinese witchConvo1_ca6ed3df:

  # w "Oh! Yeah. Yeah, I guess."
  w "哦！是啊。我想是的吧。"

# game/script.rpy:8231
translate Chinese witchConvo1_669cb708:

  # w "It's kind of a hole, to be honest."
  w "老实说，这儿简直是个狗窝。"

# game/script.rpy:8232
translate Chinese witchConvo1_d7058507:

  # w "It's really gotten away from me, like, I kind of like the wild look, and I really love all the herbs and things growing along the outside, it adds a lot to the {i}mystique{/i} I guess, but realistically it looks that way because I literally can't get it under control, I try pretty hard but it always seems to just slip away from me, it's like... trying to hold on to fog or something, you know what I mean, right?"
  w "它确实长得太野了，怎么说呢，我确实挺喜欢这种狂野的风格的，而且我非常喜欢外面长满草药什么的，我觉得这增加了很多{i}神秘感{/i}。但说实话，它长成这样完全是因为我管不住它，我已经很努力了，但它总是能从我手里溜走，就像……就像在徒手抓雾什么的，你懂我意思吧？"

# game/script.rpy:8233
translate Chinese witchConvo1_cb1fff5d:

  # w "But yeah, it's nice."
  w "不过不管怎么说，还是挺好的。"

# game/script.rpy:8235
translate Chinese witchConvo1_efc5fd7d:

  # "At that moment, the door smashed open and the toad burst in."
  "就在这时，门被砸开了，蟾蜍冲了进来。"

# game/script.rpy:8236
translate Chinese witchConvo1_652578cd:

  # "He was shrieking a wild war cry, waving a sword cane, and clearly terrified out of his mind."
  "他怪叫着不成调的战吼，挥舞着一根杖剑，显然已经吓得魂不附体。"

# game/script.rpy:8237
translate Chinese witchConvo1_0e2d3779:

  # "The witch yelped and ducked back as he jabbed at her."
  "当他朝女巫刺去时，她尖叫了一声往后躲去。"

# game/script.rpy:8238
translate Chinese witchConvo1_800898bc:

  # f "Let my friend go, you wicked Curse-gobbler!"
  f "放开我的朋友，你这个邪恶的吞咒者！"

# game/script.rpy:8240
translate Chinese witchConvo1_2a75e939:

  # "The witch grabbed a crooked dagger, still gleaming with wolfsbane from her potion work earlier, and parried his thrust."
  "女巫抓起一把弯曲的匕首招架住了他的突刺，刃上还闪烁着刚才熬制魔药残留的乌头草汁液的微光。"

# game/script.rpy:8241
translate Chinese witchConvo1_6c3fcd8e:

  # w "Do I know you?!"
  w "我认识你吗？！"

# game/script.rpy:8242
translate Chinese witchConvo1_13080986:

  # "They began to fight back and forth, crashing around the tiny cottage, and as they did the bookshelves rocked and the chairs went clattering away and the potions began to fall from the walls, exploding open in bursts of magical smoke and light."
  "他们开始你来我往地搏斗起来，在这狭小的小屋里横冲直撞。伴随着他们的打斗，书架摇晃，椅子被撞得哐当作响，魔药开始从墙上掉落，炸开一团团魔法烟雾和光芒。"

# game/script.rpy:8243
translate Chinese witchConvo1_4911c7e6:

  # "Green and blue and black and ultraviolet liquid and smoke burst out all around you."
  "绿色、蓝色、黑色以及荧光紫色的液体和烟雾在你周围爆开。"

# game/script.rpy:8244
translate Chinese witchConvo1_67919ed7:

  # w "My house!"
  w "我的房子！"

# game/script.rpy:8245
translate Chinese witchConvo1_6a802a17:

  # "The chairs were enveloped by smoke and turned into a pair of chickens, then mulberry bushes, then a pile of prunes that went clattering across the kitchen."
  "椅子被烟雾笼罩，变成了一对鸡，然后变成了桑树丛，最后变成了一堆西梅，在厨房里叮铃哐啷地乱滚。"

# game/script.rpy:8247
translate Chinese witchConvo1_0b830a71:

  # "The table warped, went soggy, and splashed across the floor as a cold, swirling purple liquid."
  "桌子扭曲、变软，化作一滩冰冷、打着旋的紫色液体溅落一地。"

# game/script.rpy:8249
translate Chinese witchConvo1_c3dd5e94:

  # "The kitchen and the walls started to twist and turn and sprout with life, and all the books and furniture turned into bats and cats and chittering cicadas that ran and scratched and flew all through the house."
  "厨房和墙壁开始扭曲变形，甚至长出了活物，所有的书和家具都变成了蝙蝠、猫和唧唧叫的蝉，在整个房子里乱跑、乱抓、乱飞。"

# game/script.rpy:8251
translate Chinese witchConvo1_4e08c59d:

  # "The fire in the kitchen flared up wildly and began to spew flowers in all directions."
  "厨房里的火狂乱地腾起，开始向四面八方喷射鲜花。"

# game/script.rpy:8253
translate Chinese witchConvo1_a928e011:

  # "The pig tried to stop the melee but was tossed aside by a rogue bromeliad."
  "小猪试图阻止这场混战，却被一株发狂的凤梨给甩到了一边。"

# game/script.rpy:8267
translate Chinese witchFinale_0f3b814c:

  # "You dived at the witch and pushed her out of the way of the stabbing sword cane."
  "你扑向女巫，把她推开，躲过了那把刺来的杖剑。"

# game/script.rpy:8269
translate Chinese witchFinale_7b5ada82:

  # "You, her and the pig went tumbling across the floor and into the fire. When you fell into the fireplace, you fell straight through the flames and down to Hell."
  "你、她和小猪在地板上滚作一团，跌进壁炉的火堆中。然而，你们没有被烧伤，而是穿过火焰，直坠地狱。"

# game/script.rpy:8272
translate Chinese witchFinale_caadac71:

  # "You both went tumbling across the floor and into the fire. When you fell into the fireplace, you fell straight through the flames and down to Hell."
  "你们俩在地板上翻滚，跌入了火中。当你们掉进壁炉时，你们穿过火焰，直坠地狱。"

# game/script.rpy:8276
translate Chinese witchFinale_c3092583:

  # "Hell was dark and sooty, and the Devil was not home."
  "地狱里一片漆黑，满是煤灰，而魔鬼不在家。"

# game/script.rpy:8278
translate Chinese witchFinale_a4474ff6:

  # "The pig was looked around in stark terror."
  "小猪极度惊恐地环顾四周。"

# game/script.rpy:8279
translate Chinese witchFinale_b194cfc6:

  # p1 "Listen to me, comrade. I can't be here. I can't go back to Hell again."
  p1 "听我说，伙计。我不能待在这儿。我不能再回地狱了。"

# game/script.rpy:8280
translate Chinese witchFinale_42b75886:

  # p1 "I have... enemies."
  p1 "我在这儿……有仇家。"

# game/script.rpy:8281
translate Chinese witchFinale_92ccf4df:

  # w "The pig is right. We have to get out. I've spent too many years here already."
  w "小猪说得对。我们得离开这儿。我已经在这里耗了太多岁月了。"

# game/script.rpy:8282
translate Chinese witchFinale_7d01524c:

  # pov "Years? What do you mean?"
  pov "岁月？你什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:8283
translate Chinese witchFinale_2b244a11:

  # "The witch sighed as you all picked yourself up from the floor, battered and bruised."
  "女巫叹了口气。此时你们正跌跌撞撞地从地上爬起，摔得鼻青脸肿。"

# game/script.rpy:8286
translate Chinese witchFinale_6e9659f2:

  # w "Not again!"
  w "怎么又来！"

# game/script.rpy:8287
translate Chinese witchFinale_c5ec891e:

  # pov "...What do you mean, not again?"
  pov "……你说的“怎么又来”是什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:8288
translate Chinese witchFinale_61cc3382:

  # "The witch sighed as you both picked yourself up from the floor, battered and bruised."
  "当你们俩跌跌撞撞地从地板上爬起来，已经遍体鳞伤时，女巫叹了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:8297
translate Chinese hellStory_cdae7fa8:

  # w "The truth is, I have served the Devil all this time, and wrought his wicked works upon the world - though it pleased me none to do so." nointeract
  w "事实是，我一直都在侍奉魔鬼，替他在人间干尽了险恶的勾当——尽管我一点也不喜欢这么做。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:8301
translate Chinese hellStory_c217b1d1:

  # "You all sat down on a lump of brimstone together, and she began to tell you her tale."
  "你们一起坐在一块硫磺石上，她开始给你们讲她的故事。"

# game/script.rpy:8303
translate Chinese hellStory_c217b1d1_1:

  # "You all sat down on a lump of brimstone together, and she began to tell you her tale."
  "你们一起坐在一块硫磺石上，她开始给你们讲她的故事。"

# game/script.rpy:8304
translate Chinese hellStory_e7c96a1c:

  # w "Once, I was the princess of a vast kingdom very far from here, where we ruled over sapphire seas and emerald skies."
  w "曾经，我是远方一个辽阔王国的公主，在那里，我们统治着蓝宝石般的汪洋和祖母绿般的穹苍。"

# game/script.rpy:8305
translate Chinese hellStory_75a84553:

  # w "From a young age I had a terrible hunger for knowledge, and soon I had devoured every book in the kingdom."
  w "我从小就对知识有着极其强烈的渴望，很快，我就把王国里所有的书都啃得一干二净。"

# game/script.rpy:8306
translate Chinese hellStory_06e076fd:

  # w "Librarians everywhere grew to fear me, and they called me The Girl Who Knew Everything."
  w "各地的图书管理员都渐渐开始惧怕我，他们叫我“无所不知的女孩”。"

# game/script.rpy:8307
translate Chinese hellStory_cdc591c9:

  # w "Soon the Great Adversary learned of my wisdom and pride, and grew jealous."
  w "很快，大敌得知了我的智慧与骄傲，心生嫉妒。"

# game/script.rpy:8309
translate Chinese hellStory_c794161e:

  # w "\"I'll teach her a thing or two,\" he said, and whipped himself to my kingdom on the spot."
  w "“我要给她点颜色看看，”他说道，然后立刻现身在我的王国里。"

# game/script.rpy:8310
translate Chinese hellStory_1a438a92:

  # mir "Oh Princess! I have need of your wisdom!"
  mir "哦，公主！我需要您的智慧！"

# game/script.rpy:8311
translate Chinese hellStory_57231c2c:

  # mir "If you are able to answer 3 riddles of mine, I will grant you a boon. But if you cannot answer, you must come serve me in hell."
  mir "如果您能答出我的三个谜语，我就满足您一个愿望。但如果您答不出来，您就必须去地狱侍奉我。"

# game/script.rpy:8312
translate Chinese hellStory_84135b19:

  # w "\"I accept!\" I said, because there wasn't a single riddle in the world I had not eaten whole."
  w "“我接受！”我说，因为这个世界上还没有我吃不透的谜语。"

# game/script.rpy:8313
translate Chinese hellStory_426ef410:

  # mir "Poke your fingers in my eyes and I will open wide my jaws. Linen cloth, quills, or paper, my greedy lust devours them all. What am I?"
  mir "​两指戳进我眼眶，大嘴张开露锋芒。麻布羽毛和纸张，贪婪欲望全吞光。我是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:8319
translate Chinese hellStory_26e00970:

  # mir "Confound it, that's right."
  mir "该死，答对了。"

# game/script.rpy:8320
translate Chinese hellStory_9cd3f87c:

  # w "The Devil ground his teeth and stomped his feet and fled from the tower."
  w "魔鬼咬牙切齿、直跺脚，逃出了塔楼。"

# game/script.rpy:8321
translate Chinese hellStory_ffaac630:

  # w "He spent all night and all day thinking of a riddle to vex me, and on the 2nd night he came to my tower again, rubbing his long fingers together."
  w "他日思夜想，想找个谜语来刁难我，到了第二天晚上，他搓着长长的手指，又来到了我的塔楼。"

# game/script.rpy:8327
translate Chinese riddle2_fdbb13ab:

  # mir "I have need of your wisdom again, O Princess."
  mir "我再次需要您的智慧，公主殿下。"

# game/script.rpy:8328
translate Chinese riddle2_4aff00a5:

  # mir "You make me, but I hold you in my grasp. I terrify without limit, but disappear before dawn. What am I?"
  mir "你造就了我，但我却将你禁锢。我带来无尽的恐惧，却在黎明前消失。我是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:8333
translate Chinese riddle2_aa78c4b6:

  # mir "Correct again!"
  mir "又答对了！"

# game/script.rpy:8334
translate Chinese riddle2_ca6377ca:

  # w "The Devil tore off his hat and threw it upon the ground and stomped on it, and tore at his clothes with anger, and fled from the tower again."
  w "魔鬼扯下帽子，把它摔在地上狠狠地踩，又愤怒地撕扯自己的衣服，再次逃出了塔楼。"

# game/script.rpy:8335
translate Chinese riddle2_6eafddf0:

  # mir "This girl is too clever by half. But I have just the thing that'll show her."
  mir "这丫头聪明过头了。不过我有法子治她。"

# game/script.rpy:8336
translate Chinese riddle2_4fe38f74:

  # w "That night as I slept he crawled into my bedroom through the chimney, and dropped the seed of a rose bush in my ear."
  w "那天晚上，趁我熟睡时，他从烟囱爬进我的卧室，在我耳朵里丢下了一颗玫瑰花丛的种子。"

# game/script.rpy:8337
translate Chinese riddle2_49c84f6b:

  # w "The seed quickly grew and grew inside my skull, until it cracked my head clean open."
  w "种子在我的头骨里飞速生长，直到把我的脑袋撑裂。"

# game/script.rpy:8338
translate Chinese riddle2_4057a7f5:

  # w "As I awoke I saw there were roses in my ears and cracks in my crown. But worse still, my thoughts began to leak out of my head in dark heavy smoke."
  w "我醒来时，发现自己耳廓长着玫瑰，头冠布满裂痕。但更糟的是，我的思想开始化作浓重的黑烟从脑袋里泄漏出去。"

# game/script.rpy:8339
translate Chinese riddle2_520b7253:

  # w "My servants came to me and I could not say their names."
  w "仆人们来到我面前，我却叫不出他们的名字。"

# game/script.rpy:8340
translate Chinese riddle2_60b21fab:

  # w "I looked at the clothes in the dresser, and I could not say which ones were mine."
  w "我看着衣柜里的衣服，却分不清哪些是我的。"

# game/script.rpy:8341
translate Chinese riddle2_a6d4b1eb:

  # w "I walked down through the tower, and where before I could have named each leaf and bush and plant, I could not for the life of me remember them now."
  w "我走下塔楼，以前我能叫出每一片叶子、每一丛灌木、每一株植物的名字，现在却死活也想不起来了。"

# game/script.rpy:8342
translate Chinese riddle2_8942acf0:

  # w "And all the while the dark smoke slowly leaked out of my head, no matter how I tried to stop it."
  w "无论我怎么试图阻止，黑烟一直在不停地从我脑袋里往外漏。"

# game/script.rpy:8343
translate Chinese riddle2_1f078715:

  # w "And so on the third night the Devil came again with a triumphant smile, and asked his third and final riddle."
  w "于是在第三个晚上，魔鬼带着胜利的微笑再次到来，问出了他第三个也是最后一个谜语。"

# game/script.rpy:8349
translate Chinese riddle3_f3a56294:

  # mir "What gets broken when it's not kept?"
  mir "什么东西如果不去守，就会破？"

# game/script.rpy:8353
translate Chinese riddle3_5283e155:

  # w "I felt the answer, right there. I sweated and strained to remember it."
  w "我感觉答案就在嘴边。我满头大汗，拼命想把它想起来。"

# game/script.rpy:8354
translate Chinese riddle3_57720715:

  # w "But no matter how I tried to hold it, the truth slipped from my hands."
  w "但无论我怎么试图抓住它，真相还是从我手中溜走了。"

# game/script.rpy:8355
translate Chinese riddle3_7134f6e8:

  # w "\"I... do not know,\" I said."
  w "“我……不知道，”我说。"

# game/script.rpy:8356
translate Chinese riddle3_0b9c006c:

  # mir "A promise!"
  mir "承诺！"

# game/script.rpy:8357
translate Chinese riddle3_4d98d9c9:

  # w "And the Devil cried out with glee, and he seized me at once and leapt into the fireplace and dragged me straight to hell."
  w "魔鬼兴奋地大叫起来，他一把抓住我，跳进壁炉，直接把我拖进了地狱。"

# game/script.rpy:8358
translate Chinese riddle3_849a5e69:

  # w "And so it was that I came to serve the Devil for the rest of my days."
  w "就这样，我沦落到要在余生里侍奉魔鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:8360
translate Chinese riddle3_a1c63be9:

  # "You and the pig shook your heads and wept to hear such a sorry tale, and all around you the tears hit the floor and turned into terrible shrieking imps that swarmed around you, poking your soft legs and cackling cruelly at your misfortune."
  "你和小猪听了这凄惨的故事，都摇着头落泪了。泪水滴在地板上，变成了可怕的尖叫小鬼，它们蜂拥在你们周围，戳着你们毫无防备的腿，残忍地嘲笑着你们的不幸。"

# game/script.rpy:8362
translate Chinese riddle3_d2383f58:

  # "You shook your head and wept to hear such a sorry tale, and all around you the tears hit the floor and turned into terrible shrieking imps that swarmed around the both of you, poking your soft legs and cackling cruelly at your misfortune."
  "你听了这凄惨的故事，摇着头落泪了。泪水滴在地板上，变成了可怕的尖叫小鬼，它们蜂拥在你们俩周围，戳着你们柔软的腿，残忍地嘲笑着你们的不幸。"

# game/script.rpy:8363
translate Chinese riddle3_4b9ff99e:

  # "Such is life in Hell."
  "地狱里的生活就是如此。"

# game/script.rpy:8367
translate Chinese riddle3_e81063ee:

  # p1 "Very well, [povname]. I suppose you have earned the right to know my true nature. I must warn you, however, that this is a tale of such base depravity that it will turn your hair white to hear it."
  p1 "很好，[povname]。我想你已经赢得了知晓我真实身份的权利。但我必须警告你，这是一个极其卑劣堕落的故事，足以吓得你白了头。"

# game/script.rpy:8368
translate Chinese riddle3_753880ed:

  # p1 "You see, long ago, I loved to do nothing but gamble. I gambled away all my money and earthly possessions, until I was cast out of every human city on earth and forced to live in a house of straw."
  p1 "你看，很久以前，我除了赌博什么都不爱。我输光了所有的钱和身外之物，直到我被世上所有的人类城市驱逐，被迫住在一间茅草屋里。"

# game/script.rpy:8369
translate Chinese riddle3_272c9b9c:

  # p1 "Naturally, I soon gambled my straw house away. On the day before my creditors were due to take it from me, the Lord arrived at my door."
  p1 "理所当然的，我很快就把我的茅草屋也输掉了。就在债主们来收房的前一天，上帝来到了我门前。"

# game/script.rpy:8370
translate Chinese riddle3_daf7e45f:

  # miw "Please, my child. I have travelled far, and I have far to go yet. Provide me lodging for the night."
  miw "求求你，我的孩子。我长途跋涉，而且还有很长的路要走。请让我借宿一晚吧。"

# game/script.rpy:8371
translate Chinese riddle3_d9609d56:

  # p1 "\"You may stay under my straw,\" I told Him, \"but I warn you - I haven't a cent to my name.\""
  p1 "“你可以在我的茅草屋里凑合一下，”我告诉他，“但我警告你——我身上一分钱也没有。”"

# game/script.rpy:8372
translate Chinese riddle3_75cff618:

  # miw "That is of no concern. Take these three coins, and buy us some bread for the night."
  miw "那不碍事。拿着这三枚硬币，去给我们买点面包当晚饭。"

# game/script.rpy:8373
translate Chinese riddle3_23ec21f8:

  # p1 "As you can imagine, I immediately gambled all the money away."
  p1 "你可以想象，我立刻就把这些钱全赌输了。"

# game/script.rpy:8374
translate Chinese riddle3_1c8859df:

  # p1 "I pretended to have dropped the coins in a puddle, but the Lord immediately saw through my clever ruse."
  p1 "我假装把硬币掉进水坑里了，但上帝立刻看穿了我这自作聪明的诡计。"

# game/script.rpy:8375
translate Chinese riddle3_5e5a3835:

  # miw "Do not test my forgiveness, pig. Here are another three coins. If you do not buy the bread this time, your immortal soul will be forfeit."
  miw "不要试探我的宽容，猪。这里还有三枚硬币。如果你这次还不去买面包，就剥夺你的不朽灵魂来抵债。"

# game/script.rpy:8376
translate Chinese riddle3_f193bd3e:

  # p1 "\"Of course, Lord,\" I said in sorrow as I knelt before him. \"I will follow your orders to the letter.\""
  p1 "“当然了，主啊，”我悲伤地说着，跪在他面前。“我将一丝不苟地遵循您的命令。”"

# game/script.rpy:8377
translate Chinese riddle3_1333ee8b:

  # p1 "Naturally I went straight to the Devil Himself and gambled those three coins away again. For my winnings the Devil gave me a deck of cards that would allow me to win any game."
  p1 "理所当然的，我径直跑去见魔鬼本尊，又把那三枚硬币全拿去赌了。作为我赢钱的彩头，魔鬼给了我一副逢赌必赢的纸牌。"

# game/script.rpy:8378
translate Chinese riddle3_78cbe351:

  # p1 "Then I really got to work. Soon I had won half the world, and the Lord was forced to ask Death to stop my rampage."
  p1 "然后我才真正开始大显身手。很快我就赢下了半个世界，上帝被迫请求死神来阻止我的疯狂行径。"

# game/script.rpy:8379
translate Chinese riddle3_6535ff95:

  # p1 "Death snuffed me out at the poker table, and so I went up to Heaven and knocked on the gates."
  p1 "死神在扑克桌上掐灭了我的生命，于是我上了天堂，敲响了大门。"

# game/script.rpy:8380
translate Chinese riddle3_3ebe9dcc:

  # miw "...No. We don't need you here. Be on your way, pig."
  miw "……不。我们这里不需要你。赶紧走你的路吧，猪。"

# game/script.rpy:8381
translate Chinese riddle3_b904d41c:

  # p1 "So I went and knocked on the gates of Purgatory."
  p1 "于是我去敲了炼狱的大门。"

# game/script.rpy:8382
translate Chinese riddle3_6e54c8b3:

  # wib "I don't think so. We have enough misery and trouble here. Be on your way, pig."
  wib "我看还是算了吧。我们这里的苦难和麻烦已经够多了。赶紧走你的路吧，猪。"

# game/script.rpy:8383
translate Chinese riddle3_9621fac8:

  # p1 "And so finally I went and knocked on the gates of Hell, where they let me in at once. There was no-one there except for Lucifer and the hunchback devils."
  p1 "最后，我去敲了地狱的大门，他们立刻让我进去了。那里除了路西法和一些驼背魔鬼之外，没有别人。"

# game/script.rpy:8384
translate Chinese riddle3_46a4e508:

  # p1 "(The straight-backed devils were all away on business, you see.)"
  p1 "（你看，那些行得正坐得直的魔鬼都出差去了。）"

# game/script.rpy:8385
translate Chinese riddle3_0a01a9c7:

  # p1 "I challenged the old goat to a game at once, and soon I had won all the hunch-backed devils off Him. We all gambled into the night and made such a noise and racket that the Devil couldn't hear Himself speak."
  p1 "我立马拉着那头老山羊赌了一把，很快我就从他那儿赢走了所有的驼背魔鬼。我们一起赌到深夜，吵闹喧哗，吵得魔鬼连自己说话的声音都听不见了。"

# game/script.rpy:8386
translate Chinese riddle3_30524ef1:

  # p1 "Finally He was forced to run to the Almighty, crying out:"
  p1 "最后，他被迫跑去向全能的主哭诉："

# game/script.rpy:8387
translate Chinese riddle3_9002cf57:

  # mir "Please, O Lord, won't you rid me of this troublesome pig?"
  mir "求求您，主啊，您能不能帮我除掉这头烦人的猪？"

# game/script.rpy:8388
translate Chinese riddle3_d4f4a170:

  # p1 "And so they took away my cards, and I was kicked out of Hell and forced to wander the land forever and never know true peace."
  p1 "于是他们没收了我的牌，我被踢出了地狱，被迫永远在世间流浪，再也体会不到真正的宁静。"

# game/script.rpy:8389
translate Chinese riddle3_c74683eb:

  # "Just as the pig predicted, you saw your hair had turned white with shock to hear such a tale. You all shook your heads with sorrow."
  "正如小猪预言的那样，你发现自己听了这样一个故事后，头发都被震惊得全白了。你们都悲伤地摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:8392
translate Chinese riddle3_bf5f7dc9:

  # w "You're right. Sitting around here telling stories won't help us."
  w "你说得对。坐在这儿讲故事可帮不了我们。"

# game/script.rpy:8396
translate Chinese devilWins_30468ab1:

  # mir "Wrong!"
  mir "错！"

# game/script.rpy:8397
translate Chinese devilWins_988318cd:

  # w "The Devil cried out with glee, and he seized me at once and leapt into the fireplace and dragged me straight to hell."
  w "魔鬼兴奋地大叫起来，他一把抓住我，跳进壁炉，直接把我拖进了地狱。"

# game/script.rpy:8398
translate Chinese devilWins_bc8997dc:

  # w "To punish me for my hubris, he dropped the seed of a rose bush in my ear as I slept that night in hell."
  w "为了惩罚我的傲慢，那天晚上我在地狱睡觉时，他在我的耳朵里丢下了一颗玫瑰花丛的种子。"

# game/script.rpy:8399
translate Chinese devilWins_49c84f6b:

  # w "The seed quickly grew and grew inside my skull, until it cracked my head clean open."
  w "种子在我的头骨里飞速生长，直到把我的脑袋撑裂。"

# game/script.rpy:8400
translate Chinese devilWins_57aa73d7:

  # w "As I awoke I saw there were roses in my ears and cracks in my crown. My thoughts began to leak out through the cracks in dark heavy smoke."
  w "我醒来时，发现自己耳廓长着玫瑰，头冠布满裂痕。我的思想开始化作浓重的黑烟，从裂缝中泄漏出去。"

# game/script.rpy:8401
translate Chinese devilWins_64ac8e95:

  # w "He showed me pictures of the people who love me, and I could not say their names."
  w "他拿出一张张爱我之人的画像，我却怎么也叫不出他们的名字。"

# game/script.rpy:8402
translate Chinese devilWins_57ce6267:

  # w "I walked through the hills, and where before I could have named each leaf and bush and plant, I could not for the life of me remember them now."
  w "我走过群山，以前我能叫出每一片叶子、每一丛灌木、每一株植物的名字，现在却死活也想不起来了。"

# game/script.rpy:8403
translate Chinese devilWins_8942acf0:

  # w "And all the while the dark smoke slowly leaked out of my head, no matter how I tried to stop it."
  w "无论我怎么试图阻止，黑烟一直在不停地从我脑袋里往外漏。"

# game/script.rpy:8404
translate Chinese devilWins_fba2433d:

  # w "And so it was I was forced to swear service to him, and I came to serve the Devil for the rest of my days."
  w "就这样，我被迫发誓向他效忠，并且要在余生里侍奉魔鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:8406
translate Chinese devilWins_a1c63be9:

  # "You and the pig shook your heads and wept to hear such a sorry tale, and all around you the tears hit the floor and turned into terrible shrieking imps that swarmed around you, poking your soft legs and cackling cruelly at your misfortune."
  "你和小猪听了这凄惨的故事，都摇着头落泪了。泪水滴在地板上，变成了可怕的尖叫小鬼，它们蜂拥在你们周围，戳着你们毫无防备的腿，残忍地嘲笑着你们的不幸。"

# game/script.rpy:8408
translate Chinese devilWins_d2383f58:

  # "You shook your head and wept to hear such a sorry tale, and all around you the tears hit the floor and turned into terrible shrieking imps that swarmed around the both of you, poking your soft legs and cackling cruelly at your misfortune."
  "你听了这凄惨的故事，摇着头落泪了。泪水滴在地板上，变成了可怕的尖叫小鬼，它们蜂拥在你们俩周围，戳着你们柔软的腿，残忍地嘲笑着你们的不幸。"

# game/script.rpy:8409
translate Chinese devilWins_4b9ff99e:

  # "Such is life in Hell."
  "地狱里的生活就是如此。"

# game/script.rpy:8416
translate Chinese hell_4b09a2b6:

  # w "We'd better get moving. I want to get back and see if my cottage is still standing." nointeract
  w "我们最好赶紧动身。我想回去看看我的小屋是不是还立在那儿。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:8418
translate Chinese hell_405d34ec:

  # "Hell was a small cave, draughty and full of coal dust."
  "地狱是个四处漏风、满是煤灰的小山洞。"

# game/script.rpy:8419
translate Chinese hell_ee41c70e:

  # "You looked through a hole in the cave wall and marvelled to see the imps cavorting in drunken song and dance beyond, each of them plotting to destroy the works of man and G-d."
  "你透过洞壁上的一个小孔往外看，惊奇地看到外面的小鬼们正醉醺醺地欢歌起舞，每一个都在密谋摧毁人类和主的造物。"

# game/script.rpy:8420
translate Chinese hell_61e0d260:

  # "You quickly retreated for fear of being seen."
  "因为害怕被发现，你赶紧退了回来。"

# game/script.rpy:8424
translate Chinese hell_6404445d:

  # "In the centre of the cavern was a small, homely cottage. You peered in the window."
  "洞穴中央有一座简朴温馨的小屋。你往窗内望去。"

# game/script.rpy:8427
translate Chinese hell_0ac1086a:

  # "The Devil was not home, but you saw His old grandmother in a rocking chair in the corner. She spotted you both at once."
  "魔鬼不在家，但你看到他的老祖母坐在角落的摇椅上。她立刻就发现了你们俩。"

# game/script.rpy:8428
translate Chinese hell_34743a4f:

  # dg "Oh, my dears! You must be terribly lost. You'd better get out of here."
  dg "哎呀，可怜的孩子们！你们肯定是迷路了吧。你们最好赶紧离开这里。"

# game/script.rpy:8429
translate Chinese hell_9613049f:

  # w "We don't know how - and I'm sworn to serve the Devil for the rest of my days."
  w "我们不知道怎么出去——而且我已经发誓，下半辈子都要侍奉魔鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:8430
translate Chinese hell_84bb6874:

  # dg "Then you have a hard road ahead. My grandson will be home soon, and He will eat you up whole if He sees you."
  dg "那你们可就难办了。我孙子很快就回来了，要是他看到你们，会把你们生吞活剥的。"

# game/script.rpy:8431
translate Chinese hell_369e2c39:

  # dg "But since I feel sorry for you, I'll see if I can help."
  dg "不过我看你们也挺可怜的，就看看能不能帮上点忙吧。"

# game/script.rpy:8433
translate Chinese hell_fb6d4aa1:

  # "With a flick of her wrist she transformed you all into fat yellow and black carpenter bees."
  "她手腕一翻，把你们全都变成了胖乎乎、黄黑相间的木蜂。"

# game/script.rpy:8435
translate Chinese hell_cd39bfc9:

  # "With a flick of her wrist she transformed you both into fat yellow and black carpenter bees."
  "她手腕一翻，把你们俩都变成了胖乎乎、黄黑相间的木蜂。"

# game/script.rpy:8436
translate Chinese hell_5b299973:

  # w "Oh!"
  w "哦！"

# game/script.rpy:8437
translate Chinese hell_a4883d03:

  # "The witch buzzed around joyously."
  "女巫开心地嗡嗡飞舞着。"

# game/script.rpy:8438
translate Chinese hell_d2ee417e:

  # w "This might seem strange but, I've always kind of wanted to be a bee."
  w "说起来可能有点怪，但我其实一直挺想当只蜜蜂的。"

# game/script.rpy:8439
translate Chinese hell_c1b9cfe3:

  # pov "We still have some questions."
  pov "我们还有点问题。"

# game/script.rpy:8440
translate Chinese hell_289f5a06:

  # dg "Here. Hide in my skirts, and I will see what answers I can coax from Old Nick."
  dg "来，躲到我的裙摆底下去，我去看看能从老魔头那里套出什么话来。"

# game/script.rpy:8441
translate Chinese hell_fda3b516:

  # "She quickly tucked you both into her skirts."
  "她迅速把你们俩塞进了裙子里。"

# game/script.rpy:8442
translate Chinese hell_40470956:

  # "Soon, the Devil came home, and no sooner did He enter the house than He noticed the air was not pure."
  "很快，魔鬼回家了，他刚一进屋就察觉到空气有些异样。"

# game/script.rpy:8443
translate Chinese hell_472f79be:

  # mir "Crinkle, crush, wailing and fleeing. I smell the flesh of a human being."
  mir "嘎吱作响，踩踏成泥，哀嚎悲鸣，仓皇逃命。我闻到了人类血肉的味道。"

# game/script.rpy:8445
translate Chinese hell_6f5979ff:

  # mir "And is that... the smell of a pig?"
  mir "还有这……哪来的猪味？"

# game/script.rpy:8446
translate Chinese hell_5832796f:

  # mir "Could it truly be my old nemesis returned at last?"
  mir "难道真的是我的老对头终于回来了？"

# game/script.rpy:8447
translate Chinese hell_b9125b9b:

  # "With this he picked up the whole house and began to turn it over looking for the flesh he smelled."
  "说着，他把整座房子举了起来，开始底朝天地翻找那血肉味是从哪传来的。"

# game/script.rpy:8449
translate Chinese hell_1552d432:

  # "You shook to see your Godfather before your eyes at last."
  "看到你的教父终于出现在眼前，你浑身发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:8451
translate Chinese hell_4b3b8200:

  # "The pig shivered beside you at the sight of his old rival."
  "小猪看到他的老宿敌，也在你身旁瑟瑟发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:8452
translate Chinese hell_1765717d:

  # dg "Hush, you young fool. You're always smelling human beings."
  dg "消停点，你这傻小子。你老是说能闻到人味。"

# game/script.rpy:8453
translate Chinese hell_8bbbd8dc:

  # dg "You're making a mess of the nice clean floors I just swept. Now come have some of the soup I made you."
  dg "把我刚扫得干干净净的地板都弄脏了。快过来喝点我给你做的汤。"

# game/script.rpy:8454
translate Chinese hell_d9308cd6:

  # "Grumbling, He put the house back down on its foundations and sat down to eat and drink. Soon He was curled up fast asleep and snoring on His grandmother's lap."
  "他嘟囔着，把房子放回地基上，坐下来大吃大喝。很快，他就蜷缩在祖母的腿上呼呼大睡，打起鼾来。"

# game/script.rpy:8463
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_b8f974fd:

  # dg "Quickly now, you two. What are your questions?" nointeract
  dg "快点，你们俩。你们有什么问题？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:8468
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_39aeb7eb:

  # dg "I dreamed that there was a young princess who knew everything. But she was tricked, and forced to pledge her soul to you. Do you think she can ever escape?"
  dg "我梦见有一个无所不知的年轻公主。但她被骗了，被迫将灵魂出卖给了你。你觉得她还能逃脱吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8469
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_653a9647:

  # mir "Ha! If only she knew!"
  mir "哈！她做梦也猜不到！"

# game/script.rpy:8470
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_75a2fca3:

  # mir "Underneath this house is a fat old worm that holds her promise to me. If she kills it, she will be free. But that will never happen!"
  mir "这栋房子下面有一条肥胖的老虫子，它装着她对我的承诺。如果她杀了那条虫子，她就自由了。但这永远不可能发生！"

# game/script.rpy:8476
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_d021f9c4:

  # dg "I dreamed that a desperate mother once pledged her child to you, as the Godfather - and that you are bound to grab [him] up at midnight tonight. Can [he] evade you, do you think?"
  dg "我梦见一个绝望的母亲曾将她的孩子托付给你做教父——而你注定要在今晚午夜将[him]抓走。你觉得[he]能躲过你吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8477
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_4fb2ab3f:

  # mir "Not on your life! None can escape the Devil!"
  mir "绝对没门！没人能逃出魔鬼的手心！"

# game/script.rpy:8478
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_92cf20a0:

  # "He chuckled to himself gleefully."
  "他得意洋洋地窃笑起来。"

# game/script.rpy:8483
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_26df6eea:

  # mir "Unless of course, [he] look me in the face and recite my second and most secret name, Belthuselah. But that will never happen!{vspace=160}{i}In your notes, write down that you {b}know the Devil's second and most secret name.{/b}{/i}"
  mir "除非，[he]看着我的脸，念出我第二个，也是最不为人知的秘名：彼土撒拉。但这永远不可能发生！{vspace=160}{i}在你的笔记中写下，你{b}知道魔鬼第二个也是最隐秘的名字。{/b}{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:8485
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_a8c9287f:

  # mir "Unless of course, [he] looks me in the face and recites my second and most secret name, Belthuselah. But that will never happen!{vspace=160}{i}In your notes, write down that you {b}know the Devil's second and most secret name.{/b}{/i}"
  mir "除非，[he]看着我的脸，念出我第二个，也是最不为人知的秘名：彼土撒拉。但这永远不可能发生！{vspace=160}{i}在你的笔记中写下，你{b}知道魔鬼第二个也是最隐秘的名字。{/b}{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:8491
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_668e5cf8:

  # dg "I dreamed that a desperate young mother once pledged her child to God, as the Godfather - and that their child was bound to be taken by Him on [his] eighteenth birthday. Can [he] ever escape, do you think?"
  dg "我梦见一个绝望的年轻母亲曾将她的孩子托付给上帝做教父——而那个孩子注定要在[his]十八岁生日那天被他带走。你觉得[he]还能逃脱吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8492
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_e317a776:

  # mir "Ha! That's easy."
  mir "哈！这很简单。"

# game/script.rpy:8494
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_85f6f0ee:

  # mir "The Lord is blind to the desperate. All [he] have to do is take on the disguise of an old leper, and G-d will walk right by."
  mir "上帝对绝望之人总是视而不见。[he]只需要伪装成一个老麻风病人，主就会径直走过去。"

# game/script.rpy:8496
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_bad2837b:

  # mir "The Lord is blind to the desperate. All [he] has to do is take on the disguise of an old leper, and G-d will walk right by."
  mir "上帝对绝望之人总是视而不见。[he]只需要伪装成一个老麻风病人，主就会径直走过去。"

# game/script.rpy:8497
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_a2955627:

  # mir "But [he]'ll never do that!"
  mir "但[he]绝对想不到那么做！"

# game/script.rpy:8503
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_19e18214:

  # dg "I dreamed that a desperate young mother once pledged her child to Death, as the godmother - and that the child was bound to be taken by Her. Can [he] ever escape, do you think?"
  dg "我梦见一个绝望的年轻母亲曾将她的孩子托付给死神做教母——而那个孩子注定要被她带走。你觉得[he]还能逃脱吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8504
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_8f005685:

  # mir "Never."
  mir "永远不可能。"

# game/script.rpy:8505
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_9e645f15:

  # "The Devil grew sombre."
  "魔鬼变得阴郁起来。"

# game/script.rpy:8506
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_fb69660b:

  # mir "There is no trick or cheat. When the child receives Death's three messengers, [he] will have to go. And that will be that."
  mir "没有任何投机取巧或作弊的余地。死神的三位信使找上门来时，[he]就非走不可了。一切就这么结束了。"

# game/script.rpy:8512
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_b74d25d1:

  # dg "I dreamed of a girl who had all her thoughts drift out of her head as heavy smoke. Do you think she could ever be cured?"
  dg "我梦见一个女孩，她所有的思想都化作浓烟从脑子里飘了出去。你觉得她的病还能治好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8513
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_f86a2bfa:

  # mir "Ha! The fool! She can never be cured, and she will never know peace."
  mir "哈！那个蠢货！她永远不可能被治愈，也永远得不到安宁。"

# game/script.rpy:8514
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_a6fba682:

  # mir "The only way she could help herself is to plant a garden in her hat, so that the flowers and herbs soak up the smoke and grow with her memories. Thus she will hold the barest part of her old knowledge."
  mir "她唯一能自救的办法，就是在自己的帽子里种上一个花园，让花草吸收那些烟雾，伴随她的记忆一起生长。这样她就能保留住她过去那一丁点残存的知识。"

# game/script.rpy:8515
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_819fe0d5:

  # mir "But she'll never figure THAT out! Ha Ha Ha!"
  mir "但她永远也想不出那个办法！哈哈哈！"

# game/script.rpy:8523
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_8ac0fb32:

  # dg "I dreamed of a poor and penniless village. Do you think they could ever claw their way out of poverty?"
  dg "我梦见一个一贫如洗的村庄。你觉得他们能从贫困中挣扎出来吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8524
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_b28658d8:

  # mir "Never, the pack of wretches! The gutter has a long and hungry groove, and it will not be satiated until they are pulled down into the mud like their forefathers before them!"
  mir "休想，那帮可悲的穷鬼！贫穷的深渊就像贪婪的沟渠，除非把他们像他们祖辈那样拖进烂泥里，否则它绝不会满足！"

# game/script.rpy:8525
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_114000f4:

  # "He cackled in triumph."
  "他洋洋得意地嘎嘎大笑。"

# game/script.rpy:8526
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_e3e27cce:

  # mir "Of course, there is one thing. Beneath the village well is an old mouse. If they bring it grapes, the well will flow with the most delicious wine forever after, and they will all live in luxury for the rest of their days."
  mir "当然了，办法也不是没有。村里的水井下面有一只老鼠。如果他们给它喂葡萄，水井就会永远流出最美味的葡萄酒，他们余生都能过上奢华的日子。"

# game/script.rpy:8527
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_8181a68b:

  # mir "But they'll all go to their graves never knowing a thing about that."
  mir "但他们到死都不会知道这件事的。"

# game/script.rpy:8538
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_8b480843:

  # dg "I dreamed of a child who looked out at the woods late at night and felt hollow. Why do you think that could be?"
  dg "我梦见一个孩子深夜望着树林，感到内心空虚。你觉得这是为什么？"

# game/script.rpy:8539
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_e0c60d38:

  # "At this the Devil fell silent for a long time."
  "听到这，魔鬼沉默了很久。"

# game/script.rpy:8541
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_4c12e442:

  # mir "Something lies under that child's house."
  mir "那孩子的房子下面藏着什么东西。"

# game/script.rpy:8542
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_b4c15e53:

  # mir "What it is, I do not know."
  mir "具体是什么，我不知道。"

# game/script.rpy:8543
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_0af508dd:

  # mir "And if I knew, I wouldn't speak of it."
  mir "就算我知道，我也不会说出来。"

# game/script.rpy:8544
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_38b2c792:

  # mir "Do not concern yourself with this dream. Soon, you will forget it."
  mir "别去在意这个梦了。很快，你就会忘记它的。"

# game/script.rpy:8545
translate Chinese devilGrandmaquestions_c91b8527:

  # mir "As will I."
  mir "我也会。"

# game/script.rpy:8551
translate Chinese devilAnswers_0364c245:

  # "In a flash, she seized one of the 3 golden hairs on His head and yanked it out. The Devil came awake with a howl of pain."
  "猛然间，老祖母抓起他头上的一根金发，一把扯了下来。魔鬼痛得惨叫一声，惊醒过来。"

# game/script.rpy:8552
translate Chinese devilAnswers_6e254eb9:

  # mir "Ouch! What are you doing?"
  mir "哎哟！你干什么？"

# game/script.rpy:8553
translate Chinese devilAnswers_2ebec882:

  # dg "I'm sorry, my grandson. I had a bad dream, and gripped hold of your hair."
  dg "抱歉，我的乖孙。我做了个噩梦，不小心揪住了你的头发。"

# game/script.rpy:8554
translate Chinese devilAnswers_e920fa80:

  # "The Devil was curious despite himself."
  "魔鬼不由自主地感到了好奇。"

# game/script.rpy:8555
translate Chinese devilAnswers_1f6de3e9:

  # mir "What did you dream?"
  mir "你梦见什么了？"

# game/script.rpy:8557
translate Chinese devilAnswers_032b6e82:

  # "Then she tore out a second hair."
  "接着，她拔下了第二根头发。"

# game/script.rpy:8558
translate Chinese devilAnswers_54b33978:

  # mir "Hey! What are you doing?"
  mir "嘿！你干什么？"

# game/script.rpy:8559
translate Chinese devilAnswers_e2737603:

  # dg "I didn't mean it. I did it in a dream."
  dg "我不是故意的。我在梦里抓的。"

# game/script.rpy:8560
translate Chinese devilAnswers_9321e615:

  # mir "What did you dream this time?"
  mir "你这次又梦见什么了？"

# game/script.rpy:8562
translate Chinese devilAnswers_b2196db8:

  # "Then she grabbed hold of the third golden hair and yanked it out by the roots."
  "然后，她抓住第三根金发，连根拔起。"

# game/script.rpy:8563
translate Chinese devilAnswers_301bd9ab:

  # mir "My last hair!"
  mir "我最后一根头发！"

# game/script.rpy:8564
translate Chinese devilAnswers_b2a896df:

  # "The Devil leapt up and stomped around the house, shouting vile curses, but she soon calmed him."
  "魔鬼跳了起来，在屋里气急败坏地直跺脚，破口大骂，但她很快就安抚住了他。"

# game/script.rpy:8565
translate Chinese devilAnswers_b88876e1:

  # dg "I'm sorry, my grandson. But what can you do against dreams?"
  dg "抱歉，我的乖孙。但是做梦这种事谁控制得了呢？"

# game/script.rpy:8566
translate Chinese devilAnswers_88e42a10:

  # mir "Hmph."
  mir "哼。"

# game/script.rpy:8567
translate Chinese devilAnswers_e29dbd66:

  # mir "What was the dream this time?"
  mir "这次又是什么梦？"

# game/script.rpy:8571
translate Chinese devilSleeps_de9c7092:

  # "The grandmother began picking the lice from His head, and soon He fell asleep again and snored so loudly that the windows rattled."
  "祖母开始在他头上捉虱子，很快他又睡着了，呼噜声震得窗户直响。"

# game/script.rpy:8572
translate Chinese devilSleeps_20965d3f:

  # dg "Ask your second question, child."
  dg "问你的第二个问题吧，孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:8575
translate Chinese devilSleeps_737cdde5:

  # "The grandmother spoke softly to Him and began lousing him again. Soon He settled down and was fast asleep once more."
  "祖母轻声对他说了几句，又开始给他捉虱子。很快他安静下来，再次沉沉睡去。"

# game/script.rpy:8576
translate Chinese devilSleeps_f24505d9:

  # dg "Ask your final question, child."
  dg "问你最后一个问题吧，孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:8579
translate Chinese devilSleeps_f0d13948:

  # "The Grandmother sang a sweet lullaby to calm Him."
  "祖母唱起了一首甜美的摇篮曲来安抚他。"

# game/script.rpy:8582
translate Chinese witchEnd_601f27cc:

  # "Soon the old dragon fell soundly asleep, and His grandmother took him off to bed and closed the door."
  "很快，这条老恶龙就酣然入睡了，他的祖母带他去床上安歇，关上了门。"

# game/script.rpy:8583
translate Chinese witchEnd_21b2272e:

  # "She shook you out of her skirts and turned you back to your human forms."
  "她把你们从裙子里抖落出来，将你们变回了人形。"

# game/script.rpy:8584
translate Chinese witchEnd_ff101975:

  # dg "Well! I'm sure you heard the answers you sought. Here are the Devil's three golden hairs."
  dg "好了！我相信你们已经听到了想要的答案。这是魔鬼的三根金发。"

# game/script.rpy:8585
translate Chinese witchEnd_fe5aa152:

  # dg "Throw them into the fire, and you will be carried straight up the chimney and out of hell."
  dg "把它们扔进火里，你们就会被直接送上烟囱，逃出地狱。"

# game/script.rpy:8586
translate Chinese witchEnd_e2c35df7:

  # w "Thank you so much. How can we ever repay you?"
  w "太感谢您了。我们要如何才能报答您呢？"

# game/script.rpy:8587
translate Chinese witchEnd_7112b538:

  # dg "No need. Just forgive my grandson his trifling ways. He is young and foolish, just as I once was."
  dg "不必了。只要别跟我孙子的小过错一般见识就行。他还年轻不懂事，就像我曾经那样。"

# game/script.rpy:8589
translate Chinese witchEnd_bc6aabe1:

  # p1 "Just a moment, please."
  p1 "请稍等一下。"

# game/script.rpy:8590
translate Chinese witchEnd_3d81ff92:

  # "The pig snuffled around the back of the cottage, and came back with a deck of cards in his mouth."
  "小猪在小屋后面四处嗅了嗅，回来时嘴里叼着一副纸牌。"

# game/script.rpy:8591
translate Chinese witchEnd_ced717fd:

  # p1 "Alright, we'd best be off. Quickly!"
  p1 "好了，我们最好赶紧走。快点！"

# game/script.rpy:8595
translate Chinese witchEnd_d01c57bb:

  # "You left the cottage and crawled down into the foundations beneath it. When you found the ancient serpent squatting beneath it, the witch speared it with her crooked finger, killing it instantly."
  "你们离开小屋，爬到了地基下面。当你们发现那条蜷缩在下面的老蛇时，女巫用她弯曲的手指刺穿了它，瞬间将它杀死。"

# game/script.rpy:8596
translate Chinese witchEnd_f8e72e52:

  # "With that, she felt a weight fall from her shoulders. You turned and saw that the Devil's mark was no longer upon her."
  "随之，她感到肩上的重担卸下了。你转过头，看到魔鬼的印记已经从她身上消失。"

# game/script.rpy:8597
translate Chinese witchEnd_6274af99:

  # "Then you went to the cottage fireplace, threw in the three golden hairs from the Devil, and leapt inside."
  "然后你走到小屋的壁炉前，扔进魔鬼的三根金发，纵身跳了进去。"

# game/script.rpy:8600
translate Chinese witchEnd_63ba296b:

  # "In an instant, you flew right up the chimney and out into the witch's cottage."
  "眨眼间，你顺着烟囱直飞而上，飞出了地狱，回到了女巫的小屋里。"

# game/script.rpy:8602
translate Chinese witchEnd_6b5f0f41:

  # "And so you went to the cottage fireplace, threw in the three golden hairs from the Devil, and leapt inside."
  "于是你们走到小屋的壁炉前，扔进魔鬼的三根金发，纵身跳了进去。"

# game/script.rpy:8605
translate Chinese witchEnd_63ba296b_1:

  # "In an instant, you flew right up the chimney and out into the witch's cottage."
  "眨眼间，你顺着烟囱直飞而上，飞出了地狱，回到了女巫的小屋里。"

# game/script.rpy:8607
translate Chinese witchEnd_194609cb:

  # "Alas, as you tumbled onto the floor of the cottage, you heard the clock strike midnight, and you saw a pair of terrible red boots stamp down in front of you."
  "命运弄人，当你们摔在小屋地板上时，时钟恰好敲响了午夜，接着你看到一双可怕的红色靴子砰地踩在了你面前。"

# game/script.rpy:8608
translate Chinese witchEnd_d9f5c530:

  # mir "Time's up, child!"
  mir "时间到了，孩子！"

# game/script.rpy:8609
translate Chinese witchEnd_5b138260:

  # mir "Now you are mine, just as your mother promised all those years ago."
  mir "现在你是我的了，就像你母亲多年前承诺的那样。"

# game/script.rpy:8614
translate Chinese witchEnd_cb8afa9d:

  # mir "I'll keep you in a cave to darn my socks, and brew my grandmother's tea, and bake bread for all the hungry souls of Hell - and there's nothing you can do about it!" nointeract
  mir "我要把你关在一个洞穴里，给我缝袜子，给我祖母泡茶，给地狱里所有饥饿的灵魂烤面包——而你对此无能为力！" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:8616
translate Chinese witchEnd_76ff3300:

  # pov "Belthuselah."
  pov "彼土撒拉。"

# game/script.rpy:8617
translate Chinese witchEnd_756498b7:

  # mir "NOOOOOOOOOOOO! How? How did you discover my second and most secret name? Impossible!"
  mir "不————————！怎么会？你是怎么查出我第二个、也是最隐秘的真名的？这不可能！"

# game/script.rpy:8618
translate Chinese witchEnd_15cdf11f:

  # "In an instant, his spell over you broke. The Devil withered and shrank and spluttered with rage, until He grew as small as an ant, whereupon you kicked Him right into the fireplace and back to hell."
  "刹那间，他对你的咒语破除了。魔鬼萎缩干瘪，气得语无伦次，直到变得像蚂蚁一样大，你顺势一脚把他踢进壁炉，踢回了地狱。"

# game/script.rpy:8619
translate Chinese witchEnd_3b2fc7a6:

  # "With the Devil taken care of, you and the witch looked over the cottage."
  "解决了魔鬼之后，你和女巫环顾着这间小屋。"

# game/script.rpy:8620
translate Chinese witchEnd_af1b0119:

  # "It was a mess of flowers and plants and flopping animals, sprouting wildly every witch-way across the room."
  "屋里乱作一团，花草在屋里巫法无天地四处疯长，动物们四下乱蹦。"

# game/script.rpy:8621
translate Chinese witchEnd_45ceb2e3:

  # "You rolled up your sleeves and slowly put the room to rights, until it was even more clean, warm and homely than it had been before."
  "你卷起袖子，慢慢地把房间收拾妥当，直到它变得比以前更加整洁、温暖和温馨。"

# game/script.rpy:8623
translate Chinese witchEnd_1abe4f84:

  # p1 "Not so fast, my erstwhile adversary."
  p1 "别急，我昔日的对手。"

# game/script.rpy:8624
translate Chinese witchEnd_5a80d551:

  # mir "No... it can't be..."
  mir "不……这不可能……"

# game/script.rpy:8625
translate Chinese witchEnd_589686b3:

  # p1 "But it is! I've returned from the pit to challenge you once more."
  p1 "但这就是真的！我从深渊归来，要再次向你发起挑战。"

# game/script.rpy:8626
translate Chinese witchEnd_98415eee:

  # "The pig revealed his deck of cards. At the sight, the Devil began sweating and shaking."
  "小猪亮出了他的那副纸牌。一看到它，魔鬼就开始冒汗发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:8627
translate Chinese witchEnd_b230368f:

  # mir "No, please... you know I can never refuse a game of chance!"
  mir "不，求你了……你知道我永远无法拒绝一场赌局！"

# game/script.rpy:8628
translate Chinese witchEnd_30b879f2:

  # p1 "All too well, you old goat. Deal."
  p1 "再清楚不过了，你这老山羊。发牌吧。"

# game/script.rpy:8629
translate Chinese witchEnd_5fb866f8:

  # "In a moment, the pig had thrashed the Devil, and won all the riches of Hell from Him. The King of Hell gave up your contract and fled the house in terror before the pig could challenge Him to another game."
  "不一会儿，小猪就把魔鬼杀得片甲不留，赢走了地狱里所有的财富。地狱之王交出了你的契约，然后在这头猪向他发起另一场赌局之前，惊恐地逃出了房子。"

# game/script.rpy:8630
translate Chinese witchEnd_65fe7757:

  # "With the Devil taken care of, you all looked over the cottage."
  "解决了魔鬼之后，你们环顾着这间小屋。"

# game/script.rpy:8631
translate Chinese witchEnd_af1b0119_1:

  # "It was a mess of flowers and plants and flopping animals, sprouting wildly every witch-way across the room."
  "屋里乱作一团，花草在屋里巫法无天地四处疯长，动物们四下乱蹦。"

# game/script.rpy:8632
translate Chinese witchEnd_45ceb2e3_1:

  # "You rolled up your sleeves and slowly put the room to rights, until it was even more clean, warm and homely than it had been before."
  "你卷起袖子，慢慢地把房间收拾妥当，直到它变得比以前更加整洁、温暖和温馨。"

# game/script.rpy:8636
translate Chinese witchEnd_7e7bb3f6:

  # "With a whoop, the Devil seized you and dragged you into the fireplace and straight to hell."
  "伴随着一声怪叫，魔鬼一把抓住你，将你拖进壁炉，直下地狱。"

# game/script.rpy:8637
translate Chinese witchEnd_7d6f8ffd:

  # "Sadly, you were trapped there forever after. I saw the flames take you. The witch mourns you still."
  "遗憾的是，你永远被困在了那里。我看着火焰将你吞噬。女巫至今仍在为你哀悼。"

# game/script.rpy:8639
translate Chinese witchEnd_4362b4b5:

  # "When misfortune is after someone, they may try to hide in all sorts of places or flee across the whole wide world, but it will still know where to find them."
  "当厄运盯上一个人时，他们可能会试图藏在各种地方，或者逃到天涯海角，但厄运总能找到他们。"

# game/script.rpy:8641
translate Chinese witchEnd_a20cefa7:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:8642
translate Chinese witchEnd_00620a41:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:8643
translate Chinese witchEnd_79e34931:

  # "What happened to the toad, you ask?"
  "你问那个蟾蜍后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:8646
translate Chinese witchEnd_29a80d9b:

  # w "Quick! Your Godfather will be here any minute."
  w "快！你的教父随时都会来。"

# game/script.rpy:8647
translate Chinese witchEnd_3c74f225:

  # "You both leapt into action. You disguised yourselves as beggars and lepers and threw lumps of mud all over the half-ruined cottage so that it looked like an abandoned hovel."
  "你们俩立刻行动起来。你们把自己伪装成乞丐和麻风病人，在半毁的小屋上糊满泥巴，让它看起来像个废弃的窝棚。"

# game/script.rpy:8648
translate Chinese witchEnd_dbb1ff34:

  # "Soon, the clock struck midnight, and you felt the light of G-d upon you."
  "很快，午夜的钟声敲响，你感觉到主的光芒落在了你身上。"

# game/script.rpy:8649
translate Chinese witchEnd_c164d3d1:

  # "It seared into your flesh as you huddled together on the floor, feeling His gaze searching for you as His heavy footfalls shook the house."
  "当你们蜷缩在地板上时，那光芒灼烧着你的血肉。你感觉到他的目光在搜寻你们，他沉重的脚步声震得房子摇晃。"

# game/script.rpy:8650
translate Chinese witchEnd_d4346bb4:

  # "But He did not see you. And soon, you felt His light fade, and His gaze turned away, and His heavy footsteps fell away into the distance."
  "但他没有看到你们。很快，你感觉到他的光芒褪去，目光移开，沉重的脚步声在远处渐渐消失。"

# game/script.rpy:8651
translate Chinese witchEnd_17221849:

  # "You and the witch clutched each other and laughed with terror and relief."
  "你和女巫紧紧相拥，在恐惧与释然中大笑起来。"

# game/script.rpy:8652
translate Chinese witchEnd_ab620e36:

  # "With G-d taken care of, you and the witch looked over the cottage."
  "解决了主的问题之后，你和女巫环顾着这间小屋。"

# game/script.rpy:8653
translate Chinese witchEnd_af1b0119_2:

  # "It was a mess of flowers and plants and flopping animals, sprouting wildly every witch-way across the room."
  "屋里乱作一团，花草在屋里巫法无天地四处疯长，动物们四下乱蹦。"

# game/script.rpy:8654
translate Chinese witchEnd_45ceb2e3_2:

  # "You rolled up your sleeves and slowly put the room to rights, until it was even more clean, warm and homely than it had been before."
  "你卷起袖子，慢慢地把房间收拾妥当，直到它变得比以前更加整洁、温暖和温馨。"

# game/script.rpy:8656
translate Chinese witchEnd_02c41607:

  # "You slowly picked yourselves up and looked over the cottage."
  "你们缓缓爬起来，环顾着这间小屋。"

# game/script.rpy:8657
translate Chinese witchEnd_af1b0119_3:

  # "It was a mess of flowers and plants and flopping animals, sprouting wildly every witch-way across the room."
  "屋里乱作一团，花草在屋里巫法无天地四处疯长，动物们四下乱蹦。"

# game/script.rpy:8658
translate Chinese witchEnd_dd1ff274:

  # "Just then, the clock struck midnight. You looked around in terror, waiting for Lady Death or Her messengers. But none came."
  "就在这时，时钟敲响了午夜。你惊恐地环顾四周，等待着死神夫人或她的信使。但谁也没来。"

# game/script.rpy:8659
translate Chinese witchEnd_30174d05:

  # w "Looks like you still have some time left!"
  w "看来你还有些时间！"

# game/script.rpy:8660
translate Chinese witchEnd_45ceb2e3_3:

  # "You rolled up your sleeves and slowly put the room to rights, until it was even more clean, warm and homely than it had been before."
  "你卷起袖子，慢慢地把房间收拾妥当，直到它变得比以前更加整洁、温暖和温馨。"

# game/script.rpy:8664
translate Chinese witchEnd_3be8afd0:

  # "Once the cottage was put to rights, you went to the village and fed some grapes to the mouse at the bottom of the village well."
  "小屋收拾妥当后，你们去了村子，给村里水井下面的老鼠喂了些葡萄。"

# game/script.rpy:8665
translate Chinese witchEnd_4c749517:

  # "In an instant, the well began to flow with the richest and most satisfying red wine, and all throughout the village rejoiced."
  "刹那间，井里开始涌出最醇厚、最甘美的红酒，整个村子都沸腾了。"

# game/script.rpy:8666
translate Chinese witchEnd_04524737:

  # "The village soon prospered by selling the wine, and you and your family became rich beyond your wildest dreams."
  "村子很快靠卖酒繁荣起来，你和你的家人也因此发了大财，过上了做梦都不敢想的富裕生活。"

# game/script.rpy:8670
translate Chinese witchEnd_983e4037:

  # "You stayed with the witch for a while after that, helping her with her forgetfulness."
  "之后，你在女巫那里留了一段时间，帮她挽留不断流失的记忆。"

# game/script.rpy:8671
translate Chinese witchEnd_7982f7a4:

  # "Over time you cultivated a garden in her hat, using the knowledge you tricked out of the Devil."
  "渐渐地，你利用从魔鬼那里套出来的知识，在她的帽子里培育了一个花园。"

# game/script.rpy:8673
translate Chinese witchEnd_041d14e9:

  # "You told the wise old Mushroom the story of your misadventures in hell, and she loved it so much that she blessed you with a mushroom's blessing, so that you always had a green thumb."
  "你向那位睿智的老蘑菇讲述了你在地狱的离奇经历，她非常喜欢这个故事，于是赐予了你蘑菇的祝福，让你拥有了绝佳的园艺天赋。"

# game/script.rpy:8674
translate Chinese witchEnd_5deb45dd:

  # "You sowed green grass and lavender and rosemary and thyme, and bottlebrushes and honeysuckle and silver spurflowers."
  "你播种了青草、薰衣草、迷迭香和百里香，还有红千层、金银花和银色龙头花。"

# game/script.rpy:8675
translate Chinese witchEnd_3d4b0787:

  # "The smoke pooled under her hat and nourished these flowers at the roots, so they grew rich and wild with her memories."
  "烟雾积聚在她的帽子下面，滋养着这些花草的根部，于是它们汲取着她的记忆，长得繁茂又张狂。"

# game/script.rpy:8676
translate Chinese witchEnd_ceb339ff:

  # "Although she would never be the Girl Who Knew Everything again, she knew enough."
  "虽然她再也无法成为那个“无所不知的女孩”，但她知道的已经足够了。"

# game/script.rpy:8678
translate Chinese witchEnd_b29e448d:

  # "Alas, despite everything you'd done, she still remained sworn to the Devil. Her promise to him was kept in a secret place that he guarded jealously, and you were never able to find it."
  "唉，尽管你做了一切，她依然受制于对魔鬼的契约。她对他的承诺被保存在一个他严密把守的秘密地点，你始终无法找到它。"

# game/script.rpy:8679
translate Chinese witchEnd_07b80a38:

  # "Every witch's Sabbath, she was forced to ride away to dance on the Thornton Peak, and commit all kinds of wicked and terrible acts in his name."
  "每到巫魔宴，她都被迫骑着扫帚飞去桑顿峰跳舞，并以他的名义犯下各种邪恶可怖的行径。"

# game/script.rpy:8680
translate Chinese witchEnd_6f9f1028:

  # "Still, you spent many peaceful months staying with her, cultivating her garden, putting her cottage to rights, and helping her rewrite all her old notebooks again."
  "尽管如此，你还是和她一起度过了许多平静安宁的岁月，培育她的花园，收拾她的小屋，帮她重新写好了所有的旧笔记。"

# game/script.rpy:8682
translate Chinese witchEnd_83014d11:

  # "She was free from the Devil at last."
  "她终于摆脱了魔鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:8683
translate Chinese witchEnd_c0be5128:

  # "You spent many peaceful months staying with her, cultivating her garden, putting her cottage to rights, and helping her rewrite all her old notebooks again."
  "你和她一起度过了许多平静的月份，培育她的花园，收拾她的小屋，并帮她重新写好了所有的旧笔记。"

# game/script.rpy:8687
translate Chinese witchEnd_30b6682b:

  # "You stayed with the witch for a while after that, trying to help her with her forgetfulness."
  "之后，你在女巫那里留了一段时间，试图帮她挽留不断流失的记忆。"

# game/script.rpy:8688
translate Chinese witchEnd_8aed2ecf:

  # "Sadly, you knew not how. You tried everything you could, but for the rest of her days, her thoughts were cursed to leak from her head in heavy smoke."
  "遗憾的是，你不知道该怎么做。你尝试了所有能想到的办法，但在她的余生中，她的思想依然被诅咒化作浓烟从脑子里泄漏出去。"

# game/script.rpy:8690
translate Chinese witchEnd_b29e448d_1:

  # "Alas, despite everything you'd done, she still remained sworn to the Devil. Her promise to him was kept in a secret place that he guarded jealously, and you were never able to find it."
  "唉，尽管你做了一切，她依然受制于对魔鬼的契约。她对他的承诺被保存在一个他严密把守的秘密地点，你始终无法找到它。"

# game/script.rpy:8691
translate Chinese witchEnd_9342536c:

  # "Every witch's Sabbath, she was forced to ride away to dance on the peak of Thornton Peak, and commit all kinds of wicked and terrible acts in his name."
  "每到巫魔宴，她都被迫骑着扫帚飞去桑顿峰跳舞，并以他的名义犯下各种邪恶可怖的行径。"

# game/script.rpy:8692
translate Chinese witchEnd_6f9f1028_1:

  # "Still, you spent many peaceful months staying with her, cultivating her garden, putting her cottage to rights, and helping her rewrite all her old notebooks again."
  "尽管如此，你还是和她一起度过了许多平静安宁的岁月，培育她的花园，收拾她的小屋，帮她重新写好了所有的旧笔记。"

# game/script.rpy:8694
translate Chinese witchEnd_f1531e98:

  # "She would never be the Girl Who Knew Everything again, but at least she was free. The Devil haunted her no longer."
  "她再也无法成为那个“无所不知的女孩”，但至少她自由了。魔鬼不再纠缠她。"

# game/script.rpy:8701
translate Chinese witchEnd_ad79175a:

  # "But you found you didn't want to leave after all."
  "但你发现自己终究是不想离开。"

# game/script.rpy:8702
translate Chinese witchEnd_fa5eea69:

  # "You stayed there in the cottage, and tended to the herbs and wildflowers, and helped her gather ingredients for her potions."
  "你留在小屋里，照料着草药和野花，帮她收集熬制魔药的材料。"

# game/script.rpy:8704
translate Chinese witchEnd_1c9f79e3:

  # "The pig bid you a tearful farewell and travelled off across the country, gambling with his magic cards until he owned half the world."
  "小猪含泪向你告别，踏上了周游全国的旅程，用他的魔法纸牌赌博，直到他赢下了半个世界。"

# game/script.rpy:8705
translate Chinese witchEnd_82383380:

  # "The witch created salves and poultices for you and your family, keeping them all in good health into their old age."
  "女巫为你和你的家人制作了药膏和敷剂，让你们一直保持着健康的体魄，直到晚年。"

# game/script.rpy:8707
translate Chinese witchEnd_57a2e6ba:

  # "You lived there in quiet happiness for many years."
  "你在那里安静而幸福地生活了许多年。"

# game/script.rpy:8708
translate Chinese witchEnd_b4d71b52:

  # "But youth does not last forever."
  "但青春无法永驻。"

# game/script.rpy:8709
translate Chinese witchEnd_ff76ab68:

  # "One day, you felt yourself wracked with a terrible fever."
  "有一天，你发了一场可怕的高烧，备受折磨。"

# game/script.rpy:8710
translate Chinese witchEnd_6702f09a:

  # "Then, you felt gout take hold of you and make all your limbs twitch, and you were wracked with one illness after another, and you fell into deep sleep for long days."
  "接着，痛风找上了你，引得四肢不停抽搐；接二连三的病痛折磨着你，让你陷入了漫长的昏睡。"

# game/script.rpy:8711
translate Chinese witchEnd_063948c9:

  # "Not even the witch could help you, though she toiled at your bedside for many long hours."
  "即使是女巫也无法帮助你，尽管她已经在你床前辛苦照料了许多个漫长的时辰。"

# game/script.rpy:8712
translate Chinese witchEnd_71c8705a:

  # w "I'm sorry. I-I wish I could do more... I should be able to heal this."
  w "我很抱歉。我——我希望能做得更多……我本该能治好你的。"

# game/script.rpy:8713
translate Chinese witchEnd_ec1df498:

  # pov "Don't worry. I won't die until Death sends Her messengers."
  pov "别担心。死神派信使来之前，我是不会死的。"

# game/script.rpy:8714
translate Chinese witchEnd_c64b28ac:

  # "But as you spoke, there was a knock on the door, and the Witch opened it to reveal the wise mushroom from the forest."
  "但话音未落，敲门声响了。女巫打开门，门外站着的正是森林里那株睿智的蘑菇。"

# game/script.rpy:8716
translate Chinese witchEnd_fe45266e:

  # m "I suppose my curse won't be needed after all."
  m "看来我的诅咒终究是用不上了。"

# game/script.rpy:8717
translate Chinese witchEnd_77865824:

  # m "It is time. Come with me."
  m "时候到了。跟我走吧。"

# game/script.rpy:8724
translate Chinese deathQuestions_8df71dd4:

  # m "The Pale Lady is waiting for you." nointeract
  m "苍白夫人在等你。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:8726
translate Chinese deathQuestions_b2f47c6b:

  # pov "But - is She going to break Her promise? She said She'd send three messengers."
  pov "可是——难道她要违背诺言吗？她说过她会派来三位信使的。"

# game/script.rpy:8727
translate Chinese deathQuestions_416d8e0b:

  # m "Didn't the fever rage at you? Didn't the gout take hold of you and shake you to pieces?"
  m "难道高烧不曾折磨过你吗？难道痛风不曾纠缠过你，把你的身体扯得支离破碎吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8728
translate Chinese deathQuestions_441a07f9:

  # m "She even sent Her sister, Sleep, to remind you of Her."
  m "她甚至派出了她的妹妹——沉睡，来提醒你她的存在。"

# game/script.rpy:8729
translate Chinese deathQuestions_c93d9dba:

  # m "She has sent all Her messengers. Now you must come down to Her kingdom."
  m "她已经派出了所有的信使。现在，你必须随我下到她的国度了。"

# game/script.rpy:8734
translate Chinese deathQuestions_29362efd:

  # m "Of course."
  m "当然可以。"

# game/script.rpy:8741
translate Chinese deathQuestions_642a3ff4:

  # w "I love you too."
  w "我也爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:8742
translate Chinese deathQuestions_50611022:

  # "You embraced, and her tears fell upon you and twisted your cheeks into sprouting flowers."
  "你们相拥在一起，她的眼泪落在你身上，让你的脸颊扭曲，绽放成花朵。"

# game/script.rpy:8743
translate Chinese deathQuestions_f3379bbf:

  # "I wept in the shadows."
  "我在阴影中落泪。"

# game/script.rpy:8744
translate Chinese deathQuestions_252880d6:

  # w "I-I'm sorry. I should have done more. Maybe if I'd checked in one of those older journals again, the one by fieldstien, I know I had a read of it before but I could have given it another try and looked for -"
  w "我——对不起。我本该做得更多。要是我再去翻翻那些古老的手记就好了，菲尔德斯廷写的那本，我知道我以前看过，但我该再找一遍的，去查查——"

# game/script.rpy:8745
translate Chinese deathQuestions_14232d8e:

  # pov "You did everything you could. You have nothing to be sorry about."
  pov "你已经尽力了。你没什么好抱歉的。"

# game/script.rpy:8746
translate Chinese deathQuestions_cb8bfb77:

  # "And you gripped her tight."
  "你紧紧地抱住了她。"

# game/script.rpy:8749
translate Chinese deathQuestions_f494bf5e:

  # pov "Goodbye, my dear friend. I love you, so much."
  pov "再见，我亲爱的朋友。我爱你，非常爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:8750
translate Chinese deathQuestions_bf7aba05:

  # w "G-goodbye. I love you too."
  w "再——再见。我也爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:8751
translate Chinese deathQuestions_50611022_1:

  # "You embraced, and her tears fell upon you and twisted your cheeks into sprouting flowers."
  "你们相拥在一起，她的眼泪落在你身上，让你的脸颊扭曲，绽放成花朵。"

# game/script.rpy:8752
translate Chinese deathQuestions_252880d6_1:

  # w "I-I'm sorry. I should have done more. Maybe if I'd checked in one of those older journals again, the one by fieldstien, I know I had a read of it before but I could have given it another try and looked for -"
  w "我——对不起。我本该做得更多。要是我再去翻翻那些古老的手记就好了，菲尔德斯廷写的那本，我知道我以前看过，但我该再找一遍的，去查查——"

# game/script.rpy:8753
translate Chinese deathQuestions_14232d8e_1:

  # pov "You did everything you could. You have nothing to be sorry about."
  pov "你已经尽力了。你没什么好抱歉的。"

# game/script.rpy:8754
translate Chinese deathQuestions_cb8bfb77_1:

  # "And you gripped her tight."
  "你紧紧地抱住了她。"

# game/script.rpy:8757
translate Chinese deathQuestions_cec7a982:

  # pov "I'm ready."
  pov "我准备好了。"

# game/script.rpy:8758
translate Chinese deathQuestions_cb738ab6:

  # m "No-one's ever ready. But there's no time left."
  m "从来就没人能真正准备好。但已经没时间了。"

# game/script.rpy:8761
translate Chinese deathQuestions_5cfba400:

  # "She gently took you down to the kingdom of Death."
  "她轻柔地带着你，向死神的国度沉去。"

# game/script.rpy:8763
translate Chinese deathQuestions_bf466e0e:

  # "And what happened to you after that, none who live can say."
  "至于那之后你经历了什么，生者无人知晓。"

# game/script.rpy:8765
translate Chinese deathQuestions_a20cefa7:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:8766
translate Chinese deathQuestions_00620a41:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:8767
translate Chinese deathQuestions_79e34931:

  # "What happened to the toad, you ask?"
  "你问那个蟾蜍后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:8771
translate Chinese deathQuestions_d081b486:

  # "You lived there together in quiet happiness. If you have not died, you live there still."
  "你们在那里一起安静而幸福地生活着。如果你们没死，你们至今仍生活在那里。"

# game/script.rpy:8773
translate Chinese deathQuestions_a20cefa7_1:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:8774
translate Chinese deathQuestions_00620a41_1:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:8775
translate Chinese deathQuestions_79e34931_1:

  # "What happened to the toad, you ask?"
  "你问那个蟾蜍后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:8780
translate Chinese deathQuestions_42e33293:

  # "When it was time to leave, you wished the Witch a tearful farewell, and returned to your cottage with your family."
  "到了该离开的时候，你含泪向女巫告别，回到了你家人的小屋。"

# game/script.rpy:8782
translate Chinese deathQuestions_354527b8:

  # "The pig wished you a long and happy life before leaving. He travelled off across the country, gambling with his magic cards until he owned half the world."
  "小猪祝你健康长寿、幸福快乐，然后离开了。他踏上了周游全国的旅程，用他的魔法纸牌赌博，直到他赢下了半个世界。"

# game/script.rpy:8784
translate Chinese deathQuestions_57a2e6ba:

  # "You lived there in quiet happiness for many years."
  "你在那里安静而幸福地生活了许多年。"

# game/script.rpy:8785
translate Chinese deathQuestions_b4d71b52:

  # "But youth does not last forever."
  "但青春无法永驻。"

# game/script.rpy:8786
translate Chinese deathQuestions_ff76ab68:

  # "One day, you felt yourself wracked with a terrible fever."
  "有一天，你发了一场可怕的高烧，备受折磨。"

# game/script.rpy:8787
translate Chinese deathQuestions_6702f09a:

  # "Then, you felt gout take hold of you and make all your limbs twitch, and you were wracked with one illness after another, and you fell into deep sleep for long days."
  "接着，痛风找上了你，引得四肢不停抽搐；接二连三的病痛折磨着你，让你陷入了漫长的昏睡。"

# game/script.rpy:8788
translate Chinese deathQuestions_063948c9:

  # "Not even the witch could help you, though she toiled at your bedside for many long hours."
  "即使是女巫也无法帮助你，尽管她已经在你床前辛苦照料了许多个漫长的时辰。"

# game/script.rpy:8789
translate Chinese deathQuestions_71c8705a:

  # w "I'm sorry. I-I wish I could do more... I should be able to heal this."
  w "我很抱歉。我——我希望能做得更多……我本该能治好你的。"

# game/script.rpy:8790
translate Chinese deathQuestions_ec1df498:

  # pov "Don't worry. I won't die until Death sends Her messengers."
  pov "别担心。死神降下她的信使之前，我是不会死的。"

# game/script.rpy:8791
translate Chinese deathQuestions_c64b28ac:

  # "But as you spoke, there was a knock on the door, and the Witch opened it to reveal the wise mushroom from the forest."
  "但话音未落，敲门声响了。女巫打开门，门外站着的正是森林里那株睿智的蘑菇。"

# game/script.rpy:8793
translate Chinese deathQuestions_fe45266e:

  # m "I suppose my curse won't be needed after all."
  m "看来我的诅咒终究是用不上了。"

# game/script.rpy:8794
translate Chinese deathQuestions_77865824:

  # m "It is time. Come with me."
  m "时候到了。跟我走吧。"

# game/script.rpy:8798
translate Chinese deathQuestions_6066b24e:

  # "You lived there for many long, happy years, visiting the Witch each summer. If you have not died, you live there still."
  "你在那里度过了许多漫长而幸福的岁月，每年夏天都会去拜访女巫。如果你没死，你至今仍生活在那里。"

# game/script.rpy:8800
translate Chinese deathQuestions_a20cefa7_2:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:8801
translate Chinese deathQuestions_00620a41_2:

  # "Oh?"
  "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:8802
translate Chinese deathQuestions_79e34931_2:

  # "What happened to the toad, you ask?"
  "你问那个蟾蜍后来怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:8814
translate Chinese toadDisappears_53f05f71:

  # "After you fell into the flames, he stood alone in the witch's cottage."
  "你掉进火焰后，他独自站在女巫的小屋里。"

# game/script.rpy:8815
translate Chinese toadDisappears_b7cd4b8d:

  # "Bromeliads sprouted from the floorboards. The dense, hot spiral of greenery pressed in around him like the organs of a great beast."
  "凤梨从地板缝隙间萌发。茂密、温热、螺旋生长的绿色植物向他步步紧逼，仿佛巨兽的脏腑。"

# game/script.rpy:8816
translate Chinese toadDisappears_e134df0e:

  # f "Well. This is another fine mess."
  f "好吧。又是个烂摊子。"

# game/script.rpy:8817
translate Chinese toadDisappears_3111f4b8:

  # "He picked up his top hat."
  "他捡起自己的大礼帽。"

# game/script.rpy:8819
translate Chinese toadDisappears_fd3cf690:

  # "There was a sound outside. Almost like a howl. He shivered."
  "外面传来一阵声响。听起来像是嚎叫。他打了个寒颤。"

# game/script.rpy:8820
translate Chinese toadDisappears_d95732ae:

  # f "I-I had best not outstay my welcome. Prickle! Crawl!"
  f "我——我最好还是别赖在这里讨人嫌了。芒刺！游移！"

# game/script.rpy:8823
translate Chinese toadDisappears_20a941dd:

  # "He rushed outside, dove down through the puddle and emerged into the darkness of the forest."
  "他冲到外面，一头扎进水洼，在森林的黑暗里现出了身形。"

# game/script.rpy:8824
translate Chinese toadDisappears_99928de2:

  # f "Shudder! Wink! Are you there?"
  f "战栗！叮铃！你们在吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8825
translate Chinese toadDisappears_f21d4109:

  # "There was no reply. No-one was there."
  "没有回答。那里空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:8826
translate Chinese toadDisappears_01aeb58a:

  # "He searched forward and found the remains of his squash carriage. "
  "他循迹向前，发现了歪瓜马车的残骸。"

# game/script.rpy:8827
translate Chinese toadDisappears_f34ed970:

  # "It had been torn in twain. Jagged claw marks rent the sides."
  "它被撕成了两半。侧面留下了参差不齐的爪痕。"

# game/script.rpy:8828
translate Chinese toadDisappears_087f711e:

  # f "Oh no. No, no, no."
  f "哦，不。不，不，不。"

# game/script.rpy:8830
translate Chinese toadDisappears_66887bc9:

  # "Something stirred in the forest around him. In the space between the trees. "
  "他周围的森林里有什么东西在骚动。在林木幽隙里。"

# game/script.rpy:8833
translate Chinese toadDisappears_b969b42f:

  # "He ran as fast as he could, helter-skelter, tumbling down hills, coat ripped, pants torn."
  "他拼命地跑，跌跌撞撞，连滚带爬地翻下山丘，衣衫褴褛，裤腿撕裂。"

# game/script.rpy:8836
translate Chinese toadDisappears_638e208d:

  # "Something fastened around his ankle."
  "有什么东西缠住了他的脚踝。"

# game/script.rpy:8837
translate Chinese toadDisappears_8b0ec8ca:

  # f "Agh!"
  f "呃啊！"

# game/script.rpy:8838
translate Chinese toadDisappears_2eb82831:

  # "A terrible agony shot through him in an instant, and then was gone."
  "一阵可怕的剧痛瞬间穿透全身，然后又消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:8839
translate Chinese toadDisappears_21a44ed9:

  # "A red, wet stain dripped from his shoe. Red footprints were left behind him as he ran. His foot felt numb. There was no pain."
  "湿乎乎的殷红血水顺着他的鞋子滴落。他奔跑时，身后留下了串串红色血印。他的脚一阵发麻，却没有任何痛觉。"

# game/script.rpy:8842
translate Chinese toadDisappears_ee383d36:

  # "At last he saw the outskirts of town before him, and thanked G-d in heaven for the blessed sight."
  "终于，他看到了前方的城镇边缘，不禁感谢天上的主赐予他这宛如救赎般的景象。"

# game/script.rpy:8845
translate Chinese toadDisappears_b9a570de:

  # "The people of the village were there, cleaning up after the feast."
  "村民们正在那里清理宴会后的残局。"

# game/script.rpy:8850
translate Chinese toadDisappears_2a22a162:

  # f "Please, fine townsfolk, help me! I'm being pursued by a wolf!"
  f "求求你们，好心的镇民们，帮帮我！我被狼追杀了！"

# game/script.rpy:8851
translate Chinese toadDisappears_9232d91b:

  # may "Oh, poor toad. Don't be silly."
  may "噢，可怜的蟾蜍。别傻了。"

# game/script.rpy:8853
translate Chinese toadDisappears_45a425ba:

  # go "There's no need to be afraid."
  go "没什么好怕的。"

# game/script.rpy:8855
translate Chinese toadDisappears_7211360e:

  # h "It's all in your head. There are no wolves in Australia."
  h "都是你的幻觉。澳大利亚没有狼。"

# game/script.rpy:8857
translate Chinese toadDisappears_dd711a2d:

  # gm "It's all in your head! There are no wolves in Australia."
  gm "都是你的幻觉！澳大利亚没有狼。"

# game/script.rpy:8859
translate Chinese toadDisappears_2554a968:

  # sh "Everyone knows that."
  sh "大家都知道。"

# game/script.rpy:8860
translate Chinese toadDisappears_423350d2:

  # f "B-but look! Look at the wound the beast wrought upon me!"
  f "可——可是你们看！看那野兽在我身上留下的伤口！"

# game/script.rpy:8861
translate Chinese toadDisappears_f33ef942:

  # "He brandished his bloody heel."
  "他急切地亮出血淋淋的脚后跟。"

# game/script.rpy:8862
translate Chinese toadDisappears_a7ce10ff:

  # may "Oh dear. Dear toad."
  may "噢，天哪。亲爱的蟾蜍。"

# game/script.rpy:8864
translate Chinese toadDisappears_02651c50:

  # h "You've always had that wound. Don't you remember?"
  h "你一直都有那个伤口。你不记得了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8866
translate Chinese toadDisappears_7d957f7a:

  # gm "You've always had that wound. Don't you remember?"
  gm "你一直都有那个伤口。你不记得了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8867
translate Chinese toadDisappears_61eccab3:

  # may "You were born that way."
  may "你生来就是这样的。"

# game/script.rpy:8870
translate Chinese toadDisappears_c993cc6a:

  # f "I-"
  f "我——"

# game/script.rpy:8871
translate Chinese toadDisappears_698f0848:

  # "His leg disappeared."
  "他的腿消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:8872
translate Chinese toadDisappears_063f356f:

  # f "Argckkhh!"
  f "啊啊啊！"

# game/script.rpy:8873
translate Chinese toadDisappears_72be6d03:

  # "A ragged chunk."
  "一个参差不齐的缺口。"

# game/script.rpy:8874
translate Chinese toadDisappears_c0551aa3:

  # "A split in space."
  "空间中的一道裂缝。"

# game/script.rpy:8875
translate Chinese toadDisappears_fa1d4e93:

  # "The blood flew onto the cobblestones, and then was gone."
  "鲜血飞溅到鹅卵石上，然后就消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:8876
translate Chinese toadDisappears_5ad401ff:

  # "A wet, twisted mess was all that was left."
  "原地只留下一滩湿漉漉的血肉扭结在一起。"

# game/script.rpy:8877
translate Chinese toadDisappears_18199a63:

  # "He fell over into the dirt."
  "他跌倒在泥土里。"

# game/script.rpy:8879
translate Chinese toadDisappears_1a870fb9:

  # h "Oh, you poor thing. Let me help you."
  h "噢，可怜的家伙。让我来帮你。"

# game/script.rpy:8881
translate Chinese toadDisappears_1135a7bc:

  # may "Oh dear, you've gotten yourself into a scrape again. Come on."
  may "噢天哪，你又把自己搞得这么狼狈。来吧。"

# game/script.rpy:8882
translate Chinese toadDisappears_0f1edca1:

  # "They lifted him up and placed him against the fence. He clung to it with one shaking arm."
  "他们把他扶起来，让他靠在栅栏上。他用一只颤抖的手臂紧紧地抓住栅栏。"

# game/script.rpy:8883
translate Chinese toadDisappears_4cab871c:

  # gm "You really shouldn't go out without your cane."
  gm "你出门真的不该不带拐杖。"

# game/script.rpy:8884
translate Chinese toadDisappears_d2610c6a:

  # f "My... cane?"
  f "我的……拐杖？"

# game/script.rpy:8885
translate Chinese toadDisappears_263a6089:

  # may "For your leg. You know."
  may "用来撑腿的呀。你懂的。"

# game/script.rpy:8886
translate Chinese toadDisappears_46a8bedc:

  # may "You've always had one leg."
  may "你一直都只有一条腿。"

# game/script.rpy:8888
translate Chinese toadDisappears_e8db0e6e:

  # "The toad searched his memories and realised that it was true."
  "蟾蜍搜寻着自己的记忆，意识到那是真的。"

# game/script.rpy:8889
translate Chinese toadDisappears_a0cb40d7:

  # "He was born with one leg."
  "他天生就只有一条腿。"

# game/script.rpy:8890
translate Chinese toadDisappears_58cd0a3b:

  # "A tough life, perhaps, but he'd always been able to survive."
  "生活也许很艰难，但他总是能活下来。"

# game/script.rpy:8891
translate Chinese toadDisappears_4bff5929:

  # "How on earth had he forgotten his walking stick?"
  "他怎么会把自己的拐杖给忘了呢？"

# game/script.rpy:8892
translate Chinese toadDisappears_2792a1a8:

  # "Forget his own head next, I expect."
  "我看他下次该把自己的脑袋给忘了。"

# game/script.rpy:8893
translate Chinese toadDisappears_fbdd9e5e:

  # f "I'm terribly sorry, I don't know what came over me. I'll-"
  f "非常抱歉，我不知道自己是怎么了。我这就——"

# game/script.rpy:8896
translate Chinese toadDisappears_96f5fb7f:

  # "His arm was gone. The stump of a shoulder."
  "他的手臂消失了。只剩下一个肩膀的残端。"

# game/script.rpy:8897
translate Chinese toadDisappears_1c845251:

  # "Exposed bone. Matted meat."
  "裸露的骨头。粘连的血肉。"

# game/script.rpy:8898
translate Chinese toadDisappears_0076c8eb:

  # "He cried out in terrible pain, and fell into the dirt once more."
  "他痛得凄厉地叫了起来，再次跌倒在泥土里。"

# game/script.rpy:8899
translate Chinese toadDisappears_459f1f01:

  # may "Well, it's been a long night."
  may "好了，今晚可够漫长的。"

# game/script.rpy:8901
translate Chinese toadDisappears_535ccd6c:

  # h "Yes, we'd best be getting home."
  h "是啊，我们最好还是回家吧。"

# game/script.rpy:8903
translate Chinese toadDisappears_350b75ba:

  # gm "Too right. We'd best be off."
  gm "没错。我们最好走了。"

# game/script.rpy:8904
translate Chinese toadDisappears_4f708341:

  # f "No - please!"
  f "不——求求你们！"

# game/script.rpy:8908
translate Chinese toadDisappears_af7de412:

  # "They ambled off into the night, making pleasant small talk as they headed down the road."
  "他们漫步走入夜色，一边沿着路走，一边愉快地闲聊着。"

# game/script.rpy:8909
translate Chinese toadDisappears_d7b283df:

  # "The toad tried to pull himself along in the dirt. He had no legs to walk with. Just a single, shaking arm."
  "蟾蜍试图在泥土中拖动自己的身体。他没有可以行走的腿。只有一只颤抖的手臂。"

# game/script.rpy:8910
translate Chinese toadDisappears_e545f9c0:

  # f "Help me... G-d, help me…"
  f "救救我……主啊，救救我……"

# game/script.rpy:8913
translate Chinese toadDisappears_7b671798:

  # "It has been tough, hasn't it, Toad? Surviving all these years, with just one arm."
  "很艰难吧，蟾蜍？这么多年来，只靠着一只手臂活下来。"

# game/script.rpy:8914
translate Chinese toadDisappears_144ad7fd:

  # "Just a single, broken hand to drag yourself along with."
  "只靠着一只残破的手，拖着自己苟延残喘。"

# game/script.rpy:8915
translate Chinese toadDisappears_d029b513:

  # "But you did it. What an inspiration."
  "但你做到了。真是个鼓舞人心的榜样。"

# game/script.rpy:8916
translate Chinese toadDisappears_31901ab3:

  # f "Who… Who are you?"
  f "谁……你是谁？"

# game/script.rpy:8917
translate Chinese toadDisappears_942a3654:

  # "How are you asking that question, Toad?"
  "你怎么还能问出这个问题呢，蟾蜍？"

# game/script.rpy:8918
translate Chinese toadDisappears_b0ae0655:

  # "You were born with no mouth."
  "你生来就没有嘴。"

# game/script.rpy:8919
translate Chinese toadDisappears_ccf50f88:

  # f "Mhmm... Mhmmm!"
  f "呜呜……呜呜呜！"

# game/script.rpy:8920
translate Chinese toadDisappears_40867c13:

  # "The poor creature attempted to scream. A pitiful sight indeed."
  "这可怜的家伙试图尖叫。真是不忍直视。"

# game/script.rpy:8921
translate Chinese toadDisappears_195565a1:

  # "The townsfolk shook their heads, and withdrew indoors. He was always like this. Better not to dwell on it."
  "镇民们摇着头，退回了屋里。他总是这样。最好别去多想。"

# game/script.rpy:8929
translate Chinese toadDisappears_14103368:

  # "And after all, now that they thought about it, what was there to dwell on? There was no-one there."
  "毕竟，现在仔细一想，又有什么好多想的呢？那里空无一人。"

# game/script.rpy:8930
translate Chinese toadDisappears_ad8a0e93:

  # "The streets were empty. There was never anything there at all."
  "街道空荡荡的。那里从来就没有任何东西。"

# game/script.rpy:8933
translate Chinese toadDisappears_ed11100d:

  # "Nothing but a top hat and an old coat, that blew away in the wind and were gone."
  "只有一顶大礼帽和一件旧外套，随风飞远，再无踪影。"

# game/script.rpy:8935
translate Chinese toadDisappears_829a2d56:

  # "They were never seen again."
  "再也没有人见过它们。"

# game/script.rpy:8966
translate Chinese witchSolo_644c2433:

  # "You walked through the woods."
  "你走在树林里。"

# game/script.rpy:8967
translate Chinese witchSolo_f3c24004:

  # "Somehow, you already knew the way to the witch's cottage."
  "不知为何，你已经知道去女巫小屋的路了。"

# game/script.rpy:8970
translate Chinese witchSolo_9107b701:

  # "Had you ever been this way before? You couldn't recall."
  "你以前走过这条路吗？你记不起来了。"

# game/script.rpy:8973
translate Chinese witchSolo_9107b701_1:

  # "Had you ever been this way before? You couldn't recall."
  "你以前走过这条路吗？你记不起来了。"

# game/script.rpy:8977
translate Chinese gilPathShowingWitch_313a1e6d:

  # "The trail took you through a dense swamp of crooked mangroves."
  "顺着这条小路，你穿过了一片虬结着红树林的茂密沼泽。"

# game/script.rpy:8978
translate Chinese gilPathShowingWitch_44715db9:

  # "Soon, you began to see a glimmer of silver light in the darkness."
  "很快，你在黑暗中看到了一线闪烁的银光。"

# game/script.rpy:8979
translate Chinese gilPathShowingWitch_2b8e1ffc:

  # "The swamp was covered in puddles of water from the rains. Each one shone with light."
  "沼泽里到处都是雨后积起的水洼。每一个都闪烁着光芒。"

# game/script.rpy:8980
translate Chinese gilPathShowingWitch_0a2eced7:

  # "All around you, the woods were dark and empty. But when you looked into the water, you saw the reflection of a shining cottage below."
  "你周围的树林黑暗而空旷。但当你向水里看去时，却看到下方倒映着一座闪闪发光的小屋。"

# game/script.rpy:8984
translate Chinese gilPathShowingWitch_0ae9bcd0:

  # ""
  ""

# game/script.rpy:8988
translate Chinese gilPathShowingWitch_1668d521:

  # "For a brief moment, you thought you saw a figure reflected in the water. But as soon as you blinked, it was gone."
  "有那么短短的一瞬，你以为看到水里倒映着一个人影。但你一眨眼，它就不见了。"

# game/script.rpy:8998
translate Chinese puddleSolo_e7f50077:

  # "You crawled to the edge and looked down into the puddle."
  "你爬到边缘，低头看向水洼。"

# game/script.rpy:9001
translate Chinese puddleSolo_307d5c87:

  # "The cottage in the reflection shone with bright light, as if the setting sun was behind it."
  "倒影中的小屋闪耀着明亮的光芒，仿佛夕阳正从它背后照来。"

# game/script.rpy:9004
translate Chinese puddleSolo_61023088:

  # "There was no trace of a cottage in the world above the water."
  "在水面上的世界里，根本找不到任何小屋的踪迹。"

# game/script.rpy:9008
translate Chinese puddleSolo_26014a45:

  # "You picked up a stick from the ground, and tossed it into the puddle."
  "你从地上捡起一根树枝，扔进水洼里。"

# game/script.rpy:9009
translate Chinese puddleSolo_ff499cad:

  # "It fell in without a single ripple in the water."
  "树枝落入水中，水面却未泛起一丝涟漪。"

# game/script.rpy:9010
translate Chinese puddleSolo_ac59d260:

  # "You saw it drop through into the reflection, and land close to the cottage."
  "你看到它落入倒影里，落在小屋附近。"

# game/script.rpy:9011
translate Chinese puddleSolo_37e73c24:

  # "You looked up. There was no trace of it in the world outside the reflection."
  "你抬起头。在倒影外的世界里，根本找不到那根树枝的踪迹。"

# game/script.rpy:9016
translate Chinese puddleSolo_8f1abeb8:

  # "You grabbed the pig to you, then leapt into the puddle."
  "你一把抓过小猪，然后跳进了水洼。"

# game/script.rpy:9018
translate Chinese puddleSolo_f72651ac:

  # "You leapt into the puddle."
  "你跳进了水洼。"

# game/script.rpy:9021
translate Chinese puddleSolo_34bd7779:

  # "The world flipped over."
  "世界翻转了。"

# game/script.rpy:9022
translate Chinese puddleSolo_17e60d48:

  # "You felt the water pass over you, and a cool chill tingled all through your body."
  "你感觉到水流漫过你，一股清凉的寒意传遍全身。"

# game/script.rpy:9025
translate Chinese puddleSolo_f108985a:

  # "When you opened your eyes, you were standing right way up again."
  "当你睁开双眼时，发现自己又重新正立了过来。"

# game/script.rpy:9026
translate Chinese puddleSolo_0fec5802:

  # "The puddle you had jumped into was now a floor, like a silver mirror."
  "刚刚跳入的那个水洼，此刻变成了银镜般的地板。"

# game/script.rpy:9027
translate Chinese puddleSolo_f590bf40:

  # "The world all around you shone white."
  "周围的世界闪耀着白光。"

# game/script.rpy:9028
translate Chinese puddleSolo_fb1d5a14:

  # "At the centre of the puddle was the cottage, shining with light."
  "水洼的中心就是那座小屋，闪耀着光芒。"

# game/script.rpy:9031
translate Chinese puddleSolo_6c41c5cb:

  # "Up over the walls grew a riot of herbs and flowers of every type, planted directly in the soil, rambling over everything and growing in a lush green-grass garden on the roof. "
  "墙上长满了各种各样的草药和花朵，它们扎根于泥土里，肆意蔓延缠绕着一切，甚至在屋顶上长成了一片郁郁葱葱的青草花园。"

# game/script.rpy:9033
translate Chinese puddleSolo_694585b8:

  # "The pig munched on some violets blooming from the windowsill."
  "小猪嚼起了在窗台上绽放的几朵紫罗兰。"

# game/script.rpy:9034
translate Chinese puddleSolo_f890bbcc:

  # w "Oh good!"
  w "太好了！"

# game/script.rpy:9035
translate Chinese puddleSolo_14ec4b4f:

  # "You stumbled back in surprise as a small, witchy figure popped out from behind the herbs."
  "一个女巫般矮小的身影从草药丛后猛地窜了出来，吓得你踉跄着退了几步。"

# game/script.rpy:9036
translate Chinese puddleSolo_7ed41cad:

  # "Her hands were covered in ink. She had a fountain pen tucked behind her ear, a chaotic scramble of notepaper tucked under her arm and a thick bundle of string wrapped around her hand."
  "她的手上沾满了墨水，耳朵后夹着一支钢笔，腋下夹着一叠杂乱的便签纸，手上缠着一大捆细绳。"

# game/script.rpy:9037
translate Chinese puddleSolo_82028319:

  # w "You're just in time. [povname], right?"
  w "你来得正是时候。[povname]，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:9038
translate Chinese puddleSolo_0f7d6c66:

  # "She took out a fork wrapped in string and planted it firmly by her doorstep. It was labelled \"A1\"."
  "她拿出一把缠着细绳的叉子，牢牢地插在门阶旁。上面贴着标签“A1”。"

# game/script.rpy:9039
translate Chinese puddleSolo_27ab82eb:

  # "You looked around and noticed that her whole backyard was littered with forks stabbed into the ground. Each fork was tied with a knot of string and labelled with a letter of the alphabet. The lines of string led to a massive tangle of twine in her front window."
  "你环顾四周，发现她的整个后院里横七竖八地插满了叉子。每把叉子上都系着一个绳结，贴着字母标签。这些细绳一直延伸到她前窗处，缠成了一个巨大杂乱的线团。"

# game/script.rpy:9040
translate Chinese puddleSolo_007fab50:

  # w "Come on. You're just in time for the next round of experiments."
  w "快来。你刚好赶上下一轮实验。"

# game/script.rpy:9041
translate Chinese puddleSolo_f22b4ceb:

  # "She grabbed your hand and pulled you inside."
  "她抓住你的手，把你拉了进去。"

# game/script.rpy:9044
translate Chinese puddleSolo_e88f7e75:

  # "Inside the cottage was a wild clutter of books and herbs and plants of all description, growing up the walls and roof."
  "小屋里杂乱无章地堆满了书，各种各样的草药和植物顺着墙壁和屋顶疯长。"

# game/script.rpy:9045
translate Chinese puddleSolo_4477c5b1:

  # "The cottage was cramped, but the walls were covered with lines of string and notes and paper scrawled with indecipherable writing."
  "小屋很狭窄，但墙上挂满了细绳、便签，纸张上潦草地画满了难以辨认的字迹。"

# game/script.rpy:9047
translate Chinese puddleSolo_62818470:

  # "The floor was covered in a network of flags and string in a grid pattern, each flag marked with a letter and number. You stepped over them gingerly to enter the room."
  "地板上布满了网格状的旗帜和细绳网络，每面旗帜上都标有字母和数字。你小心翼翼地跨过它们走进房间。"

# game/script.rpy:9048
translate Chinese puddleSolo_8f83047e:

  # "A message was painted across the wall in giant red letters: \"I OWN THIRTY TWO FORKS.\""
  "墙上用巨大的红色颜料涂着一行大字：“我有三十二把叉子。”"

# game/script.rpy:9049
translate Chinese puddleSolo_adc3c8b7:

  # w "We have two experiments running at the moment."
  w "我们目前正在进行两项实验。"

# game/script.rpy:9052
translate Chinese puddleSolo_d1baadd6:

  # "You heard something move outside the cottage."
  "你听到小屋外面有什么东西在移动。"

# game/script.rpy:9076
translate Chinese witchExperiments_c8d70a03:

  # "You looked at the walls of the cottage and noticed something wasn't right with them."
  "你看着小屋的墙壁，发现它们有些不对劲。"

# game/script.rpy:9077
translate Chinese witchExperiments_809341a7:

  # "They looked like a picture that had been folded in on itself and reflected."
  "它们看起来就像是一幅向内对折后相互映射的画作。"

# game/script.rpy:9078
translate Chinese witchExperiments_4854b131:

  # "The witch didn't seem to notice."
  "女巫似乎没有注意到。"

# game/script.rpy:9082
translate Chinese witchExperiments_a1716ce3:

  # "You blinked and rubbed your eyes furiously. There was a queer distortion in the air."
  "你眨了眨眼，拼命揉着眼睛。空气中有一种奇怪的扭曲。"

# game/script.rpy:9083
translate Chinese witchExperiments_acf00d0b:

  # "The air was completely clear, and the cottage was well-lit."
  "空气十分澄澈，小屋里光线也很充足。"

# game/script.rpy:9084
translate Chinese witchExperiments_acdcbd81:

  # "But still, for some reason you couldn't see more than five feet ahead of you."
  "但不知为何，你只能看清前方不到五英尺的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:9088
translate Chinese witchExperiments_1f05e6f0:

  # "You heard a scrabbling sound."
  "你听到一阵抓挠声。"

# game/script.rpy:9089
translate Chinese witchExperiments_3fcdfd33:

  # "It was coming from inside you. Like claws scratching in the creases of your brain."
  "声音是从你体内传来的。就像有爪子在抓挠着你大脑的沟回。"

# game/script.rpy:9090
translate Chinese witchExperiments_5fd8e849:

  # "Trying to get in."
  "试图钻进去。"

# game/script.rpy:9091
translate Chinese witchExperiments_e31b0316:

  # "You were having difficulty speaking. But you slowly walked forward and kept asking questions."
  "你说话变得困难起来。但你还是慢慢走上前，继续问着问题。"

# game/script.rpy:9096
translate Chinese witchExperiments_433fc246:

  # "You felt a deep pressure settle on you. Like being at the bottom of the ocean. Compressing your body from all angles. Your intestines knotted and twisted in coiled spirals."
  "你感到一股沉重的压力倾轧而来。就像身处海底，从四面八方挤压着你的身体。你的肠胃绞结，像螺旋般痛苦地扭曲着。"

# game/script.rpy:9097
translate Chinese witchExperiments_74fe3587:

  # "It was done."
  "结束了。"

# game/script.rpy:9098
translate Chinese witchExperiments_5d329421:

  # "The witch noticed nothing."
  "女巫什么也没注意到。"

# game/script.rpy:9099
translate Chinese witchExperiments_3cd40010:

  # w "We need to warn people. Your family, especially."
  w "我们必须警告大家。尤其是你的家人。"

# game/script.rpy:9105
translate Chinese witchExperiments_661baa8e:

  # w "What do you want to see?" nointeract
  w "你想看什么？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:9107
translate Chinese witchExperiments_c84b8e99:

  # w "Crystal ball. Perks of being a witch."
  w "水晶球。当女巫的好处。"

# game/script.rpy:9108
translate Chinese witchExperiments_a00f2320:

  # w "I was watching your house."
  w "我一直在观察你的房子。"

# game/script.rpy:9109
translate Chinese witchExperiments_f5b37c87:

  # "She laid her pile of notes down on the kitchen bench and scribbled in them as she talked."
  "她把那叠笔记撂在厨房的工作台上，一边说一边在上面草草记录着。"

# game/script.rpy:9110
translate Chinese witchExperiments_fcf8d56b:

  # "There were dark bags under her eyes. It was clear she hadn't slept in days."
  "她的眼底有很重的黑眼圈。很明显她已经好几天没睡了。"

# game/script.rpy:9111
translate Chinese witchExperiments_c0416782:

  # w "I was so happy when I saw you were coming. There's something here you need to see."
  w "看到你来我太高兴了。这里有些东西你必须得看看。"

# game/script.rpy:9117
translate Chinese witchExperiments_4ee95f3b:

  # pov "So what's experiment 1?"
  pov "那么一号实验是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:9118
translate Chinese witchExperiments_322c9104:

  # "The witch gestured to the network of flags at her feet."
  "女巫指了指她脚下的旗帜网络。"

# game/script.rpy:9119
translate Chinese witchExperiments_ca0e9b8d:

  # w "This is what started everything."
  w "这就是一切的开端。"

# game/script.rpy:9120
translate Chinese witchExperiments_b6bfc703:

  # w "When I woke up a few days ago, I noticed something."
  w "几天前我醒来时，注意到了一件事。"

# game/script.rpy:9121
translate Chinese witchExperiments_a35c9984:

  # w "Usually when I make my morning tea, it takes me 4 steps to get from the kettle to my front door."
  w "通常我泡早茶时，从水壶走到前门需要走四步。"

# game/script.rpy:9122
translate Chinese witchExperiments_5f488e92:

  # w "But when I made it that morning... it took me 3 steps."
  w "但那天早上我泡茶时……我只走了三步。"

# game/script.rpy:9123
translate Chinese witchExperiments_5535b95b:

  # pov "What?"
  pov "什么？"

# game/script.rpy:9124
translate Chinese witchExperiments_66976c91:

  # w "It's shrinking. You see?"
  w "它在缩小。看到了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9125
translate Chinese witchExperiments_d05ff6c7:

  # "She points at the grid of flags laid all across the cottage floor."
  "她指着按网格状铺满整个小屋地板的旗帜。"

# game/script.rpy:9126
translate Chinese witchExperiments_dcf49389:

  # w "The flags start here."
  w "旗帜从这里开始。"

# game/script.rpy:9127
translate Chinese witchExperiments_229c5bae:

  # "She pointed to the front left corner of the cottage, at a flag labelled \"G-02\"."
  "她指着小屋左前角一面标有“G-02”的旗帜。"

# game/script.rpy:9128
translate Chinese witchExperiments_df0be604:

  # w "And they end here."
  w "在这里结束。"

# game/script.rpy:9129
translate Chinese witchExperiments_95265691:

  # "She points to the lower right corner of the house, at a flag labelled \"Z-10\"."
  "她指着房子右下角一面标有“Z-10”的旗帜。"

# game/script.rpy:9130
translate Chinese witchExperiments_fd2bd86e:

  # w "But why would I do that? Why would I start the naming system at G-02, instead of A-01? How does that make sense as a numbering system?"
  w "但我为什么要那样做？我为什么不从A-01开始，而是从G-02开始命名？这样的编号系统怎么说得通？"

# game/script.rpy:9132
translate Chinese witchExperiments_d64e2560:

  # pov "It... doesn't."
  pov "这……说不通。"

# game/script.rpy:9133
translate Chinese witchExperiments_e63fdc3b:

  # w "Exactly."
  w "没错。"

# game/script.rpy:9134
translate Chinese witchExperiments_ac2ca41e:

  # w "Here's my hypothesis. The initial numbering system {i}began at A-01{/i}. Since then, the space has shrunk."
  w "我的假设是：最初的编号系统就是{i}从A-01开始的{/i}。但从那以后，空间缩小了。"

# game/script.rpy:9135
translate Chinese witchExperiments_76615cc5:

  # w "That's why the system now begins at this flag here, \"H-03.\""
  w "这就是为什么现在的系统从这面标着“H-03”的旗帜开始。"

# game/script.rpy:9136
translate Chinese witchExperiments_671aac6a:

  # "She pointed at the starting flag."
  "她指着那面起始旗帜。"

# game/script.rpy:9137
translate Chinese witchExperiments_2e091adf:

  # pov "But if the cottage was shrinking, we'd notice it."
  pov "但如果小屋在缩小，我们会注意到的。"

# game/script.rpy:9138
translate Chinese witchExperiments_b1e3ae77:

  # w "Not necessarily. My theory is that there is some kind of pressure, or force, that is stopping us from noticing or remembering. I just couldn't prove it - until I hit on the fork hypothesis."
  w "不一定。我的理论是，存在某种压力或力量，在阻止我们去察觉或记忆。我只是一直无法证明这一点——直到我想出了叉子假说。"

# game/script.rpy:9139
translate Chinese witchExperiments_b06f6851:

  # "She looked at you with a cold certainty."
  "她用一种冰冷而笃定的眼神看着你。"

# game/script.rpy:9140
translate Chinese witchExperiments_32f9159f:

  # w "Things are being devoured. Not just from physical reality. From our minds."
  w "事物正在被吞噬。不仅仅是从物理现实里。更是从我们的意识里。"

# game/script.rpy:9141
translate Chinese witchExperiments_875ce893:

  # "You stared down at the starting flag, in the front left corner of the cottage."
  "你低头盯着小屋左前角的那面起始旗帜。"

# game/script.rpy:9142
translate Chinese witchExperiments_8404e708:

  # "It read \"I-03\". Just like it always did."
  "上面写着“I-03”。一直都是如此。"

# game/script.rpy:9147
translate Chinese witchExperiments_902ec136:

  # "The witch took you over to her front window, which you could see was stuffed with a giant, knotted network of string."
  "女巫带你走到她的前窗，只见那里塞着一张巨大且纠结的绳网。"

# game/script.rpy:9148
translate Chinese witchExperiments_7dbe6338:

  # "The string was labelled with all the letters of the alphabet. It stretched out through the window."
  "细绳上贴着所有的字母标签，一直延伸出窗外。"

# game/script.rpy:9149
translate Chinese witchExperiments_9f3e1c54:

  # "You looked outside and saw that it was tied onto dozens of forks stuck into the soil, all over her property."
  "你向外望去，看到绳子绑在几十把插进泥土的叉子上，遍布了整个院子。"

# game/script.rpy:9150
translate Chinese witchExperiments_58c9b996:

  # w "Once I encountered the Lacuna phenomenon, I tried to think of a way to measure it."
  w "当我遭遇“空缺”现象后，我试图想出一种测量它的方法。"

# game/script.rpy:9151
translate Chinese witchExperiments_a601e67a:

  # pov "Lacuna?"
  pov "空缺？"

# game/script.rpy:9152
translate Chinese witchExperiments_708bcce4:

  # w "A gap, a blind spot. A space that shouldn't be there."
  w "一个缺口，一个盲区。一个不应该存在的空间。"

# game/script.rpy:9153
translate Chinese witchExperiments_f0aa4a54:

  # w "I tried to figure out where it's coming from - what's causing it. I tested out time of day - no results there. Are some objects more likely to disappear than others? Again, no visible pattern there. "
  w "我试图找出它是从哪里来的，是什么导致了它。我测试了时间因素，没得出结论。有些物体比其他物体更容易消失吗？同样，没有明显的规律。"

# game/script.rpy:9154
translate Chinese witchExperiments_e864c83b:

  # w "I had a breakthrough when I considered that it might be {i}location based{/i}. Emanating from a particular point. The closer an object is to that point, the more likely it is to disappear. But I couldn't make any meaningful progress because I couldn't prove whether or not something had disappeared."
  w "当我考虑到它可能是{i}受制于位置{/i}，也就是从某个特定原点向外辐射时，我取得了突破。物体离那个点越近，就越有可能消失。但我无法取得任何实质性的进展，因为我无法证明某个东西到底有没有消失。"

# game/script.rpy:9157
translate Chinese witchExperiments_636fb602:

  # "She held up a fork."
  "她举起一把叉子。"

# game/script.rpy:9158
translate Chinese witchExperiments_56d7d2fa:

  # w "Say this fork vanished. And not only that, but it vanished so completely that you never remembered it existing at all. How could you prove that it ever existed?"
  w "假设这把叉子消失了。不仅如此，它还消失得极其彻底，以至于你完全不记得它曾存在过。你要怎么证明它曾经存在过？"

# game/script.rpy:9165
translate Chinese witchExperiments_02c5d8a3:

  # w "How do you prove something {i}used{/i} to exist, if that thing now {i}does not exist, and never did?{/i}" nointeract
  w "如果一个东西现在{i}不存在，并且从未存在过{/i}，你要怎么证明它{i}曾经{/i}存在过？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:9167
translate Chinese witchExperiments_cf966a07:

  # w "That's the scary part. Even my notes no longer mention the fork ever existing."
  w "这才是最可怕的地方。连我的笔记里都不再提及这把叉子曾经存在过。"

# game/script.rpy:9168
translate Chinese witchExperiments_32fefa38:

  # w "Somehow even they have been re-written by the new, forkless reality."
  w "不知为何，连它们都被这个新的、没有叉子的现实给重写了。"

# game/script.rpy:9169
translate Chinese witchExperiments_c516578a:

  # w "No, I've only found one way to detect the change."
  w "不，我只找到了一种检测这种变化的方法。"

# game/script.rpy:9171
translate Chinese witchExperiments_cc95a1ba:

  # w "Fantastic idea, but sadly impractical. I have consulted the Devil on this, of course."
  w "想法很奇妙，但遗憾的是不切实际。当然，关于这个问题我已经请教过魔鬼了。"

# game/script.rpy:9172
translate Chinese witchExperiments_fbdb02b6:

  # w "I suspect He knows more than he's letting on, but sadly His comments have been completely unscientific. Totally useless for an experiment like this."
  w "我怀疑他知道的比他透露的要多，但遗憾的是他的言论完全不符合科学。对这种实验来说毫无用处。"

# game/script.rpy:9173
translate Chinese witchExperiments_c516578a_1:

  # w "No, I've only found one way to detect the change."
  w "不，我只找到了一种检测这种变化的方法。"

# game/script.rpy:9175
translate Chinese witchExperiments_7c57e5e3:

  # pov "I... well..."
  pov "我……嗯……"

# game/script.rpy:9176
translate Chinese witchExperiments_7f90118d:

  # pov "I don't think you can, can you?"
  pov "我觉得你证明不了，不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9178
translate Chinese witchExperiments_f0443a78:

  # w "String."
  w "细绳。"

# game/script.rpy:9179
translate Chinese witchExperiments_b7cbc602:

  # "She reached up and quickly tugged at each piece of string in the window in turn. Most of them held firm. One of them showed no resistance when she tugged."
  "她伸出手，迅速依次拉扯窗户上的每根细绳。大多数绳子都绷得笔直，纹丝不动。但当她拉到其中一根时，却没有遇到任何阻力。"

# game/script.rpy:9180
translate Chinese witchExperiments_ca7c5330:

  # "She pulled that one through the window. It was a long, long piece and she rapidly wound it up until the end came through the window."
  "她把那根绳子从窗户拉了进来。那是一根很长很长的绳子，她快速地收线，直到绳端穿过窗户。"

# game/script.rpy:9181
translate Chinese witchExperiments_6e2ac586:

  # "The end was tied into a loop with nothing inside."
  "绳端打成了一个空圈，里面什么也没有。"

# game/script.rpy:9182
translate Chinese witchExperiments_719d18c0:

  # w "You see?"
  w "你看？"

# game/script.rpy:9183
translate Chinese witchExperiments_7d346e3c:

  # w "When an object vanishes, everything around it stays the same."
  w "当一个物体消失时，它周围的一切都保持原样。"

# game/script.rpy:9184
translate Chinese witchExperiments_0a05f176:

  # w "So even though the fork is gone, {i}{b}the string remains.{/b}{/i}"
  w "所以，即便叉子不见了，{i}{b}绳子依然还在。{/b}{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:9185
translate Chinese witchExperiments_d389b9ec:

  # "She pronounced this last part with maniacal glee."
  "她带着一种癫狂的欣喜说出了最后那句话。"

# game/script.rpy:9186
translate Chinese witchExperiments_dd6f49f9:

  # w "The phenomenon seems to be able to wipe objects from our memories, but it's not a perfect deletion. The physical signs that the object used to exist are still there."
  w "这种现象似乎能将物体从我们的记忆中抹去，但这种抹除并不彻底。物体曾经存在过的物理痕迹依然存在。"

# game/script.rpy:9187
translate Chinese witchExperiments_d15dd227:

  # w "So when I pull back a piece of string that no longer has a fork in it, that means {i}a fork must have been there, and it disappeared.{/i}"
  w "所以，当我拽回一根没拴着叉子的绳子时，这就意味着{i}这根绳上绝对曾经拴过一把叉子，只是它消失了。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:9188
translate Chinese witchExperiments_f7a25e8f:

  # w "From there it was simple. All I had to do is tie all my forks with pieces of string, and laying them out in a grid network, and record the location of each piece of string that doesn't have a fork in it. "
  w "接下来的事就简单了。我只需要用绳子把所有的叉子拴起来，把它们排列成网格阵列，然后记录下每一根空绳子的位置就可以。"

# game/script.rpy:9189
translate Chinese witchExperiments_faf09acf:

  # "She carefully placed the string next to a big row of other pieces of looped string. Then she pointed at the writing on her wall that said \"I OWN TWENTY SEVEN FORKS.\""
  "她小心翼翼地把这根绳子放在了一大排打着空圈的绳子旁边。然后指着墙上的字：“我有二十七把叉子”。"

# game/script.rpy:9190
translate Chinese witchExperiments_6cb908be:

  # w "This message says I own twenty seven forks. But I have thirteen {i}forkless{/i} pieces of string. That means at least thirteen forks have disappeared since this experiment began."
  w "墙上的字写着我有二十七把叉子。但我却有十三根{i}缺了叉子{/i}的绳子。这就意味着，自实验开始以来，至少有十三把叉子消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:9191
translate Chinese witchExperiments_7f6552a9:

  # w "The question then of course is, why has the message changed to fit the new forkless reality - yet the strings are left behind?"
  w "那么问题自然来了，为什么墙上的字发生了改变，去迎合那个没有叉子的新现实——而绳子却留了下来？"

# game/script.rpy:9192
translate Chinese witchExperiments_a3024227:

  # w "Does this anomaly have some kind of limited ability to warp language, specifically?"
  w "这种异常现象是否具有某种有限的能力，专门用来扭曲语言？"

# game/script.rpy:9193
translate Chinese witchExperiments_10397690:

  # w "It almost seems to suggest some kind of active sentience behind it. It notices some things, and changes them, but misses other things. Like it's been carelessly censored."
  w "这几乎暗示着它背后潜藏着某种主动的感知力。它注意到了一些东西，改变了它们，但又遗漏了其他东西。就像是经过了一场粗心大意的审查。"

# game/script.rpy:9194
translate Chinese witchExperiments_50135aed:

  # "She whipped out her pencil and began recording a pattern of dots on her grid."
  "她迅速掏出铅笔，开始在她的网格上记录下一组点阵图案。"

# game/script.rpy:9195
translate Chinese witchExperiments_6c3435af:

  # "You noticed a place in the top left of the grid labelled \"INCIDENT ZONE\"."
  "你注意到网格左上方有一个地方标着“事件区”。"

# game/script.rpy:9196
translate Chinese witchExperiments_d96039c9:

  # pov "So... where are the disappearances coming from?"
  pov "那么……这些消失现象的源头在哪里？"

# game/script.rpy:9197
translate Chinese witchExperiments_7c4a93e2:

  # pov "Is that what your grid shows?"
  pov "你的网格上显示的就是这个吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9198
translate Chinese witchExperiments_21086076:

  # w "That's why I was so glad to speak to you."
  w "所以我这么高兴能跟你谈谈。"

# game/script.rpy:9199
translate Chinese witchExperiments_eac8f6ec:

  # "She tapped the INCIDENT ZONE label."
  "她点了点“事件区”的标签。"

# game/script.rpy:9200
translate Chinese witchExperiments_455cbb46:

  # w "It's your house."
  w "是你家。"

# game/script.rpy:9201
translate Chinese witchExperiments_bf904c87:

  # w "And it seems to be moving outward."
  w "而且它似乎正在向外蔓延。"

# game/script.rpy:9206
translate Chinese witchExperiments_b26797a7:

  # "You noticed a small closet in the back of the cottage, with a sign on the door said \"Experiment Site 3\"."
  "你注意到小屋后面有一个小壁橱，门上挂着块牌子，写着“三号实验点”。"

# game/script.rpy:9207
translate Chinese witchExperiments_226ca540:

  # pov "What's that one?"
  pov "那是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:9208
translate Chinese witchExperiments_f1d90117:

  # w "Hmm?"
  w "嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:9209
translate Chinese witchExperiments_80d60fb0:

  # w "Oh... I, uh..."
  w "哦……我，呃……"

# game/script.rpy:9210
translate Chinese witchExperiments_3e085dc0:

  # "She looked confused."
  "她看起来很困惑。"

# game/script.rpy:9211
translate Chinese witchExperiments_e5b3eede:

  # "You opened the closet and peered in carefully."
  "你打开壁橱，小心翼翼地往里瞧。"

# game/script.rpy:9212
translate Chinese witchExperiments_188ae484:

  # "Inside was a tiny set of gentlemen's clothes, carefully folded on a stool. Small enough for a rat to wear."
  "里面放着一套极小的男士西装，整整齐齐地叠在一张凳子上。小到只有老鼠才穿得下。"

# game/script.rpy:9213
translate Chinese witchExperiments_6c7ec6fd:

  # "A tiny top hat was placed on top of the pile, with a pair of miniature dress shoes next to it."
  "一顶小巧的礼帽放在这叠衣服的最上面，旁边是一双迷你正装鞋。"

# game/script.rpy:9214
translate Chinese witchExperiments_7f135446:

  # pov "What is this?"
  pov "这是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:9215
translate Chinese witchExperiments_275e7445:

  # "The longer you stared at tiny bundle of clothes, the more a sense of powerful and implicit wrongness crawled under your skin."
  "你盯着这叠小衣服看的时间越长，一种强烈而隐秘的违和感就越是爬满你的全身。"

# game/script.rpy:9216
translate Chinese witchExperiments_fcbf89d4:

  # "Something about them didn't fit. They didn't belong here."
  "它们身上有些东西不对劲。它们不属于这里。"

# game/script.rpy:9217
translate Chinese witchExperiments_400b272f:

  # w "I don't remember this."
  w "我不记得有这个。"

# game/script.rpy:9218
translate Chinese witchExperiments_858c949b:

  # "The closet was suffocating. There was barely room to breathe. You felt the urge to get out in the fresh air."
  "壁橱里令人窒息。几乎没有呼吸的空间。你迫切地想出去呼吸一下新鲜空气。"

# game/script.rpy:9219
translate Chinese witchExperiments_f332133d:

  # "You forced yourself to move closer to the clothes. You picked up one of the tiny dress shoes. The bottom was encrusted with mud."
  "你强迫自己凑近那些衣服。你拿起其中一只极小的正装鞋。鞋底结满了泥垢。"

# game/script.rpy:9220
translate Chinese witchExperiments_714f817f:

  # pov "They must be the clothes from... an old childhood toy you used to have."
  pov "它们肯定是……你小时候的一个旧玩具的衣服。"

# game/script.rpy:9221
translate Chinese witchExperiments_849c2f86:

  # pov "It's probably nothing."
  pov "大概没什么大不了的。"

# game/script.rpy:9222
translate Chinese witchExperiments_ccae651a:

  # w "Of course. Yes of course, that must be it!"
  w "当然。对，当然了，肯定是那样！"

# game/script.rpy:9223
translate Chinese witchExperiments_adff6eee:

  # w "I remember now. Nothing at all. Just an old toy."
  w "我现在想起来了。根本没什么。只是个旧玩具。"

# game/script.rpy:9240
translate Chinese witchExperiments_d241bdb7:

  # "Dark spots swam at the corners of your vision. You dropped the shoe and staggered out of the closet."
  "你的视野边缘开始发黑。你扔下鞋子，踉踉跄跄地走出壁橱。"

# game/script.rpy:9247
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_fc7e0645:

  # "You felt a strangling pressure in your throat."
  "你感到喉咙里有一股令人窒息的压力。"

# game/script.rpy:9248
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_a2d497b7:

  # w "This all seems so familiar - I'm sure I've seen it before. I knew its name."
  w "这一切看起来如此熟悉——我敢肯定我以前见过它。我知道它的名字。"

# game/script.rpy:9249
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_206a3446:

  # w "But we need to act fast. Now we know this Lacuna is coming from your house, we can -"
  w "但我们必须得快点行动了。既然我们知道这个空缺源自你家，我们就可以——"

# game/script.rpy:9250
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_4ef597de:

  # "Your tongue was fat and poisonous in your mouth."
  "你的舌头在嘴里肿胀发僵，仿佛含着毒药。"

# game/script.rpy:9251
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_b83f0d4f:

  # "It twisted, and spoke."
  "它扭动着，开口说话了。"

# game/script.rpy:9252
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_ef45a91f:

  # pov "This is an exciting theory, isn't it?"
  pov "这是一个激动人心的理论，不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9253
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_02d30eca:

  # pov "It makes you the hero. A visionary."
  pov "它让你成了英雄。一个先知先觉者。"

# game/script.rpy:9254
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_081d173f:

  # pov "You saw what no-one else could. Now only you can stop it. Thrilling."
  pov "你看到了别人看不到的东西。现在只有你能阻止它。真是刺激。"

# game/script.rpy:9255
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_1a90fb7a:

  # pov "But I think you are overlooking a much simpler explanation."
  pov "但我认为你忽略了一个简单得多的解释。"

# game/script.rpy:9257
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_7dd42144:

  # w "What do you mean?"
  w "你什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:9258
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_d8170736:

  # pov "Memory loss. Confusion."
  pov "记忆丧失。精神错乱。"

# game/script.rpy:9259
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_a8c952ed:

  # pov "Difficulty performing familiar tasks."
  pov "难以完成熟悉的任务。"

# game/script.rpy:9260
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_aa0726ae:

  # pov "Withdrawing from friends and family."
  pov "渐渐疏远亲戚朋友。"

# game/script.rpy:9261
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_29153407:

  # pov "Losing the ability to think clearly."
  pov "丧失清晰思考的能力。"

# game/script.rpy:9262
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_d2ec55ba:

  # pov "What do these symptoms suggest to you?"
  pov "这些症状会让你联想到什么？"

# game/script.rpy:9263
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_c9e82a90:

  # w "I-"
  w "我——"

# game/script.rpy:9264
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_33b376e3:

  # w "No. No, that's not possible."
  w "不。不，这不可能。"

# game/script.rpy:9265
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_e611144f:

  # "Her voice was unsteady."
  "她的声音开始发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:9266
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_c328612c:

  # w "I- I know I have struggled in the past. But it's not just me. We proved it."
  w "我——我知道我过去确实出过状况。但不仅仅是我一个人。我们已经证明了。"

# game/script.rpy:9267
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_9b9bbf62:

  # w "It can't just be in my head. What about the strings?"
  w "这不可能只是我的幻觉。那那些绳子怎么解释？"

# game/script.rpy:9268
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_093bdec8:

  # pov "What strings?"
  pov "什么绳子？"

# game/script.rpy:9269
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_1eb376ba:

  # "She turned around. There were no strings on the windowsill."
  "她转过身。窗台上根本没有绳子。"

# game/script.rpy:9270
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_f3c6394e:

  # "The floor of the cottage was clear. There were no flags."
  "小屋的地板干干净净。没有旗帜。"

# game/script.rpy:9271
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_5c59a5ee:

  # "There never were."
  "从来都没有过。"

# game/script.rpy:9272
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_e7595979:

  # w "That's - I can't - what about the forks?"
  w "那是——我怎么会——那叉子呢？"

# game/script.rpy:9273
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_87afd897:

  # pov "You're confused, dear. You don't own any forks."
  pov "你糊涂了，亲爱的。你根本没有叉子。"

# game/script.rpy:9274
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_edbf97f1:

  # pov "Don't you remember? You never have. "
  pov "你不记得了吗？你从来就没有过叉子。"

# game/script.rpy:9275
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_4a590cd6:

  # "The witch looked out the window and saw that you were right. The ground was bare. The cottage was empty. There were no forks in sight."
  "女巫向窗外望去，发现你是对的。地面光秃秃的。小屋空荡荡的。视线范围内根本没有叉子。"

# game/script.rpy:9276
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_08dc1047:

  # "Your throat pulsed and pushed the words out of your teeth."
  "你的喉咙抽动着，把话语从牙缝里挤了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:9277
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_84a5b5bb:

  # pov "You eat with your hands. Your bare hands. Like an animal."
  pov "你用手吃饭。用你的双手。像个动物一样。"

# game/script.rpy:9278
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_349ff043:

  # pov "Your claws. Your teeth."
  pov "用你的爪子。你的牙齿。"

# game/script.rpy:9279
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_51efc0ee:

  # pov "You always have. You told me so."
  pov "一直都是这样。是你亲口告诉我的。"

# game/script.rpy:9280
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_4070d93e:

  # w "No. No, I wouldn't do that. They have to be here."
  w "不。不，我不会那么做的。它们一定在这里。"

# game/script.rpy:9281
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_3d463873:

  # "The witch began to ransack the house, pulling out drawers and shelves, but there was nothing inside."
  "女巫开始在屋里翻箱倒柜，抽空抽屉，拽翻搁板，但里面什么也没有。"

# game/script.rpy:9282
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_1d6f1755:

  # "On the wall was a smeared message in bright red paint. It said \"I OWN NOTHING.\""
  "墙上有一行用鲜红油漆涂抹的大字。上面写着：“我什么也没有。”"

# game/script.rpy:9284
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_e7e964f6:

  # pov "I'm worried about you, dear. We all are."
  pov "我很担心你，亲爱的。我们大家都很担心。"

# game/script.rpy:9285
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_6ec38e2d:

  # pov "Staying all alone in this tiny, tiny cottage, all by yourself. It's barely enough room to fit."
  pov "你孤零零地一个人呆在这个小得可怜的小屋里。小得几乎连转身的地方都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:9286
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_27377b79:

  # "The walls pressed in on you. You didn't even have space to stand fully upright."
  "墙壁向你挤压过来。你甚至连完全直立的空间都没有了。"

# game/script.rpy:9287
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_11f12ac5:

  # pov "We've known each other for so long."
  pov "我们认识这么久了。"

# game/script.rpy:9288
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_8d47662a:

  # w "We have?"
  w "有吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9289
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_c30e55d4:

  # "You felt your throat muscles burn as they constricted in your throat. Your voice came out, sounding soft and comforting."
  "你感到喉咙肌肉紧缩，灼痛难忍。发出的声音听起来却轻柔无比，透着安抚的意味。"

# game/script.rpy:9290
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_d93502ab:

  # pov "Of course. So many years now. We wouldn't lie to you. We only want you to be safe."
  pov "当然了。都这么多年了。我们不会骗你的。我们只是希望你安全。"

# game/script.rpy:9291
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_f0b9861b:

  # pov "You have to trust me. You're not well. These things you're seeing... they aren't there."
  pov "你必须相信我。你病了。你看到的这些东西……它们根本不存在。"

# game/script.rpy:9292
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_0e080ca6:

  # "The witch spoke in a very small voice."
  "女巫用极小的声音说话。"

# game/script.rpy:9296
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_0d04128e:

  # w "..."
  w "……"

# game/script.rpy:9297
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_9f7889ce:

  # w "Okay."
  w "好吧。"

# game/script.rpy:9298
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_1731d7c0:

  # pov "This really is the best thing, dear. For your health."
  pov "这真的是为了你好，亲爱的。为了你的健康。"

# game/script.rpy:9300
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_8dd8db88:

  # "She looked down at her hands. They were shaking. Tears welled up in her eyes, and you looked away courteously."
  "她低头看着自己的手。在发抖。泪水涌上了她的眼眶，而你礼貌地移开了视线。"

# game/script.rpy:9301
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_94df3179:

  # w "I was doing so well. I thought I was better."
  w "我明明好多了。我以为我已经好了。"

# game/script.rpy:9302
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_803208c8:

  # w "I really, really thought..."
  w "我真的、真的以为……"

# game/script.rpy:9303
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_55f2f339:

  # "There was a long silence."
  "一阵漫长的沉默。"

# game/script.rpy:9304
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_4f784d08:

  # w "Well. It doesn't matter now."
  w "算了。现在都没关系了。"

# game/script.rpy:9305
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_4f9e45ca:

  # w "I- I'll pack my things. I know you only want me to be safe."
  w "我——我去收拾我的东西。我知道你们只是希望我安全。"

# game/script.rpy:9306
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_69c247c3:

  # pov "I'm so glad."
  pov "我很高兴你能这么想。"

# game/script.rpy:9307
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_ad019b02:

  # pov "Don't worry. Everything is going to be fine."
  pov "别担心。一切都会好起来的。"

# game/script.rpy:9308
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_c3c2b2e5:

  # pov "I'll get the others, and we'll come back for you and your things."
  pov "我去叫其他人，然后我们回来接你跟你的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:9309
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_dad7e88a:

  # pov "We can set you up in the village somewhere safe. Where you aren't a danger to yourself."
  pov "我们可以在村里给你安排一个安全的地方。一个你不会伤害到自己的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:9310
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_5451fbbe:

  # "Your muscles clenched, and pulled you upright."
  "你的肌肉紧绷着，把你拉直站起。"

# game/script.rpy:9311
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_c431f06c:

  # "The witch's face was scrunched up and she was rubbing her eyes."
  "女巫的脸皱成一团，她揉着眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:9314
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_494b8332:

  # w "Thank you. I'm sorry."
  w "谢谢你。对不起。"

# game/script.rpy:9315
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_afe7d86f:

  # pov "There's no need to be sorry. I forgive you."
  pov "没必要道歉。我原谅你。"

# game/script.rpy:9316
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_d3d99841:

  # "She looked at you. Her eyes were large and terrified."
  "她看着你。她的眼睛睁得大大的，充满了恐惧。"

# game/script.rpy:9317
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_90b389e9:

  # w "Y-you'll come back for me, right?"
  w "你——你会回来接我的，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:9318
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_0d23b7dc:

  # pov "Of course. I'll be right back."
  pov "当然。我马上就回来。"

# game/script.rpy:9319
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_84fb2c88:

  # w "I'm sorry."
  w "对不起。"

# game/script.rpy:9320
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_1223ad81:

  # "Your muscles constricted, and your legs jerked. Your arms pulled you through the miniature doorway and out of the witch's house."
  "你的肌肉紧绷，双腿猛地抽搐。你的双臂将你拉过那扇微型房门，拖出了女巫的小屋。"

# game/script.rpy:9321
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_fa9e685b:

  # "You saw the witch once in the doorway, looking scared and alone in the crushingly small space of her tiny, tiny cottage."
  "在门口，你看了女巫一眼。在她那小得令人窒息的狭窄小屋里，她显得既恐惧又孤独。"

# game/script.rpy:9325
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_8efd3315:

  # "Then the door closed, and your body turned around."
  "接着，门关上了，你的身体转了过去。"

# game/script.rpy:9335
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_3a2a7ac6:

  # "You felt the tension leave you, like surfacing from the bottom of the ocean. You bent over and hacked some twisted, bloody thing out of you and onto the grass."
  "你感到紧张感从体内消散，就像从海底浮出水面一样。你弯下腰，从体内咳出了一块扭曲的、血淋淋的东西，吐在了草地上。"

# game/script.rpy:9336
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_a23c5fcf:

  # "It looked like a matted clump of dark fur. You glanced at it once, then looked away and forgot it forever."
  "那看起来像是一团打结的暗色毛发。你瞥了它一眼，便移开视线，将它永远抛之脑后。"

# game/script.rpy:9337
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_0b730016:

  # "The night was cool and quiet. There was a lovely breeze blowing."
  "夜晚凉爽而宁静。吹着宜人的微风。"

# game/script.rpy:9339
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_54548586:

  # "You were in the middle of a large, empty field. The blank sky was above you. The grass crunched under your feet. Nothing beside remained."
  "你站在一片空旷的田野中央。头顶是空荡荡的天空。脚下的草地踩得嘎吱作响。此外空无一物。"

# game/script.rpy:9341
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_330d7041:

  # "You were in the middle of a large, empty field. The stars twinkled above you. The grass crunched under your feet. Nothing beside remained."
  "你站在一片空旷的田野中央。繁星在你头顶闪烁。脚下的草地踩得嘎吱作响。此外空无一物。"

# game/script.rpy:9342
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_d35fc71b:

  # "Why did you come out here?"
  "你为什么会来到这里？"

# game/script.rpy:9343
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_7e39f4b4:

  # "You couldn't recall. There's no-one living out this way."
  "你记不起来了。这边根本没人住。"

# game/script.rpy:9344
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_cf9ff944:

  # "Never has been."
  "从来都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:9345
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_3b87a192:

  # "You shook your head and laughed at your own foolishness. You must have gotten lost again. You've been so forgetful lately."
  "你摇了摇头，暗笑自己的愚蠢。你肯定又迷路了。你最近总是这么健忘。"

# game/script.rpy:9346
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_3cd062c8:

  # "But no matter. It was a beautiful night. Perfect for a walk."
  "但没关系。这是个美丽的夜晚。正适合散步。"

# game/script.rpy:9347
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_bf3d8c26:

  # "You stretched your legs, and began the long walk back to the village and home."
  "你伸展了一下双腿，开始了返回村里家中的漫长跋涉。"

# game/script.rpy:9348
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_1faae478:

  # "Far away, a small piece of string with a loop in it fell into the river, and was gone."
  "在很远的地方，一根打着空圈的细绳掉进了河里，消失不见了。"

# game/script.rpy:9349
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_1978ad81:

  # "There is nothing else to say. The tale is told."
  "没什么别的可说了。故事讲完了。"

# game/script.rpy:9350
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_e5506e9f:

  # "If you like it, praise it."
  "如果你喜欢它，就赞美它。"

# game/script.rpy:9352
translate Chinese witchSoloFinale_91f8d401:

  # "If not, let it be forgotten."
  "如果不喜欢，就让它被遗忘吧。"

# game/script.rpy:9377
translate Chinese toadWitchInvestigate_213d021c:

  # "The woods were quiet."
  "树林里一片寂静。"

# game/script.rpy:9391
translate Chinese toadWitchInvestigate_9367ddb6:

  # "The hairs at the back of your neck prickled."
  "你后颈的汗毛竖了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:9404
translate Chinese toadWitchInvestigate_b089ed30:

  # "You walked through the woods for long hours, picking paths at random. Eventually, you came to a clearing. You looked up."
  "你在树林里走了好几个小时，随意挑着路走。终于，你来到了一片空地。你抬起头。"

# game/script.rpy:9408
translate Chinese toadWitchInvestigate_d0a105b5:

  # "The Firmament was gazing down upon you."
  "苍穹正俯视着你。"

# game/script.rpy:9409
translate Chinese toadWitchInvestigate_090a1ca8:

  # "You looked up at Her in awe."
  "你敬畏地仰望着她。"

# game/script.rpy:9412
translate Chinese creepiestShowing_beb8b779:

  # "Where did She come from? What colossal, slow thoughts does She think up there?"
  "她从何而来？高踞天际的她，思考着怎样宏大而缓慢的思想？"

# game/script.rpy:9414
translate Chinese creepiestShowing_6032eebe:

  # "None alive could say."
  "活在世上的人谁也说不准。"

# game/script.rpy:9415
translate Chinese creepiestShowing_e3f66e38:

  # "A single tear dropped from Her eye, and streaked across the sky like a falling star."
  "一滴眼泪从她眼中滑落，像流星般划破天际。"

# game/script.rpy:9416
translate Chinese creepiestShowing_72cf17b7:

  # "You sat there for a long time."
  "你在那里坐了很久。"

# game/script.rpy:9417
translate Chinese creepiestShowing_9f5cb5fd:

  # "Finally, you turned around, and found yourself back where you began."
  "最后，你转过身，发现自己回到了起点。"

# game/script.rpy:9424
translate Chinese creepiestShowing_19b64861:

  # "You turned and walked back to the light of the village."
  "你转过身，走向村庄的灯光。"

# game/script.rpy:9432
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_422157ae:

  # "The grass rustled."
  "草丛沙沙作响。"

# game/script.rpy:9441
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_900b3246:

  # "You walked until you discovered a giant old tree."
  "你一直走，直到发现了一棵巨大的古树。"

# game/script.rpy:9445
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_9367ddb6:

  # "The hairs at the back of your neck prickled."
  "你后颈的汗毛竖了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:9461
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_c75c2b81:

  # "You walked through the darkness of the woods until you discovered an abandoned old train."
  "你穿过黑暗的树林，直到发现了一列废弃的旧火车。"

# game/script.rpy:9467
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_7350adab:

  # "For some reason you wandered off into the dark woods, picking paths at random."
  "不知为何，你游荡进了黑暗的树林，随意挑着路走。"

# game/script.rpy:9471
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_88206f5f:

  # "You found nothing and no-one. There was nothing there. Nothing but a cold silence that slowly followed you from behind the trees."
  "你什么也没找到，一个人也没看见。那里什么都没有。只有一种冰冷的寂静，从树后慢慢地跟着你。"

# game/script.rpy:9473
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_a20cefa7:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:9481
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_361688fa:

  # "A foolish endeavour. There is no such person."
  "一场愚蠢的徒劳。根本没有这个人。"

# game/script.rpy:9482
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_9bdc963c:

  # "There never was."
  "从来就没有。"

# game/script.rpy:9484
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_bdbe644a:

  # "A foolish dream. There is no such place."
  "一个愚蠢的梦。根本没有这个地方。"

# game/script.rpy:9485
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_9bdc963c_1:

  # "There never was."
  "从来就没有。"

# game/script.rpy:9487
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_6a66bc41:

  # "Very well. Curiosity is a fine vice for the hero of a tale like this."
  "很好。对于这样一个故事的主角来说，好奇心算是个不错的小毛病。"

# game/script.rpy:9488
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_a164b289:

  # "But everything has a limit. You should return to the village. The story is waiting for you."
  "但凡事都有个限度。你应该回村子里去。故事还在等着你。"

# game/script.rpy:9490
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_92f1a022:

  # "There is no need for that, child."
  "没那个必要，孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:9491
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_847ff0bf:

  # "I am here."
  "我在这里。"

# game/script.rpy:9492
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_5c622732:

  # "I always have been."
  "我一直都在。"

# game/script.rpy:9493
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_57238b3a:

  # "You wandered in circles for a long time."
  "你在原地转了很久的圈。"

# game/script.rpy:9494
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_deab9edd:

  # "Finally, you found yourself back where you began."
  "最后，你发现自己回到了起点。"

# game/script.rpy:9498
translate Chinese thiefMushroomInvestigate_4e8b1e81:

  # "The lights and warmth welcomed you back."
  "灯光与温暖迎接着你的归来。"

# game/script.rpy:9504
translate Chinese toadInvestigate_6eb6bb95:

  # "You walked along the side of the river. The water was still and deep. There was a small, muddy hole on the edge of the riverbank."
  "你沿着河边走。河水深邃而平静。河岸边有一个泥泞的小洞。"

# game/script.rpy:9512
translate Chinese toadInvestigate_4e3d5c9e:

  # "You crouched down and slithered into the hole. Mud covered you."
  "你蹲下身，钻进了洞里。你身上沾满了泥巴。"

# game/script.rpy:9513
translate Chinese toadInvestigate_bd86b8c7:

  # "It was wet, and cramped, and crawling with small worms and roaches. "
  "洞里潮湿、狭窄，爬满了小虫和蟑螂。"

# game/script.rpy:9514
translate Chinese toadInvestigate_d9b2db5d:

  # "A cold silence lay coiled in the hollow like thick fog."
  "一阵冰冷的寂静如浓雾般盘踞在这个空洞里。"

# game/script.rpy:9515
translate Chinese toadInvestigate_8bdcd044:

  # "Why did you come here?"
  "你为什么会来到这里？"

# game/script.rpy:9527
translate Chinese essay2Showing_b081d176:

  # "You uncovered a pantry with a single, mouldy piece of bread, and a pit sunk into the muck of the wall with the remains of an old fire."
  "你发现了一个储藏室，里面只有一块发霉的面包，还有墙上淤泥里凹陷下去的一个火坑，里面有生过火的残迹。"

# game/script.rpy:9529
translate Chinese essay2Showing_8d77c0f7:

  # "The silence watched you."
  "寂静注视着你。"

# game/script.rpy:9534
translate Chinese essay2Showing_1a92711c:

  # "You crawled through a tunnel in the back which lead down into the mud."
  "你爬过洞穴后部的一条隧道，通向了泥土深处。"

# game/script.rpy:9535
translate Chinese essay2Showing_40d14c7b:

  # "At the end of the tunnel was a small room with a bed and a closet."
  "隧道尽头是一个小房间，有一张床和一个壁橱。"

# game/script.rpy:9536
translate Chinese essay2Showing_0e277305:

  # "Inside the closet were two threadbare costumes. A witch and a unicorn."
  "壁橱里有两套破旧的演出服。一套女巫服，一套独角兽服。"

# game/script.rpy:9540
translate Chinese toadDiaryShowing_0302119c:

  # "Nothing beside remained."
  "此外空无一物。"

# game/script.rpy:9546
translate Chinese toadDiaryShowing_a47a4b2e:

  # "You turned around and crawled back up out of the hole."
  "你转过身，从洞里爬了出去。"

# game/script.rpy:9547
translate Chinese toadDiaryShowing_53ee1b3b:

  # pov "What a terrible place that was. Never shall I return there again."
  pov "那真是个可怕的地方。我再也不会回去了。"

# game/script.rpy:9626
translate Chinese witchInvestigate_ca223214:

  # "You walked through the trees until you began to see a glimmer of silver light in the darkness."
  "你穿行在树林中，直到开始在黑暗中看到一线闪烁的银光。"

# game/script.rpy:9629
translate Chinese witchInvestigate_0780a027:

  # "The forest was covered in puddles of water from the rains. Each one shone with light."
  "森林里到处都是雨后积起的水洼。每一个都闪烁着光芒。"

# game/script.rpy:9630
translate Chinese witchInvestigate_0a2eced7:

  # "All around you, the woods were dark and empty. But when you looked into the water, you saw the reflection of a shining cottage below."
  "你周围的树林黑暗而空旷。但当你向水里看去时，却看到下方倒映着一座闪闪发光的小屋。"

# game/script.rpy:9640
translate Chinese puddle2_e7f50077:

  # "You crawled to the edge and looked down into the puddle."
  "你爬到边缘，低头看向水洼。"

# game/script.rpy:9641
translate Chinese puddle2_7cd147f0:

  # "The surface of the water was flat and still."
  "水面平静如镜。"

# game/script.rpy:9644
translate Chinese puddle2_307d5c87:

  # "The cottage in the reflection shone with bright light, as if the setting sun was behind it."
  "倒影中的小屋闪耀着明亮的光芒，仿佛夕阳正从它背后照来。"

# game/script.rpy:9647
translate Chinese puddle2_61023088:

  # "There was no trace of a cottage in the world above the water."
  "在水面上的世界里，根本找不到任何小屋的踪迹。"

# game/script.rpy:9651
translate Chinese puddle2_26014a45:

  # "You picked up a stick from the ground, and tossed it into the puddle."
  "你从地上捡起一根树枝，扔进水洼里。"

# game/script.rpy:9652
translate Chinese puddle2_ff499cad:

  # "It fell in without a single ripple in the water."
  "树枝落入水中，水面却未泛起一丝涟漪。"

# game/script.rpy:9653
translate Chinese puddle2_ac59d260:

  # "You saw it drop through into the reflection, and land close to the cottage."
  "你看到它落入倒影里，落在小屋附近。"

# game/script.rpy:9654
translate Chinese puddle2_37e73c24:

  # "You looked up. There was no trace of it in the world outside the reflection."
  "你抬起头。在倒影外的世界里，根本找不到那根树枝的踪迹。"

# game/script.rpy:9659
translate Chinese puddle2_8f1abeb8:

  # "You grabbed the pig to you, then leapt into the puddle."
  "你一把抓过小猪，然后跳进了水洼。"

# game/script.rpy:9661
translate Chinese puddle2_f72651ac:

  # "You leapt into the puddle."
  "你跳进了水洼。"

# game/script.rpy:9664
translate Chinese puddle2_34bd7779:

  # "The world flipped over."
  "世界翻转了。"

# game/script.rpy:9665
translate Chinese puddle2_17e60d48:

  # "You felt the water pass over you, and a cool chill tingled all through your body."
  "你感觉到水流漫过你，一股清凉的寒意传遍全身。"

# game/script.rpy:9668
translate Chinese puddle2_f108985a:

  # "When you opened your eyes, you were standing right way up again."
  "当你睁开双眼时，发现自己又重新正立了过来。"

# game/script.rpy:9670
translate Chinese puddle2_0fec5802:

  # "The puddle you had jumped into was now a floor, like a silver mirror."
  "刚刚跳入的那个水洼，此刻变成了银镜般的地板。"

# game/script.rpy:9671
translate Chinese puddle2_f590bf40:

  # "The world all around you shone white."
  "周围的世界闪耀着白光。"

# game/script.rpy:9672
translate Chinese puddle2_3a06db03:

  # "At the centre of the puddle was a cottage in the middle of a garden."
  "水洼的中心是一座位于花园中央的小屋。"

# game/script.rpy:9683
translate Chinese witchCottageInvestigate_291b83d9:

  # "You walked up the front steps, and put your hand on the doorknob."
  "你走上门前的台阶，握住门把手。"

# game/script.rpy:9684
translate Chinese witchCottageInvestigate_2023ba25:

  # "The door opened up with a shuddering creak."
  "门在一阵震颤的嘎吱声中打开了。"

# game/script.rpy:9685
translate Chinese witchCottageInvestigate_e88f7e75:

  # "Inside the cottage was a wild clutter of books and herbs and plants of all description, growing up the walls and roof."
  "小屋里杂乱无章地堆满了书，各种各样的草药和植物顺着墙壁和屋顶疯长。"

# game/script.rpy:9686
translate Chinese witchCottageInvestigate_d4f41332:

  # "The cottage was tiny, but the walls were covered with bookshelves stuffed with old manuscripts and notebooks and thick textbooks on all kinds of plants and animals."
  "小屋很小，但墙边摆满了书架，上面塞满了旧手稿、笔记本，以及各种关于动植物的厚重教科书。"

# game/script.rpy:9687
translate Chinese witchCottageInvestigate_b8ea80a2:

  # "The wooden bookshelves were sprouting with herbs and plants of every type."
  "木制书架上长出了各色草药与植物的嫩芽。"

# game/script.rpy:9688
translate Chinese witchCottageInvestigate_7244cb3c:

  # "In the corner was a small kitchen with a cauldron, and up above was a small attic crawl-space."
  "角落里是摆着一口大坩埚的小厨房，上方是一个只能爬行进出的低矮小阁楼。"

# game/script.rpy:9692
translate Chinese witchCottageInvestigate_ba39c26c:

  # "You climbed up in the crawl-space."
  "你爬进了那个阁楼夹层。"

# game/script.rpy:9696
translate Chinese essay4Showing_739acad6:

  # "It was covered in dust. A small bed nestled in the corner, with a half-full teacup beside it."
  "里面布满灰尘。角落里安置着一张小床，旁边放着一个装了半杯茶的茶杯。"

# game/script.rpy:9698
translate Chinese essay4Showing_ecb0a014:

  # "Mould was beginning to grow from the teacup."
  "茶杯里已经开始长霉了。"

# game/script.rpy:9699
translate Chinese essay4Showing_0302119c:

  # "Nothing beside remained."
  "此外空无一物。"

# game/script.rpy:9704
translate Chinese essay4Showing_f19a9c3b:

  # "The door swung open, and you saw the shining silver of the puddle-world again."
  "门被推开，你再次看到了水洼世界那闪耀的银色。"

# game/script.rpy:9709
translate Chinese essay4Showing_0789a529:

  # "You looked through the garden. Old pumpkins were going to rot."
  "你在花园里看了一圈。旧南瓜快要腐烂了。"

# game/script.rpy:9710
translate Chinese essay4Showing_c62740d2:

  # "In the dirt was a single fork wrapped in string."
  "泥土里有一把缠着细绳的叉子。"

# game/script.rpy:9711
translate Chinese essay4Showing_65485aad:

  # "It was labelled with the letter A."
  "上面贴着字母“A”的标签。"

# game/script.rpy:9715
translate Chinese essay4Showing_39d7518e:

  # "You turned and slowly walked back into the puddle. The water closed around you."
  "你转过身，慢慢走回水洼。水流将你包围。"

# game/script.rpy:9716
translate Chinese essay4Showing_be212d3b:

  # "You soon found yourself back in the woods."
  "很快，你发现自己回到了树林里。"

# game/script.rpy:9727
translate Chinese mushroomInvestigate_51dc864a:

  # "The old strangler fig towered above you."
  "古老的绞杀榕在你头顶高耸。"

# game/script.rpy:9728
translate Chinese mushroomInvestigate_cbc95999:

  # "Under the vines and swamp flowers at the root of the tree lay a small blue door, inlaid with precious moonstone and intricate engravings."
  "在树根处的藤蔓和沼泽花朵下，藏着一扇蓝色的小门，上面镶嵌着珍贵的月光石，还刻有复杂的雕花。"

# game/script.rpy:9736
translate Chinese mushroomInvestigate_a86eb036:

  # "The door creaked slowly open."
  "门伴随着嘎吱声缓缓打开。"

# game/script.rpy:9740
translate Chinese mushroomInvestigate_fa0575bd:

  # "You walked back through the woods. The door creaked slowly in the wind behind you."
  "你穿过树林往回走。身后的门在风中缓缓开合，嘎吱作响。"

# game/script.rpy:9753
translate Chinese mushroomInvestigateMenu_7d99185e:

  # "The chamber was still and empty, but for a small black door set into the bark in the centre."
  "树洞里寂静空旷，只有中央的树皮上嵌着一扇黑色的小门。"

# game/script.rpy:9754
translate Chinese mushroomInvestigateMenu_adb884a2:

  # "You opened up the door and looked within cautiously."
  "你打开门，小心翼翼地往里看。"

# game/script.rpy:9757
translate Chinese essay5Showing_c2549963:

  # "The basement within was dark. Nothing moved."
  "地下室里一片漆黑。没有任何动静。"

# game/script.rpy:9759
translate Chinese essay5Showing_22477547:

  # pov "There is nothing for me here."
  pov "这里没有我要找的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:9760
translate Chinese essay5Showing_5044a29d:

  # "You left the basement and returned to the main hollow."
  "你离开地下室，回到了主树洞。"

# game/script.rpy:9767
translate Chinese essay5Showing_f2a6c1ac:

  # "Under the tree was an ancient underground river."
  "树下是一条古老的地下河。"

# game/script.rpy:9768
translate Chinese essay5Showing_431c9c5e:

  # "The mud held old crocodile footprints, long dried. There was no sign of anything living."
  "泥土里留着干涸已久的鳄鱼脚印。没有任何活物的迹象。"

# game/script.rpy:9770
translate Chinese essay5Showing_0670f4a0:

  # pov "I had best head back to the village, if I know what is good for me."
  pov "为了小命着想，我最好还是回村里去。"

# game/script.rpy:9771
translate Chinese essay5Showing_ed29718f:

  # "You turned and climbed back up the stairs."
  "你转过身，爬上了楼梯。"

# game/script.rpy:9779
translate Chinese essay5Showing_0fb19403:

  # "The canopy moved gently in the breeze."
  "树冠在微风中轻轻摇曳。"

# game/script.rpy:9782
translate Chinese mushroomPosterShowing_0f005270:

  # "No fruits or flowers grew there. The branches were bare."
  "那里没有果实也没有花朵。树枝光秃秃的。"

# game/script.rpy:9784
translate Chinese mushroomPosterShowing_4e3899c8:

  # "The cold wind slowly ate away at you, until you turned and went back inside."
  "寒风一点点啮咬着你的体温，逼得你转身退回树洞里。"

# game/script.rpy:9788
translate Chinese mushroomPosterShowing_fa0575bd:

  # "You walked back through the woods. The door creaked slowly in the wind behind you."
  "你穿过树林往回走。身后的门在风中缓缓开合，嘎吱作响。"

# game/script.rpy:9799
translate Chinese thiefInvestigate_11439848:

  # "The train was wedged between two trees. Grass grew over the wheels. There were no train tracks. No sign how it came to lie here."
  "那列火车卡在两棵树之间。野草没过了车轮。没有铁轨。丝毫看不出它是怎么跑到这里来的。"

# game/script.rpy:9810
translate Chinese thiefInvestigate_47b4c06a:

  # "You hoisted yourself up into the train carriage."
  "你双手一撑，翻进火车车厢。"

# game/script.rpy:9811
translate Chinese thiefInvestigate_2a59bea2:

  # "The main room was some kind of bar or gambling hall that now lay silent."
  "主车厢曾经大概是间酒吧或是赌场，如今却寂静无声。"

# game/script.rpy:9812
translate Chinese thiefInvestigate_6dbcca20:

  # "The moonlight gleamed on empty bottles and glasses. The wind whistled through open windows."
  "月光在空瓶子和玻璃杯上闪烁。风呼啸着穿过敞开的窗户。"

# game/script.rpy:9827
translate Chinese essay3Showing_c1af6dfa:

  # "This room must have been sweltering, once."
  "这个房间曾经一定闷热难耐。"

# game/script.rpy:9829
translate Chinese essay3Showing_8c6a15ff:

  # "Now the gaping maw of the furnace lay cold."
  "现在，熔炉那张开的巨口却一片冰冷。"

# game/script.rpy:9836
translate Chinese essay3Showing_0e7f72d8:

  # "You pulled yourself up through the window and onto the roof."
  "你顺着窗户攀上了车顶。"

# game/script.rpy:9837
translate Chinese essay3Showing_c291f4f9:

  # "There was nothing on the roof. But you sat and looked out at the countryside."
  "车顶上什么也没有。但你坐了下来，眺望着远处的乡村。"

# game/script.rpy:9839
translate Chinese essay3Showing_bea69b9f:

  # "You could barely see the dark lake nearby. The immense abyss of the night sky loomed over you."
  "你隐约能看到附近那片黑暗的湖泊。无垠的夜空笼罩在你的头顶。"

# game/script.rpy:9841
translate Chinese essay3Showing_f2c10110:

  # "You could barely see the dark lake nearby. Tiny pinpricks of stars shed faint light in the immense blackness."
  "你隐约能看到附近那片黑暗的湖泊。针尖般的星光在无边的黑暗中洒下微弱的光芒。"

# game/script.rpy:9842
translate Chinese essay3Showing_b4421d55:

  # "After a long moment, you pulled yourself back into the train."
  "过了良久，你把自己拉回了火车里。"

# game/script.rpy:9847
translate Chinese essay3Showing_90c7a740:

  # "You walked through the empty compartments."
  "你穿过空荡荡的车厢。"

# game/script.rpy:9848
translate Chinese essay3Showing_a556e196:

  # "Slowly rotting mattresses on the beds. Empty suitcases with no luggage. A ragged, midnight-blue cloak."
  "床上是慢慢腐烂的床垫。空空如也的手提箱。一件破烂的午夜蓝斗篷。"

# game/script.rpy:9852
translate Chinese noteShowing_0302119c:

  # "Nothing beside remained."
  "此外空无一物。"

# game/script.rpy:9858
translate Chinese noteShowing_3e5ac7fc:

  # "You leapt back out onto the soft grass."
  "你跳回柔软的草地上。"

# game/script.rpy:9861
translate Chinese noteShowing_c92d3273:

  # "You turned away and walked back through the woods. The wind whistled through the empty wreck behind you."
  "你转过身，穿过树林往回走。风在你身后那座空荡荡的残骸中呼啸。"

# game/script.rpy:9867
translate Chinese woodsInvestigate_272e10de:

  # "Darkness fell around you. You walked for long hours."
  "黑暗包围了你。你走了好几个小时。"

# game/script.rpy:9872
translate Chinese woodsInvestigate_59af19ea:

  # "At last you came to the bank of an ancient lake."
  "终于，你来到了一个古老湖泊的岸边。"

# game/script.rpy:9874
translate Chinese woodsInvestigate_e4541156:

  # "It had never been sounded by the sons of men. No wisdom reaches such depths."
  "凡人从未测得其深浅。没有任何智慧能触及那样的深处。"

# game/script.rpy:9879
translate Chinese gilgameshShowing_bc9e3522:

  # "The waters burned like a torch. The light of them fell upon your face."
  "湖水像火炬一样燃烧着。光芒照在你的脸上。"

# game/script.rpy:9881
translate Chinese gilgameshShowing_a5e51e4e:

  # "A rabbit, pursued by hounds, would die rather than save its life by entering that water."
  "一只被猎犬追捕的兔子，宁愿死也不愿跳进那水里逃生。"

# game/script.rpy:9883
translate Chinese gilgameshShowing_f4685292:

  # "Nothing lay by the shore. "
  "岸边什么也没有。"

# game/script.rpy:9885
translate Chinese gilgameshShowing_1163147a:

  # "The moon shone down on the scene."
  "月光倾洒在这幅景象上。"

# game/script.rpy:9887
translate Chinese gilgameshShowing_2327528e:

  # "You looked out at the water in silence. Not a single creature stirred."
  "你静静地凝视着湖水。没有任何生物在活动。"

# game/script.rpy:9889
translate Chinese gilgameshShowing_7a4ac2d0:

  # "Even the air was still."
  "连空气都是静止的。"

# game/script.rpy:9891
translate Chinese gilgameshShowing_a20cefa7:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:9892
translate Chinese gilgameshShowing_64f6ae54:

  # "I think that's quite enough."
  "我想这已经够了。"

# game/script.rpy:9893
translate Chinese gilgameshShowing_2b493b75:

  # "Let's get back to the story."
  "让我们回到故事中来。"

# game/script.rpy:9897
translate Chinese gilgameshShowing_3751b8c5:

  # "The rich dark blanket of night was softly rolling over the village as you walked in, and cooking fires lit up all across the hills, one by one."
  "当你走进村庄时，浓黑的夜色如毯子般轻柔地笼罩村庄，漫山遍野的炊火一簇接一簇地亮起。"

# game/script.rpy:9927
translate Chinese gilgameshShowing_13c55d6a:

  # "You left the lake and walked on through the woods until you saw the light of the village."
  "你离开湖边，继续穿过树林，直到看见村庄的灯光。"

# game/script.rpy:9928
translate Chinese gilgameshShowing_68ac747c:

  # "The rich dark blanket of night was softly rolling over the town, and cooking fires lit up all across the hills, one by one."
  "浓黑的夜色如毯子般轻柔地笼罩小镇，漫山遍野的炊火一簇接一簇地亮起。"

# game/script.rpy:9935
translate Chinese clearingInvestigate_3561d07b:

  # "You wandered through the trees until you found a dark clearing."
  "你穿行在树林间，直到发现了一片黑暗的空地。"

# game/script.rpy:9937
translate Chinese clearingInvestigate_e5f11da1:

  # "A gap in the forest. A lacuna."
  "森林中的一个缺口。一个空缺。"

# game/script.rpy:9938
translate Chinese clearingInvestigate_125e5141:

  # "Nothing stirred. The only sound was the crunch of your feet upon the scattered grass."
  "没有什么在动。唯一的声音是你踩在散落草叶上的嘎吱声。"

# game/script.rpy:9939
translate Chinese clearingInvestigate_bf2cf594:

  # "In the center of the clearing was an old stone. An archaic monument or shrine, weathered almost to dust. Remembered by no-one."
  "空地中央有一块粗糙的旧石。一座古老的纪念碑或神龛，已经风化得几乎化为尘土。无人记得。"

# game/script.rpy:9940
translate Chinese clearingInvestigate_4322d60c:

  # "It showed the carven image of some warrior or ancient king holding a severed head aloft."
  "上面刻着一副画面：某个战士或古代国王正高举着一颗断头。"

# game/script.rpy:9942
translate Chinese clearingInvestigate_689d58ba:

  # "The severed head was strange."
  "那颗头颅很奇怪。"

# game/script.rpy:9943
translate Chinese clearingInvestigate_4a91d191:

  # "It looked out from the tablet with a face formed from spiralling coils that looped over and around to create the eyes, the mouth, and the gritted, coiling teeth."
  "它从石碑上望出来，那张脸是盘根错节的螺旋，它们盘旋缠绕，扭曲成了眼睛、嘴巴，以及咬紧、盘卷的牙齿。"

# game/script.rpy:9944
translate Chinese clearingInvestigate_d677bf22:

  # "Something was written on the stone beneath it:"
  "下面的石头上写着些什么："

# game/script.rpy:9945
translate Chinese clearingInvestigate_ab7ec2ab:

  # "{font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font}."
  "{font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font}."

# game/script.rpy:9946
translate Chinese clearingInvestigate_1f0fb21b:

  # "You would not know this name. Its meaning was lost long ago."
  "你无从知晓这个名字。它的含义早已失传。"

# game/script.rpy:9947
translate Chinese clearingInvestigate_ae31f8f4:

  # "I am forgotten."
  "我被遗忘了。"

# game/script.rpy:9950
translate Chinese clearingInvestigate_af76ac05:

  # "The trees around you rustled, but made no noise."
  "周围的树木摇曳摩擦，却没有发出任何声音。"

# game/script.rpy:9951
translate Chinese clearingInvestigate_c39c9046:

  # "The silence was strong here."
  "这里的寂静浓重得令人窒息。"

# game/script.rpy:9954
translate Chinese essay6Showing_ef1e9b26:

  # "It wrapped itself around you like an old coat."
  "它像一件旧外套一样将你包裹。"

# game/script.rpy:9958
translate Chinese essay6Showing_1ae7adf4:

  # t "There you are! "
  t "你在这儿啊！"

# game/script.rpy:9959
translate Chinese essay6Showing_fc7ff541:

  # t "You're a wild one, running off like that! I can relate. But come, that treasure isn't going to steal itself!"
  t "你可真够野的，居然就这么跑了！我懂。不过快来吧，那财宝可不会自己飞进咱们口袋！"

# game/script.rpy:9960
translate Chinese essay6Showing_b1f99978:

  # "They took you firmly by your hand and dragged you back to the path."
  "小偷紧紧抓住你的手，把你拽回了小路。"

# game/script.rpy:9963
translate Chinese essay6Showing_b0956a73:

  # f "There you are!"
  f "你在这儿啊！"

# game/script.rpy:9964
translate Chinese essay6Showing_380f3be1:

  # f "My word, I was beginning to get quite worried. Come on, let us be off! That curse isn't going to lift itself."
  f "我的天，我开始有些担心了。快来，我们出发吧！那诅咒可不会自己解除。"

# game/script.rpy:9965
translate Chinese essay6Showing_9418b838:

  # "He took you firmly by your hand and dragged you back to the path."
  "他紧紧抓住你的手，把你拽回了小路。"

# game/script.rpy:9968
translate Chinese essay6Showing_44715db9:

  # "Soon, you began to see a glimmer of silver light in the darkness."
  "很快，你在黑暗中看到了一线闪烁的银光。"

# game/script.rpy:9969
translate Chinese essay6Showing_0780a027:

  # "The forest was covered in puddles of water from the rains. Each one shone with light."
  "森林里到处都是雨后积起的水洼。每一个都闪烁着光芒。"

# game/script.rpy:9970
translate Chinese essay6Showing_0a2eced7:

  # "All around you, the woods were dark and empty. But when you looked into the water, you saw the reflection of a shining cottage below."
  "你周围的树林黑暗而空旷。但当你向水里看去时，却看到下方倒映着一座闪闪发光的小屋。"

# game/script.rpy:9974
translate Chinese essay6Showing_0ae9bcd0:

  # ""
  ""

# game/script.rpy:9979
translate Chinese essay6Showing_1668d521:

  # "For a brief moment, you thought you saw a figure reflected in the water. But as soon as you blinked, it was gone."
  "有那么短短的一瞬，你以为看到水里倒映着一个人影。但你一眨眼，它就不见了。"

# game/script.rpy:9995
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_edb938fd:

  # "... Is that right. Is that your name."
  "……这样啊。那是你的名字。"

# game/script.rpy:9996
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_3b55665f:

  # "Well. What a surprise."
  "呵。真是个惊喜。"

# game/script.rpy:9997
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_dc48b6f4:

  # "It's an honour to meet you, {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font}. Let us hear your story together."
  "很荣幸见到你，{font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font}。让我们一起来听听你的故事。"

# game/script.rpy:9998
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_129e3882:

  # "You first walked the earth ten thousand years ago, or more. The god {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒀭𒂗𒆤{/font} appointed you as a terror to the human race."
  "你在距今一万年或更久以前首次踏足大地。神明{font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒀭𒂗𒆤{/font}指派你作为人类的梦魇。"

# game/script.rpy:9999
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_2a8825d0:

  # "An ogre. A demon. A chimera. The first monster. You mastered the art of human speech and spoke to them in their own tongue. You murdered men and walked among them, and none could stop you."
  "一个食人魔。一个恶魔。形貌缝合的异兽。最初的怪物。你掌握了人类的言辞，用他们的语言与他们交谈。你屠杀人类，混迹于他们之中，无人能阻挡你。"

# game/script.rpy:10000
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_2caaae18:

  # "Your face was a shifting spiral of intestines - like those that a haruspex may see when they cut open a man or beast to see what omens lay within."
  "你的脸是一团不断蠕动变幻的肠道螺旋——就像脏卜师剖开人畜，查看其中吉凶预兆时所见的那样。"

# game/script.rpy:10001
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_8abca1ac:

  # "The shape of those coils foretold the future, and those who looked upon them could see the prophecy of their own death. For this reason, you were sometimes called The Keeper of the Fortress of Intestines."
  "那些盘结的形状预示着未来，直视它们的人能看到自己死亡的预言。因此，你有时被称为“肠道堡垒的看守者”。"

# game/script.rpy:10002
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_bfd81ae7:

  # "You possessed seven terrors, which lay upon you like seven cloaks."
  "你身具七重恐怖，像七件披风般披戴在身。"

# game/script.rpy:10003
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_fc0b0e29:

  # "Your shout was the flood-weapon, whose utterance is Fire, and whose breath is Death."
  "你的咆哮是洪涛的武器，你的话语是火焰，你的吐息是死亡。"

# game/script.rpy:10004
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_656c6b88:

  # "But still, Gilgamesh came."
  "但吉尔伽美什还是来了。"

# game/script.rpy:10005
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_17738472:

  # "He declared that he would cut down the cedar trees. He walked for six days and six nights."
  "他宣称要砍倒雪松林。他走了六天六夜。"

# game/script.rpy:10006
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_f653756f:

  # "In his right hand was a terrible sound. In his left hand was a terrible light."
  "他的右手握着可怕的声响。他的左手握着可怕的光芒。"

# game/script.rpy:10007
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_44846550:

  # "The sword came down. When the time came, you found that you were almost glad."
  "剑落下了。当那一刻来临时，你发现自己甚至有些欣慰。"

# game/script.rpy:10008
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_c0b41867:

  # "Your neck rose to meet the blade."
  "你的脖颈扬起，迎上了利刃。"

# game/script.rpy:10009
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_268cf6ca:

  # "Perhaps you were waiting for this."
  "也许你一直在等待这一刻。"

# game/script.rpy:10010
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_a91a0704:

  # "Perhaps you had been alive too long."
  "也许你活得太久了。"

# game/script.rpy:10011
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_8b2f2615:

  # "Your head was held aloft, and then stowed in a leather sack."
  "你的头颅被高高举起，然后装进了一个皮口袋。"

# game/script.rpy:10012
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_20e89fef:

  # "That was the end."
  "那就是结局。"

# game/script.rpy:10013
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_f6eadeed:

  # "The trees fell. The mountain wore to dust. The valley is no longer sacred."
  "树木倒下。山峦化为尘土。山谷不复神圣。"

# game/script.rpy:10014
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_ebde3949:

  # "Those things have worn away like rocks in the river of the human mind. There is no trace of them now."
  "那些事物就像人类记忆长河中的岩石一样被磨损殆尽。如今已没有任何痕迹。"

# game/script.rpy:10015
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_b0c6802b:

  # "The shadows grow. The earth becomes hot and grey, like ash. "
  "阴影在蔓延。大地变得灼热而灰暗，如同灰烬。"

# game/script.rpy:10016
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_d8cd41c3:

  # "Nothing is left of you now. Perhaps a shadow."
  "你现在什么都没剩下了。或许只有一个影子。"

# game/script.rpy:10017
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_9fdf691a:

  # "Your name - {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font} - it had a specific meaning to those that spoke it. But that meaning is lost. It only lives on as a collection of syllables."
  "你的名字——{font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font}——对那些念出它的人来说有着特定的含义。但那含义已经遗失了。它如今只作为一堆音节而存在。"

# game/script.rpy:10018
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_ddf4c2f1:

  # "Why do you cling to it? If it means nothing, what point is there in having it?"
  "为什么你还要执着于它？如果它毫无意义，留着它又有什么用？"

# game/script.rpy:10019
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_a20cefa7:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:10020
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_46a897eb:

  # "Well. I hope you have enjoyed your little trek down memory lane, {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font}."
  "好吧。希望你喜欢这趟回忆之旅，{font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font}。"

# game/script.rpy:10021
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_e7744296:

  # "I am glad you are still alive. No matter what you had to do. You are still alive."
  "我很高兴你还活着。无论你为此做过什么。你依然活着。"

# game/script.rpy:10022
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_a20cefa7_1:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:10023
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_e0a55f79:

  # "That's enough. This starts to feel ghoulish."
  "够了。这感觉有点太过病态了。"

# game/script.rpy:10024
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_31a28f3f:

  # "Perhaps this gone on too long."
  "也许这拖得太久了。"

# game/script.rpy:10025
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_66c28bd4:

  # "Come find me. Go to the village, then walk to your house. I will wait for you there. I will wait for the name."
  "来找我吧。去村里，然后走到你家。我会在那里等你。我会等待那个名字。"

# game/script.rpy:10026
translate Chinese humbabaNameSecret_6f197336:

  # "That's the end. There's nothing left to tell."
  "结束了。没有什么可讲的了。"

# game/script.rpy:10056
translate Chinese note1Opens_0302119c:

  # "Nothing beside remained."
  "此外空无一物。"

# game/script.rpy:10069
translate Chinese tDiaryOpens_0302119c:

  # "Nothing beside remained."
  "此外空无一物。"

# game/script.rpy:10081
translate Chinese posterOpens_0302119c:

  # "Nothing beside remained."
  "此外空无一物。"

# game/script.rpy:10085
translate Chinese posterOpens_0302119c_1:

  # "Nothing beside remained."
  "此外空无一物。"

# game/script.rpy:10095
translate Chinese essay1Opens_da2ab377:

  # "It's quite the sight to see."
  "这真是难得一见的奇景。"

# game/script.rpy:10105
translate Chinese essay2Opens_b081d176:

  # "You uncovered a pantry with a single, mouldy piece of bread, and a pit sunk into the muck of the wall with the remains of an old fire."
  "你发现了一个储藏室，里面只有一块发霉的面包，还有墙上淤泥里凹陷下去的一个火坑，里面有生过火的残迹。"

# game/script.rpy:10115
translate Chinese essay3Opens_c1af6dfa:

  # "This room must have been sweltering, once."
  "这个房间曾经一定闷热难耐。"

# game/script.rpy:10125
translate Chinese essay4Opens_739acad6:

  # "It was covered in dust. A small bed nestled in the corner, with a half-full teacup beside it."
  "里面布满灰尘。角落里安置着一张小床，旁边放着一个装了半杯茶的茶杯。"

# game/script.rpy:10135
translate Chinese essay5Opens_c2549963:

  # "The basement within was dark. Nothing moved."
  "地下室里一片漆黑。没有任何动静。"

# game/script.rpy:10145
translate Chinese essay6Opens_ef1e9b26:

  # "It wrapped itself around you like an old coat."
  "它像一件旧外套一样将你包裹。"

# game/script.rpy:10155
translate Chinese gilgameshOpens_bc9e3522:

  # "The waters burned like a torch. The light of them fell upon your face."
  "湖水像火炬一样燃烧着。光芒照在你的脸上。"

# game/script.rpy:10165
translate Chinese creepiestOpens_beb8b779:

  # "Where did She come from? What colossal, slow thoughts does She think up there?"
  "她从何而来？高踞天际的她，思考着怎样宏大而缓慢的思想？"

# game/script.rpy:10170
translate Chinese creepiestOpens_beb8b779_1:

  # "Where did She come from? What colossal, slow thoughts does She think up there?"
  "她从何而来？高踞天际的她，思考着怎样宏大而缓慢的思想？"

# game/script.rpy:10182
translate Chinese gilgameshPathOpens_d661b29a:

  # gm "You're all doomed! Doooooooomed!"
  gm "你们全完了！全完啦啊啊啊！"

# game/script.rpy:10187
translate Chinese gilgameshPathOpens_9107b701:

  # "Had you ever been this way before? You couldn't recall."
  "你以前走过这条路吗？你记不起来了。"

# game/script.rpy:10192
translate Chinese gilgameshPathOpens_aebcb0fa:

  # f "Prickle! Crawl! Shudder and Clink! Don't tarry or stall, get us there in a wink!"
  f "芒刺！游移！战栗！叮铃！莫迟莫疑，眨眼送行！"

# game/script.rpy:10197
translate Chinese gilgameshPathOpens_2c771d95:

  # "Soon you came upon an ancient strangler fig. You cut the vines and swamp flowers from it to reveal a small blue door, inlaid with precious moonstone and intricate engravings."
  "很快，你遇到了一棵古老的绞杀榕。你砍断藤蔓和沼泽花朵，露出一扇小巧的蓝门，门上镶嵌着珍贵的月光石和繁复的雕花。"

# game/script.rpy:10219
translate Chinese gilgameshStory_5cb4f23c:

  # gBlank "That is not your name. But I can take you to the one who bears it."
  gBlank "那不是你的名字。但我能带你去见拥有那个名字的人。"

