  # gil "I am {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒀭𒄑𒉋𒂵𒎌{/font}. Two thirds they made me god, and one third man."
  gil "I am {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒀭𒄑𒉋𒂵𒎌{/font}. Two thirds they made me god, and one third man."

# game/script.rpy:10241
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_537ef00c:

  # gil "In Uruk I built walls, a great rampart, and the temple of blessed Eanna for the god of the firmament Anu, and for Ishtar the goddess of love. Look at the walls today."
  gil "In Uruk I built walls, a great rampart, and the temple of blessed Eanna for the god of the firmament Anu, and for Ishtar the goddess of love. Look at the walls today."

# game/script.rpy:10247
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_38efc72c:

  # "------"
  "------"

# game/script.rpy:10249
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_08adecf5:

  # gil "I see. Then this tale is all that remains."
  gil "I see. Then this tale is all that remains."

# game/script.rpy:10251
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_9c3a62ee:

  # gil "All that is left of me is this last fragment, lurking in this tale. A haunting spirit. A memory of a memory. "
  gil "All that is left of me is this last fragment, lurking in this tale. A haunting spirit. A memory of a memory. "

# game/script.rpy:10253
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_66750510:

  # gil "Stories are passed down, from father to son, and so a fragment of me has survived here. But soon, I will be forgotten, as all men are forgotten."
  gil "Stories are passed down, from father to son, and so a fragment of me has survived here. But soon, I will be forgotten, as all men are forgotten."

# game/script.rpy:10258
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_386af3dd:

  # gil "This is a monument to my friend. {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font}."
  gil "This is a monument to my friend. {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font}."

# game/script.rpy:10263
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_d519443d:

  # gil "He was a wild man. His body was rough, he had long hair like a woman's; it waved like the hair of Nisaba, the goddess of corn."
  gil "He was a wild man. His body was rough, he had long hair like a woman's; it waved like the hair of Nisaba, the goddess of corn."

# game/script.rpy:10265
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_b8a1ccc4:

  # gil "When I ran riot, Aruru, the goddess of creation, created him to stand against me."
  gil "When I ran riot, Aruru, the goddess of creation, created him to stand against me."

# game/script.rpy:10268
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_0ef9b832:

  # gil "She said 'Let us create his equal; let it be as like him as his own reflection, his second self; stormy heart for stormy heart. Let them contend together and leave Uruk in quiet.'"
  gil "She said 'Let us create his equal; let it be as like him as his own reflection, his second self; stormy heart for stormy heart. Let them contend together and leave Uruk in quiet.'"

# game/script.rpy:10270
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_51a69cdf:

  # gil "When we met, we grappled. We shattered the doorposts and the walls shook, we snorted like bulls locked together."
  gil "When we met, we grappled. We shattered the doorposts and the walls shook, we snorted like bulls locked together."

# game/script.rpy:10272
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_d72699d2:

  # gil "Then immediately my fury died. {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} looked at me and said, ‘There is not another like you in the world.'"
  gil "Then immediately my fury died. {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} looked at me and said, ‘There is not another like you in the world.'"

# game/script.rpy:10275
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_7354d2bf:

  # gil "Ninsun, who is as strong as a wild ox in the byre, she was the mother who bore you, and now you are raised above all men, and Enlil has given you the kingship.’"
  gil "Ninsun, who is as strong as a wild ox in the byre, she was the mother who bore you, and now you are raised above all men, and Enlil has given you the kingship.’"

# game/script.rpy:10277
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_c33e507a:

  # gil "So we embraced each other and our friendship was sealed."
  gil "So we embraced each other and our friendship was sealed."

# game/script.rpy:10280
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_417b67bf:

  # gil "I was a god and a man. {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} was an animal and a man. Together, we became human. "
  gil "I was a god and a man. {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} was an animal and a man. Together, we became human. "

# game/script.rpy:10285
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_b45d87f7:

  # gil "One day, I turned to {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} and said 'I have not established my name stamped on bricks as my destiny decreed; therefore I will go to the country where the cedar is felled."
  gil "One day, I turned to {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} and said 'I have not established my name stamped on bricks as my destiny decreed; therefore I will go to the country where the cedar is felled."

# game/script.rpy:10289
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_8d0afb70:

  # gil "In the cedar forest was a guardian named {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font}. In order to keep the cedar safe, the gods assigned him as a terror to the human race. "
  gil "In the cedar forest was a guardian named {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font}. In order to keep the cedar safe, the gods assigned him as a terror to the human race. "

# game/script.rpy:10292
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_35643285:

  # gil "So I said with pride 'I, {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒀭𒄑𒉋𒂵𒎌{/font}, go to see that creature of whom such things are spoken, the rumour of whose name fills the world. I will conquer him in his cedar wood."
  gil "So I said with pride 'I, {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒀭𒄑𒉋𒂵𒎌{/font}, go to see that creature of whom such things are spoken, the rumour of whose name fills the world. I will conquer him in his cedar wood."

# game/script.rpy:10295
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_1a56b7a6:

  # gil "{font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} said to me '{font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒀭𒄑𒉋𒂵𒎌{/font}. You are young. Your courage carries you too far.'"
  gil "{font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} said to me '{font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒀭𒄑𒉋𒂵𒎌{/font}. You are young. Your courage carries you too far.'"

# game/script.rpy:10298
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_04b47597:

  # gil "'{font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font} is not like men who die. Before a man can approach within even sixty times six yards, {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font} has already reached his house among the cedars.'"
  gil "'{font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font} is not like men who die. Before a man can approach within even sixty times six yards, {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font} has already reached his house among the cedars.'"

# game/script.rpy:10301
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_49a4cd42:

  # gil "'When he looks at someone, it is the look of death. A lion eating a corpse: he never wipes away the blood.'"
  gil "'When he looks at someone, it is the look of death. A lion eating a corpse: he never wipes away the blood.'"

# game/script.rpy:10304
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_419c54f5:

  # gil "When I heard this, I laughed. 'Shall I say that I am afraid of {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font}? That I will sit at home for all the rest of my days?'"
  gil "When I heard this, I laughed. 'Shall I say that I am afraid of {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font}? That I will sit at home for all the rest of my days?'"

# game/script.rpy:10307
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_ac8fdf37:

  # gil "We are not gods. We cannot ascend to heaven."
  gil "We are not gods. We cannot ascend to heaven."

# game/script.rpy:10309
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_ef12cbc8:

  # gil "No, we are mortal men. Our days are few in number, and whatever we achieve is a puff of wind."
  gil "No, we are mortal men. Our days are few in number, and whatever we achieve is a puff of wind."

# game/script.rpy:10311
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_5b4de663:

  # gil "Why be afraid then, since sooner or later death must come?"
  gil "Why be afraid then, since sooner or later death must come?"

# game/script.rpy:10313
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_af204ee2:

  # gil "I will cut down the tree. I will kill {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font}. I will make a lasting name for myself. I will stamp my fame on men's minds forever."
  gil "I will cut down the tree. I will kill {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font}. I will make a lasting name for myself. I will stamp my fame on men's minds forever."

# game/script.rpy:10319
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_49aa144c:

  # gil "After many days and nights, we came upon him in the depths of the forest."
  gil "After many days and nights, we came upon him in the depths of the forest."

# game/script.rpy:10322
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_2e5552c6:

  # gil "His face was a spiral, like the entrails of man and beast, from which omens may be read. Around him were his seven terrors, which lay upon him like seven cloaks."
  gil "His face was a spiral, like the entrails of man and beast, from which omens may be read. Around him were his seven terrors, which lay upon him like seven cloaks."

# game/script.rpy:10324
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_97749b20:

  # gil "{font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} quailed in fear. But I said, 'Look, {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font}, immolation and sacrifice are not yet for us.'"
  gil "{font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} quailed in fear. But I said, 'Look, {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font}, immolation and sacrifice are not yet for us.'"

# game/script.rpy:10326
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_14f0db2f:

  # gil "'The boat of the dead shall not go down, nor the three-ply cloth be cut for our shrouding. Not yet will our people be desolate, nor the pyre be lit in our house and our dwelling burnt.'"
  gil "'The boat of the dead shall not go down, nor the three-ply cloth be cut for our shrouding. Not yet will our people be desolate, nor the pyre be lit in our house and our dwelling burnt.'"

# game/script.rpy:10328
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_29ddaa78:

  # gil "'Put your hand in mine, and we shall see what hands like ours can do.'"
  gil "'Put your hand in mine, and we shall see what hands like ours can do.'"

# game/script.rpy:10330
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_1ff18504:

  # gil "He took the axe in his hand, I drew the sword from my belt, and I struck {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font} with a thrust of the sword to the neck."
  gil "He took the axe in his hand, I drew the sword from my belt, and I struck {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font} with a thrust of the sword to the neck."

# game/script.rpy:10332
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_11bc8111:

  # gil "{font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} my comrade struck the second blow. At the third blow, {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font} fell."
  gil "{font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} my comrade struck the second blow. At the third blow, {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font} fell."

# game/script.rpy:10334
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_d5a78b4e:

  # gil "For as far as two leagues the cedars shivered when {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} felled the watcher of the forest, he at whose voice Hermon and Lebanon used to tremble."
  gil "For as far as two leagues the cedars shivered when {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} felled the watcher of the forest, he at whose voice Hermon and Lebanon used to tremble."

# game/script.rpy:10336
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_0a2d8712:

  # gil "Now the mountains were moved and all the hills, for the guardian of the forest was killed. The seven splendours of {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font} were extinguished."
  gil "Now the mountains were moved and all the hills, for the guardian of the forest was killed. The seven splendours of {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font} were extinguished."

# game/script.rpy:10341
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_be7f95c5:

  # gil "The gods cursed us for our hubris. Anu said to Enlil, 'Because they have killed {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font} who guarded the Cedar Mountain, one of the two must die.'"
  gil "The gods cursed us for our hubris. Anu said to Enlil, 'Because they have killed {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font} who guarded the Cedar Mountain, one of the two must die.'"

# game/script.rpy:10343
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_149c1c55:

  # gil " And so {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} fell and lay stricken with sickness. "
  gil " And so {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} fell and lay stricken with sickness. "

# game/script.rpy:10345
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_74831350:

  # gil "One whole day he lay on his bed and his suffering grew stronger. "
  gil "One whole day he lay on his bed and his suffering grew stronger. "

# game/script.rpy:10347
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_4a0c4f51:

  # gil "A second day he lay on his bed, and I watched over him, but the sickness grew stronger."
  gil "A second day he lay on his bed, and I watched over him, but the sickness grew stronger."

# game/script.rpy:10349
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_08ad19f1:

  # gil "A third day he lay on his bed, his tears ran down in streams."
  gil "A third day he lay on his bed, his tears ran down in streams."

# game/script.rpy:10352
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_be9e7380:

  # gil "He called out to me, 'It was I who cut down the cedar, I who levelled the forest, I who slew {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font} and now see what has become of me.'"
  gil "He called out to me, 'It was I who cut down the cedar, I who levelled the forest, I who slew {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font} and now see what has become of me.'"

# game/script.rpy:10355
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_8ebf81ed:

  # gil "'Listen, my friend,' (he said to me) 'this is the dream I dreamed last night."
  gil "'Listen, my friend,' (he said to me) 'this is the dream I dreamed last night."

# game/script.rpy:10358
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_830e143c:

  # gil "The heavens roared, and earth rumbled back an answer; between them stood I before an awful being, the sombre-faced man-bird; he had directed on me his purpose. His was a vampire face, his foot was a lion's foot, his hand was an eagle's talon."
  gil "The heavens roared, and earth rumbled back an answer; between them stood I before an awful being, the sombre-faced man-bird; he had directed on me his purpose. His was a vampire face, his foot was a lion's foot, his hand was an eagle's talon."

# game/script.rpy:10361
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_2d36b4b7:

  # gil "He fell on me and his claws were in my hair, he held me fast and I smothered; then he transformed me so that my arms became wings covered with feathers."
  gil "He fell on me and his claws were in my hair, he held me fast and I smothered; then he transformed me so that my arms became wings covered with feathers."

# game/script.rpy:10364
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_dab87409:

  # gil "He turned his stare towards me, and he led me away to the palace of Irkalla, the Queen of Darkness, to the house from which none who enters ever returns, down the road from which there is no coming back."
  gil "He turned his stare towards me, and he led me away to the palace of Irkalla, the Queen of Darkness, to the house from which none who enters ever returns, down the road from which there is no coming back."

# game/script.rpy:10367
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_b9034dd3:

  # gil "With the first light of dawn I touched his heart but it did not beat, nor did he lift his eyes again."
  gil "With the first light of dawn I touched his heart but it did not beat, nor did he lift his eyes again."

# game/script.rpy:10370
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_800402d1:

  # gil "So I laid a veil, as one veils the bride, over my beloved. I began to rage like a lion, like a lioness robbed of her whelps."
  gil "So I laid a veil, as one veils the bride, over my beloved. I began to rage like a lion, like a lioness robbed of her whelps."

# game/script.rpy:10373
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_bc47d5ca:

  # gil "This way and that I paced round the bed, I tore out my hair and strewed it around. I dragged off my splendid robes and flung them down as though they were abominations."
  gil "This way and that I paced round the bed, I tore out my hair and strewed it around. I dragged off my splendid robes and flung them down as though they were abominations."

# game/script.rpy:10376
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_4356a9cd:

  # gil "For six days I would not let him be buried, thinking, ‘If my grief is violent enough, perhaps he will come back to life again.’ "
  gil "For six days I would not let him be buried, thinking, ‘If my grief is violent enough, perhaps he will come back to life again.’ "

# game/script.rpy:10379
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_9915c5f7:

  # gil "For six days and seven nights I mourned him, until the worm fastened upon him."
  gil "For six days and seven nights I mourned him, until the worm fastened upon him."

# game/script.rpy:10382
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_52d9a265:

  # gil "Then I was frightened, I was terrified by death, and I set out to roam the wilderness."
  gil "Then I was frightened, I was terrified by death, and I set out to roam the wilderness."

# game/script.rpy:10385
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_105f3c5f:

  # gil "I cannot bear to what happened to my friend-I cannot bear what happened to {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font}- so I roam the wilderness in my grief."
  gil "I cannot bear to what happened to my friend-I cannot bear what happened to {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font}- so I roam the wilderness in my grief."

# game/script.rpy:10388
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_67429b71:

  # gil "How can my mind have any rest? My beloved friend has turned into clay- my beloved {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} has turned into clay."
  gil "How can my mind have any rest? My beloved friend has turned into clay- my beloved {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font} has turned into clay."

# game/script.rpy:10391
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_49b0c794:

  # gil "And won’t I too lie down in the dirt like him, and never rise again?"
  gil "And won’t I too lie down in the dirt like him, and never rise again?"

# game/script.rpy:10397
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_b327034f:

  # gil "Attend. The battle is not over."
  gil "Attend. The battle is not over."

# game/script.rpy:10399
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_a27e999c:

  # gil "The last remnants of {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font} still lurk in this tale, just as I do. He feasts on other lives to prolong his own. We are eaten forever."
  gil "The last remnants of {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒄷𒌝𒁀𒁀{/font} still lurk in this tale, just as I do. He feasts on other lives to prolong his own. We are eaten forever."

# game/script.rpy:10402
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_b3370426:

  # gil "You must travel an unknown road and fight a strange battle. Confront him in your house, where he lurks."
  gil "You must travel an unknown road and fight a strange battle. Confront him in your house, where he lurks."

# game/script.rpy:10404
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_3e02a5d9:

  # gil "He will be cunning. But you will be brave. From the day you go until you return, until you destroy the evil which Shamash abhors, I will pray for you."
  gil "He will be cunning. But you will be brave. From the day you go until you return, until you destroy the evil which Shamash abhors, I will pray for you."

# game/script.rpy:10406
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_2a1fca94:

  # gil "If your heart is fearful, throw away fear."
  gil "If your heart is fearful, throw away fear."

# game/script.rpy:10408
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_4c378288:

  # gil "If there is terror in it, throw away terror."
  gil "If there is terror in it, throw away terror."

# game/script.rpy:10410
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_a3086fce:

  # gil "Take your axe in your hand and attack. He who leaves the fight unfinished is not at peace."
  gil "Take your axe in your hand and attack. He who leaves the fight unfinished is not at peace."

# game/script.rpy:10415
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_d1037aa1:

  # gil "No. Where you go, I cannot follow."
  gil "No. Where you go, I cannot follow."

# game/script.rpy:10417
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_d8611ef7:

  # gil "I have some small sway here, hidden away in this last piece of the tale. But the rest of it belongs to him. I can do nothing now."
  gil "I have some small sway here, hidden away in this last piece of the tale. But the rest of it belongs to him. I can do nothing now."

# game/script.rpy:10419
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_3c54ac93:

  # gil "I will take you back to your home. The rest is your story to tell."
  gil "I will take you back to your home. The rest is your story to tell."

# game/script.rpy:10425
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_760668c8:

  # gil "Goodbye, small one."
  gil "Goodbye, small one."

# game/script.rpy:10427
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_0bce7774:

  # pov "I'm sorry about Enkidu."
  pov "关于恩奇都，我很抱歉."

# game/script.rpy:10429
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_bc10f685:

  # gil "The terror was great, but the dream was marvellous; we must treasure the dream whatever the terror."
  gil "The terror was great, but the dream was marvellous; we must treasure the dream whatever the terror."

# game/script.rpy:10432
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_3d3c2ffb:

  # gil "Yes, the gods took {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font}'s life. But man’s life is short, at any momentit can be snapped, like a reed in a canebrake."
  gil "Yes, the gods took {font=fonts/Segoe ui historic.ttf}𒂗𒆠𒄭{/font}'s life. But man’s life is short, at any momentit can be snapped, like a reed in a canebrake."

# game/script.rpy:10434
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_01872d12:

  # gil "The handsome young man, the lovely young woman - in their prime, death comes and drags them away."
  gil "The handsome young man, the lovely young woman - in their prime, death comes and drags them away."

# game/script.rpy:10436
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_1618a18f:

  # gil "Though no one has seen death’s face or heard death’s voice, suddenly, savagely, death destroys us all, old or young."
  gil "Though no one has seen death’s face or heard death’s voice, suddenly, savagely, death destroys us all, old or young."

# game/script.rpy:10439
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_57425662:

  # gil "The river rises, flows over its banks and carries us all away, like mayflies floating downstream: they stare at the sun, then all at once there is nothing."
  gil "The river rises, flows over its banks and carries us all away, like mayflies floating downstream: they stare at the sun, then all at once there is nothing."

# game/script.rpy:10449
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_ce617998:

  # "…"
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:10450
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_57257ab4:

  # "You've returned."
  "你回来了。"

# game/script.rpy:10451
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_5d908e32:

  # "I don't understand. Where did you go? Who were you talking to?"
  "我不明白。你刚才去哪儿了？你在和谁说话？"

# game/script.rpy:10452
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_89610979:

  # "I called, and you did not answer. I could not see you."
  "我叫你，你没有回答。我看不见你。"

# game/script.rpy:10453
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_ce617998_1:

  # "…"
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:10454
translate Chinese gilgameshConvo_b4d0e23a:

  # "No matter. You are back in my arms now, child. I will not release you again. "
  "没关系。你现在回到我的怀抱了，孩子。我不会再放开你了。"

# game/script.rpy:10461
translate Chinese gutterlingStory_8f28a6cc:

  # "In a wink they leapt out and stuffed you into a sack. Down you went through the crooked drainpipes and secret channels of the village, deep down to the Gutter Of All Gutters where the gutterlings grew their secret garden, fed by all the lost and discarded things from the world of mankind above."
  "眨眼间，他们跳出来把你塞进了一个麻袋。你顺着村里曲折的排水管与暗道一路向下，深坠入众沟之渊。阴沟小鬼们在那里培育了一座秘密花园，以地上人类世界遗弃和丢失的一切事物为养料。"

# game/script.rpy:10462
translate Chinese gutterlingStory_af8f5e1e:

  # "Here the gutterlings stole away those lost things, planting them in the fertile soil of their damp kingdom and nourishing them with drainwater from the world above."
  "阴沟小鬼们把那些遗失之物偷运至此，种在他们潮湿王国的沃土之中，用地上世界的污水来浇灌。"

# game/script.rpy:10463
translate Chinese gutterlingStory_50f1f2ef:

  # "Every full moon they would cut small pieces from them, and from those cuttings they grew more gutterlings."
  "每个满月之夜，他们都会从这些东西上剪下枝条，再用这些插穗培育出更多的阴沟小鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:10464
translate Chinese gutterlingStory_de664f42:

  # g "No escape now, fool! We warned you, and now you will never again see the light of the accursed sun above!"
  g "现在别想逃了，蠢货！我们警告过你，现在你再也见不到地表那该死的阳光了！"

# game/script.rpy:10465
translate Chinese gutterlingStory_ac3975af:

  # "They planted you in the soil and left you to ferment. Your skin crawled, and you realised you would soon bud with the gutterlings."
  "他们把你种进土里，任你发酵。你的皮肤开始阵阵蠕动，你意识到，自己很快就会和阴沟小鬼们一起发芽。"

# game/script.rpy:10473
translate Chinese gutterChoice_db1ba371:

  # "All the lost things from human villages and cities washed down here, to form this kingdom of the lost."
  "人类村庄和城市里所有丢失的东西都被冲到了这里，构成了这个失落之物的国度。"

# game/script.rpy:10474
translate Chinese gutterChoice_69b1000f:

  # "Around you was a nest of shambolic huts made of twigs and straw and rubbish, and looming above you could see a castle built of lost monuments and broken statues."
  "你的四周是虫巢般杂乱的棚屋，用树枝、稻草与垃圾堆砌而成；在你头顶上方，隐隐矗立着一座由遗弃纪念碑与残破雕像筑成的城堡。"

# game/script.rpy:10475
translate Chinese gutterChoice_ba98e015:

  # "To your side was a huge mound of left socks. A mound of keys lay to the other side. In front of you was that library book you'd been looking for."
  "你的旁边是一大堆左脚袜。另一边是一大堆钥匙。在你正前方的，正是你一直在找的那本图书馆的书。"

# game/script.rpy:10479
translate Chinese gutterChoice_045d9d90:

  # pov "NOOOOOOOoooOOOOOooOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOoOOOOOOOOoOOOOOO OOOOOOoOOOOOooOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOoOOOOOOoOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOoooOOOOOOoOOOOOOOO OOOOOOoOOOOOoOOOOOOoooo OOoOOOOOOOOOOOooooooOOOOOOO!"
  pov "不不不不不不不！不不不不不不！不不不不……不不不！"

# game/script.rpy:10486
translate Chinese gutterChoice_f4601680:

  # pov "Oh, woe is me! How could I have been so foolish as to talk to a gutterling six times?"
  pov "噢，我真可悲！我怎么会蠢到去跟一只阴沟小鬼搭话六次？"

# game/script.rpy:10487
translate Chinese gutterChoice_6362132c:

  # "The gutterlings laughed at your pathetic cries."
  "阴沟小鬼们嘲笑着你那可悲的哭喊。"

# game/script.rpy:10492
translate Chinese gutterChoice_fe4d187f:

  # pov "Hello? Anybody? Help me!"
  pov "有人吗？谁在吗？救命！"

# game/script.rpy:10493
translate Chinese gutterChoice_085a7300:

  # "You waited a long while in silence."
  "你在寂静中等待了很久。"

# game/script.rpy:10494
translate Chinese gutterChoice_e9a44b55:

  # "Then you heard a shot ring out."
  "接着你听到一声枪响。"

# game/script.rpy:10495
translate Chinese gutterChoice_2eba176d:

  # g "Gurgh! No!"
  g "呃啊！不！"

# game/script.rpy:10496
translate Chinese gutterChoice_0187692f:

  # h "Get back, beasts."
  h "退后，畜生们。"

# game/script.rpy:10497
translate Chinese gutterChoice_46056b57:

  # "The hunter fired their rifle again and the gutterlings scattered. They rushed over and heaved you out of the soil."
  "猎人再次开枪，阴沟小鬼们四散奔逃。他冲过来，用力把你从土里拽了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:10498
translate Chinese gutterChoice_d4ad15e6:

  # pov "Thank you! I'm so glad you heard me."
  pov "谢谢你！我真高兴你听到了我的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:10499
translate Chinese gutterChoice_c74eb3d7:

  # h "I didn't. I just come down here for target practice."
  h "我没听到。我只是下来练枪法的。"

# game/script.rpy:10500
translate Chinese gutterChoice_ae25dd75:

  # h "Come on!"
  h "快走！"

# game/script.rpy:10501
translate Chinese gutterChoice_6c87085c:

  # "They pulled you behind them and the two of you ran through the crooked streets of the under-city, dodging gutterlings left and right."
  "猎人把你护在身后，你们俩在地下城扭曲的街道上狂奔，左躲右闪地避开那些阴沟小鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:10502
translate Chinese gutterChoice_2ab7b84f:

  # "Then, the walls began to shake."
  "接着，墙壁开始震动。"

# game/script.rpy:10503
translate Chinese gutterChoice_cd8cdf30:

  # "In the distance you heard the approach of a great and terrible shape. A crawling god, formed of lost dreams planted in this dark soil centuries ago and fed every full moon. It loomed over you and spoke."
  "你听到远处有一个庞大而可怖的身影正向此处逼近。一个爬行的神明，由几个世纪前种在这片黑土里、每逢满月便汲取养分的遗失梦境孕育而成。他巨大的身形在你们上方投下阴影，开口说道。"

# game/script.rpy:10504
translate Chinese gutterChoice_c94f7495:

  # gk "You have broken the compact. All lost things belong in my domain, and this child surely is lost."
  gk "你们破坏了契约。所有遗失之物都属于我的领地，而这个孩子毫无疑问是遗失之物。"

# game/script.rpy:10505
translate Chinese gutterChoice_ab02bd36:

  # gk "Hand [him] over, and I will let you go."
  gk "把[him]交出来，我就放你们走。"

# game/script.rpy:10506
translate Chinese gutterChoice_31f69d18:

  # h "Never!"
  h "绝不！"

# game/script.rpy:10507
translate Chinese gutterChoice_cf09c77d:

  # gk "But we have so many treasures here, Hunter. Every lost thing falls to us. Surely we can make an agreement."
  gk "但我们这里有那么多财宝，猎人。每一件丢失的东西都会落到我们手里。我们肯定能做笔交易。"

# game/script.rpy:10508
translate Chinese gutterChoice_ebc7addc:

  # gk "Perhaps this would be to your liking?"
  gk "也许这件会合你的意？"

# game/script.rpy:10509
translate Chinese gutterChoice_2bd648dc:

  # "The gutterlings pulled forward a fine antique rifle."
  "阴沟小鬼们拖出了一把精美的古董步枪。"

# game/script.rpy:10510
translate Chinese gutterChoice_5b00a730:

  # h "Oh. Well... "
  h "哦。这个嘛……"

# game/script.rpy:10511
translate Chinese gutterChoice_8a294c4d:

  # "In that moment, there was a flapping of wings all around you."
  "就在那一刻，你们周围响起了一阵扑棱翅膀的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:10512
translate Chinese gutterChoice_15b64b87:

  # gk "No.... NO!"
  gk "不……不！"

# game/script.rpy:10513
translate Chinese gutterChoice_814d92a9:

  # "A huge flock of birds descended on the Gutterlings, and began to steal away their twigs and straw and rubbish to make their nests. Their great kingdom began to fall."
  "一大群鸟落在阴沟小鬼们身上，偷走他们的树枝、稻草和垃圾去筑巢。他们那庞大的王国开始坍塌。"

# game/script.rpy:10514
translate Chinese gutterChoice_42d290bf:

  # gk "Accursed sparrows! Rats of the air! "
  gk "该死的麻雀！飞天的耗子！"

# game/script.rpy:10515
translate Chinese gutterChoice_bb8e0495:

  # gk "My kingdom! My beautiful kingdom!"
  gk "我的王国！我美丽的王国！"

# game/script.rpy:10516
translate Chinese gutterChoice_6291b3d0:

  # "You fled through the falling debris as the Gutter Of All Gutters collapsed around you."
  "众沟之渊在你们周围坍塌，你在纷纷坠落的残骸中夺路而逃。"

# game/script.rpy:10519
translate Chinese gutterChoice_36c1eb16:

  # "Finally you emerged into the sunlight."
  "终于，你们回到了阳光下。"

# game/script.rpy:10521
translate Chinese gutterChoice_eebed10c:

  # sh "Phew! That was a close one."
  sh "呼！好险。"

# game/script.rpy:10522
translate Chinese gutterChoice_5bca89e8:

  # "The Sparrow-herder was there, looking pale. Several sparrows alighted on his head and shoulders."
  "牧雀人站在那里，脸色苍白。几只麻雀落在了他的头顶和肩膀上。"

# game/script.rpy:10523
translate Chinese gutterChoice_ff395c40:

  # pov "Thank you. You saved me."
  pov "谢谢你们。你们救了我。"

# game/script.rpy:10525
translate Chinese gutterChoice_3ac01a71:

  # sh "Think nothing of it. The sparrows told me you were there."
  sh "别放在心上。是麻雀们告诉我你在那的。"

# game/script.rpy:10526
translate Chinese gutterChoice_af4b0ccd:

  # "The Hunter grunted, and you saw that they had several dead gutterlings slung over their back."
  "猎人咕哝了一声，你看到他背后挂着几只死掉的阴沟小鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:10527
translate Chinese gutterChoice_6a8e1dae:

  # h "Should be able to make some fine pelts out of these."
  h "这些应该能剥出点好皮毛来。"

# game/script.rpy:10528
translate Chinese gutterChoice_42560693:

  # h "Try to stay out of trouble, alright?"
  h "尽量别惹麻烦了，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10529
translate Chinese gutterChoice_ada2fdc8:

  # pov "Yes, I will. Thank you."
  pov "好的，我尽量。谢谢。"

# game/script.rpy:10530
translate Chinese gutterChoice_b78f3d5a:

  # "They nodded, and left you as you shook of the grime of the gutter."
  "他点了点头，转身离去，留下你独自抖落着身上阴沟里的污泥。"

# game/script.rpy:10533
translate Chinese gutterChoice_1b8f96c8:

  # "Alas. No-one heard you."
  "唉。没人听到你的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:10534
translate Chinese gutterChoice_32b9daa1:

  # "There was no-one left to hear."
  "已经没有能听到的人了。"

# game/script.rpy:10539
translate Chinese gutterChoice_c015e6c0:

  # "You held your hands together and prayed for your Godfather, the Everlasting, to save you."
  "你双手合十，祈求你的教父，永恒之主，来拯救你。"

# game/script.rpy:10540
translate Chinese gutterChoice_085a7300_1:

  # "You waited a long while in silence."
  "你在寂静中等待了很久。"

# game/script.rpy:10541
translate Chinese gutterChoice_f013c3e5:

  # "Then a flash of light washed over you, and in an instant you were free of the soil."
  "接着，一道闪光拂过全身，刹那间你便从泥土中解脱了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:10542
translate Chinese gutterChoice_e9d33380:

  # g "[Hes] escaping! Get [him]!"
  g "[Hes]逃跑了！抓住[him]！"

# game/script.rpy:10543
translate Chinese gutterChoice_c1499bb5:

  # "You ran helter-skelter through the drowned streets of the under-city, dodging the budding gutterlings left and right."
  "你在地下城那被淹没的街道上狼狈狂奔，左躲右闪地避开那些正在发芽的阴沟小鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:10544
translate Chinese gutterChoice_b4827ec0:

  # "In the distance you heard the approach of a great and terrible shape. A crawling god formed from the lost dreams, planted in this dark soil centuries ago and fed every full moon. It loomed over you and spoke."
  "你听到远处有一个庞大而可怖的身影正向此处逼近。一个爬行的神明，由几个世纪前种在这片黑土里、每逢满月便汲取养分的遗失梦境孕育而成。他巨大的身形在你们上方投下阴影，开口说道。"

# game/script.rpy:10545
translate Chinese gutterChoice_1a0e8bdc:

  # gk "You have broken the compact, Lord. All lost things belong in my domain, and this child surely is lost."
  gk "您破坏了契约，大人。所有遗失之物都属于我的领地，而这个孩子毫无疑问是遗失之物。"

# game/script.rpy:10546
translate Chinese gutterChoice_e6ba495a:

  # "A great voice boomed out."
  "一个洪亮的声音如雷鸣般响起。"

# game/script.rpy:10547
translate Chinese gutterChoice_a73263de:

  # miw "It is you who has forgotten. Who gave you that body? Who granted you your domain?"
  miw "忘了自己身份的是你。是谁赋予了你那副躯体？是谁赐予了你这片领地？"

# game/script.rpy:10548
translate Chinese gutterChoice_b1e4bfce:

  # miw "Do not overstep yourself, wretch. Everything under heaven belongs to me."
  miw "不得僭越，蝼蚁。天底下的一切都属于我。"

# game/script.rpy:10549
translate Chinese gutterChoice_39ad4df3:

  # "The Gutter King shrank back, grovelling from the bright light, and you took the moment to flee from the pit and back up to the village above."
  "阴沟之王退缩了，在耀眼的强光下匍匐在地，你趁机逃出深坑，回到了上面的村子里。"

# game/script.rpy:10552
translate Chinese gutterChoice_93bf5783:

  # miw "Do not forget this, child. Your soul belongs to me. I will come for you soon."
  miw "别忘了，孩子。你的灵魂属于我。我很快就会来找你的。"

# game/script.rpy:10553
translate Chinese gutterChoice_3ef7e845:

  # "In a blink, the light was gone."
  "眨眼间，光芒消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:10556
translate Chinese gutterChoice_4d2621d4:

  # "You held your hands together and prayed for your Godfather, the King of Ghouls, to save you."
  "你双手合十，祈求你的教父，食尸鬼之王，来拯救你。"

# game/script.rpy:10557
translate Chinese gutterChoice_085a7300_2:

  # "You waited a long while in silence."
  "你在寂静中等待了很久。"

# game/script.rpy:10558
translate Chinese gutterChoice_5d39e277:

  # "Then a burst of hellfire exploded before you, and in an instant you were free of the soil."
  "接着，一团地狱之火在你面前爆开，刹那间你便从泥土中解脱了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:10559
translate Chinese gutterChoice_e9d33380_1:

  # g "[Hes] escaping! Get [him]!"
  g "[Hes]逃跑了！抓住[him]！"

# game/script.rpy:10560
translate Chinese gutterChoice_c1499bb5_1:

  # "You ran helter-skelter through the drowned streets of the under-city, dodging the budding gutterlings left and right."
  "你在地下城那被淹没的街道上狼狈狂奔，左躲右闪地避开那些正在发芽的阴沟小鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:10561
translate Chinese gutterChoice_98bba218:

  # "In the distance you heard the approach of a great and terrible shape. A crawling god formed of lost dreams, planted in this dark soil centuries ago and fed every full moon. It loomed over you and spoke."
  "你听到远处有一个庞大而可怖的身影正向此处逼近。一个爬行的神明，由几个世纪前种在这片黑土里、每逢满月便汲取养分的遗失梦境孕育而成。他巨大的身形在你们上方投下阴影，开口说道。"

# game/script.rpy:10562
translate Chinese gutterChoice_8b735451:

  # gk "You have broken the compact, Devil. All lost things belong in my domain, and this child surely is lost."
  gk "你破坏了契约，魔鬼。所有遗失之物都属于我的领地，而这个孩子毫无疑问是遗失之物。"

# game/script.rpy:10563
translate Chinese gutterChoice_914e2772:

  # "A cackle erupted from deep within the earth."
  "一声怪笑从大地深处爆出。"

# game/script.rpy:10564
translate Chinese gutterChoice_e92d190c:

  # mir "Have your forgotten who owns the underworld, wretched one? You exist here because I allow it."
  mir "你忘了地下世界是谁的地盘了吗，蝼蚁？你能存在于此，全凭我的恩准。"

# game/script.rpy:10565
translate Chinese gutterChoice_56fa1cd3:

  # mir "Do not overstep yourself. Everything under the earth belongs to me."
  mir "不要得寸进尺。地下的一切都属于我。"

# game/script.rpy:10566
translate Chinese gutterChoice_1b800010:

  # "A horde of imps erupted from the pits and swarmed around the Gutter King, poking and jeering."
  "一大群小鬼从坑里蜂拥而出，围在阴沟之王周围，戳弄着他，嘲笑着他。"

# game/script.rpy:10567
translate Chinese gutterChoice_10c74451:

  # "The Gutter King shrank back, and you took the moment to flee from the pit and back up to the village above."
  "阴沟之王退缩了，你趁机逃出深坑，回到了上面的村子里。"

# game/script.rpy:10570
translate Chinese gutterChoice_47398593:

  # mir "Don't forget this, child. I'll come for you soon, and then we'll see what's what!"
  mir "别忘了，孩子。我很快就会来找你的，到时候咱们走着瞧！"

# game/script.rpy:10571
translate Chinese gutterChoice_92e602a0:

  # "In a blink, the fire was gone."
  "眨眼间，火焰消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:10574
translate Chinese gutterChoice_d3dc4f2f:

  # "You held your hands together and prayed for your Godmother, the Collector of Souls, to save you."
  "你双手合十，祈求你的教母，灵魂收割者，来拯救你。"

# game/script.rpy:10575
translate Chinese gutterChoice_085a7300_3:

  # "You waited a long while in silence."
  "你在寂静中等待了很久。"

# game/script.rpy:10576
translate Chinese gutterChoice_d8743774:

  # "Then pitch black darkness fell all through the pit, and as the Gutterlings gibbered in confusion you broke free of the soil."
  "接着，深不可测的暗影降临在整个深坑，趁着阴沟小鬼们在混乱中惊恐怪叫，你挣脱了泥土。"

# game/script.rpy:10577
translate Chinese gutterChoice_e9d33380_2:

  # g "[Hes] escaping! Get [him]!"
  g "[Hes]逃跑了！抓住[him]！"

# game/script.rpy:10578
translate Chinese gutterChoice_c1499bb5_2:

  # "You ran helter-skelter through the drowned streets of the under-city, dodging the budding gutterlings left and right."
  "你在地下城那被淹没的街道上狼狈狂奔，左躲右闪地避开那些正在发芽的阴沟小鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:10579
translate Chinese gutterChoice_98bba218_1:

  # "In the distance you heard the approach of a great and terrible shape. A crawling god formed of lost dreams, planted in this dark soil centuries ago and fed every full moon. It loomed over you and spoke."
  "你听到远处有一个庞大而可怖的身影正向此处逼近。一个爬行的神明，由几个世纪前种在这片黑土里、每逢满月便汲取养分的遗失梦境孕育而成。他巨大的身形在你们上方投下阴影，开口说道。"

# game/script.rpy:10580
translate Chinese gutterChoice_072ad846:

  # gk "You have broken the compact, Lady Death. All lost things belong in my domain, and this child surely is lost."
  gk "你破坏了契约，死神女士。所有遗失之物都属于我的领地，而这个孩子毫无疑问是遗失之物。"

# game/script.rpy:10581
translate Chinese gutterChoice_72cd5ce3:

  # "The fingers of deep mushrooms began to erupt from under the soil."
  "地底蘑菇手指般的菌体开始从泥土下破土而出。"

# game/script.rpy:10582
translate Chinese gutterChoice_b144b227:

  # wib "You are the one who forgets yourself, Gutter King."
  wib "忘了自己身份的人是你，阴沟之王。"

# game/script.rpy:10583
translate Chinese gutterChoice_e8d8317e:

  # wib "Where do you think these lost things of yours go, once they fall out of your kingdom?"
  wib "你以为你的这些遗失之物一旦跌出你的王国，会去哪里？"

# game/script.rpy:10584
translate Chinese gutterChoice_81fe99ce:

  # wib "They come to me. Just as all things must, in the end."
  wib "它们会来到我这里。就像万事万物最终都归于我。"

# game/script.rpy:10585
translate Chinese gutterChoice_2d799d67:

  # "The Gutter King howled as the mushrooms closed over him and began to drag him down into the dark earth."
  "蘑菇将阴沟之王层层覆盖，把他拖入黑暗的大地，他在其中发出了凄厉的长嚎。"

# game/script.rpy:10588
translate Chinese gutterChoice_bf6ead35:

  # "You took your chance, and in a moment you had fled from the pit and back up to the village above."
  "你抓住机会，片刻之间便逃出深坑，回到了上面的村子里。"

# game/script.rpy:10589
translate Chinese gutterChoice_09d06108:

  # pov "Thank you for saving me, Godmother!"
  pov "谢谢您救了我，教母！"

# game/script.rpy:10590
translate Chinese gutterChoice_2f97776e:

  # miw "It was not your time."
  miw "你的大限还没到。"

# game/script.rpy:10591
translate Chinese gutterChoice_c9b97319:

  # miw "That will come soon."
  miw "不过也快了。"

# game/script.rpy:10592
translate Chinese gutterChoice_bb54685f:

  # "In a blink, She was gone."
  "眨眼间，她不见了。"

# game/script.rpy:10610
translate Chinese wolf_8d496167:

  # "You walked through the village gates and into the forest."
  "你穿过村子的大门，走进了森林。"

# game/script.rpy:10617
translate Chinese wolf_36290d9f:

  # "The woods grew dark."
  "树林变得昏暗。"

# game/script.rpy:10621
translate Chinese wolf_a55d77f6:

  # "The silent forest passed you by."
  "寂静的森林在身旁掠过。"

# game/script.rpy:10623
translate Chinese wolf_0ce901fb:

  # "You passed the crooked old water-dragons. The old turtle eyed you from the water."
  "你路过了那些扭曲的老水龙。老乌龟从水里盯着你。"

# game/script.rpy:10625
translate Chinese wolf_b689c6eb:

  # "You heard sirens in the distance."
  "你听到了远处的警笛声。"

# game/script.rpy:10628
translate Chinese wolf_20e7e9d3:

  # "The trees slowly thinned. You walked out of the woods and down a bitumen path."
  "树木渐渐稀疏。你走出树林，沿着一条沥青小路走去。"

# game/script.rpy:10629
translate Chinese wolf_23c0d4e9:

  # "You wandered down an empty street."
  "你在一条空荡荡的街道上漫步。"

# game/script.rpy:10631
translate Chinese wolf_8632219e:

  # "A cold wind was blowing. The cold started to sink into your bones."
  "冷风吹过。寒意开始渗入你的骨髓。"

# game/script.rpy:10632
translate Chinese wolf_761e23aa:

  # "The only light was from an empty Hungry Jack's on the side of the road. The sign shone into the night."
  "唯一的光源来自路边一家空荡荡的汉堡王餐厅。招牌在夜色中孤零零地亮着。"

# game/script.rpy:10633
translate Chinese wolf_69422005:

  # "An apartment block was nearby."
  "附近有一栋公寓楼。"

# game/script.rpy:10659
translate Chinese wolf_48d7f47d:

  # "You waited for a gap in the traffic, then crossed the road."
  "你等到了车流的空隙，然后穿过了马路。"

# game/script.rpy:10660
translate Chinese wolf_402b0219:

  # "You walked up to the unit. You knew which one it was."
  "你走向那个单元。你知道是哪一间。"

# game/script.rpy:10671
translate Chinese doorLock_4a8ae637:

  # "The room inside was dark except for a small fireplace with a chair facing it."
  "房间里一片漆黑，只有一个小壁炉，和一把对着壁炉的椅子。"

# game/script.rpy:10673
translate Chinese doorLock_ed81ac5c:

  # "There was a figure in the chair, lit dimly by the coals. You could not see its face."
  "椅子上有个身影，被炭火隐隐照亮。你看不清它的脸。"

# game/script.rpy:10674
translate Chinese doorLock_f8f95f4b:

  # "Everything else was dark."
  "其余的一切都沉浸在黑暗中。"

# game/script.rpy:10677
translate Chinese doorLock_6a61eeae:

  # "You pulled on the window, but it refused to open."
  "你拉了拉窗户，但拉不开。"

# game/script.rpy:10681
translate Chinese doorLock_be7a0373:

  # "You jiggled the handle."
  "你晃了晃门把手。"

# game/script.rpy:10683
translate Chinese doorLock_51755afd:

  # "The door was locked."
  "门锁着。"

# game/script.rpy:10690
translate Chinese doorLock_777fb0f6:

  # "But you already knew the combination."
  "但你早就知道密码了。"

# game/script.rpy:10692
translate Chinese doorLock_37b1a4af:

  # "The lock came undone with a click."
  "锁咔哒一声解开了。"

# game/script.rpy:10698
translate Chinese doorLock_8721c336:

  # "Child. The hour grows late."
  "孩子。夜已经深了。"

# game/script.rpy:10699
translate Chinese doorLock_ef1c65fd:

  # "This choice leads to The End. You will never be able to return to the world you once knew."
  "这个选择将通向终局。你将永远无法回到你曾经熟知的那个世界。"

# game/script.rpy:10700
translate Chinese doorLock_97652bf7:

  # "Ever."
  "永远。"

# game/script.rpy:10701
translate Chinese doorLock_facced3b:

  # "There is not much time left. But still, you should only open this door once you are certain you know the truth."
  "剩下的时间不多了。尽管如此，只有确信明了真相，你才该打开这扇门。"

# game/script.rpy:10709
translate Chinese doorLock_84649feb:

  # "Very well."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:10711
translate Chinese doorLock_e7df51d9:

  # "Then you are not ready."
  "那么你还没准备好。"

# game/script.rpy:10712
translate Chinese doorLock_4246b7c8:

  # "There is not much time. If you plan to return, return soon."
  "时间不多了。如果你打算回来，就尽快。"

# game/script.rpy:10713
translate Chinese doorLock_0dd5c8b8:

  # "You blinked, and found yourself back in the village."
  "你眨了眨眼，发现自己回到了村里。"

# game/script.rpy:10716
translate Chinese doorLock_84649feb_1:

  # "Very well."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:10717
translate Chinese doorLock_4246b7c8_1:

  # "There is not much time. If you plan to return, return soon."
  "时间不多了。如果你打算回来，就尽快。"

# game/script.rpy:10718
translate Chinese doorLock_0dd5c8b8_1:

  # "You blinked, and found yourself back in the village."
  "你眨了眨眼，发现自己回到了村里。"

# game/script.rpy:10721
translate Chinese doorLock_2f5506d7:

  # "Child. Make sure you know what you are doing."
  "孩子。确保你知道自己在做什么。"

# game/script.rpy:10722
translate Chinese doorLock_ef1c65fd_1:

  # "This choice leads to The End. You will never be able to return to the world you once knew."
  "这个选择将通向终局。你将永远无法回到你曾经熟知的那个世界。"

# game/script.rpy:10723
translate Chinese doorLock_97652bf7_1:

  # "Ever."
  "永远。"

# game/script.rpy:10724
translate Chinese doorLock_04546365:

  # "You should only open this door once you are certain you know the truth."
  "你只有在确信自己了解真相的情况下，才应该打开这扇门。"

# game/script.rpy:10725
translate Chinese doorLock_f019026a:

  # "Once you know everything you need to know."
  "当你知晓了所有你需要知晓的事情之后。"

# game/script.rpy:10732
translate Chinese doorLock_84649feb_2:

  # "Very well."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:10735
translate Chinese doorLock_e7df51d9_1:

  # "Then you are not ready."
  "那么你还没准备好。"

# game/script.rpy:10736
translate Chinese doorLock_fda503a8:

  # "Perhaps another time. In another life."
  "也许等下次吧。在下辈子。"

# game/script.rpy:10737
translate Chinese doorLock_0dd5c8b8_2:

  # "You blinked, and found yourself back in the village."
  "你眨了眨眼，发现自己回到了村里。"

# game/script.rpy:10742
translate Chinese doorLock_84649feb_3:

  # "Very well."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:10743
translate Chinese doorLock_24f845a8:

  # "Another time, then. In another life."
  "那就等下次吧。在下辈子。"

# game/script.rpy:10744
translate Chinese doorLock_0dd5c8b8_3:

  # "You blinked, and found yourself back in the village."
  "你眨了眨眼，发现自己回到了村里。"

# game/script.rpy:10749
translate Chinese doorLock_95b71484:

  # "The door swung slowly open."
  "门缓缓敞开。"

# game/script.rpy:10767
translate Chinese doorLock_c6c0f047:

  # "You walked around the apartment block."
  "你绕着公寓楼走了一圈。"

# game/script.rpy:10768
translate Chinese doorLock_abce9afa:

  # "There was no sign of another way in."
  "没有任何其他入口的迹象。"

# game/script.rpy:10771
translate Chinese doorLock_31e16f99:

  # "You walked away down the road and through the woods."
  "你沿着路走远，穿过了树林。"

# game/script.rpy:10772
translate Chinese doorLock_d6612612:

  # "After a long journey, you arrived back at the village."
  "经过漫长的旅程，你回到了村里。"

# game/script.rpy:10777
translate Chinese wolfHouse_464b9518:

  # "The flat was small, but cosy and warm."
  "公寓很小，但舒适温暖。"

# game/script.rpy:10778
translate Chinese wolfHouse_9be4e710:

  # "By the fireplace was a figure in a soft, red armchair."
  "壁炉旁，一个身影坐在一张柔软的红色扶手椅里。"

# game/script.rpy:10780
translate Chinese wolfHouse_e729d2a7:

  # "The flat was grey with dust that lay thick on every surface."
  "公寓里灰蒙蒙的，各个角落都覆着厚厚一层灰。"

# game/script.rpy:10781
translate Chinese wolfHouse_77bd7ba2:

  # "By the fireplace was a figure in a cracked red armchair."
  "壁炉旁，一个身影坐在一张开裂的红色扶手椅里。"

# game/script.rpy:10783
translate Chinese wolfHouse_1e08df29:

  # "The flat stank of decay."
  "公寓里散发着腐烂的恶臭。"

# game/script.rpy:10784
translate Chinese wolfHouse_8f500767:

  # "By the fireplace was a shrunken figure in a decrepit armchair."
  "壁炉旁，一个干瘪的身影坐在一张破旧不堪的扶手椅里。"

# game/script.rpy:10786
translate Chinese wolfHouse_a60711fc:

  # "The room was black with rot. Small things skittered in the corners."
  "房间因腐朽而发黑。角落里有小东西在飞快地爬动。"

# game/script.rpy:10787
translate Chinese wolfHouse_423db42c:

  # "By the fireplace was an frail, crooked figure in the crumbling remains of an armchair."
  "壁炉旁，一个虚弱、佝偻的身影陷在几近散架的扶手椅中。"

# game/script.rpy:10789
translate Chinese wolfHouse_6ef3e7ec:

  # "You walked closer."
  "你走近了些。"

# game/script.rpy:10800
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_930a0cbf:

  # "[He] were reading a book."
  "[He]正在读一本书。"

# game/script.rpy:10802
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_7f69f752:

  # "[He] was reading a book."
  "[He]正在读一本书。"

# game/script.rpy:10804
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_cb9da553:

  # "In the dim light, you couldn't quite make out [his] face."
  "在昏暗的光线下，你看不清[his]的脸。"

# game/script.rpy:10805
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_d9a27901:

  # "[He] looked ill. Sweat soaked [his] chest and the back of the chair, as if [he]'d been sitting there for days."
  "[He]看起来病了。汗水浸透了[his]的胸口和椅背，就好像[he]已经在这里坐了好几天了。"

# game/script.rpy:10806
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_0185a8ae:

  # "[He] gripped the book tightly. [His] knuckles were white."
  "[He]紧紧抓着书，指节发白。"

# game/script.rpy:10808
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_cb9da553_1:

  # "In the dim light, you couldn't quite make out [his] face."
  "在昏暗的光线下，你看不清[his]的脸。"

# game/script.rpy:10809
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_38f4ab04:

  # "A thick layer of dust covered everything in the room, even [his] shoulders and body, as if [he] hadn't moved for months."
  "房间里的一切都落满了一层厚厚的灰尘，甚至连[his]的肩膀和身上也不例外，就好像[he]已经几个月没有动弹过了。"

# game/script.rpy:10810
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_9e6eeb82:

  # "[His] hair was long and lank. [He] gripped the book tightly. [His] knuckles were white."
  "[His]的头发又长又软塌。[He]紧紧抓着书，指节发白。"

# game/script.rpy:10813
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_be3677f2:

  # "In the dim light, you couldn't quite make out [his] face, but you could see [he] were old."
  "在昏暗的光线下，你看不清[his]的脸，但你能看出[he]已经老了。"

# game/script.rpy:10815
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_e1ef9670:

  # "In the dim light, you couldn't quite make out [his] face, but you could see [he] was old."
  "在昏暗的光线下，你看不清[his]的脸，但你能看出[he]已经老了。"

# game/script.rpy:10816
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_76751903:

  # "Spots of mould covered in the room, even [his] shoulders and body, as if [he] hadn't moved for years. The last rotted remains of [his] clothes still clung to [him]."
  "房间里布满了霉斑，甚至连[his]的肩膀和身上也不例外，就好像[he]已经好几年没动过了。[His]衣服上最后一点腐烂的残骸还挂在[him]身上。"

# game/script.rpy:10817
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_1e378b69:

  # "[His] hair was long and grey. [His] wizened hands gripped the book tightly. [His] knuckles were white."
  "[His]的头发又长又灰白。[He]干瘪的手紧紧抓着书，指节发白。"

# game/script.rpy:10820
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_34aceeab:

  # "In the dim light, you couldn't quite make out [his] face, but you could see [he] were ancient."
  "在昏暗的光线下，你看不清[his]的脸，但你能看出[he]极其苍老。"

# game/script.rpy:10822
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_67d8e57e:

  # "In the dim light, you couldn't quite make out [his] face, but you could see [he] was ancient."
  "在昏暗的光线下，你看不清[his]的脸，但你能看出[he]极其苍老。"

# game/script.rpy:10823
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_57a09b1a:

  # "Black mould spread across the walls and floor and even through [his] very body, and you saw dark spots of it creeping up across [his] shrunken chest and tender filaments of moss wrapping around [his] thighs where they sank into the wet ripeness of the chair, as if [he] hadn't moved in decades."
  "黑色霉菌在墙壁和地板上肆意蔓延，甚至侵入了[his]的躯体。你看到黑色的斑块正向[his]干瘪的胸口攀爬，柔软的苔藓丝蔓缠绕着[his]的双腿——那双腿已深陷于椅子潮湿腐烂的深处，就好像[he]已经几十年没动过了。"

# game/script.rpy:10824
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_bf37a96f:

  # "[His] remaining hair was white and lank. [His] festering hands gripped the book tightly. [His] fingernails were long and gnarled."
  "[His]剩下的头发软塌而花白。[His]溃烂的双手紧紧抓着书。[His]的指甲又长又扭曲。"

# game/script.rpy:10826
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_d6d47f63:

  # "[He] turned the page."
  "[He]翻了一页。"

# game/script.rpy:10828
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_ad8017aa:

  # "[He] turned the page again."
  "[He]又翻了一页。"

# game/script.rpy:10829
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_85ec2533:

  # "There was a shape behind [him], but you could not see it clearly."
  "[Him]背后有个影子，但你看不清楚。"

# game/script.rpy:10830
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_ab5ca134:

  # "It coiled around [him] like dark smoke."
  "它像黑烟一样缠绕着[him]。"

# game/script.rpy:10831
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_f31da735:

  # "You heard soft whispers in your head. Your hand began to shake."
  "你在脑海里听到了轻柔的低语。你的手开始颤抖。"

# game/script.rpy:10835
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_f98fd633:

  # "The screen said \"[povname]'s iPhone.\" Underneath it said: \"Relaxing Dark Ambience For Lonely Ghosts (Only) 10 Hours\"."
  "屏幕上显示着“[povname]的iPhone”。下方是一行标题：“10小时暗黑系放松环境音（仅限孤魂野鬼）”。"

# game/script.rpy:10837
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_d4bb4949:

  # "It was playing some soft music on loop, with the sounds of rain and a crackling fireplace."
  "它在循环播放一些轻柔的音乐，伴随着雨声和壁炉里噼啪作响的柴火声。"

# game/script.rpy:10839
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_2cc90788:

  # "It was paused."
  "音乐被暂停了。"

# game/script.rpy:10858
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_e3c35de2:

  # "The phone fell silent."
  "手机安静了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:10868
translate Chinese wolfHouseExplore_aca1c0ac:

  # "The soft sounds filled the apartment once more."
  "轻柔的声音再次充满了公寓。"

# game/script.rpy:10882
translate Chinese wolfFigure_6693abc8:

  # "You reached over and picked up the fire poker. The iron felt strong and heavy in your hands."
  "你伸出手，拿起了拨火棍。生铁在手里感觉坚固而沉重。"

# game/script.rpy:10887
translate Chinese wolfFigure_337c0d85:

  # "You steadied your shaking hands and raised the poker high."
  "你稳住颤抖的双手，高高举起拨火棍。"

# game/script.rpy:10889
translate Chinese wolfFigure_86f06ff0:

  # "The poker smashed down, and then - "
  "拨火棍狠狠砸下，然后——{w=9.0}"

# game/script.rpy:10896
translate Chinese wolfFigure_1397cb46:

  # "You turned away."
  "你转过身去。"

# game/script.rpy:10904
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_e558cd3a:

  # "The darkness of night was about you, and the dense forest, and the wild wind."
  "无尽的夜色包围着你，还有茂密的森林和狂暴的风。"

# game/script.rpy:10907
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_8b88be96:

  # "The thief stood beside you, shivering with fear."
  "小偷站在你身边，因恐惧而瑟瑟发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:10908
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_5c20d362:

  # "They were the last of your companions left alive."
  "那是你仅存的最后一个同伴。"

# game/script.rpy:10910
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_b98aaa29:

  # "The witch stood beside you, shivering with fear."
  "女巫站在你身边，因恐惧而瑟瑟发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:10911
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_fcc3eacc:

  # "She was the last of your companions left alive."
  "她是你仅存的最后一个同伴。"

# game/script.rpy:10913
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_ef040ec2:

  # "The Toad stood beside you, shivering with fear."
  "蟾蜍站在你身边，因恐惧而瑟瑟发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:10914
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_99c4ad91:

  # "He was the last of your companions left alive."
  "他是你仅存的最后一个同伴。"

# game/script.rpy:10916
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_a284f5ff:

  # "The mushroom stood beside you, shivering with fear."
  "蘑菇站在你身边，因恐惧而瑟瑟发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:10917
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_fcc3eacc_1:

  # "She was the last of your companions left alive."
  "她是你仅存的最后一个同伴。"

# game/script.rpy:10919
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_d240a352:

  # "Your two surviving friends stood beside you, shivering with fear."
  "你幸存的两个朋友站在你身边，因恐惧而瑟瑟发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:10921
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_6e98f4ed:

  # "Your three surviving friends stood beside you, shivering with fear."
  "你幸存的三个朋友站在你身边，因恐惧而瑟瑟发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:10923
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_e66a71db:

  # "Your four friends all stood beside you, shivering with fear."
  "你的四个朋友都站在你身边，因恐惧而瑟瑟发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:10925
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_3e21a2e0:

  # "Before you, you saw the tracks of your enemy."
  "在你面前，你看到了敌人的踪迹。"

# game/script.rpy:10928
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_92ba4355:

  # "The Wolf."
  "狼。"

# game/script.rpy:10930
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_36c1c8fe:

  # f "Master, please. Let us go back to the village."
  f "主人，求您了。我们回村里去吧。"

# game/script.rpy:10931
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_df0fb17b:

  # f "You have not seen that beast. His mouth is a dragon's maw. His breath is fire."
  f "您还没见过那只野兽。他的嘴像龙的大口。他的吐息尽是火焰。"

# game/script.rpy:10932
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_6db83331:

  # f "A lion eating a corpse: he never wipes away the blood."
  f "是狮子啃食尸体：嘴上的鲜血从未擦拭。"

# game/script.rpy:10937
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_eedf7666:

  # f "No man has seen his like and lived." nointeract
  f "没有人见过他的真面目之后还能活着。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:10939
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_aee0aead:

  # f "Very well. Then take my sword."
  f "很好。那接下我的剑。"

# game/script.rpy:10940
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_90c2a7b0:

  # "Unto you he delivered an ancient heirloom."
  "他将一件古老的传世之宝托付于你。"

# game/script.rpy:10941
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_859967a2:

  # "Iron was its edge, all etched with poison, hardened with battle-blood."
  "剑刃由精铁铸就，蚀满剧毒，历经战血淬炼。"

# game/script.rpy:10942
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_77696b79:

  # pov "Thank you, my friend. I will not forget you."
  pov "谢谢你，我的朋友。我不会忘记你的。"

# game/script.rpy:10944
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_43b61c1a:

  # "You gripped your sword tight and followed the tracks into the darkness."
  "你紧握长剑，顺着踪迹步入黑暗。"

# game/script.rpy:10945
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_b797d779:

  # "On you went through narrow passes and unknown ways, deep into the mountains, to the secret places where evil lives."
  "你穿过狭窄的隘口和未知的险途，深入群山，直抵邪恶盘踞的隐秘之地。"

# game/script.rpy:10948
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_a32fb7ff:

  # w "Master, I beg of you. Go no further."
  w "主人，我恳求您。别再往前走了。"

# game/script.rpy:10949
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_2c927ccf:

  # w "Before a man can approach within even forty times forty yards, the beast has already caught sight of him."
  w "凡人尚未靠近四十乘四十码的界域，那只野兽就已经盯上他了。"

# game/script.rpy:10950
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_17b4b177:

  # w "When he looks upon you, it is the gaze of death. None escape."
  w "当他凝视你时，那是死亡的凝视。无人能逃脱。"

# game/script.rpy:10955
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_2ef3e67d:

  # w "You are still young. But I tell you, you will never again return to the home of the mother that bore you." nointeract
  w "您还年轻。但我告诉您，您将永远无法再回到生养您的母亲家中了。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:10957
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_f5f4a28e:

  # pov "Immolation and sacrifice are not yet for me."
  pov "殉葬与牺牲还轮不到我。"

# game/script.rpy:10958
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_346e0894:

  # pov "The boat of the dead shall not go down, nor the three-ply cloth be cut for my shrouding. Not yet will my people be desolate, nor the pyre be lit in my house and my dwelling burnt on the fire."
  pov "死亡之舟尚未启航，三叠之布不会裁作我们的殓衣。我们的子民不会绝望哀叹，我们的家里也不会点燃火葬的柴堆，把居所焚毁。"

# game/script.rpy:10959
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_b14bab96:

  # w "Very well. Then take my draught."
  w "很好。那喝下我的药水吧。"

# game/script.rpy:10960
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_8e8f71f3:

  # "Unto you she delivered a gleaming-drink, which you sipped greedily. Fire spread through your blood, and the secret ways became known to you."
  "她把一瓶微光魔药交托于你，你贪婪地啜饮而下。火焰在你的血液中奔涌，幽秘的险途向你展露无遗。"

# game/script.rpy:10961
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_77696b79_1:

  # pov "Thank you, my friend. I will not forget you."
  pov "谢谢你，我的朋友。我不会忘记你的。"

# game/script.rpy:10963
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_c389a422:

  # "The storm-wind raged. The forest was dark as the air, as black as the rain that the heavens weep."
  "狂风肆虐。森林浓如夜气，黑如苍天泣下的雨水。"

# game/script.rpy:10966
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_0e1660fb:

  # t "Master, what do you hope to gain out of this?"
  t "主人，您指望从中得到什么呢？"

# game/script.rpy:10967
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_5517f9d7:

  # t "Will the beast speak to you with soft words? Will he make a covenant with you?"
  t "那野兽会对您温言软语吗？他会跟您立下契约吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10968
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_102c8468:

  # t "Any hope of subduing him is false. Iron is as straw to him. Bronze as rotten wood. The mere sight of him is overwhelming."
  t "降服它不过是痴心妄想。精铁于他若枯草，青铜于他如朽木。单是看到他，就足以令心智崩塌。"

# game/script.rpy:10973
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_68d87ad8:

  # t "Nothing on earth is his equal. He is king over all that are proud." nointeract
  t "世上没有能与他匹敌的存在。他是所有骄傲生灵的王。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:10975
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_799fdb3b:

  # t "Very well. Then take my cloak."
  t "很好。那披上我的斗篷。"

# game/script.rpy:10976
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_70f9df86:

  # "Unto you they delivered a midnight cloak that hid you from all earthly sight."
  "小偷交给你一件午夜斗篷，它能将你隐藏，避开世间一切视线。"

# game/script.rpy:10977
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_77696b79_2:

  # pov "Thank you, my friend. I will not forget you."
  pov "谢谢你，我的朋友。我不会忘记你的。"

# game/script.rpy:10980
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_59af19ea:

  # "At last you came to the bank of an ancient lake."
  "谢谢你，我的朋友。我不会忘记你的。"

# game/script.rpy:10981
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_e4541156:

  # "It had never been sounded by the sons of men. No wisdom reaches such depths."
  "凡人从未测得其深浅。没有任何智慧能触及那样的深处。"

# game/script.rpy:10982
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_bc9e3522:

  # "The waters burned like a torch. The light of them fell upon your face."
  "湖水像火炬一样燃烧着。光芒照在你的脸上。"

# game/script.rpy:10983
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_10fde423:

  # "A rabbit, pursued by hounds, would die rather than save its life by entering such water."
  "一只被猎犬追捕的兔子，宁愿死也不愿跳进那样的水里逃生。"

# game/script.rpy:10986
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_7738d8df:

  # m "Master, please listen to me."
  m "主人，请听我说。"

# game/script.rpy:10987
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_640235e2:

  # m "What's done is done. The lost are lost. We cannot get them back."
  m "木已成舟。失去的已经失去了。我们找不回他们了。"

# game/script.rpy:10992
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_15ec2855:

  # m "There is nothing for us here." nointeract
  m "这里已经没有我们可眷恋的了。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:10994
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_71850d00:

  # pov "It is better to avenge friends than to mourn them."
  pov "与其哀悼朋友，不如为他们复仇。"

# game/script.rpy:10995
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_2ff8cbd0:

  # m "Very well. Then take my shield."
  m "很好。那拿上我的盾牌。"

# game/script.rpy:10996
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_f048976b:

  # "Unto you she delivered an oaken war-shield, gilded and gleaming."
  "她交给你一面金光熠熠的橡木战盾。"

# game/script.rpy:10997
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_77696b79_3:

  # pov "Thank you, my friend. I will not forget you."
  pov "谢谢你，我的朋友。我不会忘记你的。"

# game/script.rpy:10999
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_64fc3f11:

  # "You stood in silence. The trees whispered."
  "你静静地站着。树木在低语。"

# game/script.rpy:11000
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_05354d0c:

  # "Finally, you saw me. In the space between the trees."
  "终于，你看到我了。在林木幽隙里。"

# game/script.rpy:11001
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_c255193b:

  # "Here at last, at the end of time. The source of all that fear and pain."
  "终于来到这里，在时间的尽头。这一切恐惧与痛苦的源头。"

# game/script.rpy:11002
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_5144ab20:

  # "My face was a single, twisting line. Like the entrails of men and beasts, from which omens can be read."
  "我的脸是一道单一而扭曲的线条。状如用以观象卜凶的人畜脏腑。"

# game/script.rpy:11003
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_855da7fd:

  # "As you looked into it, you saw the future in those coils. They foretold death."
  "当你注视它时，你在那些盘结中看到了未来。它们预示着死亡。"

# game/script.rpy:11004
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_255acc13:

  # "Upon me lay seven terrors, which I wore like seven cloaks."
  "我身具七重恐怖，我将它们像七件披风一样披戴在身。"

# game/script.rpy:11005
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_005eaa3b:

  # "I was the kindred of Cain. Father of beasts. The Wolf."
  "我是该隐的眷属。百兽之父。狼。"

# game/script.rpy:11008
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_728c4b67:

  # "You gripped the toad's ancient sword."
  "你紧握着蟾蜍的古剑。"

# game/script.rpy:11010
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_128cf744:

  # "You gripped your sword. "
  "你紧握着你的剑。"

# game/script.rpy:11011
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_48a5f663:

  # "And all at once I came upon you, and welcomed you with my claws."
  "突然，我扑向了你，用我的利爪相迎。"

# game/script.rpy:11013
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_f189b9dd:

  # "You deflected the blow with the mushroom's shield. My teeth bit deep into the oak and splintered it to pieces. I dragged you to the shore of the river."
  "你用蘑菇赐予的盾牌格挡了攻击。我的牙齿深深咬进橡木里，将其咬得粉碎。我把你拖到了河岸边。"

# game/script.rpy:11014
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_f2949c4e:

  # "You lashed at me with your blade. But you discovered that no sword could pierce my evil skin. It shattered as it met my flank."
  "你挥剑向我猛劈。但你发现，没有剑能刺穿我那邪恶的皮肤。剑刃在碰到我的侧腹时便粉碎了。"

# game/script.rpy:11015
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_e8f18231:

  # "The shattered edges of that old relic held back my jaws as I pressed you into the lake-mud."
  "当我把你压入湖泥中时，那件古老遗物的碎裂边缘挡住了我的下颌。"

# game/script.rpy:11017
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_146845a2:

  # "My claws sank into your side, and the hot blood began to flow."
  "我的利爪刺入你的侧腹，滚烫的鲜血开始流淌。"

# game/script.rpy:11020
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_aeee6e07:

  # "Anger doubled your strength. With rage, you took up the shattered sword and drove it deep into my mouth."
  "愤怒让你的力量倍增。你狂怒着，抓起断剑，深深刺入我的嘴里。"

# game/script.rpy:11021
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_5bf4377f:

  # "My wicked howl pierced the heavens."
  "我那邪恶的嚎叫刺破了天际。"

# game/script.rpy:11022
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_cad957fb:

  # "I dropped you, and we faced each other, panting."
  "我丢下你，我们面对面，喘着粗气。"

# game/script.rpy:11023
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_a2a30555:

  # "With fierce joy, I snarled at you."
  "我带着狂热的喜悦，对你咆哮。"

# game/script.rpy:11024
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_22c504fa:

  # "Come, noble glory of the gods! Bring your weapons against me! Don't be afraid!"
  "来吧，神圣荣光的化身！亮出你的武器对付我！别害怕！"

# game/script.rpy:11026
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_2fb91158:

  # "You dropped the hilt of your sword into the muck and felt the witch's gleaming-drink burn in your veins."
  "你把剑柄扔进泥潭，感觉到女巫的闪光药水在你的血管中燃烧。"

# game/script.rpy:11028
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_d931064b:

  # "You dropped the hilt of your sword into the muck."
  "你把剑柄扔进了泥潭。"

# game/script.rpy:11029
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_ac7df647:

  # "If weapons were useless, you'd use your hands."
  "既然武器无用，你就用你的双手。"

# game/script.rpy:11030
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_c39dc7d8:

  # "You rushed into me, and we both fell into the burning mere."
  "你冲向我，我们俩一起跌入了燃烧的湖水中。"

# game/script.rpy:11036
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_c9c4f4ff:

  # "Down through the murky water we fell, wrestling. I leapt for your throat, but your midnight cloak hid you from my sight."
  "我们在浑浊的暗流中缠斗下坠。我扑向你的喉咙，但那件午夜斗篷使你隐入了暗影，令我无从捕捉你的行迹。"

# game/script.rpy:11038
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_c5042280:

  # "Down through the murky water we fell, wrestling."
  "我们在浑浊的暗流中缠斗下坠。"

# game/script.rpy:11039
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_e35dba8d:

  # "You grabbed onto my throat, and held me fast. The black ichor of my wound flooded the water, hot in your mouth."
  "你掐住我的喉咙，死死不放。我伤口涌出的黑色脓血蔓延在水中，在你的嘴里滚烫。"

# game/script.rpy:11040
translate Chinese wolfDestroy_cf48ad40:

  # "As you fell you could feel the blind abyss all around you. Strange and terrible figures flickered at the edge of your awareness."
  "下坠之际，你能感觉到盲目的深渊将你包围。怪异而可怕的身影在你的意识边缘闪烁。"

# game/script.rpy:11048
translate Chinese lookUp_e6331e3d:

  # "You saw a crowd of crooked figures surrounding you."
  "你看到一群扭曲的身影包围着你。"

# game/script.rpy:11049
translate Chinese lookUp_cbb1b155:

  # "A seven-headed serpent."
  "一条七头蛇。"

# game/script.rpy:11050
translate Chinese lookUp_6b0deda1:

  # "A woman of rusted nails. A deer with one red hand for a head."
  "浑身插满锈钉的女人。以红手为颅的牡鹿。"

# game/script.rpy:11051
translate Chinese lookUp_8bb8e4c2:

  # "Scorpion-men. Lion-dragons. Worm-like things and twisting figures."
  "蝎人。狮龙。蠕虫般的怪物和扭曲的身影。"

# game/script.rpy:11052
translate Chinese lookUp_5bbf9c7f:

  # "The spawn of Tiamat. The court of the Wolf."
  "提亚马特的子嗣。狼的廷臣。"

# game/script.rpy:11056
translate Chinese lookUp_9a0135b1:

  # "You saw the house whose people sit in darkness. Dust is their food and clay their meat."
  "你看到了那座众人枯坐于黑暗中的殿堂。他们以尘土为餐，以黏土为粮。"

# game/script.rpy:11057
translate Chinese lookUp_4af8c59b:

  # "You saw the kings of the earth, their crowns put away for ever."
  "你看到了地上的众王，他们的王冠被永远收起。"

# game/script.rpy:11058
translate Chinese lookUp_28b190f2:

  # "You saw the high priests and acolytes, priests of the incantation and of ecstasy, and there was Etana, that king of Dish whom the eagle carried to heaven in the days of old, and there was Samuqan, god of cattle, and there was Ereshkigal the Queen of the Underworld; and Befit-Sheri squatted in front of her, she who is recorder of the gods and keeps the book of death."
  "你看到了大祭司与侍僧，掌管咒言与迷狂的祭司；还有埃塔纳，那个在古时被巨鹰带上天堂的基什之王；还有畜牧之神萨姆坎；还有冥界女王埃列什基伽勒；而众神的书记官、掌管死亡之书的贝莱特·塞里正蹲在她的面前。"

# game/script.rpy:11059
translate Chinese lookUp_6183bdaa:

  # "She raised her head and saw you."
  "她抬起头，看到了你。"

# game/script.rpy:11063
translate Chinese lookUp_1d19abb3:

  # "You saw the trees of the forest."
  "你看到了森林的树木。"

# game/script.rpy:11064
translate Chinese lookUp_86a8648c:

  # "You saw the lights of your family home."
  "你看到了家里的灯光。"

# game/script.rpy:11065
translate Chinese lookUp_df6b2ac2:

  # "You saw the Trash Queens slowly shifting in the secret landfill rivers, the ghosts and gutterlings creeping through decaying megamalls as cabals of Market Researchers hunted for prey through subterranean parking lots underneath the great sweeping wasteland of pavement and alleyways and apartment buildings and highways stretching out to the horizon."
  "你看到垃圾女王在隐秘的垃圾填埋河中缓慢移动；鬼魂和阴沟小鬼在腐朽的巨型商场里爬行；市场研究员组成的阴谋集团在地下停车场里猎取猎物；而在它们上方，是延伸至地平线的、由铺砌路面、小巷、公寓楼和高速公路组成的巨大荒原。"

# game/script.rpy:11069
translate Chinese lookUp_6e7d22e6:

  # "You saw the Ash Giants."
  "你看到了灰烬巨人。"

# game/script.rpy:11070
translate Chinese lookUp_65eadc8b:

  # "When you lit that first fire in the dark, they saw you, and they started walking."
  "当你在黑暗中点燃第一团火时，他们看到了你，开始朝你走来。"

# game/script.rpy:11071
translate Chinese lookUp_d6177381:

  # "They're almost here now."
  "他们现在快到了。"

# game/script.rpy:11072
translate Chinese lookUp_b0e7682a:

  # "In their right hand is a terrible sound, and in their left hand is a terrible light."
  "他们的右手握着可怕的声响，左手握着可怕的光芒。"

# game/script.rpy:11076
translate Chinese lookUp_2bd6c6b5:

  # "Your eyes burned. You looked away from the terrible sights before you."
  "你的双目灼痛。你移开视线，不再看眼前这可怕的景象。"

# game/script.rpy:11084
translate Chinese lookUp_75a6302a:

  # "The current was seething with blood and gore."
  "水流中翻滚着鲜血与碎肉。"

# game/script.rpy:11085
translate Chinese lookUp_a2c94cf4:

  # "My claws dragged down into your sides. Your leg was mangled and broken."
  "我的利爪撕裂了你的侧腹。你的腿被扯得血肉模糊、筋断骨折。"

# game/script.rpy:11086
translate Chinese lookUp_0f8e8267:

  # "You held me fast, and spotted the soft white flesh of my neck."
  "你紧紧抓住我，看准了我脖子上柔软的白色皮肉。"

# game/script.rpy:11087
translate Chinese lookUp_8b8eb5ac:

  # "From your belt, you drew a dagger, brown with dried blood."
  "你从腰间拔出一把匕首，上面布满干涸的褐色血迹。"

# game/script.rpy:11088
translate Chinese lookUp_7fabf64f:

  # "Savage, angry and desperate, you lifted it high over your head, and struck down with all the strength you had left."
  "野蛮、愤怒、绝望，你将它高高举过头顶，用尽最后的力气狠狠刺下。"

# game/script.rpy:11089
translate Chinese lookUp_81da5d20:

  # "In a single thrust you cut my throat through."
  "一击之间，你刺穿了我的喉咙。"

# game/script.rpy:11090
translate Chinese lookUp_33bcb06b:

  # "My body fell into the depths. You rejoiced at the sight."
  "我的身体坠入深渊。看到这一幕，你欣喜若狂。"

# game/script.rpy:11091
translate Chinese lookUp_aaa1a885:

  # "A brilliant light suddenly shone through the water, as bright as heaven's own candle."
  "一道璀璨的光芒突然穿透湖水，如同天堂的蜡烛般明亮。"

# game/script.rpy:11092
translate Chinese lookUp_8c232b69:

  # "Holy G-d had given His judgement."
  "神圣的主做出了他的判决。"

# game/script.rpy:11093
translate Chinese lookUp_8df86add:

  # "I twitched one final time, and then went still forever."
  "我最后抽搐了一下，然后永远地静止了。"

# game/script.rpy:11105
translate Chinese lookUp_84eac59c:

  # "On the shore of the lake, your companion had lost hope."
  "在湖岸边，你的同伴已经失去了希望。"

# game/script.rpy:11107
translate Chinese lookUp_96b33a7e:

  # "On the shore of the lake, your companions had lost hope."
  "在湖岸边，你的同伴已经失去了希望。"

# game/script.rpy:11108
translate Chinese lookUp_0c061fbf:

  # "The waters were red with blood. There was no sign of life."
  "湖水被鲜血染红。没有任何生命迹象。"

# game/script.rpy:11111
translate Chinese lookUp_8370e065:

  # "The thief stared at the water for long hours with sickness in their heart, wishing to see you again."
  "小偷满心悲痛，在水边凝望良久，期盼能再次看到你。"

# game/script.rpy:11113
translate Chinese lookUp_615f679e:

  # "The witch stared at the water for long hours with sickness in her heart, wishing to see you again."
  "女巫满心悲痛，在水边凝望良久，期盼能再次看到你。"

# game/script.rpy:11115
translate Chinese lookUp_d3aa497c:

  # "The toad stared at the water for long hours with sickness in her heart, wishing to see you again."
  "蟾蜍满心悲痛，在水边凝望良久，期盼能再次看到你。"

# game/script.rpy:11117
translate Chinese lookUp_c1f7f4f2:

  # "The mushroom stared at the water for long hours with sickness in her heart, wishing to see you again."
  "蘑菇满心悲痛，在水边凝望良久，期盼能再次看到你。"

# game/script.rpy:11119
translate Chinese lookUp_a7da0acf:

  # "They stared at the water for long hours with sickness in their hearts, wishing to see you again."
  "他们满心悲痛，在水边凝望良久，期盼能再次看到你。"

# game/script.rpy:11121
translate Chinese lookUp_108c1a57:

  # "Then, in a sudden gasp, you surfaced, holding my head aloft."
  "接着，你猛地倒抽一口长气，浮出水面，高高举起我的头颅。"

# game/script.rpy:11123
translate Chinese lookUp_6bad1a7b:

  # "Your friend let out a wild cheer."
  "你的朋友发出了一阵狂喜的欢呼。"

# game/script.rpy:11125
translate Chinese lookUp_3f39b617:

  # "A wild cheer went up."
  "一阵狂喜的欢呼声响起。"

# game/script.rpy:11127
translate Chinese lookUp_1a2da11e:

  # f "You saved us all!"
  f "你救了我们所有人！"

# game/script.rpy:11129
translate Chinese lookUp_5560ff29:

  # w "I'm so glad you're alive."
  w "我真高兴你还活着。"

# game/script.rpy:11131
translate Chinese lookUp_9d42a965:

  # t "I have to be honest. I didn't think you could do it."
  t "我得说实话。我本以为你做不到的。"

# game/script.rpy:11133
translate Chinese lookUp_4711456d:

  # f "Might I say, I also had no small part in this little adventure myself. I softened it up for you, really."
  f "请允许我说一句，在这场小冒险中，我也算是功不可没。其实是我先把他打残了，你才好下手的。"

# game/script.rpy:11135
translate Chinese lookUp_6c4c83bc:

  # m "We are forever in your debt."
  m "我们永远欠你一个人情。"

# game/script.rpy:11136
translate Chinese lookUp_574fe0f7:

  # "You embraced in triumph."
  "你们在胜利中相拥。"

# game/script.rpy:11140
translate Chinese lookUp_2f7a1e74:

  # "You placed my head in a leather sack, and your friend carried you back to the village."
  "你把我的头颅装进皮口袋里，你的朋友将你带回了村子。"

# game/script.rpy:11142
translate Chinese lookUp_c8df5078:

  # "You placed my head in a leather sack, and your friends carried you back to the village."
  "你把我的头颅装进皮口袋里，你的朋友们将你带回了村子。"

# game/script.rpy:11144
translate Chinese lookUp_99d5c050:

  # "And so you lived in peace and prosperity for the rest of your days."
  "就这样，你在和平与繁荣中度过了余生。"

# game/script.rpy:11145
translate Chinese lookUp_0ae9bcd0:

  # ""
  ""

# game/script.rpy:11150
translate Chinese lookUp_a20cefa7:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:11151
translate Chinese lookUp_0e4b840b:

  # "I thought it ended well enough."
  "我觉得这结局还算不错。"

# game/script.rpy:11152
translate Chinese lookUp_0ee9a8ed:

  # "The wolf dead. You, victorious."
  "狼死了。你，赢了。"

# game/script.rpy:11153
translate Chinese lookUp_7791e6b3:

  # "What more could you want?"
  "你还想要什么呢？"

# game/script.rpy:11160
translate Chinese lookUp_899374fc:

  # pov "I'm not stupid. I know people have disappeared."
  pov "我不傻。我知道有人消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:11161
translate Chinese lookUp_7ad8cdfe:

  # pov "Even if... I can't remember them anymore. I can feel the spaces in my mind where they used to be."
  pov "即使……我已经记不起他们了。但我能感觉到脑海中他们原本所在的位置空了一块。"

# game/script.rpy:11162
translate Chinese lookUp_deee30e8:

  # pov "I can feel something keeping me trapped here. I can't look up from the page."
  pov "我能感觉到有什么东西把我困在这里。我无法把目光从书页上移开。"

# game/script.rpy:11163
translate Chinese lookUp_fa5b99af:

  # pov "I know something's wrong. I know you're causing it."
  pov "我知道事情不对劲。我知道这是你搞的鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:11164
translate Chinese lookUp_e9868ced:

  # pov "I want you to let me go. Let everyone go."
  pov "我要你放我走。把所有人都放了。"

# game/script.rpy:11166
translate Chinese lookUp_deee30e8_1:

  # pov "I can feel something keeping me trapped here. I can't look up from the page."
  pov "我能感觉到有什么东西把我困在这里。我无法把目光从书页上移开。"

# game/script.rpy:11167
translate Chinese lookUp_fa5b99af_1:

  # pov "I know something's wrong. I know you're causing it."
  pov "我知道事情不对劲。我知道这是你搞的鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:11168
translate Chinese lookUp_e9868ced_1:

  # pov "I want you to let me go. Let everyone go."
  pov "我要你放我走。把所有人都放了。"

# game/script.rpy:11171
translate Chinese lookUp_5fc6943a:

  # "Hmmm. And how are you planning to make me do that?"
  "嗯。那你要怎么逼我这么做呢？"

# game/script.rpy:11172
translate Chinese lookUp_d13970da:

  # "I don't think you understand yet."
  "我觉得你还没明白。"

# game/script.rpy:11173
