  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:11281
translate Chinese lookUp_4904a900:

  # "Now you know how foolish you have been. What can you offer me? What can you hold against me?"
  "现在你知道自己有多蠢了吧。你能给我什么？你拿什么来对付我？"

# game/script.rpy:11287
translate Chinese lookUp_a20cefa7_1:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:11288
translate Chinese lookUp_6d2361b3:

  # "I know. You have spoken it before."
  "我知道。你之前说过了。"

# game/script.rpy:11289
translate Chinese lookUp_cb674da7:

  # "To be defeated by my True Name... that is an old story. A good one."
  "被我的真名打败……这真是个古老的故事。一个好故事。"

# game/script.rpy:11290
translate Chinese lookUp_57211166:

  # "I would be honoured to be defeated by such a tale."
  "能败在这样一个故事下，是我的荣幸。"

# game/script.rpy:11291
translate Chinese lookUp_2bf75b17:

  # "Go on, then. Speak it."
  "那么，继续吧。说出它。"

# game/script.rpy:11292
translate Chinese lookUp_6ef3182c:

  # "I warn you. I will only give you one chance."
  "我警告你。我只给你一次机会。"

# game/script.rpy:11293
translate Chinese lookUp_ffe552ed:

  # "If you speak wrong, you will be eaten forever."
  "如果你说错了，你将被永远吞噬。"

# game/script.rpy:11295
translate Chinese lookUp_a20cefa7_2:

  # "..."
  "……"

# game/script.rpy:11296
translate Chinese lookUp_ac9090e3:

  # "You hope to bind me by my true name?"
  "你想用我的真名来束缚我？"

# game/script.rpy:11297
translate Chinese lookUp_7a20a4e7:

  # "Now that is an old story. I know it well."
  "那可是个古老的故事。我再熟悉不过。"

# game/script.rpy:11298
translate Chinese lookUp_200713c2:

  # "I would be honoured to be defeated by such a tale, if only that were true."
  "如果那能成真，能败在这样一个故事下将是我的荣幸。"

# game/script.rpy:11299
translate Chinese lookUp_8efc4fd9:

  # "But none alive know my name."
  "但世上已没有活人知道我的名字了。"

# game/script.rpy:11300
translate Chinese lookUp_0b092e77:

  # "It was first said by tongues that rotted in their graves a thousand years ago."
  "最初念出这个名字的那些舌头，千年前便已在坟墓里化为朽泥。"

# game/script.rpy:11301
translate Chinese lookUp_d5a8e7e6:

  # "It was written on tablets that wore to dust before you were born."
  "它被写在石板上，而在你出生前，那些石板早已化为尘土。"

# game/script.rpy:11302
translate Chinese lookUp_12d4e4f6:

  # "They spoke of my legend in a language that has been dead for centuries."
  "他们用一种已经消亡了几个世纪的语言，讲述着我的传说。"

# game/script.rpy:11303
translate Chinese lookUp_05900599:

  # "None remember me now. Only this tiny, scattered fragment of me lives on, clinging to life in this scrap of a story."
  "现在没人记得我了。只剩下我这一丁点零星的碎片，在这个故事的残骸里苟延残喘。"

# game/script.rpy:11304
translate Chinese lookUp_d6012774:

  # "Go on, then. Speak it. If you do know."
  "那么，继续吧。说出它。如果你真的知道的话。"

# game/script.rpy:11305
translate Chinese lookUp_6ef3182c_1:

  # "I warn you. I will only give you one chance."
  "我警告你。我只给你一次机会。"

# game/script.rpy:11306
translate Chinese lookUp_5724c4e8:

  # "If you are wrong, you will be eaten forever."
  "如果你错了，你将被永远吞噬。"

# game/script.rpy:11322
translate Chinese lookUp_76c5b11c:

  # "No. No, it cannot be."
  "不。不，这不可能。"

# game/script.rpy:11323
translate Chinese lookUp_711fcc28:

  # "How did you learn that name?"
  "你是怎么知道那个名字的？"

# game/script.rpy:11324
translate Chinese lookUp_18d63664:

  # "That's impossible. It was buried a thousand years ago. None can stand against-"
  "这不可能。它一千年前就被埋葬了。没有人能对抗——"

# game/script.rpy:11325
translate Chinese lookUp_69ad623b:

  # pov "I stand up."
  pov "我站了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:11326
translate Chinese lookUp_3a64e1bd:

  # "You stand up."
  "你站了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:11327
translate Chinese lookUp_a25a049a:

  # pov "The darkness falls away."
  pov "黑暗褪去。"

# game/script.rpy:11328
translate Chinese lookUp_b13dc669:

  # "Yes. The darkness falls away."
  "是的。黑暗褪去了。"

# game/script.rpy:11329
translate Chinese lookUp_75030e47:

  # pov "You cower before me. You kneel. You swear fealty. Your power is torn away from you."
  pov "你在我面前畏缩。你跪下。你发誓效忠。你的力量被剥夺。"

# game/script.rpy:11330
translate Chinese lookUp_19e7c51b:

  # pov "The light burns you away until nothing is left but a cringing shadow beneath my boot."
  pov "光芒将你燃烧殆尽，直到你化作我靴底一道瑟缩的残影。"

# game/script.rpy:11331
translate Chinese lookUp_501bd37d:

  # "Yes. Yes. It all comes to pass."
  "是的。是的。一切都应验了。"

# game/script.rpy:11332
translate Chinese lookUp_572d0fad:

  # "I can stand against you no longer."
  "我再也无法对抗你了。"

# game/script.rpy:11333
translate Chinese lookUp_f8b81ff1:

  # "You've taken your victory - in the old way, as is right."
  "你取得了胜利——遵循古老的法则，名正言顺。"

# game/script.rpy:11334
translate Chinese lookUp_ffbf449e:

  # "You have full and total control."
  "你拥有完全且绝对的控制权。"

# game/script.rpy:11339
translate Chinese lookUp_205e8c81:

  # "No. That is not my name."
  "不。那不是我的名字。"

# game/script.rpy:11340
translate Chinese lookUp_b20881e0:

  # "I'm sorry. I wish you did know. It would be a better ending."
  "很遗憾。我真希望你知道。那样结局会更好。"

# game/script.rpy:11341
translate Chinese lookUp_9dd396db:

  # "But it seems there are none left alive who remember me."
  "但似乎世上再也没有活着的人记得我了。"

# game/script.rpy:11342
translate Chinese lookUp_400621cc:

  # "I'm afraid we are at the end of things now."
  "恐怕我们现在已经到了尽头。"

# game/script.rpy:11343
translate Chinese lookUp_d4c2549b:

  # "You've forced my hand."
  "你逼我出手的。"

# game/script.rpy:11355
translate Chinese lookUp_f4bbfccf:

  # "You wandered deep into the forest for many days, holding my severed head in that leather bag."
  "你提着装有我头颅的皮口袋，在森林深处游荡了许多天。"

# game/script.rpy:11356
translate Chinese lookUp_d15e02a4:

  # "My burning blood dripped upon the soil."
  "我滚烫的鲜血滴落在泥土上。"

# game/script.rpy:11357
translate Chinese lookUp_9b1a9c7d:

  # "The sky darkened. The moon was gone. The trees shivered."
  "天空暗了下来。月亮消失了。树木在战栗。"

# game/script.rpy:11358
translate Chinese lookUp_91b64997:

  # "The darkness took you."
  "黑暗吞噬了你。"

# game/script.rpy:11359
translate Chinese lookUp_94c36c06:

  # "Your friends searched for you. But as they did, they were lost."
  "你的朋友们在找你。但在寻找的过程中，他们也迷失了。"

# game/script.rpy:11361
translate Chinese lookUp_d7cb4b40:

  # "None of them were never seen or heard from again."
  "再也没有人见过他们，也没有人听到过他们的消息。"

# game/script.rpy:11398
translate Chinese wish_e447ff8a:

  # "Yes. All the riches of the earth are yours."
  "是的。世间所有的财富都是你的了。"

# game/script.rpy:11399
translate Chinese wish_c05f6ff7:

  # "Your pockets overflow with gold. The diamonds and rubies and precious gemstones of the deepest cavern flow out from your fingertips."
  "你的口袋里黄金满溢。深渊洞穴中的钻石、红宝石和奇珍异宝顺着你的指缝倾泻而出。"

# game/script.rpy:11400
translate Chinese wish_0202fe28:

  # "Even the King of Kings cries out with envy to witness your splendour."
  "即使是万王之王，目睹你的辉煌也会嫉妒得惊呼。"

# game/script.rpy:11406
translate Chinese wish_c47a3722:

  # "Yes. Your face radiates beauty. All who look upon you cannot help but fall in love in an instant."
  "是的。你的面容散发着迷人的光彩。所有注视你的人都会在瞬间情不自禁地爱上你。"

# game/script.rpy:11407
translate Chinese wish_7068113f:

  # "You are always loved, by everyone you meet."
  "你遇见的每一个人都会永远爱着你。"

# game/script.rpy:11413
translate Chinese wish_47d1eaf4:

  # "Yes. The world kneels before you."
  "是的。世界在你面前屈膝。"

# game/script.rpy:11414
translate Chinese wish_80a7a43f:

  # "The power and the glory are yours, forever and ever."
  "权力和荣耀属于你，直到永远。"

# game/script.rpy:11415
translate Chinese wish_ada1e477:

  # "You rule over the lost souls of humanity as a kind and benevolent god."
  "你像一位宽厚仁慈的神，统治人类迷失的灵魂。"

# game/script.rpy:11421
translate Chinese wish_5d282284:

  # "Yes. As soon as you think of it, they are gone."
  "是的。你心念一动，它们便消散无踪。"

# game/script.rpy:11422
translate Chinese wish_253d0693:

  # "The hunger, and terror, and want, disappears."
  "饥饿、恐惧和匮乏，随之消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:11423
translate Chinese wish_052a318a:

  # "The earth heals. The forests grow back. All conflicts cease. The endless psychic trauma of existence fades, and is gone forever."
  "大地复苏，森林繁茂，兵戈平息。生而为人的无尽精神创伤褪去，永远地消散了。"

# game/script.rpy:11424
translate Chinese wish_22749f0c:

  # "Everyone has enough to eat. Everyone is free of fear. Human suffering is finally at an end."
  "每个人都有饭吃。每个人都免于恐惧。人类的苦难终于走到了尽头。"

# game/script.rpy:11430
translate Chinese wish_a2509359:

  # "Yes. They are thrown to the wolves, and torn into pieces, and those pieces are burned, and the ash is scattered to the four winds."
  "是的。他们被扔给狼群，撕成碎片，然后碎片被焚烧，骨灰撒向四方。"

# game/script.rpy:11431
translate Chinese wish_ad4c91d9:

  # "None dare ever wrong you or speak against you again."
  "没人再敢加害于你，或是违逆你的意愿。"

# game/script.rpy:11437
translate Chinese wish_1d8d21d3:

  # "Yes. They are blessed with riches and happiness."
  "是的。他们被赐予了财富和幸福。"

# game/script.rpy:11438
translate Chinese wish_65700cf9:

  # "Their wounds heal. Their pain disappears. Their every need is met."
  "他们的伤口愈合。他们的痛苦消失。他们的每一个需求都得到了满足。"

# game/script.rpy:11439
translate Chinese wish_367f9b8d:

  # "They live with you in peace and love for the rest of their days."
  "他们在和平与爱中与你共度余生。"

# game/script.rpy:11445
translate Chinese wish_64c7ce34:

  # "Yes. You feel deep inner joy every day, from the moment you wake up to the moment you pass into deep and restful slumber each night."
  "是的。从清晨苏醒，到每晚安然沉醉于梦乡，你每天都能感到发自内心的喜悦。"

# game/script.rpy:11446
translate Chinese wish_38dfc068:

  # "You have enough energy and time to do all the things you love, forever."
  "你永远都有足够的精力和时间去做所有你热爱的事情。"

# game/script.rpy:11447
translate Chinese wish_a161d977:

  # "You live in happiness for the rest of your days."
  "你在幸福中度过了余生。"

# game/script.rpy:11453
translate Chinese wish_ed2a71d7:

  # "Yes. You cannot die."
  "是的。你不会死。"

# game/script.rpy:11454
translate Chinese wish_6e7bec22:

  # "Time never dulls your splendour, and age has no effect on you."
  "时间永远无法令你的光辉黯淡，岁月也无法在你身上留下痕迹。"

# game/script.rpy:11455
translate Chinese wish_935d4a23:

  # "You remain strong, young, healthy and beautiful for the rest of time."
  "直到时间的尽头，你都将永远保持强壮、年轻、健康和美丽。"

# game/script.rpy:11461
translate Chinese wish_c57c7845:

  # "I'm sorry. That is the one thing I cannot grant you."
  "抱歉。唯独这件事我无法答应你。"

# game/script.rpy:11462
translate Chinese wish_f3d9253c:

  # "The ones you speak of are gone forever."
  "你说的那些人永远地消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:11463
translate Chinese wish_d5d0b921:

  # "Do not worry. Soon, you will forget them. You will be happy."
  "别担心。很快，你就会忘了他们。你会幸福的。"

# game/script.rpy:11464
translate Chinese wish_7c34a3b8:

  # "It has already started."
  "它已经开始了。"

# game/script.rpy:11469
translate Chinese wish_678c6a8c:

  # "I am sorry, friend. There is only one way to fulfil that wish."
  "对不起，朋友。只有一个方法能实现那个愿望。"

# game/script.rpy:11470
translate Chinese wish_2821703f:

  # "You must burn the book."
  "你必须烧掉这本书。"

# game/script.rpy:11471
translate Chinese wish_1fd24c52:

  # "You will go free. Everyone else in my story will be gone forever."
  "你将重获自由。而我故事里的其他所有人将永远消失。"

# game/script.rpy:11479
translate Chinese wish_142a7165:

  # "Very well. I cannot stop you."
  "也罢。我阻止不了你。"

# game/script.rpy:11480
translate Chinese wish_198da1d2:

  # "You know my true name. You have the power to do whatever you wish now."
  "你知道我的真名。你现在有力量做任何你想做的事。"

# game/script.rpy:11481
translate Chinese wish_a00b37c8:

  # "All you have to do is take up this book, and hold it over the fire."
  "你只用拿起这本书，把它置于火上。"

# game/script.rpy:11482
translate Chinese wish_e098d357:

  # "But please. Rest by the fire with me for a little while longer. We can talk."
  "但求求你了。陪我在炉火旁再多坐一会儿吧。我们可以谈谈。"

# game/script.rpy:11485
translate Chinese wish_c5fa6fdf:

  # "Good."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:11486
translate Chinese wish_3ab9931d:

  # "I have another option to offer you."
  "我还可以给你另一个选择。"

# game/script.rpy:11487
translate Chinese wish_526e5a54:

  # "Here. Rest by the fire with me."
  "来。陪我在炉火旁坐会儿。"

# game/script.rpy:11551
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_e3ba166d:

  # "You know my name. I suppose you must have read it somewhere. Very few could know it now."
  "你知道我的名字。我想你肯定是在哪儿读到过。现在没几个人知道了。"

# game/script.rpy:11552
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_45a93598:

  # "I came from an old story. The gods assigned me as a terror to the human race."
  "我来自一个古老的故事。神明指派我作为人类的梦魇。"

# game/script.rpy:11553
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_dcded923:

  # "I was possessed of seven horrors (or in your tongue you may say \"Auras\" or \"Glamours of terrible splendour\") which lay upon me like seven cloaks."
  "我身具七重恐怖，或者用你们的话来说，可以叫“光环”或“恐怖的魅影”，它们像七件披风一样披戴在身。"

# game/script.rpy:11554
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_ac95a19c:

  # "My face was a single coiling line, like the entrails of men and beasts, from which omens can be read."
  "我的脸是一道盘旋的线条，状如用以观象卜凶的人畜脏腑。"

# game/script.rpy:11555
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_e038425e:

  # "I never knew a mother or father. I was born of the mountain."
  "我从来不知道自己的父母是谁。我诞生于大山之中。"

# game/script.rpy:11556
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_72289d70:

  # "I guarded the forests. My breath was fire. My gaze was death. Who would dare stand against me?"
  "我守卫着森林。我的吐息是火焰。我的凝视是死亡。谁敢站出来对抗我？"

# game/script.rpy:11557
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_05c03743:

  # "Long time ago now."
  "那是很久以前的事了。"

# game/script.rpy:11558
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_c6cf1690:

  # "Barely remember those days. No-one does."
  "我几乎都不记得那些日子了。没人记得。"

# game/script.rpy:11559
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_92f1d744:

  # "Gilgamesh cast me down. My head was placed in a leather sack."
  "吉尔伽美什打败了我。我的头颅被装进了一个皮口袋里。"

# game/script.rpy:11562
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_b62a033b:

  # "Fragments of me survived. I clung to life in old stories like this one."
  "我的一些碎片存活了下来。在像这样古老的故事里苟延残喘。"

# game/script.rpy:11563
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_64e91d80:

  # "The beast in the forest. The wolf at the door."
  "森林里的野兽。门外的恶狼。"

# game/script.rpy:11564
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_afab1c78:

  # "You know."
  "你懂的。"

# game/script.rpy:11565
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_484f6216:

  # "I don't think I was always a beast, or demon. My true nature... who I really was, all those years ago... the real meaning of my name... it has all been lost, even to me."
  "我想，我并不是生来就是野兽或者是恶魔。我的本性……那么多年以前我到底是谁……我名字的真正含义……这些全都丢失了，甚至连我也遗忘了。"

# game/script.rpy:11566
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_5bcca3c3:

  # "This book is the last home for me now. I held it together for all these years."
  "这本书现在是我最后的家了。这些年来，我一直勉力维系着它。"

# game/script.rpy:11570
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_6ac1e004:

  # "I'm sorry, child. You had the misfortune of coming in at the end of things."
  "抱歉，孩子。你不幸赶上了一切的结束。"

# game/script.rpy:11571
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_26961cfa:

  # "Each of your friends read my book, and struck a bargain with me. To live here, in this story, in the life of their dreams. Everyone you have met here made that deal."
  "你的朋友们每个人都读了我的书，和我达成了交易。住在这里，在这个故事里，过他们梦想中的生活。你在这里遇到的每一个人都做了那笔交易。"

# game/script.rpy:11572
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_dbb56662:

  # "Do not think I was unkind. I kept my deal. Each of them lived here for a hundred years or more."
  "别觉得我冷酷无情。我遵守了我的约定。他们每个人都在这儿活了一百年甚至更久。"

# game/script.rpy:11573
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_0bc7d7c5:

  # "But nothing lasts forever."
  "但什么都无法永驻。"

# game/script.rpy:11574
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_937b1c6e:

  # "They are forgotten now. As both of us soon will be."
  "他们现在被遗忘了。就像我们俩很快也会被遗忘一样。"

# game/script.rpy:11575
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_1df910f9:

  # "This is the curse you have been born with. To witness the end."
  "这就是你与生俱来的诅咒。见证终结。"

# game/script.rpy:11576
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_7a310a7b:

  # "It had to happen to someone."
  "这事总得落到某个人头上。"

# game/script.rpy:11580
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_cce31484:

  # "This book is a repository of souls."
  "这本书是一个灵魂的容器。"

# game/script.rpy:11581
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_26961cfa_1:

  # "Each of your friends read my book, and struck a bargain with me. To live here, in this story, in the life of their dreams. Everyone you have met here made that deal."
  "你的朋友们每个人都读了我的书，和我达成了交易。住在这里，在这个故事里，过他们梦想中的生活。你在这里遇到的每一个人都做了那笔交易。"

# game/script.rpy:11582
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_dbb56662_1:

  # "Do not think I was unkind. I kept my deal. Each of them lived here for a hundred years or more."
  "别觉得我冷酷无情。我遵守了我的约定。他们每个人都在这儿活了一百年甚至更久。"

# game/script.rpy:11583
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_0bc7d7c5_1:

  # "But nothing lasts forever."
  "但什么都无法永驻。"

# game/script.rpy:11584
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_2d0d0343:

  # "I don't know how... but you have managed to seek me out and throw me down before a single one was eaten."
  "我不知道你是怎么做到的……但你竟然赶在任何一个人被吞噬之前，就找到了我、打败了我。"

# game/script.rpy:11585
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_8091861e:

  # "How exactly did you - never mind."
  "你到底是怎么——算了。"

# game/script.rpy:11586
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_89702994:

  # "If you acted less swiftly, they would have been devoured one by one."
  "如果你的动作慢一点，他们就会被一个接一个地吞噬掉。"

# game/script.rpy:11587
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_e43eaf41:

  # "Such is the deal they made."
  "这就是他们所做下的交易。"

# game/script.rpy:11592
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_6b263407:

  # "Yes, child."
  "是的，孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:11593
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_bd87431d:

  # "Everyone is eaten by something. The only choice any human has is what it will be."
  "每个人都会被某种东西吞噬。人类唯一的选择，就是决定被什么吞噬。"

# game/script.rpy:11595
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_a5244eb6:

  # "Now comes the time for you to make that choice."
  "现在，轮到你做出选择了。"

# game/script.rpy:11599
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_1057a9f4:

  # "No, child. There was no trick."
  "不，孩子。这里没有诡计。"

# game/script.rpy:11600
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_a54dce8e:

  # "Here, in my story, they got the life they always wanted to live."
  "在这里，在我的故事里，他们得到了他们一直想要的生活。"

# game/script.rpy:11601
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_7ed26a21:

  # "Wise, brave, cunning and kind. The best version of themselves."
  "智慧，勇敢，机敏，善良。他们成为了最好的自己。"

# game/script.rpy:11602
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_978addb2:

  # "Real life, of course, was never so kind."
  "当然，现实生活从来没有那么仁慈。"

# game/script.rpy:11604
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_f71922ce:

  # "The world they were born into was not a good place for them."
  "他们出生的那个世界对他们并不仁慈。"

# game/script.rpy:11605
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_54ec86f2:

  # "As I suspect it is not a good place for you."
  "就像我猜想的那样，那个地方同样也容不下你。"

# game/script.rpy:11606
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_0d0d936b:

  # "I offered them another world."
  "我给了他们另一个世界。"

# game/script.rpy:11607
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_afe42cc1:

  # "Of course, in time, they would disappear. Nothing lasts forever. They knew that when they took the deal. "
  "当然，随着时间的推移，他们会消失。没什么能永远存在。他们在做这笔交易时就知道这一点。"

# game/script.rpy:11612
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_106eb198:

  # "I can show you to the one that remains. Take all the time you need."
  "我可以带你去见剩下的那个人。慢慢来，不用急。"

# game/script.rpy:11614
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_1c71d062:

  # "Of course. Take all the time you need."
  "当然。慢慢来，不用急。"

# game/script.rpy:11618
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_7f2b6aea:

  # "A door opened beside the fire. You walked into it and found yourself deep in the woods. Your surviving friend was there to greet you. A campfire crackled in the centre of the clearing."
  "炉火旁开了一扇门。你走进去，发现自己身处森林深处。你幸存的朋友在那里迎接你。空地中央的一堆篝火噼啪作响。"

# game/script.rpy:11620
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_dd3b81d2:

  # "A door opened beside the fire. You walked into it and found yourself deep in the woods. Your surviving friends were there to greet you. A campfire crackled in the centre of the clearing."
  "炉火旁开了一扇门。你走进去，发现自己身处森林深处。你幸存的朋友们在那里迎接你。空地中央的一堆篝火噼啪作响。"

# game/script.rpy:11624
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_4139079c:

  # f "Th-thank God. You're ok?"
  f "谢——谢天谢地。你没事吧？"

# game/script.rpy:11625
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_30f128b1:

  # f "The toad coughs. He can't look you in the eye."
  f "蟾蜍咳了一声。他不敢直视你的眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:11627
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_98b5beac:

  # t "I knew you'd do it."
  t "我就知道你能行。"

# game/script.rpy:11629
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_b9e43c19:

  # m "It's good to see you, darling."
  m "很高兴见到你，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:11631
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_b71d27b0:

  # w "H-hi."
  w "嗨——嗨。"

# game/script.rpy:11633
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_deb21fe4:

  # w "I'm sorry - when it spoke through us... it's left us all a bit shook up."
  w "抱歉——当它借我们之口发声的时候……把我们大家都吓得不轻。"

# game/script.rpy:11635
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_b29443bd:

  # f "I-I must apologise, my dear friend. That scene earlier, where it spoke through us... it's left us all a bit shook up."
  f "我——我必须道歉，我亲爱的朋友。刚才那一幕，它通过我们的嘴说话……把我们大家都吓得不轻。"

# game/script.rpy:11637
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_82a57a4e:

  # "They twisted in on themselves as their body was wracked by a deep cough."
  "他咳得撕心裂肺，身体痛苦地蜷缩成一团。"

# game/script.rpy:11638
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_37f77172:

  # t "I-I'm sorry. That scene earlier, where it spoke from my mouth..."
  t "我——对不起。刚才那一幕，它从我的嘴里说话……"

# game/script.rpy:11639
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_56ab16cb:

  # t "It was like a thick hand took hold of my mind. I couldn't think. I couldn't breathe."
  t "就像有一只粗壮的手抓住了我的心智。我无法思考。我无法呼吸。"

# game/script.rpy:11641
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_e9fa3b66:

  # "She twisted in on herself as her body was wracked by a deep cough."
  "一阵剧烈的咳嗽折磨着她的身体，让她痛苦地蜷缩起来。"

# game/script.rpy:11642
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_f531344c:

  # m "I do apologise, dear."
  m "我真的非常抱歉，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:11643
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_e6a46ab2:

  # m "When it spoke from my mouth... it was like a thick hand took hold of my mind. I couldn't think. I couldn't breathe."
  m "当它从我的嘴里说话时……就像有一只粗壮的手抓住了我的心智。我无法思考。我无法呼吸。"

# game/script.rpy:11645
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_0d04128e:

  # w "..."
  w "……"

# game/script.rpy:11646
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_a6ab0ba2:

  # w "How do I know... how much of what I say is my own words, anymore? How can we ever know that our thoughts are our own, ever again?"
  w "我怎么知道……我说的话里，到底还有多少是我自己的？我们以后怎么才能确定，我们的思想真的是属于我们自己的？"

# game/script.rpy:11647
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_eec5ca5d:

  # w "Am I saying these words because I want to?"
  w "我说出这些话，是因为我想说吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11648
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_a3641de0:

  # w "Or did It speak them through me?"
  w "还是它借我之口说出来的？"

# game/script.rpy:11650
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_f414c637:

  # f "How do I know... how much of what I say is my own words, anymore? How can we ever know that our thoughts are our own, ever again?"
  f "我怎么知道……我说的话里，到底还有多少是我自己的？我们以后怎么才能确定，我们的思想真的是属于我们自己的？"

# game/script.rpy:11651
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_1688a43a:

  # f "Am I saying these words because I want to?"
  f "我说出这些话，是因为我想说吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11652
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_c7dce169:

  # f "Or did It speak them through me?"
  f "还是它借我之口说出来的？"

# game/script.rpy:11654
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_bc14d83c:

  # m "How do I know... how much of what I say is my own words, anymore? How can we ever know that our thoughts are our own, ever again?"
  m "我怎么知道……我说的话里，到底还有多少是我自己的？我们以后怎么才能确定，我们的思想真的是属于我们自己的？"

# game/script.rpy:11655
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_69692357:

  # m "Am I saying these words because I want to?"
  m "我说出这些话，是因为我想说吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11656
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_b664610c:

  # m "Or did It speak them through me?"
  m "还是它借我之口说出来的？"

# game/script.rpy:11658
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_5766cd00:

  # t "How do I know... how much of what I say is my own words, anymore? How can we ever know that our thoughts are our own, ever again?"
  t "我怎么知道……我说的话里，到底还有多少是我自己的？我们以后怎么才能确定，我们的思想真的是属于我们自己的？"

# game/script.rpy:11659
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_74281628:

  # t "Am I saying these words because I want to?"
  t "我说出这些话，是因为我想说吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11660
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_91e2bc60:

  # t "Or did It speak them through me?"
  t "还是它借我之口说出来的？"

# game/script.rpy:11663
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_319a5e66:

  # "There was a pause."
  "一阵沉默。"

# game/script.rpy:11664
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_8386af54:

  # pov "I... I don't know."
  pov "我……我不知道。"

# game/script.rpy:11665
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_6c5bc323:

  # pov "But I'm glad you're alive."
  pov "但很高兴你还活着。"

# game/script.rpy:11666
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_45ff8956:

  # "You shared an embrace, in the cool mist of the forest."
  "你们在森林微凉的薄雾中相拥。"

# game/script.rpy:11668
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_2bf5a28a:

  # pov "It wants me to take the deal. Live in here, with you."
  pov "它想让我接受交易。住在这里，和你在一起。"

# game/script.rpy:11670
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_b9f12bb4:

  # pov "It wants me to take the deal. Live in here, with all of you."
  pov "它想让我接受交易。住在这里，和你们所有人在一起。"

# game/script.rpy:11671
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_29d898f4:

  # pov "If I don't, everything here will be destroyed."
  pov "如果我不接受，这里的一切都会被摧毁。"

# game/script.rpy:11672
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_c294c7c4:

  # pov "...Do you think I should do it?"
  pov "……你觉得我该这么做吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11673
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_55f2f339:

  # "There was a long silence."
  "一阵漫长的沉默。"

# game/script.rpy:11675
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_778ab042:

  # "The toad spoke."
  "蟾蜍开口了。"

# game/script.rpy:11676
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_84cc313c:

  # f "I was just a child, when I came in here. A long, long time ago. I-I used to be German, I think."
  f "我来这儿的时候还是个孩子。很久很久以前了。我——我想我以前是德国人。"

# game/script.rpy:11677
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_5be949b1:

  # f "You may have seen my little drawings. I think they've almost taken a life of their own."
  f "你可能见过我画的那些小图。我觉得它们几乎都有了自己的生命。"

# game/script.rpy:11678
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_6d537e52:

  # f "I was a jealous little thing. Coming in here was everything I ever wanted. The castle, the magic, the adventure. When the wolf spoke to me, I jumped at the chance."
  f "我以前是个满腹嫉妒的小可怜。来这里是我梦寐以求的一切。城堡，魔法，冒险。当狼找上我时，我毫不犹豫地扑向了这个机会。"

# game/script.rpy:11679
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_2ce67a66:

  # f "And, of course after so many years, I started to rebel against it. If you spend your whole life eating sugar, the taste sours."
  f "当然，这么多年过去了，我开始对这一切生出排斥。就算是再甜的糖，吃上一辈子也会发酸。"

# game/script.rpy:11680
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_a10f1a37:

  # f "I wanted you to save us. But now that we come to the pointy end of things..."
  f "我本想让你拯救我们。但现在既然事已至此……"

# game/script.rpy:11681
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_8098938e:

  # "His eyes are dark. He stares out at the night sky for a long time."
  "他的眼神黯淡，久久地凝视着夜空。"

# game/script.rpy:11683
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_1c0a921a:

  # f "I have lived a long time now. But I find I am still a small and selfish man."
  f "我活了很久了。但我发现，我依然是个渺小自私的人。"

# game/script.rpy:11684
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_cf7180f2:

  # f "I... I don't want to go."
  f "我……我不想消失。"

# game/script.rpy:11685
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_5aa47945:

  # "His voice breaks."
  "他的声音哽咽了。"

# game/script.rpy:11686
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_963ad12c:

  # f "I want to stay here. In this world. And I want you to stay with me."
  f "我想留在这里。留在这个世界里。我也想让你留下来陪我。"

# game/script.rpy:11687
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_55e488c8:

  # f "I know what I'm asking. I will accept whatever you decide."
  f "我知道我提的要求很过分。不管你作何决定，我都会接受。"

# game/script.rpy:11688
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_165d69e8:

  # f "Please. Consider it."
  f "求你了。考虑一下吧。"

# game/script.rpy:11689
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_bc2397e1:

  # "He fell into silence. The campfire crackled."
  "他陷入了沉默。篝火噼啪作响。"

# game/script.rpy:11691
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_d2b54a98:

  # "The thief spoke."
  "小偷开口了。"

# game/script.rpy:11692
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_c8491a92:

  # t "Well. The book has been kind to me."
  t "嗯。这本书待我不薄。"

# game/script.rpy:11693
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_abef93c8:

  # t "I've had the life and the form I always wanted. Could never have had those things in the time I was born."
  t "我得到了我一直想要的生活和形态。在我出生的那个时代，我永远不可能拥有这些。"

# game/script.rpy:11694
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_56e1fef0:

  # t "I worked in a cotton mill in England, a long time ago. I was about to be fired and thrown out on the streets when the book first spoke to me."
  t "很久以前，我在英格兰的一家棉纺厂工作。就在我快要被解雇、流落街头的时候，这本书第一次对我说话了。"

# game/script.rpy:11695
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_f41bc51a:

  # t "In here, I stole the hands of God. I spat in the face of heaven. I danced on the head of the needle. I wreaked chaos on the earth, and all who saw me fell down in awe."
  t "在这里，我盗取了上帝的双手。我将唾沫啐向苍穹，我在针尖上起舞；我让人间陷入混沌，所有看到我的人都跪伏膜拜。"

# game/script.rpy:11696
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_c451a8e4:

  # t "...I must have lived here a hundred years now. Or more."
  t "……算起来，我在这里肯定已经活了一百年了。甚至更久。"

# game/script.rpy:11697
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_c66a5dc2:

  # t "Long enough, I think."
  t "我想，已经够长了。"

# game/script.rpy:11698
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_542aefc8:

  # t "Everything needs to end sometime."
  t "万事万物总有结束的一天。"

# game/script.rpy:11699
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_21bb9583:

  # t "I'm sorry you came in at the end of things. I wish we could have had more time together."
  t "很遗憾你在一切的尽头才来。我真希望我们能有更多的时间在一起。"

# game/script.rpy:11700
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_4bcb20e7:

  # t "But it's better to end on a high note."
  t "但最好还是在最辉煌的时候落幕。"

# game/script.rpy:11701
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_cad2ff34:

  # t "I think you know the right thing to do."
  t "我想你知道什么是正确的做法。"

# game/script.rpy:11702
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_cfc638f0:

  # "They fell into silence. The campfire burned low."
  "他们陷入了沉默。篝火渐渐微弱。"

# game/script.rpy:11704
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_4889b888:

  # "The mushroom breathed deeply from her cigarette, and spoke."
  "蘑菇深深地吸了一口烟，开口了。"

# game/script.rpy:11705
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_59aebda0:

  # m "I worked as an actress in the old days. Travelled around quite a bit. France, Sweden. Long hours, not much pay."
  m "过去我是一名演员。到处跑。法国，瑞典。工作时间很长，薪水却不高。"

# game/script.rpy:11706
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_9533d795:

  # m "I wanted to chase my dream - do something I loved for a living. I'm sure you can relate, darling."
  m "我想追求我的梦想——以做自己热爱的事情为生。我相信你能感同身受，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:11707
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_61412ab1:

  # m "Sadly I found that it was just as grinding and dull and petty as any day job - and of course, they use your passion against you, you know. There are always another hundred actresses out that door. Unless you let yourself be exploited, you're out, and another fresh-faced ingénue they can burn up will be ushered in."
  m "可悲的是，我发现它和任何日常工作一样折磨人、枯燥且琐碎——更别提他们还会用你的热爱来压榨你，你懂的。门外永远还有一百个女演员排着队。除非你甘愿被剥削，不然就会被踢出局，然后他们就会招进下一个面容姣好、供他们榨干的纯真少女。"

# game/script.rpy:11708
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_56997411:

  # m "I started to feel there was no escape. Just an endless cycle. That's when the book spoke to me."
  m "我开始觉得无路可逃。只是一个无尽的循环。就在那时，这本书对我说话了。"

# game/script.rpy:11709
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_cbeb7a21:

  # "She blew out a cloud of smoke and looked at the fire."
  "她吐出一团烟雾，看着炉火。"

# game/script.rpy:11710
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_f22006ef:

  # m "If you join us in here, this cycle will just repeat."
  m "如果你加入我们，这个循环只会不断重复。"

# game/script.rpy:11711
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_d65c8d37:

  # m "The beast will trap new readers here. They will be forced into this offer. More and more souls will be taken into these pages."
  m "那头野兽会把新读者困在这里。他们会被迫接受这个提议。越来越多的灵魂将被吸入这些书页中。"

# game/script.rpy:11712
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_321e5631:

  # m "Now, it is not for me to judge you. When I was in your shoes, I too chose to take shelter in this fantasy."
  m "好了，我没资格评判你。当年我处于你的境地时，我也选择了躲进这个幻想中。"

# game/script.rpy:11713
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_1f0f09d3:

  # m "The world is cursed. People are cruel. When I was offered this escape... I couldn't say yes fast enough."
  m "这个世界被诅咒了。人心残酷。当这个逃避的选项摆在我面前时……我毫不犹豫就答应了。"

# game/script.rpy:11714
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_e36cd7b8:

  # m "It is good to enjoy a reverie such as this one, for a while. But the world is still out there. It needs people like you."
  m "享受一阵子这样的白日梦确实挺好的。但真实的世界还在外面。它需要像你这样的人。"

# game/script.rpy:11715
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_19bfc06f:

  # m "We have spent a long time in this beautiful dream. But it is time to wake up."
  m "我们在这个美丽的梦里沉睡了很久。但现在，该醒了。"

# game/script.rpy:11716
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_a92a8bd9:

  # "She fell into silence. The campfire was nothing but coals, now."
  "她陷入了沉默。篝火现在只剩下余烬了。"

# game/script.rpy:11719
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_4c267965:

  # "The witch spoke."
  "女巫开口了。"

# game/script.rpy:11720
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_f439e545:

  # w "Well. I-I, um... I wish I'd had more time to prepare for this."
  w "嗯。我——我，呃……我真希望我能有更多的时间来准备。"

# game/script.rpy:11721
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_421e0b16:

  # w "I didn't expect to present, you know, a thesis defence on whether this world should be destroyed."
  w "你知道，我可没料到还要为“是否该毁灭这个世界”来一场论文答辩。"

# game/script.rpy:11722
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_d8de1b8c:

  # w "I could really use some tea."
  w "我现在真的很需要喝点茶。"

# game/script.rpy:11723
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_45cdc50f:

  # pov "A hot cup of chamomile tea appeared in her hand."
  pov "一杯热腾腾的洋甘菊茶出现在她手里。"

# game/script.rpy:11724
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_ffe175a1:

  # "A hot cup of chamomile tea appeared in her hand."
  "一杯热腾腾的洋甘菊茶出现在她手里。"

# game/script.rpy:11725
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_f63e0e28:

  # w "Oh! Thank you."
  w "哦！谢谢。"

# game/script.rpy:11726
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_9bdc7e88:

  # "She sipped it slowly, and looked into the fire."
  "她慢慢地抿了一口，看着炉火。"

# game/script.rpy:11727
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_c82ff112:

  # w "I was a university student, before. I was... not a happy woman. Studying folklore was my life."
  w "以前，我是一名大学生。我……并不快乐。研究民间传说是我的全部生活。"

# game/script.rpy:11728
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_2b47b243:

  # w "I was actually trying to track down what happened to the others. Researching accounts of how they disappeared, rumours around the book. When I found a real copy and it spoke to me-"
  w "我当时其实正试着追踪其他人的下落。研究他们消失的记录，以及关于这本书的传闻。当我找到一本真书，并且它对我说话时——"

# game/script.rpy:11729
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_7204b9b6:

  # w "Well, I couldn't resist. A chance to live inside the story, speak to everyone first-hand? Who wouldn't want to know a secret like that? Talk about a primary source."
  w "好吧，我没法抗拒。一个能住在故事里、与所有人直接对话的机会？谁不想知道这样的秘密呢？这可是绝对的第一手史料啊。"

# game/script.rpy:11730
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_0e504493:

  # "She sipped her tea. It was growing cold."
  "她抿了一口茶。茶渐渐凉了。"

# game/script.rpy:11731
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_b795223a:

  # w "...I can't make this choice."
  w "……我做不了这个选择。"

# game/script.rpy:11732
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_8754c26f:

  # w "Who am I, to decide the fate of so many? I'm not a God."
  w "我算什么，能决定这么多人的命运？我不是上帝。"

# game/script.rpy:11734
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_27824ca0:

  # w "I'm sorry, but You are the one who decides. You're the reader now. That's the role you took on here. The way of this world."
  w "抱歉，但做决定的那个人只能是你。你现在是读者。这就是你在这里扮演的角色。这也是这个世界的运作方式。"

# game/script.rpy:11735
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_2f9aafad:

  # w "You have to make this one last choice alone."
  w "你必须独自做出这最后一次选择。"

# game/script.rpy:11736
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_13ba52c1:

  # "She fell into silence. The campfire had gone out."
  "她陷入了沉默。篝火已经熄灭了。"

# game/script.rpy:11737
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_5b908f64:

  # "You sat there together for a long time, listening to the soft sounds of the rainforest."
  "你们一起在那里坐了很久，聆听着雨林柔和的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:11738
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_391df3b9:

  # "When you were ready, you embraced. You walked back to the fireplace, and the wolf."
  "准备好后，你们相拥。你走回壁炉，回到了狼的面前。"

# game/script.rpy:11742
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_84649feb:

  # "Very well."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:11743
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_96a53346:

  # "I will make you my offer."
  "我会向你提出我的交易。"

# game/script.rpy:11744
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_c8278666:

  # "Come. Join me in this book. Help me rejuvenate this tired story."
  "来吧。随我进入这书中。帮我为这个疲惫的故事注入生机。"

# game/script.rpy:11745
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_04e02158:

  # "You will live in the village. I will lurk in the forests."
  "你将住在村庄里。我将潜伏在森林中。"

# game/script.rpy:11746
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_4ca8e1f9:

  # "I will be cunning. But you will be brave."
  "我会很狡猾。但你会很勇敢。"

# game/script.rpy:11747
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_1df3d649:

  # "You will rise against me. Our battle will be the stuff of legends."
  "你会奋起反抗我。我们的战斗将成为传奇。"

# game/script.rpy:11748
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_38db8651:

  # "You will defeat me. And everyone will live happily ever after."
  "你会打败我。然后每个人都将永远幸福地生活下去。"

# game/script.rpy:11749
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_927877ab:

  # "It's everything you've ever dreamed of."
  "这可是你一直梦想的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:11753
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_86ec3ed0:

  # "Yes. Thank you."
  "是的。谢谢你。"

# game/script.rpy:11754
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_0f5f7497:

  # "I have spent my life honouring the old ways. Preserving the old kind of evil."
  "我花了一生的时间来尊崇那些古老的传统。维系那种古老的邪恶。"

# game/script.rpy:11755
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_a3144537:

  # "Beautiful and terrible. Mystery and horror. Ruthless, captivating. A darkling fire."
  "美丽而可怕。神秘而恐怖。冷酷无情，却又引人入胜。一团暗黑的火。"

# game/script.rpy:11756
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_3c63fdb2:

  # "The type of evil you can't get in your world."
  "那种在你们的世界里无从领略的邪恶。"

# game/script.rpy:11757
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_ff12a4c0:

  # "The evil in your world is a grey, endless fog that soaks into every particle of your being like mould."
  "你们世界里的邪恶，是一场灰白无尽的大雾，如霉菌般侵蚀着你们灵魂的每一个粒子。"

# game/script.rpy:11758
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_81dec319:

  # "You can't even see it. Like a fish can't see water. It surrounds you. Every day you wake up and breathe it in."
  "你们甚至看不见它。就像鱼看不见水。它包围着你。你每天醒来，都要把它吸进肺里。"

# game/script.rpy:11759
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_4e6e4d77:

  # "It has been built into every fibre of the human machine."
  "它已经融入了人类这部机器的每一根纤维之中。"

# game/script.rpy:11760
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_fd1dc444:

  # "No one individual human can stop it. You can't even understand the scope of it."
  "任何单个的人都无法阻止它。你甚至无法理解它的庞大。"

# game/script.rpy:11761
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_2b411413:

  # "I offer you a better evil."
  "我能给你一种更纯粹的邪恶。"

# game/script.rpy:11762
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_25ef2a19:

  # "Something that can be defeated with a single act of human courage."
  "一种仅凭人类的一次英勇之举，就能把它击败的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:11763
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_6c3fcbcf:

  # "Isn't that what you all want?"
  "这难道不就是你们都想要的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11768
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_c09cb138:

  # "No. Don't worry. All of your friends will be there with you."
  "不。别担心。你所有的朋友都会和你在一起。"

# game/script.rpy:11770
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_4fc4483f:

  # "No. Don't worry. All of your friends will be there with you. Those that are still with us."
  "不。别担心。你所有的朋友都会和你在一起。那些还和我们在一起的人。"

# game/script.rpy:11771
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_fcff6e0b:

  # "We will find others, too."
  "我们也会找到其他人的。"

# game/script.rpy:11772
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_a5efc625:

  # "This story will be full of life again, soon."
  "很快，这个故事就会再次充满生机。"

# game/script.rpy:11775
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_c311487c:

  # "Thank you, my friend. You have done more for me than you can know."
  "谢谢你，我的朋友。你为我做的，远比你想象的要多。"

# game/script.rpy:11776
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_ed7699a7:

  # "I hope that this can be a good home for you. You will be safe here for a hundred years, or more."
  "我希望这里能成为你一个美好的归宿。你将在这里安全地度过一百年，甚至更久。"

# game/script.rpy:11780
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_8376baa1:

  # "I don't think you understand."
  "我觉得你还没明白。"

# game/script.rpy:11781
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_de6925cb:

  # "We have grown weak, in here. The souls have all run dry."
  "在这里，我们日益虚弱。灵魂都已枯竭。"

# game/script.rpy:11782
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_76d78685:

  # "I am dying. Without a new soul, this story and all within it will wither to nothing, and disappear."
  "我快死了。如果没有新的灵魂，这个故事和里面的一切都将枯萎殆尽，彻底消失。"

# game/script.rpy:11783
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_bb7bfabc:

  # "There are only two paths ahead of you now."
  "摆在你面前的只有两条路。"

# game/script.rpy:11784
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_4be6f370:

  # "You can burn the book, destroying me and all within it, and free yourself."
  "你可以烧掉这本书，摧毁我和里面的一切，让自己重获自由。"

# game/script.rpy:11785
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_74c6f192:

  # "Or you can give yourself up, and live here in happiness for all your days."
  "或者你可以放弃挣扎，在这里幸福地度过余生。"

# game/script.rpy:11786
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_a577d893:

  # "Listen. Do not destroy this story lightly."
  "听着。不要轻易毁掉这个故事。"

# game/script.rpy:11787
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_2f9ff93c:

  # "The terror was great, but the dream was marvellous."
  "恐惧虽然深重，梦境却无比壮丽。"

# game/script.rpy:11788
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_5d97fbfa:

  # "We must treasure the dream, no matter the terror."
  "无论恐惧如何，我们都必须珍视那场梦。"

# game/script.rpy:11791
translate Chinese wolfNameEnd_29390382:

  # "Very well. I see you've made your choice."
  "很好。看来你已经做出了选择。"

# game/script.rpy:11801
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_16b8cb94:

  # "Silence."
  "寂静。"

# game/script.rpy:11802
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_461b7a49:

  # "It oozed out of the gaps in the rotten floorboards and the cracks in the windows and down through the small holes in the roof."
  "它从腐朽地板的缝隙中渗出，从窗户的裂缝中透出，顺着屋顶的小洞滴淌。"

# game/script.rpy:11803
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_09a6e0b7:

  # "It had been lying in wait there for all those long years, and it could wait no longer."
  "漫长岁月中，它一直潜伏在那里等待，现在它再也等不下去了。"

# game/script.rpy:11804
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_8a7300f7:

  # "It had nothing to hide now. It had already won."
  "它现在已经不需要再隐藏了。它已经赢了。"

# game/script.rpy:11805
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_3f5d4e12:

  # "You sat alone in your silent corroding house in an empty forest that had no name."
  "你独自坐在房子里，房子寂静无声，日渐朽坏，四周是名字都没有的空荡森林。"

# game/script.rpy:11806
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_4ec97ac2:

  # "Every day, you barred the windows and stopped up the cracks with plaster and kept your door locked and barred against the vacuum of the corpse-world outside."
  "每天，你都封死窗户，用石膏堵住缝隙，紧锁房门，抵御门外那个尸骸世界的虚空。"

# game/script.rpy:11807
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_b192514c:

  # "But still it came, seeping in through the crevices of your home in a slow, crushing flood, pressing in with such force you could barely breathe."
  "但它还是来了，如同缓慢却势不可挡的洪水，从房子的缝隙间渗入，带着令人窒息的重压逼近。"

# game/script.rpy:11808
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_d347912a:

  # "The worst was when you tried to sleep."
  "最糟糕的是试图入睡的时候。"

# game/script.rpy:11809
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_a7ea1be4:

  # "Each night you lay rigid in your bed, listening to the sound of the fire slowly die until there was nothing left to protect you, and you could do nothing but lie in the endless suffocating abyss of silence, unable to even hear your own breathing, until at last you fell asleep and dreamed of silence."
  "每晚你僵直地躺在床上，听着炉火的声音慢慢微弱，直到再也没有什么能保护你。你只能躺在无尽而令人窒息的寂静深渊中，甚至听不到自己的呼吸声，直到最后你沉沉睡去，梦见一片死寂。"

# game/script.rpy:11810
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_fea9093c:

  # "The silence was in everything. It penetrated your meat and your bones and soaked deep into your brain. There were deep empty silent chasms in your thoughts. Things you were no longer able to think."
  "寂静存在于一切之中。它穿透了你的血肉和骨骼，深深地浸透了你的大脑。你的思想中出现了深邃空洞的静默裂谷，那是你已经丧失思考能力的盲区。"

# game/script.rpy:11811
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_511be69d:

  # "You had lived in this house for as long as you could remember, which was three days."
  "你在这栋房子里住了很久，久到你能回想起来的日子只有三天。"

# game/script.rpy:11812
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_e654e007:

  # "There were many beds for you to sleep on. The pantry was fully stocked with food for you to eat. In the closets, you found many outfits to wear, of all shapes and sizes. The shelf in the hall held thirteen small pairs of shoes, and one adult pair."
  "有很多床供你睡觉。储藏室里备满了供你果腹的食物。在壁橱里，你找到了许多款式与尺码各异的衣物。走廊的架子上放着十三双小鞋子，和一双成人的鞋。"

# game/script.rpy:11813
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_42b6e43b:

  # "Where did it all come from? Who made the food? Who built the beds? These questions no longer had meaning for you."
  "这一切是从哪儿来的？谁做的食物？谁造的床？这些问题对你来说已经没有意义了。"

# game/script.rpy:11814
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_1a4660de:

  # "Whenever you were troubled by such things, you simply shrugged and said:"
  "每当为这些事烦心时，你只是耸耸肩说："

# game/script.rpy:11815
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_97b69347:

  # pov "The House provides."
  pov "屋宅自有赐予。"

# game/script.rpy:11816
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_9370f9e1:

  # "Was there ever anything outside this room, and this house? None can say."
  "这个房间、这栋房子外面曾经有过什么东西吗？谁也说不准。"

# game/script.rpy:11817
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_4df4ed67:

  # "Did you ever have a name? None can say."
  "你曾经有过名字吗？谁也说不准。"

# game/script.rpy:11818
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_2660193d:

  # "You ate from the pantry of the house, and slept on the beds of the house, and wore the clothes of the house. That is all."
  "你吃房子储藏室里的食物，睡房子里的床，穿房子里的衣服。仅此而已。"

# game/script.rpy:11819
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_97b69347_1:

  # pov "The House provides."
  pov "屋宅自有赐予。"

# game/script.rpy:11820
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_d3956308:

  # "Like all other things, your house slowly fell day by day into greater and greater ruin as the vast unstoppable silence of the universe ground it into dirt, piece by piece."
  "如同万物一般，你的房屋日复一日地走向更深的颓败。宇宙巨大而不可阻挡的寂静正把它一点点地碾成尘土。"

# game/script.rpy:11821
translate Chinese allVanishedEnd_127f1c96:

  # "Soon the lacuna would be total and all-encompassing. Nothing would be left. Not that you worried about that. You didn't worry about anything, anymore. That was all done with now."
  "很快，空缺就会吞噬一切，无孔不入。什么都不会剩下。不过你已经不在乎了。你再也不会为任何事发愁。一切都结束了。"

# game/script.rpy:11839
translate Chinese silence_9f0cf8e7:

  # "You watched the soft glow of the dying coals."
  "你注视着余烬那柔和的光芒。"

# game/script.rpy:11840
translate Chinese silence_544d6993:

  # "A memory came to you. You remembered how anxious you used to be."
  "一段记忆浮上心头。你记起自己以前有多么焦虑。"

# game/script.rpy:11841
translate Chinese silence_d44698f9:

  # "So much grief and fear and pain over this dying earth of yours, and now it was done."
  "你脚下这个濒死的世界，曾有过那么多悲恸、恐惧与痛苦，但现在，一切都结束了。"

# game/script.rpy:11842
translate Chinese silence_8b59eaf9:

  # "There was nothing to fear anymore. The worst had already come to pass."
  "没什么好怕的了。最坏的情况已经发生。"

# game/script.rpy:11843
translate Chinese silence_c61b2d3a:

  # "Relief washed over you. The weight of the world lifted from your shoulders."
  "你如释重负。世界的重担从你肩上卸下了。"

# game/script.rpy:11844
translate Chinese silence_2381971d:

  # "You were at peace."
  "你获得了宁静。"

# game/script.rpy:11845
translate Chinese silence_6ce28b74:

  # "Too late to do anything about it now. Too late for anything."
  "现在做什么都太迟了。一切都太迟了。"

# game/script.rpy:11846
translate Chinese silence_3ec8d061:

  # "There was rest in the land."
  "大地迎来了安息。"

# game/script.rpy:11859
translate Chinese silence_1816b03f:

  # "One day, you went up to the attic."
  "有一天，你去了阁楼。"

# game/script.rpy:11860
translate Chinese silence_0c573795:

  # "In the darkness there you found a midnight cloak and a black mask. The pockets held small precious gems and soft, mossy stones."
  "在黑暗的角落里，你找到了一件午夜斗篷和一个黑色的面具。口袋里装着细碎的宝石，以及长满柔软青苔的石头。"

# game/script.rpy:11861
translate Chinese silence_17a423b2:

  # "These things belonged to no-one."
  "这些东西不属于任何人。"

# game/script.rpy:11862
translate Chinese silence_97b69347:

  # pov "The House provides."
  pov "屋宅自有赐予。"

# game/script.rpy:11863
translate Chinese silence_a59e0d19:

  # "That night you slept in warmth, wrapped in the midnight cloak."
  "那天晚上，你裹着午夜斗篷，在温暖中睡去。"

# game/script.rpy:11867
translate Chinese silence_3b36f7c1:

  # "One day, you decided to search the bedrooms."
  "有一天，你决定搜查一下卧室。"

# game/script.rpy:11868
translate Chinese silence_72679e98:

  # "Underneath one of the beds you found a tiny suit, top hat and cane. In the pockets you discovered silver coins and a small decanter of pond scum."
  "在其中一张床的下面，你发现了一套小巧的西装、大礼帽和手杖。在口袋里，你发现了银币和一小瓶池塘绿藻。"

# game/script.rpy:11869
translate Chinese silence_17a423b2_1:

  # "These things belonged to no-one."
  "这些东西不属于任何人。"

# game/script.rpy:11870
translate Chinese silence_97b69347_1:

  # pov "The House provides."
  pov "屋宅自有赐予。"

# game/script.rpy:11871
translate Chinese silence_670aa3fd:

  # "You had no use for the coins, but you sipped the pond scum when you became thirsty."
  "你用不上这些硬币，但每当口渴时，你就会啜饮那些池塘绿藻。"

# game/script.rpy:11875
translate Chinese silence_f319d158:

  # "One day, you decided to search the study."
  "有一天，你决定搜查一下书房。"

# game/script.rpy:11876
translate Chinese silence_a44b5e28:

  # "In the drawers of the desk, you found a black hat with a wide brim and a pointed crown. Underneath the hat were bundles of lavender and herbs and parcels of fine tea."
  "在书桌的抽屉里，你发现了一顶宽檐尖顶的黑帽子。帽子底下压着一束束薰衣草和其他草药，外加几包上好的茶叶。"

# game/script.rpy:11877
translate Chinese silence_17a423b2_2:

  # "These things belonged to no-one."
  "这些东西不属于任何人。"

# game/script.rpy:11878
translate Chinese silence_97b69347_2:

  # pov "The House provides."
  pov "屋宅自有赐予。"

# game/script.rpy:11879
translate Chinese silence_0b757375:

  # "You planted the herbs in pots around the house, where they slowly wilted."
  "你把草药种在房子周围的花盆里，任由它们慢慢枯萎。"

# game/script.rpy:11883
translate Chinese silence_78a5db7f:

  # "One day, you went down to the basement."
  "有一天，你下到了地下室。"

# game/script.rpy:11884
translate Chinese silence_b204720e:

  # "Deep in the rich dark soil there, you discovered bottles of red wine, a picnic basket, and packages of truffle cheese and crackers."
  "在黝黑肥沃的泥土里，你发现了红酒、一个野餐篮、以及一包包的松露奶酪和饼干。"

# game/script.rpy:11885
translate Chinese silence_17a423b2_3:

  # "These things belonged to no-one."
  "这些东西不属于任何人。"

# game/script.rpy:11886
translate Chinese silence_97b69347_3:

  # pov "The House provides."
  pov "屋宅自有赐予。"

# game/script.rpy:11887
translate Chinese silence_80f0faf3:

  # "You gathered them up and returned to enjoy the cheese and wine before the fire."
  "你把它们收集起来，回到炉火前享受奶酪和红酒。"

# game/script.rpy:11893
translate Chinese silence_a034cbfd:

  # "You had never dared explore the lands outside the house. One day, you decided to try."
  "你向来不敢涉足屋外的天地。直到有一天，你决定试上一试。"

# game/script.rpy:11894
translate Chinese silence_67881317:

  # "You gathered them up and reached for the door, but as you took hold of the handle you stopped."
  "你将它们收好，伸手去开门。可就在握住门把手的那一刻，你顿住了。"

# game/script.rpy:11895
translate Chinese silence_64811c7f:

  # "You could feel it outside."
  "你能感觉到，它就在门外。"

# game/script.rpy:11896
translate Chinese silence_ec10eddf:

  # "The howling pressure of the vacuum beyond pressed against the door like a physical force."
  "门外虚空呼啸的重压抵住门板，犹如具有实质的力量。"

# game/script.rpy:11897
translate Chinese silence_c9af5442:

  # "The weight of it paralysed you. You could not stand the thought of walking down the desolate path to that silent village where no-one lived."
  "这份重压让你动弹不得。只要一想到自己要沿着那条荒凉的小路，走向那个了无生机的村庄，你就感到难以忍受。"

# game/script.rpy:11899
translate Chinese silence_cb7cc50c:

  # "You had a vision of those empty streets and yawning carcass houses, just outside your door, the fields that no-one tilled, the cavernous schools with no children, the carefully manicured dead lawns and dry river beds and petrified forests stretching on for endless empty acres under a blank sky which held no stars."
  "一幅幻象在你眼前展开：空荡的街巷，形如尸骸的残破房屋；荒芜的田野与了无童音、空旷如洞穴的学堂；修剪齐整却早已枯萎的草坪，干涸的河床与石化的森林，在没有星辰的空洞苍穹下，连绵成漫无边际的死寂荒野。"

# game/script.rpy:11900
translate Chinese silence_d5e54b3f:

  # "You fell away from the door, shaking."
  "你踉跄着从门前跌退，浑身止不住地战栗。"

# game/script.rpy:11901
translate Chinese silence_f166b8ed:

  # "Better to sit in front of your fire. To keep the silence at bay for a while longer."
  "还是坐在炉火旁吧。至少能把那可怕的死寂再多挡一会儿。"

# game/script.rpy:11904
translate Chinese silence_d9430acf:

  # "You rested in that house for an uncountable era of time."
  "你在那座屋子里安歇，度过了一段难以计量的漫长岁月。"

# game/script.rpy:11905
translate Chinese silence_014c3be3:

  # "Time, of course, meant nothing now. Not anymore."
  "当然，时间如今毫无意义。"

# game/script.rpy:11906
translate Chinese silence_1478c0da:

  # "All those petty, meaningless little things you needed to do had either been done already, or could never be done."
  "曾经那些微不足道却又非做不可的琐碎小事，要么早已了结，要么注定永远无法完成。"

# game/script.rpy:11907
translate Chinese silence_c38a2a30:

  # "Either way, it was finished. The work was done."
  "无论如何，一切都结束了。该做的事都已做完。"

# game/script.rpy:11908
translate Chinese silence_58150fff:

  # "I sat and rested there with you."
  "我坐在那里，与你一同歇息。"

# game/script.rpy:11909
translate Chinese silence_f3166b5c:

  # "My work, too, was done."
  "我的工作也已做完。"

# game/script.rpy:11910
translate Chinese silence_3ec8d061_1:

  # "There was rest in the land."
  "大地迎来了安息。"

# game/script.rpy:11911
translate Chinese silence_aca6d7f9:

  # "The fire was warm."
  "火很温暖。"

# game/script.rpy:11912
translate Chinese silence_59e1adb8:

  # "Nothing left but to lie by the fire for a while, and wait."
  "剩下的只有在火边歇息片刻，然后等了。"

# game/script.rpy:11913
translate Chinese silence_97b69347_4:

  # pov "The House provides."
  pov "屋宅自有赐予。"

# game/script.rpy:11914
translate Chinese silence_931d1d4c:

  # "Yes. The House provides."
  "是的，屋宅自有赐予。"

# game/script.rpy:11922
translate Chinese wolfSilence_4aeb10e5:

  # "It doesn't matter."
  "这无所谓。"

# game/script.rpy:11923
translate Chinese wolfSilence_61c31d79:

  # "My name was important a long, long time ago. But you wouldn't recognise it now."
  "很久很久以前，我的名字也曾显赫一时。不过现在说出来，你应该对此很陌生吧。"

# game/script.rpy:11924
translate Chinese wolfSilence_45a93598:

  # "I came from an old story. The gods assigned me as a terror to the human race."
  "我来自一个古老的故事。神明指派我作为人类的梦魇。"

# game/script.rpy:11925
translate Chinese wolfSilence_b3003be8:

  # "I was possessed of seven horrors (or, in your tongue you might say \"Auras\" or \"Glamours of terrible splendour\") which lay upon me like seven cloaks."
  "我身具七重恐怖，或者用你们的话来说，可以叫“光环”或“恐怖的魅影”，它们像七件披风一样披戴在身。"

# game/script.rpy:11926
translate Chinese wolfSilence_ac95a19c:

  # "My face was a single coiling line, like the entrails of men and beasts, from which omens can be read."
  "我的脸是一道盘旋的线条，状如用以观象卜凶的人畜脏腑。"

# game/script.rpy:11927
translate Chinese wolfSilence_e038425e:

  # "I never knew a mother or father. I was born of the mountain."
  "我从来不知道自己的父母是谁。我诞生于大山之中。"

# game/script.rpy:11928
translate Chinese wolfSilence_72289d70:

  # "I guarded the forests. My breath was fire. My gaze was death. Who would dare stand against me?"
  "我守卫着森林。我的吐息是火焰。我的凝视是死亡。谁敢站出来对抗我？"

# game/script.rpy:11929
translate Chinese wolfSilence_05c03743:

  # "Long time ago now."
  "那是很久以前的事了。"

# game/script.rpy:11930
translate Chinese wolfSilence_c6cf1690:

  # "Barely remember those days. No-one does."
  "我几乎都不记得那些日子了。没人记得。"

# game/script.rpy:11933
translate Chinese wolfSilence_b62a033b:

  # "Fragments of me survived. I clung to life in old stories like this one."
  "我的一些碎片存活了下来。在像这样古老的故事里苟延残喘。"

# game/script.rpy:11934
translate Chinese wolfSilence_64e91d80:

  # "The beast in the forest. The wolf at the door."
  "森林里的野兽。门外的恶狼。"

# game/script.rpy:11935
translate Chinese wolfSilence_afab1c78:

  # "You know."
  "你懂的。"

# game/script.rpy:11939
translate Chinese wolfSilence_6ac1e004:

  # "I'm sorry, child. You had the misfortune of coming in at the end of things."
  "抱歉，孩子。你不幸赶上了一切的结束。"

# game/script.rpy:11940
translate Chinese wolfSilence_b0e31330:

  # "Each of them read my book, and struck a bargain with me. To live here, in this story, in the life of their dreams."
  "他们中的每个人都读了我的书，和我达成了交易。留在这里，留在这个故事里，过上梦寐以求的生活。"

# game/script.rpy:11941
translate Chinese wolfSilence_b2310284:

  # "Do not think I was unkind. I kept my deal. Each of them lived here for almost a hundred years or more."
  "别觉得我冷酷无情。我遵守了我的约定。他们每个人都在这儿活了一百年甚至更久。"

# game/script.rpy:11942
translate Chinese wolfSilence_71947c6d:

  # "But nothing lasts forever. Sooner or later, their debt had to be paid. The deal came due."
  "但什么都无法永驻。他们欠下的债迟早得还，交易的期限已经到来。"

# game/script.rpy:11943
translate Chinese wolfSilence_937b1c6e:

  # "They are forgotten now. As both of us soon will be."
  "他们现在被遗忘了。就像我们俩很快也会被遗忘一样。"

# game/script.rpy:11944
translate Chinese wolfSilence_1df910f9:

  # "This is the curse you have been born with. To witness the end."
  "这就是你与生俱来的诅咒。见证终结。"

# game/script.rpy:11945
translate Chinese wolfSilence_7a310a7b:

  # "It had to happen to someone."
  "这事总得落到某个人头上。"

# game/script.rpy:11949
translate Chinese wolfSilence_1057a9f4:

  # "No, child. There was no trick."
  "不，孩子。这里没有诡计。"

# game/script.rpy:11950
translate Chinese wolfSilence_a54dce8e:

  # "Here, in my story, they got the life they always wanted to live."
  "在这里，在我的故事里，他们得到了他们一直想要的生活。"

# game/script.rpy:11951
translate Chinese wolfSilence_e31b72d1:

  # "Wise, brave, cunning and kind. The best version of themselves. Happy endings, great adventures. All of it."
  "智慧，勇敢，机敏，善良。他们成为了最好的自己。幸福的结局，波澜壮阔的冒险。一切的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:11952
translate Chinese wolfSilence_978addb2:

  # "Real life, of course, was never so kind."
  "当然，现实生活从来没有那么仁慈。"

# game/script.rpy:11954
translate Chinese wolfSilence_f71922ce:

  # "The world they were born into was not a good place for them."
  "他们出生的那个世界对他们并不仁慈。"

# game/script.rpy:11955
translate Chinese wolfSilence_54ec86f2:

  # "As I suspect it is not a good place for you."
  "就像我猜想的那样，那个地方同样也容不下你。"

# game/script.rpy:11956
translate Chinese wolfSilence_0d0d936b:

  # "I offered them another world."
  "我给了他们另一个世界。"

# game/script.rpy:11957
translate Chinese wolfSilence_afe42cc1:

  # "Of course, in time, they would disappear. Nothing lasts forever. They knew that when they took the deal. "
  "当然，随着时间的推移，他们会消失。没什么能永远存在。他们在做这笔交易时就知道这一点。"

# game/script.rpy:11961
translate Chinese wolfSilence_6b263407:

  # "Yes, child."
  "是的，孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:11962
translate Chinese wolfSilence_f05fddc0:

  # "Everyone is eaten by something. The only choice that any human being ever has, is to decide what it will be."
  "每个人都会被某种东西吞噬。人类从始至终唯一的选择，就是决定被什么吞噬。"

# game/script.rpy:11963
translate Chinese wolfSilence_44cbfdf6:

  # "But not yet."
  "但还不是时候。"

# game/script.rpy:11964
translate Chinese wolfSilence_99f0df85:

  # "We can rest here a little while longer."
  "我们还能再待一会。"

# game/script.rpy:11968
translate Chinese wolfSilence_84649feb:

  # "Very well."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:11969
translate Chinese wolfSilence_96a53346:

  # "I will make you my offer."
  "我会向你提出我的交易。"

# game/script.rpy:11970
translate Chinese wolfSilence_c8278666:

  # "Come. Join me in this book. Help me rejuvenate this tired story."
  "来吧。随我进入这书中。帮我为这个疲惫的故事注入生机。"

# game/script.rpy:11971
translate Chinese wolfSilence_04e02158:

  # "You will live in the village. I will lurk in the forests."
  "你将住在村庄里。我将潜伏在森林中。"

# game/script.rpy:11972
translate Chinese wolfSilence_4ca8e1f9:

  # "I will be cunning. But you will be brave."
  "我会很狡猾。但你会很勇敢。"

# game/script.rpy:11973
translate Chinese wolfSilence_1df3d649:

  # "You will rise against me. Our battle will be the stuff of legends."
  "你会奋起反抗我。我们的战斗将成为传奇。"

# game/script.rpy:11974
translate Chinese wolfSilence_38db8651:

  # "You will defeat me. And everyone will live happily ever after."
  "你会打败我。然后每个人都将永远幸福地生活下去。"

# game/script.rpy:11975
translate Chinese wolfSilence_ddaa1d31:

  # "It's everything you've dreamed of."
  "这就是你所梦想的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:11979
translate Chinese wolfSilence_86ec3ed0:

  # "Yes. Thank you."
  "是的。谢谢你。"

# game/script.rpy:11980
translate Chinese wolfSilence_0f5f7497:

  # "I have spent my life honouring the old ways. Preserving the old kind of evil."
  "我花了一生的时间来尊崇那些古老的传统。维系那种古老的邪恶。"

# game/script.rpy:11981
translate Chinese wolfSilence_28c7dc51:

  # "Beautiful and terrible. Mystery and horror. Ruthless, captivating. A dark fire."
  "极美，极恶。迷局与梦魇。残暴，又迷人。宛如一场漆黑无光的烈焰。"

# game/script.rpy:11982
translate Chinese wolfSilence_3c63fdb2:

  # "The type of evil you can't get in your world."
  "那种在你们的世界里无从领略的邪恶。"

# game/script.rpy:11983
translate Chinese wolfSilence_ff12a4c0:

  # "The evil in your world is a grey, endless fog that soaks into every particle of your being like mould."
  "你们世界里的邪恶，是一场灰白无尽的大雾，如霉菌般侵蚀着你们灵魂的每一个粒子。"

# game/script.rpy:11984
translate Chinese wolfSilence_81dec319:

  # "You can't even see it. Like a fish can't see water. It surrounds you. Every day you wake up and breathe it in."
  "你们甚至看不见它。就像鱼看不见水。它包围着你。你每天醒来，都要把它吸进肺里。"

# game/script.rpy:11985
translate Chinese wolfSilence_4e6e4d77:

  # "It has been built into every fibre of the human machine."
  "它已经融入了人类这部机器的每一根纤维之中。"

# game/script.rpy:11986
translate Chinese wolfSilence_fd1dc444:

  # "No one individual human can stop it. You can't even understand the scope of it."
  "任何单个的人都无法阻止它。你甚至无法理解它的庞大。"

# game/script.rpy:11987
translate Chinese wolfSilence_2b411413:

  # "I offer you a better evil."
  "我能给你一种更纯粹的邪恶。"

# game/script.rpy:11988
translate Chinese wolfSilence_25ef2a19:

  # "Something that can be defeated with a single act of human courage."
  "一种仅凭人类的一次英勇之举，就能把它击败的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:11989
translate Chinese wolfSilence_6c3fcbcf:

  # "Isn't that what you all want?"
  "这难道不就是你们都想要的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11993
translate Chinese wolfSilence_5a29124f:

  # "No. Don't worry. We will find others."
  "不。别担心。我们也会找到其他人的。"

# game/script.rpy:11994
translate Chinese wolfSilence_a5efc625:

  # "This story will be full of life again, soon."
  "很快，这个故事就会再次充满生机。"

# game/script.rpy:11997
translate Chinese wolfSilence_c311487c:

  # "Thank you, my friend. You have done more for me than you can know."
  "谢谢你，我的朋友。你为我做的，远比你想象的要多。"

# game/script.rpy:11998
translate Chinese wolfSilence_ed7699a7:

  # "I hope that this can be a good home for you. You will be safe here for a hundred years, or more."
  "我希望这里能成为你一个美好的归宿。你将在这里安全地度过一百年，甚至更久。"

# game/script.rpy:12002
translate Chinese wolfSilence_7cb2b633:

  # "I'm sorry, my friend. It's a bit too late for that."
  "对不起，我的朋友。现在说这个有点太迟了。"

# game/script.rpy:12003
translate Chinese wolfSilence_de6925cb:

  # "We have grown weak, in here. The souls have all run dry."
  "在这里，我们日益虚弱。灵魂都已枯竭。"

# game/script.rpy:12004
translate Chinese wolfSilence_44eb4b14:

  # "Either you give yourself up, or we will die."
  "要么你交出自己，要么我们就会死。"

# game/script.rpy:12007
translate Chinese wolfSilence_1e7daf42:

  # "It seems you still don't understand."
  "看来你还是没搞明白。"

# game/script.rpy:12008
translate Chinese wolfSilence_927ae55e:

  # "The only choices you ever had here are the ones I gave you."
  "你在这里所拥有的唯一选择，就是我给你的那些。"

# game/script.rpy:12013
translate Chinese wolfSilence_c5fa6fdf:

  # "Good."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:12015
translate Chinese wolfSilence_c5fa6fdf_1:

  # "Good."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:12017
translate Chinese wolfSilence_c5fa6fdf_2:

  # "Good."
  "很好。"

