  # "Good."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:12021
translate Chinese wolfSilence_c5fa6fdf_4:

  # "Good."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:12023
translate Chinese wolfSilence_c5fa6fdf_5:

  # "Good."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:12025
translate Chinese wolfSilence_c5fa6fdf_6:

  # "Good."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:12027
translate Chinese wolfSilence_6538fb3a:

  # "I enjoyed our conversation. If you can call it that."
  "我很享受这场交谈。如果这也能叫作交谈的话。"

# game/script.rpy:12028
translate Chinese wolfSilence_a4ab6eb8:

  # "Of course, you could only ask the questions I gave you to ask. I hope they were enough."
  "当然，你只能提出那些我允许你提出的问题。希望这足以让你满意。"

# game/script.rpy:12029
translate Chinese wolfSilence_9609eddf:

  # "Time to finish things."
  "是时候做个了结了。"

# game/script.rpy:12034
translate Chinese wolfSilence_c5fa6fdf_7:

  # "Good."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:12036
translate Chinese wolfSilence_c5fa6fdf_8:

  # "Good."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:12038
translate Chinese wolfSilence_c5fa6fdf_9:

  # "Good."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:12040
translate Chinese wolfSilence_c5fa6fdf_10:

  # "Good."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:12042
translate Chinese wolfSilence_c5fa6fdf_11:

  # "Good."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:12044
translate Chinese wolfSilence_c5fa6fdf_12:

  # "Good."
  "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:12060
translate Chinese wolfEnd_0304b169:

  # "You have made the right choice."
  "你做出了正确的选择。"

# game/script.rpy:12061
translate Chinese wolfEnd_06309b5b:

  # "Hold my hand in yours, and we will not fear what hands like ours can do."
  "将你的手交到我手中，我们便无需再畏惧，像你我这样的双手能做出什么事来。"

# game/script.rpy:12062
translate Chinese wolfEnd_2393990a:

  # "Now we must choose your title."
  "现在我们必须选定你的头衔。"

# game/script.rpy:12106
translate Chinese wolfEnd_81f4ba67:

  # "Thank you, my child."
  "谢谢你，我的孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:12107
translate Chinese wolfEnd_20e89fef:

  # "That was the end."
  "那就是结局。"

# game/script.rpy:12108
translate Chinese wolfEnd_deefbad0:

  # "You finally turned the last page and closed the book."
  "你终于翻过了最后一页，合上了书。"

# game/script.rpy:12109
translate Chinese wolfEnd_31326f66:

  # "A sense of peace and satisfaction filled you."
  "一种平静与满足感充斥着你的心头。"

# game/script.rpy:12110
translate Chinese wolfEnd_c4ed4dc7:

  # "It was the perfect ending."
  "这是一个完美的结局。"

# game/script.rpy:12111
translate Chinese wolfEnd_63757271:

  # "You sat there for many hours, thinking over what you had read. Then, you picked up the book, and walked to the library."
  "你在那里坐了好几个小时，回味着你所读过的内容。然后你拿起书，走向了图书馆。"

# game/script.rpy:12112
translate Chinese wolfEnd_8b721b8b:

  # "You placed it there on the returns shelf. Ready for another reader."
  "你把它放在了还书架上。等待着下一位读者。"

# game/script.rpy:12113
translate Chinese wolfEnd_bf71625d:

  # "As your hand left the pages, there was a shivering in the air, and you disappeared."
  "当你的手离开书页时，空气中泛起一阵战栗，你消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:12114
translate Chinese wolfEnd_235b4a6c:

  # "Never to be seen again in the world of men."
  "再也没有在人类的世界中出现过。"

# game/script.rpy:12115
translate Chinese wolfEnd_2ad8e1cb:

  # "There was a calmness. The silence slowly abated."
  "周遭归于平静。寂静慢慢消退。"

# game/script.rpy:12116
translate Chinese wolfEnd_8bee7580:

  # "The book sat on the shelf, and waited."
  "书静静地躺在架子上，等待着。"

# game/script.rpy:12126
translate Chinese wolfEnd_91a476a5:

  # "And then there was rest in the land."
  "大地终于迎来了安宁。"

# game/script.rpy:12129
translate Chinese wolfEnd_6f260ca5:

  # "{space=5}And then there was rest in the land."
  "{space=5}大地终于迎来了安宁。"

# game/script.rpy:12132
translate Chinese wolfEnd_915a6845:

  # "\n{vspace=6}{space=11}And then there was rest in the land."
  "\n{vspace=6}{space=11}大地终于迎来了安宁。"

