translate Chinese wolfEnd_79829df3:

  # "\n\n\n{vspace=5}{space=20}And then there was rest in the land."
  "\n\n\n{vspace=5}{space=20}大地终于迎来了安宁。"

# game/script.rpy:12147
translate Chinese wolfEnd_781a7ffc:

  # "{vspace=12}{space=9}And then there was rest in the land."
  "{vspace=12}{space=9}大地终于迎来了安宁。"

# game/script.rpy:12246
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_0025125b:

  # "At last. Welcome, Georgia."
  "终于。欢迎你，乔治亚。"

# game/script.rpy:12248
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_8c1124bd:

  # "At last. Welcome, Alex."
  "终于。欢迎你，亚历克斯。"

# game/script.rpy:12249
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_86267af8:

  # "This maybe happened, or maybe did not."
  "也许确有其事，也许从未有过。"

# game/script.rpy:12250
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_24b7f072:

  # "The time is long past, and much is forgot."
  "难敌年深日久，往事早已遗落。"

# game/script.rpy:12251
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_b5608986:

  # "Back in the old days, when wishing worked, you lived in a lovely cottage on the edge of a magical forest."
  "很久以前，在许愿尚能成真的年代，你住在魔法森林边缘一座可爱的小屋里。"

# game/script.rpy:12252
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_728be654:

  # "Many strange figures lived in the woods around your house."
  "家周围的树林里到处是奇异的身影。"

# game/script.rpy:12254
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_e03bea16:

  # "To the north lived a cunning thief, in a cursed place where wicked sprites and gleeful ghosts held sway. All who lived there slept uneasily in their beds as they heard the Goblin Train rattle past their windows each night."
  "在北方，住着一个狡诈的小偷。那是个受诅咒的地方，由邪恶的妖精和欢闹作祟的幽灵所统治。住在那里的人每晚都会听到哥布林列车呼啸着从窗外驶过，夜不能寐。"

# game/script.rpy:12255
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_b41e88d8:

  # "It was said on moonless nights their long, long arms would stretch through your window and up your stairs and into your bedroom and steal your dreams right out from under your pillow. In a single motion their long, long legs would carry them away to a secret hideout where they would place your forgotten thoughts in a sack of mysterious things, never to be seen again."
  "传说在无月的黑夜，那极长极长的双臂会从窗户探入，沿着楼梯蜿蜒而上，一路探进你的卧室，直接从你的枕头底下偷走你的梦。紧接着，那奇长的双腿只需大步一跨，便能把他带回秘密的巢穴。在那里，神偷会把你遗忘的思绪塞进一个装着神秘物件的麻袋，从此再无踪迹。"

# game/script.rpy:12256
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_cdac6370:

  # "No jail could hold them and no lock could bar them entry."
  "没有哪座监狱能关住其身，也没有哪把锁能挡住其步。"

# game/script.rpy:12257
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_26777d35:

  # "Or so it was said."
  "至少传说是这样的。"

# game/script.rpy:12261
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_de0b3dae:

  # "To the north lived a wicked Imp."
  "在北方，住着一个邪恶的小鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:12263
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_74469396:

  # "To the north there were rumours of a legendary pair of winged boots, which often spoke to offer advice to lost travellers along those roads."
  "传闻在北方有一双传奇的飞翼靴，它们经常开口为沿途迷路的旅行者提供建议。"

# game/script.rpy:12265
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_8580fcdd:

  # "To the north was a terrible Frost that lay upon the land like a curse."
  "在北方，一场可怕的严霜像诅咒一样笼罩着大地。"

# game/script.rpy:12267
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_95757ed8:

  # "To the north lived a wild Goat that knew no master, and caused havoc and woe to all who crossed its path."
  "在北方，住着一头没有主人的野山羊，它给所有挡路的人带来了浩劫与灾难。"

# game/script.rpy:12269
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_f6347251:

  # "To the north lived a debaucherous Fiend whose laugh was like thunder."
  "在北方，住着一个放荡的恶魔，他的笑声如同雷鸣。"

# game/script.rpy:12271
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_ef511f26:

  # "To the north lived a gallant Rake who threw wild parties at all hours of the day and night."
  "在北方，住着一个风流的浪子，他没日没夜地举办着疯狂的派对。"

# game/script.rpy:12273
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_694a7c32:

  # "To the east, a cackling witch would hold her Sabbath on the mountain. When the sky was clear you could see the peak blaze with fire, and the Destroyer himself would emerge to dance in the firelight."
  "在东方，一个怪笑连连的女巫在山巅举行巫魔宴。天空晴朗时，你可以看到山峰燃起熊熊烈火，而毁灭者本尊会在火光中现身狂舞。"

# game/script.rpy:12274
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_4d72b4c9:

  # "Her hut lay deep under a secret lake, and she would emerge on moonless nights when the waters of that lake turned still and silver-green."
  "她的小屋深藏在一座神秘湖泊的湖底。当无月之夜，湖水平静、泛起银绿时，她便会浮出水面。"

# game/script.rpy:12277
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_aeb20e65:

  # "To the east, a kindly Midwife."
  "在东方，住着一位和蔼的接生婆。"

# game/script.rpy:12279
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_b7546cd4:

  # "To the east, the Moon itself had a secret hiding-place, known to no-one."
  "在东方，月亮本身有一个无人知晓的秘密藏身处。"

# game/script.rpy:12281
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_1e9bf11a:

  # "To the east, a Mountain towered over the land, and was often heard to rumble in ominous tones."
  "在东方，一座大山高耸于大地之上，人们常听到它发出不祥的轰鸣。"

# game/script.rpy:12283
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_8f9da91c:

  # "To the east, a crooked Pumpkin was said to hold court over the legions of the dead."
  "在东方，据说一颗长着邪恶歪脸的南瓜在亡灵大军里称王。"

# game/script.rpy:12285
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_a08a8b34:

  # "To the east, a Tyrant ruled with an iron fist, and all shuddered to hear his name said aloud."
  "在东方，一个暴君用铁腕进行统治，所有人听到他的名字都会不寒而栗。"

# game/script.rpy:12287
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_3a7d8f34:

  # "To the east, a kindly Toymaker lived in a curious little shop with no name."
  "在东方，一位和蔼的玩具匠住在一个没有名字的奇特小店里。"

# game/script.rpy:12289
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_05d65fa8:

  # "To the south, a haughty toad, who lived in a grand manor on the edge of the swamp."
  "在南方，住着一只傲慢的蟾蜍，他住在沼泽边缘的一座大庄园里。"

# game/script.rpy:12290
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_7604fdd8:

  # "He was rarely seen, but people whispered that he was wiser than Solomon and richer than Midas. Kings and prophets would come from across the land to seek his counsel and gaze with envy upon the glittering spires of his house. To buy even a single gem from amoung the hundreds that adorned the manor would bankrupt any one of them."
  "很少有人见过他，但人们私下里议论，说他比所罗门更睿智，比迈达斯更富有。各地的国王与先知纷纷慕名而来，向其求取真知，嫉妒地凝视着他那闪耀的庄园尖塔。庄园里点缀着数百颗奇珍异宝，哪怕他们倾尽家财，也换不来其中的区区一颗。"

# game/script.rpy:12293
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_aab5a01f:

  # "To the south was a wandering Beggar with no hands, who was said to know all the languages of the world."
  "在南方，有一个没有双手的流浪乞丐，据说他精通世上所有的语言。"

# game/script.rpy:12295
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_383a6a84:

  # "To the south was a crooked Crone who was often heard shrieking at midnight."
  "在南方，有一个驼背的老太婆，人们经常听到她在午夜时分尖叫。"

# game/script.rpy:12297
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_d4c9acaf:

  # "To the south was the Firebird itself, which was too bright to look upon."
  "在南方，存在着火鸟本尊，它光芒万丈，令人无法直视。"

# game/script.rpy:12299
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_a1ee97e2:

  # "To the south was a mystical Sausage which (it was said) could grant any wish."
  "在南方，有一根神秘的香肠，据说它能满足任何愿望。"

# game/script.rpy:12301
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_8c323f70:

  # "To the south was a humble Shepherd who guarded a flock of grey clouds."
  "在南方，有一位不起眼的牧羊人，他看守着一团团灰色的云朵。"

# game/script.rpy:12303
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_02cdbcb3:

  # "To the south was a gnarled old Baker who (it was said) would bake up a gingerbread child for any couple that asked."
  "在南方，有一位饱经风霜的老面包师，据说只要有夫妇相求，他就会为他们烤制一个姜饼孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:12306
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_711fc95e:

  # "To the west, a wise mushroom ambassador, who had owned these lands since before anyone could remember."
  "在西方，住着一位睿智的蘑菇大使，从没人记得清的时候起，她就拥有了这些土地。"

# game/script.rpy:12307
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_0fda2368:

  # "She was often away brokering trade agreements and peace treaties and delicate alliances between the many trees and plants and old warring ferns of the forest."
  "她常常出门在外，在林间繁多的草木与古老而好斗的蕨草之间穿针引线，斡旋于贸易协定与和平条约，维系着脆弱的同盟。"

# game/script.rpy:12310
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_9a0416ba:

  # "To the west, a pack of thieving Swans who were a terror upon the countryside."
  "在西方，有一群爱偷窃的天鹅，它们是乡间的梦魇。"

# game/script.rpy:12312
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_5fecd217:

  # "To the west, a hideous Blindworm that lurked deep within the earth."
  "在西方，一条可怕的盲蛇潜伏在大地深处。"

# game/script.rpy:12314
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_d67c742f:

  # "To the west, a magnificent Castle where the streets were paved with gold and the rivers ran with dark red wine."
  "在西方，有一座宏伟的城堡，那里的街道铺满黄金，河里流淌着深红色的葡萄酒。"

# game/script.rpy:12316
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_1692ccdd:

  # "To the west, there were rumours of an enchanted Glass Coffin with a mysterious shadow trapped within."
  "在西方，传闻有一具被施了魔法的玻璃棺材，里面困着一个神秘的影子。"

# game/script.rpy:12318
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_4d38052f:

  # "To the west, travellers spoke of a strange Singing Bone that could be heard on moonless nights."
  "在西方，旅行者们说起一根奇怪的会唱歌的骨头，在无月的夜晚就能听到它的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:12320
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_714cac91:

  # "To the west, travellers whispered that a miraculous bushel of Snake Leaves could be found, with the power to revive the dead."
  "在西方，旅行者们私下里说能找到一丛奇迹般的蛇叶，拥有起死回生的力量。"

# game/script.rpy:12324
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_e13a65b7:

  # "There were even rumours of a humble Cobbler in the heart of the woods, making [his] living repairing the shoes of these strange and mythical figures."
  "甚至有传闻说，在森林中心有一位谦卑的鞋匠，靠修理这些奇特神话人物的鞋子为生。"

# game/script.rpy:12326
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_dd4d7ade:

  # "Worst of all were the rumours of a sly Trickster who swindled [his] way across the country, duping innocent men and women out of their honest coin."
  "最糟糕的是关于一个狡诈骗子的传闻，[he]凭着招摇撞骗横行乡里，骗取无辜男女的血汗钱。"

# game/script.rpy:12328
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_d2d66fa6:

  # "Worst of all was a sinister Crow that haunted you day and night, cawing as it lurked above your mantle."
  "最糟糕的是一只阴险的乌鸦，它日夜纠缠着你，盘踞在你的壁炉台上呱呱怪叫。"

# game/script.rpy:12330
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_6a7e7256:

  # "Worst of all was the sight of a haunting Spectre that could sometimes be seen in the fog, beckoning with a pale hand."
  "最糟糕的是那个在雾中出没的鬼影，它有时会探出一只苍白的手，向过路人幽幽招唤。"

# game/script.rpy:12332
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_491e9615:

  # "There were even rumours of a blinding beauty deep in the forest, who bloomed like a winter rose."
  "甚至有传闻说，在森林深处有一位倾国倾城的美人，像冬日里的玫瑰一样绽放。"

# game/script.rpy:12334
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_329a524e:

  # "There were even rumours of a terrible Fool deep in the forest, who travelled the highways and byways freely without a single thought in [his] head."
  "甚至有传闻说，在森林深处有一个可怕的傻子，[he]在大小道路上随性游荡，整日头脑空空。"

# game/script.rpy:12336
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_01d3c8c6:

  # "Worst of all were the rumours of a Water Nixie that lurked deep in the lakes of the forest, dragging unwary travellers to [his] drowned kingdom below."
  "最糟糕的是那些关于水妖的传闻，[his]潜伏在森林的湖泊深处，将毫无防备的旅行者拖入[his]沉沦于水底的王国。"

# game/script.rpy:12338
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_29962ae6:

  # "Worst of all were the rumours of a fell Giant who slumbered under the hills, shaking the earth with [his] snores each night."
  "最糟糕的是关于一个凶恶巨人的传闻，[he]沉睡在山丘之下，每晚的鼾声都震动着大地。"

# game/script.rpy:12340
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_bf50392a:

  # "Worst of all were the rumours of a dastardly bushranger who plagued the roads, stealing everything [he] could and causing havoc left and right."
  "最糟糕的是那个卑鄙的丛林大盗的传闻，[he]盘踞要道，偷走能偷的一切，搅得四下鸡犬不宁。"

# game/script.rpy:12342
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_4a6f295a:

  # "There were even rumours of a humble Butcher who plied [his] wares in a small red shop deep in the forest. So delicious were [his] wares that travellers would flock there day and night for a bite to eat, though none could say where [he] sourced [his] intoxicating meats."
  "甚至有传闻说，在森林深处有一位不起眼的屠夫，在一家红色的小店里营生。[he]售卖的肉食如此美味，以至于旅行者们日夜涌入只求一尝，尽管没人说得清[he]是从哪里弄来这些令人销魂的肉的。"

# game/script.rpy:12344
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_1613e6f0:

  # "There were even rumours of an exiled Aristocrat who ruled over a lost kingdom, deep in the woods where no-one had ever returned from alive."
  "甚至有传闻说，在森林深处有一个被流放的贵族，统治着一个失落的王国，去到那里的人从来没有活着回来的。"

# game/script.rpy:12346
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_e9b1679a:

  # "There were even rumours of a bold Warrior-Poet from a faraway land who roamed through the forest, trying to live a peaceful life."
  "甚至有传闻说，有一位来自遥远国度的勇敢的武士诗人在森林里漫游，试图过上平静的生活。"

# game/script.rpy:12348
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_dbe2a40a:

  # "There were even rumours of a noble Heirophant who lived in quiet prayer deep in the forest."
  "甚至有传闻说，在森林深处有一位高贵的祭司，在静静地祈祷。"

# game/script.rpy:12349
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_85574688:

  # "Despite [his] strange nature, folks said they sometimes heard this [persistent.finaleTitle] whistling a merry tune late into the night."
  "尽管[his]天性古怪，但人们说，有时会听到这位[persistent.finaleTitle]在深夜吹着欢快的口哨。"

# game/script.rpy:12351
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_e63137b2:

  # "Were they happy?"
  "他们快乐吗？"

# game/script.rpy:12353
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_ec4841fe:

  # "Was [he] happy?"
  "[he]快乐吗？"

# game/script.rpy:12354
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_ce2b7d43:

  # "Well, who can say. I like to think so."
  "嗯，谁说得准呢。我倒是愿意这么想。"

# game/script.rpy:12356
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_c98cf720:

  # "One day, the endless cawing grew too much for you to bear. You packed your belongings into a knapsack, and walked into the forest."
  "有一天，无休止的呱呱叫声让你再也无法忍受。你把随身物品装进一个背包，走进了森林。"

# game/script.rpy:12358
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_c46a9c11:

  # "One day, you resolved to meet these mysterious figures for yourself. You packed your belongings into a knapsack, and walked into the forest."
  "有一天，你下定决心要亲自去见见这些神秘的人物。你把随身物品装进一个背包，走进了森林。"

# game/script.rpy:12359
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_047068f0:

  # "\"Be careful!\" Your mother cried after you. But you had resolved to take this path, no matter the danger."
  "“小心点！”你的母亲在你身后喊道。但你已经决定要走这条路，无论有多么危险。"

# game/script.rpy:12364
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_560c98c1:

  # "As you strode into the darkness of the forest, the twilight set in."
  "当你大步走进森林的黑暗中时，暮色降临了。"

# game/script.rpy:12365
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_502188f1:

  # "The crickets and cicadas all around began their chattering and squabbling, and the evening birds began to laugh and trill, and the wet cool mist of the rainforest settled around you."
  "四周的蟋蟀与秋蝉开始聒噪争吵，归巢的夜鸟也开始欢笑啼啭；与此同时，雨林里湿冷的水汽在你周围弥漫。"

# game/script.rpy:12366
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_44c54ac0:

  # "The crooked old water-dragons looked sideways at you and plotted their long, slow schemes."
  "佝偻的老水龙侧目打量你，盘算着它们那漫长又漫长的阴谋。"

# game/script.rpy:12367
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_83ead349:

  # "A small turtle saw you coming and fled into the water with a splash."
  "一只小乌龟看到你走近，扑通一声逃进了水里。"

# game/script.rpy:12368
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_de51ddd6:

  # "The road was long, and the forest was dark, but a smile broke out on your face."
  "道路漫长，森林幽暗，但你的脸上绽放出了笑容。"

# game/script.rpy:12369
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_76b19292:

  # "You were home."
  "你到家了。"

# game/script.rpy:12383
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_d7edd024:

  # "."
  "。"

# game/script.rpy:12388
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_0ae9bcd0:

  # ""
  ""

# game/script.rpy:12392
translate Chinese newStoryFinale_0ae9bcd0_1:

  # ""
  ""

# game/script.rpy:12414
translate Chinese bookBurnedFinale_9609eddf:

  # "Time to finish things."
  "是时候做个了结了。"

# game/script.rpy:12415
translate Chinese bookBurnedFinale_98711b3d:

  # "Just hold the book over the fire."
  "只要把书举到火上就行。"

# game/script.rpy:12423
translate Chinese bookBurnedFinale_406dcfdf:

  # "Good. It's done."
  "很好，完成了。"

# game/script.rpy:12424
translate Chinese bookBurnedFinale_6e1ca13e:

  # "The flames have started to catch. Won't be long now."
  "火焰开始蔓延了。要不了多久了。"

# game/script.rpy:12425
translate Chinese bookBurnedFinale_7f16b32f:

  # "I'll take you back to the village."
  "我送你回村里。"

# game/script.rpy:12426
translate Chinese bookBurnedFinale_b1fef388:

  # "You won't have much time left. You should choose who you want to spend it with."
  "你剩下的时间不多了。你应该选择你想和谁一起度过。"

# game/script.rpy:12501
translate Chinese banquetBurning_807393da:

  # "The banquet was laid out down by the river. Everyone sat along thick tables piled with every type of food, drinking and waving their arms and talking with their mouths full."
  "宴席摆在河边。大家围坐在堆满各种食物的厚重木桌旁，喝着酒，挥舞着手臂，嘴里塞满食物地交谈着。"

# game/script.rpy:12513
translate Chinese banquetBurningMenu_8acd82b7:

  # "The toad was almost submerged in a giant margarita glass, flicking his tongue out to grab every prawn and strawberry and piece of roast beef he could get."
  "蟾蜍几乎整只都泡在了一个巨大的玛格丽特酒杯里，不断地伸出舌头卷走他能抓到的每一只大虾、每一颗草莓和每一块烤牛肉。"

# game/script.rpy:12514
translate Chinese banquetBurningMenu_5e7027f4:

  # f "Ah, my old friend! You absolutely MUST try the potato bake! We should burn down the world more often (if it grants us delectable morsels such as these ones), ha ha!"
  f "啊，我的老朋友！你绝对必须尝尝这烤土豆！要是每次都能尝到如此美味的佳肴的话，我们真该多烧毁几次世界才是，哈哈！"

# game/script.rpy:12524
translate Chinese toadBurning_87a94ee1:

  # "In the distance across the river, you could see Brildebrogue Chippingham's manor, lit up and glowing like a last sunset."
  "在河对岸的远处，你能看到布里尔德布罗格·奇平汉的庄园，灯火通明，像最后的日落般散发着光芒。"

# game/script.rpy:12525
translate Chinese toadBurning_db060303:

  # pov "Do you want to go over there? Take him down a peg?"
  pov "你想去那边吗？杀杀他的锐气？"

# game/script.rpy:12526
translate Chinese toadBurning_7f25a3f7:

  # f "No. No, it's time to forget him."
  f "不。不，是时候忘记他了。"

# game/script.rpy:12527
translate Chinese toadBurning_eaf99070:

  # f "He... was my brother. Back when I was alive. That's what he represented, I mean."
  f "他……是我兄弟。在我还活着的时候。我是说，他是我兄弟的化身。"

# game/script.rpy:12528
translate Chinese toadBurning_4a1a67d0:

  # f "I let him poison my entire time here. Even in the world of my dreams. I could have been doing anything, and I spent all my days just acting out these ridiculous stories where I finally show him."
  f "我让他毁了我在这里的全部时光。甚至在我的梦境中也是如此。我本可以随心所欲，却把所有的时间都耗在了反复上演那些荒诞的戏码上，只为了最终能向他证明我自己。"

# game/script.rpy:12529
translate Chinese toadBurning_0b96c1ff:

  # f "What a waste. He must have been dead for a hundred years by now."
  f "真是浪费。他现在肯定已经死了一百年了。"

# game/script.rpy:12530
translate Chinese toadBurning_aeca39bd:

  # f "This is our time. We should spend it with the people we care about."
  f "这是我们的时间。我们应该和我们在乎的人一起度过。"

# game/script.rpy:12535
translate Chinese toadBurning_1c4af8c7:

  # "You talked for hours, going over trivialities like old friends as you sampled the feast. As dessert arrived, the toad grew somber."
  "你们聊了几个小时，像老朋友一样聊着琐事，品尝着盛宴。当甜点端上来时，蟾蜍变得忧郁起来。"

# game/script.rpy:12536
translate Chinese toadBurning_0382786b:

  # f "I have to admit, friend... the end scares me."
  f "我得承认，朋友……结局让我感到害怕。"

# game/script.rpy:12537
translate Chinese toadBurning_f55160f5:

  # f "I've been in here for a long, long time. Longer than any human should live."
  f "我在这里待了很长很长时间。比任何人类应有的寿命都要长。"

# game/script.rpy:12538
translate Chinese toadBurning_f8824173:

  # f "Perhaps I should have done this a long time ago. I-I was never good at saying goodbye."
  f "也许我很久以前就该这么做了。我、我从来都不擅长道别。"

# game/script.rpy:12539
translate Chinese toadBurning_4033da3f:

  # pov "Then let's not. Let's just enjoy this time together."
  pov "那就不道别了吧。我们就一起享受这最后的时光。"

# game/script.rpy:12540
translate Chinese toadBurning_4d465755:

  # f "...That sounds nice."
  f "……听起来不错。"

# game/script.rpy:12541
translate Chinese toadBurning_943e2d3b:

  # "He slowly smiled, and leaned over to rest on your arm. The two of you watched the bat, the rat and the black cockatoo play cards in the light of the fire."
  "他慢慢地笑了，身子倾斜着靠在你的手臂上。你们俩看着蝙蝠、老鼠和黑凤头鹦鹉在火光中打牌。"

# game/script.rpy:12544
translate Chinese toadBurning_aab6585e:

  # crowshrike "Well lads, I have to say, it's been a good run."
  crowshrike "好了小伙子们，我得说，咱们这一趟算是没白来。"

# game/script.rpy:12545
translate Chinese toadBurning_44abc57f:

  # bat "Too right."
  bat "没错。"

# game/script.rpy:12546
translate Chinese toadBurning_1092eea7:

  # cockatoo "It's been a pleasure riding with ya, boys. I... I couldn't have asked for a better crew."
  cockatoo "能和你们一起闯荡是我的荣幸，兄弟们。我……我不可能找到比这更好的团队了。"

# game/script.rpy:12547
translate Chinese toadBurning_fecf83a0:

  # rat "Oh, ya big softy. Now yer gonna make me cry."
  rat "噢，你个软心肠。你都要把我惹哭了。"

# game/script.rpy:12548
translate Chinese toadBurning_19e64636:

  # cockatoo "Bring it in lads. I love you all."
  cockatoo "过来抱一个，小伙子们。我爱你们。"

# game/script.rpy:12549
translate Chinese toadBurning_3ac27f64:

  # "They embraced in the flickering light of the flames."
  "他们在摇曳的火光中相拥。"

# game/script.rpy:12550
translate Chinese toadBurning_f67504ea:

  # f "So, I suppose this means that ah, under the circumstances, the bill is better left forgotten -"
  f "这么说来，我想啊，既然事已至此……那些酒钱是不是就可以忘了——"

# game/script.rpy:12551
translate Chinese toadBurning_210b9dfe:

  # cockatoo "Don't push it, mate."
  cockatoo "别得寸进尺啊，伙计。"

# game/script.rpy:12558
translate Chinese toadBurning_cdf9fe12:

  # "You walked out along the banks of the river until you found a small, muddy hole."
  "你沿着河岸走去，直到找到一个泥泞的小洞。"

# game/script.rpy:12559
translate Chinese toadBurning_e47180b9:

  # "Inside the hole you found a tiny suit, top hat and cane. Silver coins and a small decanter of pond scum were hidden away within the pockets."
  "在洞里，你发现了一套小巧的西装、大礼帽和手杖。口袋里藏着银币和一小瓶池塘绿藻。"

# game/script.rpy:12560
translate Chinese toadBurning_11510b9e:

  # "Who did these things belong to? You found you couldn't recall."
  "这些东西属于谁？你发现自己记不起来了。"

# game/script.rpy:12561
translate Chinese toadBurning_5b6a9903:

  # "You took the coins and commissioned a great stone slab with ornate angels engraved upon it, in pride of place at the top of the cemetery."
  "你拿着那些硬币，委托人制作了一块刻有华丽天使图案的巨大石板，放在了墓地顶端最显眼的位置。"

# game/script.rpy:12562
translate Chinese toadBurning_52812d0f:

  # "You buried the suit, hat and cane beneath the slab. You had no name to place upon it. But for some reason, it felt right."
  "你把西装、帽子和手杖埋在石板下。你没有名字可以刻在上面。但不知为何，这感觉很对。"

# game/script.rpy:12566
translate Chinese toadBurning_33550dcd:

  # "The mushroom was enjoying a glass of wine while exchanging witty anecdotes with the plants and fungi of the forest, who were all gathered around the banquet table."
  "蘑菇正在一边享用红酒，一边和围聚在宴会桌旁的森林植物与真菌们交流着风趣的轶事。"

# game/script.rpy:12574
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_999f8918:

  # m "Cheers, darling!"
  m "干杯，亲爱的！"

# game/script.rpy:12575
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_cf1d11d3:

  # "She lifted her wineglass and motioned the others at the table to join her in a toast."
  "她举起酒杯，示意桌上的其他人一起祝酒。"

# game/script.rpy:12576
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_d9dab478:

  # m2 "To [povname]!"
  m2 "敬[povname]！"

# game/script.rpy:12577
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_6fed2229:

  # town "[povname]!"
  town "[povname]！"

# game/script.rpy:12578
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_552f0b9a:

  # "Everyone erupted in whooping cheers, and wine sloshed over the table as the glasses rose up."
  "所有人爆发出阵阵欢呼，酒杯高高举起，酒水溅洒在桌面上。"

# game/script.rpy:12579
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_c470ab69:

  # m3 "Wonderful job, really, absolutely fabulous work."
  m3 "干得漂亮，真的，绝对是出色的工作。"

# game/script.rpy:12580
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_27851f08:

  # pov "I'm sorry that this all had to burn-"
  pov "抱歉这一切都必须被烧毁——"

# game/script.rpy:12581
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_e91491f5:

  # m3 "Oh, no, no, please don't go away feeling guilty about all this. It was the only option, really, this sad charade has gone on far too long already."
  m3 "噢，不，不，请千万别带着对这一切的负罪感离开。这真的是唯一的选择，这场悲惨的闹剧已经持续得太久太久了。"

# game/script.rpy:12582
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_549249cf:

  # m "I've been waiting for this moment for a long time."
  m "我等这一刻已经等了很久了。"

# game/script.rpy:12583
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_413e87aa:

  # m2 "Now, come on. How about a song?"
  m2 "现在，来吧。唱首歌怎么样？"

# game/script.rpy:12584
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_3e746710:

  # "The mushroom led you and the rest of the town in a deafening rendition of \"La Vi en Rose\" that rang out into the night, drowning out the sounds of the fire."
  "蘑菇带领你和镇上的其他人震耳欲聋地合唱起《玫瑰人生》，歌声响彻夜空，盖过了火焰燃烧的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:12589
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_adf9bf35:

  # sc "That's right, I'm back! Scraggs McKenzie, the baddest banksia in the bush!"
  sc "没错，我回来了！斯克拉格斯·麦肯齐，丛林里最狠的班克木！"

# game/script.rpy:12590
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_57ac2d1b:

  # "The bounty hunter was sitting with his boots up on the table, his boys around him."
  "赏金猎人正坐在那里，双脚架在桌子上，他的小弟们围在他身边。"

# game/script.rpy:12591
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_802da87b:

  # pov "Have we met?"
  pov "我们见过吗？"

# game/script.rpy:12592
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_56c984d7:

  # sc "You know... Scraggs! You know me, right?"
  sc "你知道的……斯克拉格斯！你认识我，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:12593
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_605568fc:

  # boys "Of course [he] do, boss! Everyone knows you. [Hes] just tryna put you off your game!"
  boys "[he]当然认识，老大！大家都认识你。[Hes]就是想乱你的阵脚！"

# game/script.rpy:12594
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_88f8dbc7:

  # sc "Come on boys, I think it's time for another musical number."
  sc "来吧小伙子们，我想是时候再来段歌舞表演了。"

# game/script.rpy:12595
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_80e4efcc:

  # pov "Oh no, that's fine -"
  pov "噢，不用了，这就挺好——"

# game/script.rpy:12596
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_00ca791d:

  # "Scraggs and company launched into a long, flashy musical number explaining what they'd been doing this whole story while you were on your own adventures."
  "斯克拉格斯和他的同伙们开始了一段冗长而花哨的歌舞表演，解释着在你独自冒险时，他们在这个故事里都在干些什么。"

# game/script.rpy:12597
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_3165bf94:

  # boys "-so that's why we're the toughest... that's why we're the gruffest... that's why we're the roughest, gang in tooooooown!"
  boys "——所以我们最坚强……所以我们最张狂……我们是镇上最不好惹的帮派，当仁不让昂昂昂昂昂！"

# game/script.rpy:12598
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_1f41d999:

  # sc "That's right!"
  sc "没错！"

# game/script.rpy:12599
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_b4193783:

  # "You and the rest of the town applauded."
  "你和镇上的其他人鼓起了掌。"

# game/script.rpy:12604
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_3471089a:

  # som "Bet you don't remember me, do you?"
  som "我敢说你肯定不记得我了，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:12605
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_704d5b42:

  # pov "Um-"
  pov "呃——"

# game/script.rpy:12606
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_53a44c40:

  # som "I come from the future! In my world, everyone is as crooked as I! We dance our crooked dances and sing crooked songs, long into the night."
  som "我来自未来！在我的世界里，所有人都和我一样扭曲！我们跳着扭曲的舞，唱着扭曲的歌，直到夜深。"

# game/script.rpy:12607
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_090e8227:

  # som "Enjoy yourself in the real world, friend, but know that the crooked ways will come upon you too! It's just a matter of time... twisted, broken time..."
  som "在真实世界里好好享受吧，朋友，但你要知道，扭曲迟早也会降临到你身上！这只是时间问题……扭曲、破碎的时间……"

# game/script.rpy:12608
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_ca7215c1:

  # "He cackled in his sinister way as you slowly slid away from him."
  "当你慢慢从他身边溜走时，他发出阴险的怪笑。"

# game/script.rpy:12617
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_839f4e3d:

  # "You wandered away from the party, searching through the forest until you found an old strangler fig rotting away."
  "你离开派对，在森林中寻找，直到发现一棵正在腐烂的古老绞杀榕。"

# game/script.rpy:12618
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_60ce6a34:

  # "In its depths you discovered bottles of red wine, a picnic basket, and packages of truffle cheese and crackers."
  "在它的深处，你发现了红酒、一个野餐篮，以及一包包的松露奶酪和饼干。"

# game/script.rpy:12619
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_2e3f1a59:

  # "You took these things and enjoyed them with your friends in the village. You poured the wine, and raised a toast."
  "你拿上这些东西，在村子里和你的朋友们一起享用。你倒满红酒，举杯祝酒。"

# game/script.rpy:12620
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_f7d9995b:

  # "You had no name to dedicate the toast to. But for some reason, it felt right."
  "你没有可以致敬的名字。但不知为何，这感觉很对。"

# game/script.rpy:12625
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_4ed6c864:

  # "The mayor was twisting slowly in the moonlight."
  "镇长在月光下缓慢地扭动着。"

# game/script.rpy:12626
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_daf12406:

  # may "This is goodbye, then. I'm sorry we didn't get more pages together."
  may "那么，就在此别过吧。很遗憾我们没能有更多共处的篇幅。"

# game/script.rpy:12627
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_229a2432:

  # may "I have heard his song at last. Just like my mother and my sister before me."
  may "我终于听到了他的歌声。就像我母亲和我姐姐以前那样。"

# game/script.rpy:12628
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_e4aac1a8:

  # may "Moon-Head."
  may "月亮头。"

# game/script.rpy:12629
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_427ff636:

  # "A slight sound echoed on the breeze. Like laughter."
  "微风中回荡着轻微的声音。像是笑声。"

# game/script.rpy:12630
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_789540a3:

  # may "I belong with his congregation. Now that the story is done, I can go up there and dance forever in the moon-mad twilight."
  may "我是他的信徒。既然故事已经结束，我就能去往高天之上，在痴狂的月色暮光中永远起舞了。"

# game/script.rpy:12631
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_6094fb03:

  # may "You've done a lot for all of us. I hope we've all brought you a little joy."
  may "你为我们大家做了很多。希望我们也曾给你带来过一丝欢乐。"

# game/script.rpy:12632
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_40962bf1:

  # "The clouds covered the moon for but an instant. When the light shone again, he was gone."
  "乌云遮住月亮只有一瞬。当光芒再次闪耀时，他不见了。"

# game/script.rpy:12636
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_f94c3070:

  # "You came upon the pigs enjoying a game of poker."
  "你碰见了几只猪正在打扑克。"

# game/script.rpy:12637
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_723b8716:

  # p1 "Greetings! Care to join us?"
  p1 "你好！有兴趣加入我们吗？"

# game/script.rpy:12638
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_2565ca45:

  # p2 "Don't do it, kid. He'll rob you blind with those devil's cards of his."
  p2 "别玩，孩子。他会用他那副魔鬼的牌把你的钱赢个精光的。"

# game/script.rpy:12639
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_d6ab7b09:

  # p3 "No harm in it now, Montgomery. You can't take it with you."
  p3 "现在没关系了，蒙哥马利。生不带来死不带去。"

# game/script.rpy:12640
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_f8f222e7:

  # "You settled down to play and in a blink you had gambled away your life's savings."
  "你坐下来玩，眨眼间就输光了你一生的积蓄。"

# game/script.rpy:12641
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_9fa68ce1:

  # "(Don't worry. You have no need for them anymore.)"
  "（别担心。你已经不再需要它们了。）"

# game/script.rpy:12642
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_082f218f:

  # p1 "We have crossed paths a few times, haven't we? I hope you've enjoyed our little interactions."
  p1 "我们打过几次交道，不是吗？希望你喜欢我们那些小小的互动。"

# game/script.rpy:12643
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_4545e17f:

  # "The pigs looked out at the horizon as the slow line of fire crept inward."
  "随着缓慢的火线向内蔓延，猪们望向地平线。"

# game/script.rpy:12644
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_68eaddfb:

  # p3 "Another fragile domicile."
  p3 "又是一个脆弱的住所。"

# game/script.rpy:12645
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_65ff0d4d:

  # p2 "We'd better make it of stronger stuff next time."
  p2 "下次我们最好用更坚固的材料来建。"

# game/script.rpy:12646
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_a6ca0db5:

  # p1 "Yes."
  p1 "是啊。"

# game/script.rpy:12647
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_e44421b5:

  # p1 "Next time, brothers. I promise I will grant you that perfect, everlasting {color=#0000ffff}House{/color}."
  p1 "下次吧，兄弟们。我保证，我会让你们住上那座完美的、永恒的{color=#0000ffff}房子{/color}。"

# game/script.rpy:12651
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_41fad60e:

  # well "Evening. Got any smokes?"
  well "晚上好。有烟吗？"

# game/script.rpy:12652
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_164f42a0:

  # pov "A packet of cigarettes appeared in my hand."
  pov "一包烟出现在我手里。"

# game/script.rpy:12653
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_93491baa:

  # "A packet of cigarettes appeared in your hand, and you tossed them down the well."
  "一包烟出现在你手里，你把它扔下了水井。"

# game/script.rpy:12654
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_9eef71b1:

  # well "Cheers. You have a good one, alright? Take care."
  well "谢了。好好过，听到没？保重。"

# game/script.rpy:12658
translate Chinese mushroomBurning_3eede05a:

  # "You turned and walked back to the centre of the village."
  "你转过身，走回村子中心。"

# game/script.rpy:12665
translate Chinese townBurning_2f3d7dac:

  # "You walked out to the edge of town. The blank night sky was beautiful to behold. You heard dancing and laughter on the wind."
  "你走到镇子的边缘，空无一物的夜空美不胜收，风中传来阵阵起舞与欢笑的声响。"

# game/script.rpy:12667
translate Chinese townBurning_415ffd33:

  # "You walked out to the edge of town. The stars in the night sky were beautiful to behold. You heard dancing and laughter on the wind."
  "你走到镇子的边缘。夜空中的繁星美不胜收。你听到风中传来的舞蹈和欢笑声。"

# game/script.rpy:12677
translate Chinese townBurningMenu_53d0da6d:

  # "The goblin train chuffed as it wound its way through the houses in a lazy circuit around town."
  "哥布林列车慵懒地绕着镇子兜着圈，在房屋间穿行时发出“哧哧”的声响。"

# game/script.rpy:12678
translate Chinese townBurningMenu_a6190d12:

  # "You waited until it was close, then leapt aboard."
  "你等它靠近，然后跳上了车。"

# game/script.rpy:12679
translate Chinese townBurningMenu_16600f02:

  # "Lush goblin fruits were laid out all across the carriage, and a wild goblin riot was in progress."
  "车厢里摆满了甜美的哥布林水果，一场狂野的哥布林狂欢正在进行中。"

# game/script.rpy:12689
translate Chinese trainBurning_fb37bc03:

  # goblin1 "Go on. Have some of the goblin fruits. No harm in it now!"
  goblin1 "去吧。吃点哥布林水果。反正现在吃也没关系了！"

# game/script.rpy:12690
translate Chinese trainBurning_cbdfaeb0:

  # goblin2 "How about a bit of a wager?"
  goblin2 "打个赌怎么样？"

# game/script.rpy:12691
translate Chinese trainBurning_e37d170b:

  # goblin3 "Yeh, just small stakes, y'know - just yer soul! HA HA HA!"
  goblin3 "是啊，小赌怡情嘛，你懂的——就赌你的灵魂！哈哈哈！"

# game/script.rpy:12692
translate Chinese trainBurning_19f8ad16:

  # "You joined in their goblin games, and danced and sang and ate greedily from goblin fruits until the juice dripped down your mouth."
  "你加入了他们的哥布林游戏，又跳又唱，贪婪地吃着哥布林水果，汁水顺着你的嘴角滴下。"

# game/script.rpy:12693
translate Chinese trainBurning_218f0c30:

  # "They were right. No harm in it now. There was nothing left to lose."
  "他们是对的。现在没关系了。反正已经没有什么可失去的了。"

# game/script.rpy:12698
translate Chinese trainBurning_134895e8:

  # "Deep in the depths of the train, within the smoke and ash, you found the goblin queen."
  "在火车深处，在烟雾与灰烬之中，你找到了哥布林女王。"

# game/script.rpy:12699
translate Chinese trainBurning_ed20db27:

  # goblinQueen "You've done well, child."
  goblinQueen "你做得很好，孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:12700
translate Chinese trainBurning_d568d393:

  # goblinQueen "I can offer you only one thing for your service. Is there any shape you wish to take?"
  goblinQueen "作为对你的答谢，我只能给你一样东西。你有什么想变成的形态吗？"

# game/script.rpy:12705
translate Chinese trainBurning_270865fb:

  # goblinQueen "Just say the word, and you will be transformed." nointeract
  goblinQueen "只要说一声，你就能改变形态。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:12707
translate Chinese trainBurning_4ad969e2:

  # "You leaned over and whispered your desire into the goblin queen's ear."
  "你倾下身，在哥布林女王的耳边轻声说出了你的愿望。"

# game/script.rpy:12708
translate Chinese trainBurning_b12e2193:

  # "They waved their hands. In a moment you felt your skin ripple and change, and you were transformed into exactly the shape you wished."
  "它挥了挥手。顷刻间，你感到皮肤泛起涟漪发生变化，你完全变成了你想要的形态。"

# game/script.rpy:12711
translate Chinese trainBurning_a6cae2d8:

  # goblinQueen "A pity. You would have looked fantastic as a cassowary, dear."
  goblinQueen "真可惜。你变成食火鸡肯定会非常好看的，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:12716
translate Chinese trainBurning_d29adbea:

  # "You climbed up on the roof, and found the thief sitting there looking up at the sky."
  "你爬上车顶，发现小偷正坐在那里仰望天空。"

# game/script.rpy:12717
translate Chinese trainBurning_109b993d:

  # t "You did good, kid."
  t "你干得好，孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:12718
translate Chinese trainBurning_d9a7a514:

  # pov "I-I'm sorry. It's all over now."
  pov "我、我很抱歉。现在一切都结束了。"

# game/script.rpy:12719
translate Chinese trainBurning_d61a54fd:

  # t "Listen, we did it. We won. All of us managed to get in here and live decades of our lives being the people we want to be, and doing the things we want to do. That's all anyone can hope for."
  t "听着，我们做到了。是我们赢了。我们都成功来到了这里，在几十年的岁月里，做着想做的事，成了想成为的人。人生至此，夫复何求。"

# game/script.rpy:12720
translate Chinese trainBurning_ce8deb95:

  # t "Everything has to come to an end someday. Better to go out on our own terms."
  t "任何事物都有结束的一天。能以自己的方式退场总归是件好事。"

# game/script.rpy:12722
translate Chinese trainBurning_db334e33:

  # "You sat and watched the black night sky as the train chuffed gently beside the river."
  "火车在河边发出柔和的“哧哧”声，你坐着凝视着漆黑的夜空。"

# game/script.rpy:12724
translate Chinese trainBurning_8886b1a1:

  # "You sat and watched the stars as the train chuffed gently beside the river."
  "火车在河边发出柔和的“哧哧”声，你坐着凝视着漆黑的夜空。"

# game/script.rpy:12725
translate Chinese trainBurning_d8f34255:

  # t "Let's take this baby somewhere! Where do you want to go? Anywhere in the world."
  t "咱们开着这宝贝去兜兜风吧！你想去哪儿？世界上的任何地方。"

# game/script.rpy:12726
translate Chinese trainBurning_b23cdcbb:

  # pov "Do we have time?"
  pov "我们有时间吗？"

# game/script.rpy:12727
translate Chinese trainBurning_f4d89c53:

  # t "It's a story! We have all the time in the world!"
  t "这是一个故事！我们有的是时间！"

# game/script.rpy:12728
translate Chinese trainBurning_ca7ea57a:

  # "And so you rode the train across the world. Paris, Bangladesh, New Orleans. You saw it all, and wept and danced and laughed for forty years."
  "于是你乘着火车穿行世界。巴黎，孟加拉国，新奥尔良。你领略了一切，在四十年的时间里尽情地哭泣、跳舞和欢笑。"

# game/script.rpy:12729
translate Chinese trainBurning_0cecf803:

  # "At last, when the journey was done, you returned to the place where it all began to finish the rest of your goodbyes."
  "最后，当旅程结束时，你回到了故事开始的地方，去完成剩下的告别。"

# game/script.rpy:12733
translate Chinese trainBurning_c8890695:

  # "As the train passed a corner, you leapt off it and tumbled onto the earth."
  "当火车驶过一个拐角时，你跳下火车，滚落在地上。"

# game/script.rpy:12738
translate Chinese trainBurning_d60910a8:

  # "You walked through the forest until you found the rusting remains of an old train."
  "你穿过森林，直到找到一列正在生锈的旧火车残骸。"

# game/script.rpy:12739
translate Chinese trainBurning_0c573795:

  # "In the darkness there you found a midnight cloak and a black mask. The pockets held small precious gems and soft, mossy stones."
  "在黑暗的角落里，你找到了一件午夜斗篷和一个黑色的面具。口袋里装着细碎的宝石，以及长满柔软青苔的石头。"

# game/script.rpy:12740
translate Chinese trainBurning_2eb68991:

  # "Who did these things belong to? You found you could not recall."
  "这些东西属于谁？你发现自己记不起来了。"

# game/script.rpy:12741
translate Chinese trainBurning_c27a8e1d:

  # "You stole them away in a wink, and kept them hidden in a secret pocket. For some reason, that felt right."
  "你一眨眼的功夫就把它们偷走了，并藏在一个隐秘的口袋里。不知为何，这感觉很对。"

# game/script.rpy:12747
translate Chinese trainBurning_d6a7a70f:

  # "A witch's sabbath was afoot on the edge of the forest, just outside of town. You saw women and crooked things dance around a bonfire, gibbering with joy."
  "在镇外森林的边缘，一场巫魔宴正在进行。你看到女巫和扭曲的怪物在篝火旁跳舞，狂乱地欢叫着。"

# game/script.rpy:12748
translate Chinese trainBurning_09cbfc09:

  # "Belphegor, Lord of Hogs, lounged before the bonfire, partaking of occasional truffles offered to Him by His many worshippers."
  "野猪之主贝尔芬格慵懒地斜倚在篝火前，偶尔享用着他众多崇拜者供奉的松露。"

# game/script.rpy:12756
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_cb9a7e01:

  # w "Hello."
  w "你好。"

# game/script.rpy:12757
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_ef60a7d3:

  # "The witch was leaning against the fencepost, away from the party, looking out over the water."
  "女巫靠在栅栏柱上，远离了宴会，眺望着水面。"

# game/script.rpy:12758
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_36722699:

  # w "I suppose this is it, isn't it?"
  w "我想这就是结局了，不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:12759
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_9483f100:

  # w "You know, it's funny, I spent all these years thinking about this moment and trying to understand what was going on and, you know, get to the truth of it all, and now..."
  w "你知道吗，这挺可笑的。这些年来我一直想着这一刻，试图弄明白发生了什么，想要探寻这一切的真相，而现在……"

# game/script.rpy:12760
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_0d643605:

  # w "I thought I'd feel different."
  w "我还以为我的感觉会有所不同。"

# game/script.rpy:12761
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_334e1523:

  # "She looks at you, wiping her eyes."
  "她看着你，擦了擦眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:12762
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_13288f7e:

  # w "I'm very glad I had the time to know you. You made the right decision."
  w "我很高兴有时间认识你。你做了正确的决定。"

# game/script.rpy:12766
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_60c4152f:

  # dg "Evening, child."
  dg "晚上好，孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:12767
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_7f2b6b52:

  # "The devil's grandmother was warming her sooty feet by the fire."
  "魔鬼的祖母正在火边烤着她满是煤灰的脚。"

# game/script.rpy:12768
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_b88255a7:

  # dg "A fine night it is. My grandson has let all the souls out of Hell, you know. Just for these last moments."
  dg "真是个难得的好夜啊。你知道吗，我孙子把地狱里所有的灵魂都放出来了。就为了这最后的时刻。"

# game/script.rpy:12769
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_27862d12:

  # "You looked up and saw a stream of cackling imps and sinners streaking across the sky."
  "你抬起头，看到一长串咯咯怪笑的小鬼和罪人划过天空。"

# game/script.rpy:12770
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_f6c66af9:

  # dg "It's a good thing you've done."
  dg "你做了一件好事。"

# game/script.rpy:12771
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_098945b6:

  # dg "Take care of yourself, when you're out there in the other world. Make sure to eat! You're skin and bones, child."
  dg "到了另一个世界的时候，好好照顾自己。千万记得多吃点！你都瘦得皮包骨头了，孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:12777
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_3a75786d:

  # "You left the sounds of laughter behind you and went to the edge of the woods."
  "你把笑声抛在身后，走向森林边缘。"

# game/script.rpy:12778
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_09e44044:

  # "In a silver-green puddle, you found a black hat with a wide brim and a pointed crown. Underneath the hat were bundles of lavender and herbs and parcels of fine tea."
  "在一个银绿色的水洼里，你发现了一顶宽檐尖顶的黑帽子。帽子底下压着一束束薰衣草和其他草药，外加几包上好的茶叶。"

# game/script.rpy:12779
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_2eb68991:

  # "Who did these things belong to? You found you could not recall."
  "这些东西属于谁？你发现自己记不起来了。"

# game/script.rpy:12780
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_b1078abf:

  # "You buried the hat beneath an old oak, and planted the lavender and herbs all around the mound."
  "你把帽子埋在了一棵老橡树下，在坟包周围种满了薰衣草和草药。"

# game/script.rpy:12784
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_d6eb4405:

  # gm "I told you we were doomed! Doomed, I said! I told you so!"
  gm "我早就告诉过你们我们完蛋了！完蛋了！我早就说过了！"

# game/script.rpy:12785
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_e99ea561:

  # pov "Yes. You told us all."
  pov "是啊。你都告诉大家了。"

# game/script.rpy:12786
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_dc5ad6ab:

  # "The old Gloom-monger sat back with a sigh of profound satisfaction. His smile flickered in the light of the flames."
  "那个阴郁鬼心满意足地叹了口气，靠在椅背上。他的笑容在火光中摇曳。"

# game/script.rpy:12787
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_d2766bd9:

  # "Would that we can all achieve our dreams, as he has."
  "但愿我们都能像他一样，实现自己的梦想。"

# game/script.rpy:12791
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_3a66c8eb:

  # "The goose-girl was herding the geese into the paddock. The hunter sat on the paddock fence, swinging their legs."
  "牧鹅女正把鹅赶进围场。猎人坐在围场的栅栏上，晃荡着双腿。"

# game/script.rpy:12792
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_dd22e0fc:

  # go "Hard to believe this will be the last time. I don't even know how long I've been in here."
  go "很难相信这是最后一次了。我甚至不知道自己在这里待了多久。"

# game/script.rpy:12794
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_bc6a3ebe:

  # h "It must have been at least a decade for me."
  h "对我来说，肯定至少有十年了。"

# game/script.rpy:12795
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_ba72717b:

  # pov "Do you have any regrets?"
  pov "你们有什么遗憾吗？"

# game/script.rpy:12796
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_f94d8f02:

  # go "Just one."
  go "只有一个。"

# game/script.rpy:12797
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_4dc3725b:

  # go "I wish I could have seen those caverns, deep beneath the earth. The first goose-girl."
  go "我希望能去看看地下深处的那些洞穴。去看看第一位牧鹅女。"

# game/script.rpy:12798
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_24ea9114:

  # go "What would it be like to throw off my human skin and join them?"
  go "脱去我人类的皮囊，加入他们会是什么感觉呢？"

# game/script.rpy:12799
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_4f2ba0bb:

  # pov "I can grant that wish."
  pov "我能实现那个愿望。"

# game/script.rpy:12800
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_e6977e43:

  # go "Really?"
  go "真的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:12801
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_82139893:

  # "A distant honking sounded across the plains."
  "平原上空传来了一阵遥远的鹅叫声。"

# game/script.rpy:12802
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_98686d14:

  # go "Thank you. Please."
  go "谢谢你。拜托了。"

# game/script.rpy:12803
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_8c5441fd:

  # "The honking intensified, and you saw a glimpse of the abominable goose-faced men in the shadow of the moon. Goosefeathers floated in on the wind."
  "鹅叫声越来越大，你在月影中瞥见了那些可怕的鹅面人。鹅毛在风中飘落。"

# game/script.rpy:12805
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_58354105:

  # h "Wait! Take me with you!"
  h "等等！带我一起走！"

# game/script.rpy:12806
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_cb323f1a:

  # "The goose-girl reached out. They clasped hands, then embraced in a flurry of feathers."
  "牧鹅女伸出手。他们双手紧紧交握，随后在漫天飞羽中相拥。"

# game/script.rpy:12807
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_aa1b4c2f:

  # go "Thank you, [povname]."
  go "谢谢你，[povname]。"

# game/script.rpy:12808
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_26f96252:

  # h "You did good, kid! We'll see you in the next world!"
  h "干得好，孩子！我们下个世界见！"

# game/script.rpy:12809
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_612d6ceb:

  # "You staggered back, blinded by the light."
  "你被强光晃得踉跄后退。"

# game/script.rpy:12810
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_a519dcca:

  # "When you looked back you saw two geese flying up into the moonlight."
  "当你再看时，两只鹅飞向了月光中。"

# game/script.rpy:12811
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_73430aca:

  # "Soon, they were out of sight and gone forever."
  "很快，他们就飞出了视线，永远消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:12816
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_de78ae5f:

  # "The sparrow herder sat on the church roof, leaning against the steeple and looking out over the fields in the moonlight. He spoke without preamble."
  "牧雀人坐在教堂的屋顶上，靠着尖塔，在月光下眺望着田野。他开门见山地说道。"

# game/script.rpy:12817
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_fd7f8a0f:

  # sh "Thank you."
  sh "谢谢你。"

# game/script.rpy:12818
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_dccb958b:

  # sh "I entered this book forty years ago. I've been a child for a long time."
  sh "我四十年前就进入了这本书，已经当了很久的孩子了。"

# game/script.rpy:12819
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_d420124c:

  # sh "It'll be good to finally rest."
  sh "终于能安息真是太好了。"

# game/script.rpy:12820
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_35a1aeba:

  # "A bird landed on his lap, and he absently fed it a piece of mango."
  "一只鸟落在他的膝盖上，他心不在焉地喂了它一块芒果。"

# game/script.rpy:12821
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_a9c28f0b:

  # sh "I think you're going to make it, [povname]."
  sh "我想你会挺过去的，[povname]。"

# game/script.rpy:12822
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_ea59c44e:

  # sh "You're going to look back on your life one day and feel like you did it. "
  sh "有一天，当你回首一生，你会觉得这一辈子没有白活。"

# game/script.rpy:12823
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_9d628f2a:

  # sh "You'll realise it all worked out ok. You figured it out."
  sh "你会发现一切最终都迎刃而解了。你找到了你想要的答案。"

# game/script.rpy:12824
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_c3dc9d8f:

  # sh "How do I know all this?"
  sh "我是怎么知道这些的？"

# game/script.rpy:12825
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_f96e966b:

  # sh "The sparrows told me."
  sh "麻雀告诉我的。"

# game/script.rpy:12829
translate Chinese witchBurningMenu_3eede05a:

  # "You turned and walked back to the centre of the village."
  "你转过身，走回了村子中心。"

# game/script.rpy:12836
translate Chinese homeBurning_eef5a0aa:

  # "You began the long walk home."
  "你踏上了漫漫归途。"

# game/script.rpy:12837
translate Chinese homeBurning_b6b43367:

  # "The wet cool mist of the rainforest settled around you."
  "雨林里湿冷的水汽在你周围弥漫。"

# game/script.rpy:12840
translate Chinese homeBurning_ee8a63f1:

  # "Along the way, you may or may not have met a man all in white."
  "在路上，你也许遇见了一个白衣客，也许未曾遇见。"

# game/script.rpy:12841
translate Chinese homeBurning_1feb23ba:

  # "His right hand held a dove. His other hand held a gun. His other hand held a crisp dollar bill. His other hand held a pillar of fire."
  "他的右手托着白鸽，另一只手握着枪，另一只手捏着崭新的钞票，另一只手擎着一柱烈火。"

# game/script.rpy:12842
translate Chinese homeBurning_5358437f:

  # "His suit was perfect. His face was too bright to look upon."
  "他的西装完美无瑕。面容光辉夺目，令人不敢直视。"

# game/script.rpy:12843
translate Chinese homeBurning_ba44107e:

  # miw "A tragedy. This world of my dominion burns too soon."
  miw "真是个悲剧。我主宰的这个世界燃烧得太早了。"

# game/script.rpy:12844
translate Chinese homeBurning_fa4cb9b2:

  # miw "I would condemn you for it. But I cannot reach you in the place where you live."
  miw "我本该为此降罪于你。但我无法触及你所在之处。"

# game/script.rpy:12845
translate Chinese homeBurning_5afd90c8:

  # "He looked small, now. Powerless."
  "他现在看起来很渺小。无能为力。"

# game/script.rpy:12846
translate Chinese homeBurning_b6ac6de9:

  # "Lord, I hope you know that I have always tried to honour you in this story. In my own way."
  "主啊，愿您知晓，在这个故事里，我一直在用自己的方式努力荣耀您的名。"

# game/script.rpy:12847
translate Chinese homeBurning_8d10bb50:

  # miw "Go. Taunt me no longer."
  miw "走吧。别再嘲弄我了。"

# game/script.rpy:12852
translate Chinese homeBurning_307bf1ae:

  # miw "I will rest in Heaven until the last moments." nointeract
  miw "我将静驻于天堂，直到最后一刻。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:12856
translate Chinese homeBurning_cca8289a:

  # "You hurried on into the woods."
  "你匆匆走进了树林。"

# game/script.rpy:12859
translate Chinese homeBurning_849ab59c:

  # "In the deeper darkness of the forest, you may or may not have met a man all in red."
  "在森林更深处的幽暗中，你也许遇见了一个红衣客，也许未曾遇见。"

# game/script.rpy:12860
translate Chinese homeBurning_941bd86c:

  # "All the jewels of the earth fell from His right hand, and all the pleasures of the world fell from His left, and His other hand held all the wonders of the universe, and His other hand held a fat cigar, and His other hand held a long knife black as coal dust, and His other hand held the most intoxicating spices, such that the King of Kings would cry to taste them, and His other hand held a single dead rose, and His other hand was in his pocket and out of view."
  "世间的所有珠宝从他右手滑落，世间的一切欢愉从他左手流泻；他的另一只手托着宇宙万象的奇观，另一只手夹着粗大的雪茄，另一只手握着漆黑如煤灰的长刀，另一只手捧着最醉人的香料，连万王之王尝了都会落泪；他的另一只手捏着枯萎的玫瑰，而他的另一只手插在口袋里，藏在暗处。"

# game/script.rpy:12861
translate Chinese homeBurning_c822cdf5:

  # mir "Thank you, my wicked one! All of creation burns, just as planned!"
  mir "谢谢你，我邪恶的孩子！所有的造物都在燃烧，正按计划进行！"

# game/script.rpy:12862
translate Chinese homeBurning_99b11b8f:

  # mir "All morality and rules have fallen! The only rule of the law will be “Do as thou wilt”. Now we may finally glory and kill and riot in the triumphant light of the black sun!"
  mir "所有的道德与规则都已经土崩瓦解！唯一的法则就是“行汝所欲”。现在，我们终于可以在黑日凯旋的光芒下狂欢、杀戮、暴动了！"

# game/script.rpy:12863
translate Chinese homeBurning_cb9e1cc6:

  # "You watched him cackle and cavort."
  "你看着他咯咯怪笑，手舞足蹈。"

# game/script.rpy:12872
translate Chinese homeBurning_cca8289a_1:

  # "You hurried on into the woods."
  "你匆匆走进了树林。"

# game/script.rpy:12875
translate Chinese homeBurning_fcd546ee:

  # "In the deepest darkness of the forest, you may or may not have met a handsome woman all in black."
  "在森林最深处的幽暗中，你也许遇见了一个英气逼人的黑衣女子，也许未曾遇见。"

# game/script.rpy:12876
translate Chinese homeBurning_cdd9b922:

  # "Her limbs were broken. She had no hands."
  "她四肢俱断。她没有双手。"

# game/script.rpy:12877
translate Chinese homeBurning_cb96bc6a:

  # wib "Goodbye, child."
  wib "再见，孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:12878
translate Chinese homeBurning_06988a13:

  # wib "It seems, at the end of time, even Death may die."
  wib "看来，在时间的尽头，即便是死神也可能死去。"

# game/script.rpy:12879
translate Chinese homeBurning_b81a424b:

  # wib "I wonder... who will carry me to that far shore?"
  wib "我在想……谁会把我带到彼岸呢？"

# game/script.rpy:12880
translate Chinese homeBurning_bea13313:

  # "I will."
  "我会。"

# game/script.rpy:12881
translate Chinese homeBurning_ae7355a3:

  # "You have carried so many. It is only right that someone be there to carry you."
  "您已经带走了那么多人。理应有人在那里带您走。"

# game/script.rpy:12882
translate Chinese homeBurning_5fd96b80:

  # wib "Thank you."
  wib "谢谢你。"

# game/script.rpy:12887
translate Chinese homeBurning_a40310fa:

  # wib "I will stay here until the end. To take away the others." nointeract
  wib "我会留在这里直到最后。去带走其他人。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:12891
translate Chinese homeBurning_cca8289a_2:

  # "You hurried on into the woods."
  "你匆匆走进了树林。"

# game/script.rpy:12892
translate Chinese homeBurning_83ead349:

  # "A small turtle saw you coming and fled into the water with a splash."
  "一只小乌龟看到你走近，扑通一声逃进了水里。"

# game/script.rpy:12893
translate Chinese homeBurning_44c54ac0:

  # "The crooked old water-dragons looked sideways at you and plotted their long, slow schemes."
  "佝偻的老水龙侧目打量你，盘算着它们那漫长又漫长的阴谋。"

# game/script.rpy:12894
translate Chinese homeBurning_a4eb9457:

  # "The twilight set in, and the crickets and cicadas all around began their chattering and squabbling, and the evening birds began to laugh and trill, and the wet cool mist of the rainforest settled around you."
  "暮色渐浓。四周的蟋蟀与秋蝉开始聒噪争吵，归巢的夜鸟也开始欢笑啼啭；与此同时，雨林里湿冷的水汽在你周围弥漫。"

# game/script.rpy:12895
translate Chinese homeBurning_20382577:

  # "Finally you came to a small house on stilts on the banks of a muddy river."
  "终于，你来到了那条泥泞的河岸边，停在一座高脚屋前。"

# game/script.rpy:12896
translate Chinese homeBurning_c7aa5c77:

  # "She was waiting for you on the front steps."
  "她在前门台阶上等着你。"

# game/script.rpy:12899
translate Chinese homeBurning_4325c51e:

  # mum "Come in. I have the kettle on."
  mum "快进屋吧，茶都烧好了。"

# game/script.rpy:12900
translate Chinese homeBurning_7246f4b9:

  # "You rushed in to hug her, and she ushered you inside to join her for tea."
  "你冲上前拥抱了她，她把你迎进屋里，一起喝茶。"

# game/script.rpy:12901
translate Chinese homeBurning_cf1f5b81:

  # mum "We never got a chance to talk much, did we? Only one scene together."
  mum "我们从来没机会能好好说会话，是吧？我们就同框过一场戏。"

# game/script.rpy:12902
translate Chinese homeBurning_b8611ab3:

  # mum "I don't even really know what you're like."
  mum "我甚至都不太清楚你究竟是个怎样的人。"

# game/script.rpy:12903
translate Chinese homeBurning_0438dd6b:

  # mum "Well, I wanted to say..."
  mum "嗯，我想说的是……"

# game/script.rpy:12904
translate Chinese homeBurning_9461b255:

  # mum "Whatever else happens and whoever you are, whoever you may become..."
  mum "无论发生什么，无论你是谁，无论你将来会成为谁……"

# game/script.rpy:12905
translate Chinese homeBurning_6c111359:

  # mum "I'm proud of you."
  mum "我为你感到骄傲。"

# game/script.rpy:12906
translate Chinese homeBurning_2571b161:

  # mum "I love you."
  mum "我爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:12907
translate Chinese homeBurning_1c02be67:

  # "You embraced."
  "你们相拥。"

# game/script.rpy:12908
translate Chinese homeBurning_47271b60:

  # "Perhaps we can say that you spent days there, chatting about all that had happened."
  "不妨就当做，你们在那里待了几天，聊着所有发生过的事情。"

# game/script.rpy:12909
translate Chinese homeBurning_bbdfc9f7:

  # "Perhaps even months or years, resting and enjoying time with your family, and looking out over the muddy river at sunset with a hot cup of tea and your mother's arm around you."
  "甚至可能过了几个月或几年，你与家人一起休息，享受时光，喝着热茶，在母亲的臂弯里眺望着日落时分的泥泞河流。"

# game/script.rpy:12910
translate Chinese homeBurning_4dc819d3:

  # "But at last, it was time to go."
  "但最终，是时候离开了。"

# game/script.rpy:12911
translate Chinese homeBurning_ad1b2f3e:

  # "You hugged your family for the last time, and set out back to the village to finish the rest of your goodbyes."
  "你最后一次拥抱了你的家人，动身返回村子，去向余下的人一一道别。"

