  new "如果你跳下了火车，请翻至第121页。"

  # game/script.rpy:9925
  old "If you walked back to the village, go to page 50."
  new "如果你走回了村庄，请翻至第50页。"

  # game/script.rpy:10218
  old "That is not your name. But I can take you to the one who bears it."
  new "那不是你的名字。不过，我可以带你去见以此为名的人。"

  # game/script.rpy:10224
  old "Cuneiform?? Maybe Sumerian. \"As you approach, you see Gilgamesh before you. This was the man to whom all things were known; this was the king who knew the countries of the world. He was wise, he saw the abyss and knew secret things, he brought us a tale of the days before the flood.\""
  new "楔形文字？？也许是苏美尔文。“待你走近，吉尔伽美什在你眼前站立。此人知晓秘密所在，一切皆知悉；这位君王走遍天下，深谙万国之理。他智慧无穷，见到幽深海底，晓得秘密所在，带来洪水前的信息。”"

  # game/script.rpy:10227
  old "Now, witness / behold! He stands weeping at the foot of a great stone that seems to scrape the heavens"
  new "现在且看！他立在一块巨石下面，石高仿佛直上九天；他在石脚下，泪水涟涟。"

  # game/script.rpy:10231
  old "\n\n\n\nWhat brings you, young one?"
  new "\n\n\n\n什么风把你吹来了，孩子？"

  # game/script.rpy:10235
  old "If you asked him who he was, turn to page 604."
  new "如果你问他他是谁，请翻至第604页。"

  # game/script.rpy:10235
  old "If you told him that the walls of Uruk fell long ago, turn to page 605."
  new "如果你告诉他乌鲁克的城墙早已倒塌，请翻至第605页。"

  # game/script.rpy:10235
  old "If you asked him about the stone, turn to page 606."
  new "如果你问他关于石头的事，请翻至第606页。"

  # game/script.rpy:10235
  old "If you ask him about Enkidu, turn to page 607."
  new "如果你问他关于恩奇都的事，请翻至第607页。"

  # game/script.rpy:10235
  old "If you asked him what happened next, turn to page 612."
  new "如果你问他接下来会发生什么，请翻至第612页。"

  # game/script.rpy:10235
  old "If you asked him about Humbaba, turn to page 615."
  new "如果你问他关于胡姆巴巴的事，请翻至第615页。"

  # game/script.rpy:10235
  old "If you asked him how Enkidu died, turn to page 613."
  new "如果你问他恩奇都是怎么死的，请翻至第613页。"

  # game/script.rpy:10235
  old "If you asked him what you should do, turn to page 622."
  new "如果你问他你该干什么，请翻至第622页。"

  # game/script.rpy:10235
  old "If you asked him to come with you, turn to page 619."
  new "如果你邀请他和你同行，请翻至第619页。"

  # game/script.rpy:10235
  old "If you said goodbye, turn to page 621."
  new "如果你告了别，请翻至第621页。"

  # game/script.rpy:10238
  old "I am Gilgamesh. Two thirds they made me god, and one third man."
  new "我是吉尔伽美什。我三分之二是神，三分之一是人。"

  # game/script.rpy:10240
  old "In Uruk I built walls, a great rampart, and the temple of blessed Eanna for the god of the firmament Anu, and for Ishtar the goddess of love. Look at the walls today. Go, see them, walk along them, I say. See how the ramparts gleam like copper in the sun. No king has built their like again."
  new "在乌鲁克，我修建了城墙，筑起无人能够照样模仿的胸墙；又为天神安努和爱神伊什妲，修建了神圣的埃安纳。今天且看那城墙：去吧，登上乌鲁克城墙，绕墙转一转；看那胸墙在阳光下铜光闪闪，后世再无君王能照样修建。"

  # game/script.rpy:10246
  old "Lacuna in the text"
  new "文本中的空缺"

  # game/script.rpy:10248
  old "I see. Then this tale is all that remains."
  new "我明白了。那么，留下来的只有这个故事。"

  # game/script.rpy:10250
  old "All that is left of me is this last fragment, lurking in this tale. ...A haunting (spirit)..., A memory of (?)."
  new "我留下的，只有潜藏在这个故事里的最后一块残片。……一个萦绕不去的（幽灵）……一段关于（？）的记忆。"

  # game/script.rpy:10252
  old "Just as stories are passed down from father to son, so a fragment of me has passed down through the ages and survived here. Soon, I will be forgotten, just as all men are forgotten."
  new "故事由父传子，一代一代流传；我的一块残片也穿过岁月，在这里幸免消散。不久，我终将被人遗忘，正如世上人人都难逃遗忘。"

  # game/script.rpy:10257
  old "This is a monument to my beloved. Enkidu."
  new "这是为我朋友立下的丰碑。恩奇都。"

  # game/script.rpy:10262
  old "He was a wild man. His body was rough, he had long hair like a woman's; it waved like the hair of Nisaba, the goddess of corn."
  new "他是个野人。厚厚的毛发长满躯体，头披长发，与妇女无异；茂盛得像谷物女神妮撒芭的庄稼地。"

  # game/script.rpy:10264
  old "When I ran riot, Aruru, the goddess of creation, created him to stand against me."
  new "当我肆意妄为横行无忌，创造女神阿鲁鲁，便造出他来与我匹敌。"

  # game/script.rpy:10267
  old "She said 'Let us create his equal; let it be as like him as his own reflection, his second self; stormy heart for stormy heart. Let them contend together and leave Uruk in quiet.'"
  new "她说：“现在，仍按造他的方式造一人；此人要像他的倒影，成为他的另一个自己，要强壮得足以抵御他心中的风暴。让他们相互制衡，让乌鲁克重归平静！”"

  # game/script.rpy:10269
  old "When we met, we grappled. We shattered the doorposts and the walls shook, we snorted like bulls locked together. I bent my knee with my foot planted on the ground and with a turn Enkidu was thrown. "
  new "相遇之时，我们扭住厮打。门柱颤动，墙壁摇晃，我们像两头相抵的公牛，喘息喷鼻。我屈下一膝，一脚牢牢踏地，转身便将恩奇都摔倒。"

  # game/script.rpy:10271
  old "Then immediately my fury died. Enkidu looked at me and said, ‘There is not another like you in the world.'"
  new "随后我的怒火顿消无迹。恩奇都望着我说：“这世间无人能与你相比。”"

  # game/script.rpy:10274
  old "'Ninsun, who is as strong as a wild ox in the byre, she was the mother who bore you, and now you are raised above all men, and Enlil has given you the kingship, for your strength surpasses the strength of men.’"
  new "“野牛宁荪母把你生，她如圈中的野牛一样强壮。如今你高居众人之上；恩利尔把王权赐给你，因为你的力量超越凡人。”"

  # game/script.rpy:10276
  old "So we embraced each other and our friendship was sealed."
  new "于是我们相拥，友谊就此缔结。"

  # game/script.rpy:10279
  old "I was a god and a man.\nEnkidu was an animal and a man.\nTogether, we became human. "
  new "我曾是神，也是人。\n恩奇都是野兽，也是人。\n我们在一起，成为了真正的人。"

  # game/script.rpy:10284
  old "One day, I turned to Enkidu and said 'I have not established my name stamped on bricks as my destiny decreed; therefore let us go to the country where the cedar is felled.'"
  new "有一天，我转向恩奇都说：我尚未如命运所指，将名字刻在砖上留传百世；因此我要去那砍伐雪松的国度。"

  # game/script.rpy:10288
  old "In the cedar forest was a guardian named Humbaba. In order to keep the cedar safe, the gods assigned him as a terror to the human race. "
  new "雪松林中有个卫士，名叫胡姆巴巴。为了保护雪松的安全，神明指派他作为人类的梦魇。"

  # game/script.rpy:10291
  old "So I said with pride 'I, Gilgamesh, go to see that creature of whom such things are spoken, the rumour of whose name fills the world. I will conquer him in his cedar wood and show the strength of the sons of Uruk. All the world shall know of it.'"
  new "于是我傲然说道：“我，吉尔伽美什，要去见识那怪物，它名声在外，天下皆知其恐怖。我要在他的雪松林里，将他征服。”"

  # game/script.rpy:10294
  old "Enkidu said to me 'Gilgamesh. You are young. Your courage carries you too far.'"
  new "恩奇都对我说：“吉尔伽美什啊，你还很年轻，心高气傲不知险。”"

  # game/script.rpy:10297
  old "'Humbaba is not like men who die. Before a man can approach within even sixty times six yards, Humbaba has already reached his house among the cedars.'"
  new "“胡姆巴巴与必死的凡人有异。人还未能靠近三百六十码，胡姆巴巴就早已在雪松林中的老巢里等着你。”"

  # game/script.rpy:10300
  old "'When he looks at someone, it is the look of death. A lion eating a corpse: he never wipes away the blood.'"
  new "“他的眼神是死亡的凝视。是狮子啃食尸体：嘴上的鲜血从未擦拭。”"

  # game/script.rpy:10303
  old "When I heard this, I laughed. 'Shall I say that I am afraid of Humbaba? That I will sit at home for all the rest of my days?'"
  new "我听后大笑：“难道我要说我害怕胡姆巴巴？难道我要在家里坐等终老？”"

  # game/script.rpy:10306
  old "We are not gods. We cannot ascend to heaven."
  new "我们不是神。我们无法升入天堂。"

  # game/script.rpy:10308
  old "No, we are mortal men. Our days are few in number, and whatever we achieve is a puff of wind."
  new "不，我们是必死的凡人。我们的时日屈指可数，一切成就皆如风中云烟。"

  # game/script.rpy:10310
  old "Why be afraid then, since sooner or later death must come?"
  new "既然死亡迟早降临人间，为何还要惊恐不安？"

  # game/script.rpy:10312
  old "I will cut down the tree. I will kill Humbaba. I will make a lasting name for myself. I will stamp my fame on men's minds forever."
  new "我要砍倒那棵树。我要杀死胡姆巴巴。我要为自己留下流芳百世的威名。我要将我的声望在人们心中注定。"

  # game/script.rpy:10318
  old "After many days and nights, we came upon him in the depths of the forest."
  new "许多日日夜夜过去，我们终于在森林深处与他相遇。"

  # game/script.rpy:10321
  old "His face was a spiral, like the entrails of man and beast, from which omens may be read. Around him were arrayed seven (Terrors? Auras?), which lay upon him like seven cloaks."
  new "他的脸是一个螺旋，状如用以观象卜凶的人畜脏腑。他的七重（恐怖？光环？）环绕四周，像七件披风一样披戴在身。"

  # game/script.rpy:10323
  old "Enkidu quailed in fear. But I said, 'Look, Enkidu, immolation and sacrifice are not yet for us.'"
  new "恩奇都心生畏惧。我却说：“看吧，恩奇都，还没到我们献身为祭的时候。”"

  # game/script.rpy:10325
  old "'The boat of the dead shall not go down, nor the three-ply cloth be cut for our shrouding. Not yet will our people be desolate, nor the pyre be lit in our house and our dwelling burnt on the fire.'"
  new "死亡之舟尚未启航，三叠之布不会裁作我们的殓衣。我们的子民不会绝望哀叹，我们的家里也不会点燃火葬的柴堆，把居所焚毁。"

  # game/script.rpy:10327
  old "'Put your hand in mine, and we shall see what hands like ours can do.'"
  new "把你的手放在我手里，看看你我这双手能创下什么奇观。"

  # game/script.rpy:10329
  old "He took the axe in his hand, I drew the sword from my belt, and I struck Humbaba with a thrust of the sword to the neck."
  new "他将斧头拿在手边，我从腰间拔出短剑，一剑刺中胡姆巴巴的脖颈。"

  # game/script.rpy:10331
  old "Enkidu my comrade struck the second blow. At the third blow, we struck together and Humbaba fell."
  new "我的战友恩奇都砍下第二击。到第三击时，我们一同出手，胡姆巴巴便倒下了。"

  # game/script.rpy:10333
  old " For as far as two leagues the cedars shivered when Enkidu felled the watcher of the forest, he at whose voice Hermon and Lebanon used to tremble."
  new "恩奇都砍倒森林守卫，两里格之内的雪松都为之发抖，黑门山与黎巴嫩山曾因他的声音而战栗不休。"

  # game/script.rpy:10335
  old "I held his head aloft. Now the mountains were moved and all the hills, for the guardian of the forest was killed. The seven splendours of Humbaba were extinguished."
  new "我高高举起他的头颅。森林的守卫已毙，如今群山移位，丘陵战栗。胡姆巴巴的七重光芒也随之尽皆熄灭，无声无息。"

  # game/script.rpy:10340
  old "The gods cursed us for our hubris. Anu said to Enlil, 'Because they have killed Humbaba who guarded the Cedar Mountain, one of the two must die.'"
  new "众神因我们的狂妄降下诅咒之言。安努对恩利尔这样发话：“只因他们杀死了镇守雪松山的胡姆巴巴，这两人之中，必须有一人命丧黄泉。”"

  # game/script.rpy:10342
  old "And so Enkidu fell and lay stricken with sickness. "
  new "于是恩奇都病倒，身染重疾卧病不起。"

  # game/script.rpy:10344
  old "One whole day he lay on his bed and his suffering grew stronger. "
  new "头一整天，他躺在床上，痛苦愈发泛滥。"

  # game/script.rpy:10346
  old "A second day he lay on his bed, and I watched over him, but the sickness grew stronger."
  new "第二天，他躺在床上，我守候在旁，病魔更加凶残。"

  # game/script.rpy:10348
  old "A third day he lay on his bed, his tears ran down in streams, and the sickness grew stronger."
  new "第三天，他躺在床上，泪水流成河川。"

  # game/script.rpy:10351
  old "He called out to me, 'It was I who cut down the cedar, I who levelled the forest, I who slew Humbaba, and now see what has become of me.'"
  new "他向我呼喊：“是我砍伐雪松，是我将森林推倒，是我杀死胡姆巴巴，现在看看我的下场有多糟！”"

  # game/script.rpy:10354
  old "'Listen, my friend,' (he said to me) 'this is the dream I dreamed last night.'"
  new "“我的朋友啊，请听我讲，”（他对我说）“这是我昨夜所做的梦。”"

  # game/script.rpy:10357
  old "\n\n(???)...the sombre-faced man-bird; he had directed on me his purpose. His face was a vampire face, his foot was a lion's foot, his hand was an eagle's talon.'"
  new "\n\n(???)...面色阴沉的人面鸟，他将目标锁定在我的身形。他有一张吸血鬼的面庞，长着狮脚和鹰爪这般模样。"

  # game/script.rpy:10360
  old "'He fell on me and his claws were in my hair, he held me fast and I smothered; then he transformed me so that my arms became wings covered with feathers.'"
  new "他扑向我，利爪揪住我的头发，紧紧擒拿住我，让我快要窒息；他就改变我的形貌，使我的膀臂变为长满羽毛的翅膀。"

  # game/script.rpy:10363
  old "'He turned his stare towards me, and he led me away to the palace of Irkalla, the Queen of Darkness, to the house from which none who enters ever returns, down the road from which there is no coming back.'"
  new "他转眼盯住我，将我带去暗夜女王伊尔卡拉的宫邸，到那有进无出的屋，走那有去无回的路。"

  # game/script.rpy:10366
  old "With the first light of dawn I touched his heart but it did not beat, nor did he lift his eyes again."
  new "天刚蒙蒙亮，我摸摸他的心脏，它的跳动已经完全止息；他也没有再把头抬起。"

  # game/script.rpy:10369
  old "So I laid a veil, as one veils the bride, over my beloved. I began to rage like a lion, like a lioness robbed of her whelps."
  new "于是我把深爱之人的脸蒙上，就像蒙面新娘。我发怒如雄狮，又如丧子的母狮。"

  # game/script.rpy:10372
  old "This way and that I paced round the bed, I tore out my hair and strewed it around. I dragged off my splendid robes and flung them down as though they were abominations."
  new "我在床榻旁踱来踱去，踟蹰彷徨。我揪掉自己的卷发，一把一把地扔在地上。我撕碎、扔掉自己的华丽衣裳。"

  # game/script.rpy:10375
  old "For six days I would not let him be buried, thinking, ‘If my grief is violent enough, perhaps he will come back to life again.’ "
  new "连着六日，我不容人将他埋葬，心想：“若我的悲恸足够凄苦，也许他能复生，重见世间万物。”"

  # game/script.rpy:10378
  old "For six days and seven nights I mourned him, until the worm fastened upon him."
  new "六天七夜我为他哭丧不止，直到从他的鼻孔中爬出了蛆虫。"

  # game/script.rpy:10381
  old "Then I was frightened, I was terrified by death, and I set out to roam the wilderness."
  new "我才感到恐惧；我开始惧怕死亡，于是便在荒野游荡。"

  # game/script.rpy:10384
  old "I cannot bear to what happened to my friend-\nI cannot bear what happened to Enkidu-\nso I roam the wilderness in my grief."
  new "朋友的遭遇，我无法承受；\n恩奇都的遭遇，我无法承受；\n于是我满怀悲伤，在荒野奔走游荡。"

  # game/script.rpy:10387
  old "How can my mind have any rest?\nMy beloved friend has turned into clay-\nmy beloved Enkidu has turned into clay."
  new "我怎能保持镇静？\n我深爱的朋友已经化为泥土——\n恩奇都，我深爱的朋友，他已经化为泥土。"

  # game/script.rpy:10390
  old "And won’t I too lie down in the dirt\nlike him, and never rise again?"
  new "难道我不会像他一样，倒卧尘土，\n终将不再起，一卧到千古？"

  # game/script.rpy:10396
  old "Attend. The battle is not over."
  new "听着。战争尚未止息。"

  # game/script.rpy:10398
  old "The last remnants of Humbaba still lurk in this tale, just as I do. He feasts on other lives to prolong his own. We are eaten forever."
  new "胡姆巴巴的余孽仍隐于故事中，就和我一样。他吞吃他人的性命，以此苟延残喘。我们永远被他吞吃。"

  # game/script.rpy:10401
  old "You must travel an unknown road and fight a strange battle. Confront him in your house, where he lurks."
  new "你必须行未识的路，打奇异的仗。到你的屋里去与他对峙，他就潜藏在那里。"

  # game/script.rpy:10403
  old "He will be cunning. But you will be brave. From the day you go until you return, until you destroy the evil which Shamash abhors, I will pray for you."
  new "他必极为诡诈。但你当刚强壮胆。从你出发之日起，直到你归来，直到你把厌恶之物沙玛什除灭，我都会为你祈祷。"

  # game/script.rpy:10405
  old "If your heart is fearful, throw away fear."
  new "若你心怀恐惧，就把恐惧抛弃。"

  # game/script.rpy:10407
  old "If there is terror in it, throw away terror."
  new "若其中有畏惧，就当弃绝畏惧。"

  # game/script.rpy:10409
  old "Take your axe in your hand and attack. He who leaves the fight unfinished is not at peace."
  new "把战斧握在手中，向他进攻。没有结束战斗便离开的人，必不得安宁。"

  # game/script.rpy:10414
  old "No. Where you go, I cannot follow."
  new "不。你要去的地方，我无法相随。"

  # game/script.rpy:10416
  old "I have some small sway here, hidden away in this last piece of the tale. But the rest of it belongs to him. I can do nothing now."
  new "隐于这个故事的最后篇章，我还有些微的力量。但其余的部分都归他所有。现在我已无能为力。"

  # game/script.rpy:10418
  old "I will take you back to your home. The rest is your story to tell."
  new "我会把你送回家。余下的故事，要由你来讲。"

  # game/script.rpy:10424
  old "Goodbye, small one."
  new "再见，小家伙。"

  # game/script.rpy:10428
  old "The terror was great, but the dream was marvellous; we must treasure the dream whatever the terror."
  new "恐惧固然巨大，但梦境却极奇妙；我们必须把梦境当成至宝，无论那是怎样的惊吓与烦扰。"

  # game/script.rpy:10431
  old "Yes, the gods took Enkidu’s life.\nBut man’s life is short, at any moment\nit can be snapped, like a reed in a canebrake."
  new "是的，众神夺走了恩奇都的性命。\n但凡人的寿命如朝露般无常，\n随时可能折断，就像芦苇丛中的芦苇。"

  # game/script.rpy:10433
  old "The handsome young man, the lovely young woman -\nin their prime, death comes and drags them away."
  new "不论英俊男儿，还是美丽少女——\n都难免夭折于华年。"

  # game/script.rpy:10435
  old "Though no one has seen death’s face or heard\ndeath’s voice, suddenly, savagely, death\ndestroys us all, old or young."
  new "没有人见过死神的面庞，也没有人听过死神的声响，\n但突然之间，残暴无情，死神将我们所有人毁灭，\n无论年老还是少壮。"

  # game/script.rpy:10438
  old "The river rises, flows over its banks\nand carries us all away, like mayflies\nfloating downstream: they stare at the sun,\nthen all at once there is nothing."
  new "洪水泛滥，河水四溢，\n把我们悉数卷离，浮游在水上自在地游来漂去；\n它们晒着太阳甚惬意，顷刻间，一切都会化为乌有成子虚。"

